decant-partial-of-khadlaj-mansion-edp,Decant/Partial Of Khadlaj Mansion EDP,"<h3><strong>Khadlaj Mansion  Eau De Parfum – Boozy Sweetness with Rich Gourmand Woods ✨</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Inspired By: Angels' Share Paradis by By Kilian</strong></p>
<p>Discover <strong>Khadlaj Mansion</strong>, a luxurious Eau De Parfum crafted in the UAE that captures the essence of opulence and indulgence. Blending rich cognac, luscious berries, creamy gourmand accords, and smooth woody notes, this long-lasting fragrance delivers a bold yet sophisticated scent that leaves a lasting impression.</p>
<h3>🥃 Fragrance Notes:</h3>
<p><strong>Top: Cognac, Raspberry, Nutty Notes</strong> – A captivating opening of rich cognac, juicy raspberry, and roasted nutty accords creates a warm, fruity, and irresistibly indulgent first impression.</p>
<p><strong>Heart: Tonka Bean, Violet, Myrrh, Rose</strong> – A luxurious heart where creamy tonka bean, elegant violet, resinous myrrh, and velvety rose blend seamlessly to add depth, warmth, and refined sophistication.</p>
<p><strong>Base: Caramel, Oakmoss, Praline, Sandalwood</strong> – A rich and sensual finish of buttery caramel, sweet praline, earthy oakmoss, and creamy sandalwood leaves an unforgettable, smooth, and long-lasting trail.</p>
<p>✨ <strong>Khadlaj Mansion</strong> is perfect for evening wear, festive celebrations, romantic occasions, and cooler weather—a fragrance that embodies luxury, elegance, and irresistible gourmand warmth with every spray.</p>
<p><strong>Eau De Parfum • Long Lasting • Unisex</strong></p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Khadlaj, New Arrivals, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,440.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/KhadlajMansion.png?v=1785400531,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,caramel; oakmoss; praline; sandalwood,,,,,,inspired-by-angels-share-paradis-by-by-kilian,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Khadlaj-Perfumes/Mansion-120489.html,,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,sweet; woody; fruity; warm-spices; amber,,tonka-bean; violet; myrrh; rose,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,cognac; raspberry,,,unisex,,,,,white,bottle,woody; fruity,,,,special-occasion,woody; gourmand; fruity,,,liquid,fall,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
