decant-partial-of-khadlaj-25-heritage-edp,Decant/Partial Of Khadlaj 25 Heritage EDP,"<h3><strong>Khadlaj 25 Heritage Eau De Parfum – Aromatic Freshness with Smoky Woody Sophistication ✨</strong></h3>
<p>Discover <strong>Khadlaj 25 Heritage</strong>, a distinguished Eau De Parfum crafted in the UAE that celebrates timeless elegance with a harmonious blend of fresh aromatics, refined florals, and rich woody accords. Designed for those who appreciate sophistication and character, this long-lasting fragrance evolves beautifully from a vibrant opening to a warm, smoky finish.</p>
<h3>🌿 Fragrance Notes:</h3>
<p><strong>Top: Eucalyptus, Cardamom, Bergamot</strong> – A refreshing burst of crisp eucalyptus, spicy cardamom, and sparkling bergamot creates an invigorating and uplifting opening.</p>
<p><strong>Heart: Cedarwood, Fig Tree, Rose</strong> – A refined heart where smooth cedarwood, green fig tree, and elegant rose blend seamlessly, adding depth, freshness, and timeless sophistication.</p>
<p><strong>Base: Incense, Cashmeran, Sandalwood</strong> – A luxurious finish of smoky incense, velvety cashmeran, and creamy sandalwood leaves a warm, smooth, and long-lasting trail.</p>
<p>✨ <strong>Khadlaj 25 Heritage</strong> is perfect for daily wear, office settings, evening occasions, and special gatherings—a fragrance that reflects confidence, refinement, and modern luxury with every spray.</p>
<p><strong>Eau De Parfum • Long Lasting • Unisex</strong></p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Khadlaj, New Arrivals, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,440.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Khadlaj25Heritage.png?v=1785400004,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,incense; cashmeran; sandalwood,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,cedarwood; fig; rose,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,eucalyptus; cardamom; bergamot,,,for-men,,,,,brown,bottle,woody; spicy; fresh; floral,gift-box,,,everyday; casual,woody; aromatic,,,liquid,,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
