decant-partial-of-khadlaj-icon-edp,Decant/Partial Of Khadlaj Icon EDP,"<h3><strong>Khadlaj Icon Eau De Parfum – Fresh Citrus with Smoky Amber Elegance ✨</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Inspired By: Bleu de Chanel L'Exclusif by Chanel</strong></p>
<p>Discover <strong>Khadlaj Icon</strong>, a sophisticated Eau De Parfum crafted in the UAE that captures the essence of modern elegance and timeless masculinity. Blending vibrant citrus, aromatic lavender, smoky incense, and smooth woody accords, this long-lasting fragrance delivers a refined and confident scent that's perfect for every occasion.</p>
<h3>🌿 Fragrance Notes:</h3>
<p><strong>Top: Bergamot</strong> – A sparkling burst of fresh bergamot creates a crisp, citrusy opening that is bright, refreshing, and invigorating.</p>
<p><strong>Heart: Labdanum, Incense, Lavender</strong> – A refined heart where resinous labdanum, smoky incense, and aromatic lavender come together to add depth, sophistication, and an elegant oriental touch.</p>
<p><strong>Base: Amber, Suede, Sandalwood</strong> – A luxurious finish of warm amber, soft suede, and creamy sandalwood leaves a smooth, sensual, and long-lasting trail.</p>
<p>✨ <strong>Khadlaj Icon</strong> is perfect for daily wear, office settings, evening outings, and special occasions—a fragrance that reflects confidence, sophistication, and effortless luxury with every spray.</p>
<p><strong>Eau De Parfum • Long Lasting • Unisex</strong></p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, New Arrivals, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,520.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/KhadlajIcon.png?v=1785398949,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,inspired-by-bleu-de-chanel-l-exclusif-by-chanel-1,,,,,,,,amber; citrus; woody; musky; powdery,,labdanum; incense; lavender,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,bergamot,,,unisex,,,,,blue,bottle,citrus; lavender; woody,,,glass,everyday; casual,woody; aromatic,,,liquid,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
