decant-partial-of-rasasi-al-wisam-hayan-edp,Decant/Partial Of Rasasi Al Wisam Hayan EDP,"<h3><strong>Rasasi Al Wisam Hayan Eau De Parfum – Spicy Fruity Leather with Earthy Sophistication ✨</strong></h3>
<p>Discover <strong>Rasasi Al Wisam Hayan</strong>, an elegant Eau De Parfum that combines vibrant fruits, warm spices, and luxurious leather with rich woody accords. Crafted for those who appreciate bold yet refined fragrances, this long-lasting scent unfolds beautifully from a fresh and spicy opening to a deep, earthy finish that leaves a lasting impression.</p>
<h3>🌿 Fragrance Notes:</h3>
<p><strong>Top: Saffron, Cinnamon, Apple</strong> – A captivating opening of exotic saffron, warm cinnamon, and crisp apple creates a rich, spicy, and fruity introduction.</p>
<p><strong>Heart: Rose, Leather</strong> – A sophisticated heart where velvety rose blends seamlessly with smooth leather, adding elegance, warmth, and depth.</p>
<p><strong>Base: Oakmoss, Musk, Papyrus, Patchouli</strong> – A refined base of earthy oakmoss, soft musk, aromatic papyrus, and rich patchouli delivers a powerful, long-lasting, and masculine trail.</p>
<p>✨ <strong>Rasasi Al Wisam Hayan</strong> is perfect for evening wear, formal occasions, cooler weather, and those who enjoy a fragrance that balances spicy freshness with leathery warmth and earthy sophistication.</p>
<p><strong>Eau De Parfum • Long Lasting • Unisex</strong></p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, New Arrivals, Partial, Rasasi",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,515.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Alwisamhayan.png?v=1785395197,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,oakmoss; musk; papyrus; patchouli,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,rose; leather,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,saffron; cinnamon; apple,,,,,,,,black,bottle,spicy; fruity; woody; rose,,,,formal,woody; spicy; fruity,,,spray,fall,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
