decant-partial-of-rasasi-al-wisam-habban-edp,Decant/Partial Of Rasasi Al Wisam Habban EDP,"<h3><strong>Rasasi Al Wisam Habban Eau De Parfum – Elegant Rose with Earthy Amber Depth ✨</strong></h3>
<p>Discover <strong>Rasasi Al Wisam Habban</strong>, a refined Eau De Parfum that showcases the timeless beauty of Bulgarian roses blended with earthy patchouli, rich oakmoss, and warm amber. Crafted for those who appreciate classic oriental elegance, this long-lasting fragrance offers a sophisticated scent that transitions beautifully from fresh florals to a deep, comforting finish.</p>
<h3>🌹 Fragrance Notes:</h3>
<p><strong>Top: Bulgarian Roses</strong> – A luxurious opening of exquisite Bulgarian roses delivers a rich, velvety floral aroma with timeless elegance.</p>
<p><strong>Heart: Patchouli, Oakmoss</strong> – An earthy and aromatic heart where patchouli and oakmoss create depth, character, and natural sophistication.</p>
<p><strong>Base: Amber</strong> – A warm, resinous amber base provides a smooth, long-lasting finish with a rich and comforting trail.</p>
<p>✨ <strong>Rasasi Al Wisam Habban</strong> is perfect for formal occasions, evening wear, romantic moments, and anyone who appreciates a classic floral-oriental fragrance with refined warmth and lasting elegance.</p>
