xlnc-diva-edition-20mlx3-extrait-de-parfum,XLNC Diva Edition 20mlx3 Extrait De Parfum,"<h5>XLNC Diva Edition 20ml × 3 Extrait De Parfum – Three Signature Fragrances, One Luxurious Collection ✨</h5>
<h5>Discover <strong>XLNC Diva Edition</strong>, a luxurious <strong>Extrait De Parfum</strong> gift set featuring three distinctive fragrances, each thoughtfully crafted to express elegance, confidence, and individuality. Whether you're in the mood for radiant florals, timeless roses, or creamy white florals, this beautifully curated collection offers a unique fragrance experience for every occasion.</h5>
<h5>✨ <strong>This exclusive set includes three 20ml perfumes:</strong>
</h5>
<h5>
<strong>Fleurique (20ml)</strong> – A captivating floral-fruity fragrance that opens with vibrant fruits, unfolds into an elegant floral bouquet, and finishes with a refined musky-woody trail.</h5>
<h5>
<strong>Metallic Rose (20ml)</strong> – A bold and sophisticated floral fragrance where luxurious Turkish red rose and pink pepper blend seamlessly with raspberry bloom, warm amber, and papyrus for a modern, elegant finish.</h5>
<h5>
<strong>Glaze (20ml)</strong> – A rich oriental-floral fragrance combining luminous fruits and opulent white florals with a smooth, sensual base of Tahitian vanilla, cashmere wood, patchouli, and sandalwood.</h5>
<h5>🌿 <strong>Fragrance Notes:</strong>
</h5>
<h5>
<strong>Top:</strong> Litchi, Bergamot, Peach, Turkish Red Rose, Pink Pepper, Gardenia, Nectarine, Pear</h5>
<h5>
<strong>Heart:</strong> Peony, Orange Blossom, Jasmine, Petalia, Turkish Red Rose, Raspberry Bloom, Tuberose, Indian Jasmine</h5>
<h5>
<strong>Base:</strong> Musk, Moss, Woody Notes, Papyrus, Amber, Tahitian Vanilla, Cashmere Wood, Patchouli, Sandalwood</h5>
<h5>✨ <strong>Whether you choose a fragrance to match your mood or discover a new signature scent, XLNC Diva Edition offers three unique fragrance experiences in one elegant collection—perfect for everyday wear, special occasions, and thoughtful gifting.</strong>
</h5>
