</h5>
<h5>
<strong>Top:</strong> Nutmeg, Pink Pepper, Orange Blossom, Orris – A vibrant opening where the warm spice of nutmeg and pink pepper is balanced by the soft floral elegance of orange blossom and powdery orris, creating a refined and captivating first impression.</h5>
<h5>
<strong>Heart:</strong> Toffee, Caramel, Cinnamon, Clary Sage – An irresistible heart of rich toffee and creamy caramel, enhanced by the comforting warmth of cinnamon and the aromatic freshness of clary sage, adding sweetness, depth, and character.</h5>
<h5>
