riiffs-seasons-rise-100ml-edp,Riiffs Seasons Rise 100ml EDP,"<h5>Riiffs Seasons Rise 100ml Eau De Parfum – Warm Spiced Sweetness with Addictive Amber Depth ✨</h5>
<h5>Discover <strong>Riiffs Seasons Rise</strong>, a captivating <strong>Eau De Parfum</strong> that masterfully blends vibrant spices, delicate florals, indulgent gourmand notes, and rich amber woods. With its impressive longevity and luxurious composition, this fragrance offers a warm, charismatic scent that is perfect for those who appreciate bold sophistication and modern elegance.</h5>
<h5>🌿 <strong>Fragrance Notes:</strong>
</h5>
<h5>
<strong>Top:</strong> Nutmeg, Pink Pepper, Orange Blossom, Orris – A vibrant opening where the warm spice of nutmeg and pink pepper is balanced by the soft floral elegance of orange blossom and powdery orris, creating a refined and captivating first impression.</h5>
<h5>
<strong>Heart:</strong> Toffee, Caramel, Cinnamon, Clary Sage – An irresistible heart of rich toffee and creamy caramel, enhanced by the comforting warmth of cinnamon and the aromatic freshness of clary sage, adding sweetness, depth, and character.</h5>
<h5>
<strong>Base:</strong> Cashmeran, Praline, Vanilla Bean, Amber, Ambroxan – A luxurious and long-lasting finish featuring velvety cashmeran, delicious praline, creamy vanilla bean, warm amber, and smooth ambroxan, leaving a sensual, woody, and unforgettable trail.</h5>
<h5>✨ <strong>Riiffs Seasons Rise</strong> is perfect for evening wear, date nights, festive celebrations, and cooler weather—a fragrance that reflects confidence, charm, and contemporary luxury.</h5>
<h5><strong>Inspired by Emporio Armani Stronger With You Parfum.</strong></h5>
<h5><strong>Eau De Parfum • Long Lasting • Men</strong></h5>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, New Arrivals, Riiffs",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,48,deny,manual,3689.00,4099.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/RiiffsSeasonsRise.png?v=1784607652,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,cashmeran; praline; vanilla; amber; ambroxan,riiffs,,,edp,,inspired-by-emporio-armani-stronger-with-you-parfum,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Riiffs-Perfumes/Seasons-Rise-118090.html,unisex,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,sweet; caramel; amber; powdery; musky,,toffee; caramel; cinnamon; clary-sage,,,,,,,,,,,,special-discount-on-riiffs-seasons-collection,,,nutmeg; pink-pepper; orange-blossom; orris,,,unisex,,,,,orange,spray,spicy; woody; vanilla; sandalwood,,,,special-occasion,woody; spicy,,,liquid,fall; winter,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
