<p data-start=""0"" data-end=""103""><strong data-start=""0"" data-end=""103"">The Perfumer's Workshop Tea Rose EDT – Timeless Floral Elegance with Blooming Rose Beauty 🌹✨</strong></p>
<p data-start=""105"" data-end=""524"">Experience <strong data-start=""116"" data-end=""152"">The Perfumer's Workshop Tea Rose</strong>, a classic Eau de Toilette that celebrates the pure beauty of fresh roses. This elegant floral fragrance opens with soft, delicate blooms before revealing a luxurious bouquet of premium roses, finishing with a fresh green woody base that lingers gracefully on the skin. Perfect for women who appreciate timeless sophistication and the enchanting charm of natural florals.</p>
<p data-start=""526"" data-end=""549"">🌸 <strong data-start=""529"" data-end=""549"">Fragrance Notes:</strong></p>
<p data-start=""551"" data-end=""703""><strong data-start=""551"" data-end=""559"">Top:</strong> Peony, Chamomile – A soft and refreshing opening with delicate peony petals and soothing chamomile, creating a light, elegant first impression.</p>
<p data-start=""705"" data-end=""920""><strong data-start=""705"" data-end=""715"">Heart:</strong> Tea Rose, Damask Rose, Bulgarian Rose – A rich floral heart featuring the romantic essence of tea rose, luxurious Damask rose, and exquisite Bulgarian rose for a beautifully feminine and timeless bouquet.</p>
<p data-start=""922"" data-end=""1091""><strong data-start=""922"" data-end=""931"">Base:</strong> Geranium Leaf, Violet Leaf, Cedarwood – A fresh and refined finish with crisp green leaves and smooth cedarwood, adding depth, elegance, and lasting freshness.</p>
<p data-start=""1093"" data-end=""1323"">✨ <strong data-start=""1095"" data-end=""1131"">The Perfumer's Workshop Tea Rose</strong> is perfect for everyday wear, brunches, office, special occasions, and spring or summer days—delivering a beautifully natural rose fragrance that is fresh, elegant, and effortlessly timeless.</p>
<p data-start=""1325"" data-end=""1371"" data-is-last-node="""" data-is-only-node=""""><strong data-start=""1325"" data-end=""1371"" data-is-last-node="""">Eau De Toilette • Long Lasting • For Women</strong></p>
