decant-partial-of-armaf-club-de-nuit-intense-overdose-extrait-de-parfum,Decant/Partial Of Armaf Club De Nuit Intense Overdose Extrait De Parfum,"<p><strong>Armaf Club De Nuit Intense Overdose Extrait De Parfum – Fruity Citrus Power with Rich Woody Elegance ✨</strong></p>
<p><strong>With a</strong><strong> twist of Absolu Aventus 2023 by Creed</strong></p>
<p>Experience <strong>Armaf Club De Nuit Intense Overdose</strong>, a premium Extrait De Parfum for men that combines vibrant fruity freshness with deep woody sophistication. Opening with an energetic burst of pineapple and sparkling citrus, this long-lasting fragrance evolves into a refined heart before settling into a warm, sensual base that leaves an unforgettable impression. Perfect for the modern man who values confidence, elegance, and lasting performance.</p>
<p><strong>🍍 Fragrance Notes:</strong></p>
<p><strong>Top:</strong> Pineapple, Blue Crystal, Tangerine, Bergamot – A fresh and vibrant opening featuring juicy pineapple, sparkling citrus, and crisp aromatic accords for an energetic first impression.</p>
<p><strong>Heart:</strong> Oakmoss, Vanilla Flower, Plum – A refined blend of earthy oakmoss, delicate vanilla flower, and luscious plum, adding richness and sophistication.</p>
<p><strong>Base:</strong> White Powder, Patchouli, Amber, Tonka Bean – A smooth and masculine finish with warm amber, earthy patchouli, creamy tonka bean, and soft powdery notes for a long-lasting, irresistible trail.</p>
<p>✨ <strong>Armaf Club De Nuit Intense Overdose</strong> is perfect for evening wear, special occasions, date nights, and year-round use—delivering a bold, luxurious fragrance that balances fresh fruity notes with rich woody warmth and exceptional longevity.</p>
<p><strong>Extrait De Parfum • Long Lasting • For Men</strong></p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","Armaf, Full, New Arrivals",true,Size,5ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,23,deny,manual,429.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/CDNOverdose.png?v=1784345068,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,white-powder; patchouli; amber; tonka-bean,,,,,,,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Armaf/Club-De-Nuit-Intense-Overdose-136770.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,fruity; sweet; citrus; earthy; vanilla,,oakmoss; vanilla; plum,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,pineapple; blue-crystal; tangerine; bergamot,,,for-men,,,,,,bottle,citrus; fruity; woody,,,,special-occasion,fruity; citrus; woody,,,spray,,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
