decant-partial-of-azzaro-pour-homme-edt,Decant/Partial Of Azzaro Pour Homme EDT,"<p>Azzaro Pour Homme EDT for Men: Unveiling Timeless Masculinity and Sophistication 🌟</p>
<p>Indulge in the essence of refined masculinity with Azzaro Pour Homme 100ml EDT, an iconic fragrance that epitomizes sophistication and charm. Crafted to captivate the senses and evoke a sense of timeless allure, this fragrance is a celebration of the modern man's elegance and charisma.</p>
<p>🔥 A Symphony of Fragrance Notes: Embark on a sensory journey with Azzaro Pour Homme, where each note harmonizes seamlessly to create an unforgettable olfactory experience.</p>
<p>Top Notes: The fragrance unfolds with a burst of freshness, as lavender, lemon, caraway, basil, bergamot, clary sage, iris, and star anise dance delicately on the skin. This vibrant medley sets the stage for the masculine journey ahead, exuding confidence and allure from the first spritz.<br>Middle Notes: Delve deeper into the heart of Azzaro Pour Homme and discover a rich blend of vetiver, sandalwood, patchouli, cedar, juniper berries, and cardamom. These aromatic notes add depth and complexity, creating a warm and inviting core that resonates with sophistication and refinement.<br>Base Notes: As the fragrance settles, it leaves a lasting impression with its base notes of oakmoss, leather, amber, musk, and tonka bean. This seductive combination lingers on the skin, leaving behind a trail of undeniable sensuality and allure.</p>
<p>🎩 Timeless Elegance: Azzaro Pour Homme embodies the essence of timeless elegance, making it the perfect companion for the modern gentleman. Whether worn for a formal occasion or a casual outing, this fragrance exudes confidence and sophistication, leaving a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>
<p>🛒 Discover Fragrance Excellence at Fragstalk.in: Elevate your fragrance experience with 100% original niche and designer fragrances. Fragstalk.in, your go-to destination for all fragrance needs in India, offers a curated selection at amazing prices.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Azzaro, Decant, New Arrivals, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,599.00,5350.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Azzaro-Pour-Homme-Edt-100ml.png?v=1779879097,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,oakmoss; leather; amber; musk; tonka-bean,azzaro,,,edt,,azzaro,,aromatic; spicy,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Azzaro/Azzaro-pour-Homme-829.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,aromatic; woody; fresh-spicy; earthy; lavender-1; mossy,,vetiver; patchouli; cedar; sandalwood; juniper-berries; cardamom,,,,,,,,,,,office,,,,lavender; lemon; caraway; basil; bergamot; clary-sage; iris; star-anise,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
