decant-partial-of-armaf-uniq-oud-forever-edp,Decant/Partial Of Armaf Uniq Oud Forever EDP,"<p><strong>Armaf Uniq Oud Forever Eau de Parfum – Spiced Citrus with Modern Oud Sophistication ✨</strong></p>
<p>Discover <strong>Armaf Uniq Oud Forever</strong>, a luxurious Eau de Parfum that blends vibrant citrus, exotic spices, elegant florals, and rich woody accords into a bold and contemporary fragrance. Crafted for those who appreciate refined luxury, this long-lasting scent opens with an invigorating burst of bergamot, cardamom, saffron, and pink pepper, unfolds into a sophisticated floral heart, and finishes with a warm, woody base that leaves a smooth and unforgettable impression.</p>
<p>🖤 <strong>Fragrance Notes:</strong></p>
