revlon-charlie-blue-100ml-edt,Revlon Charlie Blue 100ml EDT,"<h5>Revlon Charlie Blue 100ml EDT: Embrace Classic Feminine Elegance | A Timeless Floral Fragrance </h5>
<p>Revlon Charlie Blue 100ml Eau De Toilette is an iconic fragrance that celebrates confidence, grace, and timeless beauty. Crafted for the modern woman who appreciates classic floral compositions, this captivating scent effortlessly blends fresh citrus, delicate florals, and warm woody accords. Every spray leaves behind an elegant and memorable trail, making it the perfect companion for everyday sophistication and special occasions alike.</p>
<p>🔥 <strong>Unveiling the Fragrance Notes:</strong></p>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong> Begin your fragrance journey with a refreshing blend of bergamot, geranium, chamomile, and galbanum. The sparkling citrus freshness of bergamot is beautifully complemented by the green, aromatic nuances of galbanum and the soft herbal touch of chamomile, creating an invigorating and uplifting opening.</p>
<p><strong>Middle Notes:</strong> At the heart of Revlon Charlie Blue lies a luxurious bouquet of jasmine, muguet (lily of the valley), rose, and ylang-ylang. These elegant florals bloom gracefully to deliver a rich, feminine aroma that exudes charm, romance, and timeless sophistication.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong> As the fragrance settles, it unveils a warm and comforting base of sandalwood, oakmoss, and musk. Creamy sandalwood blends seamlessly with the earthy richness of oakmoss, while soft musk adds depth and sensuality, leaving behind a smooth, elegant, and long-lasting finish.</p>
<p>🌿 <strong>Crafted for the Confident Woman:</strong> Revlon Charlie Blue is more than just a fragrance—it's a timeless expression of elegance and individuality. Perfect for women who appreciate classic floral scents with a sophisticated woody base, this Eau De Toilette transitions effortlessly from daytime wear to evening occasions. Its enduring charm and refined composition make it a cherished addition to any fragrance collection.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"",New Arrivals,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,799.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/RevlonCHarlieBlue.png?v=1784027374,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,bottle,citrus; floral; woody; jasmine; lavender; rose,,,,everyday; special-occasion,floral; woody,,,spray,,female,,,,,,,kg,,,active
issey-miyake-l-eau-d-issey-pour-homme-125ml-edt,Issey Miyake L’eau D’issey Pour Homme 125ml EDT,"<p><strong>Issey Miyake L’Eau D’Issey Pour Homme 125ml EDT: A Timeless Fusion of Freshness and Elegance 🌊✨</strong></p>
<p>Discover the iconic freshness of <strong>Issey Miyake L’Eau D’Issey Pour Homme 125ml Eau De Toilette</strong>, a sophisticated fragrance that perfectly balances vibrant citrus, warm spices, and rich woody notes. Designed for the modern man, this timeless scent captures the harmony between nature and elegance, making it an ideal choice for every occasion.</p>
<p>🌟 <strong>Indulge in the Essence of Luxury:</strong><br>Crafted with exceptional precision, <strong>L’Eau D’Issey Pour Homme</strong> is celebrated for its refreshing yet masculine character. Its <strong>125ml Eau De Toilette</strong> concentration delivers a clean, invigorating fragrance that lasts throughout the day, leaving a refined and unforgettable impression.</p>
<p>💧 <strong>Unveiling the Fragrance Notes:</strong></p>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong><br>The journey begins with the sparkling freshness of <strong>Yuzu</strong>, a rare Japanese citrus fruit renowned for its crisp, vibrant, and energizing aroma. Its refreshing character instantly awakens the senses, creating a bright and invigorating opening.</p>
<p><strong>Heart Notes:</strong><br>At the heart, <strong>Cinnamon</strong> and <strong>Nutmeg</strong> blend seamlessly to introduce a warm, spicy richness. These aromatic spices add depth and sophistication, creating a refined contrast to the fresh citrus opening while enhancing the fragrance's masculine appeal.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong><br>As the fragrance settles, the creamy elegance of <strong>Sandalwood</strong> emerges, wrapping the scent in a smooth, woody warmth. This luxurious base provides exceptional depth and longevity, leaving behind a subtle yet captivating trail that exudes confidence and timeless sophistication.</p>
<p>✨ <strong>Perfect for daily wear, office settings, and special occasions, Issey Miyake L’Eau D’Issey Pour Homme is a signature fragrance that embodies freshness, refinement, and effortless masculine style.</strong></p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"",New Arrivals,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,5199.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/IsseyMiyake.png?v=1784026250,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,spray,citrus; spicy; woody,,,,everyday; special-occasion,fresh; citrus; spicy; woody,,,liquid,,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
