<p><strong>Middle Notes:</strong> Cypriol, Benzoin Resinoid, Patchouli, Agarwood<br><em>(A deep and sophisticated heart where earthy cypriol, resinous benzoin, rich patchouli, and luxurious agarwood create an intensely refined and mysterious character.)</em></p>
