<p>Perfect for both men and women, <strong>Celoud Attar</strong> is an exceptional choice for evening wear, special occasions, festive celebrations, or whenever you want to make a lasting statement. Its rich oriental composition balances fruity freshness with woody depth, making it an elegant signature fragrance for every season.</p>
<p>Embrace the essence of refined luxury with <strong>Celoud Attar</strong> – where vibrant freshness meets timeless sophistication. 🌹🌙</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Attars,"",New Arrivals,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1099.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/NaseemCeloud.png?v=1783740562,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,leather; labdanum; amber; vanilla,naseem,,,,,inspired-by-oud-maracuja,,,,men,,,,,,cypriol; benzoin; patchouli; agarwood,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,passionfruit; saffron; rose,,,for-men,,,,,,bottle,vanilla; woody; fruity; rose,,,,special-occasion,oriental; woody; fruity,,,oil,,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
