paris-corner-enchantment-blue-intense-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Enchantment Blue Intense 100ml EDP,"<p><strong>Paris Corner Enchantment Blue Intense Eau de Parfum</strong>, a refreshing and sophisticated <strong>Woody Floral</strong> fragrance that perfectly balances vibrant freshness with refined elegance. The fragrance opens with an invigorating blend of <strong>Lemon, Bellflower, Cedar, and Apple</strong>, creating a crisp, fruity-citrus introduction that is both uplifting and captivating. As it develops, the heart reveals a graceful combination of <strong>Bamboo, Jasmine, and White Rose</strong>, adding a fresh floral character with a touch of natural serenity and sophistication. The scent settles into a smooth and enduring base of <strong>Cedar, Musk, and Amber</strong>, leaving behind a warm, woody, and subtly sensual trail that lingers beautifully throughout the day. Versatile and effortlessly elegant, <strong>Paris Corner Enchantment Blue Intense Eau de Parfum</strong> is an excellent choice for daily wear, offering a long-lasting fragrance experience that exudes confidence, freshness, and timeless charm.</p>
