french-avenue-enigma-une-100ml-edp,French Avenue Enigma Une 100ml EDP,"<p><strong>French Avenue Enigma Une Eau de Parfum</strong>, a bold and sophisticated <strong>Amber Spicy</strong> fragrance crafted for those who appreciate elegance with a touch of mystery. This captivating scent opens with a vibrant blend of <strong>Cardamom, Cinnamon, Nutmeg, and Grapefruit</strong>, creating a warm yet refreshing introduction that instantly commands attention. As the fragrance unfolds, the heart reveals a refined fusion of <strong>Lavender, Coumarin, and Vanilla</strong>, adding a smooth, aromatic sweetness that enhances its depth and character. The composition settles into a rich and long-lasting base of <strong>Licorice, Patchouli, Amber, and Vetiver</strong>, leaving behind a warm, sensual trail that is both distinctive and unforgettable. Perfect for evening wear or special occasions, <strong>French Avenue Enigma Une Eau de Parfum</strong> delivers a luxurious fragrance experience, combining spice, sweetness, and woody elegance for a truly timeless appeal.</p>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong> Cardamom, Cinnamon, Nutmeg, Grapefruit</p>
