paris-corner-ministry-of-oud-amber-oud-100ml-extrait-de-perfume,Paris Corner Ministry of Oud Amber Oud 100ml Extrait De Perfume,"<p>Ministry of Oud Amber Oud Extrait De Perfume for men, an olfactory masterpiece that encapsulates the essence of sophistication and masculinity. This exquisite fragrance is a harmonious blend of aromatic notes that create a captivating and long-lasting aura.</p>
<p>At first spritz, you'll be greeted by a burst of citrus freshness, as the top notes of Lemon, Lime, and Bergamot dance on your skin. This initial zesty explosion is like a ray of sunshine, uplifting and invigorating. As it settles, the heart of the fragrance unveils a rich and opulent bouquet. Rose de Mai, Fig, Jasmine, and Ylang-Ylang combine to form a floral symphony that is both elegant and enticing.</p>
<p>The real magic of Amber Oud unfolds in its base notes. Here, the warm and sensual Agarwood (Oud) takes center stage, infusing the scent with an exotic and woody depth. This precious ingredient is skillfully complemented by Birch, Sandalwood, Benzoin, Ambergris, Cinnamon, Saffron, Oakmoss, Orris, Musk, and Patchouli. The result is a complex and alluring aroma that lingers on your skin throughout the day and into the night.</p>
<p>Amber Oud is more than just a fragrance; it's an experience, a statement of refined taste and style. It's worth noting that this scent is a homage to the iconic <strong>Amber Aoud by Roja Dove</strong>, known for its luxurious and spicy amber character. Ministry of Oud has masterfully recreated the essence of this masterpiece, making it accessible to those who appreciate the art of fine fragrance.</p>
<p><strong>Top notes</strong> are Bergamot, Lime and Lemon</p>
<p><strong>Middle notes</strong> are Rose, Fig, Ylang-Ylang and Jasmine</p>
<p><strong>Base notes</strong> are Agarwood (Oud), Ambergris, Saffron, Cinnamon, Civet, Orris Root, Birch, Sandalwood, Musk, Oakmoss and Patchouli.</p>
<p>In a world of scents, Ministry of Oud Amber Oud stands as a testament to the enduring allure of amber-infused perfumery, destined to become a signature scent for the discerning modern man. Elevate your presence with the timeless charm of Amber Oud, and let its aromatic symphony speak volumes about your sophistication and individuality.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"",New Arrivals,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,1749.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/MinistryOfoudAmberOud.png?v=1783580621,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,bottle,citrus; floral; woody,,,,,woody; floral,,,spray,,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
pendora-scents-chanteur-100ml-edp,Pendora Scents Chanteur 100ml EDP,"<p><strong>Pendora Scents Chanteur EDP: A Bold Fusion of Florals, Fruits &amp; Earthy Warmth | A Modern Statement Fragrance with Sensual Depth</strong></p>
<p>Pendora Scents Chanteur 100ml Eau De Parfum is a captivating and expressive fragrance that blends creamy florals, juicy fruits, and earthy woody accords into a bold and modern composition. Designed for individuals who love unique contrasts and confident scents, this fragrance delivers a dynamic journey that feels both vibrant and deeply sensual.</p>
<p>🔥 <strong>Unveiling the Fragrance Notes:</strong></p>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong> The fragrance opens with an intriguing blend of creamy tuberose, spicy black pepper, juicy pineapple, and earthy patchouli. This unusual yet captivating combination creates a bold, slightly tropical opening with a warm spicy edge that immediately stands out.</p>
<p><strong>Heart Notes:</strong> As the scent evolves, elegant jasmine pairs with a fresh twist of lemon. This heart brings brightness and floral sophistication, balancing the richness of the top notes with a clean, uplifting, and refined character.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong> The fragrance settles into a smooth and long-lasting base of patchouli, musk, vanilla, and vetiver. These warm and earthy notes add depth, softness, and sensuality, leaving behind a rich, comforting trail that lingers beautifully on the skin.</p>
<p>🌿 <strong>Crafted for the Confident Modern Individual:</strong> Pendora Scents Chanteur is more than just a fragrance—it is an expression of bold personality and refined taste. Perfect for evening wear, special occasions, and year-round use, this Eau De Parfum is designed for those who appreciate distinctive blends, strong projection, and memorable signature scents.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, New Arrivals, Partial",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,1399.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Pendorachanteur.png?v=1783060666,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,clear,spray,floral; fruity; woody; spicy,,,glass; metal; paper,special-occasion; everyday,floral; fruity; woody; musky,,,liquid,,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
ajmal-yearn-perfume-100ml-edp,Ajmal Yearn Perfume 100ml EDP,"<p><strong>Ajmal Yearn Eau de Parfum</strong>, a refreshing and effortlessly elegant fragrance crafted for those who appreciate a clean, modern scent with timeless appeal. This vibrant composition opens with an uplifting blend of <strong>Bright Citrus, Fresh Lemon, and Bergamot</strong>, delivering an energizing burst of freshness that instantly awakens the senses. As the fragrance unfolds, the heart reveals a graceful harmony of <strong>Soft Florals and Aromatic Accords</strong>, adding a refined and soothing character to the composition. The scent settles into a smooth, comforting base of <strong>Light Woods and Clean Musk</strong>, leaving behind a subtle, long-lasting trail of freshness and sophistication. Perfect for everyday wear, <strong>Ajmal Yearn Eau de Parfum</strong> offers a versatile and uplifting fragrance experience, making it an excellent choice for those who seek effortless elegance and lasting confidence throughout the day.</p>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong> Bright Citrus, Fresh Lemon, Bergamot</p>
