naseem-burhan-bakhoor-50gms,Naseem Burhan Bakhoor 50GMS,"<p data-start=""0"" data-end=""439"" class=""PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer""><strong data-start=""0"" data-end=""31"">Naseem Burhan Bakhoor 50GMS</strong> is a premium bakhoor that brings together fresh, floral, and woody accords to create a refined and long-lasting home fragrance experience. Designed to elevate your surroundings with an elegant and soothing aroma, this luxurious bakhoor is ideal for daily use, festive occasions, and welcoming guests. Its perfectly balanced composition delivers a clean yet comforting scent that leaves a lasting impression.<span aria-hidden=""true"" class=""PDq2pG_selectionAnchor""></span></p>
<p data-start=""441"" data-end=""993"">The fragrance opens with a refreshing blend of <strong data-start=""488"" data-end=""501"">Aldehydes</strong>, <strong data-start=""503"" data-end=""513"">Citrus</strong>, and <strong data-start=""519"" data-end=""534"">Fresh Notes</strong>, offering a bright and airy introduction that instantly revitalizes the atmosphere. As the scent unfolds, the heart reveals a sophisticated fusion of <strong data-start=""685"" data-end=""694"">Orris</strong>, <strong data-start=""696"" data-end=""704"">Rose</strong>, and <strong data-start=""710"" data-end=""721"">Jasmine</strong>, adding a soft powdery elegance complemented by rich floral nuances. The fragrance settles into a warm and luxurious base of <strong data-start=""847"" data-end=""856"">Amber</strong>, <strong data-start=""858"" data-end=""866"">Musk</strong>, and <strong data-start=""872"" data-end=""886"">Sandalwood</strong>, creating a smooth, woody finish with a subtle musky depth that lingers beautifully throughout your space.</p>
<p data-start=""995"" data-end=""1304""><strong data-start=""995"" data-end=""1020"">Naseem Burhan Bakhoor</strong> is more than just an incense—it's a symbol of timeless elegance and refined craftsmanship. Perfect for enhancing your home, creating a serene ambiance, or adding a touch of luxury to special moments, this bakhoor envelops your surroundings in a sophisticated and memorable fragrance.</p>
<p data-start=""1306"" data-end=""1326""><strong data-start=""1306"" data-end=""1326"">Notes Breakdown:</strong></p>
<p data-start=""1328"" data-end=""1456"" data-is-last-node="""" data-is-only-node=""""><strong data-start=""1328"" data-end=""1342"">Top Notes:</strong> Aldehydes, Citrus, Fresh Notes<br data-start=""1373"" data-end=""1376""><strong data-start=""1376"" data-end=""1393"">Middle Notes:</strong> Orris, Rose, Jasmine<br data-start=""1414"" data-end=""1417""><strong data-start=""1417"" data-end=""1432"" data-is-only-node="""">Base Notes:</strong> Amber, Musk, Sandalwood</p>",FragsTalk,Home & Garden > Decor > Home Fragrances > Incense,"",New Arrivals,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,625.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/NaseemBurhanGiftSet.png?v=1783395394,1,"",false,,,3686,,,,,,,,,,,,,amber; musk; sandalwood,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,orris; rose; jasmine,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,aldehydes; citrus; fresh,,,,,,,,blue,,,,resin,plastic,,,,,,,,disposable,,,,,,kg,,,active
naseem-sadaat-bakhoor-50gms,Naseem Sadaat Bakhoor 50GMS,"<p><strong>Naseem Sadaat Bakhoor 50GMS</strong> is a luxurious bakhoor that fills your home with an inviting blend of fruity sweetness, elegant florals, and rich woody warmth. Crafted to create a welcoming and relaxing atmosphere, this premium incense offers a long-lasting aroma that is perfect for daily use, special gatherings, or moments of relaxation. Its beautifully balanced composition transforms any space into a haven of comfort and sophistication.</p>
<p>The fragrance opens with a vibrant burst of <strong>Pineapple</strong> and <strong>Strawberry</strong>, delivering a juicy, refreshing sweetness that instantly uplifts the senses. As the aroma develops, the heart reveals a graceful bouquet of <strong>Rose</strong>, <strong>Jasmine</strong>, and <strong>Peach</strong>, combining delicate florals with a soft fruity nuance to create an elegant and captivating character. The fragrance settles into a rich and comforting base of <strong>Vanilla</strong>, <strong>Patchouli</strong>, and <strong>Sandalwood</strong>, leaving behind a warm, creamy, and woody trail that lingers beautifully in your surroundings.</p>
<p><strong>Naseem Sadaat Bakhoor</strong> is more than just an incense—it's an expression of luxury and refined tradition. Whether used to fragrance your home, welcome guests, or enhance special occasions, it creates an unforgettable ambiance with its harmonious blend of fruity, floral, and woody notes.</p>
<p><strong>Notes Breakdown:</strong></p>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong> Pineapple, Strawberry<br><strong>Middle Notes:</strong> Rose, Jasmine, Peach<br><strong>Base Notes:</strong> Vanilla, Patchouli, Sandalwood</p>",FragsTalk,Home & Garden > Decor > Home Fragrances > Incense,"",New Arrivals,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,625.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/NaseemSadaat.png?v=1783394741,1,"",false,,,3686,,,,,,,,,,,,,vanilla; patchouli; sandalwood,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,rose; jasmine; peach,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,pineapple; strawberry,,,,,,,,floral,,,,resin,resin,,,,,,,,disposable,,,,,,kg,,,active
naseem-bushra-bakhoor-50gms,Naseem Bushra Bakhoor 50GMS,"<h5 data-section-id=""ep2ku8"" data-start=""0"" data-end=""89"" class=""PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer"">
<span role=""text""><strong data-start=""3"" data-end=""87"">Naseem Bushra Bakhoor 50GMS – Timeless Floral Elegance with Warm Musky Depth 🌹✨</strong></span><span aria-hidden=""true"" class=""PDq2pG_selectionAnchor""></span>
</h5>
<p data-start=""90"" data-end=""134""><strong data-start=""90"" data-end=""134"">For Men &amp; Women | Floral • Musky • Woody</strong></p>
<p data-start=""136"" data-end=""416""><strong data-start=""136"" data-end=""161"">Naseem Bushra Bakhoor</strong> is a beautifully crafted unisex bakhoor that combines sparkling citrus, elegant florals, and a rich woody-musky base. Smooth, comforting, and long-lasting, it fills your space with a luxurious aroma that exudes warmth, sophistication, and timeless charm.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""h5y3yk"" data-start=""418"" data-end=""441""><span role=""text""><strong data-start=""422"" data-end=""441"">Fragrance Notes</strong></span></h3>
<p data-start=""443"" data-end=""706""><strong data-start=""443"" data-end=""459"">✨ Top Notes:</strong> Aldehyde, Ylang-Ylang &amp; Bergamot 🌿🍋🌼<br data-start=""499"" data-end=""502"">A fresh and radiant opening where airy aldehydes blend seamlessly with the exotic sweetness of ylang-ylang and the zesty brightness of bergamot, creating a clean, uplifting, and inviting first impression.</p>
<p data-start=""708"" data-end=""939""><strong data-start=""708"" data-end=""728"">🌸 Middle Notes:</strong> Carnation, Rose &amp; Peach 🌺🌹🍑<br data-start=""759"" data-end=""762"">The heart blossoms with the spicy elegance of carnation, the romantic richness of rose, and the juicy sweetness of peach, adding a soft floral warmth and refined sophistication.</p>
<p data-start=""941"" data-end=""1144""><strong data-start=""941"" data-end=""959"">🌳 Base Notes:</strong> Vetiver, Leather &amp; Musk 🌿🖤🤍<br data-start=""990"" data-end=""993"">A rich and comforting base of earthy vetiver, smooth leather, and sensual musk leaves a warm, elegant, and long-lasting trail that lingers beautifully.</p>
<p data-start=""1146"" data-end=""1376"">Perfect for <strong data-start=""1158"" data-end=""1246"">daily use, special gatherings, prayer spaces, and creating a welcoming home ambiance</strong>, <strong data-start=""1248"" data-end=""1273"">Naseem Bushra Bakhoor</strong> is ideal for those who appreciate <strong data-start=""1308"" data-end=""1372"">fresh floral fragrances with a luxurious woody-musky finish.</strong> 🌹✨</p>
<p data-start=""1378"" data-end=""1448"" data-is-last-node="""" data-is-only-node=""""><strong data-start=""1378"" data-end=""1448"" data-is-last-node="""">Naseem Bushra Bakhoor – where floral beauty meets timeless warmth.</strong></p>",FragsTalk,Home & Garden > Decor > Home Fragrances > Incense,"",New Arrivals,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,625.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/NaseemBushraBakhoor.png?v=1783336239,1,"",false,,,3686,,,,,,,,,,,,,vetiver; leather; musk,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,carnation; rose; peach,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,aldehydes; ylang-ylang; bergamot,,,,,,,,gold,,,,resin,metal,,,,,,,,disposable,,,,,,kg,,,active
decant-partial-of-paris-corner-pendora-scent-black-legendary-classic-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Pendora Scent Black Legendary Classic EDP,"<p><strong>Paris Corner Pendora Scent Black Legendary Classic EDP – Timeless Fruity Aromatic Elegance ✨</strong></p>
<p>Step into refined masculinity with <strong>Paris Corner Pendora Scent Black Legendary Classic Eau de Parfum</strong>, a bold and charismatic fragrance that blends juicy fruits, spicy aromatics, and deep woody-amber warmth. Modern yet classic in spirit, it’s designed for those who carry confidence with effortless style.</p>
<p>🌿 <strong>Fragrance Journey:</strong></p>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong> Pineapple, Bergamot – A bright and energetic opening where juicy pineapple meets sparkling bergamot, creating an instantly fresh and uplifting introduction.</p>
<p><strong>Heart Notes:</strong> Red Apple, Cardamom, Pepperwood (Hercules Club), Jasmine – A vibrant and spicy-floral heart where crisp apple sweetness blends with warm cardamom, aromatic pepperwood spice, and a soft touch of jasmine elegance.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong> Tonka Bean, Amber, White Cedar Extract, Oakmoss – A rich and masculine dry-down where creamy tonka and golden amber meet dry cedarwood and earthy oakmoss, leaving a deep, refined trail.</p>
<p>✨ <strong>Vibe:</strong> Fresh • Fruity • Spicy • Masculine • Confident Classic</p>
<p>Perfect for daily wear, office settings, and evening outings, <strong>Black Legendary Classic</strong> is a versatile signature scent that balances freshness with warm sophistication.</p>
<p><strong>Eau de Parfum • Long Lasting • Masculine-leaning Unisex</strong></p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Partial",false,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,0.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/BlackLegendaryClassic.png?v=1783149795,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,draft
