decant-partial-of-arabiyat-prestige-bedour-edp,Decant/Partial Of Arabiyat Prestige Bedour EDP,"<p><strong>Arabiyat Prestige Bedour EDP – Fruity Gourmand Elegance ✨</strong></p>
<p>Discover a playful yet sophisticated twist with <strong>Arabiyat Prestige Bedour Eau de Parfum</strong>, a modern fragrance that blends sparkling fruits, sweet gourmand facets, and warm musky depth. It feels youthful, addictive, and softly sensual — a scent that lingers with cozy sweetness and smooth refinement.</p>
<p>🌿 <strong>Fragrance Journey:</strong></p>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong> Citrus, Manzana (Apple), Bergamot, Licorice – A bright and juicy opening where crisp apple and citrus sparkle meet the soft sweetness of bergamot, lifted by a subtle, intriguing touch of licorice.</p>
<p><strong>Heart Notes:</strong> Pineapple Tart, Dry Amber, Vanilla, Vetiver – A delicious gourmand heart where tropical pineapple pastry sweetness blends with warm amber and creamy vanilla, grounded by earthy vetiver for balance and depth.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong> Brown Sugar, Musk – A soft, comforting dry-down with warm brown sugar sweetness wrapped in clean, skin-like musk, leaving a smooth and cozy trail.</p>
<p>✨ <strong>Vibe:</strong> Sweet • Fruity • Gourmand • Playful • Warm &amp; Addictive</p>
<p>Perfect for casual wear, evenings out, and cooler weather, <strong>Bedour EDP</strong> is an easy-going yet memorable scent that feels deliciously modern and comforting.</p>
<p><strong>Eau de Parfum • Long Lasting • Sweet Unisex</strong></p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Partial",false,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,0.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/ArabiyatPrestigeBedour_38582b36-90d7-4b47-9b11-aa6277e25f58.png?v=1783149367,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,draft
