decant-partial-of-arabiyat-prestige-bedour-extrait,Decant/Partial Of Arabiyat Prestige Bedour Extrait,"<p><strong>Arabiyat Prestige Bedour Extrait – Soft Gourmand Radiance ✨</strong></p>
<p>Indulge in the dreamy elegance of <strong>Arabiyat Prestige Bedour Extrait</strong>, a luxurious fragrance that blends juicy fruits, delicate florals, and irresistible gourmand sweetness. Smooth, modern, and addictive, it wraps the skin in a soft yet captivating aura of warmth and charm.</p>
<p>🌿 <strong>Fragrance Journey:</strong></p>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong> White Peach, Mandarin, Bergamot – A luminous opening where juicy white peach melts into sparkling citrus freshness, creating a bright and inviting introduction.</p>
