decant-partial-of-mykonos-sorrento-edp,Decant/Partial Of Mykonos Sorrento EDP,"<p><strong>Mykonos Sorrento EDP – Mediterranean Citrus Breeze ✨</strong></p>
<p>Capture the spirit of sunlit coasts with <strong>Mykonos Sorrento Eau de Parfum</strong>, a vibrant, refreshing fragrance inspired by the sparkling energy of the Mediterranean. Bright citrus, airy florals, and soft woods come together in a modern, uplifting composition that feels effortlessly clean and elegant.</p>
<p>🌿 <strong>Fragrance Journey:</strong></p>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong> Mandarin, Bergamot, Ginger, Magnolia, Grapefruit – A radiant opening bursting with zesty citrus freshness, gently softened by floral magnolia and a spicy ginger sparkle.</p>
<p><strong>Heart Notes:</strong> Ginger, Grapefruit, Neroli, Powdery Notes, Watery Notes – A breezy and luminous heart where watery accords and delicate neroli blend with airy powderiness, creating a clean, ocean-kissed freshness.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong> Amber, Musk, Cedarwood, Grapefruit, Patchouli, Orris Root – A smooth and grounding dry-down with soft woods, sensual musk, earthy patchouli, and elegant orris adding a refined touch of depth.</p>
<p>✨ <strong>Vibe:</strong> Fresh • Aquatic • Citrusy • Modern • Mediterranean Elegance</p>
<p>Perfect for daytime wear, summer outings, and warm climates, <strong>Mykonos Sorrento EDP</strong> feels like a coastal escape in a bottle — crisp, airy, and effortlessly sophisticated.</p>
<p><strong>Eau de Parfum • Fresh Long Lasting • Unisex</strong></p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Partial",false,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,0.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/MykonosSorrento.png?v=1783148290,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,green,bottle,citrus; floral; woody,,,glass; metal; paper,everyday; special-occasion,fresh; citrus; floral; woody,,,liquid,summer,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,draft
