<p><strong>Heart Notes:</strong> Floral, Resinous – A deep, textured heart that balances soft florals with balsamic resins, adding complexity and a smooth oriental richness.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong> Oud, Musk, Woody – A powerful and long-lasting dry-down where smoky oud, sensual musk, and dry woods create a luxurious and commanding trail.</p>
