decant-partial-of-ajmal-amir-one-edp,Decant/Partial Of Ajmal Amir One EDP,"<p><strong>Ajmal Amir One Eau De Parfum ✨</strong><br><em>A Fresh Citrus–Floral Elegance with Warm Oud Depth</em></p>
<p>Experience a refined and modern fragrance that balances freshness, florals, and rich oriental warmth. <strong>Ajmal Amir One EDP</strong> opens with a bright citrusy lift, unfolds into a smooth floral heart, and settles into a deep, sensual oud base — creating a sophisticated and long-lasting signature.</p>
<p>🌿 <strong>Fragrance Profile</strong></p>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong> Bergamot, Lemon, Lavender, Clary Sage<br>A fresh and aromatic opening where zesty citrus meets calming lavender and herbal sage, creating an uplifting and clean introduction.</p>
<p>🌸 <strong>Heart Notes:</strong> Sandalwood, Rose, Jasmine, Lily-of-the-Valley, Patchouli<br>A rich floral-woody heart that blends creamy sandalwood with elegant rose and jasmine, softened by lily-of-the-valley and earthy patchouli for depth and balance.</p>
<p>🌫️ <strong>Base Notes:</strong> Agarwood (Oud), Amber, Musk<br>A warm and sensual dry-down where smoky oud, golden amber, and smooth musk create a deep, long-lasting oriental trail.</p>
<p>✨ <strong>Overall Impression:</strong><br>A versatile blend of freshness and depth — ideal for both daily wear and special occasions. It reflects confidence, elegance, and modern oriental sophistication.</p>
