decant-partial-of-zimaya-al-embratur-intense-edp-1,Decant/Partial Of Zimaya Al Embratur Intense EDP,"<p><strong>Zimaya Al Embratur Intense EDP: A Bold Blend of Citrus, Spices &amp; Warm Vanilla | A Powerful Fragrance for the Modern Gentleman</strong></p>
<p>Zimaya Al Embratur Intense Eau De Parfum is a sophisticated fragrance that combines sparkling citrus, aromatic spices, and rich gourmand accords into a captivating scent experience. Crafted for those who appreciate confidence and elegance, this luxurious composition offers a perfect balance of freshness and warmth, making it an ideal signature fragrance for every occasion.</p>
<p>🔥 <strong>Unveiling the Fragrance Notes:</strong></p>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong> The fragrance opens with a refreshing burst of zesty lemon and vibrant pink pepper. This lively citrus-spice combination creates an energetic and invigorating introduction that instantly captures attention with its crisp and modern appeal.</p>
<p><strong>Heart Notes:</strong> As the fragrance unfolds, the exotic richness of saffron blends beautifully with aromatic lavender and luscious fruity accords. This refined heart adds warmth, elegance, and a touch of sweetness, creating a perfectly balanced and sophisticated character.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong> The scent settles into a luxurious base of creamy vanilla, smooth tonka bean, warm amber, and sensual musk. These comforting notes provide remarkable depth, exceptional longevity, and a rich, inviting trail that lingers effortlessly throughout the day.</p>
<p>🌿 <strong>Crafted for the Modern Gentleman:</strong> Zimaya Al Embratur Intense is more than just a fragrance—it's a statement of confidence, sophistication, and timeless style. Perfect for office wear, evening occasions, special events, and year-round use, this Eau De Parfum is designed for men who seek a versatile, long-lasting fragrance with an unforgettable presence.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","",false,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,0.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/ElEmbratureIntense.png?v=1783067549,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,blue,spray,citrus; spicy; vanilla; woody,,,glass; paper,everyday; special-occasion,citrus; aromatic; gourmand,,,liquid,,male,,,,,,,kg,,,draft
decant-partial-of-zimaya-al-embratur-intense-edp-1,,,,,,,,,95ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,0.00,,true,true,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,
decant-partial-of-swiss-arabian-shaghaf-for-men-edp,Decant/Partial Of Swiss Arabian Shaghaf For Men EDP,"<p><strong>Swiss Arabian Shaghaf For Men EDP: A Dynamic Fusion of Citrus, Spices &amp; Deep Amber Woods | A Bold Masculine Fragrance with Intense Character</strong></p>
<p>Swiss Arabian Shaghaf For Men Eau De Parfum is a powerful and energetic fragrance that blends fresh citrus, aromatic spices, aquatic nuances, and rich woody-amber depth. Crafted for men who appreciate strong, long-lasting scents with a modern oriental twist, this fragrance delivers a bold and captivating aura that evolves beautifully throughout the day.</p>
<p>🔥 <strong>Unveiling the Fragrance Notes:</strong></p>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong> The fragrance opens with a refreshing burst of Chinese orange, lemon, and lavender. This vibrant citrus-aromatic introduction creates an immediate sense of freshness and cleanliness, setting a bright and energetic tone.</p>
<p><strong>Heart Notes:</strong> As the scent develops, marine sea notes blend with cardamom, cinnamon, sage, cypriol oil (nagarmotha), and marigold. This complex heart brings a unique balance of aquatic freshness, spicy warmth, and herbal depth, adding richness and intrigue to the composition.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong> The fragrance settles into a deep and indulgent base of praline, tolu balsam, patchouli, palisander rosewood, black amber, and ebony wood. These warm gourmand-woody accords create a powerful, long-lasting trail that is sweet, smoky, and intensely masculine.</p>
<p>🌿 <strong>Crafted for the Confident Man:</strong> Swiss Arabian Shaghaf For Men is more than just a fragrance—it is a statement of strength, passion, and modern oriental luxury. Perfect for evening wear, special occasions, and cooler weather, this Eau De Parfum is designed for men who prefer bold, intense, and memorable signature scents.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","",false,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,0.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/SwissArabianShaghafForMen.png?v=1783066613,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,clear,spray,citrus; spicy; woody; oriental,,,glass; metal,special-occasion; everyday,citrus; aromatic; spicy; woody; musky,,,liquid,fall; winter,male,,,,,,,kg,,,draft
