decant-partial-of-ahmed-al-maghribi-khilfah-edp,Decant/Partial Of Ahmed Al Maghribi Khilfah EDP,"<p><strong>Ahmed Al Maghribi Khilfah EDP: A Fresh Aromatic Blend of Citrus, Woods &amp; Musky Amber | A Modern Sophisticated Unisex Fragrance</strong></p>
<p>Ahmed Al Maghribi Khilfah Eau De Parfum is a refined and contemporary fragrance that beautifully balances bright citrus freshness, aromatic herbs, and deep woody-musky accords. Designed for fragrance lovers who appreciate elegance with a modern twist, this scent delivers a clean yet powerful aura that feels both uplifting and long-lasting.</p>
<p>🔥 <strong>Unveiling the Fragrance Notes:</strong></p>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong> The fragrance opens with an invigorating burst of grapefruit, bergamot, davana, pink pepper, and ginger. This vibrant blend creates a zesty, spicy-citrus introduction that feels energetic, fresh, and instantly attention-grabbing.</p>
<p><strong>Heart Notes:</strong> As the scent develops, ambrette blends with white amber, agarwood (oud), and rosemary. This heart brings a smooth balance of musky warmth, subtle sweetness, and aromatic herbal freshness, adding depth and sophistication to the composition.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong> The fragrance settles into a rich and long-lasting base of ambroxan, patchouli, vetiver, musk, and leather. These warm woody and leathery accords create a powerful masculine-leaning trail that is clean, sensual, and undeniably modern.</p>
<p>🌿 <strong>Crafted for the Modern Individual:</strong> Ahmed Al Maghribi Khilfah is more than just a fragrance—it is a statement of confidence, refinement, and contemporary elegance. Perfect for office wear, daily use, and all-season versatility, this Eau De Parfum is designed for those who appreciate fresh yet deep fragrances with excellent performance and sophistication.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","",false,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,0.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/MaghribiKhilfah.png?v=1783065866,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,clear,bottle,citrus; woody; spicy; fresh; herbal,,,glass; metal,everyday; special-occasion,fresh; citrus; aromatic; woody; musky,,,liquid,spring; summer; fall; winter,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,draft
