decant-partial-of-khadlaj-ria-100ml-edp,Decant/Partial Of Khadlaj Ria 100ml EDP,"<p><strong>Khadlaj Ria 100ml EDP: A Juicy Fruity-Modern Blend with Sweet Citrus &amp; Musky Depth | A Vibrant Feminine Fragrance Full of Energy</strong></p>
<p>Khadlaj Ria 100ml Eau De Parfum is a bright, playful, and modern fragrance that celebrates juicy fruits, sparkling citrus, and soft musky-woody undertones. Designed for women who love fun yet elegant scents, this fragrance delivers an uplifting aura that feels youthful, radiant, and effortlessly charming from the first spray to the final dry down.</p>
