<p><strong>Middle Notes:</strong> As the scent develops, warm rum blends with woody accords, cinnamon, clary sage, and African geranium. This heart reveals a rich, boozy-spicy character with herbal freshness and refined warmth, adding complexity and depth to the composition.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong> The fragrance settles into a smoky, sensual base of incense, leather, benzoin, patchouli, and cedarwood. These deep and resinous notes create a long-lasting, masculine trail that is bold, mysterious, and undeniably sophisticated.</p>
