decant-partial-of-pendora-scents-chanteur-100-ml-edp,Decant/Partial Of Pendora Scents Chanteur EDP,"<p><strong>Pendora Scents Chanteur EDP: A Bold Fusion of Florals, Fruits &amp; Earthy Warmth | A Modern Statement Fragrance with Sensual Depth</strong></p>
