decant-partial-of-paris-corner-ministry-of-oud-thailand-oud-in-cairo-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Ministry Of Oud Thailand Oud In Cairo EDP,"<p><strong>Paris Corner Ministry Of Oud Thailand Oud In Cairo EDP: An Exotic Masterpiece of Smoky Oud &amp; Spices | A Bold Oriental Fragrance for True Connoisseurs</strong></p>
<p>Paris Corner Ministry Of Oud Thailand Oud In Cairo Eau De Parfum is a luxurious oriental fragrance that celebrates the richness of precious oud, smoky resins, and warm spices. Crafted for those who appreciate deep, intense, and sophisticated scents, this captivating composition delivers an unforgettable olfactory journey filled with mystery, elegance, and timeless allure.</p>
<p>🔥 <strong>Unveiling the Fragrance Notes:</strong></p>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong> The fragrance opens with an enticing blend of warm cinnamon, rich leather, and aromatic cardamom. This bold introduction creates a spicy and leathery accord that instantly captures attention, setting the stage for a truly luxurious fragrance experience.</p>
<p><strong>Heart Notes:</strong> As the scent evolves, the mystical warmth of myrrh combines with the smoky richness of tobacco, incense, and Atlas cedar. This opulent heart adds remarkable depth and character, enveloping the senses in a refined oriental embrace that is both powerful and elegant.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong> The fragrance settles into an extraordinary base featuring Thailand oud, capriol oil, nagamuthu, Cambodian oud, and earthy patchouli. These rare and precious ingredients create an intensely woody, smoky, and long-lasting finish, leaving behind a distinguished trail of luxury and sophistication.</p>
<p>🌿 <strong>Crafted for the Lovers of Oriental Luxury:</strong> Paris Corner Ministry Of Oud Thailand Oud In Cairo is more than just a fragrance—it's an expression of bold elegance and artisanal perfumery. Perfect for evening wear, formal occasions, and cooler seasons, this Eau De Parfum is designed for those who seek exceptional longevity, rich oud accords, and a commanding presence with every spray.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,379.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/MinistryOfOudThailandInCairo.png?v=1783052080,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,thailand-oud; cambodian-oud; cypriol-oil; patchouli,,,,,,,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/PARIS-CORNER/Thailand-Oud-in-Cairo-74585.html,,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,,,myrrh; incense; tobacco; atlas-cedar,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,leather; cardamom; cinnamon,,,,,,,,clear,,woody; spicy; herbal,,,glass,special-occasion,oriental; woody,,,liquid,fall; winter,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
