burberry-for-men-100ml-edt,Burberry For Men 100ml EDT,"<h5>Burberry For Men 100ml EDT: A Classic Expression of British Elegance | Timeless Everyday Fragrance for the Modern Gentleman</h5>
<p>Burberry For Men 100ml Eau De Toilette is an iconic fragrance that perfectly balances fresh aromatic notes with warm woody accords, creating a scent that is effortlessly sophisticated and undeniably masculine. Designed for the gentleman who appreciates timeless style and understated confidence, this classic fragrance leaves a lasting impression from the first spray to the final dry down.</p>
<p>🔥 <strong>Unveiling the Fragrance Notes:</strong></p>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong> Experience a refreshing opening as crisp mint, calming lavender, sparkling bergamot, and aromatic thyme come together in perfect harmony. This invigorating blend delivers an energizing burst of freshness that awakens the senses and sets the tone for an elegant fragrance journey.</p>
<p><strong>Middle Notes:</strong> At the heart lies a refined composition of cedarwood, creamy sandalwood, aromatic geranium, delicate jasmine, and earthy oakmoss. These woody and floral accords create a balanced, sophisticated character that is both comforting and effortlessly masculine, making it ideal for everyday wear.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong> As the fragrance settles, rich musk, smooth vanilla, and warm amber emerge to create a soft, sensual finish. This inviting base provides depth, warmth, and long-lasting appeal, leaving behind a memorable trail of confidence and timeless charm.</p>
<p>🌿 <strong>Crafted for the Modern Gentleman:</strong> Burberry For Men is more than just a fragrance—it's a symbol of classic British sophistication and effortless style. Perfect for office wear, casual outings, evening occasions, and year-round use, this Eau De Toilette is designed for men who value elegance, versatility, and enduring quality in every spray.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","",true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,4999.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/BurberryForMen.png?v=1783048796,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,musk; vanilla; amber,burberry,,,edt,,,,,,,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,,,cedar; sandalwood; geranium; jasmine; oakmoss,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,mint; lavender; bergamot; thyme,,,,,,,,,spray,fresh; woody; citrus,,,glass; metal; paper,everyday; special-occasion,aromatic; woody; musky,,,liquid,,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
jpg-le-male-75ml-edt,JPG Le Male 75ml EDT,"<p><strong>JPG Le Male 75ml Eau de Toilette – Fresh Aromatic Fougère with Warm Vanilla &amp; Woods ✨</strong><br><strong>Inspired By:</strong> Jean Paul Gaultier Le Male</p>
