chopard-cedar-malaki-80-ml-edp,Chopard Cedar Malaki 80 ml EDP,"<p><strong>Chopard Cedar Malaki 80ml Eau De Parfum – Majestic Cedar with Aromatic Woody Depth ✨</strong></p>
<p>Discover <strong>Chopard Cedar Malaki Eau De Parfum</strong>, a refined and powerful fragrance that blends aromatic herbs, crisp citrus, and deep woody accords. Elegant yet commanding, this scent captures the essence of modern masculinity with a sophisticated, long-lasting trail rooted in rich cedarwood.</p>
<p><strong>🌿 Fragrance Notes:</strong></p>
<p><strong>Top:</strong> Cypress, Cardamom, Artemisia, Grapefruit &amp; Lavender – A fresh and aromatic opening where herbal lavender and citrusy grapefruit meet spicy cardamom and green cypress for a vibrant, invigorating start.</p>
<p><strong>Heart:</strong> Atlas Cedar &amp; Cedar – A majestic cedarwood heart delivers a dry, woody elegance that feels refined, structured, and confidently masculine.</p>
<p><strong>Base:</strong> Cypriol Oil (Nagarmotha), Labdanum, Patchouli &amp; Tonka Bean – A deep, earthy base of smoky cypriol, resinous labdanum, and creamy tonka bean enriched with patchouli creates a warm, sensual, and long-lasting dry down.</p>
<p>✨ <strong>Chopard Cedar Malaki</strong> is perfect for office wear, evening sophistication, and cooler weather—a fragrance that reflects strength, clarity, and understated luxury.</p>
<p>Inspired by Chopard Cedar Malaki.</p>
