elizabeth-arden-green-tea-100ml-edp-1,Elizabeth Arden Green Tea 100ml EDP,"<p><strong>Elizabeth Arden Green Tea 100ml Eau De Parfum – Refreshing Citrus with Herbal Serenity ✨</strong></p>
<p>Discover <strong>Elizabeth Arden Green Tea Eau De Parfum</strong>, a revitalizing fragrance that blends sparkling citrus, aromatic herbs, and soft musky woods. Crisp, uplifting, and effortlessly refreshing, this scent evokes a sense of calm and natural elegance with every spray.</p>
<p>🌿 <strong>Fragrance Notes:</strong></p>
<p><strong>Top:</strong> Lemon, Bergamot, Mint, Orange Peel &amp; Rhubarb – A vibrant burst of citrus and cool mint, balanced by the crisp tartness of rhubarb for an energizing opening.</p>
<p><strong>Heart:</strong> Jasmine, Musk, Oakmoss, Fennel, Carnation &amp; White Amber – A refreshing floral heart enriched with aromatic herbs, soft musk, and warm amber for a beautifully balanced character.</p>
<p><strong>Base:</strong> Green Tea, Jasmine, Musk, Oakmoss, Celery Seeds, Caraway, Cloves &amp; Amber – A soothing blend of green tea and earthy woods, enhanced with delicate spices and warm amber for a clean, comforting finish.</p>
<p>✨ <strong>Elizabeth Arden Green Tea</strong> is perfect for daily wear, warm weather, and moments when you want to feel fresh and revitalized—a fragrance that reflects purity, vitality, and effortless sophistication.</p>
