anfar-midnight-frost-intense-100ml-extrait-de-parfum,Anfar Midnight Frost Intense 100ml Extrait De Parfum,"<p><strong>Anfar Midnight Frost Intense 100ml Extrait De Parfum – Icy Freshness with Bold Elegance ✨</strong></p>
<p>Discover <strong>Anfar Midnight Frost Intense Extrait De Parfum</strong>, a captivating fragrance that blends crisp fruits, aromatic spices, and warm woody accords. Fresh yet intensely sophisticated, this scent delivers an invigorating opening that settles into a smooth, long-lasting trail of elegance.</p>
<p>🌿 <strong>Fragrance Notes:</strong></p>
<p><strong>Top:</strong> Apple, Sicilian Bergamot, Italian Lemon &amp; Star Anise – A vibrant burst of juicy apple and sparkling citrus, enhanced by the aromatic warmth of star anise.</p>
<p><strong>Heart:</strong> Ice, Plum, Orange Blossom &amp; Cardamom – A refreshing icy accord meets luscious plum, delicate orange blossom, and spicy cardamom for a uniquely refined heart.</p>
<p><strong>Base:</strong> Driftwood, Amber, Musk &amp; Moss – A rich woody foundation softened by warm amber, clean musk, and earthy moss, creating a deep and memorable finish.</p>
<p>✨ <strong>Anfar Midnight Frost Intense</strong> is perfect for both everyday wear and evening occasions—a fragrance that embodies freshness, confidence, and modern sophistication with exceptional lasting power.</p>
<p><strong>Long Lasting • Extrait De Parfum • Unisex</strong></p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Anfar, Full",true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,3150.00,4500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/AnfarMidnightFrostIntense.png?v=1782880259,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,driftwood; amber; musk; moss,anfar,,,extrait,,,,,,unisex,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,,,plum; orange-blossom; cardamom,,,,,,,,,,,,special-offer-on-anfar-perfumes,,,apple; bergamot; lemon; star-anise,,,unisex,,,,,blue,pump-bottle,citrus; woody; spicy; floral,,,plastic,everyday; special-occasion,fresh; citrus; aromatic; woody,,,liquid,,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
decant-partial-of-paris-corner-ministry-of-oud-amber-oud-extrait-de-perfume,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Ministry of Oud Amber Oud Extrait De Perfume,"<p>Ministry of Oud Amber Oud Extrait De Perfume for men, an olfactory masterpiece that encapsulates the essence of sophistication and masculinity. This exquisite fragrance is a harmonious blend of aromatic notes that create a captivating and long-lasting aura.</p>
<p>At first spritz, you'll be greeted by a burst of citrus freshness, as the top notes of Lemon, Lime, and Bergamot dance on your skin. This initial zesty explosion is like a ray of sunshine, uplifting and invigorating. As it settles, the heart of the fragrance unveils a rich and opulent bouquet. Rose de Mai, Fig, Jasmine, and Ylang-Ylang combine to form a floral symphony that is both elegant and enticing.</p>
<p>The real magic of Amber Oud unfolds in its base notes. Here, the warm and sensual Agarwood (Oud) takes center stage, infusing the scent with an exotic and woody depth. This precious ingredient is skillfully complemented by Birch, Sandalwood, Benzoin, Ambergris, Cinnamon, Saffron, Oakmoss, Orris, Musk, and Patchouli. The result is a complex and alluring aroma that lingers on your skin throughout the day and into the night.</p>
<p>Amber Oud is more than just a fragrance; it's an experience, a statement of refined taste and style. It's worth noting that this scent is a homage to the iconic <strong>Amber Aoud by Roja Dove</strong>, known for its luxurious and spicy amber character. Ministry of Oud has masterfully recreated the essence of this masterpiece, making it accessible to those who appreciate the art of fine fragrance.</p>
<p><strong>Top notes</strong> are Bergamot, Lime and Lemon</p>
<p><strong>Middle notes</strong> are Rose, Fig, Ylang-Ylang and Jasmine</p>
<p><strong>Base notes</strong> are Agarwood (Oud), Ambergris, Saffron, Cinnamon, Civet, Orris Root, Birch, Sandalwood, Musk, Oakmoss and Patchouli.</p>
<p>In a world of scents, Ministry of Oud Amber Oud stands as a testament to the enduring allure of amber-infused perfumery, destined to become a signature scent for the discerning modern man. Elevate your presence with the timeless charm of Amber Oud, and let its aromatic symphony speak volumes about your sophistication and individuality.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,8,deny,manual,399.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Ministry-of-Oud-Amber-Oud-100ML-Extrait-De-Perfume-300x300_bc5f8b3d-7456-4c28-92ca-c2c461d56f14.png?v=1782806988,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
