armaf-club-de-nuit-intense-man-limited-edition-a-collectors-pride-105ml-parfum,Armaf Club De Nuit Intense Man Limited Edition A Collectors Pride 105ml Parfum,"<p><strong>Armaf Club De Nuit Intense Man 105ml Parfum Limited Edition: A Collector's Pride</strong> 🌟</p>
<p>Embark on an olfactory journey of distinction with the all-new Armaf Club De Nuit Intense Man 105ml Parfum Limited Edition – a testament to luxury and exclusivity. Crafted to captivate the senses and evoke an air of sophistication, this fragrance masterpiece is a collector's pride, redefining the essence of opulence.</p>
<p>🔥 <strong>Unparalleled Longevity:</strong> Experience the allure of enduring sophistication with Armaf Club De Nuit Intense Man. This fragrance, meticulously formulated and expertly blended in the UAE, boasts an unmatched longevity that ensures you stand out in every crowd, leaving a lasting impression that transcends time.</p>
<p>💎 <strong>Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<strong>Top Notes:</strong> A symphony of freshness awaits as apple, bergamot, blackcurrant, pineapple, and lemon converge to create an invigorating burst of citrus and fruit. Feel the vibrancy of this opening act, setting the stage for an unforgettable journey.</li>
<li>
<strong>Middle Notes:</strong> Delve deeper into the heart of elegance with the delicate fusion of rose, birch, and jasmine. These floral and woody accords add depth and complexity, infusing the fragrance with a refined charm that captivates the senses.</li>
<li>
<strong>Base Notes:</strong> The grand finale unfolds with the rich and sensual allure of musk, ambergris, patchouli, and vanilla. This symphony of base notes creates a warm and inviting trail that lingers on the skin, leaving a mesmerizing aura in your wake.</li>
</ul>
<p>👑 <strong>The Creed Aventus Connection:</strong> Armaf Club De Nuit Intense Man stands proudly as the best Inspired of the iconic Creed Aventus, revered as the king in the fragrance community. Embrace the essence of royalty and sophistication with this remarkable creation, destined to become a timeless classic in its own right.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","",true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,6899.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Armaf-Club-de-Nuit-Intense-Man-Limited-Edition_8a261e4d-ae8a-4338-95ce-cf91800af7ec.png?v=1782715091,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,adults,,,spray,citrus; fruity; woody; spicy; floral,gift-box,,glass; metal,special-occasion,citrus; fruity; woody; oriental; musky,,,liquid,,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
