ibraheem-al-qurashi-diamond-collection-discovery-set-10mlx10-white-edp,Ibraheem Al Qurashi Diamond Collection Discovery Set 10mlx10 White EDP,"<p data-start=""0"" data-end=""78"" class=""PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer""><strong data-start=""0"" data-end=""78"">Ibraheem Al Qurashi Diamond Collection Discovery Set White EDP (10ml x 10)</strong><span aria-hidden=""true"" class=""PDq2pG_selectionAnchor""></span></p>
<p data-start=""80"" data-end=""530"">Experience the art of luxury perfumery with the <strong data-start=""128"" data-end=""194"">Ibraheem Al Qurashi Diamond Collection Discovery Set White EDP</strong>, a curated selection of ten exquisite 10ml Eau de Parfum sprays designed for fragrance lovers who appreciate variety, sophistication, and exceptional craftsmanship. From bright, invigorating mornings to elegant evenings, this premium collection offers a versatile fragrance wardrobe that adapts effortlessly to every occasion and mood.</p>
<p data-start=""532"" data-end=""1116"">Explore an extraordinary spectrum of scent profiles, from sparkling citrus and crisp aquatic accords to delicate florals, creamy woods, warm vanilla, rich incense, and majestic oud. Each fragrance reveals its own unique personality, whether it's the fresh vibrancy of bergamot and mandarin, the romantic elegance of peony and cherry blossom, the smooth refinement of iris and sandalwood, or the captivating depth of frankincense, patchouli, and precious woods. Crafted with long-lasting performance and refined Arabian artistry, every spray leaves an elegant and memorable impression.</p>
<p data-start=""1118"" data-end=""1448"">The collection includes <strong data-start=""1142"" data-end=""1340"">Black Carbon Diamond, Emerald Soul Diamond, Grey Pearl Diamond, White Regent Diamond, Purple Heart Diamond, Nude Coral Diamond, Pink Sakura Diamond, Cullinan Iris Diamond, Black Incense Diamond,</strong> and <strong data-start=""1345"" data-end=""1366"">Blue Aqua Diamond</strong>, allowing you to discover a signature scent for every season, setting, and style.</p>
<p data-start=""1450"" data-end=""1682"" data-is-last-node="""" data-is-only-node="""">Perfect for personal exploration or as a luxurious gift, this discovery set lets you experience the brilliance of the Diamond Collection before committing to a full-sized bottle. Elevate your fragrance journey—one diamond at a time.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"",Ibraheem Al Qurashi,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,5,deny,manual,7449.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/wdw.png?v=1782447246,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,white,spray,citrus; aquatic; floral; woody; vanilla; spicy,gift-box,,glass; metal,everyday; special-occasion,citrus; fresh; floral; woody; musky; gourmand,,,liquid,spring; summer; fall; winter,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
ibraheem-al-qurashi-diamond-collection-discovery-set-10mlx10-black-edp,Ibraheem Al Qurashi Diamond Collection Discovery Set 10mlx10 Black EDP,"<p><strong>Ibraheem Al Qurashi Diamond Collection Discovery Set Black EDP (10ml x 10)</strong></p>
<p>Step into a world of confidence, depth, and unmistakable luxury with the <strong>Ibraheem Al Qurashi Diamond Collection Discovery Set Black EDP</strong>. Curated for those who appreciate bold Arabian perfumery, this premium collection includes ten 10ml Eau de Parfum vials, each showcasing a distinctive expression of power, refinement, and mystery. Designed to suit different moods and occasions, the set offers an immersive fragrance journey without compromising on performance or elegance.</p>
<p>Discover captivating compositions that weave together smoky accords, supple leather, dark woods, warm spices, and rich amber, balanced by subtle hints of florals and precious resins. Every fragrance delivers impressive longevity and a commanding presence, leaving a memorable trail that evolves beautifully throughout the day and into the night. Whether you're dressing for an important meeting, a formal evening, or simply elevating your everyday style, there's a scent to match the moment.</p>
<p>Ideal for fragrance enthusiasts and first-time explorers alike, this discovery set lets you experience the artistry of the Diamond Collection before investing in a full-sized bottle. Find the scent that reflects your personality, complements your style, and becomes your signature. Sophisticated, versatile, and undeniably luxurious, this collection is an invitation to explore the finest traditions of modern Arabian perfumery.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Ibraheem Al Qurashi",true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,7449.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/zAS.png?v=1782446624,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,black,spray,woody; spicy; floral,gift-box,,glass; plastic,special-occasion; everyday,woody; oriental; spicy; floral,,,liquid,,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
birra-taaruf-premium-attar-concentrated-perfume-oil,Birra Taaruf Premium Attar Concentrated Perfume Oil,"<h6><strong>Taaruf Eau de Parfum – A Journey of Luxury &amp; Distinction ✨🖤🌙</strong></h6>
<h6><strong>Long Lasting Eau de Parfum | Rich Woody Ambery Fragrance 🌲🔥</strong></h6>
<h6>Experience the timeless elegance of <strong>Taaruf</strong>, a captivating fragrance that embodies sophistication, depth, and refinement. Crafted for those who appreciate luxurious oriental scents, Taaruf blends precious spices, rich woods, and sensual musks to create an unforgettable signature. Every spray unveils a warm and mysterious aura that commands attention with effortless grace. ✨👑</h6>
<h6>🌟 <strong>Fragrance Notes</strong>
</h6>
<h6>🔥 <strong>Top Notes: Spicy Saffron</strong>
</h6>
<h6>The fragrance opens with the exotic richness of Saffron 🌺✨, delivering a warm, spicy, and slightly leathery aroma that instantly captivates the senses and sets the stage for an opulent experience.</h6>
<h6>🌲 <strong>Heart Notes: Agarwood (Oud) &amp; Woody Notes</strong>
</h6>
<h6>At the heart lies the majestic beauty of Agarwood (Oud) 🖤🌳, blended with rich Woody Notes 🌲. This luxurious combination creates a smoky, earthy, and subtly sweet character that exudes confidence, elegance, and mystery.</h6>
<h6>🌙 <strong>Base Notes: Amber, Musk &amp; Cashmere Wood</strong>
</h6>
<h6>As the fragrance settles, warm Amber ✨🧡 adds a balsamic richness, while soft Musk 🤍 envelops the skin in sensual comfort. Velvety Cashmere Wood 🪵 completes the composition with a smooth, cozy warmth, leaving behind an irresistibly refined and long-lasting trail.</h6>
<h6>Perfect for evening wear 🌃🥂, special occasions 🎩✨, or moments when you want to make a lasting impression, <strong>Taaruf</strong> is a fragrance that speaks of luxury, confidence, and timeless style.</h6>
<h6>🖤✨ <strong>Bold, elegant, and unforgettable—Taaruf is a fragrance that leaves its mark long after you've gone. 🌲🔥👑</strong>
</h6>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Attar, Birra, Full, Summer Essentials",true,Size,6ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,5,deny,manual,500.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/BirraTaaruf.png?v=1782371029,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,'1,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
