decant-partial-of-ajmal-chapter-1-edp,Decant/Partial Of Ajmal Chapter 1 EDP,"<h4 data-section-id=""hnojc2"" data-start=""0"" data-end=""76"" class=""PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer"">
<span role=""text""><strong data-start=""2"" data-end=""76"">Ajmal Chapter 1 EDP – A Story of Sophistication &amp; Strength 📖✨🌿</strong></span><span aria-hidden=""true"" class=""PDq2pG_selectionAnchor""></span>
</h4>
<p data-start=""78"" data-end=""145""><strong data-start=""78"" data-end=""145"">Long Lasting Eau de Parfum | Warm Woody Oriental Fragrance 🖤🌲</strong></p>
<p data-start=""147"" data-end=""517"">Begin a new chapter of confidence and elegance with <strong data-start=""199"" data-end=""228"">Ajmal Chapter 1 100ml EDP</strong>. ✨ Crafted for individuals who appreciate depth, character, and timeless style, this captivating fragrance unfolds like a compelling story—rich in warmth, mystery, and sophistication. Every note is carefully blended to create a scent that leaves a lasting impression wherever you go. 🌟💼</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""1wqzpf3"" data-start=""519"" data-end=""545""><span role=""text"">🌿 <strong data-start=""526"" data-end=""545"">Fragrance Notes</strong></span></h3>
<h4 data-start=""547"" data-end=""585""><span role=""text"">✨ <strong data-start=""554"" data-end=""585"">Top Notes: Cardamom &amp; Amber</strong></span></h4>
<p data-start=""586"" data-end=""780"">The fragrance opens with the aromatic spice of Cardamom 🌱💚, beautifully paired with the golden warmth of Amber 🧡✨. This inviting introduction feels smooth, refined, and instantly captivating.</p>
<h4 data-start=""782"" data-end=""831""><span role=""text"">🍃 <strong data-start=""790"" data-end=""831"">Heart Notes: Patchouli, Fig &amp; Cypriol</strong></span></h4>
<p data-start=""832"" data-end=""1040"">At its heart lies an intriguing blend of earthy Patchouli 🌿, sweet and luscious Fig 🍈, and smoky Cypriol 🌾🔥. Together, these notes create a rich and distinctive character that exudes confidence and depth.</p>
<h4 data-start=""1042"" data-end=""1116""><span role=""text"">🌲 <strong data-start=""1050"" data-end=""1116"">Base Notes: Cashmere Wood, Sandalwood, White Musk &amp; Tonka Bean</strong></span></h4>
<p data-start=""1117"" data-end=""1390"">The scent settles into a luxurious base of velvety Cashmere Wood 🪵🤎 and creamy Sandalwood 🌳, enhanced by the clean sensuality of White Musk 🤍 and the warm sweetness of Tonka Bean 🍂✨. The result is a smooth, comforting trail that lingers beautifully throughout the day.</p>
<p data-start=""1392"" data-end=""1626"">Whether you're heading to an important meeting 💼, an evening gathering 🌙🥂, or simply embracing your everyday journey 🚶♂️✨, <strong data-start=""1520"" data-end=""1539"">Ajmal Chapter 1</strong> is the perfect signature scent for those who value style, presence, and individuality.</p>
<h4 data-section-id=""ueeyls"" data-start=""1628"" data-end=""1718""><span role=""text"">📖✨ <strong data-start=""1636"" data-end=""1718"" data-is-last-node="""">Write your story with confidence. Leave your mark with Ajmal Chapter 1. 🌿🖤🔥</strong></span></h4>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Ajmal, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,5,deny,manual,1059.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/AjmalChapter1_7ce669a4-a81f-42cf-abb2-36e98be97f87.png?v=1782369002,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
