ajmal-chapter-3-50ml-edp,Ajmal Chapter 3 50ml EDP,"<h5><strong>Ajmal Chapter 3 50ml EDP – A Story of Radiance &amp; Romance 📖✨🌹</strong></h5>
<p><strong>Long Lasting Eau de Parfum | Fruity Floral Fragrance 🍑🌸</strong></p>
<p>Discover a fragrance that captures the beauty of joyful moments and timeless elegance with <strong>Ajmal Chapter 3 50ml EDP</strong>. ✨ Bursting with luscious fruits, blooming florals, and a warm sensual finish, this enchanting scent is designed for those who embrace life with confidence, grace, and a touch of romance. 💖🌷</p>
<h5>🍑 <strong>Fragrance Notes</strong>
</h5>
<h5>✨ <strong>Top Notes: Peach, Apricot, Red Fruits &amp; Green Notes</strong>
</h5>
<p>The fragrance opens with a delicious blend of juicy Peach 🍑, sweet Apricot 🍊, and vibrant Red Fruits 🍓🍒, brightened by refreshing Green Notes 🌿. This sparkling introduction feels playful, uplifting, and irresistibly inviting. 💫</p>
<h5>🌹 <strong>Heart Notes: Rose &amp; Osmanthus</strong>
</h5>
<p>At its heart blooms the timeless elegance of Rose 🌹, paired beautifully with the delicate fruity-floral charm of Osmanthus 🌼✨. Together, they create a graceful and romantic bouquet that exudes femininity and sophistication. 💕🌸</p>
<h5>🌙 <strong>Base Notes: Musk, Sandalwood &amp; Amber</strong>
</h5>
<p>As the fragrance settles, soft Musk 🤍 wraps the senses in comfort, while creamy Sandalwood 🌳 and golden Amber ✨🧡 add warmth, depth, and lasting elegance. The result is a smooth, sensual trail that lingers beautifully throughout the day. 🌙💫</p>
<p>Perfect for daytime outings ☀️, romantic dinners 🌹🍷, or special celebrations 🎉✨, <strong>Ajmal Chapter 3</strong> is a versatile fragrance that effortlessly enhances your natural charm and leaves a memorable impression wherever you go.</p>
<h6>📖💖 <strong>Sweet, elegant, and captivating—Ajmal Chapter 3 is a beautiful chapter written in the language of fragrance. 🍑🌹✨</strong>
</h6>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","",true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,4999.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Chapter3.png?v=1782367071,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,musk; sandalwood; amber,ajmal,,,edp,,made-in-uae,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Ajmal/Chapter-3-102737.html,unisex,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,,,rose; osmanthus,,,,,,,,,,,,special-discount-on-ajmal-chapter-series,,,peach; apricot; red-fruits; green-notes,,,unisex,,,,,black,spray,fruity; floral; woody,,,glass; plastic,everyday; special-occasion,fruity; floral; woody; musky,,,liquid,,female,,,,,,,kg,,,active
ajmal-chapter-2-50ml-edp,Ajmal Chapter 2 50ml EDP,"<h5><strong>Ajmal Chapter 2 50ml EDP – A Tale of Elegance &amp; Warmth 📖✨🤍</strong></h5>
<p><strong>Long Lasting Eau de Parfum | Sophisticated Floral Gourmand Fragrance 🌸🍦</strong></p>
<p>Turn the page to a world of charm, comfort, and timeless sophistication with <strong>Ajmal Chapter 2 50ml EDP</strong>. ✨ Crafted for those who appreciate refined beauty and graceful allure, this captivating fragrance blends delicate florals, creamy gourmand notes, and sensual woods into an unforgettable olfactory journey. A scent that feels both comforting and luxurious, perfect for every memorable moment. 💖🌙</p>
<h5>🌿 <strong>Fragrance Notes</strong>
</h5>
<h5>✨ <strong>Top Notes: Black Tea, Jasmine &amp; Spices</strong>
</h5>
<p>The fragrance opens with the rich aroma of Black Tea ☕🖤, delicately infused with blooming Jasmine 🌼 and a touch of exotic Spices 🌿✨. This elegant introduction feels warm, inviting, and intriguingly sophisticated.</p>
<h5>🌸 <strong>Heart Notes: Almond, Heliotrope &amp; Orris</strong>
</h5>
<p>At its heart, creamy Almond 🌰 adds a delicious softness, while powdery Heliotrope 🌸 and luxurious Orris 💜 create a velvety floral bouquet that radiates elegance and refinement. The result is smooth, comforting, and irresistibly charming. ✨💕</p>
<h5>🤍 <strong>Base Notes: Vanilla, Musk &amp; Sandalwood</strong>
</h5>
<p>The fragrance settles into a sensual base of sweet Vanilla 🍦, soft White Musk 🤍, and creamy Sandalwood 🌳. This warm and comforting blend leaves behind a sophisticated trail that lingers beautifully throughout the day and night. 🌙✨</p>
<h5>Perfect for romantic evenings 🌹, special occasions ✨🥂, or everyday moments when you want to feel effortlessly elegant 💃, <strong>Ajmal Chapter 2</strong> envelops you in a luxurious aura of warmth and femininity.</h5>
<h5>📖💖 <strong>Soft, sophisticated, and unforgettable—Ajmal Chapter 2 is the perfect next chapter in your fragrance story. ✨🌸🍦🤍</strong>
</h5>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Ajmal, Full",true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,5,deny,manual,4999.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/AjmalChapter2.png?v=1782366213,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,vanilla; musk; sandalwood,ajmal,,,edp,,made-in-uae,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Ajmal/Chapter-2-102736.html,unisex,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,powdery; almond; vanilla; nutty; sweet,,almond; heliotrope; orris,,,,,,,,,,,,special-discount-on-ajmal-chapter-series,,,black-tea; jasmine; spices,,,unisex,,,,,black,,floral; woody; vanilla,,,glass,everyday; special-occasion,floral; gourmand; woody,,,liquid,,female,,,,,,,kg,,,active
