decant-partial-of-7-scents-amethyst-aura-edp,Decant/Partial Of 7 Scents Amethyst Aura EDP,"7 Scents Amethyst Aura 100ml EDP – Watery Florals with Serene Elegance 💜🌊For Men &amp; Women | Fresh • Floral • Woody
7 Scents Amethyst Aura is a luminous unisex fragrance that captures the calm beauty of water-soaked florals and soft woods. Airy, elegant, and effortlessly soothing, it feels like a gentle breeze over blooming petals — refined yet comforting, perfect for everyday elegance.
Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Lotus, Melon, Freesia, Rose Water, Rose, Calone &amp; Cyclamen 🌸💧🍈The opening is fresh and aquatic, blending dewy lotus and melon with delicate freesia and rose water. Calone adds a clean marine freshness, while cyclamen enhances the airy floral sparkle.
Heart Notes: Lily-of-the-Valley, Lily, Water Peony &amp; Carnation 🌼🌿At the heart, a bouquet of soft florals blooms gracefully. Lily-of-the-valley and lily bring purity and brightness, while water peony and carnation add a gentle, romantic depth.
Base Notes: Musk, Tuberose, Exotic Woods, Osmanthus, Cedar, Sandalwood &amp; Amber 🤍🌳The dry-down is warm and serene, where creamy woods and soft amber blend with musk and tuberose. Osmanthus adds a subtle fruity-floral nuance, leaving a smooth, comforting, and long-lasting trail.
Perfect for daytime wear, spring and summer, or anyone who loves fresh aquatic florals with a calm, elegant aura.
💜✨ 7 Scents Amethyst Aura – a whisper of water, flowers, and quiet luxury.
