Base Notes: Tonka Bean, Akigalawood, Ambrofix &amp; Patchouli 🌲🔥
A rich and long-lasting base of creamy tonka, woody notes, and patchouli leaves a sensual and memorable trail.

Perfect for night outs, parties, dates, and cool-weather wear, 9PM Night Out suits those who enjoy sweet, spicy fragrances with a smooth woody finish.

