decant-partial-of-afnan-souvenir-blooming-bliss-edp,Decant/Partial Of Afnan Souvenir Blooming Bliss EDP,"<p>Afnan Souvenir Blooming Bliss 100ml EDP for Women 🌸✨ – A Journey into Sweet Elegance<br>
Afnan Souvenir Blooming Bliss is a luxurious Eau de Parfum crafted in the UAE, designed for women who adore the art of irresistible sweetness wrapped in elegance. With a long-lasting performance that lingers gracefully, this fragrance is Inspired by the creamy sophistication of Vanilla Powder by Matiere Première, offering a scent that feels both comforting and alluring.<br>
