decant-partial-of-afnan-supremacy-noir-edp,Decant/Partial Of Afnan Supremacy Noir EDP,"<p>Afnan Supremacy Noir 100ml Eau De Parfum For Men: Redefining Elegance and Longevity</p>

<p>Step into a world of unparalleled sophistication with Afnan Supremacy Noir, a fragrance masterpiece meticulously crafted for the modern man. Exuding an aura of timeless allure, this 100ml Eau De Parfum is a testament to luxury and refinement, proudly made in the United Arab Emirates (UAE).</p>

<p>🔥 Unrivaled Longevity: Afnan Supremacy Noir stands as a beacon of endurance, promising an unparalleled olfactory journey that lasts through the day and well into the night. Designed for those who demand excellence, its long-lasting formula ensures you make a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>💼 A Scent of Distinction:</p>

<p>Top Notes: The fragrance opens with a captivating blend of Siberian pine, juniper, and Calabrian bergamot, evoking a sense of crisp freshness and invigorating energy. Feel the zesty burst of citrus intertwined with the earthy richness of pine, setting the stage for a memorable experience.<br>
Middle Notes: As the scent unfolds, notes of leather, patchouli, and labdanum emerge, adding depth and complexity to the composition. The warm embrace of leather mingles with the earthy allure of patchouli, while labdanum infuses a touch of resinous sweetness, creating an intoxicating heart that captivates the senses.<br>
Base Notes: The journey culminates in a harmonious blend of clary sage and amber, leaving a trail of refined sensuality in its wake. Bask in the comforting warmth of amber, complemented by the herbal freshness of clary sage, as the fragrance lingers on your skin, leaving an indelible mark of sophistication.</p>

<p>🏙️ A Fragrance Made for Success: Crafted in the UAE, Afnan Supremacy Noir embodies the essence of modern luxury and success. Its versatile nature makes it the perfect companion for any occasion, whether it's a boardroom meeting or a night out on the town.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Afnan, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,500.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Afnan-Supermacy-Noir.png?v=1779820165,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,patchouli; labdanum,afnan,,,parfum,,afnan,,aromatic,,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,woody; aromatic; green; leather; patchouli,,pine-tree; leather; lavender,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,spruce; bergamot; violet,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
