decant-partial-of-afnan-modest-deux-pour-femme-edp,Decant/Partial Of Afnan Modest Deux Pour Femme EDP,"<p>Introducing Afnan Modest Deux Pour Femme, a 100ml Eau de Parfum that encapsulates the essence of timeless elegance and feminine allure. This enchanting fragrance is a symphony of carefully curated notes, each contributing to a harmonious and captivating olfactory experience.</p>

<p>At the pinnacle of this perfume's allure are the Top notes, where the tantalizing blend of Raspberry, Rose, and Cassis unfolds. The juicy sweetness of raspberry intertwines with the delicate floral notes of rose, while the hint of cassis adds a touch of sophistication, creating a captivating opening that sets the stage for the journey to come.</p>

<p>As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes emerge, revealing a delightful combination of Pink Pepper, Peony, and Jasmine. The subtle spiciness of pink pepper adds a modern twist, while the lush peony and intoxicating jasmine contribute a floral bouquet that is both graceful and alluring. Together, these middle notes elevate the fragrance, adding depth and complexity.</p>

<p>The final act of Afnan Modest Deux Pour Femme unfolds with the rich and enduring base notes. Virginia Cedar brings a woody warmth, complemented by the earthy nuances of Patchouli, creating a foundation that grounds the scent in sophistication. White Musk, with its clean and sensual aura, wraps the fragrance in a soft, lingering embrace, leaving a lasting impression.</p>

<p>Indulge in the timeless allure of Afnan Modest Deux Pour Femme, a fragrance that celebrates the essence of femininity with its exquisite blend of notes. This Eau de Parfum is not just a scent; it's a statement, an expression of grace and sophistication that lingers long after you've stepped into the world.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Afnan, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,480.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Afnan-Modest-Deux-pour-femme.png?v=1779820170,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,patchouli; musk; gardenia,afnan,,,edp,,afnan; inspired-by-la-nuit-tresor,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Afnan/Modest-Deux-59135.html,women,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,la-nuit-tresor,,sweet; fruity; warm-spicy; patchouli; vanilla,,vanilla; spices,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,raspberry; dark-chocolate; strawberry; cherry,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
