decant-partial-of-afnan-historic-olmeda-edp,Decant/Partial Of Afnan Historic Olmeda EDP,"<p>Afnan Historic Olmeda Unisex Eau De Parfum 100ml invites you to embark on a sensory journey through the picturesque Spanish countryside. This unisex fragrance embodies the warmth and allure of the historic Olmeda region, enveloping you in a captivating blend of scents that evoke relaxation and tranquility.</p>

<p>Encased in a sleek and stylish 100ml bottle, Afnan Historic Olmeda Eau De Parfum is a testament to refined taste. Its enduring fragrance makes it a versatile choice for any occasion, whether you're exploring the countryside during the day or savoring a romantic evening beneath the stars.</p>

<p>PERFUME NOTES:</p>

<p>Top Notes: A harmonious blend of Pink Pepper, Cardamom, Juniper, and Grapefruit creates an invigorating and lively introduction, setting the stage for the olfactory journey.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: The heart of the fragrance unfolds with the sophisticated combination of Calabrian Bergamot, Cedar, Nutmeg, and Jasmine, lending a nuanced and complex character to the scent.</p>

<p>Base Notes: The fragrance settles into a captivating finish with the grounding notes of Patchouli, Apple, Ambergri, and Musk, leaving a lasting impression that lingers in the air.</p>

<p>Afnan Historic Olmeda Eau De Parfum is more than a fragrance; it's an ode to the timeless beauty of the Spanish countryside, encapsulated in a bottle that speaks of elegance and luxury. Immerse yourself in the essence of Olmeda and let this unisex perfume accompany you on your journey through the rich tapestry of life.</p>

<p>This perfume will remind you of two very popular and expensive fragrances Versace Pour Homme Dylan Blue by Versac And Bleu de Chanel.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Afnan, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,8,deny,manual,550.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Afnan-historic-olmeda.png?v=1779820170,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,ambergris; apple; musk; patchouli,afnan,,,edp,,afnan; inspired-by-dylan-blue,,aromatic,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Afnan/Historic-Olmeda-75670.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,dylan-blue,6-8-hours,fresh-spicy; citrus; aromatic; woody; animalic,,bergamot; cedar; nutmeg-1; jasmine,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,grapefruit; pink-pepper-1; juniper; cardamom,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
