decant-partial-of-afnan-supremacy-pink-pour-femme-edp,Decant/Partial Of Afnan Supremacy Pink Pour Femme EDP,"<p>Afnan Supremacy Pink Pour Femme is a captivating olfactory masterpiece that entices the senses and delivers an enduring, enchanting fragrance experience for women. This exquisite Eau de Parfum, presented in a generous 100ml bottle, promises exceptional longevity, ensuring that you stay enveloped in its alluring aroma throughout the day and well into the night.</p>

<p>At the heart of this fragrance lies a harmonious blend of notes that awakens the senses and unfolds in a captivating symphony. The top notes are a burst of vivacious Pink Pepper and delicate Violet, creating an initial impression that is both spicy and floral. As the perfume evolves, the heart notes of Rose, Peony, and Lily-of-the-Valley reveal themselves, lending a soft, floral elegance to the composition.</p>

<p>Afnan Supremacy Pink Pour Femme finds its depth and allure in the base notes of Musk and Amber. These rich, sensuous elements provide a warm and inviting foundation that lingers on the skin, leaving a trail of sophistication and femininity.</p>

<p>What makes this fragrance even more intriguing is its resemblance to the well-loved Roses Musk by Montale. It captures the essence of this famous fragrance, making it an excellent alternative for those who adore Roses Musk but seek a more budget-friendly option.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Pink Peppercorn and Violet<br>
Middle Notes: Rose, Peony and Muguet<br>
Base Notes: Musk and Dry Amber</p>

<p>In sum, Afnan Supremacy Pink Pour Femme is an enduring, alluring, and budget-conscious choice that embodies the essence of timeless femininity, making it an ideal companion for every woman seeking a long-lasting fragrance that leaves a lasting impression.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Afnan, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,650.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Afnan-Supremacy-pink.png?v=1779820171,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,musk; amber,afnan,,,,,afnan,,aromatic; floral,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Afnan/Supremacy-Pink-70705.html,women,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,rose; floral; fresh; musky; powdery; white-floral,,rose; peony; lily-of-the-valley,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,pink-pepper-1; violet,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
