decant-partial-of-afnan-supremacy-silver-pour-homme-edp,Decant/Partial Of Afnan Supremacy Silver Pour Homme EDP,"<p>Afnan Supremacy Silver Pour Homme Parfum is an olfactory masterpiece designed for the modern, confident man. This extraordinary fragrance, known for its exceptional longevity, is an impeccable blend of top-tier ingredients, ensuring that you leave a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>The top notes of Pineapple, Black Currant, Bergamot, and Apple immediately captivate your senses with their fresh, fruity zest. As the scent unfolds, the heart notes reveal a captivating blend of Birch, Patchouli, Moroccan Jasmine, and Rose. These elements introduce a sense of depth and sophistication, adding an enticing complexity to the fragrance.</p>

<p>Afnan Supremacy Silver Pour Homme truly comes into its own with the base notes of Musk, Oakmoss, Ambergris, and Vanilla. These deep, rich components create an aura of confidence and elegance that lingers throughout the day and well into the evening. This perfume is not only long-lasting but also evokes a sense of luxury and distinction.</p>

<p>Top Notes - Pineapple, Black Currant, Bergamot and Apple<br>
Middle Notes - Birch, Patchouli, Moroccan Jasmine and Rose<br>
Base notes - Musk, Oakmoss, Ambergris and Vanilla.</p>

<p>What sets Afnan Supremacy Silver Pour Homme apart is its uncanny resemblance to the highly acclaimed Aventus by Creed. It serves as an excellent and budget-friendly alternative for those who appreciate the essence of Aventus but prefer not to break the bank. With this fragrance, you can confidently assert your unique style and make a memorable statement, all while enjoying an enduring and enchanting scent. Afnan Supremacy Silver Pour Homme is the perfect olfactory companion for the modern man who demands excellence in his fragrance choices.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Afnan, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,499.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Afnan-Supremacy-Silver.png?v=1779820172,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,musk; oakmoss; ambergris; vanilla,,,,edp,,afnan; inspired-by-aventus,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Afnan/Supremacy-Silver-27352.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,aventus,6-8-hours,fruity; leather; woody; sweet; citrus,,birch; patchouli; moroccan-jasmine; rose,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,pineapple; bergamot; black-currant; apple,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
