decant-partial-of-afnan-supremacy-in-oud-edp,Decant/Partial Of Afnan Supremacy In Oud EDP,"<p>Afnan Supremacy In Oud Parfum for men, is a fragrance that exudes sophistication, mystique, and remarkable longevity. Crafted with a meticulous blend of exquisite notes, it stands as an olfactory masterpiece, ideal for those who appreciate the allure of fine perfumery.</p>

<p>Opening with a burst of opulence, the top notes of Saffron, Nutmeg, and Lavender create an aromatic entrance that is both spicy and soothing. These initial impressions set the stage for a scent journey that is nothing short of extraordinary.</p>

<p>The heart of this fragrance features the majestic Agarwood, also known as Oud, interwoven with Sweet Notes. The inclusion of Agarwood adds an enigmatic depth, its woody and balsamic qualities creating an aura of timeless elegance. Meanwhile, the sweet notes provide a harmonious contrast, enhancing the overall balance and complexity.</p>

<p>As Afnan Supremacy In Oud dries down, the base notes of Patchouli and Musk become more prominent. Patchouli lends a dark, earthy richness, while Musk adds a sensual, animalic quality. This combination ensures that the fragrance lingers on your skin, making it exceptionally long-lasting.</p>

<p>Notably, Afnan Supremacy In Oud is celebrated for its uncanny resemblance to the renowned Oud for Greatness by Initio Parfums Prives. This makes it not just a signature scent but also an affordable alternative, allowing you to experience the luxury of a high-end fragrance without breaking the bank.</p>

<p>Top Notes - Saffron, Nutmeg and Lavender<br>
Middle Notes - Agarwood (Oud) and Sweet Notes<br>
Base Notes - Patchouli and Musk</p>

<p>In sum, Afnan Supremacy In Oud is a captivating, long-lasting perfume that embodies the spirit of Oud and presents itself as an enticing option for those who desire a Inspired of Initio's masterpiece. It's a scent that leaves an indelible impression, evoking confidence, charm, and a sense of timeless allure.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Afnan, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,630.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Afnan-Supremacy-in-Oud.png?v=1779820173,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,patchouli; musk,afnan,,,edp,,afnan; inspired-by-oud-for-greatness-1,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Afnan/Supremacy-in-Oud-68283.html,unisex,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,oud-for-greatness,8-12-hours,warm-spicy; oud; fresh-spicy; sweet; patchouli; metallic,,agarwood; sweet,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,saffron; nutmeg-1; lavender,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
