decant-partial-of-afnan-supremacy-incense-edp,Decant/Partial Of Afnan Supremacy Incense EDP,"<p>Afnan Supremacy Incense 100ML Eau de Parfum for men is a fragrance that exudes power, mystique, and longevity. This captivating scent is the epitome of masculine allure, designed for those who seek an enduring olfactory experience.</p>

<p>Opening with a burst of intensity, the top notes of Oregano, Spices, Bergamot, and Herbal Notes immediately captivate the senses. These initial notes create an aromatic and spicy introduction that sets the tone for what's to come.</p>

<p>As the fragrance evolves, the heart reveals a rich and opulent blend of Opoponax, Amber, and Labdanum. This combination adds a deep, resinous complexity, infusing Supremacy Incense with an aura of sensuality and warmth.</p>

<p>The base notes, consisting of Smoke, Agarwood (Oud), Leather, and Patchouli, add a smoky and leathery dimension to the scent. The prominent presence of Agarwood creates an exotic and woody profile, while the leather and patchouli contribute a touch of earthiness and sophistication.</p>

<p>Notably, Afnan Supremacy Incense is celebrated for its exceptional longevity. This Eau de Parfum lingers on the skin for hours, making it perfect for those who want their fragrance to last throughout the day and into the night.</p>

<p>Top Note: Bergamot, Green Notes, Oregano, Spices<br>
Heart Note: Ambergris, Labdanum, Opopanax<br>
Base Note: Oud, Patchouli, Skin, Smoke</p>

<p>Afnan Supremacy Incense is often recognized as a fantastic alternative to the renowned Interlude Man by Amouage. It captures the essence of the original with remarkable accuracy, offering a cost-effective option for those who appreciate the luxurious aroma of Interlude Man but prefer a more budget-friendly choice.</p>

<p>In summary, Afnan Supremacy Incense is a long-lasting masterpiece that exudes elegance and power. Its aromatic journey takes you from a spicy, herbal opening to a deep, resinous heart, and finally to a smoky, leathery base. This fragrance is the epitome of sophistication, making it an excellent choice for those seeking a luxurious scent that won't break the bank.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Afnan, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,530.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Afnan-supremacy-incense.png?v=1779820173,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,smoke; agarwood; leather; patchouli,afnan,,,edp,,afnan; inspired-by-interlude-man,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Afnan/Supremacy-Incense-64372.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,interlude-man,6-8-hours,amber; smoky; fresh-spicy; woody; oud; balsamic,,opoponax; amber; labdanum,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,oregano; spices; herbal; bergamot,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
