decant-partial-of-afnan-9am-edp,Decant/Partial Of Afnan 9AM EDP,"<p>Introducing Afnan 9am 100ml EDP Perfume for Men, a captivating fragrance that embodies freshness and vitality. This invigorating scent combines a vibrant citrus blend with aromatic spices and woody undertones, making it the perfect choice for the modern gentleman.</p>

<p>At the initial spritz, you are greeted with a burst of zesty energy as the top notes of Lemon, Mandarin Orange, Cardamom, and Pink Pepper dance on your skin. This combination creates an uplifting and refreshing sensation, evoking a sense of vibrancy and confidence.</p>

<p>As the fragrance settles, the heart notes begin to unveil a harmonious blend of Lavender, Green Apple, Orange Blossom, and Rose. These middle notes add depth and complexity to the composition, infusing a touch of floral sweetness balanced by a crisp green apple aroma. The interplay of these notes creates a captivating and well-rounded fragrance experience.</p>

<p>Finally, the base notes of Musk, Moss, Cedar, and Patchouli come into play, creating a lasting and memorable impression. The warm and earthy tones of musk and cedar blend seamlessly with the earthiness of moss and the spiciness of patchouli. This combination results in a sophisticated and masculine scent that lingers on the skin, leaving a trail of confidence and allure.</p>

<p>Afnan 9am 100ml EDP Perfume for Men is designed for those who appreciate a fresh and citrusy fragrance that exudes masculinity and style. Whether worn during a professional setting or a casual outing, this fragrance embodies the essence of a modern man with its invigorating citrus top notes, aromatic heart notes, and woody base notes.</p>

<p>Top notes are Lemon, Mandarin Orange, Cardamom and Pink Pepper</p>

<p>Middle notes are Lavender, Green Apple, Orange Blossom and Rose</p>

<p>Base notes are Musk, Moss, Cedar and Patchouli</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Afnan, Decant, men, Office Perfumes, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,495.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Afnan-9am-100ml-EDP.png?v=1779820174,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,musk; moss; cedar; patchouli,afnan,,,edp,,afnan,,aromatic,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Afnan/9am-70706.html,,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,citrus; musky; aromatic; woody; warm-spicy; lavender; mossy; earthy; fruity; powdery,,lavender; orange-blossom-1; green-apple; rose,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,lemon; mandarin-orange; cardamom; pink-pepper-1,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
