decant-partial-of-afnan-rare-carbon-edp,Decant/Partial Of Afnan Rare Carbon EDP,"<p>Afnan Rare Carbon Perfume is a great long-lasting fragrance for men.</p>

<p>Indulge in the captivating essence of Afnan Rare Carbon, a remarkable fragrance that mirrors the allure of Tom Ford's Ombre Leather. This exquisite perfume takes you on an olfactory journey through a symphony of notes, evoking sensuality, sophistication, and intrigue.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Leather, Violet Leaf, Nutmeg, and Cinnamon<br>
The fragrance begins with a bold and confident statement as the top notes of supple leather intertwine with the freshness of violet leaf. A subtle hint of nutmeg adds a touch of warmth and complexity, while cinnamon spices up the composition, creating an alluring opening that captivates the senses.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Violet, Agarwood (Oud), Rose, and Cedar<br>
As the fragrance develops, a heart of rare beauty emerges. The floral elegance of violet flirts with the woody intensity of agarwood, also known as oud, creating a rich and mysterious accord. Soft petals of rose add a delicate touch, harmonizing effortlessly with the refined aroma of cedar. Together, these middle notes create an enchanting symphony full of depth and sophistication.</p>

<p>Base Notes: Sandalwood, Vetiver, and Amber<br>
As the fragrance lingers on your skin, it gracefully settles into a captivating base. Smooth sandalwood embraces your senses, exuding a creamy and luxurious warmth. Deep and earthy vetiver adds a touch of masculinity, lending a seductive quality to the fragrance. The base is enhanced by the timeless allure of amber, leaving a lingering and irresistible trail.</p>

<p>Afnan Rare Carbon is a masterpiece that embraces the essence of Tom Ford's Ombre Leather while maintaining its unique character. Its blend of leather, violet, and the rich allure of oud creates an unforgettable symphony that will leave a lasting impression. Put on Afnan Rare Carbon, and let its intoxicating notes transport you into a world of sophistication and intrigue. Experience the allure of this exceptional fragrance today.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Afnan, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,8,deny,manual,500.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Afnan-Rare-Carbon-100ml-EDP.png?v=1779820175,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,vetiver; sandalwood; amber,afnan,,,edp,,afnan; inspired-by-ombre-leather,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Afnan/Rare-Carbon-66627.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,ombre-leather,6-8-hours,leather; woody; powdery; ozone; animalic; violet; oud; aquatic; rose; fresh-spicy,,violet; agarwood; rose; cedar,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,leather; violet-leaf; nutmeg-1; cinnamon,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
