decant-partial-of-afnan-supremacy-not-only-intense-extrait-de-parfum,Decant/Partial Of Afnan Supremacy Not Only Intense Extrait De Parfum,"<p>Afnan Supremacy Not Only Intense Extrait De Parfum 150ml For Men: Unveiling a Symphony of Opulence</p>

<p>Prepare to embark on an olfactory journey like no other with Afnan Supremacy Not Only Intense. This exquisite Extrait De Parfum, presented in a generous 150ml bottle, exudes an aura of sophistication and luxury that is truly unmatched. Crafted to captivate the senses, this fragrance transcends boundaries, drawing inspiration from the iconic scents of Hacivat by Nishane and the revered Creed Aventus. Prepare to be mesmerized as you delve into the layers of this exceptional creation.</p>

<p>🔥 Elevate Your Senses with Exquisite Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: A harmonious blend of black currant, bergamot, and apple sets the stage for an invigorating and refreshing opening. Experience the tantalizing burst of fruity freshness that leaves a lasting impression.<br>
Middle Notes: As the fragrance unfolds, notes of oakmoss, patchouli, and lavender emerge, infusing the composition with a sense of depth and sophistication. Feel the earthy richness and floral elegance intertwine, creating a captivating heart that beckons exploration.<br>
Base Notes: The journey culminates in a seductive symphony of ambergris, musk, and saffron. Bask in the warm embrace of these sensual accords, as they linger on the skin, leaving an unforgettable trail of luxury and allure.</p>

<p>🌿 Versatility for Every Season: Afnan Supremacy Not Only Intense is more than just a fragrance—it's a statement of timeless elegance. With its versatile DNA, this scent can be worn year-round, effortlessly transitioning from day to night, from casual outings to formal affairs. Embrace its uniqueness and let it become an extension of your signature style.</p>

<p>💎 Luxury Redefined: In a world where exclusivity reigns supreme, Afnan Supremacy Not Only Intense stands as a beacon of luxury. Inspired by the finest fragrances in the world, this masterpiece encapsulates the essence of refinement and sophistication. Elevate your fragrance collection and indulge in the epitome of opulence.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","Afnan, best seller, Decant, men, Partial, Party",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,5,deny,manual,497.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Afnan-Supremacy-Not-Only-Intense-Extrait-De-Parfum-150ml.png?v=1779820166,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,ambergris; musk; saffron,afnan,,,extrait,,afnan; inspired-by-aventus,,aromatic,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Afnan/Supremacy-Not-Only-Intense-68271.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,aventus,6-8-hours,fruity; mossy; woody; earthy; citrus; fresh-spicy,,oakmoss; patchouli; lavender,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,black-currant; bergamot; apple,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
