decant-partial-of-afnan-turathi-blue-edp,Decant/Partial Of Afnan Turathi Blue EDP,"<p>Turathi Blue by Afnan, an exquisite fragrance designed specifically for men. This Aromatic Aquatic scent opens with a refreshing burst of Citruses, instantly awakening the senses with its zesty and invigorating notes. As the fragrance settles, the heart reveals a captivating blend of Amber and Woodsy Notes, lending an alluring depth and sophistication to the composition. The base notes of Musk, Patchouli, and Spices add a sensual and comforting touch, leaving a memorable and long-lasting trail.</p>

