decant-partial-of-ahmed-al-maghribi-brulee-edp,Decant/Partial Of Ahmed Al Maghribi Brulee EDP,"Ahmed Al Maghribi Brûlée 100ml Eau De Parfum – Decadent Sweetness with Smoky Warmth 🍮🔥
For Men | Gourmand • Warm • Creamy

Brûlée by Ahmed Al Maghribi is an indulgent gourmand fragrance crafted for men who appreciate bold sweetness layered with refined depth. Inspired by the richness of caramelized desserts, this scent blends creamy sweetness with warm spice and smoky undertones, creating a smooth yet powerful signature that lingers beautifully.

Fragrance Notes ✨

Top Notes: Caramel, Sugar, Coconut, Cardamom, Sicilian Bergamot 🍯🥥
A mouthwatering opening of caramel and sugar melts into creamy coconut, while cardamom adds a subtle spicy kick. Bright Sicilian bergamot balances the sweetness with a fresh citrus sparkle.

Heart Notes: Vanilla, Orange Blossom, Incense, Chocolate &amp; Milk 🍫🌸
The heart is luxuriously smooth — rich vanilla and milk swirl with decadent chocolate, softened by delicate orange blossom. A touch of incense adds depth and a slightly smoky elegance.

Base Notes: White Musk, Ambroxan Woods &amp; Tonka Beans 🌿🔥
A warm, masculine base of white musk and woody ambroxan blends seamlessly with sweet tonka beans, leaving a creamy, long-lasting trail that feels both comforting and seductive.

Perfect for evenings, cooler weather, and special occasions, Brûlée is for the man who enjoys sweet sophistication with a confident, modern edge.

✨ Brûlée – where caramelized sweetness meets smoky masculine warmth.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Ahmed Al Maghribi, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,18,deny,manual,500.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Ahmed-Al-Maghribi-Brulee.png?v=1779820182,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
