decant-partial-of-ahmed-al-maghribi-atraab-extrait-de-parfum,Decant/Partial Of Ahmed Al Maghribi Atraab Extrait De Parfum,"Ahmed Al Maghribi Atraab 100ml Extrait De Parfum – Creamy Citrus Elegance with Warm Amber Depth 🍊✨
For Men &amp; Women | Citrus • Creamy • Amber

Atraab by Ahmed Al Maghribi is a luxurious extrait de parfum crafted for those who appreciate smooth sophistication with a modern twist. Rich in concentration and beautifully blended, it opens with radiant citrus brightness, melts into a soft creamy heart, and settles into a warm, musky-woody embrace. Balanced and versatile, Atraab is designed to leave a refined, long-lasting impression.

Fragrance Notes ✨

Top Notes: Sweet Citrus &amp; Fruity Accords 🍊🍑
A luminous burst of sweet citrus intertwined with juicy fruity nuances creates a vibrant, uplifting opening that feels fresh yet indulgent.

Middle Notes: Soft Florals &amp; Warm Creamy Notes 🌸🥛
The heart reveals delicate florals wrapped in smooth, creamy accords, adding elegance and comfort while maintaining a silky, sophisticated character.

Base Notes: Amber, Musk &amp; Woody Notes 🌿🔥
A warm foundation of glowing amber and sensual musk blends seamlessly with rich woody tones, delivering depth, longevity, and a softly seductive trail.

Perfect for day-to-night wear and all seasons, Atraab suits both men and women who love fragrances that feel clean, creamy, and warmly inviting.

✨ Atraab – luminous freshness wrapped in creamy amber warmth.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","Ahmed Al Maghribi, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,430.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Ahmed-Al-Maghribi-Atraab.png?v=1779820183,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,extrait,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
