decant-partial-of-ahmed-al-maghribi-blush-noir-edp,Decant/Partial Of Ahmed Al Maghribi Blush Noir EDP,"Ahmed Al Maghribi Blush Noir 75ml EDP – Luscious Fruits with Sensual Oriental Depth 🍓🌹
For Women | Fruity • Floral • Warm

Blush Noir by Ahmed Al Maghribi is a captivating women’s fragrance that blends vibrant fruits with velvety florals and a deep, sensual base. Playful yet sophisticated, it opens with a burst of juicy sweetness before unfolding into an elegant floral heart and settling into a warm, addictive oriental finish. Perfect for women who love bold femininity wrapped in luxury.

Fragrance Notes ✨

Top Notes: Pink Grapefruit, Cassis, Blackberry, Rhubarb, Peony, Apple, Pear, Litchi, Peach &amp; Clary Sage 🍑🍎
A dazzling fusion of juicy red fruits and crisp orchard notes creates a bright, mouthwatering opening balanced with soft floral hints and a subtle aromatic touch.

Heart Notes: Lily of the Valley, Egyptian Jasmine, Marine Notes, Tonka Bean, Raspberry, May Rose, Saffron, Praline, Violet, Damask Rose &amp; Wild Berries 🌹🌊
The heart blooms with romantic roses and jasmine, enriched by sweet praline and berries, while marine notes and saffron add depth and modern elegance.

Base Notes: Vanilla, Ambergris, Ambroxan, Incense, Caramel, Musk, Sandalwood, Oud &amp; Moss 🍦🔥
A rich, creamy base of vanilla and caramel melts into sensual musk, smoky incense, and luxurious oud, leaving a long-lasting, irresistible trail.

