decant-partial-of-ahmed-al-maghribi-mauzoon-edp,Decant/Partial Of Ahmed Al Maghribi Mauzoon EDP,"<p>Ahmed Al Maghribi Mauzoon 100ml EDP – A Dreamlike Embrace of Affection 💫Made in UAE | Unisex | Long Lasting<br>
Ahmed Al Maghribi Mauzoon is a poetic blend of sweet woodiness and nostalgic allure, crafted for those who cherish life’s most tender moments. This unisex Eau de Parfum invites you into a sensory journey of passion, warmth, and soulful memories.<br>
The scent opens with a stimulating blend of Vanilla and Bergamot, touched by Saffron and juicy Peach, creating a vibrant yet soothing prelude. This energetic start soon melts into a refined heart of Cedarwood, sweet Violets, and floral Jasmine, painting a picture of serene affection and graceful elegance.<br>
As the fragrance settles, White Musk, golden Amber, and rich Agarwood form a deep, spiritual base. Hints of Patchouli and creamy Sandalwood wrap the wearer in a warm, lingering trail that whispers tradition and timeless beauty.<br>
Top Notes: Vanilla, Bergamot, Saffron, Peach(A sweet, citrusy spark with earthy undertones.)<br>
