Base Notes: The fragrance concludes with a warm and sensual base of amber, tolu balsam, and musk. Amber provides a golden, resinous sweetness, while tolu balsam adds a rich, balsamic touch. The musk brings a soft, earthy finish, creating a harmonious and deeply satisfying end to the olfactory journey.</p>

<p>🌞 Crafted in the UAE: Ahmed Al Maghribi Oulil Amr is a proud creation of the UAE, a country renowned for its rich tradition of perfumery. Each bottle encapsulates the essence of Arabian luxury and craftsmanship, making it a symbol of elegance and sophistication.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Ahmed Al Maghribi, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,7,deny,manual,1233.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Ahmed-Al-Maghribi-Oulil-Amr.png?v=1779820304,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,amber; musk; pine-tree,ahmed-al-maghribi,,Oriental ,,,ahmed-al-maghribi; made-in-uae,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Ahmed-Al-Maghribi/Oulil-Amr-115743.html,unisex,,,,woody; oud; animalic; rose; warm-spicy,,cambodian-oud; rose,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,cardamom; peony,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
