decant-partial-of-ahmed-al-maghribi-laathani-edp,Decant/Partial Of Ahmed Al Maghribi Laathani EDP,"<p>Ahmed Al Maghribi Laathani 80ml Eau De Parfum is a long-lasting fragrance masterpiece made in the UAE. This exquisite scent is an ode to the richness of Arabian heritage, blending the finest ingredients to create a symphony of emotions and experiences. Laathani captures the true essence of luxury, elegance, and refinement, making it an iconic fragrance that transcends generations.</p>

<p>Top Notes:</p>

<p>Laathani unveils a dazzling display of Fresh Notes and Candied Fruit, a symphony of freshness and sweetness that captures attention and captivates the senses. This initial burst sets the stage for the grandeur to come, hinting at the layers of complexity waiting to unfold. The fresh notes provide an invigorating and uplifting start, while the candied fruit adds a touch of delightful sweetness that makes the opening truly enchanting.</p>

<p>Middle Notes:</p>

<p>As the heart notes emerge, the fragrance takes on a deeper and more intricate character. The Oud Accord, renowned for its exotic and mesmerizing qualities, infuses the composition with a rich and resinous aroma that is both captivating and mysterious. Complementing this is the inclusion of Rosemary, adding a fresh and herbaceous twist that balances the richness of the Oud Accord and adds a touch of intrigue. This combination creates a sophisticated and alluring middle phase that keeps the senses engaged.</p>

<p>Base Notes:</p>

<p>But it is in the base notes where Laathani truly shines, leaving an unforgettable impression that lingers in the air long after you've passed. The leather notes evoke images of luxurious leather goods, exuding elegance, refinement, and a hint of sensuality. Paired with the Bakhoor Accords, which lend a smoky, incense-like quality, the fragrance takes on a mystical and intoxicating charm that is as captivating as it is irresistible. This deep, rich base ensures that Laathani leaves a lasting mark, making it a memorable and cherished scent.</p>

<p>The Timeless Melody of Laathani</p>

<p>""A Symphony Without Alternatives""</p>

<p>Laathani’s essence is like each drop of a majestic symphony, infused with a myriad of emotions, experiences, and moods that capture the true essence of Arabian heritage. This harmonious blend of fragrances tells grand tales, celebrating the pride and prestige of Arabic tradition. Picture the exceptional richness of Laathani as it permeates through your being, merging seamlessly with your soul to become an integral part of your narrative.</p>

<p>Laathani, an iconic fragrance, reverently honors the mystical essence of nature, crafting a poetic narrative that transcends generations. A true masterpiece born from the heart of artistic inspiration.</p>

<p>Embrace the luxurious and long-lasting allure of Ahmed Al Maghribi Laathani, and let it become a timeless part of your story.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Ahmed Al Maghribi, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,887.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Ahmed-Al-Maghribi-Laathani.png?v=1779820306,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,leather,ahmed-al-maghribi,, Oriental ,,,ahmed-al-maghribi; inspired-by-imperial-valley-by-gissah,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Ahmed-Al-Maghribi/Laathani-104338.html,unisex,,,,oud; leather; fresh-spicy; aromatic; animalic,,bakhoor,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,oud; rosemary,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
