<p>Embrace the allure of timeless elegance with Ahmed Al Maghribi Lush Noir, a captivating fragrance that embodies the essence of femininity and refinement. Designed for the modern woman who exudes confidence and grace, this 75ml Eau De Parfum is a testament to luxury and sophistication.</p>

<p>🌟 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>🍃 Top Notes: The journey begins with a tantalizing blend of freshness and mystery. A hidden fresh accord intertwines seamlessly with the citrusy aroma of bergamot, while the subtle sweetness of bitter almond adds an unexpected twist. This intriguing combination sets the stage for the opulent experience that follows.</p>

<p>💐 Middle Notes: As the fragrance unfolds, a bouquet of floral notes emerges to captivate the senses. Bonjour, a delicate white floral accord, blooms alongside the intoxicating aroma of ylang-ylang, infusing the composition with a sense of romance and allure. Each note dances harmoniously, creating a symphony of beauty and grace.</p>

<p>🍂 Base Notes: The grand finale unveils a rich and sensual foundation that lingers on the skin like a soft caress. Creamy vanilla envelops the senses in a warm embrace, while coumarin adds a subtle hint of sweetness. Musk adds depth and intensity, leaving a lasting impression that echoes long after the fragrance fades.</p>

<p>🌌 A Journey of Sensuality: Ahmed Al Maghribi Lush Noir is more than just a fragrance – it's an olfactory journey that transports you to a world of luxury and sophistication. With each spray, you'll be whisked away on a sensual adventure, enveloped in a veil of elegance and allure.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Ahmed Al Maghribi, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,593.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/ahmed-al-maghribi-lush-noir.png?v=1779820314,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,vanilla; musk,ahmed-al-maghribi,,Floral Woody Musk,edp,,ahmed-al-maghribi; inspired-by-good-girl-blush-by-carolina-herrera,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Ahmed-Al-Maghribi/Lush-Noir-104887.html,women,,,,floral; citrus; vanilla; sweet; almond,,peony; ylang-ylang,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,bergamot; bitter-almond,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
