<p>Embark on a journey of timeless allure with Ahmed Al Maghribi Rose Noir, a fragrance crafted to mesmerize and captivate. This 75ml Eau De Parfum for women is an ode to sophistication, exuding an aura of mystery and grace that leaves a lasting impression.</p>

<p>🌟 Unveiling the Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: The fragrance begins with a burst of citrusy freshness, as Sicilian orange intertwines with the spicy warmth of ginger and the delicate floral essence of jasmine. This vibrant combination sets the stage for a captivating olfactory experience.<br>
Middle Notes: As the scent evolves, vanilla bean lends its sweet embrace, while powdery and sea notes add a touch of ethereal charm. The result is a harmonious blend of creamy richness and aquatic freshness, reminiscent of a tranquil seaside getaway.<br>
