<p>Ahmed Al Maghribi Blue By Ahmed 100ml Eau De Parfum is a symphony of sophistication, an olfactory masterpiece that encapsulates the essence of luxury. With every spritz, immerse yourself in a world of refined charm and irresistible allure, crafted to captivate the senses and leave an indelible mark wherever you go.</p>

<p>🔥 Unveiling the Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Begin your olfactory voyage with a burst of freshness, as the invigorating blend of grapefruit, pink pepper, mint, and lemon dances upon your skin. The zesty citrus notes mingle with the spicy nuances, creating a vibrant and uplifting opening that sets the stage for the sensory journey ahead.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Delve deeper into the heart of Ahmed Al Maghribi Blue, where the warmth of ginger, the spiciness of nutmeg, the floral elegance of jasmine, and the captivating allure of Iso E Super intertwine harmoniously. This aromatic bouquet exudes sophistication and refinement, enveloping you in a comforting embrace that resonates with timeless charm.</p>

<p>Base Notes: As the fragrance evolves, it settles into a rich and sensual base, where the smoky essence of incense mingles with the earthy tones of vetiver, cedar, and sandalwood. Patchouli adds a touch of depth and mystery, while labdanum infuses a resinous sweetness. The composition is anchored by the creamy warmth of white musk, leaving a lingering trail of irresistible seduction in your wake.</p>

<p>🌿 Crafted for the Discerning Connoisseur: Ahmed Al Maghribi Blue is more than just a fragrance; it's a statement of refined taste and discerning elegance. Perfectly suited for the modern gentleman or sophisticated lady, this Eau De Parfum is a testament to the art of perfumery, crafted with meticulous attention to detail and an unwavering commitment to quality.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Ahmed Al Maghribi, best seller, Daily Wear, Decant, men, Office Perfumes, Partial, Summer Essentials, Women",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,83,deny,manual,390.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Blue-By-Ahmed.png?v=1779820318,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,sandalwood; patchouli; cedar; white-musk; labdanum; incense; vetiver,ahmed-al-maghribi,,Aromatic,extrait,,ahmed-al-maghribi; inspired-by-blue-de-chanel,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Ahmed-Al-Maghribi/Blue-by-Ahmed-104882.html,unisex,,,,citrus; woody; aromatic; musky; fresh-spicy,,jasmine; ginger; nutmeg-1,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,grapefruit; lemon; mint; pink-pepper-1,,,for-men,,'1,all-ages,,,spray,citrus; spicy; floral; woody; vanilla,,,glass; paper,everyday,citrus; aromatic; woody; musky,,,liquid,,male; unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
