decant-partial-of-ahmed-al-maghribi-arwa-edp,Decant/Partial Of Ahmed Al Maghribi Arwa EDP,"<p>Ahmed Al Maghribi Arwa Perfume 100ml EDP: A Unisex Ode to Timeless Elegance 🌟</p>

<p>Embark on an olfactory journey that transcends gender boundaries with Ahmed Al Maghribi Arwa Perfume. This exquisite 100ml Eau De Parfum is a harmonious blend of sophistication and allure, meticulously crafted to captivate both men and women alike. From its vibrant citrusy top notes to its alluring base, every whiff of Arwa Perfume unveils a symphony of scents that linger long after application.</p>

<p>🍊 Top Notes: At the forefront of this enchanting fragrance are the citrusy fresh oranges, infusing a burst of invigorating energy that revitalizes the senses. Pepper adds a subtle hint of spice, creating a tantalizing opening that piques curiosity and sets the stage for the olfactory journey ahead.</p>

<p>💐 Middle Notes: The heart of Arwa Perfume reveals a captivating bouquet where lavenders and patchouli intertwine in a dance of elegance and depth. Fiery pink peppers add a touch of sensuality, infusing the composition with an irresistible allure that leaves a lasting impression.</p>

<p>🍯 Base Notes: As the fragrance settles, a sumptuous blend of honey, gilded amber, gentle musk, and labdanum envelops the wearer in a warm embrace. Each note contributes to the perfume's rich and opulent base, leaving a trail of seduction in its wake that lingers delicately on the skin.</p>

<p>🌿 Unleash the Power of Elegance: Ahmed Al Maghribi Arwa Perfume transcends conventional gender norms, inviting both men and women to embrace its timeless elegance. Whether worn during the day or for evening soirées, this versatile fragrance exudes confidence and sophistication, making it the perfect accessory for any occasion.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Ahmed Al Maghribi, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,420.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Ahmed-Al-Maghribi-Arwa.png?v=1779820324,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,amber,,,,edp,,,,aromatic,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/PARIS-CORNER/Arwa-113879.html,,,,,warm-spicy; amber; aromatic; musky,,pink-pepper-1; patchouli; musk,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,orange; pepper; lavender,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
