decant-partial-of-ahmed-al-maghribi-oud-couture-edp,Decant/Partial Of Ahmed Al Maghribi Oud Couture EDP,"<p>Ahmed Al Maghribi Nawatique Perfume 100ml EDP for Men: A Symphony of Luxury and Longevity</p>

<p>Elevate your olfactory experience with Ahmed Al Maghribi's Nawatique Perfume, a meticulously crafted 100ml Eau de Parfum designed to captivate the senses and withstand the nuances of the Indian weather.</p>

<p>Tailored for Indian Weather: Nawatique Perfume is not just a fragrance; it's a reflection of sophistication tailored for the dynamic Indian climate. Crafted with precision, it embraces the diversity of scents that resonate well in the vibrancy of Indian weather.</p>

<p>Unrivaled Longevity: Experience an enduring fragrance journey with Nawatique. With an exceptional longevity that defies expectations, this perfume ensures you stay enveloped in its luxurious aura throughout the day. The secret lies in its high fragrance oil concentration, a testament to Ahmed Al Maghribi's commitment to quality.</p>

<p>Top Notes Bursting with Citrus Elegance: Nawatique unfolds with a burst of freshness as top notes of orange, red berries, and peach dance together in harmonious unity. This citrus-infused opening sets the stage for a fragrance that is invigorating and magnetic from the very first spray.</p>

<p>Heart Notes of Floral Opulence: The heart notes reveal a rich tapestry of white flowers, rose, and honey, adding a layer of sophistication and sweetness to the composition. This harmonious blend ensures Nawatique remains a captivating presence, leaving an indelible mark.</p>

