decant-partial-of-ahmed-al-maghribi-couture-noir-edp,Decant/Partial Of Ahmed Al Maghribi Couture Noir EDP,"<p>Ahmed Al Maghribi Couture Noir, an olfactory masterpiece designed for the discerning gentleman who seeks a fragrance that transcends time and trends. Immerse yourself in the allure of this Eau de Parfum, a symphony of notes meticulously curated to create an enchanting fragrance journey that unfolds with sophistication.</p>

<p>Scent Profile: Ahmed Al Maghribi Couture Noir is not just a fragrance; it's an experience. Crafted for men who appreciate the finer things in life, this perfume boasts an extraordinary longevity, making it ideal for the dynamic and diverse climate of India. The beast mode endurance ensures that you make a lasting impression wherever you go, from the vibrant streets of Mumbai to the serene landscapes of Kerala.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Apple and Lemon: The olfactory journey commences with a burst of freshness from crisp apples and zesty lemons. This invigorating blend awakens the senses, setting the stage for the symphony of notes that follows.</p>

