decant-partial-of-ahmed-al-maghribi-kaaf-extrait-de-parfum,Decant/Partial Of Ahmed Al Maghribi Kaaf Extrait De Parfum,"<p>Ahmed Al Maghribi presents Kaaf Perfume, a captivating 100ml Extrait De Parfum for men that effortlessly combines freshness with enduring allure. This fragrance is a celebration of the Maghrib, capturing its essence in a bottle. With a super fresh aquatic profile, Kaaf is designed for those who seek a scent that lingers throughout the day.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Dive into a refreshing blend of Red Fruits, the succulent juiciness of Watermelon, the calming essence of Lavender, and the zesty brightness of Sicilian Orange.</p>

<p>Heart Notes: The heart of Kaaf unfolds with the delicate and enchanting notes of Lotus, the sweet floral embrace of Jasmine, the timeless charm of Lily of The Valley, all harmonized with the invigorating Sea Accord.</p>

<p>Base Notes: As the day progresses, the fragrance settles into a warm and sensual symphony, featuring the rich and creamy notes of Sandalwood, the modern and sophisticated Ambroxan, and the soft lingering touch of White Musk.</p>

<p>Kaaf by Ahmed Al Maghribi stands out as a luxurious and long-lasting perfume, ensuring that its wearer remains enveloped in a captivating aura for hours on end. This fragrance is not just a scent; it's a journey into the magic of the Maghrib, bottled for those who appreciate freshness and sophistication in one exquisite blend.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","Ahmed Al Maghribi, best seller, Daily Wear, Decant, men, Office Perfumes, Partial, Summer Essentials",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,460.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Ahmed-Al-Maghribi-Kaaf.png?v=1779820343,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,ambroxan; amberwood; musk; baldsam-fir; cedar; tonka-bean,ahmed-al-maghribi,,Best Seller,edp,,ahmed-al-maghribi; inspired-by-percival-by-parfums-de-marly,,aromatic,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Ahmed-Al-Maghribi/Kaaf-102460.html,unisex,,,6-8-hours,amber; aromatic; woody; citrus; fresh-spicy,,hedione; violet; jasmine; coriander; cinnamon; cardamom,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,lavender; mandarin-orange; bergamot; geranium; pink-pepper-1,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
