decant-partial-of-ahmed-al-maghribi-bin-shaikh-edp,Decant/Partial Of Ahmed Al Maghribi Bin Shaikh EDP,"<p>Ahmed Al Maghribi presents the Bin Shaikh Eau De Parfum, a 90ml masterpiece designed for men seeking an enduring fragrance that lingers throughout the day. This captivating scent is a harmonious blend of top, middle, and base notes that come together to create an olfactory symphony.</p>

<p>Top Notes: The initial impression opens with a bouquet of exquisite notes, where the freshness of Rose, Citruses, and Lavender intertwine with the richness of Saffron and the earthy allure of oak moss. This top layer sets the stage for a captivating aromatic journey.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Moving to the heart of the fragrance, an elegant fusion of Sugar, Bakhoor, and floral tones like Jasmine, Orchid, and Violet emerge. This middle phase adds a touch of sweetness, deepened by the oriental richness of Bakhoor, creating a well-balanced and intriguing aromatic profile.</p>

<p>Base Notes: The lasting impression comes from the powerful and enduring base notes. Agarwood (Oud) and Patchouli provide a woody and earthy foundation, while Amber and White Musk infuse a warm sensuality. The fragrance is anchored by the persistent and enchanting notes of Ambroxan, leaving a captivating trail in its wake.</p>

<p>Bin Shaikh by Ahmed Al Maghribi is not just a scent; it's a statement of sophistication and longevity. This Eau De Parfum is a testament to the brand's commitment to crafting enduring fragrances that stand the test of time, making it a must-have for individuals who appreciate the fusion of luxury and longevity in a bottle.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Ahmed Al Maghribi, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,8,deny,manual,789.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Ahmed-Al-Maghribi-Bin-Shaikh.png?v=1779820345,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,agarwood; amber; patchouli; white-musk; ambroxan,ahmed-al-maghribi,,Oriental Fragrance,edp,,ahmed-al-maghribi; inspired-by-oud-for-greatness,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Ahmed-Al-Maghribi/Bin-Shaikh-66619.html,unisex,,,8-12-hours,oud; amber; warm-spicy; sweet; musky,,bakhoor; sugar; jasmine; orchid; violet,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,saffron; rose; oakmoss; lavender; citruses,,,for-men,,'1,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
