decant-partial-of-ajmal-oud-on-the-rocks-edp,Decant/Partial Of Ajmal Oud On The Rocks EDP,"Ajmal Oud On The Rocks 100ML EDP 🧊✨For Men &amp; Women | Fresh • Oud • Musky-Woody
Ajmal Oud On The Rocks is a modern twist on traditional oud—cool, vibrant, and effortlessly luxurious. Designed for those who love the richness of oud without heaviness, this unisex fragrance delivers a refreshing “on the rocks” sensation, blending crisp freshness with deep woody warmth.
🌿 Fragrance Experience
Top Impression:❄️ Fresh Accords – A cool, airy opening that feels clean and invigorating, like chilled elegance.🍋 Subtle Citrus Nuance – Adds a light sparkle, keeping the scent lively and modern.
Heart Impression:🪵 Soft Oud – Smooth and refined, offering depth without overpowering.🌿 Aromatic Touches – Gentle green hints that enhance freshness.
Base Impression:🤍 Musk – Clean, soft, and long-lasting on the skin.🌲 Woody Notes – Dry and elegant, creating a balanced foundation.✨ Amber Hints – A warm glow that lingers beautifully.
Oud On The Rocks opens with a refreshing coolness, transitions into a smooth and wearable oud heart, and settles into a musky-woody base that feels both sophisticated and easygoing.
✨ Long-Lasting | Fresh Oud Twist | Unisex AppealIdeal for daily wear, warm weather, or anyone exploring oud in a lighter, more modern style.
