decant-partial-of-ajmal-wave-edp,Decant/Partial Of Ajmal Wave EDP,"<p><strong>Ajmal Wave 100ml EDP – Refreshing Oceanic Citrus with Deep Amber Woods 🌊🍊🌿✨</strong><br><strong>For Men &amp; Women | Aquatic • Citrusy • Woody Ambery</strong></p>
<p>Ajmal Wave is a vibrant unisex fragrance that captures the freedom of the open sea and the energy of coastal breezes. Blending sparkling citrus freshness with marine accords, sea salt nuances, and warm woody amber undertones, it creates a scent that feels clean, modern, and effortlessly sophisticated.</p>
<h3>🌿 Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong><br>🌊 <strong>Oceanic Accord</strong> – Crisp aquatic freshness that evokes cool ocean waves.<br>🧂 <strong>Sea Salt</strong> – Mineral salty nuances adding a refreshing coastal character.<br>🍊 <strong>Grapefruit</strong> – Bright citrus zest that brings sparkle and vitality.</p>
<p><strong>Heart Notes:</strong><br>🌊 <strong>Oceanic Notes</strong> – Continuing the airy marine freshness at the heart.<br>🧂 <strong>Sea Salt</strong> – Enhances the clean, breezy aquatic profile.<br>🍃 <strong>Bay Leaf</strong> – Aromatic green freshness with a subtle spicy edge.<br>🌸 <strong>Geranium</strong> – Fresh floral sophistication adding balance and elegance.<br>🔥 <strong>Red Amber</strong> – Warm amber richness that deepens the composition.<br>🌿 <strong>Guaiac Wood</strong> – Smooth smoky woods providing depth and character.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong><br>🔥 <strong>Red Amber</strong> – Warm, sensual amber that lingers beautifully.<br>🌿 <strong>Guaiac Wood</strong> – Rich woody warmth delivering a refined, lasting finish.</p>
<p>Ajmal Wave opens with a sparkling blend of oceanic accords, sea salt, and juicy grapefruit, creating an invigorating burst of freshness. The heart introduces aromatic bay leaf, elegant geranium, and warm amber woods, while the base settles into a smooth fusion of red amber and guaiac wood for a sophisticated and long-lasting trail.</p>
<p>Perfect for daily wear, office, casual outings, and warm-weather occasions, it is ideal for those who love fresh aquatic fragrances with a modern woody-amber depth.</p>
<p><strong>🌊🍊🌿✨ Ajmal Wave – ride the freshness of the ocean with warm amber sophistication.</strong></p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Ajmal, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,320.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Ajmal-Wave.png?v=1779820366,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,amber; guaiac-wood,ajmal,,,edp,,ajmal,,aquatics,,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,oceanic-accord; sea-salt; grapefruit; amber; fresh,,geranium; bay-leaf; spices,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,sea-salt-1; grapefruit; fresh,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
