decant-partial-of-ajmal-ahlam-edp,Decant/Partial Of Ajmal Ahlam EDP,"<p>Ajmal Ahlam 100ML Eau de Parfum for Men: A Bold Journey Through Spice and Elegance 🔥<br>
Step into a world of refined masculinity with Ajmal Ahlam 100ML Eau de Parfum for Men, a fragrance that blends the warmth of spices with the freshness of citrus and the depth of woody, oriental notes. Perfectly crafted by the renowned Ajmal perfumers, Ahlam is the ultimate expression of strength and sophistication for the modern man.<br>
💎 Fragrance Notes:<br>
Top Notes: The scent opens with an invigorating burst of spice and citrus, where the fiery warmth of cinnamon, nutmeg, and cardamom beautifully complement the bright freshness of grapefruit. This dynamic combination creates an exciting and energizing introduction that captivates the senses and sets the stage for the journey ahead.<br>
Middle Notes: As the fragrance settles, a rich, oriental heart emerges, blending the timeless elegance of lavender with the intoxicating warmth of amber. This middle layer offers a smooth, ambery richness that contrasts with the fresh top, creating a harmonious balance between bold and refined.<br>
Base Notes: The fragrance deepens into a luxurious, earthy base of patchouli and vetiver, enhanced by a lingering warmth of amber. These grounding notes provide a robust finish, leaving behind a long-lasting trail that evokes strength and confidence, making a memorable impression wherever you go.<br>
🌞 Inspired by the Bold Essence of Eastern Traditions: Ajmal Ahlam captures the spirit of oriental fragrances with its complex blend of spicy, citrus, and woody notes. It's the perfect choice for the man who seeks a fragrance that is both daring and sophisticated, making it ideal for both day and evening wear.<br>
Embrace the allure of Ajmal Ahlam and let its bold and vibrant scent elevate your presence with every spray. A fragrance for the modern man who dares to dream big and live fully.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Ajmal, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,385.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Ajmal-Ahlam.png?v=1779820374,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,patchouli; vetiver; woody; amber,ajmal,,,edp,,ajmal,,,,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,warm-spicy; woody; amber; aromatic; fresh,,lavender; amber,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,cinnamon; nutmeg-1; cardamom; grapefruit,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
