decant-partial-of-ajmal-aristocrat-edp,Decant/Partial Of Ajmal Aristocrat EDP,"<p>Ajmal Aristocrat Him 75ml EDP – The Epitome of Prestige and Power ✨<br>
Ajmal Aristocrat Him is a fragrance crafted for the modern gentleman—one who exudes confidence, charm, and sophistication. Designed in the UAE, this luxurious Eau de Parfum blends fresh citrus, refined florals, and deep woody accords to create a scent that leaves a lasting impression.<br>
