decant-partial-of-al-haramain-amber-oud-aqua-dubai-extrait-de-parfum,Decant/Partial Of Al Haramain Amber Oud Aqua Dubai Extrait De Parfum,"<p>Al Haramain Amber Oud Aqua Dubai 100ml Extrait De Parfum – Freshness Meets Royal Elegance 🌊<br>
Crafted in the UAE, Amber Oud Aqua Dubai by Al Haramain is a luxurious interpretation of aquatic freshness blended with opulent oriental depth. This Extrait De Parfum is Inspired by Imagination by Louis Vuitton, yet it carves its own signature with a richer, longer-lasting Middle Eastern twist.<br>
Fragrance Notes:<br>
Top Notes: Bergamot, Green Notes, Mandarin OrangeA zesty and invigorating opening that bursts with citrusy brightness and leafy freshness.<br>
Middle Notes: Amber, Melon, Black Currant, PineappleJuicy and vibrant, the heart delivers a sweet tropical accord balanced by warm amber richness.<br>
