decant-partial-of-al-wataniah-kayaan-classic-edp,Decant/Partial Of Al Wataniah Kayaan Classic EDP,"<p>Al Wataniah Kayaan Classic 100ml EDP For Men: Unveiling Timeless Elegance 🌟</p>

<p>Experience the pinnacle of luxury and sophistication with Al Wataniah Kayaan Classic 100ml Eau De Parfum for Men. Crafted with precision in the UAE, this exquisite fragrance embodies a perfect blend of tradition and modernity, delivering a long-lasting scent that exudes confidence and charisma.</p>

<p>🌟 The Ultimate Dior Homme Intense Inspired: Al Wataniah Kayaan Classic is celebrated as the finest Inspired of the iconic Dior Homme Intense by Dior. It mirrors the exceptional allure of its inspiration, capturing the essence of elegance and refinement that defines the original. Indulge in the luxury of Dior without compromising on quality or performance.</p>

<p>💐 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: The fragrance opens with a refreshing burst of bergamot and orange. These citrus notes provide a vibrant and invigorating introduction, setting the stage for an unforgettable olfactory journey. Feel the zest and energy that these top notes bring, making a bold and captivating first impression.<br>
Middle Notes: As the fragrance unfolds, the heart reveals a beautiful blend of rose and jasmine. These floral notes add a touch of sophistication and romance, creating a harmonious balance that is both alluring and captivating. The middle notes lend a timeless elegance to the scent, making it perfect for any occasion.<br>
Base Notes: The grand finale of this fragrance journey is marked by the warm and sensual notes of vanilla. The base notes provide a lasting impression, leaving a trail of irresistible allure that lingers on the skin. Embrace the comforting and luxurious finish that defines Al Wataniah Kayaan Classic.</p>

<p>🌞 Long-Lasting Brilliance: Designed to withstand the test of time, Al Wataniah Kayaan Classic ensures you remain enveloped in its captivating aroma from morning till night. Its long-lasting formula is perfect for the discerning gentleman who demands excellence in every aspect of life.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","AL WATANIAH, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,460.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Kayaan-Classic-Al-Wataniah.png?v=1779820469,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,vanilla; sandalwood; musk; patchouli,al-wataniah,,,edp,,al-wataniah; inspired-by-homme-intense-2011,,vanilla; woody,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Al-Wataniah/Kayaan-Classic-82472.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,homme-intense-2011,8-12-hours,powdery; iris; woody; vanilla; violet; earthy,,tuscan-iris; spices; jasmine; rose,,,,,,,,,,,party,,,,orange; bergamot,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
