decant-partial-of-albait-aldimashqi-bronzy-edp,Decant/Partial Of Albait Aldimashqi Bronzy EDP,"<p>Albait Aldimashqi Bronzy 75ml EDP for Women – Radiant Warmth in Bloom ✨🌅</p>

<p>A fragrance that glows with confidence and sensuality, Albait Aldimashqi Bronzy is a celebration of warmth, elegance, and modern femininity. Crafted in the UAE, this Eau de Parfum wraps the skin in a luminous blend of citrus, florals, and creamy depth—perfect for women who love a scent that feels both bold and beautifully comforting.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>🍊 Top Notes: Bergamot, Mandarin Orange<br>
A sparkling burst of bergamot and juicy mandarin opens the fragrance with vibrant freshness, instantly uplifting and full of energy.</p>

<p>🌸 Heart Notes: Ylang Ylang, Rose<br>
The heart unfolds into a rich floral harmony where exotic ylang ylang meets romantic rose, adding softness, femininity, and irresistible charm.</p>

<p>🍦 Base Notes: Vanilla, Patchouli<br>
A warm, addictive base of creamy vanilla and earthy patchouli creates depth and sensuality, leaving behind a smooth, long-lasting trail with a bronzed glow.</p>

<p>Ideal for both day and evening wear, Albait Aldimashqi Bronzy is made for the woman who shines effortlessly—confident, graceful, and unforgettable.</p>

<p>✨ Albait Aldimashqi Bronzy – a radiant scent that lingers like golden warmth on the skin.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Albait Aldimashq, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,547.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Albait-Aldimashqi-Bronzy.png?v=1779820475,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
