decant-partial-of-albait-aldimashqi-rozy-edp,Decant/Partial Of Albait Aldimashqi Rozy EDP,"<p>Albait Aldimashqi Rozy 75ml EDP for Men – Bold Elegance, Spiced Sophistication 🌶️🌿</p>

<p>A fragrance of character and distinction, Albait Aldimashqi Rozy blends spice, sweetness, and depth into a modern signature scent for the confident man. Crafted in the UAE, this Eau de Parfum balances lively freshness with warm, inviting undertones, creating an aura that is both charismatic and refined.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>🌶️ Top Notes: Pink Pepper, Juniper, Violet<br>
A vibrant and invigorating opening of pink pepper, crisp juniper, and soft violet sparks energy and intrigue, making a striking first impression.</p>

<p>🍬 Heart Notes: Toffee, Cinnamon, Lavender, Sage<br>
The heart unfolds with a sophisticated mix of sweet toffee, warming cinnamon, calming lavender, and aromatic sage—offering a rich, complex, and memorable middle that feels both comforting and dynamic.</p>

<p>🤎 Base Notes: Vanilla, Amber, Tonka Bean, Suede<br>
A deep, masculine base of creamy vanilla, golden amber, nutty tonka bean, and soft suede provides longevity and a sensual finish, leaving a smooth, lasting trail that exudes elegance and confidence.</p>

<p>Perfect for evening sophistication, special occasions, or daily wear that demands attention, Albait Aldimashqi Rozy is a bold yet refined statement.</p>

