decant-partial-of-albait-aldimashqi-paradoxe-edp,Decant/Partial Of Albait Aldimashqi Paradoxe EDP,"<p>Albait Aldimashqi Paradoxe 75ml EDP for Women – A Modern Expression of Femininity ✨🌸</p>

