decant-partial-of-albait-aldimashqi-hacivat-edp,Decant/Partial Of Albait Aldimashqi Hacivat EDP,"<p>Albait Aldimashqi Hacivat 75ml EDP – A Timeless Ode to Elegance 🍍🌿<br>
A fragrance of sophistication and power, Albait Aldimashqi Hacivat embodies the art of chypre perfumery with a captivating balance of freshness, depth, and woody allure. Crafted in the UAE, this scent is an homage to refined masculinity, blending luminous citrus with a rich, earthy foundation. Inspired by Hacivat by Nishane, it radiates confidence and charm with every spritz.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:<br>
✨ Top Notes: Pineapple, Grapefruit, BergamotA vibrant fusion of zesty citrus and juicy pineapple introduces the scent with an exhilarating freshness, exuding vitality and charisma.<br>
🌿 Middle Notes: Cedar, Patchouli, JasmineAn elegant heart of woody cedar, earthy patchouli, and delicate jasmine anchors the fragrance, adding warmth and complexity.<br>
🍂 Base Notes: Oakmoss, Woody NotesA seductive blend of rich oakmoss and deep woody nuances delivers a refined and long-lasting finish, leaving an unforgettable trail.<br>
Perfect for the modern gentleman who commands attention effortlessly, Albait Aldimashqi Hacivat is ideal for both daytime elegance and evening sophistication. A scent that lingers like a legacy—bold, charismatic, and timeless. ✨🔥</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Albait Aldimashq, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,533.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Albait-Aldimashqi.png?v=1779820498,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
