decant-partial-of-albait-aldimashqi-ombre-nomade-edp,Decant/Partial Of Albait Aldimashqi Ombre Nomade EDP,"<p>Albait Aldimashq Ombre Nomade 75ml EDP – A Majestic Oud Symphony 🏮<br>
A fragrance that speaks of grandeur, Albait Aldimashq Ombre Nomade is an ode to the timeless elegance of the Orient. Crafted in the UAE, this opulent scent is for the man who commands presence and leaves a lasting impression. Inspired by Ombre Nomade by Louis Vuitton, it embodies the richness of smoky oud, deep resins, and luscious florals, weaving a tale of luxury and adventure.</p>

