decant-partial-of-armaf-cool-ace-edp,Decant/Partial Of Armaf Cool Ace EDP,"Armaf Cool Ace 100ml EDP – Fresh, Spicy &amp; Smooth 🌿✨
For Men | Citrus • Spicy • Woody

Armaf Cool Ace is a refined and modern fragrance for men who enjoy a fresh yet subtly spicy scent. Crisp citrus meets aromatic spices and soft woody accords, creating a well-balanced, confident, and versatile fragrance. Perfect for daily wear, office settings, or casual evenings, it exudes understated elegance.

Fragrance Notes ✨

Top Notes: Bergamot &amp; Heliotrope 🍋🌸
The fragrance opens with bright, refreshing bergamot combined with the soft, powdery floral touch of heliotrope. This creates a clean, uplifting, and approachable introduction.

Heart Notes: Cumin &amp; Aromatic Spices 🌿🌶️
At the heart, warm cumin and aromatic spices add depth and character. This spicy core gives the fragrance a subtle, masculine richness without being overpowering.

Base Notes: Soft Powdery Accords &amp; Masculine Woods 🌳🤍
The dry-down is smooth and comforting. Gentle powdery accords blend with robust masculine woods, leaving a long-lasting, elegant trail that feels confident and modern.

Ideal for men who love versatile, fresh, and subtly spicy fragrances, Cool Ace is polished, approachable, and effortlessly stylish.

🌿✨ Armaf Cool Ace – freshness, spice, and woody sophistication in harmony.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Armaf, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,498.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Armaf-Cool-Ace.png?v=1779820597,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
