decant-partial-of-armaf-club-de-nuit-urban-elixir-edp,Decant/Partial Of Armaf Club De Nuit Urban Elixir EDP,"<p>Armaf Club De Nuit Urban Elixir</p> 

<p>Armaf Club De Nuit Urban Elixir is a standout fragrance for men, celebrated for its exceptional longevity and captivating scent. This hybrid Inspired blends elements of Dior Sauvage and other designer fragrances like Aventus and Prada, offering a sophisticated and enduring experience.</p>

<p>Top Notes: The fragrance opens with a fresh and invigorating blend of bergamot, pink pepper, jasmine, and orange blossom, creating a vibrant and energetic introduction.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: The heart reveals a complex mix of soothing lavender, elegant geranium, earthy elemi, and unique tagetes. Vetiver adds a smoky, woody touch, while saffron introduces a hint of exotic spice.</p>

