decant-partial-of-armaf-odyssey-aoud-edp,Decant/Partial Of Armaf Odyssey Aoud EDP,"<p>Armaf Odyssey Aoud is a new fragrance that was launched in 2023. It is a luxurious and exotic fragrance that is perfect for those who appreciate the finer things in life. As its name indicates oud creates a very beautiful and luxurious woody aroma with all the notes below which empowers the fragrance to last longer. It is a unisex scent that both men and women can enjoy, and it is known for its long-lasting and captivating aroma.</p>


