decant-partial-of-armaf-club-de-nuit-iconic-edp,Decant/Partial Of Armaf Club De Nuit Iconic EDP,"<p>Armaf Club de Nuit Iconic perfume is a highly versatile fragrance that has gained a reputation as an excellent Inspired of the popular Blue de Chanel perfume.</p>

<p>Designed specifically for men, this scent offers a unique and long-lasting olfactory experience. The fragrance opens with a vibrant blend of grapefruit, lemon, mint, pink pepper, and coriander, creating a refreshing and invigorating top note. As the fragrance develops, the heart notes of ginger, nutmeg, jasmine, and melon add a spicy and aromatic touch, balancing the citrusy opening. Finally, the bottom notes of incense, amber, cedar, sandalwood, patchouli, labdanum, and woody accords provide a warm and sensual foundation, leaving a lasting impression.</p>

<p>Armaf Club de Nuit Iconic is known for its ability to be worn on various occasions, making it suitable for both daytime and evening wear. Its exceptional longevity ensures that the fragrance stays with you throughout the day, while its captivating blend of notes leaves a memorable and sophisticated trail. This fragrance has become a popular choice among fragrance enthusiasts who appreciate its affordable yet high-quality alternative to the iconic Blue de Chanel.</p>

<p>Top Note: Grapefruit, Lemon, Mint, Pink Pepper, Coriander<br>
Heart Note: Ginger, Nutmeg, Jasmine and Melon<br>
Bottom Note: Incense, Amber, Cedar, Sandalwood, Patchouli, Labdanum, Woody</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Armaf, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,7,deny,manual,726.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Armaf-Club-de-Nuit-Iconic-Eau-de-Parfum-105ML.png?v=1779820638,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
