decant-partial-of-armaf-royal-amber-oud-parfum,Decant/Partial Of Armaf Royal Amber Oud Parfum,"<p>Armaf Royal Amber Oud Pour Homme is an excellent fragrance for men. It's a newly launched perfume in 2022. as the name indicates, Royal Amber Oud has royal feelings.</p>

<p>You will get a fruity aroma on the top and Leather, Amber, Oud notes are very settled and prominent in this fragrance. this fragrance truly indicated the royal feelings and classic effects at the same time. It is a Parfum version that has a higher oil concentration so the performance of this fragrance is mind-blowing. If you will apply 4 spays then you will be smelling great haul day long with a great scent trail and projection. Till the next day you can smell it on your clothes.</p>

<p>It is a must-have winter fragrance for men or you can use it in the nighttime in summer or on hot days.</p>

<p>Top notes are iris, Strawberry, Rhubarb, Raspberry, Orange, Plum, Pink Pepper, Black Pepper, and Cardamom</p>

<p>Middle notes are Jasmine, Carnation, Geranium, and Rose</p>

<p>Base notes are Cypriol Oil or Nagarmotha, Agarwood (Oud), Vetiver, Cedar, Patchouli, Guaiac Wood, Leather, Musk, Labdanum, Honey, Vanilla and Olibanum.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Armaf, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,540.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Armaf-Royal-Amber-Oud-Parfum-100ml.png?v=1779820651,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
