decant-partial-of-armaf-ombre-oud-intense-edp,Decant/Partial Of Armaf Ombre Oud Intense EDP,"<p>Armaf Ombre Oud Intense a provocative fruity spicy masculine scent opens with fresh fruity notes of citrus, lemon and ginger leading to its opulent floral heart of jasmine and rose spiced up with violet to add a passionate accords. The base includes sandalwood, musk, ambroxan, and cedar.. The primum fregrance by sterling perfumes.</p>

<p>By sterling perfumes. Armaf Ombre Oud Intense Edp is a hidden labyrinth revealed in layers of opulence, a perfume for men of great performance. Top Notes: Bergamot Orange Cedar leaves. Middle Notes: Passion fruit Thyme Sandal. Base Notes: Ambrocenide Musk Cedarwood Amber Vanilla.</p>

<p>Fragrance Perfume : Ombre Oud Intense</p>

<p>Fragrance : Bergamot Orange Cedar Leaves, Passion Fruit, Thyme Sandal, Ambrocenide, Musk, Cedarwood, Amber And Vanilla.</p>

<p>Gender : Men</p>

