decant-partial-of-armaf-tag-him-edt,Decant/Partial Of Armaf Tag Him EDT,"<p>TAG-HIM POUR HOMME BY ARMAF TAG HIM POUR HOMME Confident, iconic and swashbuckling - an intense and energizing scent reveals masculine modernity. An aromatic woody fragrance with top notes of lemon, grapefruit and lavender mingled with spicy accents of pink pepper, ginger and warm woods of cedar and vetiver. The dry down is woody and ambery</p>

<p>Tag-Him by Armaf is a Woody Spicy fragrance for men. Top notes are Grapefruit, Lemon, Pink Pepper and Bergamot; middle notes are Ginger, Mint, Nutmeg and Lavender; base notes are Vetiver, Sandalwood, Patchouli and Cedar.</p>

