decant-partial-of-armaf-victory-pour-homme-edp,Decant/Partial Of Armaf Victory Pour Homme EDP,"<p>Victory is a perfume by Armaf for men and was released in 2019. The scent is fruity-gourmand. It is being marketed by Sterling Perfumes.</p>

<p>Top Notes Orange, Pear, Cardamom</p>

<p>Heart Notes Lavender, Pink pepper, Fruity notes</p>

<p>Base Notes Patchouli, Vetiver</p>

<p>100ml for men.</p>

<p>Projection of this fragrance is 2 to 2.5 hours for about 1.5 feet then sillage for 6 hours with great longevity of 8+ hours. Definitely value for mony.</p>

<p>Little worm so recommended to wear this fragrance in evening time or cool weather.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Armaf, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,400.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Armaf-victory-pour-homme-100ml-EDP.png?v=1779820676,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
