decant-partial-of-armaf-seduction-for-men-edp,Decant/Partial Of Armaf Seduction For Men EDP,"<p>Seduction For Men is a bold woody musky scent that empowers itself through sea tones and grapefruit for a crisp opening.</p>

<p>The heart features a tantalising dance of spices, geranium, and bay leaf.</p>

<p>A base of guaiac wood and amber completes the fragrance.</p>

<p>It has a very nice Projection for about 2 hours 2 feet then you get good sillage for about 6 7 hours then it becomes very smooth musky woody ambery scent on skin and clothes for about 8+ hours easily.</p>

<p> </p>

<p>Good compliment getter.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Armaf, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,485.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/ARMAF-SEDUCTION-FOR-MEN-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779820678,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
