decant-partial-of-fragrance-world-monarch-queen-edp,Decant/Partial Of Fragrance World Monarch Queen EDP,"Fragrance World Monarch Queen 100ml EDP – Royal Elegance with Warm Vanilla &amp; Musk 👑✨
For Women | Citrus • Vanilla • Musky
Fragrance World Monarch Queen is a graceful and sophisticated feminine fragrance that blends sparkling citrus freshness with creamy vanilla and soft musky woods. Elegant, smooth, and long-lasting, it’s crafted for women who love a classy scent with a modern royal touch.
🌿 Fragrance Notes
Top Notes:
🍊 Bergamot &amp; Mandarin – Bright citrus freshness that feels lively, elegant, and refreshing.
Heart Notes:
🌸 Clove, Vanilla &amp; Vetiver – A warm spicy-floral heart wrapped in creamy sweetness and earthy sophistication.
Base Notes:
🪵 Sandalwood &amp; Musk – Soft woody warmth with a smooth musky trail that lingers beautifully on the skin.
This fragrance opens with a sparkling citrus burst, melts into a warm sweet-spicy heart, and settles into a soft woody-musky finish that feels luxurious and feminine.
Perfect for daily wear, elegant evenings, brunch dates, office wear, and special occasions, it suits women who enjoy sophisticated fragrances with a soft sweet warmth.
