decant-partial-of-fragrance-world-one-self-edp,Decant/Partial Of Fragrance World One Self EDP,"Fragrance World One Self 100ml EDP for Men – Be Unapologetically You 💫Crafted in the UAE, One Self by Fragrance World is a bold and modern Eau de Parfum for men who lead with authenticity. Inspired by the iconic MYSLF by Yves Saint Laurent, this scent is a celebration of self-expression and effortless charm.
