Middle Notes: Delve deeper into the heart of Optimystic, where cardamom, ginger, and orange blossom converge to elevate the fragrance to new heights. This aromatic medley adds a spicy and floral complexity, evoking a sense of intrigue and magnetism.
Base Notes: The journey reaches its crescendo with a rich and opulent base, where amber, tobacco, and cedar cast a mesmerizing spell. Bask in the warm embrace of these timeless notes, as they envelop you in a cloak of sensuality and sophistication.

🌿 Inspired by The One for Men: Optimystic stands as a remarkable homage to The One for Men Eau de Parfum by Dolce&amp;Gabbana, capturing the essence of its iconic predecessor while adding a unique twist of its own. Embrace the familiarity of classic elegance reinvented for the modern man.

🌞 Elevate Your Signature Scent: Crafted for the discerning gentleman who exudes confidence and refinement, Fragrance World Optimystic is the perfect companion for every occasion. Whether it's a boardroom meeting or a romantic evening, let your fragrance leave a lasting impression that resonates with sophistication and charm.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Fragrance World, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,380.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Fragrance-World-Optimystic.png?v=1779821004,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
