<p>🌰 Base Notes: The finale is a decadent blend of tonka bean, licorice, precious woods, musk, amber, and patchouli. This luxurious medley of base notes adds depth and complexity, leaving a trail of sensual warmth that lingers on the skin, captivating all who encounter it.</p>

<p>🎀 A Inspired of Timeless Elegance: Fragrance World Jasmin Noir pays homage to the iconic Jasmin Noir by Bvlgari, capturing its essence with precision and finesse. Every spritz is a tribute to the enduring legacy of sophistication and refinement, allowing you to embody the timeless elegance of the original fragrance.</p>

<p>🌟 Embrace Your Feminine Charm: Indulge in the allure of Fragrance World Jasmin Noir and embrace your inner femininity. Whether it's a special occasion or a daily indulgence, let this exquisite perfume be your signature scent, a reflection of your unique style and personality.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Fragrance World, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,360.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/fragrance-world-jasmin-noir-poue-femme.png?v=1779821006,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
