Base Note: The fragrance culminates in a lingering base of patchouli, a timeless and earthy note that anchors the scent with depth and complexity. Its velvety warmth adds a sensual allure that lingers on the skin, leaving a lasting impression that is as unforgettable as it is alluring.</p>

<p>🌺 A Tribute to Black Orchid Parfum: Fragrance World Azara pays homage to the iconic Black Orchid Parfum by Tom Ford, capturing its essence and allure in a mesmerizing blend that is both timeless and contemporary. Embrace the legacy of luxury with every spray, as you embark on a journey of sensory splendor unlike any other.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Fragrance World, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,360.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Fragrance-World-Azara.png?v=1779821007,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
