decant-partial-of-lattafa-khamrah-waha-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Khamrah Waha EDP,"Lattafa Khamrah Waha 100ml Eau De Parfum – Fresh Marine Woods with Creamy Warmth 🌊🍋✨
For Men &amp; Women | Fresh • Aromatic • Woody • Musky
Lattafa Khamrah Waha is a refreshing and modern unisex fragrance Crafted by renowned perfumer Jordi Fernández. Vibrant citrus, cool marine accords, and creamy woody warmth blend together in a scent that feels energetic, sophisticated, and effortlessly luxurious—perfect for those who enjoy fresh fragrances with depth and sensuality.
Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Bergamot, Ginger, Juniper &amp; Yuzu 🍋🌿⚡
The opening is crisp, sparkling, and invigorating. Bright bergamot and juicy yuzu create a refreshing citrus burst, while spicy ginger adds warmth and juniper introduces a cool aromatic freshness that feels clean and refined.
Heart Notes: Cucumber, Sea Salt, Sage &amp; Iris 🌊🥒🌿
At the heart, the fragrance becomes airy and aquatic. Fresh cucumber and sea salt create a breezy marine sensation, while sage adds aromatic depth. Soft iris brings a smooth, elegant touch that balances freshness with sophistication.
Base Notes: Ambrofix™, Akigalawood, Vanilla, Musk &amp; Tonka Bean 🌫️🪵🍦
The dry-down is creamy, woody, and long-lasting. Modern ambrofix and akigalawood provide a warm woody trail, while vanilla and tonka bean add subtle sweetness. Soft musk wraps the fragrance in a clean, sensual finish.
Perfect for daily wear, summer evenings, vacations, and signature scent lovers, this fragrance delivers a fresh yet comforting aura with impressive lasting power.
✨ Lattafa Khamrah Waha – a captivating fusion of sparkling freshness, marine elegance, and creamy woody warmth.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, men, Partial, Party",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,550.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Khamrah-Waha.png?v=1779821021,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,aquatics,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
