Lattafa Esraa Attar is ideal for anyone who loves fruity-gourmand fragrances with a sweet, feel-good vibe—fresh yet warm, playful yet elegant. A perfect companion for daily wear, brunch dates, and anytime you want a scent that feels bright, sweet, and truly delightful.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Attar, Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,1100.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Esraa-Attar.png?v=1779821040,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
