decant-partial-of-lattafa-lail-maleki-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Lail Maleki EDP,"<p>Lattafa Lail Maleki 100ML EDP – The Night is Yours 🌙✨An intoxicating unisex fragrance from the house of Lattafa, Lail Maleki is a bold expression of passion and power. Made in the UAE and crafted for long-lasting performance, this Eau de Parfum is a luxurious oriental scent that captivates from the very first spray.<br>
The opening is a dazzling burst of fruity accords, warm spices, and zesty citruses, creating a magnetic and mysterious aura. As it evolves, the heart reveals a sensual blend of golden honey, exotic jasmine, rich gardenia, and seductive orchid, adding floral sweetness and depth. Finally, the base lingers with a lavish trail of creamy sandalwood, velvety musk, sweet caramel, and golden amber, offering a warm, gourmand finish that feels both regal and comforting.<br>
Fragrance Notes:<br>
Top Notes: Fruity Notes, Spicy Notes, Citruses(A bold and vibrant introduction with sweet warmth and a hint of zest.)<br>
