decant-partial-of-lattafa-teriaq-intense-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Teriaq Intense EDP,"<p>Lattafa Teriaq Intense 100ml EDP for Men – Bold, Unique, and Long-Lasting 🌟</p>

<p>Step into a world of refined intensity with Lattafa Teriaq Intense, a fragrance that exudes boldness and sophistication. Crafted in the UAE, this Eau De Parfum is a testament to luxury and long-lasting performance, designed for men who dare to stand out.</p>

<p>✨ Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: The opening is a vibrant burst of saffron and bergamot, setting the stage with a zesty yet spicy allure.<br>
Middle Notes: At its heart, the fragrance reveals the richness of plum liquor and cinnamon, creating a warm and intoxicating blend that is both sensual and inviting.<br>
Base Notes: The dry-down is a masterpiece of depth and warmth, with amber, tonka bean, and benzoin leaving a trail of unforgettable elegance.</p>

<p>🔥 Crafted to Perfection:<br>
