<p>🔥 Unparalleled Longevity: Prepare to be enchanted by the enduring charm of Lattafa Ajwad. With its super long-lasting formula, this fragrance becomes an integral part of your persona, accompanying you through every moment of your day with unwavering elegance.</p>

<p>💫 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Delight in the initial burst of freshness as fruity notes dance upon your senses, creating a tantalizing opening that sets the stage for the olfactory journey ahead. Experience the playful vibrancy that awakens the spirit.<br>
Heart Notes: As the fragrance unfolds, jasmine and rose take center stage, intertwining in a delicate embrace of floral splendor. Feel the romantic allure wash over you, evoking a sense of timeless elegance and grace.<br>
Base Notes: The journey culminates in a symphony of richness and warmth, as amber, vanilla, musk, and cedarwood form a harmonious base. Let the lingering trail of sensuality and depth envelop you in a veil of irresistible allure.</p>

<p>🌺 Versatile Elegance for All: Designed to transcend gender boundaries, Lattafa Ajwad is a fragrance for those who appreciate timeless elegance and enduring luxury. Whether for a formal affair or a casual outing, its versatility ensures you always leave a lasting impression.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,567.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-ajwad.png?v=1779821143,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
