Heart Notes: Delve deeper into a floral symphony with notes of vanilla, roses, and lily-of-the-valley at the heart of Ajwad Pink To Pink. The sweet embrace of vanilla intertwines with the delicate floral bouquet, evoking feelings of romance and sophistication.<br>
Base Notes: As the fragrance settles, it leaves a trail of sensuality with its base notes of musk. A classic and timeless scent, musk adds depth and warmth, enhancing the overall allure of this exquisite fragrance.</p>

<p>🌟 Versatile Elegance: Designed to be worn by both men and women, Lattafa Ajwad Pink To Pink transcends traditional gender norms. Its versatility allows you to effortlessly transition from day to night, from casual outings to formal affairs, while exuding confidence and charm.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,1080.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Ajwad-Pink-To-Pink.png?v=1779821144,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
