decant-partial-of-lattafa-atlas-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Atlas EDP,"<p>Lattafa Atlas Eau De Parfum 55ml for Men: A Fresh Marine Symphony of Long-Lasting Elegance</p>

<p>Indulge in the invigorating allure of Lattafa Atlas, a fragrance that embodies the essence of a boundless sea breeze. This 55ml Eau De Parfum is meticulously crafted to be a true companion for the modern man, offering an unrivaled freshness that stands the test of time.</p>

<p>Beast Mode Longevity: Lattafa Atlas is not merely a fragrance; it's an experience. Revel in its beast mode longevity that ensures you stay immersed in the freshness throughout your day. Make a lasting impression with a scent that endures.</p>

