decant-partial-of-lattafa-khamrah-qahwa-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Khamrah Qahwa EDP,"<p>Indulge in the captivating allure of Lattafa Khamrah Qahwa, a 100ml Eau de Parfum designed for both men and women. This fragrance is meticulously crafted to endure the dynamic climate of Indian weather, offering an extraordinary olfactory experience that lingers throughout the day. Embrace the confidence and charm that comes with a scent known for its remarkable longevity – a true beast mode fragrance.</p>

<p>🌟 Fragrance Profile:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Cinnamon, Cardamom, and Ginger Embark on a sensory journey with the invigorating blend of spicy cinnamon, aromatic cardamom, and zesty ginger. The top notes set the stage for a fragrance that is both bold and enticing.</p>

