<p>Long-Lasting Elegance: Khamrah Qahwa by Lattafa is more than just a perfume; it's a statement of enduring elegance. Its longevity ensures that you remain enveloped in its aromatic embrace from morning to night, making it an ideal companion for any occasion.</p>

<p>Perfect Blend for All: This versatile fragrance effortlessly complements both men and women, making it a perfect choice for those who appreciate the finer things in life. Whether it's a daytime affair or an evening soirée, Khamrah Qahwa adds a touch of luxury to every moment.</p>

<p>Dive into Luxury: Immerse yourself in the opulence of Lattafa Khamrah Qahwa. Elevate your senses with this remarkable perfume that transcends time, leaving an unforgettable mark wherever you go. Experience the magic of a fragrance that's as enduring as it is enchanting.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","best seller, Decant, LATTAFA, men, Partial, Party, Women",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,18,deny,manual,550.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Khamrah-Qahwa.png?v=1779821147,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
