decant-partial-of-lattafa-al-nashama-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Al Nashama EDP,"<p>Lattafa Al Nashama 100ML EDP for women is a fragrance that encapsulates the essence of femininity with a delightful and enduring allure. This olfactory masterpiece is renowned for its exceptional longevity, making it a steadfast companion throughout the day and well into the night.</p>

<p>The fragrance opens with a tantalizing burst of sweetness, as honey takes center stage in the top notes. This golden nectar sets the tone for an indulgent and luxurious olfactory experience. As the perfume unfolds, a symphony of white florals dances gracefully, adding an ethereal touch to the composition. These floral notes contribute to the fragrance's overall elegance, evoking a sense of timeless beauty.</p>

<p>Citrus notes weave seamlessly into the heart of the fragrance, introducing a refreshing and lively element. The citrus accord provides a bright and invigorating quality, balancing the sweetness with a touch of zesty sophistication. The journey through Al Nashama continues with the entrance of caramel, adding a rich and gourmand facet to the perfume. This note infuses the fragrance with warmth and indulgence, creating an irresistible allure that captivates the senses.</p>

<p>As the perfume evolves on the skin, an animalic undertone emerges, adding a sensuous and primal quality. This final layer contributes depth and complexity, ensuring that Lattafa Al Nashama is not just a fragrance but an olfactory narrative that unfolds uniquely on each wearer.</p>

<p>In a world where longevity is a prized attribute, Lattafa Al Nashama stands out as a paragon of endurance, making it a compelling choice for those who seek a fragrance that lingers in memory and time. This scent is a celebration of femininity, blending sweetness, florals, citrus, caramel, and animalic notes into a harmonious symphony that resonates with sophistication and allure.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,440.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Al-Nashama-Lattafa.png?v=1779821148,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
