decant-partial-of-lattafa-al-nashama-caprice-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Al Nashama Caprice EDP,"<p>Immerse yourself in the opulence of Lattafa Al Nashama Caprice, an exquisite Eau de Parfum designed for both men and women who appreciate the finer things in life. This fragrance is a harmonious symphony of aromas that radiate exclusivity and refinement. With each spritz, Al Nashama Caprice unveils a sensorial experience, enveloping you in a blend of scents meticulously crafted to elevate your senses and boost your confidence.</p>

<p>The fragrance notes are a testament to its complexity and versatility. Aromatic and fresh, the lavender undertones provide a soothing and timeless quality, while the infusion of fresh spices adds a tantalizing twist that invigorates the senses. The woody notes lend a warm and grounding character, creating a perfect balance with the citrusy elements that add a touch of brightness and vibrancy. The herbal nuances add a natural and earthy dimension, completing the olfactory journey with sophistication.</p>

<p>Elevate your fragrance game with Lattafa Al Nashama Caprice, where each note is a brushstroke painting a portrait of luxury. This scent isn't just a perfume; it's an expression of individuality and refinement that lingers, leaving an unforgettable impression. Let the aromatic lavender, fresh spices, woody essence, citrusy notes, and herbal undertones combine to create a symphony of scents that resonate with sophistication and exclusivity. Redefine your signature scent and embrace the confidence that comes with wearing a fragrance crafted for those who appreciate the artistry of perfumery.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,5,deny,manual,475.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Al-Nashama-Caprice.png?v=1779821149,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
