decant-partial-of-lattafa-rave-now-rouge-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Rave Now Rouge EDP,"<p>Lattafa Rave Now Rouge Eau de Parfum, a captivating fragrance designed for both men and women, is an olfactory masterpiece that transcends the boundaries of conventional scents. This 100ml bottle houses an elixir that goes beyond a mere fragrance, offering an enchanting experience that lingers throughout the day and well into the night.</p>

<p>Renowned for its exceptional longevity, Rave Now Rouge is a testament to the artistry of Lattafa, ensuring that each spritz unfolds into a symphony of scents that dances on the skin for an extended period. The perfume opens with a burst of freshness from its top notes, where Herbal Notes intertwine seamlessly with Balsamic Notes. This initial aromatic embrace sets the stage for an olfactory journey that is both invigorating and sophisticated.</p>

<p>The heart of Rave Now Rouge reveals a floral elegance with Iris and Resins at its core. This exquisite blend adds a layer of complexity to the fragrance, evoking a sense of timeless beauty and refined charm. As the scent develops, it gracefully transitions into the base notes, where the warm and grounding embrace of Woody Notes and Sandalwood takes center stage. This foundation imparts a subtle yet enduring earthiness that enhances the overall character of the fragrance.</p>

<p>Lattafa's Rave Now Rouge is a unisex fragrance that transcends gender norms, making it a versatile and intriguing choice for those who appreciate the art of perfumery. With its long-lasting formula and a harmonious blend of herbal, resinous, and woody notes, Rave Now Rouge stands as a beacon of sophistication, leaving an indelible mark wherever its wearer goes. This fragrance is not just a scent; it's an ode to lasting impressions and timeless allure.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,348.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rave-Now-Rouge.png?v=1779821150,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
