decant-partial-of-lattafa-badee-al-oud-sublime-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Badee Al Oud Sublime EDP,"<p>Lattafa Badee Al Oud Sublime is an olfactory masterpiece that transcends traditional gender boundaries, offering an enchanting olfactory experience for both men and women. This 100ML Eau de Parfum is not just a fragrance; it's a journey into the sublime, a symphony of scents that lingers throughout the day and night, showcasing an exceptional longevity that truly sets it apart.</p>

<p>Opening with a burst of freshness, the top notes dance on the skin, revealing a delightful combination of crisp Apple, exotic Litchi, and the timeless elegance of Rose. This initial olfactory embrace sets the stage for a fragrance that evolves, unveiling a heart rich in complexity. Plum and Jasmine intertwine, creating a floral and fruity melody that captivates the senses.</p>

<p>As the fragrance progresses, it leaves a lasting impression with its deep and sensual base notes. Vanilla adds a touch of sweetness, while Moss and Patchouli provide an earthy depth that grounds the composition in sophistication. The result is a harmonious blend that is both alluring and comforting.</p>

<p>What sets Bade’e Al Oud Sublime apart is not only its luxurious scent but also its status as an excellent alternative to the renowned Eden Juicy Apple | 01 by Kayali Fragrances. This Lattafa creation captures the essence of the expensive favorite, offering a budget-friendly option without compromising on quality or longevity.</p>

<p>Top notes are Apple, Litchi and Rose</p>

<p>Middle notes are Plum and Jasmine</p>

<p>Base notes are Vanilla, Moss and Patchouli.</p>

<p>In every spray, Bade’e Al Oud Sublime becomes a signature scent, an aromatic companion that accompanies you through every facet of life. From its top notes that spark a sense of vibrancy to its lingering base that leaves an unforgettable trail, this fragrance embodies the sublime in a bottle, a testament to the artistry and allure of Lattafa's creations.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,460.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-sublime.png?v=1779821152,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
