decant-partial-of-lattafa-ajayeb-dubai-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Ajayeb Dubai EDP,"<p>Experience the epitome of opulence with Lattafa Ajayeb Dubai Eau De Parfum, a captivating fragrance that transcends gender boundaries. Unveiling a symphony of enduring notes, this scent is an ode to timeless allure, perfect for those who seek a fragrance that lingers throughout the day.</p>

<p>Lattafa Ajayeb Dubai opens with a burst of citrusy brightness, where the zesty accord of orange and lemon dances in perfect harmony. This lively introduction creates an immediate sense of freshness, setting the stage for the journey into the heart of the fragrance.</p>

<p>As the scent evolves, the heart notes unfold, revealing a lush blend of jasmine, mango, and osmanthus. The floral elegance of jasmine intertwines with the sweet succulence of mango, creating a delightful and fruity bouquet. Osmanthus adds a touch of sophistication, elevating the composition to a higher level of olfactory delight.</p>

<p>The base notes of amber, sandalwood, musk, and oud form the olfactory foundation of this fragrance. Rich amber imparts a warm, honeyed character, seamlessly blending with the woody and creamy essence of sandalwood. Musk adds a sensuous depth, while oud, with its resinous and slightly smoky undertones, contributes an exotic touch that lingers on the skin.</p>

<p>The honey-fruity amber-based composition of Lattafa Ajayeb Dubai Eau De Parfum ensures an enduring olfactory experience. This fragrance is not merely a scent; it's a statement of luxury, a lingering trail of sophistication that effortlessly captivates the senses. Embrace the enchanting allure of Ajayeb Dubai and indulge in a fragrance that defines lasting elegance.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,385.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Ajayeb-Dubai.png?v=1779821153,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
decant-partial-of-lattafa-ajayeb-dubai-edp,,,,,,,,,70ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1294.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Decant_Image.png?v=1781928894,2,"",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,
decant-partial-of-lattafa-emeer-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Emeer EDP,"<p>Indulge in the opulence of Lattafa Emeer Eau De Parfum, a 100ml bottle of pure sophistication for men. This super long-lasting and premium fragrance is a captivating blend of meticulously selected notes that elevate your olfactory experience to new heights.</p>

<p>The journey begins with a burst of citrus freshness, as zesty Lemon and Bergamot intertwine with the crispness of Juniper Berries and the herbal allure of Clary Sage. This invigorating symphony sets the stage for an unforgettable fragrance experience.</p>

<p>As the scent evolves, the heart notes come to life with an intriguing blend of Cardamom's spicy warmth, the delicate essence of White Tea, the creamy richness of Sandalwood, and the timeless allure of Olibanum. This harmonious combination creates a captivating and balanced olfactory profile.</p>

<p>The grand finale unfolds with a rich and enduring base. Ambergris adds a touch of sensuality, while Cashmeran brings a warm and musky depth. Patchouli contributes earthiness, and Cedarwood provides a solid, woody foundation. Together, these base notes create a lasting impression that lingers throughout the day, making Emeer an emblem of timeless elegance.</p>

<p>Top Note: Lemon, Bergamot, Juniper Berries, Clary Sage<br>
Heart Note: Cardamon, White Tea, Sandalwood, Olibanum<br>
Base Note: Ambergris, Cashmeran, Patchouli, Cedarwood</p>

<p>Lattafa Emeer is not just a fragrance; it's an expression of refined taste and enduring charisma. Immerse yourself in the luxury of this exquisite perfume, designed for those who appreciate the finer things in life.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, men, Partial, Party",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,580.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Emeer.png?v=1779821154,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
