decant-partial-of-lattafa-niche-emarati-khalid-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Niche Emarati Khalid EDP,"<p>Lattafa Niche Emarati Khalid for Men is an olfactory masterpiece that embodies the essence of sophistication and individuality. This fragrance is an absolute standout, showcasing a unique and fresh citrusy allure that is nothing short of captivating.</p>

<p>Upon the first spritz, you are greeted with the enchanting top notes of saffron, labdanum, and leather, which create a complex and spicy introduction. These notes blend seamlessly to provide an initial burst of intrigue, setting the stage for what is to come.</p>

<p>As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes of birch, cade, and patchouli take center stage. This middle layer introduces a smoky, woody depth to the scent, adding complexity and a hint of mystery. The combination of these notes exudes confidence and allure, making it a perfect choice for the modern, self-assured man.</p>

<p>But what truly sets Lattafa Niche Emarati Khalid apart is its remarkable longevity. It's not just a fragrance; it's a statement that lasts. The base notes of benzoin, agarwood, tolu balsam, and leather anchor the scent, creating an enduring and luxurious trail that lingers throughout the day and into the night.</p>

<p>Top notes: Saffron, Labdanum, Leather<br>
Middle notes: Birch, Cade, Patchouli<br>
Base notes: Benzoin, Agarwood, Tolu Balsam, Leather</p>

<p>This fragrance is the embodiment of elegance and character, designed for the discerning individual who appreciates the art of perfumery. Lattafa Niche Emarati Khalid is more than just a scent; it's a reflection of your unique style and a testament to your unwavering presence. Embrace its uniqueness and bask in the compliments that will undoubtedly come your way when you wear this extraordinary Eau de Parfum.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,650.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/lattafa-niche-emarati-khalid.png?v=1779821157,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
