decant-partial-of-lattafa-niche-emarati-al-dana-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Niche Emarati Al Dana EDP,"<p>Lattafa Niche Emarati Al Dana 100ml Eau de Parfum for Men is an olfactory masterpiece that encapsulates the essence of luxury and sophistication. This fragrance is a testament to Lattafa's commitment to creating unique and exquisite scents that leave a lasting impression.</p>

<p>At first spritz, you're greeted with an invigorating burst of fresh citrus notes that include Bergamot, Lemon, Pineapple, Pepper, and Lime. This top note medley is an uplifting and energizing start, immediately grabbing your attention. The citrusy opening creates a sense of vitality and sets the stage for what's to come.</p>

