<p>The base notes, which linger on your skin for hours, feature a captivating fusion of Patchouli, Amber, Woody accords, a touch of Smokiness, and Musk. These elements give Lattafa Niche Emarati Al Dana its distinctive and enduring character. The fragrance's longevity is truly exceptional, making it an ideal choice for those who seek a long-lasting scent that carries them through the day and into the night.</p>

<p>Top notes: Berganor, Lemon, Pineapple, Pepper, Lime</p>

