<p>This Eau de Parfum is a masterpiece that exudes elegance and uniqueness. It's the olfactory embodiment of confidence and sophistication, making it an excellent choice for those who appreciate luxury and a fresh, long-lasting fragrance. Lattafa Niche Emarati Al Dana is a statement of refined taste and is sure to leave a remarkable impression wherever you go.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,650.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Niche-Emarati-Al-Dana.png?v=1779821158,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
