decant-partial-of-lattafa-pride-lahdath-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Pride Lahdath EDP,"<p>Lattafa Pride Lahdath Eau De Parfum for Women is a captivating and long-lasting fragrance that is sure to leave a lasting impression. This 80ml EDP is the epitome of luxury and sophistication, designed for the modern woman who exudes confidence and elegance.</p>

<p>The top notes of Rose and Lemon immediately grab your attention with their fresh and invigorating aroma. As the scent evolves, you'll be enveloped by the heart of the fragrance, where the delicate and enchanting notes of Rose blend seamlessly with the sweet and indulgent essence of Caramel. This harmonious combination creates a sense of warmth and sensuality, making it perfect for special occasions or everyday wear.</p>

<p>As the perfume dries down, the base notes of Vanilla, Cedarwood, and Musk come into play, adding depth and longevity to the scent. The rich and creamy Vanilla infuses the fragrance with a sweet and comforting aura, while the woody notes of Cedarwood provide a touch of sophistication. Musk, with its soft and alluring nature, lingers on the skin, leaving a seductive and unforgettable trail.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Iris, Lemon, Sage<br>
Heart Notes: Ylang-Ylang, Mint, Violet Leaves<br>
Base Notes: Sandalwood, Cedarwood, Tobacco, Oak Moss, Amber, Musk, Patchouli</p>

<p>Lattafa Pride Lahdath is often hailed as a remarkable Inspired of the renowned Roses Vanille by Mancera, offering a budget-friendly alternative without compromising on quality and performance. This fragrance not only showcases your unique style but also ensures that you remain memorable wherever you go. Whether you're heading to a formal event or simply want to feel extraordinary every day, Lattafa Pride Lahdath Eau De Parfum is your perfect olfactory companion. It's a testament to your individuality and an embodiment of timeless allure.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,575.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-pride-lahdath.png?v=1779821160,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
