decant-partial-of-lattafa-pride-thouq-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Pride Thouq EDP,"<p>Lattafa Pride Thouq Eau De Parfum is a captivating fragrance designed for the modern woman who seeks a scent that not only lingers but also leaves an unforgettable impression. With its impressive longevity, this perfume is a true olfactory gem. In every spritz, you embark on a sensory journey that lasts for hours, making it perfect for all-day wear and special occasions.</p>

<p>At the top, the fragrance unfolds with the sparkling freshness of Bergamot and the sweet succulence of Litchi. These notes create an invigorating and inviting introduction that sets the stage for what's to come.</p>

<p>The heart of Pride Thouq is a harmonious blend of delicate Rose and mystical Incense. The Rose adds a soft, floral elegance to the scent, while the Incense provides depth and a touch of the exotic. This combination is both alluring and enchanting, making it a perfect choice for women who appreciate complexity in their fragrances.</p>

<p>The base notes of Amber and Vetiver anchor the composition with warmth and sensuality. Amber imparts a subtle sweetness, while Vetiver adds a woody, earthy depth that lingers on the skin.</p>

<p>Top notes: bergamot, lychee.</p>

<p>Middle notes: rose, incense.</p>

<p>Base notes: amber, vetiver.</p>

<p>What makes this fragrance even more remarkable is its resemblance to the renowned Delina Exclusif by Parfums de Marly. Lattafa Pride Thouq Eau De Parfum offers an affordable alternative to this high-end favorite, making luxury accessible to all. With its luxurious scent and long-lasting nature, Pride Thouq is a fragrance that empowers women with confidence and sophistication, leaving a trail of elegance wherever they go. This perfume is a testament to the fact that luxury can be attainable without compromise.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,500.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-pride-thouq.png?v=1779821161,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
