decant-partial-of-lattafa-vurv-assoluto-intense-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Vurv Assoluto Intense EDP,"<p>Vurv Assoluto Intense By Lattafa is an olfactory masterpiece designed for the modern woman who exudes confidence and sensuality. This 100ML Eau de Parfum is a fragrant symphony that weaves an enchanting and long-lasting aura around you, making it a must-have addition to your collection.</p>

<p>At its heart, Vurv Assoluto Intense is a harmonious blend of delicate and daring notes. The initial burst of crisp apple awakens your senses with its fruity vivacity, offering a fresh and inviting start. This is complemented by the alluring sweetness of orange blossom, which adds a touch of floral elegance to the composition. Orchid, the heart's jewel, lends an exotic and exotic quality to the fragrance, creating a captivating, multi-faceted floral bouquet that lingers in the air.</p>

<p>As the perfume unfolds, it descends into a warm and alluring base. Labdanum, with its resinous and ambery character, adds depth and richness to the scent, evoking a sense of mystery and sophistication. Caramel, the final note, infuses Vurv Assoluto Intense with a delectable sweetness that's both comforting and enticing, leaving a memorable, delectable trail in your wake.</p>

<p>This fragrance is the epitome of elegance and passion, perfect for special occasions or everyday wear when you want to make a lasting impression. Lattafa Vurv Assoluto Intense 100ML EDP is a statement of your individuality, a symbol of your allure, and a testament to your style. It's a captivating scent that will accompany you throughout the day, ensuring you leave an unforgettable mark wherever you go.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,330.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Vurv-Assoluto-Intense-Perfume.png?v=1779821162,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
