decant-partial-of-lattafa-hayaatim-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Hayaatim EDP,"<p>Lattafa Hayaatim 100ML Eau de Parfum for Men is a captivating olfactory journey that beautifully encapsulates freshness and fruitiness, making it the perfect fragrance for those who crave a long-lasting and invigorating scent. This fragrance opens with a burst of zesty energy, blending the crisp notes of pineapple and bergamot with the sweet, juicy aroma of apple. These top notes provide an immediate sense of freshness that lingers throughout the day.</p>

<p>As Lattafa Hayaatim evolves, the heart of the fragrance emerges, revealing an enchanting blend of patchouli, jasmine, and rose. These middle notes add a touch of floral elegance and sophistication, balancing the initial fruitiness with a subtle, yet distinctive, floral bouquet.</p>

<p>The fragrance reaches its full crescendo as it dries down to reveal a harmonious base composed of musk, vanilla, oakmoss, sandalwood, cedarwood, and ambergris. This complex base imparts depth and character, enhancing the overall longevity of the scent while creating a warm and inviting aura that's perfect for daytime wear.</p>

<p>Lattafa Hayaatim is a versatile and safe choice suitable for individuals of all age groups. Its fresh and fruity profile ensures that it is never overwhelming, making it ideal for casual, professional, or everyday wear. With its exceptional longevity and balanced composition, this Eau de Parfum is a true standout in the realm of fragrances, offering a refreshing and enduring experience that will leave a lasting impression.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,390.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-hayaatim.png?v=1779821163,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
