decant-partial-of-lattafa-pride-nebras-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Pride Nebras EDP,"<p>Lattafa Pride Nebras Eau De Parfum is a captivating olfactory masterpiece designed for both men and women, transcending traditional gender boundaries. This unisex fragrance offers an enduring sensory journey, with remarkable longevity that will keep you enveloped in its enchanting aura throughout the day or night.</p>

