decant-partial-of-lattafa-suqraat-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Suqraat EDP,"<p>Lattafa Suqraat is an exceptional fragrance that epitomizes timeless elegance and sophistication, housed in a 100ml Eau de Parfum bottle designed to charm the senses. Crafted for men who appreciate the finer things in life, Suqraat stands out as a remarkable olfactory masterpiece known for its extraordinary longevity.</p>

<p>At the top, the fragrance bursts to life with invigorating notes of Bergamot and Ginger. This initial burst is a zesty and spicy blend that awakens the senses and sets the stage for an olfactory journey that is truly remarkable.</p>

<p>As Suqraat unfolds, the heart notes reveal themselves, and it's a delicate dance of Violet Leaf and Lavender. The herbal, slightly floral nuances of these heart notes infuse the scent with a calming and refined quality, striking a harmonious balance with the vivacity of the top notes.</p>

<p>The fragrance's true character shines in the base notes, where Musk, Sandalwood, and Amber take center stage. The deep, sensual warmth of Musk combines seamlessly with the creamy, woody nuances of Sandalwood, creating a foundation that's simultaneously comforting and enticing. The Amber note adds a subtle touch of resinous sweetness, enriching the overall composition.</p>

<p>Suqraat is not just a fragrance; it's an olfactory experience that lingers on the skin for an extended period. Its long-lasting nature ensures that you remain enveloped in its luxurious aroma throughout the day or evening.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Bergamot and Ginger<br>
