decant-partial-of-lattafa-blend-of-lattafa-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Blend Of Lattafa EDP,"<p>Lattafa's ""Blend of Lattafa"" is a captivating olfactory masterpiece that encapsulates luxury, sophistication, and durability within a 100ml Eau de Parfum for men. This fragrance is renowned for its remarkable longevity, making it the perfect choice for those who desire an enduring, alluring scent that lingers throughout the day.</p>

