decant-partial-of-lattafa-badee-al-oud-honor-glory-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Badee Al Oud Honor & Glory EDP,"Lattafa Bade’e Al Oud Honor &amp; Glory Eau de Parfum is an exquisite fragrance that transcends gender boundaries, a captivating olfactory masterpiece designed to grace both men and women. This fragrance, presented in a generous 100ml bottle, offers an unforgettable, long-lasting experience that lingers throughout the day and night.

