decant-partial-of-lattafa-bayaan-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Bayaan EDP,"<p>Lattafa Bayaan 100ml Eau de Parfum for men is an olfactory masterpiece that encapsulates a harmonious blend of notes, designed for the modern gentleman who seeks to make a lasting impression. This fragrance is a captivating journey through layers of scents that combine to create a truly unforgettable experience.</p>

