decant-partial-of-lattafa-safwaan-lautre-musk-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Safwaan Lautre Musk EDP,"<p>Lattafa Safwaan Lautre Musk 100ml EDP: A Fragrance for Men and Women</p>

<p>Lattafa Safwaan Lautre Musk is a captivating unisex fragrance that comes in a 100ml Eau de Parfum bottle. This perfume offers a symphony of scents that intertwine seamlessly, creating a unique olfactory experience that lingers throughout the day and into the night.</p>

<p>Long-Lasting Elegance:</p>

<p>One of the most remarkable features of Lattafa Safwaan Lautre Musk is its exceptional longevity. This fragrance is designed to endure, making it an ideal choice for those who seek a scent that lasts from dawn to dusk. It gracefully transitions from day to night, ensuring you smell alluring no matter the occasion.</p>

<p>Sensational Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: The fragrance opens with a fresh and powdery blend of White Musk and Iris. The White Musk provides a clean and airy beginning, while Iris adds a touch of sophistication and elegance. This combination is the perfect introduction to the fragrance.</p>

<p>Heart Notes: Moving to the heart of the scent, you'll discover the delightful harmony of Vanilla and Coconut. These sweet, creamy notes add a warm and inviting dimension to the fragrance, evoking feelings of comfort and sensuality.</p>

<p>Base Notes: The fragrance settles into a captivating base of Heliotrope and Amber. Heliotrope brings a powdery, almond-like scent, while Amber contributes depth and complexity. This foundation ensures that Lattafa Safwaan Lautre Musk leaves a lasting impression.</p>

<p>A Unisex Masterpiece:</p>

<p>Lattafa Safwaan Lautre Musk is a fragrance that transcends gender boundaries. Its versatility allows both men and women to revel in its enchanting aroma, making it an excellent choice for couples who appreciate shared scents. This fragrance exemplifies the idea that beauty knows no gender, and its allure will undoubtedly leave an indelible mark on all who encounter it.</p>

<p>In summary, Lattafa Safwaan Lautre Musk 100ml EDP is a long-lasting fragrance that weaves together a symphony of White Musk, Iris, Vanilla, Coconut, Heliotrope, and Amber. Its unisex appeal ensures it's a versatile choice for all, while its enduring elegance makes it a scent to remember. Discover a fragrance that lingers, defines, and enchants with every spray.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,375.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Safwaan-Lautre-Musk-100ml-EDP.png?v=1779821173,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
