decant-partial-of-lattafa-mohra-silky-rose-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Mohra Silky Rose EDP,"<p>Lattafa Mohra Silky Rose Perfume is a captivating and long-lasting olfactory masterpiece, designed for women who appreciate the allure of luxury but don't want to break the bank. This 100ml Eau de Parfum is a symphony of scents that will envelop you in an aura of sophistication and charm.</p>

<p>At the top, you'll be greeted by a delightful burst of Rose, Pink Pepper, and Litchi. This combination is a mesmerizing introduction, a floral and slightly spicy overture that immediately sets the stage for the opulent experience that follows. As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes of Rose, Musk, and Lily-of-the-Valley take center stage. The lush and velvety Rose remains dominant, while the Musk and Lily-of-the-Valley add depth and a touch of sweet innocence to the composition. Finally, in the base, the fragrance lingers with a captivating blend of Musk, Vanilla, and Patchouli. This rich and sensuous foundation ensures a memorable and long-lasting dry-down that will leave an impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>Mohra Silky Rose is reminiscent of the lavish scents found in two iconic and expensive fragrances, The Favourite by Penhaligon's and Delina by Parfums de Marly. With its rich and harmonious floral notes, it captures the essence of these high-end perfumes while being an affordable alternative that doesn't compromise on quality.</p>

<p>Top notes are Rose, Pink Pepper and Litchi</p>

<p>Middle notes are Rose, Musk and Lily-of-the-Valley</p>

<p>Base notes are Musk, Vanilla and Patchouli.</p>

<p>Indulge in the allure of luxury without the exorbitant price tag. Lattafa Mohra Silky Rose Perfume is a testament to the fact that opulence can be accessible, and beauty can be everlasting.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,385.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Mohra-Silky-Rose-Perfume-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779821174,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
decant-partial-of-lattafa-mohra-silky-rose-edp,,,,,,,,,90ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1664.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Decant_Image.png?v=1781928894,2,"",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,
decant-partial-of-lattafa-mohra-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Mohra EDP,"<p>Lattafa Mohra 100ml Eau de Parfum for men is an olfactory masterpiece that promises a long-lasting and captivating fragrance experience. This budget-friendly gem stands as a remarkable alternative to the distinguished Halfeti Leather by Penhaligon's, known for its leather-infused allure. Mohra, an Eau de Parfum, belongs to the Leather fragrance family, making it an ideal choice for men who appreciate the rich and robust scent of leather.</p>

<p>At the top of the fragrance, Mohra opens with an exquisite blend of saffron, blood orange, lavender, and bergamot. The saffron adds a touch of luxury, while the zesty blood orange and bergamot create a vibrant and invigorating introduction. Lavender contributes a soothing and aromatic quality, setting the stage for the heart of the fragrance.</p>

<p>In the middle notes, Mohra takes an exciting turn with the inclusion of black pepper, rose, and cashmeran. The black pepper adds a spicy kick, while the rose provides a touch of elegance and floral charm. Cashmeran brings warmth and depth, balancing the composition beautifully.</p>

<p>The base notes are where the fragrance truly shines, with patchouli, sandalwood, cedar, labdanum, and musk. These elements work together to create a rich, woody foundation with smoky and resinous undertones. The interplay of these base notes ensures a lasting and memorable trail that lingers on your skin.</p>

<p>Top notes are Saffron, Blood Orange, Lavender and Bergamot;</p>

<p>Middle notes are Black Pepper, Rose and Cashmeran;</p>

<p>Base notes are Patchouli, Sandalwood, Cedar, Labdanum and Musk.</p>

<p>Mohra's exceptional longevity makes it a reliable choice for all-day wear, and its sophisticated blend of notes exudes a sense of luxury that belies its budget-friendly price point. This fragrance is a testament to the artistry of perfumery and offers a cost-effective option for those seeking a fragrance reminiscent of Halfeti Leather. With Mohra, Lattafa presents a compelling olfactory narrative that is bound to leave a lasting impression.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,385.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Mohra100ml-EDP.png?v=1779821175,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
decant-partial-of-lattafa-mohra-edp,,,,,,,,,50ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,999.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Decant_Image.png?v=1781928894,2,"",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,
decant-partial-of-lattafa-khashabi-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Khashabi EDP,"<p>Lattafa Khashabi, a 100ml Eau de Parfum tailored for the modern man who seeks both elegance and longevity in his fragrance. This olfactory masterpiece is designed to leave an indelible impression, with an exceptional staying power that will carry you through the day and into the night. Lattafa Khashabi is the embodiment of refined masculinity.</p>

<p>At the top, zesty and invigorating notes of Lemon and Bergamot open the olfactory journey, creating an initial burst of freshness that sets the stage for what's to come. As the fragrance develops, the heart notes come into play. Jasmine, White Flowers, and Rose blend harmoniously, offering a delightful bouquet that is both floral and sophisticated. This aromatic middle phase adds a touch of romantic allure to the composition.</p>

<p>As the fragrance settles into its final act, the base notes take center stage. Woodsy Notes and Musk create a warm, embracing foundation that is undeniably masculine. The woody accords provide depth and stability, while Musk adds a sensual and enduring quality that lingers on the skin, making it perfect for special occasions or everyday wear.</p>

<p>Top notes are Lemon and Bergamot</p>

<p>Middle notes are Jasmine, White Flowers and Rose</p>

<p>Base notes are Woodsy Notes and Musk.</p>

<p>Lattafa Khashabi is a fragrance that makes a statement. Its long-lasting nature ensures that you'll leave a memorable trail wherever you go. This scent is the embodiment of sophistication, making it an ideal choice for the modern man who appreciates quality and endurance in his fragrances. Elevate your presence with Lattafa Khashabi, where freshness, floral elegance, and woody sensuality unite to create an unforgettable fragrance experience.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,380.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Khashabi-100ml-EDP.png?v=1779821177,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
