decant-partial-of-lattafa-aura-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Aura EDP,"<p>Lattafa Aura, a 60ml Eau de Parfum, is a fragrance that transcends gender boundaries. With remarkable longevity, it offers a unique olfactory experience for both women and men. This enchanting scent opens with a top note of saffron, which immediately sets the tone for a rich and luxurious olfactory journey.</p>

<p>As the fragrance unfolds, you'll discover a harmonious blend of balsam fir and jasmine in the heart notes. The balsam fir adds a touch of evergreen forest freshness, while the jasmine infuses an alluring floral sweetness, creating a well-balanced composition.</p>

<p>The base notes of Lattafa Aura are a symphony of sensuality, featuring ambergris, cashmeran, musk, cedarwood, and moss. This combination of ingredients creates a warm and inviting aura that lingers on the skin for hours, making it an excellent choice for those who appreciate long-lasting scents.</p>

<p>Lattafa Aura is celebrated for its similarity to the highly acclaimed Baccarat Rouge 540 by Maison Francis Kurkdjian, often referred to as a masterpiece in the fragrance world. This budget-friendly alternative captures the essence of Baccarat Rouge 540, with its amber floral profile, making it accessible to those who appreciate opulent scents without breaking the bank.</p>

<p>Top notes are Saffron and Jasmine</p>

<p>Middle notes are Amberwood and Ambergris</p>

<p>Base notes are Fir Resin and Cedar.</p>

<p>Lattafa Aura is more than just a fragrance; it's a journey of sensory delight that bridges the gap between genders, offering a captivating and long-lasting olfactory experience reminiscent of the finest fragrances in the world. Indulge in the affordable luxury of Lattafa Aura and let your presence leave an unforgettable trace in its wake.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,412.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Aura-60ml-EDP.png?v=1779821177,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
