decant-partial-of-lattafa-mayar-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Mayar EDP,"<p>Lattafa Mayar Perfume is a captivating olfactory masterpiece in a 100ml Eau de Parfum that embodies sophistication, femininity, and enduring allure. Crafted for women who appreciate a fragrance that stands the test of time, Mayar is an exceptional choice.</p>

<p>Mayar opens with a delightful burst of freshness, where the top notes of Raspberry, Litchi, and Violet Leaf come together in a symphony of fruity and floral aromas. This initial impression is an enchanting prelude to the perfume's enduring beauty.</p>

<p>As Mayar evolves, it reveals a heart of elegant charm. The middle notes of Peony, White Rose, and Jasmine create a delicate, floral bouquet that is both tender and empowering. This floral core adds depth and complexity to the fragrance, making it perfect for any occasion.</p>

<p>What truly sets Mayar apart is its remarkable longevity. This Eau de Parfum lingers on your skin, ensuring that your signature scent lasts throughout the day and well into the night. The base notes of Vanilla and Musk infuse the perfume with a creamy, sensual warmth, leaving a lasting and memorable impression.</p>

<p>Top notes are Raspberry, Litchi and Violet Leaf</p>

<p>Middle notes are Peony, White Rose and Jasmine</p>

<p>Base notes are Vanilla and Musk.</p>

<p>Lattafa Mayar Perfume is more than just a fragrance; it's an olfactory experience that reflects the strength, elegance, and charisma of the modern woman. Whether you're heading to the office or stepping out for a special evening, Mayar is your faithful companion, ensuring that you leave an indelible mark wherever you go. Embrace the enduring charm of Mayar and let your presence linger in the hearts and minds of those you encounter.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,550.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Mayar-Perfume-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779821178,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
