decant-partial-of-lattafa-azeezah-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Azeezah EDP,"<p>Lattafa Azeezah 100ML Eau de Parfum for women is a captivating and enduring fragrance that leaves a lasting impression. This perfume boasts an impressive longevity, ensuring you stay wrapped in its delightful aroma throughout the day or night.</p>

<p>At the top, it opens with a symphony of scents, including the invigorating freshness of Bergamot and Lemon, the rich allure of Almond, and the comforting warmth of Coffee. These top notes create an initial burst of energy and intrigue.</p>

<p>The heart of Lattafa Azeezah reveals an exquisite bouquet of floral and aromatic notes. Tuberose and Jasmine Sambac bring a seductive and sweet allure, while the Orange Blossom, Orris, and Bulgarian Rose add a touch of elegance and sophistication. This combination of middle notes is a delicate and harmonious blend that enchants the senses.</p>

<p>As the perfume settles, the base notes emerge to create a deep and enduring foundation. Tonka Bean, Cacao, and Vanilla infuse a gourmand sweetness, while Praline adds a nutty richness. The fragrance's woody and musky facets are enhanced by Sandalwood, Musk, Amber, Cashmere Wood, Cinnamon, Patchouli, and Cedar, delivering depth and complexity.</p>

<p>Top notes are Almond, Coffee, Bergamot and Lemon</p>

<p>Middle notes are Tuberose, Jasmine Sambac, Orange Blossom, Orris and Bulgarian Rose</p>

<p>Base notes are Tonka Bean, Cacao, Vanilla, Praline, Sandalwood, Musk, Amber, Cashmere Wood, Cinnamon, Patchouli and Cedar.</p>

<p>Lattafa Azeezah is an excellent alternative to the renowned Good Girl by Carolina Herrera, offering a budget-friendly option that doesn't compromise on quality. It falls under the category of an Amber Floral fragrance, making it perfect for women who appreciate a blend of sweet and floral notes with a hint of sensuality. This fragrance will undoubtedly make a bold statement, leaving an unforgettable trail wherever you go.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,345.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Azeezah-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779821179,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
