decant-partial-of-lattafa-pride-shaheen-gold-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Pride Shaheen Gold EDP,"<p>Lattafa Pride Shaheen Gold Eau De Parfum, a fragrance designed for both women and men, is a captivating olfactory journey that leaves a lasting impression. This remarkable scent is not just a perfume; it's a testament to elegance and endurance.</p>

<p>Pride Shaheen Gold opens with an invigorating burst of fresh pineapple and zesty grapefruit, creating an enticing and revitalizing top note. These fruity elements dance together, setting the stage for an olfactory experience like no other.</p>

<p>As the fragrance evolves, the heart reveals a rich and harmonious blend of sweet fig and soothing lavender. This combination strikes a delicate balance between the sweet and the aromatic, making the scent alluring and comforting at the same time.</p>

<p>The base notes of vanilla, earthy patchouli, and warm, enveloping tonka bean provide a deep and long-lasting foundation. This symphony of base notes adds depth and sensuality to the fragrance, making it an ideal choice for those who seek a scent that lingers throughout the day and into the night.</p>

