<p>Lattafa Pride Shaheen Gold Eau De Parfum is more than just a fragrance; it's a statement of endurance and sophistication. This unisex perfume is perfect for those who appreciate a long-lasting scent that combines the freshness of citrus with the warmth of aromatic and sweet elements. Pride Shaheen Gold embodies the essence of timeless allure for both men and women.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,490.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Pride-Shaheen-Gold-Eau-De-Parfum-100ml.png?v=1779821180,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
