decant-partial-of-lattafa-najdia-tribute-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Najdia Tribute EDP,"<p>Lattafa Najdia Tribute, a masterpiece in the world of fragrances, is a 100ml Eau de Parfum designed for men who appreciate the finer things in life. This scent is an olfactory journey that combines both classic and contemporary elements, making it the perfect choice for those who seek a unique and long-lasting aromatic experience.</p>

<p>With an opening burst of invigorating notes, Najdia Tribute sets the stage with zesty Ginger, Mandarin Orange, and a crisp Apple, all elegantly underscored by the timeless freshness of Bergamot. This initial explosion of citrus and fruit creates an irresistible allure that captivates the senses.</p>

<p>As the fragrance evolves, it unveils its heart, a rich and complex blend that includes Violet Leaf, Guaiac Wood, Saffron, and Cedar. These middle notes add depth and character, providing a sense of sophistication and masculinity that is both modern and classic.</p>

<p>Najdia Tribute's base notes exude strength and sensuality, with Leather, Ambergris, Agarwood (Oud), and Sandalwood forming a magnetic and long-lasting foundation. The warmth of Ambergris and the exotic allure of Oud harmonize with the smooth, woody nuances of Sandalwood and the seductive leather accord. This combination lingers on the skin, leaving a lasting impression that is both unforgettable and intensely masculine.</p>

<p>Top notes are Ginger, Mandarin Orange, Apple and Bergamot</p>

<p>Middle notes are Violet Leaf, Guaiac Wood, Saffron and Cedar</p>

<p>Base notes are Leather, Ambergris, Agarwood (Oud) and Sandalwood.</p>

<p>In essence, Lattafa Najdia Tribute is a tribute to timeless masculinity, combining the allure of tradition with the magnetism of the contemporary man. Its exceptional longevity ensures that you will be enveloped in this exquisite fragrance throughout the day, making it a distinctive choice for any occasion.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,355.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Najdia-Tribute-100ml-EDP.png?v=1779821182,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
