decant-partial-of-lattafa-liam-silver-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Liam Silver EDP,"<p>Lattafa Liam Silver 100ml EDP for men is an olfactory masterpiece that offers a captivating and enduring scent experience. This fragrance is a testament to Lattafa's commitment to crafting high-quality scents at an affordable price, making it an excellent choice for those who appreciate both luxury and budget-conscious options.</p>

<p>Liam Silver is renowned for its exceptional longevity, ensuring that you remain enveloped in its intoxicating aura throughout the day and well into the night. This perfume embodies sophistication, making it the perfect choice for formal occasions, yet versatile enough for everyday wear.</p>

<p>At its opening, Liam Silver greets you with a tantalizing blend of cardamom, black tea, and fig. The top notes offer a spicy and slightly fruity introduction that instantly captures attention. As it evolves, the heart of the fragrance reveals an enchanting fusion of iris, vetiver, and labdanum. These middle notes provide a refined depth, infusing a sense of elegance into the scent. Finally, the fragrance settles into a warm and comforting base, where the woody richness of sandalwood, the sweetness of vanilla and tonka, and the earthy depth of patchouli come together to create an inviting and enduring dry-down.</p>

<p>Top notes are Fig, Cardamom and Black Tea</p>

<p>Middle notes are Labdanum, Iris and Vetiver</p>

<p>Base notes are Sandalwood, Vanilla, Patchouli and Tonka.</p>

<p>Liam Silver's ability to balance these notes beautifully, offering a harmonious and long-lasting fragrance, makes it an excellent alternative to Gris Charnel by BDK Parfums. This Amber Spicy fragrance is versatile, suitable for both men and women, and embodies the essence of luxury without breaking the bank. In essence, Lattafa Liam Silver is an olfactory gem, a budget-friendly revelation for those seeking a fragrant journey that transcends time and trends.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,430.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Liam-Silver-100ml-EDP.png?v=1779821182,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
