decant-partial-of-lattafa-opulent-musk-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Opulent Musk EDP,"<p>Lattafa Opulent Musk is an exquisite 100ML Eau de Parfum designed for both men and women. This fragrance is a testament to the art of perfumery, encapsulating an air of luxury and opulence that lingers throughout the day. With remarkable longevity, it's a scent that will accompany you on your journey from morning till night, making a lasting impression.</p>

<p>At the heart of this olfactory masterpiece are meticulously selected notes that create an enchanting symphony. The top notes unveil a harmonious blend of White Musk, Saffron, and Lemon. This initial burst is refreshing, bright, and slightly spicy, setting the stage for what's to come. The heart of the fragrance reveals delicate White Flowers and Jasmine, adding a soft, floral elegance that gracefully balances the composition.</p>

<p>As the scent settles, the base notes of White Musk, Cedar, Amber, Resin, and Fir Resin take center stage. Here, the fragrance deepens, offering a rich, warm, and slightly resinous aroma that lingers on the skin, leaving a captivating and sensual trail.</p>

<p>Top notes are White Musk, Saffron and Lemon</p>

<p>Middle notes are White Flowers and Jasmine</p>

<p>Base notes are White Musk, Cedar, Amber, Resin and Fir Resin.</p>

<p>Lattafa Opulent Musk is reminiscent of the highly-praised Baccarat Rouge 540 by Maison Francis Kurkdjian and Instant Crush by Mancera, but it possesses a unique character that distinguishes it in the world of fragrances. It embodies sophistication, sensuality, and a touch of mystery. This fragrance is a statement of individuality and refined taste, making it the perfect choice for those who seek a scent that is both memorable and versatile, suiting any occasion and leaving a remarkable impression wherever you go.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,483.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Opulent-Musk-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779821183,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
