decant-partial-of-lattafa-yara-moi-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Yara Moi EDP,"<p>Lattafa Yara Moi Perfume is a luxurious olfactory masterpiece that captivates the senses with its enchanting blend of notes, making it the perfect olfactory accessory for the modern, confident woman. This 100ML Eau de Parfum boasts extraordinary longevity, ensuring that your signature scent lasts throughout the day and into the night.</p>

<p>At the heart of Yara Moi Perfume lies a harmonious composition that begins with a top note of Peach, exuding a luscious, juicy sweetness that instantly entices. Complementing this fruity allure is the delicate aroma of Jasmine, which lends a floral sophistication to the fragrance's initial impression.</p>

<p>As the perfume unfolds, the middle notes emerge to further enrich the olfactory journey. Caramel adds a delectable gourmand aspect to the scent, providing a mouthwatering sweetness that is both indulgent and alluring. Amber then weaves a warm, resinous depth into the composition, creating a rich and inviting heart.</p>

<p>The base notes of Patchouli and Sandalwood form a solid foundation for this enchanting fragrance. Patchouli contributes an earthy, slightly spicy dimension, while Sandalwood imparts a creamy, woody sensuality, leaving a lingering, memorable trail that embodies elegance and allure.</p>

<p>Top notes are Peach and Jasmine</p>

<p>Middle notes are Caramel and Amber</p>

<p>Base notes are Patchouli and Sandalwood.</p>

<p>Lattafa Yara Moi Perfume is a true statement fragrance for women who appreciate longevity and depth in their scents. Its evocative blend of Peach, Jasmine, Caramel, Amber, Patchouli, and Sandalwood harmoniously combines to create a fragrance that is as enduring as it is enchanting, making it the ideal choice for any occasion, from day to night.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,425.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Yara-Moi-Perfume-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779821184,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
