decant-partial-of-lattafa-yara-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Yara EDP,"<p>Lattafa's Yara Perfume, a captivating 100ml Eau de Parfum for women, is a fragrance that seamlessly weaves enchanting notes into an olfactory masterpiece. This scent is nothing short of captivating, leaving an enduring and delightful impression that lingers throughout the day and night.</p>

<p>The top notes of Tangerine, Heliotrope, and Orchid create an inviting and refreshing initial impression. These bright and citrusy notes are gracefully balanced by the subtle floral nuances, setting the stage for what's to come.</p>

<p>As the fragrance unfolds, the heart notes take center stage with a blend of Tropical Notes and Gourmand accords. This combination introduces an irresistible sweetness, reminiscent of exotic fruits and delectable treats. The heart notes evoke a sense of warmth and indulgence, making Yara a perfect companion for special occasions or everyday wear.</p>

<p>Finally, the fragrance settles into its rich and enduring base notes of Vanilla, Sandalwood, and Musk. This blend imparts depth and sensuality, leaving a lasting trail of elegance wherever you go. The oriental character of Yara's base notes adds a touch of mystery and sophistication to the overall composition.</p>

<p>TOP: Tangerine, Heliotrope, Orchid</p>

<p>HEART: Tropical Notes, Gourmand</p>

<p>BASE: Vanilla, Sandalwood, Musk</p>

<p>Yara is not just a perfume; it's an experience. Its long-lasting Eau de Parfum formula ensures that you remain enveloped in its alluring aura, from morning to night. This fragrance is the embodiment of timeless charm, suitable for women who seek a perfume that defines their individuality and leaves a lasting impression. Lattafa's Yara Perfume is a delightful journey through a world of scents, a testament to the brand's commitment to quality and elegance.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,450.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Yara-Perfume-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779821185,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
