decant-partial-of-lattafa-liam-blue-shine-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Liam Blue Shine EDP,"<p>Lattafa Liam Blue Shine 100ml Eau de Parfum for men is a fragrance that leaves an indelible impression, offering an exceptionally enduring scent experience. With its impressive longevity, this perfume is designed for the modern man who seeks a signature scent that will last throughout the day and into the night.</p>

<p>The top notes of Bergamot, Rosemary, and Pepper introduce a fresh and invigorating opening. The crispness of Bergamot pairs with the herbal depth of Rosemary, while the Pepper adds a touch of spiciness, making for an attention-grabbing initial impression.</p>

<p>In the heart of Liam Blue Shine, the fragrance transitions into a maritime symphony with Sea Notes and Violet. This combination creates a captivating and aquatic aura that's both refined and alluring, making it perfect for a wide range of occasions.</p>

<p>As the fragrance settles into the base notes, you'll discover the warmth of Amber, the earthiness of Patchouli, and the sensuality of Musk. These elements provide depth and complexity to the fragrance, leaving a remarkable, memorable trail that lingers on your skin and in the minds of those around you.</p>

<p>Top Notes : Bergamot, Pepper, Rosemary<br>
Heart Notes : Marine, Violet<br>
Base Notes : Patchouli, Amber, Musk</p>

<p>Liam Blue Shine is an exceptional alternative for those who appreciate Acqua di Giò Profondo by Giorgio Armani but are seeking a more budget-friendly option. This Aromatic Fougere fragrance embodies sophistication and versatility, making it an excellent choice for daily wear and special occasions. With its remarkable staying power, Liam Blue Shine ensures that you'll leave a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,410.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Liam-Blue-Shine-100ml-EDP.png?v=1779821186,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
