decant-partial-of-lattafa-yara-tous-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Yara Tous EDP,"<p>Lattafa Yara Tous Perfume is a captivating olfactory experience that redefines luxury and sensuality. This exquisite 100ml Eau de Parfum for women boasts remarkable longevity, ensuring you stay enveloped in its enchanting aura all day long.</p>

<p>The fragrance opens with a burst of tropical allure, where the top notes of Coconut, Mango, and Passionfruit transport you to a paradisiacal world. These fruity nuances create an inviting and fresh introduction, setting the stage for the journey that awaits.</p>

<p>As the scent evolves, the heart notes emerge, weaving a delicate floral tapestry of Heliotrope, Jasmine, and Orange Blossom. This bouquet adds a layer of sophistication, combining the sweetness of jasmine with the powdery, almond-like scent of heliotrope, and the intoxicating bloom of orange blossom.</p>

<p>The perfume's allure deepens with its base notes, a rich and warm blend of Cashmeran, Vanilla, and Musk. These base notes provide a comforting, creamy, and sensual foundation that lingers on the skin, leaving an unforgettable trail. Cashmeran adds a woody and musky depth, while vanilla adds a sweet, gourmand touch, and musk infuses an enticing sensuality.</p>

<p>Lattafa Yara Tous Perfume is not just long-lasting; it's also uniquely captivating. This fragrance is a symphony of exotic fruits, elegant florals, and seductive base notes, making it a perfect choice for women and girls who appreciate a perfume that stands out and endures, leaving an indelible impression wherever they go. Indulge in this olfactory masterpiece, and let it accompany you on a journey of alluring sophistication and lasting allure.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,410.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Yara-Tous-Perfume-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779821188,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
