decant-partial-of-lattafa-fakhar-extrait-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Fakhar Extrait EDP,"<p>Lattafa Fakhar Extrait Eau De Parfum, available in a generous 100ml bottle, is an olfactory masterpiece designed to captivate both men and women. This fragrance is more than just a scent; it's an enduring experience. The exceptional longevity of this perfume ensures you'll make a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>At the heart of Lattafa Fakhar Extrait Eau De Parfum lies a captivating blend of notes. The top notes are a zesty and invigorating mix of Grapefruit, Pink Pepper, and Cardamom, creating an exhilarating opening that immediately grabs your attention. As it settles, the middle notes reveal themselves, with Solar Notes, Artemisia, and Tuberose contributing to a unique and slightly mysterious character. Finally, the base notes of Labdanum, Cashmeran, Amber, and Leather lend an exquisite depth and sensuality to this fragrance, making it perfect for those special occasions.</p>

<p>Lattafa Fakhar Extrait Eau De Parfum is more than just an enchanting aroma; it's a pocket-friendly alternative to the luxurious 1 Million Parfum by Paco Rabanne. This Leather fragrance for men, with its striking resemblance to the renowned Paco Rabanne scent, offers a budget-friendly option without compromising on quality or allure.</p>

