<p>Middle notes are Solar Notes, Artemisia and Tuberose</p>

<p>Base notes are Labdanum, Cashmeran, Amber and Leather.</p>

<p>Whether you're a man or a woman, Lattafa Fakhar Extrait Eau De Parfum will adorn you with an air of sophistication, leaving a trail of intrigue wherever you go. It's a fragrance that refuses to be forgotten, a testament to your unique style and elegance.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,415.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Fakhar-Extrait-Eau-De-Parfum-100ml.png?v=1779821190,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
