decant-partial-of-lattafa-rave-now-intense-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Rave Now Intense EDP,"<p>Introducing Lattafa Rave Now Intense EDP 100ml, a captivating fragrance designed for the modern man who exudes confidence and charisma. This exquisite perfume is meticulously crafted to provide an unforgettable olfactory experience that lingers on the skin for an exceptionally long time, leaving a trail of enchantment wherever you go.</p>

<p>Inspired by the timeless classic La Nuit de L'Homme Eau Électrique by Yves Saint Laurent, Lattafa Rave Now Intense EDP pays homage to the original masterpiece while infusing its unique essence. This fragrance offers a luxurious and sensuous blend of notes that harmoniously fuse together, creating a scent that is both bold and refined.</p>

<p>At the top, the invigorating burst of Watermelon, Tangerine, and Cucumber sets the stage for an energizing and refreshing opening. The juicy sweetness of Watermelon is balanced by the zesty brightness of Tangerine, while the cool crispness of Cucumber adds a touch of sophistication.</p>

<p>As the scent develops, the heart reveals a compelling accord of Sage and Basil. The aromatic and herbal qualities of these middle notes lend an air of confidence and allure to the fragrance. Sage brings a sense of wisdom and depth, while Basil imparts a green, slightly spicy character that complements the overall composition.</p>

<p>Finally, the base notes of Sandalwood, Cedar, and Leather leave a lasting impression that is both warm and comforting. The creamy and woody facets of Sandalwood blend seamlessly with the aromatic nuances of Cedar, creating a luxurious foundation. The addition of Leather adds an element of allure and sensuality, providing the perfect finishing touch to this modern classic.</p>

<p>Lattafa Rave Now Intense EDP is an exceptional fragrance that embodies the spirit of sophistication and refinement. Its long-lasting nature ensures that you can confidently wear it throughout the day and into the night, making it an ideal companion for every occasion. Experience the allure of this remarkable scent, and indulge in the timeless elegance it brings to your style.</p>

<p>Top notes are Watermelon, Tangerine and Cucumber</p>

<p>Middle notes are Sage and Basil</p>

<p>Base notes are Sandalwood, Cedar and Leather.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,350.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Rave-Now-Intense-EDP-100Ml.png?v=1779821190,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
