decant-partial-of-lattafa-pride-shaheen-silver-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Pride Shaheen Silver EDP,"<p>Shaheen silver Lattafa perfume is a great Long lasting fragrance for men.</p>

<p>Lattafa Pride Shaheen Silver Perfume is an exceptional fragrance that captures the essence of the renowned and extravagantly priced Creed Aventus while offering an affordable alternative. This budget-friendly gem allows fragrance enthusiasts to indulge in the luxurious and captivating aroma without breaking the bank.</p>

<p>Opening with an invigorating burst of Cassis and Bergamot, the top notes of Lattafa Pride Shaheen Silver Perfume immediately captivate the senses. The vibrant and juicy Cassis intertwines with the uplifting citrusy notes of Bergamot, creating a refreshing and energetic introduction.</p>

<p>As the fragrance develops, the heart notes of Rose and Patchouli come to the forefront, adding depth and sophistication. The elegant and timeless essence of Rose blossoms, exudes a romantic and floral character. Patchouli, known for its earthy and woody qualities, complements the Rose, providing a warm and aromatic touch that adds complexity to the composition.</p>

<p>Finally, Lattafa Pride Shaheen Silver Perfume unveils its base notes, which consist of Musk, Oakmoss, and Amber. The sensual and musky allure of Musk intertwines with the deep and earthy aroma of Oakmoss, creating a robust foundation for the fragrance. Amber adds a touch of warmth and richness, enhancing the overall depth and longevity of the scent.</p>

<p>The combination of these notes in Lattafa Pride Shaheen Silver Perfume offers an enchanting experience reminiscent of the highly expensive Creed Aventus. It is a fragrance that exudes confidence, elegance, and sophistication, making it an ideal choice for any occasion.</p>

<p>With its affordability and exceptional quality, Lattafa Pride Shaheen Silver Perfume allows fragrance enthusiasts to enjoy a similar olfactory experience to Creed Aventus without compromising their budget. It's a fragrance that evokes luxury and prestige, making it a true gem for those seeking an affordable alternative to a renowned and expensive perfume.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Cassis, Bergamot</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Rose, Patchouli</p>

<p>Base Notes: Musk, Oakmoss, Amber</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,450.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Pride-Shaheen-Silver-Eau-De-Parfum-100ml.png?v=1779821192,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
