decant-partial-of-lattafa-rave-now-white-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Rave Now White EDP,"<p>Rave Now White perfume by Lattafa, is a captivating fragrance that embodies the essence of freshness and elegance. Launched in 2023, this perfume is a testament to Lattafa's commitment to creating exceptional fragrances that leave a lasting impression.</p>

<p>Rave Now White opens with a burst of invigorating top notes, combining the succulent sweetness of peach with the vibrant zest of mandarin. The addition of tuberose adds a touch of floral sophistication, creating a harmonious blend that instantly uplifts your senses.</p>

<p>As the fragrance unfolds, the heart notes of gardenia, iris, and jasmine take center stage. The exquisite blend of these floral notes adds depth and complexity to the composition, evoking a sense of refined beauty and femininity.</p>

<p>Finally, the base notes of sandalwood, vanilla, and vetiver leave a warm and sensual trail, ensuring a long-lasting and memorable experience. The creamy richness of sandalwood combines seamlessly with the sweet allure of vanilla, while the earthy tones of vetiver add a touch of sophistication and depth.</p>

<p>Rave Now White is a fragrance that captivates with its fresh and citrusy character, making it ideal for everyday wear and special occasions alike. Its exceptional longevity ensures that you can confidently enjoy its enchanting aroma throughout the day and into the night.</p>

<p>Indulge in the allure of Rave Now White, a fragrance that embodies elegance, freshness, and timeless beauty. With its carefully selected notes and long-lasting performance, it is sure to become a cherished addition to your fragrance collection.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,348.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Rave-Now-White-EDP-100Ml.png?v=1779821193,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
