decant-partial-of-lattafa-ejaazi-intensive-silver-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Ejaazi Intensive Silver EDP,"<p>Ejaazi Intensive Silver Perfume by Lattafa Brand is an exquisite fragrance designed specifically for men. With its aromatic fruity composition, this perfume offers a captivating scent that lingers throughout the day, leaving a lasting impression.</p>

<p>At the top of the fragrance, you will encounter the invigorating blend of Mandarin Orange and Grapefruit. These citrusy notes provide a refreshing and energetic opening, creating a sense of vibrancy and vitality.</p>

<p>As the fragrance develops, the heart notes of Cedar and Sea Notes come into play. The woody essence of Cedar adds depth and sophistication to the composition, while the Sea Notes introduce a hint of aquatic freshness. Together, these middle notes create a balanced fusion that is both alluring and captivating.</p>

<p>Finally, the base notes of Amber and Moss leave a lasting impression. Amber brings warmth and sensuality to the fragrance, enveloping the wearer in an aura of elegance and charm. The earthy tones of Moss add a touch of greenery, enhancing the overall depth and complexity of the scent.</p>

<p>The combination of these notes in Ejaazi Intensive Silver Perfume results in a fragrance that is both intriguing and long-lasting. Its aromatic fruity character is perfect for those who appreciate a harmonious blend of fresh and woody elements. Whether worn for special occasions or everyday use, this fragrance is sure to leave a lasting impression on those around you.</p>

<p>Lattafa Brand is renowned for its high-quality perfumes that offer a luxurious olfactory experience. Ejaazi Intensive Silver Perfume is no exception, showcasing the brand's commitment to excellence and attention to detail. With its long-lasting aroma and well-crafted notes, this fragrance is a testament to Lattafa's dedication to creating captivating scents for the discerning modern man.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,390.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Ejaazi-Intensive-Silver-Perfume-100-Ml-Edp.png?v=1779821194,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
