decant-partial-of-lattafa-hayaati-black-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Hayaati Black EDP,"<p>Indulge in the captivating allure of Hayaati Hayaati by Lattafa, a remarkable Woody Aromatic fragrance designed exclusively for men. Immerse yourself in the essence of luxury with this long-lasting scent that embraces sophistication and style.</p>

<p>Opening with a burst of freshness, the top notes of crisp Apple and zesty Bergamot awaken the senses, creating an invigorating and energetic aura. As the fragrance evolves, the heart reveals a warm and spicy blend of Cinnamon and Woodsy Notes, adding depth and richness to the composition. This alluring combination exudes a confident and charismatic presence.</p>

<p>Finally, the base notes of Musk and Vanilla emerge, leaving an irresistible trail that lingers in the air, making a lasting impression wherever you go. The smoothness of Musk intertwines with the creamy sweetness of Vanilla, adding a touch of sensuality and sophistication.</p>

<p>Hayaati Hayaati is a fragrance that embodies the essence of timeless elegance and leaves a lasting impression of luxury. Experience the allure of this exquisite scent and let it become an integral part of your distinguished persona.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,380.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Hayaati-Black-100-ML-EDP.png?v=1779821195,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
