decant-partial-of-lattafa-hayaati-al-maleky-blue-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Hayaati Al Maleky Blue EDP,"<p>Hayaati Hayaati Al Maleky Blue, is an exquisite fragrance for men by the renowned Lattafa brand. This perfume is a captivating fusion of fresh fruity and woody notes, leaving an enchanting trail that lasts throughout the day.</p>

<p>The fragrance opens with a lively combination of Nutmeg, Pink Pepper, and Ginger, providing a tantalizing burst of spice and warmth. The invigorating essence of Bergamot adds a refreshing touch, further enhancing the vibrant character of this scent.</p>

<p>At its heart, a harmonious blend of Incense, Cedar, and Labdanum emerges, exuding a sense of sophistication and elegance. These woody notes create a captivating aura that is both alluring and charismatic.</p>

<p>The base notes, a blend of Woody Notes, Amber, Musk, and Ambergris, lend a luxurious and long-lasting quality to the fragrance. The warmth of Amber and the sensuality of Musk intertwine seamlessly, leaving an indelible impression on the senses.</p>

<p>Hayaati Hayaati Al Maleky is a masterpiece that embodies the essence of modern masculinity, offering an unforgettable olfactory experience for the discerning gentleman.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,360.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Hayaati-Al-Maleky-Blue-100-ML-EDP.png?v=1779821196,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
