decant-partial-of-lattafa-hayaati-gold-elixir-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Hayaati Gold Elixir EDP,"<p>Introducing Hayaati Gold Elixir by Lattafa, a captivating fragrance that exudes opulence and allure. Crafted for both men and women, this exquisite Amber woody Spicy scent is a testament to timeless elegance. With its intoxicating blend of ingredients, this perfume leaves an everlasting impression, ensuring a truly luxurious experience.</p>

<p>At the top, the fragrance opens with the invigorating notes of Bergamot, Cassis, and Grapefruit, evoking a sense of freshness and vibrancy. As the scent develops, the heart reveals a harmonious composition of Peach, Leather, and Saffron, adding depth and sensuality. Finally, the base notes of Vanilla, Amber, Musk, and Vetiver create a warm and enveloping aura that lingers on the skin.</p>

<p>Hayaati Gold Elixir by Lattafa is a fragrance that seamlessly blends sophistication and intensity, making it an ideal choice for special occasions and intimate moments. Indulge in the allure of this fragrance, and let its long-lasting presence leave an indelible mark wherever you go. Experience the epitome of luxury with Hayaati Gold Elixir.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,370.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Hayaati-Gold-Elixir-100-ML-EDP.png?v=1779821197,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
