decant-partial-of-lattafa-pride-ansaam-silver-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Pride Ansaam Silver EDP,"<p>Ansaam Silver is another jewel from the Pride line, the perfume house of Lattafa, and will please both men and women with its special freshness.</p>

