<p>This Perfume is one of the most expensive and desireable perfume for men and women in the brand Lattafa . It has an intoxicating scent that can be quite potent. The Brand Lattafa are using Oud and Musk Fragrance as a base notes to create some amazing fragrances both homme and femme</p>

