Base Notes: Vanilla, Tonka Bean, Amberwood, Myrrh, Benzoin, Akigalawood<br>
(A luscious, woody, and resinous base that lingers with an air of sophistication and warmth.)</p>

<p>Lattafa Khamrah is a perfect blend of sweetness, spice, and woodiness, making it an ideal choice for cozy evenings and special occasions. Its long-lasting and well-balanced composition has earned it immense popularity within the fragrance community. If you’re searching for a scent that exudes elegance and charm, Lattafa Khamrah is your ultimate companion.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial, Vanilla",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,5,deny,manual,558.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Khamrah-Lattafa-100Ml-EDP-For-Men-and-Women.png?v=1779821233,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,vanilla,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
