decant-partial-of-lattafa-qimmah-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Qimmah EDP,"<p>Perfume Qimmah Eau de Parfum By Lattafa<br>
Perfume Qimmah Eau de Parfum by Lattafa is an invigorating, fresh, woodsy men's scent. Lattafa Qimmah is the fragrance that opens with energizing oud fragrance with oriental notes. The fragrance has best answer to the other Inspireds and the perfume is for men. It's the perfume you can fall in love with the first smell</p>


<p>The top notes are citrus notes, pepper and cedar.</p>

<p>Lavender, sage and rosemary follow on the middle note.</p>

<p>The final base is creamy and woody with vetiver, patchouli, musk and Oudh.</p>

<p>A wonderfully fresh and woody fragrance that is very suitable for any occasion.</p>


