decant-partial-of-lattafa-ramz-silver-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Ramz Silver EDP,"<p>Lattafa Ramz Silver Eau de Parfum 100ml – The Bold Signature of Modern Men ✨<br>
Lattafa Ramz Silver is a luxurious Eau de Parfum made in the UAE, designed for men who exude confidence, charm, and magnetic appeal. Known for its long-lasting performance, this fragrance captures the perfect balance of freshness and sensuality, making it an irresistible signature scent for any occasion. Inspired by the iconic Ultra Male by Jean Paul Gaultier, it delivers the same captivating aura at a much more accessible value.<br>
Fragrance Notes:<br>
Top Notes: Pear, Lavender, Bergamot, Mint(A refreshing burst of fruity sweetness blended with aromatic coolness, setting a vibrant and energetic tone.)<br>
Middle Notes: Cardamom, Sage(Aromatic spices and herbal sophistication add depth, creating a masculine and refined heart.)<br>
Base Notes: Vanilla, Amber, Musk, Patchouli(A warm and seductive foundation of sweetness and earthy richness ensures a powerful, lingering trail.)<br>
Perfect for evening wear, parties, or romantic occasions, Lattafa Ramz Silver wraps you in a sensual aura that turns heads wherever you go. It’s the scent of confidence, elegance, and timeless attraction—crafted for the man who knows how to leave a lasting impression.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, LATTAFA, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,370.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/LATTAFA-RAMZ-SILVER-PERFUME-FOR-MEN-100-ML-EDP.png?v=1779821298,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
