decant-partial-of-lattafa-najdia-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Najdia EDP,"<p>Lattafa Najdia is a remarkable perfume that combines the best elements of two renowned fragrances, Rasasi Hawas and Invictus by Paco Rabanne. This oriental fragrance is a true gem, opening with an invigorating blend of notes that instantly captivate the senses. With its long-lasting formula, Lattafa Najdia is perfect for daytime wear, making it an ideal choice for the summer season.and you can also wear it all year around.</p>

<p>At the top, you'll experience a refreshing burst of lemon, cinnamon, lemongrass, apple, and bergamot. These vibrant notes create a lively and uplifting aura that sets the stage for the fragrance to unfold. As it develops, the middle notes of watery notes, lavender, rosemary, and cardamom add depth and complexity, giving Lattafa Najdia a sophisticated touch.</p>

<p>The fragrance's base notes consist of amber, musk, cedar, sandalwood, and tobacco, creating a warm and sensual foundation. These rich and enticing notes linger on the skin, leaving a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>One of the most appealing aspects of Lattafa Najdia is its affordability. Despite its exceptional quality and longevity, it remains a budget-friendly option for men who appreciate high-quality fragrances. With Lattafa Najdia, you can enjoy a captivating scent that rivals more expensive options without breaking the bank. Its a must-have scent and you cant go wrong with this fragrance.</p>

<p>Top notes are Lemon, Cinnamon, Lemongrass, Apple and Bergamot</p>

<p>Middle notes are Watery Notes, Lavender, Rosemary and Cardamom</p>

<p>Base notes are Amber, Musk, Cedar, Sandalwood and Tobacco.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Daily Wear, Decant, LATTAFA, Office Perfumes, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,5,deny,manual,410.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/LATTAFA-NAJDIA-PERFUME-FOR-MEN-100-ML-EDP.png?v=1779821300,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,lattafa,,,,,,,,,,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
