decant-partial-of-fragrance-world-enigma-deux-edp,Decant/Partial Of Fragrance World Enigma Deux EDP,"Fragrance World Enigma Deux 100ml EDP: A Captivating Symphony for Men &amp; Women

Embark on an enchanting olfactory journey with Fragrance World Enigma Deux 100ml Eau De Parfum, a mesmerizing scent designed to transcend traditional boundaries of gender. Crafted with precision and passion, Enigma Deux embodies the essence of allure and sophistication, enveloping both men and women in its irresistible charm.

🔥 Sensory Delight: Enigma Deux opens with a tantalizing blend of Tonka Bean and Oak, creating a harmonious symphony that captivates the senses from the very first spritz. The top notes dance together in perfect harmony, setting the stage for the unfolding drama of fragrance that lies ahead.

💖 Unisex Elegance: Breaking free from the confines of traditional gender norms, Enigma Deux celebrates individuality and self-expression. Its versatile nature allows both men and women to revel in its captivating aura, making it a statement of timeless elegance and modern sophistication.

🎵 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:

Top Notes: The journey begins with the rich and comforting aroma of Tonka Bean, complemented by the woody nuances of Oak. This opening creates an inviting atmosphere, drawing you deeper into the fragrance experience.
Heart Notes: As the scent evolves, notes of Cinnamon and Hazelnut emerge, infusing the heart of Enigma Deux with warmth and spice. This captivating blend adds depth and complexity, enticing the senses with its irresistible allure.
Base Notes: The fragrance journey reaches its crescendo with the sensual embrace of a Cognac Accord. Rich and intoxicating, this base note leaves a lasting impression, wrapping you in a veil of sophistication and mystery.

