decant-partial-of-maison-alhambra-jean-lowe-azure-edp,Decant/Partial Of Maison Alhambra Jean Lowe Azure EDP,"<p>Maison Alhambra Jean Lowe Azure 100ml EDP – The Ultimate Citrus Fresh Scent 🌟</p>

<p>Experience a refreshing burst of vibrant citrus with Maison Alhambra Jean Lowe Azure, a high-quality and rich-smelling fragrance crafted in the UAE. Designed as a refined Inspired of Louis Vuitton Afternoon Swim, this 100ml Eau de Parfum captures the essence of a perfect summer day, making it ideal for daytime and warm-weather wear.</p>

