(Rounds out the scent with a sweet, vibrant finish, leaving a lasting, refreshing impression.)</p>

<p>Jean Lowe Azure is a citrusy fresh aquatic blend that’s as unique as it is refreshing, perfect for those seeking a clean, invigorating scent to complement the heat of summer. Its high-quality composition ensures a long-lasting fragrance that keeps you feeling cool, confident, and sophisticated all day. Embrace the luxurious freshness of Maison Alhambra Jean Lowe Azure and make it your go-to summer fragrance.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Maison Alhambra, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,450.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-Jean-Lowe-Azure.png?v=1779878357,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
