decant-partial-of-maison-alhambra-chants-tenderina-edp,Decant/Partial Of Maison Alhambra Chants Tenderina EDP,"<p>Maison Alhambra Chants Tenderina 100ml EDP for Women: Embrace the Symphony of Freshness and Elegance 🌸</p>

<p>Discover the allure of Maison Alhambra Chants Tenderina, a fragrance designed to captivate and enchant. This 100ml Eau De Parfum is a celebration of femininity, crafted to be as unique and vibrant as the woman who wears it. Inspired by the iconic Chanel Chance Eau Tendre, Chants Tenderina offers a long-lasting, fresh, and fruity scent that resonates with elegance and sophistication.</p>

<p>🌿 Enduring Freshness: Chants Tenderina is not just a fragrance; it's an experience. Its long-lasting nature ensures that you remain enveloped in its delightful aroma from morning to night. Perfect for any occasion, this fragrance will keep you feeling fresh and confident throughout the day.</p>

<p>💐 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: The journey begins with a delightful burst of bergamot, grapefruit blossom, and peach. This invigorating trio sets a fresh and fruity tone, creating an immediate sense of joy and vitality.<br>
Middle Notes: At its heart, Chants Tenderina blooms with the delicate and romantic essence of jasmine, rose, and iris. These floral notes blend seamlessly, adding depth and an alluring charm that is both soft and captivating.<br>
Base Notes: The fragrance culminates in a luxurious base of white musk, vetiver, vanilla, and patchouli. This combination provides a warm and sensual foundation, leaving a lasting impression that is both comforting and sophisticated.</p>

<p>🌞 Uniquely Suited for Women: Maison Alhambra Chants Tenderina is meticulously crafted for the modern woman who values uniqueness and elegance. Its fresh, fruity, and floral composition makes it versatile for any setting, be it a casual day out or a glamorous evening event.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Maison Alhambra, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,354.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Chants-Tenderina-1.png?v=1779878370,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
