decant-partial-of-maison-alhambra-oasis-edp,Decant/Partial Of Maison Alhambra Oasis EDP,"<p>Maison Alhambra Oasis 100ml Eau De Parfum: A Unisex Ode to Eternal Freshness 🌟</p>

<p>Embark on a journey of enchantment with Maison Alhambra Oasis, a captivating fragrance that transcends boundaries of gender. This 100ml Eau De Parfum, meticulously crafted in the United Arab Emirates, embodies the essence of everlasting freshness, leaving a trail of allure wherever it goes.</p>

<p>🌿 An Oasis of Freshness: Immerse yourself in the oasis of rejuvenation with Maison Alhambra Oasis. Designed to withstand the test of time, this fragrance is a celebration of nature's purity and vitality. From dawn to dusk, experience a burst of freshness that revitalizes your senses and uplifts your spirit.</p>

<p>💫 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: A symphony of citrus and fruity delights welcomes you, as bergamot, pear, strawberry, orange, and raspberry dance together in harmonious unity. Feel the refreshing breeze of this exhilarating introduction, awakening your senses to the wonders that lie ahead.<br>
Heart Notes: Delve deeper into the heart of Oasis, where jasmine, ylang-ylang, and orange blossom bloom in radiant splendor. Experience the floral symphony that captivates the soul, exuding elegance and grace with every breath.<br>
Base Notes: The journey culminates in a serene embrace of earthy warmth, as patchouli, moss, cedarwood, vanilla, and musk intertwine to create a comforting and sensual finale. Revel in the lingering embrace of Maison Alhambra Oasis, a testament to timeless sophistication.</p>

<p>🌟 A Tribute to Orza by Tiziana Terenzi: Maison Alhambra Oasis pays homage to the beloved Orza by Tiziana Terenzi, capturing its essence with unparalleled precision. As a Inspired, it inherits the same exquisite qualities and enchanting allure, offering a sensory experience that is truly divine.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Maison Alhambra, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,400.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-Oasis.png?v=1779878372,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
