decant-partial-of-maison-alhambra-russe-leather-edp,Decant/Partial Of Maison Alhambra Russe Leather EDP,"<p>Introducing Maison Alhambra's Russe Leather, an 80ML Eau de Parfum for both men and women, renowned for its extraordinary longevity that weaves an olfactory tale of sophistication and bold allure. This fragrance is a symphony of notes, carefully crafted to evoke a sense of passion and modernity, making it an ideal companion for every occasion.</p>

<p>The fragrance opens with a burst of invigorating freshness, combining the crispness of mint, the herbal elegance of clary sage, and the earthy nuances of cedar needle. Siberian pine and coriander add a touch of spice, creating a top note composition that is both refreshing and intriguing.</p>

<p>As Russe Leather evolves, it reveals a heart that is rich and complex. Lavender and rosemary lend an aromatic floral quality, while the warmth of nutmeg and the smoky essence of guaiac wood add depth. Basil and patchouli contribute to the heart notes, creating a captivating blend that is both timeless and contemporary.</p>

<p>The fragrance concludes with a sensuous and lasting impression. Tonka bean imparts a sweet and creamy quality, harmonizing with the distinct aroma of leather and the woody essence of cypress. This base note combination adds a layer of sophistication, ensuring that Russe Leather leaves a memorable and lingering trail.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Mint, Clary Sage, Cedar Needle, Siberian Pine, Coriander<br>
Heart Notes: Lavender, Rosemary, Nutmeg, Guaiac Wood, Basil, Patchouli<br>
Base Notes: Tonka Bean, Leather, Cypress</p>

<p>Maison Alhambra's Russe Leather is not only a fragrance but a narrative, a story of opulence and refinement. Remarkably long-lasting, it unfolds on the skin, transforming your daily routine into an olfactory adventure. As a splendid alternative to the expensive Russian Leather by Memo Paris, this EDP stands as a testament to affordable luxury, capturing the essence of the original in an artful interpretation that is both accessible and exquisite.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Maison Alhambra, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,381.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Russe-leather-maison-alhambra.png?v=1779878382,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
