decant-partial-of-maison-alhambra-dublin-leather-edp,Decant/Partial Of Maison Alhambra Dublin Leather EDP,"Maison Alhambra presents Dublin Leather, an 80ML Eau de Parfum for men that stands as a testament to the artistry of perfumery. Unveiling a symphony of notes, this fragrance exudes timeless sophistication and is characterized by an exceptional longevity, making it a paragon of enduring allure.

