decant-partial-of-maison-alhambra-kismet-angel-edp,Decant/Partial Of Maison Alhambra Kismet Angel EDP,"Maison Alhambra's Kismet Angel, a 100ML Eau De Parfum that transcends traditional boundaries with its exotic and gender-neutral allure. Revel in an olfactory journey that lasts beyond the ordinary; Kismet Angel is a symphony of scents, meticulously crafted to linger on the skin for an extended period, ensuring you carry an enchanting aura throughout the day and into the night.

