decant-partial-of-maison-alhambra-zaffiro-collection-regale-edp,Decant/Partial Of Maison Alhambra Zaffiro Collection Regale EDP,"<p>Maison Alhambra Zaffiro Collection Regale 100ML Eau de Parfum, a fragrance that exudes timeless elegance and sophistication. This perfume is more than just a scent; it's an olfactory masterpiece that captures the essence of luxury and exclusivity.</p>

<p>Maison Alhambra is renowned for creating fragrances that stand the test of time, and the Zaffiro Collection Regale is no exception. Its long-lasting formula ensures that you stay enveloped in its enchanting aroma throughout the day, making it a true companion for all your special moments.</p>

<p>At its heart, the Regale boasts a luxurious bouquet of Indian Saffron, which adds a rich, warm, and exotic allure. This is complemented by the delicate sweetness of jasmine, the enticing spiciness of cardamom, and the softness of rose notes. These elements combine to create a symphony of scents that are both captivating and alluring.</p>

<p>As the fragrance unfolds, key notes of patchouli and white cedar emerge, adding depth and complexity. The vanilla undertones infuse a creamy sweetness, while musk lends an irresistible sensuality that lingers in the air, leaving an indelible impression.</p>

<p>Maison Alhambra's Zaffiro Collection Regale is more than just a perfume; it's a statement of opulence and refinement. Whether you're attending a formal soirée or simply want to elevate your daily routine, this fragrance is your go-to choice for making a lasting impression. With its luxurious blend of ingredients and enduring scent, it's an olfactory masterpiece that embodies the essence of sophistication and luxury.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Maison Alhambra, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,388.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-Zaffiro-Collection-Regale-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878387,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
