decant-partial-of-maison-alhambra-your-touch-women-edp,Decant/Partial Of Maison Alhambra Your Touch Women EDP,"<p>Maison Alhambra Your Touch Women is designed for women seeking a scent that leaves an enduring impression. This fragrance is a testament to sophistication and sensuality, offering a captivating and long-lasting olfactory experience.</p>

<p>Opening with an enchanting burst of top notes, ""Your Touch"" entices the senses with the delightful fusion of Raspberry, Lemon, and Neroli. This initial burst is refreshingly fruity and zesty, creating an inviting aura. As the fragrance evolves, it gracefully transitions into the heart note of Rose, lending a floral elegance that embodies femininity and grace. The Rose note adds a romantic and timeless dimension to the composition.</p>

<p>As the perfume unfolds further, it settles into its warm and lasting base notes. The combination of Vanilla, Musk, and Amberwood creates a sensual and enveloping dry-down that lingers on the skin, leaving an alluring trail wherever you go. This unique blend of base notes adds depth and character to the fragrance, making it perfect for both daytime and evening wear.</p>

<p>""Your Touch"" is a budget-friendly alternative to the renowned Emporio Armani Because It’s You by Giorgio Armani. It captures the essence of the original while offering a more affordable option without compromising on quality or longevity. This Floral Fruity fragrance is a celebration of modern femininity, making it an ideal choice for confident women who want a scent that reflects their unique charm and allure.</p>

<p>Indulge in the long-lasting allure of Maison Alhambra's ""Your Touch,"" and let this exquisite fragrance become an essential part of your daily ensemble.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Maison Alhambra, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,355.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-Your-Touch-Women-100ml-EDP.png?v=1779878388,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
