decant-partial-of-maison-alhambra-your-touch-edp,Decant/Partial Of Maison Alhambra Your Touch EDP,"<p>Maison Alhambra's The Artist No 2, a 100ML Eau de Parfum designed exclusively for men. This olfactory masterpiece is a testament to timeless elegance and unwavering charisma. Crafted for those who seek sophistication and longevity in their fragrance, The Artist No 2 is a scent that lingers, leaving an indelible impression.</p>

<p>At the top, a captivating blend of Cardamom, Pink Pepper, Mint, and Violet Leaf sets the stage, evoking an aura of freshness and intrigue. As the fragrance unfolds, the heart notes reveal themselves, a harmonious symphony of Pineapple, Sage, Watermelon, Cinnamon, and Lavender, creating a dynamic and captivating core. These heart notes balance sweet and spicy elements, ensuring an enigmatic allure.</p>

<p>But what truly sets The Artist No 2 apart is its robust and lasting base notes. Anchored by Vanilla's warmth and Chestnut's earthiness, the fragrance delves into the rich, woody depths of Cedar, Amberwood, and Guaiac Wood, culminating in a smoky, sensual embrace that endures throughout the day and into the night.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Cardamom, Pink Pepper, Mint and Violet Leaf<br>
Heart Notes: Pineapple, Sage, Watermelon, Cinnamon and Lavender<br>
Base Notes: Vanilla, Chestnut, Cedar, Amberwood and Guaiac Wood</p>

<p>This exceptional creation from Maison Alhambra is more than just a fragrance; it's a statement of refined taste and unwavering confidence. A remarkable Inspired and budget-friendly alternative to Emporio Armani Stronger With You Intensely by Giorgio Armani, The Artist No 2 is an Amber Fougere fragrance that exudes masculine strength and allure. Experience the lasting power of this scent, an olfactory masterpiece that will leave a lasting impression wherever you go. Elevate your presence and make a statement with Maison Alhambra's The Artist No 2.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Maison Alhambra, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,370.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-Your-Touch-100ml-EDP.png?v=1779878389,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
