decant-partial-of-maison-alhambra-the-artist-no-2-edp,Decant/Partial Of Maison Alhambra The Artist No 2 EDP,"<p>Maison Alhambra presents The Artist No 2, a 100ML Eau de Parfum that transcends gender boundaries with its captivating blend of scents. This fragrance is more than just a perfume; it's an olfactory masterpiece that lingers on the skin, ensuring an enduring and memorable presence.</p>

<p>The top notes of Apple, Pink Pepper, and Rosemary create an invigorating and spicy opening, setting the stage for what's to come. As the fragrance develops, the heart notes reveal themselves, dominated by the exquisite essence of Bulgarian Rose and Turkish Rose, which infuse a rich, romantic floral bouquet with a touch of Clove's warmth. These middle notes convey a sense of elegance and passion.</p>

<p>The base notes of Cypriol Oil, Patchouli, Labdanum, Castoreum, and Ambroxan add depth and complexity to The Artist No 2. Cypriol Oil lends an earthy, woody character, while Patchouli contributes a sensual, velvety dimension. Labdanum, Castoreum, and Ambroxan intertwine to create a warm, resinous, and slightly animalic undertone, leaving a lasting impression on the senses.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Pink Pepper, Rosemary Oil, Apple Accord<br>
Heart Notes: Bulgarian Rose Oil, Turkish Rose Absolute, Clove Oil<br>
Base Notes: Patchouli Heart, Amboroxan, Labdanum, Cypriol Heart, Castoreum</p>

<p>This remarkable fragrance is not only a testament to artistry but also a remarkable budget-friendly alternative to Promise by Frederic Malle, known for its Amber Floral allure. The Artist No 2 by Maison Alhambra is an olfactory journey that defies conventions, making it suitable for both men and women who appreciate the timeless allure of a scent that lingers long after you've left the room. Immerse yourself in the captivating world of The Artist No 2 and let your presence be an unforgettable work of art.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Maison Alhambra, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,385.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-The-Artist-No-2-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878391,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
