decant-partial-of-maison-alhambra-the-artist-no-1-edp,Decant/Partial Of Maison Alhambra The Artist No 1 EDP,"<p>Maison Alhambra's The Artist No.1 transcends gender boundaries with its captivating blend of notes. This fragrance is more than just a scent; it's a work of art that exudes elegance and passion, designed to leave a lasting impression on both men and women.</p>

<p>The Artist No.1 opens with the graceful allure of Rose, a timeless and delicate floral note that sets the stage for what's to come. As it unfolds, the heart notes of Blackcurrant, Raspberry, and Clove emerge, weaving a tapestry of sweet and spicy intrigue. This harmonious combination evokes a sense of mystery and allure that is simply irresistible.</p>

<p>As the scent matures, it settles into its base notes, which are a rich and luxurious blend of Patchouli, Sandalwood, and Frankincense. These notes bring depth and warmth, leaving a trail of sophistication and sensuality in their wake. The enduring presence of these base notes ensures that Maison Alhambra's The Artist No.1 lingers on the skin, making it a truly long-lasting fragrance.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Rose<br>
Heart Notes: Blackcurrant, Raspberry, and Clove<br>
Base Notes: Patchouli, Sandalwood, and Frankincense</p>

<p>What makes The Artist No.1 even more remarkable is its ability to capture the essence of Frederic Malle's iconic Portrait of a Lady, offering a budget-friendly alternative without compromising on quality. This Amber Floral fragrance is a masterpiece that embodies the spirit of both men and women who appreciate the finer things in life. With The Artist No.1, you can wear artistry and elegance, leaving your mark wherever you go.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Maison Alhambra, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,385.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-The-Artist-No-1-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878393,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
