decant-partial-of-maison-alhambra-sceptre-malachite-edp,Decant/Partial Of Maison Alhambra Sceptre Malachite EDP,"<p>Maison Alhambra introduces the Sceptre Malachite, a 100ML Eau de Parfum designed exclusively for men seeking sophistication and longevity in their fragrances. This olfactory masterpiece boasts remarkable staying power, ensuring you stay enveloped in its captivating aura throughout the day.</p>

<p>At its heart, Sceptre Malachite is a harmonious blend of olfactory notes that tell a story of timeless elegance. The top notes tantalize your senses with a symphony of freshness, combining zesty Bergamot, invigorating Lemon, soothing Lavender, and the uplifting Lemon Verbena. This refreshing prelude sets the stage for an aromatic journey unlike any other.</p>

<p>As the scent evolves, you'll discover the warm embrace of Amber and Oud, creating a sensuous and inviting atmosphere. The Aromatic and Herbal notes infuse the composition with depth and complexity, adding a hint of mystery and sophistication. A delicate touch of Rose adds a floral facet that perfectly balances the richness of the fragrance.</p>

<p>Sceptre Malachite by Maison Alhambra proudly stands as an excellent alternative to the renowned Kobraa by Bvlgari. It embodies the essence of an Amber Fougere fragrance, offering a budget-friendly option without compromising on quality or longevity. This fragrance exudes confidence and charisma, making it an ideal choice for the modern man who appreciates the finer things in life.</p>

<p>With its captivating blend of notes, impressive longevity, and budget-friendly appeal, Maison Alhambra's Sceptre Malachite is a true gem in the world of men's fragrances. Experience the allure of this scent and make a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Maison Alhambra, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,410.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-Sceptre-Malachite-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878393,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
