decant-partial-of-maison-alhambra-la-voie-edp,Decant/Partial Of Maison Alhambra La Voie EDP,"<p>Maison Alhambra's La Voie, a captivating fragrance designed for the modern woman who exudes confidence and grace. This 100ML Eau de Parfum is a symphony of scents that will leave a lasting impression, just like the indomitable spirit of the woman who wears it.</p>

<p>La Voie is renowned for its remarkable longevity, ensuring you stay enveloped in its enchanting aura throughout the day and into the night. With its carefully curated notes, it's a fragrant journey that unfolds gracefully on your skin.</p>

<p>At the top, the perfume bursts forth with the luminous and zesty notes of Orange Blossom and Bergamot. These opening notes are fresh and invigorating, setting the stage for what's to come.</p>

<p>In the heart of the fragrance, Tuberose and Indian Jasmine take center stage, creating a floral bouquet that is both elegant and alluring. These middle notes infuse La Voie with an irresistible feminine charm.</p>

<p>Finally, the base notes of Madagascar Vanilla, White Musk, and Virginian Cedar anchor the scent, leaving a sensual and woody trail that lingers on your skin like a secret you can't help but share.</p>

<p>What makes La Voie truly special is its affordability. It's a wonderful alternative to the luxurious My Way by Giorgio Armani, offering the same floral sophistication at a fraction of the price.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Orange Blossom and Bergamot<br>
Heart Notes: Tuberose and Indian Jasmine<br>
Base Notes: Madagascar Vanilla, White Musk and Virginian Cedar.</p>

<p>In summary, Maison Alhambra's La Voie is not just a perfume; it's a statement of individuality and style. With its long-lasting allure and budget-friendly nature, it's the perfect choice for women who want to make a memorable impression wherever they go.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Maison Alhambra, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,8,deny,manual,360.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-La-Voie-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878393,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
