decant-partial-of-maison-alhambra-dark-door-intense-edp,Decant/Partial Of Maison Alhambra Dark Door Intense EDP,"<p>Dark Door Intense : A Luxurious Olfactory Journey</p>

<p>Unlock the door to an enchanting olfactory experience with Maison Alhambra's Dark Door Intense. This 100ML Eau de Parfum for men is a testament to sophistication and sensuality, offering an enduring fragrance that lingers on the skin for hours.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Lavender</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Iris, Ambrette (Musk Mallow), Pear, Vanilla</p>

<p>Base Notes: Virginia Cedar, Vetiver</p>

<p>Crafted by the renowned perfumer François Demachy, Dark Door Intense opens with the crisp, refreshing note of Lavender, setting the stage for an aromatic journey like no other. As the scent evolves, the heart reveals a harmonious blend of Iris, Ambrette, and Pear. The Iris lends an elegant, powdery quality, while Ambrette and Pear add a touch of fruitiness and muskiness.</p>

<p>The fragrance reaches its crescendo with the base notes of Virginia Cedar and Vetiver. These woody elements infuse depth and masculinity into the composition, creating a captivating dry down that leaves an indelible impression.</p>

<p>Dark Door Intense is more than just a scent; it's a budget-friendly alternative to the classic Dior Homme Intense 2011 by Dior. It captures the essence of the original, with its Woody Floral Musk profile, offering a similar level of sophistication and allure at a fraction of the price.</p>

<p>Maison Alhambra's commitment to quality ensures that this fragrance is not only an affordable alternative but also a long-lasting one. Dark Door Intense is designed to accompany you through your day, from morning meetings to evening soirées, leaving an unforgettable trail of elegance wherever you go.</p>

<p>Unlock the Dark Door Intense and step into a world of timeless sophistication and allure, all within the reach of your budget. Elevate your fragrance game with Maison Alhambra, where luxury meets affordability.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Maison Alhambra, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,340.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-Dark-Door-Intense-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878396,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
