decant-partial-of-maison-alhambra-man-black-edition-edp,Decant/Partial Of Maison Alhambra Man Black Edition EDP,"<p>Maison Alhambra Man Black Edition 100ML Eau de Parfum for men, a captivating and long-lasting fragrance that embodies sophistication and masculinity. This olfactory masterpiece is designed to leave a lasting impression, making it a perfect choice for the modern, confident man.</p>

<p>The top notes of Lavender, Pineapple, Bergamot, and Lemon Verbena immediately greet your senses with a burst of freshness and zest. These invigorating top notes create an enticing opening that sets the stage for what's to come.</p>

<p>As the fragrance evolves, you'll discover a heart of Red Apple, Dried Fruits, Oak Moss, Geranium, Coumarin, and Rose. This intriguing blend of middle notes adds depth and complexity, balancing fruity sweetness with earthy undertones, and a hint of floral elegance.</p>

<p>The base notes of Tonka Bean and Sandalwood provide a warm and sensual foundation that lingers on your skin throughout the day and into the evening. These rich, woody notes create a sophisticated trail that exudes confidence and allure.</p>

<p>Maison Alhambra Man Black Edition is celebrated for its remarkable resemblance to the popular Legend by Montblanc, making it an excellent budget-friendly alternative. This Aromatic Fougère fragrance is tailored for the man who appreciates quality without compromising on value. It's a fragrance that seamlessly transitions from day to night, from the boardroom to a special date night.</p>

<p>Top notes are Lavender, Pineapple, Bergamot and Lemon Verbena</p>

<p>Middle notes are Red Apple, Dried Fruits, oak moss, Geranium, Coumarin and Rose</p>

<p>Base notes are Tonka Bean and Sandalwood.</p>

<p>Experience the enduring charm and versatility of Maison Alhambra Man Black Edition. Immerse yourself in a world of elegance and sophistication with a scent that defines modern masculinity. It's the perfect choice for the discerning man who seeks a signature fragrance that leaves a lasting memory wherever he goes.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Maison Alhambra, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,345.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-Man-black-edition-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878396,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
decant-partial-of-maison-alhambra-man-black-edition-edp,,,,,,,,,50ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,999.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Decant_Image.png?v=1781928894,2,"",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,
decant-partial-of-maison-alhambra-b-a-d-femme-edp,Decant/Partial Of Maison Alhambra B.A.D Femme EDP,"<p>Maison Alhambra B.A.D Femme, a captivating 100ml Eau de Parfum designed for men with a penchant for luxury and sensuality. This fragrance is a remarkable olfactory experience, reminiscent of the iconic Good Girl by Carolina Herrera, reimagined for the modern man. It's an enchanting blend that balances the contrasting elements of sweetness and spiciness, making it the perfect signature scent for the confident and sophisticated individual.</p>

<p>Top notes are Almond, Coffee, Bergamot and Lemon</p>

<p>Middle notes are Tuberose, Jasmine Sambac, Orange Blossom, Orris and Bulgarian Rose</p>

<p>Base notes are Tonka Bean, Cacao, Vanilla, Praline, Sandalwood, Musk, Amber, Cashmere Wood, Cinnamon, Patchouli and Cedar.</p>

<p>At the very first whiff, the top notes of Almond, Coffee, Bergamot, and Lemon dance on your skin, awakening your senses with a burst of invigorating citrus and the warm embrace of roasted coffee beans. As it settles, the heart notes reveal themselves in a harmonious symphony of Tuberose, Jasmine Sambac, Orange Blossom, Orris, and Bulgarian Rose. These floral accords add a touch of elegance and seduction to the composition, ensuring that this fragrance remains enticing throughout the day or night.</p>

<p>The base notes of Tonka Bean, Cacao, Vanilla, Praline, Sandalwood, Musk, Amber, Cashmere Wood, Cinnamon, Patchouli, and Cedar provide depth and longevity to this scent, leaving a trail of warmth and sophistication wherever you go. It's a fragrance that lingers in the air, leaving a lasting impression on everyone you encounter.</p>

<p>Maison Alhambra B.A.D Femme is more than just a fragrance; it's an embodiment of charisma and style. Embrace the duality of its character, embodying both the sweetness of a charming smile and the allure of a mysterious gaze. With every spray, you'll capture attention, leaving an indelible mark that defines your presence. Elevate your fragrance game with Maison Alhambra B.A.D Femme, the essence of modern masculinity.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Maison Alhambra, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,355.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-B.A.D-Femme-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878397,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,'1,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
