decant-partial-of-maison-alhambra-cassius-edp,Decant/Partial Of Maison Alhambra Cassius EDP,"<p>Maison Alhambra presents Cassius, a 100ML Eau de Parfum for men that embodies timeless sophistication and magnetic charm. Cassius is more than just a fragrance; it's a symphony of scents that leaves a lasting impression, making it the perfect choice for the modern man seeking distinction and allure.</p>

<p>Cassius opens with a captivating burst of Nutmeg, Green Apple, and Saffron. This initial olfactory journey is a tantalizing invitation to a world of elegance and charisma. As the scent unfolds, the heart notes emerge, revealing a harmonious blend of Tonka Bean, Rose, Osmanthus, and Davana. These floral and fruity elements add depth and complexity, evoking a sense of refinement that lingers in the air.</p>

<p>What truly sets Cassius apart is its remarkable longevity. This fragrance is designed to endure, accompanying you throughout the day and into the night, making it perfect for any occasion.</p>

<p>As Cassius dries down, it leaves a mesmerizing trail of Patchouli, Vanilla, and Opoponax in its wake. These base notes contribute to the fragrance's depth and sensuality, leaving an indelible mark wherever you go.</p>

<p>Top notes are Nutmeg, Green Apple and Saffron</p>

<p>Middle notes are Tonka Bean, Rose, Osmanthus and Davana</p>

<p>Base notes are Patchouli, Vanilla and Opoponax.</p>

<p>Cassius is more than a scent; it's an experience. It's a great alternative for those who appreciate the opulence of Carlisle by Parfums de Marly but seek a budget-friendly option. With its longevity, unique blend of notes, and magnetic aura, Cassius by Maison Alhambra is a must-have for the modern man who aspires to make a lasting impression wherever he ventures. Choose Cassius and embrace the art of alluring distinction.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Maison Alhambra, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,335.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-Cassius-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878399,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
