decant-partial-of-maison-alhambra-floral-bloom-edp,Decant/Partial Of Maison Alhambra Floral Bloom EDP,"<p>Floral Bloom Maison Alhambra, a 100ml Eau de Parfum that embodies timeless elegance and floral opulence. Crafted for the modern woman who seeks both longevity and beauty in her scent, this fragrance is an olfactory masterpiece. Renowned perfumer Alberto Morillas, the genius behind many iconic scents, has artfully blended a bouquet of exquisite notes to create a fragrance that lingers on your skin throughout the day.</p>

<p>At the heart of Floral Bloom Maison Alhambra is the enchanting jasmine, a symbol of femininity and grace. Its intoxicating aroma dances on your skin, captivating your senses with its sweet, floral allure. As the fragrance unfolds, the velvety tuberose emerges, adding depth and sensuality to the composition. Finally, the base note of Rangoon Creeper weaves a unique, exotic twist, leaving an indelible impression that is both captivating and mysterious.</p>

<p>What sets Floral Bloom Maison Alhambra apart is its remarkable longevity. This perfume is designed to accompany you from dawn to dusk, its fragrance evolving beautifully over time. With just a few spritzes, you'll embark on a sensory journey that mirrors the changing facets of a blooming flower.</p>

<p>For those who appreciate timeless elegance and the allure of florals, Floral Bloom Maison Alhambra is the perfect choice. It embodies the essence of femininity and is ideal for any occasion, from casual outings to formal events. This fragrance is a homage to the classic Gucci Bloom, designed to captivate the senses and leave an unforgettable impression. Indulge in the beauty of Floral Bloom Maison Alhambra and embrace the essence of floral luxury.</p>

<p>Top note is Jasmine</p>

<p>Middle note is Tuberose</p>

<p>Base note is Rangoon Creeper.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Maison Alhambra, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,340.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Floral-Bloom-Maison-Alhambra-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878400,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,floral,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
decant-partial-of-maison-alhambra-floral-bloom-edp,,,,,,,,,50ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,999.00,2200.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Decant_Image.png?v=1781928894,2,"",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,
decant-partial-of-maison-alhambra-narissa-ambre-edp,Decant/Partial Of Maison Alhambra Narissa Ambre EDP,"<p>Narissa Ambre Maison Alhambra 100ML Eau de Parfum is a luxurious and enduring fragrance designed for the modern woman who exudes sophistication and grace. This exquisite perfume offers a captivating olfactory journey that lingers throughout the day and into the night, making it the perfect choice for those who seek a long-lasting, alluring scent.</p>

<p>At the top, you'll be greeted by a delightful blend of Frangipani, Ylang-Ylang, and White Flowers. These floral notes open the scent with a delicate and enchanting sweetness, evoking the sensation of walking through a blossoming garden in the early morning.</p>

<p>As the fragrance unfolds, the heart reveals a harmonious duet of Musk and Amber, adding depth and sensuality to the composition. These middle notes create a warm and inviting aura that draws people closer, leaving an indelible impression.</p>

<p>The base notes of Cashmeran, Vanilla, and Cedar provide a solid foundation for Narissa Ambre Maison Alhambra. They lend an elegant and woody dimension to the scent, leaving a trail of sophistication in your wake.</p>

<p>This fragrance, inspired by Narciso Eau de Parfum Ambrée by Narciso Rodriguez, is a remarkable Inspired that captures the essence of the original with remarkable precision. It exudes the same magnetic charm and sensuous allure, making it a perfect choice for those who appreciate the exquisite subtleties of amber floral fragrances. Narissa Ambre Maison Alhambra is an invitation to embrace your inner allure and leave a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>Top notes are Frangipani, Ylang-Ylang and White Flowers</p>

<p>Middle notes are Musk and Amber</p>

<p>Base notes are Cashmeran, Vanilla and Cedar</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Maison Alhambra, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,340.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Narissa-Ambre-Maison-Alhambra-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878401,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
decant-partial-of-maison-alhambra-narissa-ambre-edp,,,,,,,,,80ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1119.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Decant_Image.png?v=1781928894,2,"",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,
decant-partial-of-maison-alhambra-tux-edp,Decant/Partial Of Maison Alhambra Tux EDP,"<p>Note : Brand has changed the name from TUX to WINSOME , but quality of the product remains same.</p>

<p>Maison Alhambra Tux 90ML EDP for Men, a captivating olfactory masterpiece that unveils an aura of timeless sophistication and rugged charm. This fragrance is a symphony of alluring notes, meticulously crafted to resonate with the modern man's distinct taste and personality. Inspired of Tuxedo by Yves Saint Laurent.</p>

<p>Maison Alhambra Tux opens with an invigorating burst of freshness, as the interplay of Violet Leaf Accord, Bergamot Oil, and Coriander Seeds oil infuses the composition with an energetic vibrancy. These top notes immediately draw you in with their crisp and invigorating facets, setting the stage for an olfactory journey unlike any other.</p>

<p>The heart of this fragrance is a harmonious blend of elegance and intensity. Rose Oil and Lily Of The Valley Accord intertwine, exuding a refined floral elegance that's balanced by the captivating allure of Black Pepper Oil. This heart note combination adds depth and complexity to the composition, revealing different facets with every wear.</p>

<p>What truly sets Maison Alhambra Tux apart is its base notes, a seductive and comforting symphony that lingers on the skin for hours. The warm embrace of Ambergris Accord is juxtaposed with the earthy richness of Patchouli Heart, creating a dynamic interplay that's both alluring and grounded. The scent experience reaches its crescendo with the enveloping sweetness of Vanilla Bourbon, leaving an indelible impression that lasts long after the first application.</p>

<p>For those who find solace in the intoxicating aroma of coffee, Maison Alhambra Tux is a revelation. This long-lasting perfume weaves a subtle thread of coffee-like richness throughout its composition, adding a unique and irresistible dimension to the fragrance. It's a scent that speaks of confidence, refinement, and a taste for the finer things in life.</p>

<p>Maison Alhambra Tux 90ML EDP for Men is more than a fragrance; it's an embodiment of masculinity, sophistication, and the power of scent to evoke emotions and memories. With its intricate blend of notes and its remarkable longevity, it's poised to become an essential addition to any connoisseur's collection.</p>

<p>Top Notes -Violet Leaf Accord, Bergamot Oil, Coriander Seeds oil<br>
Heart Notes - Rose Oil, Lily Of The Valley Accord, Black Pepper Oil<br>
Base Notes - Ambergris Accord, Patchouli Heart, Vanilla Bourbon</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Maison Alhambra, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,8,deny,manual,455.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-Tux-90ML-EDP.png?v=1779878402,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
