decant-partial-of-maison-alhambra-delilah-edp,Decant/Partial Of Maison Alhambra Delilah EDP,"<p>Delilah by Maison Alhambra – 100ML EDP 🌸✨Elegance Redefined. Inspired by Delina.<br>
Unveil your grace with Delilah by Maison Alhambra, a luxurious Eau de Parfum for women, crafted in the UAE with exquisite long-lasting performance. This sophisticated scent is Inspired by the iconic Delina by Parfums de Marly, delivering opulence without compromise.<br>
Delilah opens with a sparkling blend of Litchi, Rhubarb, Bergamot, and a dash of Nutmeg, giving a vibrant and juicy first impression. At its heart, it blossoms into a romantic bouquet of Turkish Rose, Peony, Vanilla, and Petalia, softened by a gentle touch of Musk. The dry-down reveals a warm, sensual base of Cashmeran, Incense, Cedarwood, and Haitian Vetiver, leaving a lasting trail of mystery and allure.<br>
Fragrance Notes:<br>
Top Notes: Litchi, Rhubarb, Bergamot, Nutmeg(A fruity-spicy spark that’s playful and bold.)<br>
Middle Notes: Turkish Rose, Peony, Vanilla, Musk, Petalia(A floral heart that’s elegant, sweet, and feminine.)<br>
Base Notes: Cashmeran, Incense, Cedar, Haitian Vetiver(A woody, musky base that lingers with depth and warmth.)<br>
Perfect for romantic evenings, special occasions, or whenever you want to feel irresistibly feminine. 💖</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","best seller, Date Night Picks, Decant, Maison Alhambra, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,370.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Delilah-for-women-Maison-Alhambra-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878416,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,'1,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
