decant-partial-of-maison-alhambra-jubilant-rose-edp,Decant/Partial Of Maison Alhambra Jubilant Rose EDP,"<p>Maison Alhambra Jubilant Rose 100ml EDP For Women – The Essence of Timeless Elegance 🌹</p>

<p>Introducing Maison Alhambra Jubilant Rose, formerly known as Versencia Crystal—though the name has changed, the luxurious quality and exquisite presentation remain the same. Made in the UAE, this high-quality, rich-smelling fragrance captures the spirit of elegance and sophistication, offering a beautifully balanced scent profile reminiscent of the celebrity favorite Bright Crystal by Versace.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Yuzu, Ice Accord, Pomegranate<br>
(A refreshing, icy burst with a hint of fruity sweetness to captivate the senses.)<br>
Middle Notes: Acajou, Plant Amber, Musk<br>
(Warm and sensual, adding depth and smoothness to the fragrance.)<br>
Base Notes: Peony, Magnolia, Lotus Flower<br>
(Soft and floral, creating a graceful and feminine finish.)</p>

<p>Maison Alhambra Jubilant Rose is a versatile fragrance suited to all-weather wear, making it perfect for any season. With its radiant floral and fresh notes, it’s ideal for both day and evening occasions, enveloping you in a soft yet long-lasting aroma. Embrace the charm and sophistication of Jubilant Rose—a scent that leaves a memorable impression everywhere you go.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Maison Alhambra, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,350.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Versencia-Crystal-Maison-Alhambra-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878459,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
