decant-partial-of-maison-alhambra-jorge-di-profondo-edp,Decant/Partial Of Maison Alhambra Jorge Di Profondo EDP,"Maison Alhambra Jorge Di Profumo Deep Blue 100ML EDP – Dive into Deep Blue Freshness 🌊

Note: Recently rebranded from Jorge Di Profundo to Jorge Di Profumo Deep Blue, this fragrance offers the same premium quality and elegant packaging. If you order Profundo, you’ll receive Profumo Deep Blue without any compromise in quality.

Experience the powerful allure of Maison Alhambra Jorge Di Profumo Deep Blue, a high-quality, rich-smelling fragrance crafted in the UAE. This aromatic fougère is designed for men who appreciate depth and sophistication.

Fragrance Notes:

Top Notes: Bergamot, Sicilian Lemon &amp; Black Pepper
(A vibrant, zesty opening with a hint of spice, evoking a fresh sea breeze.)
Heart Notes: Lavender, Tobacco &amp; Geranium
(An aromatic blend that adds warmth and complexity, perfect for a masculine edge.)
Base Notes: Sandalwood, Musk &amp; Vetiver
(A rich, earthy base that lingers, providing depth and longevity.)

