decant-partial-of-paris-corner-cosmic-giardino-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Cosmic Giardino EDP,"Paris Corner Cosmic Giardino 100ml EDP for Men &amp; Women – A Tropical Expression of Modern Elegance ✨
Paris Corner Cosmic Giardino is a unisex Eau de Parfum that beautifully blends sun-kissed freshness with smooth, contemporary sophistication. Inspired by Le Beau Paradise Garden by Jean Paul Gaultier, this fragrance opens with a refreshing tropical brightness, moves into a soft aromatic-floral heart, and settles into a warm, sensual base that feels both relaxed and refined. It’s an ideal choice for daytime wear, holidays, casual evenings, and moments when you want a scent that’s fresh yet confidently stylish.
Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Fig, Coconut &amp; Sea Salt 🥥🌿The opening is creamy and airy, with juicy fig adding a green sweetness, coconut bringing smooth tropical richness, and sea salt creating a clean, breezy freshness that instantly feels uplifting and modern.
Middle Notes: Lavender, Violet &amp; Geranium 🌸At the heart, aromatic lavender blends with soft violet and fresh geranium. This layer adds elegance and balance, giving the fragrance a refined unisex character that feels calm, smooth, and effortlessly wearable.
Base Notes: Tonka Bean, Sandalwood &amp; Ambroxan 🌿The dry-down is warm and addictive. Tonka bean adds gentle sweetness, sandalwood delivers creamy woods, and ambroxan provides a modern amber-musky depth with excellent longevity.
Paris Corner Cosmic Giardino is perfect for those who love fresh tropical openings, elegant aromatic hearts, and a cozy yet modern base—an easygoing yet sophisticated scent that transitions beautifully from day to night.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,440.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/PARIS-CORNER-Cosmic-Giardino.png?v=1779878489,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
decant-partial-of-paris-corner-cosmic-giardino-edp,,,,,,,,,90ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,2159.00,3499.00,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Decant_Image.png?v=1781928894,2,"",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,
decant-partial-of-paris-corner-qissa-gala-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Qissa Gala EDP,"Paris Corner Qissa Gala 100ml EDP For Women – A Story of Grace &amp; Indulgence 🌸✨Feminine • Elegant • Long-Lasting
Paris Corner Qissa Gala is a beautifully composed fragrance that celebrates soft femininity wrapped in creamy sweetness. Floral, slightly gourmand, and effortlessly elegant, this scent feels romantic yet comforting—perfect for women who enjoy graceful fragrances with a modern, sweet touch.

Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Gardenia, Violet Leaf, Ylang-Ylang, Almond 🌼🌿The opening is smooth and inviting. Creamy almond blends with lush gardenia and exotic ylang-ylang, while violet leaf adds a fresh green nuance, creating a soft and elegant first impression.
Middle Notes: Tuberose, Lily of the Valley, Coconut, Plum 🌸🥥At the heart, rich white florals bloom beautifully. Tuberose adds depth and sensuality, lily-of-the-valley brings freshness, while coconut and plum introduce a creamy, fruity sweetness that feels indulgent yet balanced.
Base Notes: Musk, Vanilla, Sweet Notes, Moss 🤍🌙The base is warm and comforting. Smooth vanilla and sweet notes melt into clean musk, while moss adds a subtle earthy touch, leaving a soft, long-lasting, and elegant trail.
Perfect for daily wear, brunch dates, evenings, and special occasions, Qissa Gala is ideal for lovers of floral-gourmand fragrances with a creamy and feminine character.
✨ Delicate yet captivating, Paris Corner Qissa Gala tells a fragrance story filled with charm, warmth, and timeless beauty.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,372.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Qissa-Gala.png?v=1779878491,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
