decant-partial-of-paris-corner-december-ambar-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner December Ambar EDP,"Paris Corner December Ambar 85ml EDP – A Cozy Fusion of Warmth &amp; Elegance 🍏✨

Paris Corner December Ambar is a unisex Eau de Parfum that beautifully balances festive vibrance with deep, inviting warmth — perfect for the cooler months, evening gatherings, and moments when you want to leave a lasting impression. This scent opens with a bright, intriguing blend that quickly settles into an elegantly rich heart, before resting on a soft and addictive amber-gourmand base that wraps you in a comforting embrace.

Fragrance Notes

✨ Top Notes: Apple, Anise, Coconut
A fresh and crisp opening greets the senses with juicy apple and creamy coconut, while the subtle spice of anise adds a unique twist — bright, playful, and instantly captivating.

🌹 Middle Notes: Saffron, Rose, Plum
The heart unfolds with luxurious floral and fruity facets — exotic saffron and velvety rose mingle with succulent plum to deliver a rich and sophisticated character that feels both comforting and unforgettable.

🔥 Base Notes: Benzoin, Amber, Anise, Cedarwood, Vanilla, Caramel, Moss
A warm and indulgent base of amber, vanilla, caramel, and benzoin creates a luscious, golden trail. Cedarwood and moss add earthy depth, while a whisper of anise ties back to the top for a beautifully cohesive finish.

Paris Corner December Ambar is the perfect choice for cool evenings, romantic dinners, festive events, or anytime you want a scent that’s both cozy and classy. Its comforting amber-gourmand heart makes it especially inviting and wonderfully versatile across genders. 🌟✨",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,459.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-December-Ambar.png?v=1779878492,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
