decant-partial-of-paris-corner-pendora-amber-grand-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Pendora Amber Grand EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Pendora Amber Grand 100ml EDP: Embrace Timeless Elegance 🌟</p>

<p>Introducing Paris Corner Pendora Amber Grand 100ml Eau De Parfum, a captivating fragrance masterpiece made in the UAE. This luxurious scent promises a long-lasting allure, wrapping you in an enchanting embrace that endures throughout the day and into the night. Crafted to perfection, Amber Grand stands as the best Inspired of the esteemed Grand Soir by Maison Francis Kurkdjian, offering you an exquisite fragrance experience at a fraction of the cost.</p>

<p>💐 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Amber: The heart of this fragrance is rich and resinous amber, delivering a warm and sensual undertone that forms the foundation of this captivating scent.<br>
Vanilla: Adding a creamy sweetness, vanilla melds seamlessly with the amber, creating a luxurious and comforting aroma that lingers on the skin.<br>
Siam Benzoin: This note brings a balsamic richness to the composition, enhancing the depth and complexity of the fragrance with its sweet, resinous scent.<br>
Tonka Bean: Offering a nuanced blend of sweetness and spice, tonka bean introduces a subtle hint of almond and cinnamon, enriching the overall fragrance profile.<br>
Spanish Labdanum: This ingredient adds a leathery, slightly smoky nuance, contributing to the sophisticated and exotic character of Amber Grand.<br>
Lavender: The fresh and aromatic touch of lavender balances the composition, infusing a calming and refreshing element that complements the richer notes.</p>

