Birch: Earthy and smoky, birch leaves a trail of masculine sophistication, adding a touch of ruggedness to the composition.<br>
Benzoin: Sweet and resinous, benzoin lends a comforting warmth, enveloping the wearer in a cocoon of indulgent luxury.<br>
Geranium: Crisp and green, geranium adds a fresh, herbal dimension, infusing the fragrance with vitality and brightness.</p>

<p>🌹 Inspired by Luxury: Paris Corner Prive Zarah Ombre De Louis is a remarkable Inspired of the iconic Ombre Nomade by Louis Vuitton, offering a taste of exclusivity at an accessible price point. Revel in the prestige and refinement of this exquisite fragrance, reminiscent of the most expensive scents in the world.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,443.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Prive-Zarah-Ombre-De-Louis.png?v=1779878612,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,extrait,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
