decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-frenetic-delicieuse-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Emir Frenetic Delicieuse EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Frenetic Delicieuse 80ml EDP: A Unisex Ode to Exquisite Luxury</p>

<p>Embark on a sensory journey like no other with Paris Corner Emir Frenetic Delicieuse, an 80ml Eau De Parfum designed to captivate both men and women. This fragrance masterpiece echoes the essence of sophistication and opulence, drawing inspiration from the iconic Fève Délicieuse by Dior, yet offered at a fraction of the cost.</p>

<p>🔥 Indulge in Exclusivity: Paris Corner Emir Frenetic Delicieuse stands as a testament to refined elegance. It embodies the epitome of luxury, offering wearers an opportunity to indulge in the allure of high-end fragrances without breaking the bank.</p>

<p>💐 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Lavender, mint, and bergamot converge to create a refreshing and invigorating opening. Feel the crispness of lavender, the coolness of mint, and the citrusy zest of bergamot, setting the stage for an unforgettable olfactory experience.<br>
Middle Notes: A symphony of sour cherry, jasmine, and freesia dances at the heart of Emir Frenetic Delicieuse. This floral-fruity fusion adds depth and allure, evoking a sense of femininity and sensuality that transcends gender boundaries.<br>
Base Notes: The grand finale unfolds with a decadent blend of tonka bean, vanilla, cacao pod, caramel, praline, benzoin, milk, sandalwood, leather, and cedar. This rich and indulgent base creates a luxurious trail that lingers on the skin, leaving a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>🌹 A Tribute to Dior's Fève Délicieuse: Paris Corner Emir Frenetic Delicieuse pays homage to the renowned Fève Délicieuse by Dior, offering a comparable experience at an accessible price point. Immerse yourself in the same intoxicating aroma of sophistication and refinement, now within reach.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,416.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Frenetic-Delicieuse.png?v=1779878621,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
