Middle Notes: The heart of Killer Oud Overdose unveils a rich and complex bouquet, featuring myrrh, labdanum, cinnamon, benzoin, mastic, patchouli, and geranium. These aromatic ingredients intertwine to create a warm and inviting core, exuding an air of sophistication and allure.<br>
Base Notes: As the fragrance settles, it leaves a lingering trail of sensuality with its base notes of animalic nuances, smoke, incense, sandalwood, leather, and clary sage. This seductive blend adds depth and complexity, ensuring an unforgettable olfactory experience that resonates long after the initial application.</p>

