decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-elania-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Emir Elania EDP,"<p>Paris Corner's Emir Elania for Women is a captivating olfactory symphony that enchants the senses with its exquisite blend of notes, creating a fragrance that is both enduring and alluring. This 100ML Eau de Parfum is a testament to sophistication and allure, designed for the modern woman who seeks a scent as unique as she is.</p>

<p>The fragrance opens with a burst of freshness from top notes that include Litchi, Rhubarb, Bergamot, and Nutmeg. This initial olfactory experience is a dance of sweet and spicy, setting the stage for what unfolds. The heart of Emir Elania reveals a floral masterpiece, with Turkish Rose and Peony embracing the senses. Musk adds a touch of sensuality, while Petalia and Vanilla contribute a creamy sweetness that lingers delicately.</p>

<p>As the fragrance settles into its base notes, Emir Elania unveils a rich and grounding essence. Cashmeran provides warmth and depth, complemented by the woody allure of Cedar and the earthy sophistication of Haitian Vetiver. The final touch comes from the lingering tendrils of Incense, leaving a trace of mystery and seduction.</p>

<p>What makes Emir Elania truly remarkable is its exceptional longevity. This Eau de Parfum is crafted to be a steadfast companion, accompanying you throughout the day and into the night with its enduring allure. It stands out as a remarkable alternative to the renowned Delina by Parfums de Marly, offering a luxurious experience at a more accessible price point.</p>

<p>In every spritz, Emir Elania captures the essence of timeless elegance, making it an indispensable addition to the fragrance collection of the discerning woman who appreciates sophistication and enduring beauty.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,373.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Elania.png?v=1779878624,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
