decant-partial-of-paris-corner-killer-oud-cabana-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Killer Oud Cabana EDP,"<p>Paris Corner's Killer Oud Cabana 100ml Eau de Parfum for men is a luxurious olfactory experience designed for those who appreciate a scent that transcends time. This fragrance is renowned for its exceptional longevity, ensuring that the captivating essence lingers throughout the day, leaving an indelible impression.</p>

<p>The top notes of Orange Blossom, Galbanum, and Mint combine to create an invigorating and fresh introduction that immediately captures attention. As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes of Vetiver, Moss, and Ivy take center stage, providing a green and earthy complexity that adds depth and sophistication to the composition.</p>

<p>The base notes of Patchouli, Myrrh, and Dry Wood anchor the fragrance with a warm and woody foundation. This blend of elements creates a sensual and mysterious trail that unfolds gradually, leaving a memorable imprint on the senses.</p>

<p>What makes Killer Oud Cabana truly exceptional is its undeniable resemblance to the highly coveted Beach Hut Man by Amouage. This fragrance serves as an excellent and budget-friendly alternative, allowing individuals to indulge in the opulence of a renowned scent without the exorbitant price tag.</p>

<p>The artful combination of notes in Killer Oud Cabana not only mirrors the richness of Beach Hut Man but also adds a unique touch, making it a distinctive fragrance in its own right. The interplay of citrus, green, and woody elements in this olfactory masterpiece ensures that every spritz is a journey to a sun-soaked paradise, making it an ideal choice for those who seek sophistication and longevity in their fragrance. Embrace the allure of Killer Oud Cabana, a scent that transcends time and captivates the senses with its harmonious blend of notes.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,395.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/killer-oud-cabana.png?v=1779878625,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
