decant-partial-of-paris-corner-killer-oud-ethic-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Killer Oud Ethic EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Killer Oud Ethic, a 100ml Eau de Parfum designed for men who appreciate the allure of mystery and the power of a lasting impression. This olfactory masterpiece promises an enduring fragrance experience, ensuring you leave an indelible mark wherever you go.</p>

<p>At the first whiff, the top notes unfold a captivating blend of Frankincense, Pink Pepper, Cardamom, Saffron, Nutmeg, Cumin, Mace, Red Berries, and Myrtle. This symphony of spicy and aromatic elements sets the stage for a fragrance that is both bold and enigmatic. As the scent develops, the heart notes reveal Myrrh and Geranium, adding a touch of floral warmth to the composition.</p>

<p>The base notes, where the true essence of longevity resides, boast a rich and complex blend of Castoreum, Musk, Sandalwood, Cedarwood, Frankincense, Patchouli, Oud, and Leather. This robust foundation not only ensures an extended wear time but also imparts a deep and sophisticated character to the fragrance.</p>

<p>What makes Paris Corner Killer Oud Ethic truly exceptional is its uncanny resemblance to the luxurious Epic Man by Amouage, providing fragrance enthusiasts with an affordable alternative without compromising on quality. It embodies the spirit of the original, allowing you to indulge in the opulence of a high-end fragrance at a fraction of the cost.</p>

<p>In every spritz, Killer Oud Ethic unveils a story of refinement and allure, making it an indispensable companion for the modern man who seeks to make a lasting statement. Elevate your fragrance game with this captivating blend that marries tradition with contemporary elegance, leaving an olfactory trail that echoes in the memories of those you encounter.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,395.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/killer-oud-ethic.png?v=1779878626,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
