decant-partial-of-paris-corner-killer-oud-death-by-oud-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Killer Oud Death By Oud EDP,"<p>Paris Corner presents the epitome of opulence with its Killer Oud Death By Oud, a 100ml Eau de Parfum designed exclusively for men. This olfactory masterpiece is not merely a fragrance; it's an experience that defies time with its extraordinary longevity. Crafted to leave an enduring impression, Killer Oud stands as a testament to the brand's commitment to luxury and sophistication.</p>

<p>Opening with an invigorating burst, the top notes of Grapefruit and Lavender dance together in perfect harmony. The citrusy vibrancy of Grapefruit intertwines seamlessly with the calming essence of Lavender, creating an initial impression that is both refreshing and refined. As the fragrance evolves, the heart reveals a captivating blend of Tobacco, Spices, and Leather. This dynamic combination exudes masculinity, evoking an air of mystery and allure.</p>

<p>However, it's the base notes that truly make Killer Oud Death By Oud an olfactory journey to remember. The rich, resinous depth of Amber merges with the rare and exotic Oud, creating a lingering trail that is both captivating and seductive. This fragrance pays homage to the traditions of perfumery by incorporating the timeless allure of Oud, a note revered for its complexity and depth.</p>

<p>What sets Killer Oud apart is its uncanny resemblance to the revered Oud Malaki by Chopard, a fragrance known for its exclusivity and prestige. Paris Corner has masterfully crafted a more accessible alternative without compromising on the essence of sophistication and luxury. This makes Killer Oud Death By Oud not only a superb fragrance for those who appreciate enduring, captivating scents but also an intelligent choice for those seeking the allure of a high-end classic at a more budget-friendly price point. Unleash the power of Killer Oud, and let the scent speak volumes about your style and sophistication.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,400.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Killer-Oud-Death-By-Oud.png?v=1779878627,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
