decant-partial-of-paris-corner-killer-oud-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Killer Oud EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Killer Oud is a 100ml Eau de Parfum crafted for the modern man who appreciates sophistication and allure in a fragrance. This olfactory masterpiece is renowned for its exceptional longevity, ensuring that the wearer is enveloped in its captivating aura throughout the day and well into the night.</p>

<p>At the initial spritz, the fragrance opens with a burst of freshness from the top notes, where the zesty notes of Bergamot seamlessly blend with the warmth of Allspice and the herbal allure of Oregano. This dynamic combination sets the stage for an olfactory journey that is both invigorating and mysterious.</p>

<p>As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes unfold, revealing a rich tapestry of scents. Opoponax, Incense, Amber, and Labdanum come together to create a complex and alluring bouquet. The resinous sweetness of Opoponax dances with the ancient charm of Incense, while Amber and Labdanum add depth and warmth, creating a scent profile that is both intriguing and sophisticated.</p>

<p>The journey concludes with the lingering base notes, leaving an indelible impression. Sandalwood and Patchouli provide an earthy foundation, while Leather and Oud infuse an exotic and sensuous quality. The inclusion of Oud, a highly prized and rare ingredient, adds a touch of opulence, making this fragrance truly distinctive.</p>

<p>Paris Corner Killer Oud is celebrated not just for its captivating scent but also for being a remarkable Inspired of the prestigious Interlude Man by Amouage. This budget-friendly alternative allows individuals to experience the luxury and grandeur associated with Interlude Man without compromising on quality. Embrace the mystique and allure of Paris Corner Killer Oud, a fragrance that leaves an unforgettable trail of sophistication and masculinity.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,395.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Killer-Oud.png?v=1779878628,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
