decant-partial-of-paris-corner-killer-oud-lyre-intense-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Killer Oud Lyre Intense EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Killer Oud Lyre Intense, a captivating olfactory experience for the discerning man who appreciates the allure of mystique and luxury. This 100ml Eau de Parfum is more than just a fragrance; it's an embodiment of timeless elegance and sophistication.</p>

<p>Crafted for the man who demands longevity, Killer Oud Lyre Intense boasts an extraordinary staying power that lingers throughout the day and well into the night. The fragrance opens with a symphony of invigorating top notes, including the citrusy burst of Bergamot, the warmth of Cardamom, the spicy allure of Cinnamon, and the zesty essence of Ginger. This initial olfactory journey sets the stage for the aromatic adventure that follows.</p>

<p>In the heart of the fragrance, a harmonious blend of Ylang-Ylang, Rose, Orris Root, Geranium, Jasmine, and Angelica unfolds, creating a floral and spicy fusion that adds depth and complexity. As the fragrance evolves, the base notes emerge, leaving an indelible impression. A rich tapestry of Woodsy Notes, Sandalwood, Tonka Bean, Patchouli, Vanilla, Oakmoss, Vetiver, Incense, and Musk weaves together, creating a sensual and lingering trail.</p>

<p>Paris Corner Killer Oud Lyre Intense is not just a fragrance; it's an affordable masterpiece, reminiscent of the opulence found in the very expensive and esteemed Lyric Man by Amouage. This fragrance is a sublime Inspired, capturing the essence of the original with precision and finesse. Elevate your presence with this luxurious scent that transcends time, leaving an indelible mark wherever you go. Immerse yourself in the world of Killer Oud Lyre Intense, where sophistication meets affordability in a bottle of olfactory excellence.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,395.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Killer-Oud-Lyre-Intense.png?v=1779878630,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
