decant-partial-of-paris-corner-killer-oud-revolution-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Killer Oud Revolution EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Killer Oud Revolution, a captivating 100ml Eau de Parfum for men that transcends the ordinary, leaving an indelible mark with its intense and enduring fragrance. This scent is more than a perfume; it's a journey into the realms of sophistication and masculinity.</p>

<p>The top notes of Orange Blossom, Rosemary, Bitter Orange, and Red Pepper create an exhilarating opening, awakening the senses with a burst of citrusy and spicy accords. As the fragrance unfolds, the heart reveals a floral symphony of Neroli, Orris, Ylang-Ylang, and Jasmine, adding a layer of refinement and allure. These middle notes infuse the scent with a subtle floral complexity, striking a harmonious balance between freshness and sensuality.</p>

<p>The allure of Killer Oud Revolution lies in its robust and enduring base notes. Patchouli, Sandalwood, Cedarwood, and Vetiver form a solid foundation, grounding the fragrance in a rich, woody embrace. This olfactory journey culminates in a lingering trail that asserts its presence long after the initial application.</p>

<p>What sets Killer Oud Revolution apart is its remarkable longevity. As a super long-lasting perfume, it accompanies you throughout the day, making a statement wherever you go. The fragrance seamlessly transitions from day to night, from casual outings to formal affairs, ensuring that you leave a lasting impression.</p>

<p>Notably, Killer Oud Revolution is revered as an exquisite Inspired of the opulent and sought-after Reflection Man by Amouage. This makes it not just a signature scent but also a budget-friendly alternative to a fragrance synonymous with luxury. Embrace the revolution of scent with Paris Corner Killer Oud Revolution, a fragrance that speaks volumes about your style, sophistication, and lasting impact.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,395.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/killer-oud-revolution.png?v=1779878631,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
