decant-partial-of-paris-corner-magic-oud-sandal-wood-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Magic Oud Sandal Wood EDP,"<p>Paris Corner's Magic Oud Sandal Wood Eau de Parfum for men is an olfactory masterpiece that weaves an enchanting tale of opulence and sophistication. This 100ML fragrance is not just a scent; it's an experience, a journey through layers of aromatic excellence.</p>

<p>The top notes of Neroli and Jasmine greet your senses with a burst of floral freshness, setting the stage for the luxurious symphony that follows. As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes unfold, revealing a captivating blend of Peach, Rose, and Cinnamon. This combination adds a sensual warmth to the composition, creating an alluring and inviting aura.</p>

<p>The base notes of Magic Oud Sandal Wood anchor the fragrance in a rich tapestry of exotic essences. Santalwood, a timeless and precious wood note, mingles with the sophisticated Leather, creating a strong and assertive foundation. Amber notes and Oud contribute a touch of oriental mystique, infusing the fragrance with depth and intensity. The lingering trail is then embraced by the soft and alluring embrace of Musk notes, leaving an unforgettable imprint.</p>

<p>What sets Magic Oud Sandal Wood apart is its remarkable longevity. This Eau de Parfum is not just a fragrance; it's a commitment that stays with you throughout the day, ensuring that you make a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>Top: Neroli, jasmine</p>

<p>Middle: Peach, rose, cinnamon</p>

<p>Base: santalwood, leather note, amber notes, oud, musks note.</p>

<p>Furthermore, this fragrance is celebrated as an exceptional alternative to the renowned Les Absolus d'Orient Santal Royal by Guerlain. The Magic Oud Sandal Wood is a masterful Inspired, offering a budget-friendly option without compromising on quality and elegance. Immerse yourself in the magic of this scent, and let it become an integral part of your identity, elevating your presence with each spritz.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,348.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Magic-oud-sandal-wood.png?v=1779878632,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,woody,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
