decant-partial-of-paris-corner-barcode-signature-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Barcode Signature EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Barcode Signature, a captivating olfactory journey encapsulated in a 100ml Eau de Parfum designed for men who appreciate the artistry of fragrance. This scent is not merely a fleeting experience; it is an enduring symphony that resonates throughout the day, boasting an impressive longevity that sets it apart in the realm of perfumery.</p>

<p>At the pinnacle of this aromatic composition are the invigorating top notes of Bergamot, Mandarin, and Neroli. The citrusy burst of Bergamot dances harmoniously with the zesty allure of Mandarin, while Neroli adds a touch of floral sophistication, creating an initial impression that is both refreshing and refined.</p>

<p>As the fragrance unfolds, the heart reveals a nuanced blend of Green Tea and Blackcurrant. The earthy, slightly bitter nuances of Green Tea interlace seamlessly with the sweet and tangy essence of Blackcurrant, establishing a magnetic core that draws you into its verdant embrace.</p>

<p>The foundation of Barcode Signature rests upon a solid base of Musk and Sandalwood, providing a warm and sensual trail that lingers on the skin. Musk imparts a subtle animalic allure, adding depth to the composition, while the creamy, woody notes of Sandalwood contribute a touch of luxury and sophistication.</p>

<p>Top notes: Bergamot, mandarin and neroli</p>

<p>Middle notes: Green tea and blackcurrant</p>

<p>Base notes: Musk and sandalwood</p>

<p>What makes Barcode Signature truly noteworthy is its distinguished resemblance to the renowned Silver Mountain Water by Creed. This budget-friendly alternative captures the essence of the opulent original, offering a compelling option for those who seek a high-quality fragrance without the exorbitant price tag.</p>

<p>In essence, Paris Corner Barcode Signature is not just a perfume; it's an olfactory masterpiece that accompanies you throughout the day, leaving an indelible mark of sophistication and style. Elevate your presence with this exquisite blend that seamlessly marries longevity, affordability, and a captivating aroma inspired by the timeless allure of Silver Mountain Water.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,335.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Barcode-Signature.png?v=1779878633,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
