decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-voux-elegante-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Emir Voux Elegante EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Voux Elegante 100ML Eau de Parfum for Men is an exquisite olfactory journey that exudes elegance, longevity, and character. Crafted with a meticulous blend of aromatic notes, this fragrance is a captivating alternative to the renowned XJ 1861 Naxos by Xerjoff, ensuring you experience luxury at an affordable price.</p>

<p>The top notes of cinnamon, lavender, and honey greet your senses with a warm, sweet embrace. This initial burst is inviting and intriguing, setting the stage for what's to come. As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes of jasmine, bergamot, and tobacco take center stage. The jasmine adds a touch of floral sophistication, balanced by the bergamot's citrusy freshness and the smoky allure of tobacco. Vanilla lends a creamy, gourmand quality that's both comforting and irresistible.</p>

<p>The base notes of cardamom, lemon, cashmeran, and tonka bean provide a rich and lasting foundation for Emir Voux Elegante. Cardamom adds a spicy twist, while lemon contributes a zesty, vibrant undertone. The fragrance's depth is enhanced by the woody, musky nuances of cashmeran and the sweet, warm embrace of tonka bean.</p>

<p>Top Notes -Cinnamon, lavender, honey</p>

<p>Heart Notes - jasmine, bergamot, tobacco, vanilla,</p>

<p>Base Notes - cardamom, lemon, cashmeran and tonka bean.</p>

<p>One of the most outstanding features of this scent is its remarkable longevity, ensuring that it lingers on your skin throughout the day or night. With Emir Voux Elegante, you can confidently make a lasting impression, exuding sophistication and style. Whether you're dressing up for a special occasion or adding a touch of luxury to your everyday life, this fragrance is the perfect companion.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,373.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Voux-Elegante.png?v=1779878639,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-voux-elegante-edp,,,,,,,,,85ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1471.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Decant_Image.png?v=1781928894,2,"",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,
decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-arcana-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Emir Arcana EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Arcana 100ML Eau de Parfum is a captivating fragrance that transcends the boundaries of gender. This scent is not just long-lasting; it's an olfactory journey that lingers in memory, leaving a trail of allure and sophistication. With an enchanting blend of notes, it evokes the essence of the iconic Kirke by Tiziana Terenzi, making it a remarkable alternative for fragrance enthusiasts.</p>

<p>At its opening, Emir Arcana unleashes a burst of fruity vibrancy. The top notes of passionfruit, peach, pear, raspberry, cassis, and sand create a juicy and tantalizing introduction. This symphony of fruits dances on your skin, exuding a sense of opulence.</p>

<p>As the fragrance matures, it gracefully transitions into the heart of the composition, where delicate lily-of-the-valley takes center stage. This floral accord adds a touch of elegance, balancing the fruity exuberance with its subtle, dewy sweetness.</p>

<p>The base notes of musk, sandalwood, vanilla, patchouli, and heliotrope provide a warm and sensuous foundation to Emir Arcana. These elements create an embracing and enduring aroma that clings to your skin, making it an ideal choice for those who appreciate longevity in their scents.</p>

<p>Top: Passionfruit, Peach, Pear, Raspberry, Cassis, Sand</p>

<p>Middle: Lily-of-the-Valley</p>

<p>Base: Musk, Sandalwood, Vanilla, Patchouli, Heliotrope</p>

<p>Emir Arcana is a fragrance that defies traditional gender boundaries, making it an enticing choice for both men and women. Its resemblance to Kirke by Tiziana Terenzi offers an affordable alternative without compromising on quality and allure. Whether worn during the day or for an evening soiree, Paris Corner's Emir Arcana is an enchanting elixir that exudes luxury and charm.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,395.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Emir-arcana.png?v=1779878640,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-arcana-edp,,,,,,,,,80ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1559.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Decant_Image.png?v=1781928894,2,"",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,
decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-you-re-drugged-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Emir You’re Drugged EDP,"<p>Paris Corner's ""Emir You're Drugged"" Eau de Parfum for Men is a captivating olfactory journey, a fragrance that leaves an unforgettable trail. This 100ml bottle houses an elixir of pure sophistication and power, making it a must-have for the modern man seeking to leave a lasting impression.</p>

<p>This scent opens with an intriguing blend of top notes, where the warmth of cinnamon intertwines with the bold, intoxicating aroma of whiskey. It's an entrance that commands attention and exudes confidence. As the fragrance settles, the heart notes emerge, offering a symphony of cardamom's spicy, green allure and the sensual, earthy richness of nutmeg. Together, they create an alluring and mysterious depth.</p>

<p>What truly sets ""Emir You're Drugged"" apart is its base, where the essence of coffee and vanilla unfolds. This dynamic combination forms a luscious, aromatic foundation that envelops you in an aura of sensuality and charm. It's a scent that lingers throughout the day and into the night, ensuring you're unforgettable in every setting.</p>

<p>Top notes are Cinnamon and Whiskey</p>

<p>Middle notes are Cardamom and Nutmeg</p>

<p>Base notes are Coffee and Vanilla.</p>

<p>The perfume's longevity is remarkable, making it perfect for long days and nights. Not only is it an olfactory powerhouse, but it's also an excellent budget-friendly alternative to the renowned ""Intoxicated"" by By Kilian. ""Emir You're Drugged"" captures the essence of the original fragrance, making it a smart choice for those who appreciate luxury scents without the premium price tag. This fragrance is for the modern gentleman who craves a unique and long-lasting signature scent that commands attention and respect.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,415.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Emir-Youre-Drugged.png?v=1779878642,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-you-re-drugged-edp,,,,,,,,,90ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1934.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Decant_Image.png?v=1781928894,2,"",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,
decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-cedrat-essence-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Emir Cedrat Essence EDP,"<p>Paris Corner's Emir Cedrat Essence 75ml Eau de Parfum for Men is the epitome of long-lasting luxury in a bottle. This exceptional fragrance captivates the senses with its exquisite blend of notes, creating an olfactory experience that is both timeless and modern.</p>

<p>At the outset, the top notes of Sicilian Lemon, Black Currant, Bergamot, and a hint of Spicy Notes burst forth, leaving a fresh and invigorating trail in their wake. The citrusy brightness of the lemon and the richness of black currant create an initial impression that is nothing short of captivating.</p>

<p>As this captivating scent unfolds, the heart notes emerge, featuring a harmonious fusion of Fruity Notes, Patchouli Leaf, and Water Jasmine. This combination strikes a perfect balance between earthy and floral, adding depth and complexity to the fragrance.</p>

<p>The journey concludes with a base that exudes sophistication and masculinity. Cedar, Leather, Sandalwood, Vanilla, White Musk, and Moss intertwine to form a warm and alluring foundation. The interplay of these elements creates a sensuous dry-down that lingers throughout the day, making Emir Cedrat Essence a truly enduring scent.</p>

<p>Top: Sicilian Lemon, Black Currant, Bergamot and Spicy Notes</p>

<p>Middle: Fruity Notes, Patchouli Leaf and Water Jasmine</p>

<p>Base: Cedar, Leather, Sandalwood, Vanilla, White Musk and Moss</p>

<p>This fragrance is undoubtedly a remarkable tribute to the ever-popular Cedrat Boise by Mancera, offering a budget-friendly alternative that doesn't compromise on quality or longevity. Paris Corner has masterfully crafted a fragrance that mirrors the allure of its inspiration while adding its own unique touch. Emir Cedrat Essence is a testament to timeless sophistication, making it the perfect choice for the modern man seeking an enduring and distinctive signature scent.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,433.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/emir-cedrat-essence.png?v=1779878642,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-cedrat-essence-edp,,,,,,,,,65ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1516.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Decant_Image.png?v=1781928894,2,"",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,
decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-vibrant-orange-and-neroli-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Emir Vibrant Orange And Neroli EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Vibrant Orange and Neroli is an olfactory masterpiece designed for the modern man who exudes confidence and charm. This 100ml Eau de Parfum is more than just a fragrance; it's a statement, an aura that lingers in the air. Crafted to be exceptionally long-lasting, it ensures that your presence is memorable wherever you go.</p>

<p>At the top, Emir Vibrant Orange and Neroli opens with a burst of invigorating freshness, combining the zesty notes of Mandarin Orange and Californian Lemon. This citrusy embrace is the perfect introduction to the symphony that follows.</p>

<p>In the heart of the fragrance, Neroli and Jasmine Sambac take center stage, adding a floral elegance that's both sophisticated and inviting. The interplay between these floral notes creates a harmonious blend that resonates with refinement.</p>

<p>As the scent settles, the base notes of Cotton Candy and White Musk emerge, leaving a sweet and sensuous trail that lingers on your skin, a subtle reminder of your presence. This unique combination of notes creates a signature scent that's truly captivating.</p>

<p>Top: Mandarin Orange and Californian Lemon</p>

<p>Middle: Neroli and Jasmine Sambac</p>

<p>Base: Cotton Candy and White Musk</p>

<p>Emir Vibrant Orange and Neroli is celebrated for its remarkable resemblance to the much-loved and expensive fragrance, Sundazed by Byredo. Now, you can indulge in this budget-friendly alternative without compromising on quality or longevity. With its vibrant, long-lasting, and affordable charm, Emir Vibrant Orange and Neroli is the perfect olfactory companion for any occasion, adding an air of sophistication to your everyday style.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,373.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Emir-vibrant-orange-neroli.png?v=1779878643,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-vibrant-orange-and-neroli-edp,,,,,,,,,80ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1384.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Decant_Image.png?v=1781928894,2,"",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,
decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-vertex-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Emir Vertex EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Vertex is a captivating olfactory masterpiece, epitomizing the essence of luxury and elegance in a 100ML Eau de Parfum for Men. This fragrance stands out as an exceptional, long-lasting perfume that will leave an indelible mark on anyone who encounters it.</p>

<p>The top notes of Orange, Mandarin Orange, Bergamot, and Lemon create a vibrant and citrusy opening that is both refreshing and invigorating. As it settles, the heart notes emerge, featuring Pineapple, Cistus Incanus, and Jasmine. These notes infuse a lush, tropical sweetness, balanced by the aromatic resinous quality of Cistus Incanus.</p>

<p>The base notes of Paris Corner Emir Vertex are a symphony of earthy and woody elements, including Cypress, Balsam Fir, Oakmoss, Leather, Patchouli, and Tobacco. These rich and robust accords create a sensuous foundation, enriched with Olibanum, Juniper Berries, Musk, and Cashmere Wood. The fragrance evolves with Labdanum, Amber, Sandalwood, Elemi resin, Galbanum, Rum, Ambergris, and Benzoin, adding depth and complexity to its character.</p>

<p>Emir Vertex is celebrated as a remarkable Inspired of the prestigious Apex by Roja Dove, capturing the opulence and sophistication of the original in a more budget-friendly package. It exudes an aura of opulence and prestige, making it a perfect choice for those who seek luxury in their everyday lives.</p>

<p>Top notes are Orange, Mandarin Orange, Bergamot and Lemon</p>

<p>Middle notes are Pineapple, Cistus Incanus and Jasmine</p>

<p>Base notes are Cypress, Balsam Fir, Oakmoss, Leather, Patchouli, Tobacco, Olibanum, Juniper Berries, Musk, Cashmere Wood, Labdanum, Amber, Sandalwood, Elemi resin, Galbanum, Rum, Ambergris and Benzoin.</p>

<p>In essence, Paris Corner Emir Vertex is a testament to the artistry of perfumery, a scent that lingers with distinction, and a fragrance that mirrors the pinnacle of olfactory excellence. This fragrance is a gateway to the world of luxury scents, making it a timeless addition to any collection.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,400.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Emir-Vertex.png?v=1779878645,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-vertex-edp,,,,,,,,,80ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1599.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Decant_Image.png?v=1781928894,2,"",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,
decant-partial-of-paris-corner-north-stag-hypnotic-oud-quinze-xv-extrait-de-parfum,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner North Stag Hypnotic Oud Quinze XV Extrait De Parfum,"<p>Introducing Paris Corner's North Stag Hypnotic Oud Quinze XV Extrait De Parfum, a masterpiece in the realm of men's fragrances. This 100ml elixir is not just a scent; it's an olfactory journey, a captivating tale of masculine allure that leaves an indelible mark.</p>

<p>The longevity of this fragrance is truly remarkable. It weaves an aromatic tale that begins with an intoxicating blend of top notes. As soon as it touches your skin, the scent comes alive with the exotic and spicy fusion of Cypriol, Labdanum, saffron, cardamom, cinnamon, and the zesty brightness of grapefruit. These opening notes create an immediate, alluring impression, making you impossible to forget.</p>

<p>The heart of this fragrance reveals its depth and complexity with a rich combination of woody notes, amber, velvety sandalwood, the sweet allure of jasmine, and the earthy aroma of tobacco. These middle notes create a warm and inviting essence that draws people closer to you, like a magnetic force.</p>

<p>As the scent settles and evolves, it reaches its grand crescendo in the base notes. Here, leather and musk intertwine with the sensuous richness of tonka bean and the legendary presence of oud. The base notes are where the true longevity of this fragrance becomes evident, lingering on your skin for hours, if not days.</p>

<p>Top: Cypriol, Labdanum, saffron, cardamom, cinnamon and grapefruit</p>

<p>Middle: Woody notes, Amber, Sandalwood, Jasmine and Tobacco</p>

<p>Base: Leather, Musk, Tonka and Oud</p>

<p>Paris Corner's North Stag Hypnotic Oud Quinze XV Extrait De Parfum is a masterpiece that can be likened to a fine wine - it only gets better with time. As you wear this fragrance, you'll experience the evolution of scents, from the initial burst of exotic spices to the deep, intoxicating embrace of the base notes. This fragrance isn't just a scent; it's an experience, a story that lingers in the memories of those you encounter.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,468.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/North-stag-hypnotic-oud.png?v=1779878646,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,extrait,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
