decant-partial-of-paris-corner-north-stag-sept-vii-extrait-de-parfum,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner North Stag Sept VII Extrait De Parfum,"Paris Corner's North Stag SEPT VII Extrait De Parfum, a captivating olfactory journey that defines sophistication and timeless elegance. This meticulously crafted fragrance, presented in a generous 100 ml flacon, is a testament to the art of perfumery, designed exclusively for the modern man who exudes charisma and confidence.

At the heart of this exquisite scent lies a symphony of meticulously selected notes, drawing inspiration from the legendary Aventus by Creed. North Stag SEPT VII opens with a burst of freshness, where top notes of Melon, Cucumber, Pineapple, Bergamot, and Black Currant intertwine, creating an invigorating and memorable first impression. These zesty top notes are reminiscent of a sun-kissed orchard, setting the stage for an olfactory experience like no other.

As the fragrance evolves, the middle notes of Patchouli, Jasmine, Sage, and Basil come into play, adding depth and complexity. The earthy, herbal qualities of patchouli harmonize with the delicate floral hints of jasmine, sage, and basil, resulting in a well-balanced and masculine heart.

The journey culminates in the rich and enduring base notes of Musk, Woody Notes, Vanilla, and Ambergris. These elements provide a solid foundation, leaving an unforgettable trail that lingers in your wake. The interplay of musk and woody notes adds sensuality, while vanilla and ambergris bring warmth and depth to the fragrance.

Top: Melon, Cucumber, Pineapple, Bergamot and Black Current

Middle: Patchouli, Jasmine, Sage &amp; Basil

Base: Musk, Woody notes, Vanilla &amp; Ambergris

Paris Corner's North Stag SEPT VII Extrait De Parfum is not just a fragrance; it's a statement. With its long-lasting performance and captivating aroma, this scent pays homage to the timeless Aventus by Creed while carving its path in the world of Chypre Fruity fragrances for men. Elevate your presence, embrace your allure, and leave an indelible mark with every spritz of this remarkable fragrance.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,465.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-North-stag-SEPT-VII-Extrait-De-Parfum-100-ml-1.png?v=1779878652,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,extrait,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
