decant-partial-of-paris-corner-north-stag-huit-viii-extrait-de-parfum,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner North Stag Huit VIII Extrait De Parfum,"Paris Corner's North Stag Huit VIII Extrait De Parfum, a 100ml olfactory masterpiece designed for the discerning modern man. This fragrance embodies sophistication and power, capturing the essence of a timeless gentleman.

At the top of this olfactory journey, you're greeted with an invigorating burst of Pink pepper, bergamot, lavender, and grapefruit. These opening notes are an elegant blend of citrusy freshness with a hint of spice, setting the stage for what's to come.

As the fragrance unfolds, the heart notes reveal themselves in a captivating symphony. Saffron, cinnamon, and black pepper infuse warmth and sensuality into the composition, creating a rich and spicy core that exudes confidence and charisma.

The base notes of tobacco, vanilla, leather, and vetiver provide the fragrance with a solid foundation, anchoring it in a deep and alluring masculinity. The interplay of these elements forms a seductive and long-lasting dry down that lingers on the skin, leaving an indelible impression.

Top notes are Pink Pepper, elemi, Bergamot and Grapefruit

Middle notes are Cinnamon, Saffron and Paprika

Base notes are Tobacco, Leather and Vetiver.

North Stag Huit VIII Extrait De Parfum is a homage to the iconic Spicebomb by Viktor&amp;Rolf, embodying the same spirit of a woody, spicy fragrance but at a fraction of the cost. This fragrance speaks to the man who is both refined and daring, who commands attention without saying a word. With its impressive longevity, it's the perfect companion for any occasion, whether it's a formal event or a night out on the town. Elevate your scent game with this captivating and affordable alternative to the classic favorite. Paris Corner has once again delivered an exceptional fragrance for the modern man who knows what he wants.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,465.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-North-Stag-Huit-VIII-Extrait-De-Parfum-100-ml-1.png?v=1779878652,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,extrait,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
