decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-fire-your-desire-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Emir Fire Your Desire EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Fire Your Desire is a captivating and gender-neutral fragrance that sets hearts ablaze with its sultry blend of notes. This 100ml Eau de Parfum is a luxurious olfactory experience that evokes warmth, sensuality, and a touch of mystery.</p>

<p>At the top, Emir Fire Your Desire opens with the rich and inviting aroma of Cognac, immediately setting a sophisticated and alluring tone. As the scent unfolds, it reveals its heart notes of Cinnamon, Tonka Bean, and Oak. These elements add depth and complexity, infusing the fragrance with a spicy, woody allure that is both comforting and enticing.</p>

<p>The base notes of Praline, Vanilla, and Sandalwood bring a sweet, creamy, and velvety richness to the fragrance. They create a lasting impression that lingers on the skin, leaving a trail of warmth and seduction wherever you go.</p>

<p>Emir Fire Your Desire is inspired by the renowned Angels' Share by By Kilian, an Amber Vanilla fragrance that has captivated both men and women with its intoxicating charm. This Paris Corner creation pays homage to the original while offering an affordable alternative that doesn't compromise on quality or longevity.</p>

<p>Top note is Cognac;</p>

<p>Middle notes are Cinnamon, Tonka Bean and Oak</p>

<p>Base notes are Praline, Vanilla and Sandalwood.</p>

<p>Whether worn by a man or a woman, Emir Fire Your Desire is a fragrance that ignites passion and desire. It's the perfect choice for those who appreciate a scent that's as bold and unforgettable as they are. Let Emir Fire Your Desire envelop you in its alluring embrace, and experience the magic of this exquisite fragrance.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,395.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Fire-Your-Desire-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878653,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
