decant-partial-of-paris-corner-atoof-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Atoof EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Atoof 100ML Eau de Parfum for men is an olfactory masterpiece that captivates the senses and exudes an air of timeless elegance. This fragrance is a compelling homage to the classic Rosendo Mateu No 5 Floral, Amber, Sensual Musk, a testament to its enduring appeal. Atoof presents a symphony of notes that unfolds with sophistication and intrigue.</p>

<p>At first encounter, the top notes embrace you with a spicy and exotic floral dance, reminiscent of the most luxurious blooms and a touch of spice that adds an enigmatic allure. The heart of the fragrance unveils a rich bouquet of carnation and lily-of-the-valley, creating a refined and harmonious blend that resonates with the senses.</p>

<p>As the scent journey continues, the base notes of amber, vanilla, and musk take center stage. These warm, sensual accords create a lasting and seductive trail that lingers on the skin, making Atoof a fragrance that is both memorable and irresistible.</p>

<p>Atoof, with its exceptional longevity and sillage, is perfect for the modern man who appreciates the timeless appeal of Rosendo Mateu's masterpiece No 05. This fragrance is more than a Inspired; it's a tribute to the artistry of scent-making, allowing you to experience the sophistication and sensuality of the original masterpiece in a new and captivating form.</p>

<p>Top notes are Spices and Exotic floral notes</p>

