<p>Base notes are Amber, Vanilla and Musk.</p>

<p>Indulge in the luxurious world of Paris Corner Atoof, where tradition meets innovation, and sensuality knows no bounds. This 100ML Eau de Parfum is a statement of sophistication and style, designed for the discerning man who seeks an unforgettable olfactory experience.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,376.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Atoof-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878656,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
