decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-the-triumphant-sapphire-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Emir The Triumphant Sapphire EDP,"<p>Emir The Triumphant Sapphire is a remarkable olfactory masterpiece that exudes sophistication and power in every spritz. This 100ML Eau de Parfum for men is a true triumph in the world of fragrance, capturing the essence of luxury and masculinity in a bottle.</p>

<p>At its first encounter, Emir The Triumphant Sapphire unfolds with an invigorating burst of top notes. Lemon, Chamomile, Sage, Saffron, and Tagetes blend harmoniously to create a zesty, herbal introduction that's both refreshing and intriguing. As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes emerge, showcasing a delicate bouquet of Rose, Indian Jasmine, and Magnolia. These floral tones add depth and sensuality to the composition, giving it a timeless quality.</p>

<p>The base notes of Agarwood (Oud), Patchouli, and Amber provide a solid foundation, leaving a lasting impression that is both woody and warm. This rich and alluring base lingers on the skin, creating an aura of sophistication and allure.</p>

<p>Emir The Triumphant Sapphire is a masterful Inspired of Blue Sapphire by Boadicea the Victorious, known for its amber-woody character. This fragrance pays homage to its predecessor while offering a more accessible option without compromising on quality or longevity. It embodies the spirit of a triumphant conqueror, confident and regal.</p>

<p>Top notes are Lemon, Chamomile, Sage, Saffron and Tagetes</p>

<p>Middle notes are Rose, Indian Jasmine and Magnolia</p>

<p>Base notes are Agarwood (Oud), Patchouli and Amber.</p>

<p>This EDP is more than just a fragrance; it's a statement of power and refinement. With its impressive sillage and longevity, it's the perfect choice for a confident and modern man who seeks to leave a lasting impression wherever he goes. Paris Corner has truly created a triumphant masterpiece with Emir The Triumphant Sapphire.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,360.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-The-Triumphant-Sapphire-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878658,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
