<p>With its remarkable resemblance to Tom Ford's Tobacco Vanille, Paris Corner Charuto Tobacco Vanille 100ml for men is a true gem in the world of fragrances. It captures the essence of amber and spice, making it an irresistible choice for the modern man who seeks sophistication and charisma in every aspect of his life. Indulge in the allure of this scent and leave a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,396.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Charuto-Tobacco-Vanille-100ml.png?v=1779878661,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
