decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-voux-spices-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Emir Voux Spices EDP,"Paris Corner Emir Voux Spices 100ML EDP, an exquisite olfactory symphony that defies conventional boundaries. This captivating fragrance, designed for both women and men, is a harmonious blend of daring spices and luxurious woods, embodying the perfect balance between strength and elegance. Inspired Of Ivory Route by Xerjoff

Crafted for those with a penchant for long-lasting fragrances, Emir Voux Spices envelops the senses in a lingering embrace that endures throughout the day. A true masterpiece for coffee enthusiasts, this scent boasts an irresistible coffee note that lends an invigorating and distinctive character.

The journey through Emir Voux Spices begins with its top notes, a fiery dance of spicy accords that awaken the senses with a burst of energy. As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes emerge, revealing the sensual embrace of sandalwood and patchouli. These precious woods intertwine, adding depth and warmth to the composition, while also creating a mesmerizing aura that draws people closer.

Finally, the base notes leave an indelible impression with the harmonious combination of allspice and basil. This distinctive blend exudes a captivating freshness that is both invigorating and soothing, leaving a trail that is as unforgettable as it is sophisticated.

Emir Voux Spices transcends gender norms, appealing to those who appreciate the complexity of fragrances that are rich and multifaceted. Whether worn to make a statement or to elevate daily experiences, this fragrance encapsulates the spirit of modern luxury and individuality.

In a sleek and elegant 100ML bottle, Paris Corner's Emir Voux Spices EDP is a testament to the artistry of perfumery, capturing the essence of passion, confidence, and the joy of savoring life's most alluring scents.

Top Notes - Spicy Notes
Heart Notes - Sandalwood &amp; Patchouli
Base Notes - Allspice &amp; Basil",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,373.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Voux-Spices-100ML-EDP.webp?v=1780393673,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,spicy,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
