decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-voux-blue-oud-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Emir Voux Blue Oud EDP,"<p>Experience the allure of Parisian elegance and Middle Eastern mystique with Paris Corner's Emir Voux Blue Oud Eau de Parfum, a luxurious olfactory journey designed for both women and men. This enchanting fragrance is a true testament to the artistry of perfumery, delivering an exquisite blend of contrasting notes that captivate the senses and leave a lasting impression. Inspired Of More Than Words by Xerjoff</p>

<p>At the heart of Emir Voux Blue Oud lies the soul-stirring aroma of Oud, a rich and deep note that anchors the composition in a sense of opulence and tradition. The fragrance opens with a burst of fruity notes that dance like sunlight through a blossoming orchard, infusing an air of freshness and playfulness. As the scent develops, floral notes unfurl delicately, weaving a tapestry of elegance and grace.</p>

<p>The journey takes a delightful twist as spicy notes intermingle, adding a dash of intrigue and sensuality. The warm embrace of ambergris lends a sophisticated depth, reminiscent of golden sands meeting the deep blue sea, while olibanum evokes a sense of sacred tranquility. Woody notes intertwine with labdanum, creating a harmonious balance between earthiness and ethereal beauty.</p>

<p>What sets Emir Voux Blue Oud apart is its exquisite homage to coffee lovers. As the fragrance evolves, an enchanting aroma of roasted coffee beans emerges, creating an intoxicating blend that awakens the senses and adds a unique twist to the traditional oud fragrance. This unexpected combination adds a layer of sophistication and modernity, making it a standout choice for those seeking a fragrance that defies convention.</p>

<p>Crafted with precision and dedication, Emir Voux Blue Oud is more than just a perfume – it's a journey, an experience, and a statement. Its long-lasting nature ensures that its captivating aura stays with you throughout the day and into the night, allowing you to exude confidence and charm wherever you go. Paris Corner's Emir Voux Blue Oud is the embodiment of luxury, passion, and innovation, a true masterpiece for fragrance enthusiasts who appreciate the art of scent composition.</p>

<p>Main Notes : Oud, fruity notes, floral notes, spicy notes, ambergris, olibanum, woody notes and labdanum.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,373.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Voux-Blue-Oud-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878664,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
