decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-voux-violette-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Emir Voux Violette EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Voux Violette EDP, a sublime fragrance that transcends traditional gender boundaries. This exquisite 100ML potion is a harmonious symphony of scents designed for both women and men who seek an enduring olfactory journey. Inspired Of Accento by Xerjoff</p>

<p>A testament to its longevity, Emir Voux Violette envelops the senses with an irresistible aromatic aura that lingers throughout the day. It's a fragrant masterpiece that caters to those with an affinity for the rich and invigorating aroma of coffee, making it an exceptional choice for coffee connoisseurs seeking a unique and luxurious scent.</p>

<p>At the outset, the perfume bursts forth with an intriguing blend of Pineapple and Hyacinth, creating a refreshing and vivacious opening that awakens the senses. As the scent settles, the heart notes come into play, intertwining Iris, Jasmine, and Pink Pepper. This fusion generates a magnetic and seductive allure, drawing others in with every whiff.</p>

<p>The journey culminates in the base notes, where the essence truly unveils its enduring character. The hypnotic dance of Musk, Vetiver, Amber, Vanilla, and Patchouli forms a sensual and intricate foundation that evokes depth and sophistication. This medley of elements not only contributes to the perfume's remarkable longevity but also leaves an indelible mark on the wearer's skin and memory.</p>

<p>Paris Corner Emir Voux Violette is more than a fragrance; it's an experience that defies norms and leaves a trail of enchantment. Whether worn by a man or a woman, its dynamic notes and long-lasting nature ensure that it becomes a part of their identity, a signature scent that captures their essence and elevates their presence. For those who appreciate the artistry of coffee and the art of perfumery, this exceptional EDP is an invitation to indulge in an unparalleled sensory adventure.</p>

<p>Top notes are Pineapple and Hyacinth</p>

<p>Middle notes are Iris, Jasmine and Pink Pepper</p>

<p>Base notes are Musk, Vetiver, Amber, Vanilla and Patchouli</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,373.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Voux-Violette-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878665,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
