decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-voux-turquoise-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Emir Voux Turquoise EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Voux Turquoise Eau de Parfum, a mesmerizing fragrance designed to entice both women and men into a world of sensory delight. This exquisite 100ML perfume is a testament to elegance and versatility, offering a long-lasting olfactory journey that lingers gracefully on the skin. Inspired Of Erba Pura by Xerjoff</p>

<p>Emir Voux Turquoise is a symphony of scents that beautifully marries the essence of coffee with a harmonious blend of notes. If you're a coffee aficionado, this fragrance is a must-have, as it skillfully intertwines the rich aroma of coffee with a myriad of other enticing ingredients.</p>

<p>Opening with a burst of invigorating freshness, the top notes include zesty Sicilian Orange, vibrant Calabrian Bergamot, and tangy Sicilian Lemon. This initial burst awakens the senses and sets the stage for the intriguing layers to come. The heart of the fragrance features a delightful fruitiness that adds a touch of sweetness and depth.</p>

<p>As the scent evolves, the base notes emerge, weaving a sense of warmth and sensuality. Madagascar Vanilla infuses a creamy sweetness, while White Musk contributes a soft, ethereal quality that envelops you in an irresistible embrace. Completing the composition, Amber lends a rich, resinous depth that adds complexity and sophistication.</p>

<p>The real magic of Emir Voux Turquoise lies in its ability to seamlessly blend masculine and feminine elements, creating a unisex fragrance that adapts beautifully to any occasion. Its remarkable longevity ensures that you can revel in its captivating aroma throughout the day and into the night.</p>

<p>Indulge your senses in the world of Paris Corner Emir Voux Turquoise, where the intoxicating notes of coffee, citrus, fruits, vanilla, musk, and amber converge to craft a fragrance that is truly enchanting and unforgettable.</p>

<p>Top notes are Sicilian Orange, Calabrian bergamot and Sicilian Lemon</p>

<p>Middle note is Fruits</p>

<p>Base notes are White Musk, Madagascar Vanilla and Amber.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,373.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Voux-Turquoise-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878666,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
