decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-super-crush-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Emir Super Crush EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Super Crush is a captivating and long-lasting fragrance tailored for the modern man who exudes charisma and confidence. This exquisite Eau de Parfum comes in a generous 100ML bottle, holding a remarkable blend of carefully selected notes that create an alluring and unforgettable scent experience. Inspired Of Instant Crush by Mancera</p>

<p>At the top, the fragrance opens with an invigorating burst of energy, featuring an enticing combination of Saffron, Ginger, Sicilian Mandarin, and Sicilian Bergamot. This vibrant blend immediately captures attention and sets the stage for what lies ahead.</p>

<p>Moving into the heart of the fragrance, the Middle Notes reveal a rich and harmonious bouquet of scents. Amberwood provides depth and warmth, complemented by the floral elegance of Moroccan Rose and Egyptian Jasmine. The exotic touch of Indonesian Patchouli Leaf adds a mysterious allure that draws people in, making this fragrance truly magnetic.</p>

<p>As the fragrance settles into its Base Notes, it leaves a lingering trail of sophistication and sensuality. Madagascar Vanilla infuses a sweet and creamy essence, while Sandalwood brings a woody and earthy quality to the composition. White Musk contributes a soft and comforting aura, further enhancing the allure. Finally, Oakmoss adds a touch of green and a sense of timeless elegance to the overall blend.</p>

<p>Paris Corner Emir Super Crush is an olfactory masterpiece that captures the essence of a modern-day gentleman who knows how to leave a lasting impression. Whether it's for a formal occasion or a casual rendezvous, this long-lasting fragrance will accompany him throughout the day, leaving a trail of undeniable charm and magnetic allure. Emir Super Crush is the perfect accessory to enhance a man's personality and presence, making it an essential addition to any fragrance collection.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Saffron, Ginger, Sicilian Mandarin and Sicilian Bergamot</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Amberwood, Moroccan Rose, Egyptian Jasmine and Indonesian Patchouli Leaf</p>

<p>Base Notes : Madagascar Vanilla, Sandalwood, White Musk and Oakmoss</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,427.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Super-Crush-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878669,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
