decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-trillium-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Emir Trillium EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Trillium is an exquisitely crafted and long-lasting fragrance designed for the modern man who exudes charisma and confidence. This captivating Eau de Parfum blends a harmonious symphony of aromatic notes, unveiling a captivating journey of olfactory pleasure that lingers throughout the day. Inspired Of Elysium Pour Homme Parfum Cologne by Roja Dove</p>

<p>At the top, a burst of zesty and invigorating citrus notes sets the stage. Sparkling grapefruit, lemon, bergamot, and lime intermingle with aromatic thyme, artemisia, and galbanum, creating an initial impression that is refreshing and uplifting.</p>

<p>In the heart of the fragrance, a fusion of sophistication and allure emerges. Aromatic vetiver and juniper merge with succulent berries and the irresistible sweetness of black currant and apple. The intriguing hint of pink pepper adds a touch of spice, while the warm embrace of cedar and the earthy essence of cypriol oil enhance the complexity. Soft and delicate florals, including lily-of-the-valley, jasmine, and rose, lend a graceful touch, balancing the composition.</p>

<p>As the scent settles into its base, a sense of sensuality and refinement takes center stage. Luxurious ambergris and supple leather create a rich and opulent foundation. The indulgent sweetness of vanilla and the resinous warmth of benzoin contribute to the allure, while the rich and smoky notes of labdanum bring depth and intensity.</p>

<p>The Paris Corner Emir Trillium EDP is a captivating fragrance that seamlessly transitions from day to night, making it the perfect companion for any occasion. Its long-lasting nature ensures that the wearer's presence remains unforgettable, leaving a trail of sophistication and elegance wherever they go. This fragrance is an ode to timeless masculinity and the epitome of confidence, embodying the spirit of the modern man who stands out effortlessly in any crowd.</p>

<p>Top: Grapefruit, Lemon, Bergamot, Lime, Thyme, Artemisia, Galbanum</p>

<p>Middle: Vetiver, Juniper, Berries, Black Currant, Apple, Pink Pepper, Cedar, Cypriol Oil or Nagarmotha, Lily-of-the-Valley, Jasmine, Rose</p>

<p>Base: Ambergris, Leather, Vanilla, Benzoin, Labdanum</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,400.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Trillium-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878670,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-trillium-edp,,,,,,,,,90ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1799.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Decant_Image.png?v=1781928894,2,"",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,
decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-patchouli-no-7-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Emir Patchouli No 7 EDP,"Paris Corner Emir Patchouli No 7 is a captivating and long-lasting fragrance designed exclusively for the modern man. This exquisite Eau de Parfum combines the richness of oriental scents with a touch of woody warmth, creating a luxurious olfactory experience that leaves a lasting impression. Inspired Of Moonlight Patchouli by Van Cleef &amp; Arpels

At the top, the fragrance opens with an enticing fusion of Patchouli Leaf, adding depth and earthiness, accompanied by the alluring allure of Cacao, enhancing its warm and inviting character. Woody Notes interlace these top accords, infusing the scent with a rugged and masculine edge.

Moving to the heart of the composition, the fragrant bouquet blossoms with the elegance of Bulgarian Rose, offering a delicate floral touch that complements the earlier notes. The soft and powdery Iris Flower enhances the heart, lending a refined and sophisticated element that gracefully balances the fragrance.

As the scent settles into its base, it reveals an irresistible blend of Suede and Leather, exuding an aura of sensuality and masculinity. These leather notes create a magnetic attraction, evoking images of a confident and charismatic gentleman. Additionally, a hint of Fruity Notes adds a playful twist, providing a subtle sweetness that enhances the overall allure.

Paris Corner Emir Patchouli No 7 60ML EDP is a captivating fragrance that embraces the essence of a modern man's spirit. Its long-lasting formula ensures it stays with you throughout the day, making it the perfect companion for any occasion, from business meetings to intimate evenings. This opulent and distinctive scent will undoubtedly leave a lasting impression and become a staple in any man's fragrance collection.

Top: Patchouli Leaf, Cacao, Woodsy Notes
Middle: Bulgarian Rose, Iris Flower
