decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-acadia-intenso-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Emir Acadia Intenso EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Acadia Intenso is a captivating and long-lasting fragrance designed for the modern man who exudes sophistication and charm. The scent opens with a burst of invigorating freshness, where zesty notes of Grapefruit and Lemon intermingle with the cool essence of Mint and the spicy allure of Pink Pepper and Coriander. Adding depth and complexity, the fragrance is enriched with the delightful and woody undertones of Bergamot and Aldehydes. Inspired Of Bleu de Chanel Eau de Parfum by Chanel</p>

<p>As the scent evolves, it reveals an intriguing heart that embraces the warmth of Ginger and Nutmeg, lending a subtle hint of spiciness, while the delicate essence of Jasmine and the succulent aroma of Melon add a touch of refinement and sweetness to the composition.</p>

<p>The base notes of Emir Acadia Intenso create a sensuous and captivating trail that lingers for hours on the skin. A mesmerizing blend of smoky Incense and rich Amber creates an aura of mystique, while the comforting embrace of Cedar and Sandalwood infuses a woody and earthy accord. The enigmatic and slightly earthy Patchouli intertwines with the sweet and resinous scent of Labdanum, further enhancing the depth of the fragrance. Finally, the luxurious and velvety essence of Amberwood leaves a lasting impression, adding an elegant and confident finish to this remarkable olfactory journey.</p>

<p>Emir Acadia Intenso is a versatile and timeless fragrance that perfectly complements the gentleman's personality, making it ideal for both casual and formal occasions. Its long-lasting nature ensures that the captivating aura of the wearer remains intact throughout the day or night, making it a worthy addition to any fragrance collection.vv</p>

<p>Top: Grapefruit, Lemon, Mint, Pink Pepper, Bergamot, Aldehydes and Coriander</p>

<p>Middle: Ginger, Nutmeg, Jasmine and Melon</p>

<p>Base: Incense, Amber, Cedar, Sandalwood, Patchouli, Labdanum and Amberwood</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,395.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Acadia-Intenso-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878673,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
