decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-when-soul-gets-high-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Emir When Soul Gets High EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir When Soul Gets High is an exquisite and long-lasting fragrance designed for men who appreciate sophistication and allure. This 100ML Eau de Parfum opens with a tantalizing blend of fruity and spicy notes, captivating the senses from the very first spritz. Inspired Of Back to Black by By Kilian</p>

<p>The top notes burst with the richness of juicy Cherry and luscious Raspberry, enhanced by the warmth of spicy Cardamom and zesty Bergamot. As the fragrance settles, the heart unfolds a luxurious bouquet, combining the earthiness of Nutmeg, the floral allure of Geranium, and the calming essence of Chamomile. This aromatic blend is balanced to perfection with a touch of Coriander, adding an intriguing twist to the composition.</p>

<p>The base notes lend an air of sensuality and depth to the fragrance. Sweet and creamy Vanilla harmonizes with the alluring sweetness of White Honey and the nutty essence of Almond, creating a rich and inviting aroma. The spicy and resinous blend of Tobacco, Gingerbread, Amber, and Olibanum adds a captivating intensity, while the woody accords of Virginia Cedar and Oak evoke a sense of strength and elegance. The smooth and comforting Tonka Bean and Benzoin leave a mesmerizing trail that lingers long after the initial application.</p>

<p>Emir When Soul Gets High is an opulent and sophisticated fragrance that encapsulates the essence of a confident and refined man. Ideal for special occasions or evening wear, this captivating scent will undoubtedly leave a lasting impression wherever you go. Whether you are attending a formal event or enjoying a night out, this fragrance will elevate your style and confidence to new heights.</p>

<p>Notes: White honey, Tobacco, Cherry, Vanilla, Raspberry, Almond, Gingerbread, Amber, Tonka Bean, Nutmeg, Benzoin, Chamomile, Saffron, Cardamom, Patchouli, French labdanum, Olibanum, Oak, Virginia Cedar, Coriander, Geranium, Bergamot</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,390.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-When-Soul-Gets-High-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878674,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
