decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-identity-oud-crescent-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Emir Identity Oud Crescent EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Identity Oud Crescent is an exquisite and captivating long-lasting fragrance tailored for men who seek to make a bold and sophisticated statement. This 100ML Eau de Parfum embodies the essence of luxury and elegance, capturing the allure of Parisian craftsmanship in every bottle.</p>

