<p>As the fragrance evolves, a rich and opulent heart emerges, blending the opulent charm of Turkish Rose with the smoky allure of Olibanum. Red Berries and Red Currant add a tantalizing fruity twist, while Violet adds a hint of floral sophistication. The heart of the scent is a symphony of contrasting elements, beautifully weaving together to create a distinctive and memorable experience.</p>

<p>Finally, the fragrance settles into a deep and sensual base that lingers on the skin for hours. The star of the show, Agarwood (Oud), unfolds its intense woody and resinous facets, exuding an aura of luxury and prestige. Leather and Patchouli add a touch of masculinity and earthiness, while Amber and Sandalwood provide a warm and inviting embrace, rounding off the composition with a hint of creamy sweetness.</p>

<p>Paris Corner Emir Identity Oud Crescent is a masterpiece of fragrance craftsmanship, fusing together premium ingredients to create a scent that leaves a lasting impression wherever it goes. This intoxicating blend is ideal for formal occasions, romantic evenings, or any moment when a man desires to leave a trail of sophistication and allure in his wake.</p>

