decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-oud-and-vanilla-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Emir Oud And Vanilla EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Oud and Vanilla 75ML EDP is an exquisite and long-lasting fragrance tailored for sophisticated men who seek an aura of elegance and charisma. This captivating scent is a perfect blend of classic and contemporary, evoking a sense of mystery and allure. Inspired Of Aoud Vanille by Mancera</p>

<p>At the very first whiff, the top notes enchant the senses with a rich fusion of precious ingredients. The opulent and woody Agarwood, commonly known as Oud, takes the lead, leaving an intriguing trail of earthy warmth. A spicy kick follows, courtesy of the zesty Black Pepper, which is complemented by the aromatic and exotic Saffron, infusing the fragrance with a captivating allure. The inclusion of Cardamom adds a touch of sweetness and a hint of green freshness, making the opening an enticing experience.</p>

<p>The heart of the fragrance boasts a bouquet of delicate floral notes, which add a touch of refinement and balance to the composition. These floral accords exude a sense of luxury and enhance the masculine charm of the scent.</p>

<p>As the fragrance gracefully settles, the base notes emerge, weaving a luxurious tapestry of sensuality. Madagascar Vanilla lends its sweet and creamy essence, enveloping the wearer in a warm and inviting embrace. Guaiac Wood, with its smoky and leathery nuances, infuses a dash of strength and character to the scent. Finally, the smooth and velvety Sandalwood wraps up the composition, leaving a lasting impression of sophistication and elegance.</p>

<p>Emir Oud and Vanilla, with its unique combination of luxurious oud, delicate florals, and smooth vanilla, stands as a testament to Paris Corner's commitment to crafting captivating fragrances that leave a lasting impression. Ideal for special occasions or daily wear, this Eau de Parfum is a refined and powerful choice for the modern man seeking an enduring fragrance that mirrors his confident and sophisticated demeanor.</p>

<p>Top: Agarwood (Oud), Black Pepper, Saffron and Cardamom</p>

