decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-vanilla-and-roses-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Emir Vanilla And Roses EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Vanilla And Roses 75ML EDP, a captivating and long-lasting fragrance specially crafted for women. This exquisite scent takes you on a delightful olfactory journey, enveloping your senses with a harmonious blend of refreshing top notes, alluring middle notes, and warm, comforting base notes. Inspired of Roses Vanille by Mancera</p>

<p>At the first spritz, the top notes of Lemon and Water create a sparkling and invigorating opening that instantly energizes the senses. The zesty Lemon adds a tangy brightness while the refreshing Water Notes evoke a sense of purity and crispness.</p>

<p>As the fragrance settles, the heart reveals a bouquet of lush and romantic notes. The mesmerizing Middle notes of Rose and Sugar intertwine gracefully, exuding an air of elegance and femininity. The delicate sweetness of Sugar complements the timeless and classic allure of Rose, evoking feelings of love and passion.</p>

<p>Finally, the base notes of Vanilla, Sugar, White Musk, and Cedar provide a warm and comforting foundation that lingers on the skin throughout the day. The rich and creamy Vanilla blends harmoniously with the sweet Sugar, creating a soft and alluring aura. Subtle hints of White Musk add a touch of sensuality, while the earthy Cedar brings depth and sophistication to the composition.</p>

<p>This Paris Corner fragrance is masterfully balanced, capturing the essence of a blooming garden adorned with roses and wrapped in the embrace of vanilla-infused breezes. Ideal for the modern, confident woman, Emir Vanilla And Roses is the perfect choice for any occasion, whether it's a casual day out, an evening soirée, or a special romantic date. Be prepared to leave a lasting impression wherever you go with this captivating and enduring Eau de Parfum.</p>

<p>Top: Top: Lemon and Water Notes</p>

<p>Middle: Rose and Sugar</p>

