decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-lueur-despoir-arena-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Emir Lueur Despoir Arena EDP,"<p>Paris Corner's Emir Lueur Despoir Arena 100ML EDP is an exquisite fragrance that embodies timeless elegance and allure, making it the perfect choice for both men and women seeking a long-lasting and captivating scent. This luxurious Eau de Parfum boasts a carefully crafted composition that showcases a harmonious blend of notes, culminating in an enchanting olfactory experience.</p>

<p>At the heart of Emir Lueur Despoir Arena lies the essence of two distinct roses - Rose and Bulgarian Rose, creating a romantic and floral bouquet that evokes feelings of love and passion. To add depth and richness to the fragrance, Agarwood Oud comes into play, infusing a woody and resinous aroma that exudes sophistication and refinement.</p>

<p>As the fragrance unfolds on the skin, the mesmerizing allure of Ambergris emerges, offering a sensuous and captivating sweetness that lingers throughout the day. Saffron contributes a warm and spicy touch, adding a hint of opulence and extravagance to the overall scent. Finally, a subtle kick of Black Pepper spices up the blend, leaving a lingering trail of alluring sensuality that captivates the senses.</p>

<p>Emir Lueur Despoir Arena is a well-balanced and complex fragrance that effortlessly transitions from day to night, making it a versatile choice for any occasion. Its exceptional longevity ensures that the enchanting scent remains with you, leaving a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>Experience the enchanting allure of Emir Lueur Despoir Arena 100ML EDP and indulge in the luxury of this captivating fragrance that combines the finest floral, woody, and spicy notes to create an unforgettable olfactory journey for all.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes : Rose, Bulgarian Rose, Agarwood Oud, Ambergris, Saffron And Black Pepper.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,395.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Lueur-Despoir-Arena-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878683,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
