decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-opulentia-empyreal-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Emir Opulentia Empyreal EDP,"<p>Introducing Paris Corner Emir Opulentia Empyreal, a captivating and long-lasting fragrance designed for the modern and sophisticated man. This exquisite 100ml Eau de Parfum is a symphony of luxurious notes, skillfully blended to create an aura of opulence and refinement.</p>

