decant-partial-of-paris-corner-opulentia-inverno-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Opulentia Inverno EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Opulentia Inverno 100ML EDP, a luxurious and long-lasting fragrance tailor-made for the discerning man. Capturing the essence of opulence and sophistication, this exquisite scent exudes an aura of confidence and allure that leaves a lasting impression on everyone in its wake. Inspired of Silver Mountain Water by Creed</p>

<p>At the top, bursts of invigorating Bergamot and zesty Mandarin set the stage for a vibrant and refreshing opening, instantly captivating the senses with their effervescent charm. As the fragrance unfolds, the heart notes reveal an intriguing blend of soothing Green Tea and succulent Black Currant. This unique combination lends a sophisticated and slightly mysterious character, drawing others in with its alluring magnetism.</p>

