decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-resurrection-extrait-de-parfum,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Emir Resurrection Extrait De Parfum,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Resurrection Extrait de Parfum 100ML, a captivating and long-lasting fragrance designed exclusively for men. Crafted with the finest ingredients, this exquisite scent exudes sophistication and allure, making it the perfect companion for any occasion. Inspired by Acqua di Parma Colonia Oud perfume</p>

<p>At the very top of the fragrance pyramid, the Paris Corner Emir Resurrection opens with a burst of freshness, combining the zesty allure of Calabrian bergamot with the invigorating essence of Italian orange. These vibrant top notes create an energetic and uplifting introduction, setting the stage for the captivating journey that lies ahead.</p>

<p>As the scent evolves, the heart notes take center stage, weaving a rich tapestry of captivating aromas. The enchanting essence of Agarwood (oud) exudes a deep and mystical character, evoking a sense of mystery and sensuality. Accompanied by the warm and creamy notes of Amyris and the subtle hint of coriander, the heart of the fragrance offers a harmonious blend that entices the senses and leaves a lasting impression.</p>

<p>In the base notes, the Paris Corner Emir Resurrection reveals its true essence, unveiling a sense of sophistication and depth. The luxurious scent of leather intertwines with the enchanting allure of Atlas Cedar and the velvety smoothness of sandalwood, creating an opulent and indulgent foundation for the fragrance. Musk lends a subtle yet irresistible sensuality, while the earthy and aromatic Indonesian Patchouli Leaf completes the composition with an air of refinement.</p>

<p>The Paris Corner Emir Resurrection Extrait de Parfum is a masterful symphony of scents, skillfully blended to offer a fragrance that endures throughout the day and into the night, leaving a trail of charisma and allure wherever it is worn. With its distinct and powerful character, this fragrance captures the essence of modern masculinity, making it a truly remarkable addition to any gentleman's collection.</p>

<p>Indulge in the timeless charm of Paris Corner Emir Resurrection and embark on a journey of elegance, sophistication, and allure with every spritz.</p>

<p>Top notes: Calabrian bergamot, Italian orange</p>

<p>Middle notes: Agar (oud), Amyris, Coriander</p>

<p>Base: Leather, Atlas Cedar, Sandalwood, Musk, Indonesian Patchouli Leaf</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,415.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Resurrection-Extrait-de-Parfum-100ML.png?v=1779878693,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,extrait,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
