decant-partial-of-paris-corner-emir-forbidden-sugar-edp,Decant/Partial Of Paris Corner Emir Forbidden Sugar EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Forbidden Sugar, a captivating and long-lasting fragrance that will transport you to a world of indulgence and allure. This 100ML Eau de Parfum is a symphony of sweet and exotic notes, carefully blended to create a truly enchanting experience.</p>

<p>At the top, you'll be greeted by an irresistible concoction of delightful scents. The luscious sweetness of Marshmallow and Honey intertwines with the juicy allure of Cassis and Coconut, while the zesty freshness of Bergamot adds a citrusy twist. This tantalizing combination immediately captivates the senses, drawing you deeper into the fragrance's spell.</p>

<p>As the heart of the fragrance unfolds, a rich and creamy accord emerges, filled with warmth and comfort. Caramel and Vanilla create a sumptuous gourmand aroma, perfectly complemented by the juiciness of Pear and the softness of Jasmine. The essence of ripe Peach adds a touch of sophistication, making the middle notes of Forbidden Sugar an irresistible and memorable experience.</p>

<p>In the base, the fragrance takes a sensual turn, wrapping you in an alluring and mysterious embrace. White Musk lends a velvety smoothness, while Orange Blossom adds a touch of floral elegance. The fruity and slightly tangy notes of Raspberry provide a playful contrast, while Violet contributes a delicate and powdery aura, completing the fragrance with an air of sophistication.</p>

<p>Paris Corner Emir Forbidden Sugar is a masterpiece that seamlessly balances sweetness and sophistication. Its long-lasting formula ensures you remain enchanted throughout the day, leaving an unforgettable trail wherever you go. Embrace the forbidden allure of sugar and let this captivating fragrance be your ultimate signature scent.</p>

<p> </p>

<p>Top: Marshmallow, Honey, Cassis, Coconut and Bergamot</p>

<p>Middle: Caramel, Vanilla, Pear, Jasmine and Peach</p>

<p>Base: White Musk, Orange Blossom, Raspberry and Violet</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Paris Corner, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,390.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Forbidden-Sugar-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878695,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
