decant-partial-of-rasasi-la-yuqawam-tobacco-blaze-edp,Decant/Partial Of Rasasi La Yuqawam Tobacco Blaze EDP,"<p>Rasasi Tobacco Blaze 75ml Eau De Parfum for Men: Igniting Passion and Elegance 🌟</p>

<p>Prepare to embark on a journey of sophistication and allure with Rasasi Tobacco Blaze, a timeless fragrance crafted for the modern gentleman. With its captivating blend of rich notes and unparalleled complexity, this 75ml Eau De Parfum stands as a testament to refined masculinity.</p>

<p>🔥 Unveiling the Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Saffron, Neroli, and Lily-of-the-Valley converge to create a tantalizing opening that captures attention from the very first spritz. Saffron lends its exotic allure, while Neroli and Lily-of-the-Valley infuse a delicate floral freshness, setting the stage for the olfactory journey ahead.<br>
Middle Notes: As the fragrance unfolds, a symphony of Apricot, Violet, Coumarin, Amber, and Cedar unfolds. Apricot adds a juicy sweetness, while Violet and Coumarin infuse a powdery softness. Amber and Cedar bring depth and warmth, crafting a heart that exudes sophistication and charm.<br>
Base Notes: The grand finale is a harmonious blend of Leather, Agarwood (Oud), and Patchouli. Leather adds a rugged yet refined edge, while Agarwood (Oud) lends its exotic richness. Patchouli anchors the composition with its earthy allure, leaving a lasting impression that lingers in the air long after the wearer has departed.</p>

<p>🌿 A Tribute to Masculine Sensuality: Rasasi Tobacco Blaze celebrates the essence of masculine sensuality, weaving together contrasting elements to create a fragrance that is both bold and alluring. From its vibrant opening to its sensual dry-down, every facet of this scent reflects the multifaceted nature of the modern man.</p>

<p>💼 Versatile Elegance for Every Occasion: Whether it's a formal evening event or a casual daytime outing, Rasasi Tobacco Blaze is the perfect companion for every occasion. Its versatile nature effortlessly transitions from day to night, ensuring you always make a lasting impression.</p>

<p>🛍️ Indulge in Rasasi Tobacco Blaze: Elevate your fragrance game and embrace the allure of Rasasi Tobacco Blaze. With its timeless sophistication and undeniable charm, it's the ultimate expression of masculine elegance. Experience the magic today!</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Partial, Rasasi",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,920.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/rasasi-tobacco-blaze.png?v=1779878779,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
