decant-partial-of-rasasi-while-in-love-forever-edp,Decant/Partial Of Rasasi While In Love Forever EDP,"<p>Rasasi While In Love Forever 80ml EDP For Women: Embrace Eternal Romance 🌸</p>

<p>Discover the essence of everlasting love with Rasasi While In Love Forever, an enchanting fragrance that captures the essence of eternal romance. This 80ml Eau De Parfum is a testament to the enduring power of affection, enveloping you in a captivating aura that transcends time.</p>

<p>🌿 A Symphony of Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Transport yourself to a whimsical garden adorned with Sicilian lemon, bellflower, and green apple. The crispness of lemon blends harmoniously with the delicate sweetness of bellflower and the refreshing aroma of green apple, creating an invigorating opening that sets the stage for a captivating olfactory journey.<br>
Middle Notes: As the fragrance unfolds, embrace the delicate allure of jasmine, bamboo, and white rose. Jasmine infuses a hint of sensuality, while bamboo adds a touch of freshness and white rose exudes timeless elegance. Together, these notes form a mesmerizing bouquet that captivates the senses with its floral splendor.<br>
Base Notes: The fragrance journey concludes with a warm embrace of cedar, amber, and musk. Cedarwood lends a comforting earthiness, while amber adds a subtle hint of sweetness. Musk provides a lingering sensuality that leaves a lasting impression, ensuring that the memory of While In Love Forever lingers in the air long after you've departed.</p>

<p>🌞 Versatile Elegance for All Seasons: Whether it's a sunny spring morning, a balmy summer afternoon, or a crisp autumn evening, While In Love Forever is the perfect companion for every season. Its versatile nature makes it suitable for all weather conditions, ensuring you radiate elegance and charm regardless of the forecast.</p>

<p>💫 Long-Lasting Performance: With its enduring formula, While In Love Forever ensures that your fragrance journey lasts throughout the day. Whether you're conquering the boardroom or indulging in a romantic evening rendezvous, this fragrance remains a steadfast companion from dawn till dusk.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Partial, Rasasi",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,419.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/rasasi-while-in-love-forever.png?v=1779878781,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
