decant-partial-of-rasasi-innocence-edp,Decant/Partial Of Rasasi Innocence EDP,"<p>Rasasi Innocence 65ml Eau De Parfum: Embrace the Essence of Feminine Elegance 🌸</p>

<p>Indulge in the enchanting allure of Rasasi Innocence, a captivating fragrance designed to evoke the essence of feminine grace and sophistication. Perfectly suited for the radiant days of summer, this 65ml Eau De Parfum is a delightful companion for women who embrace life with elegance and charm.</p>

<p>☀️ Summertime Serenity: As the sun dances in the azure sky, Rasasi Innocence blooms like a delicate flower, infusing the air with its refreshing aura. Ideal for the balmy days of summer, this fragrance exudes a sense of serenity and tranquility, enveloping you in a cocoon of sheer bliss.</p>

<p>🌺 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: A harmonious blend of gardenia, bergamot, and citruses greets your senses with a burst of freshness and vitality. Experience the uplifting embrace of floral and citrusy accords that awaken your spirit.<br>
Middle Notes: Delve deeper into a heart of pure elegance, where carnation, rose, and jasmine intertwine to create a bouquet of timeless beauty. Each note adds a layer of romantic allure, evoking the essence of blooming gardens in full bloom.<br>
Base Notes: The journey culminates in a symphony of warmth and sensuality, as apricot, sandalwood, vanilla, and peach caress your skin with their velvety embrace. Feel the gentle caress of these exquisite base notes, leaving a lingering trail of sophistication wherever you go.</p>

<p>🌟 Long-Lasting Performance: Experience the luxury of long-lasting performance as Rasasi Innocence weaves its magic throughout the day. From sun-kissed mornings to starlit evenings, this fragrance remains by your side, a faithful companion that whispers tales of grace and allure.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Partial, Rasasi",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,354.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rasasi-innocence-Women.png?v=1779878782,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
