decant-partial-of-rasasi-submission-edp,Decant/Partial Of Rasasi Submission EDP,"<p>Rasasi Submission For Men is an olfactory masterpiece, a 100ML Eau de Parfum that transcends the ordinary, leaving an indelible mark of sophistication and allure. From the house of Rasasi, renowned for its commitment to crafting scents that embody luxury and timeless elegance, Submission For Men stands out as a true testament to the artistry of perfumery.</p>

<p>This fragrance boasts an extraordinary longevity that weaves itself into the fabric of time, making every spritz an enduring experience. The top notes introduce a harmonious blend of Mandarin and Saffron, creating an initial burst of citrusy freshness seamlessly intertwined with the warm, spicy nuances of saffron. This aromatic overture sets the stage for what unfolds as a sensory journey through layers of complexity.</p>

<p>As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes reveal a captivating bouquet where the sweet, floral essence of Jasmine meets the earthy, woody allure of Patchouli. This interplay of notes adds depth and richness, creating a magnetic allure that draws those nearby into its captivating embrace.</p>

<p>The base notes, a foundation of Dry Wood and Sandalwood, anchor the fragrance with a subtle yet commanding presence. The dry wood imparts a hint of rugged masculinity, while the timeless allure of sandalwood adds a creamy, velvety finish. Together, they create a lingering trail that resonates with sophistication.</p>

<p>Rasasi Submission For Men is not just a fragrance; it's an olfactory symphony that unfolds gradually, revealing its diverse facets over time. Whether worn for special occasions or as a daily signature scent, this Eau de Parfum is an ode to the modern man's refined taste and unwavering charisma. Embrace the allure, make a lasting impression, and let Rasasi Submission For Men be the essence of your distinct identity.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Partial, Rasasi",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,345.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rasasi-Submission-For-Men.png?v=1779878784,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
