decant-partial-of-rasasi-hawas-ice-edp,Decant/Partial Of Rasasi Hawas Ice EDP,"<p>Rasasi Hawas Ice for Men is a fragrance that exudes a sense of icy sophistication and endless charm. With its captivating blend of notes, this scent is a declaration of strength, masculinity, and refinement.</p>

<p>Hawas Ice is not just a fragrance; it's a journey that lasts and lingers, making a statement of your presence. Its longevity is remarkable, ensuring that you stay invigorated and confident throughout the day and well into the night.</p>

<p>The top notes open with a burst of freshness, featuring zesty Bergamot, tangy Lemon, and a cooling touch of Mint. These elements create an exhilarating and uplifting introduction that sets the stage for what's to come.</p>

<p>In the heart of this fragrance, Orange Blossom adds a touch of floral elegance, while Cardamom and Plum infuse an alluring warmth. Blackcurrant adds a hint of sweet tartness, creating a well-rounded and harmonious composition.</p>

<p>As the scent evolves, the base notes take center stage, revealing the fragrance's true depth. Earthy Patchouli and the rich warmth of Amber blend seamlessly with creamy Tonka and smooth Sandalwood. This base provides an enduring foundation that keeps the scent close to your skin and leaves a memorable trail in your wake.</p>

<p>Top: Bergamot, Lemon, Mint</p>

<p>Heart: Orange Blossom, Cardamom, Plum, Blackcurrant</p>

<p>Base: Patchouli, Amber, Tonka, Sandalwood</p>

<p>Rasasi Hawas Ice for Men is the epitome of modern masculinity, offering a fresh and invigorating experience that is both captivating and long-lasting. It's the perfect choice for those who appreciate a fragrance that reflects their dynamic and confident nature, making it a must-have addition to any collection.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","best seller, Decant, men, Office Perfumes, Partial, Rasasi, Summer Essentials",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,27,deny,manual,533.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rasasi-hawas-Ice-for-Men-100Ml-EDP.png?v=1779878785,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,musk; amber; cardamom; moss,rasasi,,Aromatic,edp,,rasasi; made-in-uae,,aquatics,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Rasasi/Hawas-Ice-89050.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,fruity; citrus; sweet; fresh; aromatic,,plum; orange-blossom; cardamom,,,,,,,,,,,daily-wear,,,,green-apple; lemon; bergamot; star-anise,,,for-men,,'2,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
