decant-partial-of-rasasi-brilliant-bronze-edp,Decant/Partial Of Rasasi Brilliant Bronze EDP,"<p>Rasasi Brilliant Bronze, a captivating fragrance that embodies timeless masculinity. This 100ML Eau de Parfum for men is more than just a scent; it's an olfactory journey that will leave a lasting impression. Crafted for those who appreciate sophistication and long-lasting allure, Brilliant Bronze is a fragrant masterpiece that takes inspiration from the most popular fragrances, reminiscent of Leather Oud by Dior, yet available at a budget-friendly price point.</p>

<p>At the very first spritz, you're greeted by a harmonious burst of top notes that dance on your senses. Cardamom, with its spicy and aromatic allure, mingles gracefully with the freshness of bergamot, while the exotic and oceanic whispers of ambergris create an intriguing contrast. This opening is a prelude to what's to come.</p>

<p>As Brilliant Bronze settles, the heart notes reveal themselves, creating a rich and complex tapestry. Violet adds a touch of floral elegance, beautifully balanced by the earthy depth of patchouli. This combination exudes confidence and refinement, making it suitable for any occasion.</p>

<p>The fragrance's journey concludes with a base that lingers in the memory. Oudh, known as ""liquid gold,"" brings a touch of oriental mystique, while sandalwood lends a creamy, woody warmth. Leather notes add a sensual and luxurious dimension, ensuring that Brilliant Bronze leaves a mesmerizing trail wherever you go.</p>

<p>Rasasi Brilliant Bronze is not just a fragrance; it's an experience. It captures the essence of Leather Oud by Dior while offering an affordable alternative that doesn't compromise on quality or longevity. This Eau de Parfum is designed for the modern man who seeks sophistication and confidence in every aspect of life. With its impressive sillage and long-lasting presence, Brilliant Bronze becomes a part of your identity, leaving an indelible mark wherever you venture.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Cardamom. Ambergris, Bergamot.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Violet. Patchouli.</p>

<p>Base Notes: Oudh. Sandalwood, Leather.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Partial, Rasasi",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,360.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rasasi-Brilliant-Bronze-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878786,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
