decant-partial-of-rasasi-deep-blue-edp,Decant/Partial Of Rasasi Deep Blue EDP,"<p>Rasasi Deep Blue For Men 100ML Eau de Parfum is the epitome of timeless elegance and masculinity, encapsulating the essence of sophistication in a bottle. This long-lasting fragrance is a masterpiece crafted for the modern man who seeks to leave a lasting impression wherever he goes.</p>

<p>At the very first spray, the top notes of zesty Mandarin and a hint of Pink Pepper greet your senses, creating an invigorating and refreshing burst of energy. It's a captivating opening that instantly uplifts your mood, making it perfect for daily wear or special occasions.</p>

<p>As the scent evolves, the heart notes take center stage, with the gentle and powdery Orris note lending an air of refinement. This floral facet adds a touch of sensuality to the composition, making it suitable for both daytime and evening wear.</p>

<p>The base notes of Vetiver and Leather provide a strong and confident finish to this fragrance. Vetiver brings an earthy, woody depth, while Leather adds a touch of ruggedness and masculinity. Together, they create a compelling and long-lasting dry-down that lingers on the skin, leaving a trail of sophistication wherever you go.</p>

<p>What makes Rasasi Deep Blue truly remarkable is its resemblance to two iconic fragrances - Grey Vetiver by Tom Ford and Fahrenheit by Dior. It combines the freshness of Grey Vetiver with the boldness of Fahrenheit, resulting in a harmonious blend that stands out in its own right.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Mandarin, Pink Pepper</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Orris.</p>

<p>Base Notes: Vetiver, Leather</p>

<p>In summary, Rasasi Deep Blue For Men is a fragrance that embodies class, longevity, and style. It's a versatile scent that pays homage to the classics while forging its own path of distinction, making it a must-have for any man who appreciates the art of fine perfumery.</p>

