decant-partial-of-rasasi-wood-excess-pour-homme-edp,Decant/Partial Of Rasasi Wood Excess Pour Homme EDP,"<p>Rasasi Wood Excess Pour Homme 100ML EDP is the epitome of timeless elegance and masculine sophistication. Crafted for the modern man who exudes confidence and charisma, this long-lasting perfume is a symphony of captivating notes that will leave a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>

