<p>Notably, this fragrance draws inspiration from the timeless appeal of Dior Sauvage EDT and EDP, not in different directions it's not an exact Inspired but takes reference to sauvage. it has more powdery elements. making it a versatile choice suitable for all seasons and occasions. Whether you're heading to the office, a casual outing, or a formal event, this fragrance complements your style effortlessly.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Orange, Bergamot, Pear.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Geranium, Lavender, Magnolia, Jasmine.</p>

<p>Base Notes: Cinnamon, Cardamom, Tobacco, Guaiac, Vanilla, Cedarwood.</p>

<p>In summary, Rasasi ""Its Essential For Men"" is more than just a perfume; it's an experience. With its harmonious blend of notes and remarkable longevity, it's an essential addition to any modern man's grooming arsenal, leaving you feeling confident and sophisticated all day long.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Decant, Partial, Rasasi",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,5,deny,manual,350.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rasasi-Its-Essential-For-Men-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878794,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
