decant-partial-of-rasasi-amber-alive-edp,Decant/Partial Of Rasasi Amber Alive EDP,"<p>Rasasi Amber Alive For Men 100ML Eau de Parfum, a captivating and enduring fragrance designed to resonate with the modern man. This fragrance exudes a timeless allure and is an affordable alternative to the classic Drakkar Noir by Guy Laroche. Inspired of Drakkar Noir by Guy Laroche</p>

<p>Top Notes: Rasasi Amber Alive opens with an invigorating burst of lavender and artemisia oil, creating an initial freshness that awakens the senses. The combination of tarragon oil, lemon oil, and pine oil adds a zesty and slightly woody undertone, setting the stage for the journey ahead.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: As the fragrance develops, the heart reveals a complex blend of clove bud, black pepper oil, and leather notes. This accord strikes a harmonious balance between spice and sophistication, while the infusion of rose oil and geranium lends a subtle floral dimension, adding depth and intrigue.</p>

<p>Base Notes: The dry-down is where Rasasi Amber Alive truly shines, as it settles into a warm and inviting embrace. Earthy patchouli oil and the subtle woody notes of tree amber create a solid foundation, leaving a lasting impression that is both grounding and seductive.</p>

<p>Rasasi Amber Alive For Men is characterized by its remarkable longevity, ensuring that you stay confidently refreshed throughout the day and into the night. This budget-friendly fragrance offers an enticing alternative to the iconic Drakkar Noir, making it accessible without compromising on quality.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Lavender, Artemesia, Tarragon, Lemon, Pine</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Clove, Black Pepper, Leather Notes, Rose, Geranium.</p>

<p>Base Notes: Earthy Patchouli Oil, Tree. Amber</p>

<p>Whether worn casually or for special occasions, Rasasi Amber Alive For Men is an olfactory journey that evolves with time, leaving a trail of masculinity and sophistication. It's the perfect companion for the modern man who seeks a lasting and affordable fragrance experience. Unleash your inner charisma with Rasasi Amber Alive For Men, a fragrance that truly comes alive on your skin.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Partial, Rasasi",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,350.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rasasi-Amber-Alive-For-Men-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878798,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
