decant-partial-of-rasasi-attar-mubakhar-cpo,Decant/Partial Of Rasasi Attar Mubakhar CPO,"<p>Attar mubakhar by Rasasi is a lovely powdery scent. The top note is floral and rosy with woody notes. Vanilla, musk and sandal form the heart and base. A powdery and clean scent, it is recommended for both women and men.</p>

