decant-partial-of-rasasi-dareej-women-edp,Decant/Partial Of Rasasi Dareej Women EDP,"<p>Daarej pour Femme by Rasasi is a Floral Fruity Gourmand fragrance for women. The rumors are true: it smells exactly like Hypnôse by Lancôme. The opening is pretty strong and intoxicating. When the alcohol evaporates the fragrance shows off all its organic and opulent facets. It’s a creamy vanilla fragrance. Soft and delicate. It’s sweet but not gourmand sweet. It’s on the floral side along with some powderiness - so sophisticated and elegant. It’s a very modern fragrance - not intoxicatingly strong but not light either. It’s a perfect balance between those and it can be worn every day and it would be still special and sophisticated enough. All in all I would say that it’s a modem take on oriental vanilla along with some powderiness and understated woodiness. It’s great! The longevity is nice. It lasts for 6-7 hours easily and it projects strong for 2 hours. Safe blind buy!</p>

<p>Top notes are Peach, Orange, Bergamot and Green Notes</p>

<p>Middle notes are Heliotrope, Orchid, Tuberose, Jasmine and Lily-of-the-Valley</p>

<p>Base notes are Caramel, Vetiver, Musk, Sandalwood, Amber and Patchouli.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Partial, Rasasi",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,370.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rasasi-Dareej-Women-EDP-100-ML.png?v=1779878820,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
