decant-partial-of-rasasi-faqat-lil-rijal-edp,Decant/Partial Of Rasasi Faqat Lil Rijal EDP,"Faqat Lil rijal faqat Lil rijal - 50 ml spray faqat Lil rijal's woody flavors create a luscious yet robust aura while the zesty and delicately aromatic inflections lend it a delightful trial. Crafted for the today's man who loves to command attention and appreciation, the perfume starts on a soft elegant leathery note of saffron, freshened by hot spicy cardamom braced bergamot, finally settling down to a very manly fragrance wherein the animalist accents of musk get enveloped by the warm earthiness and luscious sensuality of sandalwood. Faqat Lil rijal is an unapologetic ode to strength, power, and machismo. The stoic steel bottle reinforces its masculine essence.

