decant-partial-of-rasasi-hatem-edp,Decant/Partial Of Rasasi Hatem EDP,"<p>Hatem by Rasasi is a Woody Spicy fragrance for women and men. Its aquatic fresh spicy and woody musky fragrance for men. best for daily wear and office wear. Main fragrance in this fragrance ara woody, aromatic, citrus, warm spicy, fresh spicy.</p> 

