decant-partial-of-rasasi-blue-lady-edp,Decant/Partial Of Rasasi Blue Lady EDP,"<p>Rasasi Blue Lady Perfume EDP 40 ml: A Symphony of Elegance and Grace for Women 🌸</p>

<p>Indulge in the timeless allure of Rasasi Blue Lady Perfume, a fragrant masterpiece that epitomizes sophistication and femininity. This 40 ml Eau De Parfum is a celebration of elegance, designed to envelop you in a veil of enchanting fragrance that captivates the senses and leaves an unforgettable impression.</p>

<p>🌟 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Embark on a journey of floral delight as tuberose, ylang-ylang, African orange flower, and violet leaf intertwine to create a mesmerizing opening. Experience the fresh and invigorating burst of blooms that sets the stage for an olfactory adventure.<br>
Middle Notes: Delve deeper into a heart of pure indulgence, where jasmine, plum, narcissus, and peach weave together in perfect harmony. Feel the velvety richness and fruity sweetness that adds depth and allure to the fragrance.<br>
Base Notes: The fragrance journey culminates in a warm embrace of sandalwood, vanilla, musk, amber, and vetyver. Bask in the sensual warmth and lingering sweetness that lingers on the skin, leaving a trail of sophistication and grace.</p>

<p>💫 Versatile Appeal for All Seasons: Rasasi Blue Lady Perfume transcends the boundaries of time and weather, making it the perfect companion for every occasion and season. Whether it's a sunny spring day or a crisp autumn evening, this fragrance effortlessly adapts to complement your style and mood.</p>

<p>⏳ Long-Lasting Performance: Experience the luxury of enduring fragrance as Rasasi Blue Lady Perfume envelops you in its captivating aura throughout the day. With its long-lasting formula, you can confidently embrace every moment, knowing that your scent will linger long after you've left the room.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Partial, Rasasi",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,450.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rasasi-Blue-Lady-Perfume-EDP-40-ml.png?v=1779878842,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
