decant-partial-of-zimaya-khafaya-blue-edp,Decant/Partial Of Zimaya Khafaya Blue EDP,"Zimaya Khafaya Blue 100ml EDP – Powerful, Spicy &amp; Intensely Masculine 💙🔥Inspired by Sauvage Elixir by Dior | Made in UAE
Zimaya Khafaya Blue is a bold and commanding fragrance crafted for men who prefer strong, spicy, and long-lasting scents. Rich spices meet aromatic freshness and deep woods, creating a confident signature that feels luxurious, modern, and undeniably masculine.

Fragrance Notes ✨
