decant-partial-of-zimaya-hayam-edp,Decant/Partial Of Zimaya Hayam EDP,"<p>Zimaya Hayam Eau de Parfum – A Rush of Passion, A Whisper of Mystery 💫🍊100ml EDP | Inspired by Rouge Trafalgar by Dior | Made in UAE<br>
