The fragrance opens with a captivating blend of raspberry, cinnamon, and bergamot. Juicy raspberry brings a luscious sweetness, cinnamon adds a warm, spicy edge, and bergamot brightens the opening with a subtle citrus sparkle, creating an addictive first impression.
At the heart, apple, caramel, and rose unfold beautifully. Crisp apple and melted caramel create a rich gourmand accord, while soft rose adds elegance and balance, keeping the sweetness refined rather than overpowering.
The base is deep, smooth, and intoxicating. Cognac, vanilla, amber, tonka bean, and moss come together to form a warm, boozy, and creamy dry-down. Cognac adds sophistication, vanilla and tonka bean enhance the sweetness, amber provides glowing warmth, and moss gives an earthy, luxurious finish.
