decant-partial-of-zimaya-al-barari-coral-edp,Decant/Partial Of Zimaya Al Barari Coral EDP,"Zimaya Al Barari Coral 100ml EDP For Men &amp; Women – A Radiant Fusion of Juicy Freshness and Warm Elegance ✨
Zimaya Al Barari Coral is a vibrant and modern unisex Eau de Parfum that captures the feeling of sunlit gardens, ripe fruits, and smooth amber warmth. Lively yet refined, this fragrance is designed for those who enjoy a fresh, fruity opening balanced by a soft woody and musky base. It’s versatile, uplifting, and effortlessly elegant—perfect for everyday wear or moments when you want a scent that feels bright and confident.
Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Bergamot, Orange, Ginger, Mango, Pear 🍊🥭The opening bursts with juicy energy as sparkling bergamot and orange blend with the crisp sweetness of pear and mango. A hint of ginger adds a gentle spicy lift, creating a refreshing yet playful introduction that feels clean, fruity, and inviting.
