decant-partial-of-antonio-banderas-blue-seduction-edt-for-men,Decant/Partial Of Antonio Banderas Blue Seduction EDT For Men,"Antonio Banderas Blue Seduction 100ml EDT – Cool Aquatic Freshness with Smooth Masculine Charm 🌊🍈✨For Men | Fresh • Aquatic • Aromatic
Blue Seduction by Antonio Banderas is a refreshing and effortlessly stylish fragrance that captures the essence of cool ocean breezes and relaxed confidence. Light, crisp, and subtly sensual, it’s perfect for men who prefer clean freshness with a modern twist.
Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Melon, Bergamot, Mint &amp; Black Currant 🍈🍋🌿A bright and juicy opening where sweet melon meets zesty bergamot, uplifted by cooling mint and a hint of black currant for a crisp, refreshing start.
Heart Notes: Sea Water, Green Apple, Cappuccino, Cardamom &amp; Nutmeg 🌊🍏☕The heart introduces a unique aquatic accord blended with fresh green apple, while soft cappuccino adds a creamy nuance. Cardamom and nutmeg bring a gentle spice, adding depth and intrigue.
Base Notes: Woodsy Notes &amp; Amber 🌲✨A smooth dry-down of warm woods and soft amber creates a clean, masculine trail that lingers without overpowering.
