Fragrance Notes:Top Notes: Pink Pepper, BergamotThe fragrance opens with a lively burst of pink pepper, adding a spicy, vibrant touch, perfectly balanced by the fresh, zesty brightness of bergamot. This combination creates an energetic and sophisticated first impression, filled with both freshness and intrigue.
