Base Notes: Amber, Woody Notes, PatchouliThe fragrance settles into a warm, sensual base where amber and earthy patchouli provide a deep, sophisticated foundation. Subtle woody notes add complexity, leaving behind a rich, enduring trail that speaks of strength, elegance, and undeniable magnetism.
Nayel King is perfect for both day and evening wear, making it an ideal scent for anyone who desires a fragrance with depth, elegance, and a touch of royal allure. With its rich florals and luxurious warmth, it’s the perfect signature scent for those who want to command attention and leave a lasting impression. ✨👑",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Arabiyat Prestige, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,643.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Arabiyat-Prestige-Nayel-King.png?v=1779879017,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
