decant-partial-of-ard-al-zaafaran-mousuf-azure-edp,Decant/Partial Of Ard Al Zaafaran Mousuf Azure EDP,"<p>Ard Al Zaafaran Mousuf Azure 100ml EDP For Men – A Refined Fresh-Spicy Classic ✨<br>
Ard Al Zaafaran Mousuf Azure is a vibrant and sophisticated Eau de Parfum crafted for men who appreciate a balanced blend of freshness and subtle warmth. Inspired by Y Elixir by Yves Saint Laurent, this fragrance opens with uplifting citrus brightness, transitions through a spicy-floral heart, and settles into a warm, elegant base—making it ideal for daily wear, office settings, casual evenings, and modern gentlemanly style.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes ✨<br>
Top Notes: Bergamot, Orange, Lime 🍊🍋The opening is crisp and energizing, with juicy bergamot, zesty orange, and tangy lime creating a fresh and invigorating burst. This citrusy start sets a confident and clean tone that’s perfect for daytime wear and warm weather.<br>
Middle Notes: Violet, Nutmeg 🌿🌸At the heart, delicate violet brings a refined floral touch while spicy nutmeg adds warmth and depth. This combination creates a sophisticated middle layer that feels modern and balanced—neither too sweet nor too sharp.<br>
