decant-partial-of-ard-al-zaafaran-mithqal-edp,Decant/Partial Of Ard Al Zaafaran Mithqal EDP,"<p>Discover Ard Al Zaafaran Mithqal 100ml EDP: A Captivating Fusion of Elegance and Longevity for Men and Women 🌟</p>

<p>Embark on a sensory journey like no other with Ard Al Zaafaran Mithqal, an exquisite fragrance meticulously crafted in the heart of the UAE. This 100ml Eau De Parfum is a testament to the rich heritage of Arabian perfumery, blending traditional charm with contemporary allure to create an olfactory masterpiece that transcends gender boundaries.</p>

<p>🌺 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: At the outset, experience a burst of freshness that awakens the senses. Bergamot, roses, and sea notes come together in perfect harmony, invoking a sense of serenity and rejuvenation reminiscent of a gentle breeze by the shore.<br>
Heart Notes: Delve deeper into a floral symphony that captivates the soul. A delicate blend of roses, lilies, and hibiscus unfolds, enveloping you in a bouquet of exquisite blooms that exude grace and femininity while maintaining a subtle masculinity.<br>
Base Notes: As the fragrance settles, a warm and inviting embrace awaits. Amber and musk intertwine with the exotic sweetness of ripe mangoes, creating a sensuous and intoxicating trail that lingers on the skin, leaving a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>🔥 Long-Lasting Appeal Made in UAE: Crafted with meticulous attention to detail and the finest ingredients, Ard Al Zaafaran Mithqal embodies the essence of luxury and sophistication. Its long-lasting formula ensures that you remain enveloped in its enchanting aura throughout the day and into the night, making it the perfect choice for any occasion.</p>

<p>💫 Versatile Elegance for All: Designed to transcend gender boundaries, Ard Al Zaafaran Mithqal is a fragrance for individuals who appreciate the finer things in life. Whether worn by a man or a woman, its captivating blend of notes effortlessly complements any style, personality, or mood, making it a timeless addition to any fragrance collection.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Ard Al Zaafaran, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,353.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Ard-Al-Zaafaran-Mithqal.png?v=1779879068,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,sandalwood; patchouli; jasmine; ylang-ylang,ard-al-zaafaran,,,edp,,ard-al-zaafaran,,floral; woody,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Ard-Al-Zaafaran/Mithqal-77976.html,unisex,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,rose; woody; powdery; amber; musky,,floral; rose,,,,,,,,,,,daily-wear,,,,bergamot; rose; sea-note,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
