decant-partial-of-ard-al-zaafaran-crystal-brown-edp,Decant/Partial Of Ard Al Zaafaran Crystal Brown EDP,"<p>Ard Al Zaafaran Crystal Brown, a captivating 100ml Eau de Parfum designed for the modern, confident woman. This exquisite fragrance offers a timeless allure that lingers throughout the day and night, ensuring you leave an unforgettable impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>Crystal Brown is more than just a perfume; it's an olfactory journey that begins with the delicate embrace of its top notes. The initial burst of Freesias exudes freshness and vitality, invoking a sense of natural beauty. As the fragrance unfolds, a harmonious blend of Roses and Lilies emerges, revealing a lush, floral heart that is both elegant and enchanting. These middle notes evoke the essence of a blooming garden, making you feel as if you're strolling through a fragrant paradise.</p>

