decant-partial-of-ard-al-zaafaran-crystal-black-edp,Decant/Partial Of Ard Al Zaafaran Crystal Black EDP,"Ard Al Zaafaran Crystal Black is an exceptional long-lasting fragrance designed for the modern man who seeks sophistication and confidence in every step he takes. This 100ml Eau de Parfum is a masterful composition that opens with an invigorating burst of freshness from a harmonious blend of juniper, grapefruit, zesty bergamot, and vibrant mandarin oranges. The top notes provide an uplifting and energetic introduction, setting the stage for an unforgettable olfactory journey. Said To be a Inspired Of Light Blue Italian Zest Pour Homme by Dolce&amp;Gabbana

As the scent settles, the heart of the fragrance reveals a captivating and sensual allure. Enveloping the senses with warmth and depth, rosewood exudes elegance, while Sichuan pepper adds a subtle spicy nuance that sparks intrigue. Intertwined with these captivating ingredients is the unmistakable essence of rosemary, lending an herbal and aromatic facet to the heart notes.

