decant-partial-of-ard-al-zaafaran-mousuf-edp,Decant/Partial Of Ard Al Zaafaran Mousuf EDP,"<p>Ard Al Zaafaran Mousuf 100ml EDP Perfume for Men</p>

<p>Ard Al Zaafaran presents Mousuf, a captivating fragrance that embraces the essence of sophistication and luxury. This 100ml Eau de Parfum (EDP) for men is designed to leave a lasting impression, enveloping the senses in a delightful olfactory experience. Mousuf is renowned as a remarkable Inspired of the popular One Million Luck perfume, exuding similar vibes yet with its distinctive charm.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:<br>
- Grape: The opening notes of Mousuf indulge your senses with the succulent and juicy aroma of grapes. This refreshing note adds a fruity touch to the fragrance, creating an enticing and energetic introduction.</p>

<p>- Chocolate: As the scent develops, a rich and decadent hint of chocolate emerges. This note adds depth and warmth to Mousuf, lending a luxurious and indulgent character to the fragrance.</p>

<p>- Musky Oud: At its heart, Mousuf reveals the alluring and sensual composition of musky oud. This note brings a touch of oriental mystique, combining woodsy and earthy tones with a touch of animalic musk.</p>

<p>- Floral: Complementing the previous notes, Mousuf incorporates a delicate floral bouquet. These floral nuances provide a subtle elegance to the fragrance, adding a sophisticated and refined touch.</p>

<p>- Caramel Aroma: Providing a sweet and gourmand twist, a caramel aroma gracefully intertwines with the other notes in Mousuf. This note creates a delectable accord, leaving a warm and comforting trail.</p>

<p>Inspired by One Million Luck:<br>
Mousuf by Ard Al Zaafaran is celebrated as an exceptional Inspired of One Million Luck perfume. As such, it possesses a similar composition that captures the spirit and allure of the original fragrance. With its harmonious blend of grape, chocolate, musky oud, floral, and caramel aroma, Mousuf aims to provide a reminiscent experience while offering its own unique personality.</p>

<p>Overall, Ard Al Zaafaran Mousuf 100ml EDP perfume for men is a captivating fragrance that combines fruity, gourmand, and woody elements, making it a delightful choice for those who appreciate opulent and long-lasting perfumes. Its well-balanced blend of notes creates an aura of sophistication and elegance, making Mousuf a remarkable fragrance to add to your collection.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Ard Al Zaafaran, Decant, men, Partial, Party",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,350.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Ard-Al-Zaafaran-Mousuf-100ml-EDP.png?v=1779879077,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,toffee; tobacco; floral-notes,ard-al-zaafaran,,,edp,,,,,,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,sweet; fruity; oud; musky; tobacco,,oud; musk,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,grapes; chocolate,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
