decant-partial-of-ard-al-zaafaran-safeer-al-oud-edp,Decant/Partial Of Ard Al Zaafaran Safeer Al Oud EDP,"<p>Ard Al Zaafaran Safeer al oud is an exquisite fragrance that caters to both men and women, captivating the senses with its enchanting blend of notes. This 100ml Eau de Parfum is a harmonious composition designed to leave a lasting impression.</p>

<p>At the top notes, Safeer Al Oud introduces the rich and distinctive aroma of oudh, infusing the fragrance with an element of opulence. The sweet and delicate scent of roses adds a touch of femininity, while the spicy saffron lends a warm and exotic allure to the blend.</p>

<p>Moving into the heart notes, Gujrun balm, sandalwood, and patchouli take center stage, creating a captivating and alluring accord. Gujrun balm contributes a soothing and refreshing quality, while sandalwood adds a creamy and woody note. Patchouli, with its earthy and slightly sweet aroma, enhances the depth and complexity of the fragrance.</p>

<p>As the perfume reaches its base, a remarkable blend of notes come together to leave a lasting and memorable trail. Incense brings a touch of mystique and spiritual energy, harmonizing with the oudh to create an intriguing aroma. The inclusion of cedar adds a woody and aromatic aspect, while guaiac wood contributes a unique smoky characteristic to the composition.</p>

<p>Ard Al Zaafaran Safeer al oud 100ml EDP perfume for men and women is an olfactory masterpiece that combines the elegance of oudh, the allure of roses and saffron, and the sacredness of incense. With its well-balanced composition and long-lasting nature, this fragrance offers a truly enchanting experience for those who seek a captivating and memorable scent.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Ard Al Zaafaran, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,330.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Ard-Al-Zaafaran-Safeer-al-oud-100ml-EDP.png?v=1779879078,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,woody; white-musk; vanilla,ard-al-zaafaran,,,edp,,ard-al-zaafaran,,fruity; floral,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Ard-Al-Zaafaran/Safeer-Al-Ward-119396.html,women,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,white-floral; rose; fresh; vanilla,,peony; orange-blossom-1; amber,,,,,,,,,,,party,,,,jasmine; rose; red-fruits,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
