decant-partial-of-asdaaf-ameer-al-arab-edp,Decant/Partial Of Asdaaf Ameer Al Arab EDP,"<p>Asdaaf by Lattafa Eau De Parfum carry strong fragrance that opens up with energizing notes while having the base of jasmine, wood, musk and oud. Asdaaf perfumes are perfect combination of spices, resins, exotic woods an essential oils. The root of this type of perfumes are the aromatic notes of the oriental and woody groups. The main feature in Arabic perfumes is its sensuality, exoticism and intense scent. Arabic fragrances are usually more intense and stronger. Asdaaf perfumes by Lattafa are well developed with long lasting frgarnce particles as arabian perfumes are having history of long lasting and smoky fragrance. Asdaaf perfumes are exotic and attractive enough that you can't resist them.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Asdaaf, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,330.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Asdaaf-Ameer-Al-Arab-100ml-EDP.png?v=1779879087,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,patchouli; saffron; sandalwood,asdaaf,,,edp,,asdaaf,,,,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,,,basil; lavender; pepper,,,,,,,,,,,office,,,,jasmine; honeysuckle,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
