decant-partial-of-azzaro-the-most-wanted-parfum,Decant/Partial Of Azzaro The Most Wanted Parfum,"Azzaro The Most Wanted 100ml Parfum For Men – The Ultimate Expression of Power &amp; Seduction 🔥
Azzaro The Most Wanted Parfum is an intensely bold and addictive fragrance crafted for men who thrive on confidence, charisma, and fearless ambition. This parfum concentration delivers depth, richness, and long-lasting performance, making it an exceptional choice for evenings, parties, and moments when you want to stand out effortlessly.

Fragrance Notes 🔥
Top Note: Ginger 🌶️The opening bursts with spicy ginger, delivering an immediate hit of warmth and energy. It’s sharp, vibrant, and magnetic—setting a daring and confident tone from the first spray.
Middle Note: Woodsy Notes 🌲At the heart, smooth woody accords add strength and masculinity. These notes provide structure and depth, balancing the initial spice with a refined, modern elegance.
Base Note: Bourbon Vanilla 🍦The dry-down is irresistibly addictive. Rich bourbon vanilla wraps the fragrance in creamy sweetness, adding warmth, sensuality, and a seductive trail that lingers long after.
Azzaro The Most Wanted Parfum is perfect for men who love warm, spicy-sweet fragrances with strong projection and confidence. Best suited for night-time wear, cooler weather, and special occasions, it’s a statement scent for those who want to be noticed—bold, intense, and undeniably desirable.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Azzaro, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,900.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Azzaro-Most-Wanted-Parfum.png?v=1779879088,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,bourbon-vanilla,azzaro,,,parfum,,azzaro,,vanilla,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Azzaro/The-Most-Wanted-Parfum-73664.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,vanilla; woody; fresh-spicy; fresh; powdery; sweet,,woodsy-notes,,,,,,,,,,,party,,,,ginger,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
