decant-partial-of-azzaro-chrome-edp,Decant/Partial Of Azzaro Chrome EDP,"<p>Azzaro Chrome 100ml Eau De Parfum for Men: Unveiling Timeless Elegance 🌟</p>

<p>Embark on a journey of sophistication and allure with Azzaro Chrome, a fragrance masterpiece designed for the modern gentleman. Presented in a 100ml Eau De Parfum concentration, this scent encapsulates the essence of timeless elegance and masculine charm, leaving an indelible mark wherever you go.</p>

<p>🔥 Exquisite Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Note - Green Mandarin: The olfactory journey begins with a burst of freshness, as vibrant green mandarin awakens the senses with its citrusy zest. Its invigorating presence sets the stage for the captivating layers that follow, promising a dynamic and refreshing opening that commands attention.<br>
Middle Note - Lavender: At the heart of Azzaro Chrome lies the soothing embrace of lavender, a timeless ingredient revered for its calming and aromatic qualities. Immerse yourself in its delicate floral bouquet, as lavender lends a touch of refinement and sophistication to the composition, creating a sense of serenity and balance.<br>
Base Note - Pine: The fragrance journey culminates in the earthy warmth of pine, evoking images of lush forests and crisp mountain air. Pine adds depth and complexity to the scent, grounding it with its woody nuances and imparting a sense of rugged masculinity. As the base note lingers on the skin, it leaves a lasting impression of strength and resilience.</p>

<p>🌲 Azzaro Chrome: Inspired by Nature, Crafted for Men: Inspired by the purity and vitality of nature, Azzaro Chrome celebrates the essence of masculinity in all its forms. Whether you're navigating the urban jungle or embarking on outdoor adventures, this fragrance serves as your steadfast companion, exuding confidence and sophistication with every spritz.</p>

<p>🛒 Discover Fragrance Excellence at Fragstalk.in: Elevate your fragrance experience with 100% original niche and designer fragrances. Fragstalk.in, your go-to destination for all fragrance needs in India, offers a curated selection at amazing prices.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Azzaro, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,620.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Azzaro-Chrome-EDP-Man-100ml.png?v=1779879090,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
