decant-partial-of-birra-oud-obsession-edp,Decant/Partial Of Birra Oud Obsession EDP,"<p>Birra Oud Obsession 50ml EDP – Pure Oud Intensity with Spiced Woods 🖤🔥🌲For Men | Oud • Woody • Spicy<br>
