decant-partial-of-birra-glacier-edp,Decant/Partial Of Birra Glacier EDP,"Birra Glacier 100ml EDP – Icy Fresh Citrus with Marine Woody Depth ❄️🌊🍊For Men | Fresh • Aquatic • Woody
Birra Glacier is a premium men’s fragrance inspired by crisp ocean air and cool mountain freshness. Clean, sharp, and modern, it opens fresh and citrusy, flows into a marine woody heart, and settles into a smooth amber base that lingers with quiet strength.

Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Grapefruit &amp; Violet Leaf 🍊🍃A sharp, refreshing opening where zesty grapefruit meets green violet leaf for a cool, airy start.
Heart Notes: Sea Notes, Violet Wood Notes &amp; Rosewood 🌊🌲An aquatic heart blended with smooth woods adds depth, freshness, and a refined masculine character.
