Middle Notes: As the fragrance evolves, leather and mimosa take center stage, adding depth and complexity. The rich, supple aroma of leather exudes sophistication, while mimosa lends a touch of floral sweetness, perfectly balancing the composition and adding a layer of refinement.<br>
