<p>Indulge in the irresistible allure of Calvin Klein CK One Shock, a fragrance that effortlessly embodies the essence of modern masculinity. This 100ml EDT masterpiece is a bold symphony of scents designed to leave a lasting impression, making it the perfect companion for the confident and daring man.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Lavender, Clementine, and Cucumber join forces to create a fresh and invigorating introduction. The combination of these notes delivers a burst of energy that captivates the senses from the very first spray, setting the stage for the olfactory journey ahead.<br>
