decant-partial-of-davidoff-cool-water-intense-edp,Decant/Partial Of Davidoff Cool Water Intense EDP,"<p>Davidoff Cool Water Intense EDP 125ml – Fresh Citrus with Creamy Amber Depth 🌊🍊<br>
For Men | Fresh • Creamy • Amber</p>

<p>Cool Water Intense by Davidoff reimagines the iconic aquatic signature with a richer, more addictive twist. This Eau de Parfum delivers a vibrant burst of citrus freshness layered over creamy tropical warmth and a smooth amber base. Modern, confident, and effortlessly masculine, it’s designed for men who appreciate freshness with lasting depth.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes ✨</p>

<p>Top Note: Green Mandarin 🍊<br>
A sparkling splash of green mandarin opens the fragrance with crisp, juicy brightness — refreshing and energizing from the very first spray.</p>

<p>Heart Note: Coconut Nectar 🥥<br>
At the heart, creamy coconut nectar adds a smooth tropical warmth, creating a subtle sweetness that feels both relaxed and refined.</p>

<p>Base Note: Amber 🔥<br>
The scent settles into a sensual amber base, delivering warmth, longevity, and a magnetic masculine trail that lingers beautifully on the skin.</p>

<p>Perfect for daily wear, warm weather, and casual evenings, Cool Water Intense is fresh yet bold — ideal for men who want a clean scent with a creamy, modern edge.</p>

