decant-partial-of-dolce-gabbana-the-one-edt,Decant/Partial Of Dolce & Gabbana The One EDT,"<p>Dolce &amp; Gabbana The One Eau De Toilette – Warm Spiced Elegance with Smooth Tobacco Charm 🍊🔥🌿For Men | Spicy • Woody • Warm • Sophisticated Dolce &amp; Gabbana The One is a refined and charismatic fragrance that blends fresh brightness with warm, sensual depth. It opens crisp and slightly spicy, transitions into an aromatic, gently sweet heart, and settles into a smooth, masculine base. The overall feel is modern yet timeless—effortlessly elegant without being overpowering. Fragrance Notes ✨ Top Notes: Grapefruit, Coriander &amp; Basil 🍊🌿✨The opening is fresh and lively. Grapefruit delivers a bright citrus spark, while coriander adds a subtle spicy edge. Basil introduces a green, aromatic freshness that keeps the blend clean and uplifting. Heart Notes: Ginger, Cardamom &amp; Orange Blossom 🌶️🌼🌿At the heart, the fragrance becomes warm and inviting. Ginger brings a zesty heat, cardamom adds a smooth, slightly sweet spice, and orange blossom softens the composition with a light floral touch. Base Notes: Amber, Tobacco &amp; Cedar 🔥🌳🚬The dry-down is rich and comforting. Amber provides a warm glow, tobacco adds a smooth, slightly sweet smokiness, and cedar gives a clean woody structure that lingers on the skin. Perfect for evenings, date nights, and year-round wear, The One is smooth, masculine, and quietly seductive. ✨ Dolce &amp; Gabbana The One – a balanced fusion of fresh spice, warm tobacco, and elegant woody depth.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Decant, Dolce & Gabbana, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,914.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/DnG-The-One.png?v=1779879284,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
