Base Notes: Raspberry, Violet &amp; Musk 🍓🌸🤍A soft and comforting base of sweet raspberry, powdery violet, and clean musk leaves a gentle, long-lasting and elegant trail.
Perfect for daily wear, summer days, office, and casual outings, Estiara Mistic Waters suits women who love fresh, watery fragrances with fruity sweetness.
