decant-partial-of-estiara-life-spirit-adventure-edp,Decant/Partial Of Estiara Life Spirit Adventure EDP,"<p>Estiara Life Spirit Adventure 100ml EDP – Embrace the Thrill of Discovery 🌿<br>
Experience the essence of untamed exploration with Estiara Life Spirit Adventure. This long-lasting Eau de Parfum for men captures the vibrancy of life's most adventurous moments, making it an ideal companion for the modern explorer.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:<br>
Top Notes: Bergamot, Lemon, Mandarin Orange, Cardamom, and Coriander<br>
(A sparkling blend of citrus and spice ignites a fresh and energetic opening, evoking a sense of boldness.)</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Cypress, Jasmine, Geranium, and Bay Leaf<br>
(A sophisticated heart of aromatic greens and florals adds depth, creating a warm, captivating aura.)</p>

<p>Base Notes: Sandalwood, Cedar, and Musk<br>
(A rich and grounding base of wood and musk provides a smooth, long-lasting finish that lingers irresistibly.)</p>

<p>Crafted for the confident and adventurous man, Life Spirit Adventure is perfect for daytime escapades or evening endeavors. Its invigorating scent energizes the senses while its warm, masculine undertones exude timeless elegance. Discover the thrill of every moment with this versatile fragrance that stays with you, leaving a lasting impression.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Estiara, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,306.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Estiara-Life-Spirit-Adventure.png?v=1779879389,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
