(A refreshing burst of citrus and aquatic brilliance awakens the senses with vibrant energy.)<br>
Middle Notes: Black Currant, Green Tea<br>
(A delicate and aromatic fusion adds a touch of elegance and depth.)<br>
Base Notes: Musk, Galbanum, Sandalwood<br>
(A sensual and earthy blend ensures a smooth, lingering finish with irresistible warmth.)</p>

<p>Perfect for both casual and formal occasions, Stag White is a versatile fragrance that complements your refined persona. Its long-lasting formula ensures you stay fresh and confident from dawn to dusk.</p>

