decant-partial-of-flavia-mega-men-edp,Decant/Partial Of Flavia Mega Men EDP,"<p>Flavia Mega Men 100ml EDP – A Bold and Invigorating Essence 🌿🍊</p>

<p>Flavia Mega Men captures the essence of dynamic masculinity with a fragrance that is as energizing as it is enduring. The fragrance opens with a burst of freshness from Orange Blossom, Bergamot, Cardamom, and Lemon, creating a vibrant and invigorating first impression. This bright, citrus-forward opening is immediately followed by a warm and aromatic heart of Coriander, Lavender, Geranium, Rosemary, and Nutmeg, adding depth and a touch of spice to the fragrance. The base notes of Vetiver, Litchi, and Tonka provide a smooth, rich finish, ensuring long-lasting wear throughout the day.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes: Top Notes: Orange Blossom, Bergamot, Cardamom, Lemon<br>
(A refreshing citrus blend that awakens the senses with its bright, energetic qualities.)</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Coriander, Lavender, Geranium, Rosemary, Nutmeg<br>
(A harmonious medley of herbal and floral elements, creating a captivating, aromatic heart.)</p>

<p>Base Notes: Vetiver, Litchi, Tonka<br>
(A rich, grounding finish with a subtle sweetness and earthy depth.)</p>

<p>Flavia Mega Men is perfect for the modern man who seeks a fragrance that combines freshness, warmth, and longevity, making it ideal for both day and evening wear.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Flavia, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,328.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Flavia-Mega-Men.png?v=1779879403,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
