decant-partial-of-franck-olivier-blue-touch-edp,Decant/Partial Of Franck Olivier Blue Touch EDP,"<p>Experience Timeless Sophistication with Franck Olivier Blue Touch 100ML EDP For Men 🌟</p>

<p>Indulge in the epitome of refined masculinity with Franck Olivier Blue Touch, a fragrance masterpiece crafted in the heart of the France. This 100ml Eau De Parfum for men embodies sophistication, allure, and enduring elegance, making it a timeless addition to any gentleman's collection.</p>

<p>🔥 Long-Lasting Luxury: Experience the enchanting allure of Blue Touch, designed to linger on the skin for hours on end. Its long-lasting formula ensures you exude confidence and charm from morning meetings to evening soirées, leaving a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>💎 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: A burst of freshness greets your senses as lemon, bergamot, green notes, tangerine, and pink pepper intertwine to create a vibrant and invigorating opening. Feel the zesty allure that sets the stage for the olfactory journey ahead.<br>
Middle Notes: The heart of Blue Touch reveals a harmonious blend of melon, patchouli, woody notes, vetiver, sage, and galbanum. This sophisticated medley adds depth and complexity, evoking an aura of refined masculinity.<br>
Base Notes: The fragrance concludes with a sensual and captivating base, where musk, amber, and oakmoss intertwine to create a warm and enveloping trail. Embrace the lingering richness that defines the essence of Blue Touch.</p>

<p>🌊 Best Inspired of Acqua di Gio: Blue Touch stands as a testament to timeless elegance, earning its reputation as the best Inspired of Acqua di Gio by Giorgio Armani. Its captivating blend of notes captures the essence of the iconic fragrance, offering a unique and sophisticated interpretation.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Franck Olivier, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,415.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Franck-Olivier-Blue-Touch.png?v=1779879413,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
