<p>Franck Olivier Oud Vanille is a fragrance that exudes confidence, refinement, and allure. It's the perfect choice for those seeking a long-lasting, luxurious scent that will leave a lasting impression wherever you go. With its rich and complex composition, it's sure to become your signature scent, a fragrant testament to your individuality and sophistication.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Franck Olivier, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,7,deny,manual,424.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/franck-olivier-Oud-vanille.png?v=1779879415,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,oud,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
