decant-partial-of-franck-olivier-white-touch-edp,Decant/Partial Of Franck Olivier White Touch EDP,"<p>Franck Olivier White Touch Eau de Parfum for Women is an enchanting fragrance that weaves a story of elegance and freshness, capturing the essence of contemporary femininity. This 100ml EDP is not just a fragrance; it's a signature that lingers for an extended period, ensuring you feel confident and beautiful throughout the day.</p>

