<p>In conclusion, Franck Olivier Oud Touch 100ML EDP for Men is an enchanting, long-lasting fragrance that oozes sophistication and luxury. It's a remarkable Inspired of the distinguished Oud Ispahan by Dior, making it an excellent choice for those who desire a high-quality scent without the extravagant price tag. This fragrance is an olfactory journey that will leave a lasting impression wherever you wear it.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Franck Olivier, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,415.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/fanck-Olivier-oud-touch.webp?v=1780384849,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,oud,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
