Perfect for evenings, date nights, and cooler weather, this Eau de Parfum delivers a smooth balance of sweetness, warmth, and subtle sensuality.
✨ French Avenue Zenith Vanilla – a refined blend of boozy citrus sparkle and creamy vanilla warmth.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, French Avenue, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,588.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/French-Avenue-Zenith-Vanilla.png?v=1779879419,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,vanilla,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
