decant-partial-of-french-avenue-aromatix-teas-me-extrait-de-parfum,Decant/Partial Of French Avenue Aromatix Teas Me Extrait De Parfum,"French Avenue Aromatix Teas Me 100ml Extrait de Parfum – A Playful Infusion of Spice &amp; Seduction 🍋🔥
Dare to be intriguing with French Avenue Aromatix Teas Me, an extrait de parfum that balances freshness, warmth, and irresistible allure. Bold yet refined, this scent is a flirtatious dance of zesty citrus, aromatic tea, and creamy ambered depth—crafted for those who enjoy leaving a lingering impression.
Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Lime, Ginger 🍋The opening is bright and stimulating. Sparkling lime bursts with juicy freshness, while fiery ginger adds an energizing kick, creating an instant sense of vibrancy and playful confidence.
Middle Notes: Black Tea, Hedione, Geranium, Cardamom 🫖At the heart, smooth black tea takes center stage, rich and comforting yet effortlessly modern. Airy hedione lifts the composition with a luminous floral glow, while geranium brings green elegance. Cardamom weaves in a gentle spice, adding depth and sensual intrigue.
Base Notes: Tonka, Vanilla, Patchouli, Amber, Olibanum 🌙The dry-down is warm, addictive, and deeply comforting. Creamy tonka and vanilla melt into resinous amber and sacred olibanum, while patchouli grounds the scent with an earthy, seductive trail that clings beautifully to the skin.
Teas Me is refined yet teasing—a sophisticated fragrance that invites curiosity, lingers with intention, and keeps them coming closer. ✨",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","Decant, French Avenue, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,8,deny,manual,650.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/French-Avenue-Aromatix-Teas-Me.png?v=1779879440,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,extrait,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
