decant-partial-of-french-avenue-aromatix-magnetiq-extrait-de-parfum,Decant/Partial Of French Avenue Aromatix Magnetiq Extrait De Parfum,"<p>French Avenue Aromatix Magnetiq 100ml Extrait de Parfum – Effortless Charisma, Intensely You ⚡✨<br>
