decant-partial-of-geoffrey-beene-grey-flannel-edt,Decant/Partial Of Geoffrey Beene Grey Flannel EDT,"<p>Geoffrey Beene Grey Flannel 120ml EDT: A Timeless Elegance in a Bottle 🌟</p>

<p>Indulge in the timeless sophistication and enduring charm of Geoffrey Beene Grey Flannel EDT for Men, a fragrance masterpiece that transcends trends and stands the test of time. Crafted for the modern gentleman who appreciates classic elegance with a touch of contemporary allure, this 120ml EDT is a must-have addition to any fragrance collection.</p>

<p>🔥 Long-Lasting Allure: Geoffrey Beene Grey Flannel isn't just a fragrance; it's an olfactory journey that lasts throughout the day and into the night. Experience the captivating scent trail that lingers on your skin, leaving a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>💐 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: The fragrance opens with a burst of freshness, combining the invigorating notes of galbanum, petitgrain, neroli, bergamot, and lemon. This lively blend sets the stage for the sophisticated layers that follow.<br>
Middle Notes: As the scent evolves, it reveals a heart of floral elegance, with violet, iris, geranium, mimosa, narcissus, sage, and rose intertwining to create a harmonious bouquet of aromatic delight. Each note adds depth and complexity, enhancing the overall allure of the fragrance.<br>
Base Notes: The foundation of Grey Flannel is built upon a rich and earthy base, where oakmoss, vetiver, cedar, tonka bean, and almond come together to provide a warm and comforting finish. This lingering trail evokes a sense of masculinity and refinement that is both comforting and captivating.</p>

<p>🌿 Timeless Elegance: Geoffrey Beene Grey Flannel is more than just a fragrance; it's a statement of refined elegance that never goes out of style. Whether worn during the day or for a special evening occasion, its versatile nature makes it the perfect accessory for the modern man.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Decant, Geoffrey Beene, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,425.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Grey-Flannel-Geoffrey-Beene.png?v=1779879481,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
