decant-partial-of-gucci-flora-gorgeous-gardenia-edp,Decant/Partial Of Gucci Flora Gorgeous Gardenia EDP,"Gucci Flora Gorgeous Gardenia 100ml Eau De Parfum – Bright Floral Sweetness with Playful Fruity Charm 🌸🍓✨For Women | Floral • Fruity • Sweet • Soft
