decant-partial-of-gulf-orchid-old-fashioned-edp,Decant/Partial Of Gulf Orchid Old Fashioned EDP,"Gulf Orchid Old Fashioned 100ml Eau De Parfum – Boozy Cherry Elixir with Smoky Spiced Depth 🍒🥃🔥✨For Men &amp; Women | Fruity • Spicy • Boozy • Warm
Gulf Orchid Old Fashioned is a bold and intoxicating unisex fragrance inspired by the richness of a classic cocktail. Deep fruits, dark spices, and smooth woody notes blend into a warm, slightly smoky composition that feels luxurious and mysterious. It opens with a sweet yet resinous spark, evolves into a spiced boozy heart, and settles into a rich, leathery base that lingers with confidence and depth.
