Heart Notes: Rum, Ginger, Spices, Clove, Woody Notes &amp; Cedarwood 🥃🌿🔥🌲At the heart, the fragrance turns warm and opulent. Boozy rum introduces a smooth, intoxicating depth, while ginger and clove bring a spicy kick. Woody notes and cedarwood ground the composition with a dry, elegant structure.
