decant-partial-of-hamidi-prestige-fame-edp,Decant/Partial Of Hamidi Prestige Fame EDP,"<p>Hamidi Prestige Fame, an Eau de Parfum that transcends traditional boundaries, is a captivating olfactory experience for both men and women. This remarkable fragrance is renowned for its exceptional longevity, ensuring you stay enveloped in its alluring aroma throughout the day and into the night.</p>

<p>At the pinnacle of this olfactory symphony are the top notes, a harmonious blend of Cognac and Saffron. These accords unfold an opulent and spirited introduction, setting the stage for an olfactory journey that is both luxurious and memorable. As the fragrance evolves, the heart reveals a captivating fusion of Cinnamon and Tonka Bean. This aromatic core adds depth and complexity, embodying sophistication and allure.</p>

<p>The journey concludes with a rich and lingering base, where Praline, Vanilla, and Sandalwood unite to leave an indelible impression. This trifecta of base notes imparts a creamy sweetness and a warm, woody sensuality that lingers on the skin, creating an irresistible allure.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Cognac, saffron.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Cinnamon, Tonka Bean.</p>

<p>Base Notes Praline, Vanilla and Sandalwood</p>

<p>Notably, Hamidi Prestige Fame is celebrated for being a superb alternative to the exquisitely expensive and popular fragrance, Angels' Share by By Kilian. This makes it a wallet-friendly option without compromising on the luxurious experience, making it an ideal choice for those who appreciate opulence and value. Immerse yourself in the prestige of Hamidi Fame, where enduring elegance meets affordability.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Hamidi, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,500.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/hamidi-prestige-fame.png?v=1779879527,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
decant-partial-of-hamidi-prestige-fame-edp,,,,,,,,,50ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,999.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Decant_Image.png?v=1781928894,2,"",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,
decant-partial-of-hamidi-prestige-status-edp,Decant/Partial Of Hamidi Prestige Status EDP,"<p>Introducing Hamidi Prestige Status, an exquisite olfactory experience captured in an Eau de Parfum that transcends the ordinary. This alcohol-free formulation signifies a commitment to sophistication and subtlety, making it the epitome of modern masculinity. The fragrance boasts unparalleled longevity, ensuring that each spritz is a lingering testament to refined elegance throughout the day.</p>

<p>At the pinnacle of its aromatic symphony are invigorating top notes, where the zesty dance of Grapefruit and Lemon meets the cool breeze of Mint, underscored by the subtle heat of Pink Pepper. The heart of the fragrance unfolds with a magnetic blend of dynamic elements, including the spicy embrace of Ginger and Nutmeg, the floral allure of Jasmine, and the enigmatic presence of Iso E Super. As the fragrance settles, the base notes reveal a profound and lasting impression — a fusion of the mystical with the earthy. Incense intertwines with the grounding essences of Vetiver, Cedar, and Patchouli, while the warmth of Sandalwood and Labdanum converges with the ethereal trail of White Musk.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Grapefruit, Lemon, Mint and Pink Pepper.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Ginger, Nutmeg, Jasmine and Iso E Super.</p>

<p>Base Notes Incense, Vetiver, Cedar, Sandalwood, Patchouli, Labdanum and White Musk</p>

<p>Hamidi Prestige Status stands as a remarkable alternative to the iconic Bleu de Chanel by Chanel, capturing its essence with finesse. This fragrance is more than a mere dupe; it's an homage to timeless sophistication, offering an affordable yet luxurious option for those who appreciate the allure of prestige in every drop.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Hamidi, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,500.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Hamidi-Prestige-Status-Alcohol-free-perfume.png?v=1779879528,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
decant-partial-of-hamidi-prestige-status-edp,,,,,,,,,50ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,999.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Decant_Image.png?v=1781928894,2,"",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,
decant-partial-of-hamidi-prestige-esteem-edp,Decant/Partial Of Hamidi Prestige Esteem EDP,"<p>Introducing Hamidi Prestige Esteem, an opulent olfactory experience in specially crafted for women who revel in luxury and allure. This remarkable fragrance is not only a sensory masterpiece but also boasts an alcohol-free formulation, making it gentle on the skin. Lasting power is elevated to an extraordinary level, ensuring that the captivating essence lingers throughout the day and into the night.</p>

<p>At the top, a symphony of citrus unfolds with the zesty dance of Blood Orange and Mandarin Orange, creating a bright and invigorating opening. The heart of the fragrance is a lush bouquet featuring the floral elegance of Honey, Gardenia, Orange Blossom, Jasmine, and Peach. This harmonious blend evokes a sense of femininity and sophistication. The base notes of Vanilla, Caramel, and Patchouli add a sweet and earthy depth, leaving a lingering trail of sensuality.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Blood Orange and Mandarin Orange.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Honey, Gardenia, Orange Blossom, Jasmine, and Peach.</p>

<p>Base Notes: Vanilla, Caramel, Patchouli</p>

<p>Hamidi Prestige Esteem is not just a fragrance; it's an affordable luxury that mirrors the allure of the iconic Scandal by Jean Paul Gaultier. This scent encapsulates the essence of its high-end counterpart, providing a great dupe for those who seek sophistication without compromising their budget. Unveil an aura of prestige and indulge in the lasting embrace of Hamidi Prestige Esteem.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Hamidi, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,500.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Hamidi-Prestige-Esteem.png?v=1779879529,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
