<p>Havoc Silver Perfume 75ML for men and ladies is named a beautiful fine overgrown, green, aldehydic chypre with a flower that starts with a tempting botanical creme broule. It step by step settles down to a truly exquisite retro blend of green floracy and a swoon musk. Havoc Perfume For Men make your body fresh and cool. Cologne spray with long time stay smell. Destruction Silver is an exceptionally uncommon and elusive aroma. This Fragrance was initially created back in the 1970'S by MARY QUANT.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Decant, Havoc, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,373.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Havoc-Silver-75ml-EDT.png?v=1779879557,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
