decant-partial-of-hermes-h24-edp,Decant/Partial Of Hermes H24 EDP,"<p>Hermes H24 For Men 100ml Eau de Parfum: A Modern Olfactory Masterpiece</p>

<p>Discover a new dimension of sophistication with Hermes H24, an olfactory symphony that redefines the essence of masculinity. This 100ml Eau de Parfum embodies the spirit of the modern man – bold, refined, and irresistibly charismatic.</p>

<p>Fragrance Unveiled:</p>

<p>Clary Sage: At the forefront of this aromatic journey is the enigmatic clary sage, a herbaceous note that introduces an herbal freshness, setting the stage for an olfactory exploration. This vibrant top note adds an invigorating touch, making H24 a fragrance that intrigues right from the first spritz.<br>
Oak Moss: As the scent evolves, the heart reveals the timeless allure of oak moss. Earthy and woody, this note adds depth and complexity, creating a robust and enduring core that resonates with natural elegance. It's a nod to the classic, seamlessly interwoven with modernity.<br>
Sclarene: The inclusion of sclarene in the composition introduces a hint of sweetness, adding a subtle sensuality to the fragrance. It bridges the herbal and woody facets, creating a harmonious blend that captivates the senses with every nuance.<br>
Metallic Note: The metallic note in H24 is the avant-garde touch that sets this fragrance apart. A contemporary twist, it introduces an industrial edge, symbolizing strength and innovation. This unexpected element adds an intriguing dimension to the olfactory journey, making H24 a scent that defies convention.</p>

<p>A Symphony of Elegance: Hermes H24 is a modern symphony of elegance, encapsulated in a 100ml Eau de Parfum. It transcends time and trends, offering a fragrance experience that is both timeless and cutting-edge. The sleek and minimalist bottle design mirrors the essence of the fragrance – refined simplicity.</p>

<p>🛒 Discover Fragrance Excellence at Fragstalk.in: Elevate your fragrance experience with 100% original niche and designer fragrances. Fragstalk.in, your go-to destination for all fragrance needs in India, offers a curated selection at amazing prices.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Hermes, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1000.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Hermes-H24.png?v=1779879562,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
