decant-partial-of-hugo-boss-number-one-edt,Decant/Partial Of Hugo Boss Number One EDT,"Hugo Boss No.1 100ml Eau De Toilette – Classic Power with Aromatic Warmth &amp; Smoky Depth 🖤🌿🔥For Men | Aromatic • Woody • Spicy • Classic
Hugo Boss No.1 is a bold, old-school masculine fragrance that speaks of confidence, authority, and timeless style. It opens with a vibrant burst of citrus and herbs, evolves into a rich floral-aromatic heart, and finishes with a deep, smoky, and slightly sweet base. The composition feels complex yet balanced—perfect for those who appreciate classic perfumery with strong character.
Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Artemisia, Juniper, Bergamot, Lemon, Green Apple, Caraway, Basil &amp; Grapefruit 🍏🍋🌿The opening is fresh, green, and energetic. Citrus notes like bergamot, lemon, and grapefruit add brightness, while green apple introduces a crisp sweetness. Herbs and spices like basil, artemisia, juniper, and caraway create a sharp, aromatic edge.
Heart Notes: Honey, Lavender, Rose, Jasmine, Sage, Geranium, Lily of the Valley &amp; Orris Root 🍯🌸🌿At the heart, the fragrance becomes warm and slightly sweet. Honey adds a rich golden touch, while lavender and sage keep it aromatic. Florals like rose and jasmine soften the composition, and orris root adds a refined powdery nuance.
Base Notes: Tobacco, Oakmoss, Patchouli, Sandalwood, Musk, Amber, Cinnamon &amp; Cedar 🌳🔥🚬The dry-down is deep and masculine. Tobacco and oakmoss bring a smoky, earthy richness, patchouli enhances depth, while sandalwood and cedar add woody smoothness. Amber, musk, and a hint of cinnamon create a warm, lasting finish.
Perfect for formal occasions, evening wear, and lovers of classic scents, Hugo Boss No.1 is powerful, sophisticated, and undeniably timeless.
✨ Hugo Boss No.1 – a commanding blend of fresh aromatics, rich florals, and smoky woody warmth.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Decant, Hugo Boss, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,695.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Boss-Number-One.png?v=1779879563,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
