decant-partial-of-ibraheem-al-qurashi-manta-lthr-edp,Decant/Partial Of Ibraheem Al Qurashi Manta LTHR EDP,"Ibraheem Al Qurashi Manta LTHR 75ml EDP For Men &amp; Women 🖤✨Made in UAE
Ibraheem Al Qurashi Manta LTHR is a bold and luxurious Eau de Parfum crafted for men and women who are drawn to modern fruity-oriental compositions wrapped in deep leathery warmth. It opens with an intriguing fusion of tropical sweetness and spicy richness, evolving into a sensual heart of juicy fruits and smoky oud. The fragrance finally settles into a creamy, ambered leather base, delivering a long-lasting scent trail that feels elegant, powerful, and irresistibly addictive. Sophisticated yet daring, Manta LTHR is designed for those who enjoy statement-making fragrances with depth and character.
Fragrance Notes 🌿
Top Notes: Tropical Fruits, Saffron &amp; Blackcurrant 🍍✨Opening is vibrant and exotic, where juicy tropical fruits blend with the golden spice of saffron and the tart sweetness of blackcurrant, creating an energetic and luxurious first impression.
Heart Notes: Raspberry, Oud Wood &amp; Benzoin 🍇🔥The heart unfolds into a rich contrast of sweet raspberry and deep smoky oud, softened by the resinous warmth of benzoin, adding depth and sensuality.
Base Notes: Patchouli, Vanilla, Leathery Accord &amp; Amber 🌲🤎The dry-down is warm and addictive, combining earthy patchouli with creamy vanilla, smooth leather, and glowing amber for a refined, long-lasting finish.
✨🖤 Manta LTHR – where tropical brightness meets smoky oud and sensual leather elegance.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Ibraheem Al Qurashi, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,8,deny,manual,640.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/IBRAQ-Manta-LTHR.png?v=1779879570,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,patchouli; vanilla; leather; amber,ibraheem-al-qurashi,,,edp,,made-in-uae,,,,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,,,raspberry; woody; benzoin,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,tropical-fruit; saffron; black-current,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
