decant-partial-of-ibraheem-al-qurashi-vicuna-lthr-edp,Decant/Partial Of Ibraheem Al Qurashi Vicuna LTHR EDP,"Ibraheem Al Qurashi Vicuna LTHR 75ml EDP For Men &amp; Women 🖤✨Made in UAE
Ibraheem Al Qurashi Vicuna LTHR is a deeply sophisticated Eau de Parfum designed for men and women who appreciate bold aromatic freshness blended with rich oriental resins and a smooth leathery-woody foundation. Complex, elegant, and long-lasting, this fragrance moves through layers of herbs, spices, incense, and warm woods—creating a scent that feels powerful, refined, and timelessly luxurious.
Fragrance Notes 🌿
Top Notes: Clary Sage, Coriander, Bergamot, Lavender &amp; Cardamom 🌿🍋The fragrance opens with a fresh aromatic wave of clary sage and lavender, lifted by the citrus brightness of bergamot. Coriander and cardamom add a gentle spicy edge, making the opening crisp, herbal, and refined.
Heart Notes: Frankincense, Cinnamon, Myrrh, Orris, Clove &amp; Cocoa 🔥🌸At the heart, smoky frankincense and myrrh create a rich resinous depth, layered with warm cinnamon and clove spice. Orris brings powdery elegance, while cocoa adds a smooth, subtle gourmand richness that softens the intensity.
Base Notes: Tonka Bean, Patchouli, Cedarwood, Vetiver, Amber &amp; Musk 🌲🤍The dry-down settles into a luxurious base of earthy patchouli and vetiver, balanced with cedarwood strength and warm amber glow. Tonka bean and musk add creamy softness, leaving a sensual, long-lasting trail.
