decant-partial-of-ibraheem-al-qurashi-golden-amber-edp,Decant/Partial Of Ibraheem Al Qurashi Golden Amber EDP,"<p>Ibraheem Al Qurashi Golden Amber 100ML Eau De Parfum – The Essence of Timeless Luxury 🌟</p>

<p>Indulge in the captivating scent of Ibraheem Al Qurashi Golden Amber, a high-quality, long-lasting attar made in the UAE. This rich-smelling fragrance weaves together musky and woody elements, creating an enchanting experience that elevates your senses. Inspired by the Alps, it is a perfect blend of indulgence, strength, and timeless elegance.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Bergamot and Nutmeg<br>
(A refreshing burst of citrus and spice that uplifts and awakens the senses.)<br>
Middle Notes: Violet and Cistus Incanus<br>
(A soft, floral heart with calming sweetness, adding depth and elegance to the fragrance.)<br>
Base Notes: Ambergris and Patchouli<br>
(Warm, earthy, and musky notes that linger, offering a luxurious and lasting finish.)</p>

<p>Golden Amber opens with the vibrant freshness of Bergamot and Nutmeg, which seamlessly blend into the heart of Violet and Cistus Incanus, offering a comforting floral touch. The Ambergris and Patchouli base add a layer of warmth and depth, creating a long-lasting, indulgent fragrance. Floating over the Alps, the fragrance carries a musky woody scent, balanced by citrus notes that revive your inner youth and energy. Perfect for any occasion, Ibraheem Al Qurashi Golden Amber envelops you in a world of refined elegance.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Ibraheem Al Qurashi, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,700.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Ibraheem-Al-Qurashi-Golden-Amber.png?v=1779879659,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,birch; citruses,ibraheem-al-qurashi,,Oriental Woody,edp,,made-in-uae,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Ibraheem-AlQurashi/Golden-Amber-100575.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,leather; amber; floral; smoky; citrus,,leather; rose,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,amber; carnation,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
