decant-partial-of-ibraheem-al-qurashi-arabian-tobacco-extrait-de-parfum,Decant/Partial Of Ibraheem Al Qurashi Arabian Tobacco Extrait De Parfum,"Ibraheem Al Qurashi Arabian Tobacco 100ml Extrait De Parfum – Smoky Tobacco with Sweet Gourmand Depth 🔥☕For Men | Tobacco • Sweet • Smoky
Arabian Tobacco by Ibraheem Al Qurashi is a luxurious extrait de parfum crafted for men who appreciate deep, bold, and addictive fragrances. Rich tobacco blends with creamy sweetness and smoky warmth, creating an intense and long-lasting signature scent perfect for special occasions.

Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Tobacco, Saffron &amp; Iris 🍂A bold opening of rich tobacco softened with elegant iris and warm saffron creates a refined and powerful start.
Heart Notes: Salted Caramel Fudge, Tonka &amp; Rose 🍮🌹A delicious gourmand heart blends creamy caramel sweetness with smooth tonka and a touch of rose, adding warmth and sophistication.
