decant-partial-of-jacques-bogart-one-man-show-emerald-edt,Decant/Partial Of Jacques Bogart One Man Show Emerald EDT,"<p>Jacques Bogart one man show emerald edition was launched in spring 2018 as a modern fragrance which blends sparkling freshness, woody sensuality and powerful leather. This floral, woody and oriental fragrance was developed by corinne cachen. Top notes: violet, basil, elemi. Heart notes: Tonka bean, cedar wood, nutmeg. Base notes: labdanum, patchouli, leather.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Decant, Jacques Bogart, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,399.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Jacques-Bogart-One-Man-Show-Emerald-100ml-EDT.png?v=1779879687,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,leather; labdanum; patchouli,jacques-bogart,,,edt,,jacques-bogart,,aromatic; spicy,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Jacques-Bogart/One-Man-Show-Emerald-Edition-46964.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,fresh-spicy; aromatic; woody; amber; leather; balsamic; powdery,,cedar; nutmeg-1; tonka-bean,,,,,,,,,,,daily-wear,,,sweet-warm,basil; elemi; violet,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
