decant-partial-of-jacques-bogart-one-man-show-oud,Decant/Partial Of Jacques Bogart One Man Show Oud,"<p>Jacques Bogart One Man Show Oud Edition is one of the most classic woody-spicy and little sweet fragrances with long-lasting and beast performance. The main fragrance notes in this fragrance are oud, leather, warm spices so it's totally aromatic fragrance with a hint of tobacco. Its masculine and strong fragrance.</p>

<p>One Man Show Oud Edition by Jacques Bogart is a Woody Aromatic fragrance for men.</p>

<p>Top notes are Galbanum, Red Thyme and Bergamot</p>

<p>Middle notes are Agarwood (Oud), Spices and Geranium</p>

<p>Base notes are Leather, Patchouli and Papyrus.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Jacques Bogart, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,390.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Jacques-Bogart-One-Man-Show-Oud-100ml.png?v=1779879688,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
