decant-partial-of-jaguar-prive-edt,Decant/Partial Of Jaguar Prive EDT,"<p>The top opens with sweet and warm bergamot orange for a cheerful and compelling citrus wave. A hint of tropical air permeates the first impression for an added delight. Aromatic lavender creates a sunny, minty heart for a relaxed yet distinctly elegant impact, including undertones of green herbs. The base has an intense, hearty woodiness for a timeless aroma; the earthy tones of birch join seductive benzoin and animalic musk for aroma depth and a strongly masculine yet clean essence.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Decant, Jaguar, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,390.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/JAGUAR-FOR-MEN-PRIVE-EDT-100ML.webp?v=1780383001,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
