decant-partial-of-jaguar-classic-electric-sky-edt,Decant/Partial Of Jaguar Classic Electric Sky EDT,"<p>Classic Electric Sky by Jaguar is a Aromatic Fougere fragrance for men. This is a new fragrance. Classic Electric Sky was launched in 2020. The nose behind this fragrance is Alexandra Monet. Top notes are Violet Leaf, Grapefruit and Sichuan Pepper; middle notes are Geranium, Lavender and Clary Sage; base notes are Amberwood, Oakmoss and Tonka Bean.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Decant, Jaguar, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,390.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/JAGUAR-Classic-Electric-Sky-Men-EDT100-ml.png?v=1779879691,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
