decant-partial-of-jaguar-classic-black-edt,Decant/Partial Of Jaguar Classic Black EDT,"<p>Jaguar Classic Black 100 ml EDT – Power Meets Elegance 🖤✨<br>
Jaguar Classic Black is a bold and sophisticated fragrance crafted for the modern man who values both charm and confidence. Designed in the tradition of oriental-fougère compositions, it strikes the perfect balance between invigorating freshness and seductive warmth, making it a timeless everyday signature.<br>
Fragrance Notes:Top Notes: Green Apple, Tangerine, Orange(A vibrant citrus-fruity burst opens the scent with energy and crisp freshness, instantly uplifting the mood.)<br>
Middle Notes: Cardamom, Nutmeg, Black Tea(Spicy and aromatic accords create a refined heart, blending warmth with elegance, while black tea adds depth and intrigue.)<br>
Base Notes: Sandalwood, White Musk, Cedarwood(A smooth and sensual dry-down of creamy woods and musk lingers with sophistication and masculine strength.)<br>
Jaguar Classic Black is perfect for office wear, evening outings, and special occasions where you want to leave a lasting impression. Its versatile character makes it an essential in every fragrance wardrobe.<br>
Confident, sensual, and undeniably masculine, Jaguar Classic Black is more than a fragrance—it’s a statement of refined power and timeless elegance. 🖤</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Decant, Jaguar, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,395.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Jaguar-Classic-Black-100-ml-EDT.png?v=1779879694,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
