decant-partial-of-joovan-platinum-musk-cologne-spray,Decant/Partial Of Joovan Platinum Musk Cologne Spray,"<p>Joovan Platinum Musk For Men Cologne Spray 59ml – A Refined and Invigorating Scent 🌟</p>

<p>Joovan Platinum Musk For Men is a sophisticated cologne spray made in France that brings an energetic yet refined fragrance experience. This versatile scent is perfect for the modern man who enjoys a refreshing, long-lasting fragrance with a touch of sensuality.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes:<br>
Fresh and citrusy notes, such as lemon and bergamot, provide a vibrant, uplifting opening that instantly awakens the senses.<br>
Base Notes:<br>
The heart of the fragrance reveals delicate floral notes, often including jasmine or rose, blended seamlessly with musk, creating a soft yet captivating bouquet.<br>
Base Notes:<br>
The scent finishes with warm, sensual musky notes, sometimes enhanced with a subtle hint of amber or wood, offering a comforting and lasting depth.</p>

<p>Joovan Platinum Musk is a perfect balance of freshness and warmth, making it an ideal choice for day-to-night wear. Whether you're heading to work, a casual outing, or a special occasion, this fragrance ensures you make a lasting impression. Elevate your scent game with this high-quality, sophisticated cologne.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Joovan, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,369.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Joovan-Plantinum-Musk.png?v=1779879703,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
