decant-partial-of-joovan-sex-appeal-cologne,Decant/Partial Of Joovan Sex Appeal Cologne,"<p>Joovan Sex Appeal Eau De Cologne for Men 88ml – Unleash Your Confidence 🌟</p>

<p>Experience the irresistible allure of Joovan Sex Appeal Eau De Cologne for Men, an aromatic spicy fragrance crafted in France. Designed for the modern man, this cologne combines the perfect balance of musk, spices, and woods, creating a scent that exudes masculinity and confidence.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes:<br>
Fresh and invigorating, the fragrance opens with a blend of aromatic spices that awaken the senses.<br>
Middle Notes:<br>
A rich heart of musky and woody accords that add depth and sophistication.<br>
Base Notes:<br>
A warm, sensual base with earthy woods that linger on the skin, leaving a lasting impression.</p>

<p>This long-lasting cologne ensures that you stay confident and captivating throughout the day. Whether for a casual outing or a night out, Joovan Sex Appeal will help you make a statement with every spray. Embrace the essence of masculinity and elevate your scent game with this timeless, unforgettable fragrance. Perfect for those who seek a bold and confident presence.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Joovan, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,325.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Joovan-Sex-Appeal-Eau-De-Cologne.png?v=1779879704,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
