decant-partial-of-joovan-musk-cologne,Decant/Partial Of Joovan Musk Cologne,"<p>Joovan Musk Eau de Cologne for Women 59ml – A Fresh, Elegant Essence 🌸</p>

<p>Experience the timeless elegance of Joovan Musk Eau de Cologne, a refined fragrance made in France. This enchanting perfume offers a delicate balance of floral, citrus, and warm spicy notes, creating a scent that’s both refreshing and alluring. Perfect for the modern woman who appreciates sophistication and subtlety, Joovan Musk is designed to leave a lasting impression.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Note: White Floral Musk<br>
(A fresh and clean opening with soft, floral musk, setting a delicate tone.)<br>
Middle Note: Citrus<br>
(A burst of zesty citrus that adds a vibrant, energizing heart to the fragrance.)<br>
Base Note: Spicy Amber Facets<br>
(Warm, spicy amber that lingers and creates a rich, sensual finish.)</p>

<p>Joovan Musk Eau de Cologne is ideal for everyday wear, offering a long-lasting, balanced scent that can be worn for both casual and special occasions. Its light yet captivating aroma makes it a perfect choice for those who seek elegance without being overpowering. Embrace the essence of French sophistication with Joovan Musk Eau de Cologne and indulge in a fragrance that exudes both freshness and warmth.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Joovan, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,371.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Joovan-Musk-Eau-de-Cologne.png?v=1779879704,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
