decant-partial-of-khadlaj-karus-blu-spice-edp,Decant/Partial Of Khadlaj Karus Blu Spice EDP,"<p>Khadlaj Karus Blu Spice 100ml EDP – A Spark of Fresh Spice 🌿🔥Made in UAE | Unisex | Long Lasting Eau de Parfum<br>
Experience the bold sophistication of Khadlaj Karus Blu Spice, a uniquely balanced unisex fragrance that merges fresh elegance with exotic spice. Crafted in the UAE with premium ingredients, this Eau de Parfum offers remarkable longevity that stays with you through the day and into the night.<br>
Inspired By Imagination by Louis Vuitton<br>
It opens with a refreshing burst of tea leaves and bergamot, delivering a clean, citrusy energy that instantly uplifts the senses. As the scent settles, the heart unfolds into a vibrant blend of neroli and ginger, creating a warm, zesty floral-spice fusion that is both inviting and confident. Finally, the fragrance is grounded by a rich and smooth base of cinnamon and guaiacwood, leaving behind a spicy-woody trail that is deep, sensual, and unforgettable.<br>
Fragrance Notes:Top Notes: Tea, BergamotA fresh and calming introduction with bright citrusy flair.<br>
