decant-partial-of-louis-cardin-ray-edp,Decant/Partial Of Louis Cardin Ray EDP,"Louis Cardin Ray 100ml EDP For Men – A Warm Honeyed Oud Sophistication ✨Louis Cardin Ray is a bold and luxurious Eau de Parfum crafted for men who appreciate rich sweetness blended with deep woody intensity. It opens with a smooth, golden warmth, unfolds into a refined floral heart, and settles into a powerful woody-oud base—perfect for evening wear, special occasions, and confident statements.Fragrance Notes ✨Top Notes: Honey &amp; Saffron 🍯🔥The opening is warm, sweet, and captivating. Honey delivers a rich, golden sweetness, while saffron adds an exotic, spicy depth—creating a striking and memorable introduction.Heart Note: Rose 🌹At the heart, rose brings refined floral elegance, softening the sweetness with a sophisticated, velvety touch that enhances the fragrance’s luxurious character.Base Notes: Cashmirwood, Agarwood (Oud) &amp; Sandalwood 🌲🤎The dry-down is deep, woody, and sensual. Cashmirwood offers smooth warmth, agarwood (oud) provides dark, resinous richness, and sandalwood adds creamy depth—leaving a long-lasting, powerful trail.Louis Cardin Ray is ideal for men who desire a fragrance that is sweet yet bold—warm and spicy at first, elegantly floral at heart, and intensely woody and refined at the finish. A statement scent of strength and sophistication.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Louis Cardin, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,325.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Louis-Cardin-Ray.png?v=1779879809,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
