decant-partial-of-louis-cardin-pink-cloud-edp,Decant/Partial Of Louis Cardin Pink Cloud EDP,"Louis Cardin Pink Cloud 100ml EDP For Women – A Dreamy Fruity-Floral Delight ✨Louis Cardin Pink Cloud is a charming and uplifting Eau de Parfum crafted for women who love playful sweetness wrapped in soft elegance. It opens with sparkling citrus freshness, blossoms into a luscious fruity-floral heart, and settles into a warm, sensual base—perfect for daytime wear, brunch dates, and romantic evenings.Fragrance Notes ✨Top Notes: Bergamot, Neroli, Orange &amp; Green Notes 🍊🌿The opening is bright and refreshing. Bergamot and orange bring zesty citrus sparkle, neroli adds delicate floral freshness, and green notes provide a crisp, airy lift—creating a joyful first impression.Heart Notes: Strawberry, Jasmine, Peach, Coconut, Rose &amp; Lily-of-the-Valley 🍓🌸🥥At the heart, juicy strawberry and peach offer sweet vibrancy, coconut adds creamy softness, and jasmine, rose, and lily-of-the-valley create a graceful floral bouquet—forming a feminine, dreamy core.Base Notes: Patchouli, Musk &amp; Amber 🤍🌿The dry-down is warm and comforting. Patchouli provides subtle earthiness, musk adds soft sensuality, and amber delivers golden warmth—leaving a sweet, elegant, and lasting trail.Louis Cardin Pink Cloud is perfect for women who adore fragrances that are bright, sweet, and romantic—fresh and sparkling at first, fruity and floral at heart, and warm, soft, and irresistibly feminine at the finish.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Louis Cardin, Partial, Women",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,410.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Louis-Cardin-Pink-Cloud.png?v=1779879810,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
