decant-partial-of-louis-cardin-red-ruby-edp,Decant/Partial Of Louis Cardin Red Ruby EDP,"Louis Cardin Red Ruby 100ml EDP – Radiant Saffron Amber with Modern Woody Depth ❤️✨For Men &amp; Women | Warm • Ambery • Woody
