decant-partial-of-louis-cardin-compassion-2-irresistible-edp,Decant/Partial Of Louis Cardin Compassion 2 Irresistible EDP,"<p>Louis Cardin Compassion 2 Irresistible 90ml EDP For Women – A Fruity-Floral Bouquet with Amber Warmth ✨<br>
Louis Cardin Compassion 2 Irresistible is a vibrant and charming Eau de Parfum crafted for women who love joyful sweetness with a graceful floral heart and a warm, amber finish. Inspired by Very Irresistible Damascena Rose by Givenchy, this fragrance blends fruity brightness with soft florals and grounding warmth—making it perfect for daytime wear, casual outings, brunch dates, and moments when you want a scent that feels cheerful yet elegant.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes ✨<br>
Top Notes: Sweet Notes, Floral Notes, Patchouli 🌸🍬The opening is bright and inviting, with a lively mix of sweet accords and delicate floral nuances. A subtle touch of patchouli adds a soft earthy depth that complements the sweet-floral energy without overpowering it—creating a playful yet refined introduction.<br>
Middle Note: Fruity Notes 🍓🍍At the heart, a medley of juicy fruity notes brings a burst of vibrant sweetness and luscious energy. This fruity core enhances the youthful and uplifting character of the fragrance, making it feel fresh, radiant, and beautifully expressive.<br>
Base Note: Amber 🧡The dry-down settles into warm amber, giving the fragrance a cozy, sensual glow that lingers on the skin. This base adds depth and smooth resonance to the sweeter opening and heart, tying the composition together with subtle sophistication.<br>
Louis Cardin Compassion 2 Irresistible is ideal for women who enjoy sweet, fruity-floral fragrances with a warm and comforting finish. It’s cheerful, elegant, and effortlessly wearable—perfect for everyday charm and lively moments.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Louis Cardin, Partial, Women",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,330.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Louis-Cardin-Compassion-2-Irresistible.png?v=1779879836,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
