decant-partial-of-my-perfumes-mpf-vanilla-and-tobacco-edp,Decant/Partial Of My Perfumes MPF Vanilla And Tobacco EDP,"My Perfumes MPF Vanilla and Tobacco 100ml EDP For Men – A Rich &amp; Sophisticated Tobacco-Gourmand Masterpiece ✨
My Perfumes MPF Vanilla and Tobacco is a luxurious and bold Eau de Parfum crafted for men who appreciate deep, warm, and indulgent fragrances. Inspired by the iconic Tobacco Vanille by Tom Ford, this scent blends spicy warmth, rich woodiness, creamy caramel, and decadent vanilla—creating a refined tobacco-gourmand that’s perfect for evenings, cooler weather, special occasions, or any moment you want to leave a lasting impression.

Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Saffron, Cardamom, Cinnamon Bark 🌶️✨The opening is spicy and inviting, with exotic saffron adding a luxurious richness, cardamom bringing aromatic warmth, and cinnamon bark giving a sweet spice twist. This bold start sets a vibrant and memorable tone.
Heart Notes: Patchouli, Sandalwood, Caramel 🌿🌰At the heart, earthy patchouli and creamy sandalwood create a smooth and woody core that’s rich and comforting. Caramel enhances the composition with its warm, gourmand sweetness, adding depth and delicious allure.
Base Notes: Amber, Vanilla, Musk 🤍🍦The dry-down is warm, sensual, and long-lasting. Amber provides a rich resinous warmth, vanilla delivers creamy sweetness, and musk adds cozy softness—striking the perfect balance between bold character and smooth sophistication.
My Perfumes MPF Vanilla and Tobacco is ideal for men who love deep, warm, and indulgent fragrances with a spicy-sweet tobacco edge. It’s a confident and sophisticated scent that’s perfect for evenings, dates, cooler months, and any time you want a fragrance that feels rich, elegant, and unforgettable.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, My Perfumes MPF, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,360.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/My-Perfumes-MPF-Vanilla-And-Tobacco.png?v=1779879906,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,vanilla,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
