decant-partial-of-my-perfumes-mpf-just-oud-and-wood-edp,Decant/Partial Of My Perfumes MPF Just Oud And Wood EDP,"<p>My Perfumes MPF Just Oud and Wood 100ml EDP For Men – A Refined Oud-Woody Classic ✨<br>
My Perfumes MPF Just Oud and Wood is a masculine and elegant Eau de Parfum crafted for those who appreciate the timeless sophistication of deep woods and subtle spices. Inspired by Tom Ford Oud Wood, this fragrance weaves a refined tapestry of aromatic cardamom, rich woods, and warm resins—making it an ideal choice for evening wear, cooler seasons, formal occasions, and moments when you want to leave a quietly powerful impression.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes ✨<br>
Top Notes: Cardamom, Wood 🌿🪵The opening is aromatic and distinct, with spicy cardamom adding refined warmth while rich wood tones bring an earthy strength. This combination sets a bold yet elegant tone from the very first moment.<br>
Heart Notes: Patchouli, Sandalwood 🌲At the heart, creamy sandalwood and earthy patchouli create a beautifully balanced woody core. These notes enhance the fragrance’s depth and add a smooth, sophisticated character that feels both modern and timeless.<br>
Base Notes: Amber, Musk 🤍🔥The dry-down is warm and sensual, with amber lending a resinous glow and musk adding softness and longevity. This base leaves a lingering trail that feels smooth, masculine, and understatedly luxurious.<br>
