decant-partial-of-naseem-midnight-love-perfume,Decant/Partial Of Naseem Midnight Love Perfume,"<p>Discover an alluring fragrance with Naseem Midnight Love Aqua Perfume for Men, part of the Prestige Collection, crafted to enchant and captivate. This luxurious 50ml perfume, made in the UAE, is alcohol-free, ensuring a pure scent experience and remarkable longevity. Midnight Love opens with the lively burst of bergamot, mingling with the warmth of pink pepper and a touch of mandarin for an invigorating, spicy twist. In the heart, delicate notes of orris, jasmine, and ylang ylang blossom gracefully, adding a layer of soft, floral elegance that embodies refined masculinity.</p>

<p>As the fragrance settles, it unveils a rich, comforting base, where creamy sandalwood, earthy moss, and sensual musk blend seamlessly with the sweetness of vanilla and woody undertones. This sophisticated composition offers a balanced scent journey—bold yet smooth, vibrant yet calming. Midnight Love Aqua captures the essence of romance and mystery, making it ideal for evening wear or special occasions. Perfect for the modern man who values luxury and charm, this fragrance leaves a lasting impression, enveloping you in a veil of elegance from dusk till dawn.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Naseem, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,480.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/naseem-midnight-love.png?v=1779879998,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
