decant-partial-of-naseem-paradise-escape-perfume,Decant/Partial Of Naseem Paradise Escape Perfume,"<p>Naseem Paradise Escape Aqua from the Prestige Collection captures the essence of a luxurious getaway in every spray. This alcohol-free, long-lasting fragrance opens with vibrant top notes of mandarin, bergamot, and lemon, creating an instant splash of fresh, zesty energy. As it unfolds, heart notes of cardamom, leather, and fruity hints blend with earthy coriander and aromatic ciste, adding warmth and an exotic, bold touch to the fragrance. This unique composition then deepens with a rich, grounding base of woody tones, musk, amber, and patchouli, evoking the tranquil, lush beauty of a private paradise.</p>

<p>Crafted in the UAE, Paradise Escape Aqua is designed for the modern man who values sophistication and timeless appeal. The fragrance takes you on an olfactory journey, from invigorating freshness to a warm, earthy finish, creating an aura that feels both comforting and adventurous. This is the perfect scent for those who want to leave a lasting impression with a blend that’s luxurious, captivating, and reminiscent of an unforgettable escape.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Naseem, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,480.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/naseem-paradise-escape.png?v=1779879999,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
