decant-partial-of-naseem-peak-pulse-perfume,Decant/Partial Of Naseem Peak Pulse Perfume,"<p>Naseem Peak Pulse Aqua Perfume for Men is a luxurious, alcohol-free fragrance crafted in the UAE as part of the prestigious Prestige Collection. This bold, masculine scent captures the exhilarating thrill of skiing down the Swiss Alps, immersing you in an unforgettable adventure with every spray.</p>

<p>Peak Pulse opens with a fresh burst of bergamot and lemon, creating an invigorating and crisp introduction. As it settles, the heart unfolds with a balanced blend of rose and sandalwood, adding a touch of rugged elegance that speaks to the allure of high-altitude peaks. In the base, a sophisticated fusion of amber, jasmine, and musk combines with rich woody notes, providing a warm, confident finish that feels timeless and enduring.</p>

<p>This long-lasting fragrance is perfect for the modern man who seeks a scent as powerful as his ambitions and as captivating as his journey. Whether for daily wear or special occasions, Peak Pulse is designed to make a lasting impression, enveloping you in a fresh yet earthy aroma that mirrors the natural beauty of the Alps. Ideal for those who dare to conquer, this fragrance leaves an aura of refinement and strength.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Naseem, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,480.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/naseem-peak-pulse.png?v=1779880000,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
