decant-partial-of-naseem-marine-adventure-perfume,Decant/Partial Of Naseem Marine Adventure Perfume,"<p>Marine Adventure Aqua by Naseem Perfumes is a luxurious, alcohol-free fragrance for men who love the thrill of exploration. Part of the Prestige Collection, this 50ml scent is crafted in the UAE and inspired by the boundless beauty of the sea.</p>

<p>The fragrance opens with the fresh, invigorating touch of salty ocean air, blending with the rugged essence of ciste. This creates an energizing start that captures the excitement of setting sail. As the scent develops, exotic notes of davana, warm benzoin, and vibrant saffron emerge, adding a rich layer that’s both unique and unforgettable.</p>

<p>Finally, the fragrance settles into a bold base of wood, musk, and moss, leaving a lasting, masculine finish that lingers beautifully. Marine Adventure Aqua is perfect for those who seek a long-lasting scent as adventurous as they are. With its sophisticated blend, this fragrance mirrors the spirit of the ocean and the allure of unexplored horizons.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Naseem, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,480.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Naseem-Marine-Adventure-50ml.png?v=1779880001,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
