decant-partial-of-naseem-signature-gold-aqua-parfume,Decant/Partial Of Naseem Signature Gold Aqua Parfume,"<p>Naseem Signature Gold Aqua Parfum 100ml – A Luxurious, Alcohol-Free Fragrance for Men and Women 🌟</p>

<p>Indulge in the exquisite scent of Naseem Signature Gold, a premium, alcohol-free fragrance crafted in the UAE. Designed for both men and women, this high-quality, rich-smelling perfume offers a captivating blend of fruity, spicy, and woody notes, creating an unforgettable olfactory experience.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Raspberry, Anise, Cinnamon<br>
(A vibrant opening with sweet, spicy warmth that captures attention immediately.)<br>
Middle Notes: Rosemary, Cashmere Wood, Rose<br>
(Adds depth with a harmonious blend of herbal, woody, and floral tones, enriching the scent’s complexity.)<br>
Base Notes: Musk, Amber Xtreme, Blonde Woods, Tobacco<br>
(A sensual, earthy finish that leaves a lingering, memorable impression.)</p>

<p>Naseem Signature Gold combines sweetness, spice, and earthiness in a beautifully balanced fragrance. With its alcohol-free formula, it’s gentle on the skin while delivering long-lasting performance. Perfect for various occasions, this scent exudes sophistication, making it a versatile choice for those seeking a fragrance that is both alluring and refined. Embrace the elegance of Naseem Signature Gold and experience a luxurious fusion of aromas that’s sure to leave a lasting mark.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Naseem, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,600.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Naseem-Signature-Gold.png?v=1779880002,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
