decant-partial-of-naseem-african-sunset-perfume,Decant/Partial Of Naseem African Sunset Perfume,"<p>Naseem African Sunset Parfum 75ml – Alcohol-Free Elegance from the UAE</p>

<p>Discover the captivating allure of Naseem African Sunset Parfum, a 75ml alcohol-free fragrance meticulously crafted in the UAE. This long-lasting scent is designed to evoke the enchanting beauty of an African sunset, capturing the essence of luxury and sophistication.</p>

<p>💫 Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: The fragrance opens with the radiant citrus glow of bergamot, seamlessly blended with the spicy vibrance of pink pepper. This invigorating combination mirrors the fiery hues of the sunset horizon, setting the stage for a mesmerizing olfactory journey.<br>
Middle Notes: As the scent evolves, the heart reveals a harmonious blend of geranium, ginger, leather, and pear. The floral elegance of geranium intertwines with the spicy warmth of ginger, the rich depth of leather, and the subtle sweetness of pear, creating a captivating and sophisticated core.<br>
Base Notes: The fragrance settles into a warm, earthy base of moss, benzoin, cedarwood, sandalwood, and patchouli. This luxurious blend provides a lasting, sensual finish, enveloping you in an aura of timeless elegance.</p>

<p>🌞 Perfect for Every Occasion: Ideal for any setting, Naseem African Sunset Parfum’s long-lasting, alcohol-free formula ensures you remain enveloped in its captivating scent throughout the day. Whether for a special event or daily wear, this fragrance exudes confidence and charm.</p>

<p>Elevate your fragrance collection with the exquisite allure of Naseem African Sunset Parfum. Embrace the enchanting essence of an African sunset in every spray.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Naseem, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,430.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Naseem-African-Sunset.png?v=1779880003,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
