Base Notes: The fragrance culminates in a rich and sensual base of musk, smoky undertones, tonka, leather, and vanilla. These elements impart a sense of confidence and mystery, leaving an unforgettable trail wherever you go.</p>

<p>Naseem Power Aqua Parfume's meticulously crafted blend of heart and base notes ensures a fragrance experience that is both captivating and enduring. Perfect for any occasion, it enhances your presence with its unique and memorable scent profile. Embrace the essence of luxury and sophistication with every spray of this exceptional fragrance.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Naseem, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,350.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Naseem-Power.png?v=1779880004,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
