decant-partial-of-naseem-hypnotic-passion-perfume,Decant/Partial Of Naseem Hypnotic Passion Perfume,"<p>Naseem Hypnotic Passion Parfum, a captivating olfactory symphony designed for men, is an unparalleled sensorial journey housed in a flacon that boasts an alcohol-free formulation. Unveiling an alluring and intense experience, this fragrance is a testament to sophistication and allure.</p>

<p>Renowned for its extraordinary longevity, Naseem Hypnotic Passion is an olfactory masterpiece that transcends time. The top notes burst forth with a dynamic blend of Raspberry, Blueberry, Pink Pepper, and Litchee, creating an invigorating and fruity prelude that captures attention from the first spritz. The heart of the fragrance reveals a floral tapestry with notes of Rose, Peony, and Lily of the Valley, weaving a delicate and harmonious bouquet that lingers in the air.</p>

<p>As the scent evolves, the base notes of Musk, Vanilla, and Cotton Candy emerge, adding depth and warmth to the composition. The musky embrace intertwines seamlessly with the sweet and creamy allure of vanilla, while the subtle hint of Cotton Candy creates a whimsical and irresistible charm.</p>

<p>Top Notes Raspberry, Blueberry, Pink Pepper, Litchee</p>

<p>Middle Notes Rose, Peony. Lily Of The Valley</p>

