decant-partial-of-naseem-twin-paradise-perfume,Decant/Partial Of Naseem Twin Paradise Perfume,"<p>Indulge your senses in the captivating allure of Naseem Twin Paradise, a mesmerizing fragrance designed exclusively for men. This elixir, delicately crafted without alcohol, is a testament to sophistication and longevity.</p>

<p>As the aromatic symphony unfolds, the top notes dance with vibrancy, weaving together the sweetness of peach, the floral elegance of orange blossom, the citrusy zest of bergamot, and the exotic touch of tropical shell, reminiscent of sun-kissed coconut palms. This harmonious blend creates an opening that is both refreshing and tantalizing.</p>

<p>In the heart of the fragrance, a bouquet of middle notes emerges, embracing the wearer with the soft, powdery allure of heliotrope, the delicate charm of orris, the intoxicating richness of gardenia, the heady sensuality of tuberose, and the timeless elegance of jasmine. This symphony of floral tones adds depth and complexity, creating an olfactory experience that evolves with every passing moment.</p>

<p>Top Notes Peach, Orange Blossom, Bergamot, Tropical Shell(coconut)</p>

<p>Middle Notes Heliotrope, Orris, Gardenia, Tuberose, Jasmine</p>

<p>Base Notes Woody, Sandalwood, Ambergris, Vanilla</p>

<p>As the fragrance gracefully settles, the base notes take center stage, grounding the composition in a warm and inviting embrace. The woody accord, coupled with the creamy richness of sandalwood, the mysterious allure of ambergris, and the sweet warmth of vanilla, leaves an indelible impression. Naseem Twin Paradise is more than a scent; it's an enduring journey through a paradise of olfactory sensations, a fragrance that lingers on the skin, making every moment unforgettable.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Naseem, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,430.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Naseem-twin-paradise.png?v=1779880012,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
