decant-partial-of-naseem-urban-beat-perfume,Decant/Partial Of Naseem Urban Beat Perfume,"<p>Naseem Urban Beat, a captivating fragrance designed for the modern man who appreciates sophistication and style. This alcohol-free masterpiece is not just a perfume; it's an olfactory journey that transcends time. Renowned for its exceptional longevity, Naseem Urban Beat is a symphony of scents that linger, leaving an unforgettable impression.</p>

