<p>The depth of Naseem Urban Beat is revealed in its base notes, a rich blend of Patchouli, Moss, Leather, Woody accords, Amber, and Cedarwood. This composition grounds the fragrance with a sense of warmth, masculinity, and sensuality. The interplay of these elements creates an aura that is both distinctive and versatile, perfect for any occasion.</p>

