decant-partial-of-naseem-night-of-success-perfume,Decant/Partial Of Naseem Night Of Success Perfume,"<p>Introducing Naseem Night Of Success Parfume, a captivating olfactory journey crafted for the modern man seeking enduring elegance. Encased in a sleek bottle, this fragrance stands out as an embodiment of sophistication and resilience. What sets it apart is not just its alluring scent but also its exceptional staying power; this is a perfume designed to linger throughout the night and leave an unforgettable impression.</p>

<p>At the first whiff, the top notes of Spicy Accord, Raspberry, and Plum create an invigorating blend that sparks the senses. This initial burst is a vibrant prelude to the heart of the fragrance, where the exquisite fusion of Rose, Jasmine, and Leather unfolds. Here, the perfume takes on a nuanced and dynamic character, balancing floral delicacy with a hint of boldness.</p>

<p>As the night progresses, the fragrance settles into its magnetic base notes. Oud, Cedarwood, Vetiver, Warm Amber, and Musk form a symphony that resonates with warmth and depth. The woody and oriental tones create an aura of mystery, perfectly complementing the earlier notes and ensuring a lasting, impactful presence.</p>

<p>Top Notes Spicy Accord, Raspberry, Plum</p>

<p>Middle Notes Rose, Jasmine, Leather</p>

<p>Base Notes Oud, Cedarwood, Vetiver, Warm Amber, Musk</p>

<p>What sets Naseem Night Of Success apart is not just its luxurious blend of notes, but its status as an alcohol-free fragrance. This not only caters to those with sensitivity but also enhances the longevity of the scent. In every spritz, Naseem Night Of Success Parfume is an ode to persistence, encapsulating the essence of success in a bottle.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Naseem, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,500.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Naseem-night-of-success-1.png?v=1779880014,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
