decant-partial-of-naseem-turn-up-the-volume-perfume,Decant/Partial Of Naseem Turn Up The Volume Perfume,"<p>Naseem Turn Up The Volume Parfume for Men, in its Alcohol-Free rendition, is a symphony of olfactory excellence, designed for those who seek not just a fragrance but an unforgettable sensorial experience. This scent is a testament to the artistry of perfumery, promising an enduring allure that captivates throughout the day and into the night.</p>

<p>The top notes dance with freshness and zest, as the citrusy burst of Bergamot harmonizes with the lively accents of Pink Pepper and the tropical charm of Pineapple. This lively opening sets the stage for the aromatic journey that unfolds.</p>

<p>As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes reveal a sophisticated blend. Lavender, with its calming floral essence, intertwines with the rich and robust notes of Leather and the earthy allure of Patchouli. This combination creates a complex and intriguing profile that reflects both strength and elegance.</p>

<p>The base notes anchor the fragrance in a timeless embrace. Cedarwood contributes a woody warmth, while Musk adds a sensual depth. Ambroxan introduces a touch of modernity, and Moss rounds off the composition with a subtle earthiness. The result is a seamless fusion of elements that lingers on the skin, leaving an impression that is as powerful as it is refined.</p>

<p>Top Notes Bergamot, Pink Pepper, Pineapple</p>

<p>Middle Notes Lavender, Leather, Patchouli</p>

<p>Base Notes Cedarwood, Musk, Ambroxan, Moss</p>

<p>Naseem Turn Up The Volume is not merely a fragrance; it's a symphony that turns up the volume on your presence, creating an aura that resonates with charisma and sophistication. In its 75ml Alcohol-Free formulation, it is not just a scent; it's a statement of enduring style and allure.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Naseem, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,430.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Naseem-turn-up-the-volume.png?v=1779880015,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
