decant-partial-of-naseem-wild-impulse-perfume,Decant/Partial Of Naseem Wild Impulse Perfume,"<p>Introducing Naseem Wild Impulse, a captivating olfactory journey encapsulated in a Alcohol-Free masterpiece designed for the modern man. This fragrance boasts an unparalleled longevity, ensuring that its aromatic allure lingers throughout the day, leaving a lasting impression.</p>

<p>At the first spritz, a burst of invigorating freshness envelops you, courtesy of the Top Notes. Bergamot, renowned for its citrusy vibrancy, mingles seamlessly with the spiciness of Pink Pepper and the zesty allure of Mandarin. This initial symphony creates a dynamic and energetic introduction that sets the stage for what's to come.</p>

<p>The heart of Naseem Wild Impulse reveals a sophisticated blend of Middle Notes, where the calming essence of Lavender intertwines with the rugged allure of Leather and the herbal sophistication of Thyme. This harmonious fusion adds depth and complexity to the fragrance, making it a sensory journey through different layers of masculinity.</p>

<p>As the scent evolves, the Base Notes emerge to leave a memorable and distinctive trail. Moss brings an earthy and green quality, while Amber and Musk contribute a warm and sensual richness. Patchouli, known for its deep and woody character, anchors the fragrance in a subtle, yet powerful, manner.</p>

<p>Top Notes Bergamot, Pink Pepper, Mandarin</p>

<p>Middle Notes Lavender, Leather, Thyme</p>

<p>Base Notes Moss, Amber, Musk, Patchouli</p>

<p>Naseem Wild Impulse stands as a testament to refined masculinity, offering a symphony of notes that dance on the skin, creating an aromatic masterpiece that is both bold and sophisticated. It's not just a perfume; it's an expression of individuality that endures, making every moment memorable.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Naseem, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,430.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Naseem-Wild-Impulse.png?v=1779880016,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
