decant-partial-of-naseem-shabab-perfume,Decant/Partial Of Naseem Shabab Perfume,"<p>Naseem Shabab Parfume, available in an 80ml alcohol-free formulation, is a captivating fragrance designed for both men and women. This olfactory masterpiece boasts an exceptional longevity, making it the perfect choice for those who appreciate enduring scents that linger throughout the day and night.</p>

<p>The top notes of Pineapple, Bergamot, and Black Currant create a refreshing and invigorating opening, setting the stage for a sensory journey. As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes of Birch, Patchouli, and Jasmine unfold, adding a layer of sophistication and complexity. These middle notes contribute to the perfume's depth, making it suitable for various occasions.</p>

<p>The base notes of Ambergris, Musk, and Vanilla provide a warm and sensual foundation, leaving a lasting impression that intertwines seamlessly with your skin's natural chemistry. This blend of notes not only ensures an enduring fragrance but also offers a harmonious balance between freshness, earthiness, and sweetness.</p>

<p>Top Notes Pineapple, Bergamot, Black Currant</p>

