decant-partial-of-naseem-oud-perfume,Decant/Partial Of Naseem Oud Perfume,"<p>Naseem Oud Parfum for Men is an olfactory masterpiece that captivates the senses with its rich and complex fragrance profile. Encased in an 80ml bottle, this alcohol-free perfume is a celebration of longevity, ensuring that its enchanting aroma lingers throughout the day.</p>

