decant-partial-of-naseem-aqua-perfume,Decant/Partial Of Naseem Aqua Perfume,"<p>Naseem Aqua Parfume 80ml Alcohol-Free for Men is an olfactory masterpiece that combines lasting power with a refreshing aura. This fragrance opens with a burst of invigorating top notes, where the zesty blend of Ginger, Bergamot, and Grapefruit creates an uplifting and energetic introduction. The heart of the fragrance reveals a sophisticated fusion, intertwining the floral elegance of Jasmine and Orris Root with the earthy allure of Vetiver.</p>

<p>As time unfolds, the base notes emerge, leaving an irresistible and enduring trail. Musk provides a sensual foundation, while the warm and slightly sweet nuances of Ambergris add depth and complexity. The fragrance reaches its harmonious conclusion with the soothing and creamy essence of Sandalwood.</p>

