decant-partial-of-nusuk-ateeq-extrait-de-parfum,Decant/Partial Of Nusuk Ateeq Extrait De Parfum,"Nusuk Ateeq Extrait de Parfum 100ml — A Majestic Blend of Sweet Spice, Aromatic Warmth &amp; Timeless Elegance ✨🔥🌿
Nusuk Ateeq is an opulent unisex extrait crafted for those who appreciate depth, richness, and a touch of royal charm. Inspired by the iconic XJ 1861 Naxos by Xerjoff, it marries honeyed sweetness, bright citrus, aromatic herbs, and creamy woods—creating a fragrance that feels both noble and irresistibly modern. Ateeq is bold yet smooth, powerful yet inviting, making it a perfect statement scent for men and women who command presence effortlessly.
Fragrance Notes:Top Notes: Cinnamon, Honey, Amber, Grapefruit, LimeThe opening shines with a radiant blend of warm cinnamon and velvety honey—sweet, spicy, and instantly captivating. Amber adds a golden glow, while grapefruit and lime burst through with zesty freshness, energizing the composition with vibrant citrus brightness. 🍯✨🍋🔥
Heart Notes: Tobacco, Lavender, JasmineAs it unfolds, Ateeq transitions into a refined aromatic heart. Rich tobacco brings depth and sophistication, lavender adds calm herbaceous elegance, and jasmine infuses soft floral sensuality. This balance of sweet, smoky, and airy notes creates a mesmerizing, textured core. 🌿💜🌸
Base Notes: Tonka, Vanilla Orchid, Cedarwood, Coumarin, MuskThe dry-down is luxuriously smooth and long-lasting. Tonka and vanilla orchid deliver creamy sweetness, cedarwood adds polished warmth, coumarin gives a comforting powdery touch, and soft musk wraps the scent in an intimate, addictive finish. 🌙🍮🌲
Nusuk Ateeq Extrait de Parfum is perfect for evening sophistication, special gatherings, or daily wear when you want an elegant, sweet-spicy fragrance that leaves a memorable, radiant trail. A timeless masterpiece of warmth and allure. ✨🔥🌿",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","Decant, Nusuk, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,549.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Nusuk-Ateeq.png?v=1779880048,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,extrait,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
