decant-partial-of-paris-belle-ombrelle-extrait-de-parfum,Decant/Partial Of Paris Belle Ombrelle Extrait De Parfum,"<p>Paris Belle Ombrelle – A Mesmerizing Dance of Oud, Spice, and Floral Elegance 🌹✨100ml Extrait de Parfum for Men, Inspired by Ombre Nomade by Louis Vuitton<br>
Paris Belle Ombrelle is a fragrance that masterfully blends the richness of oud with the soft beauty of florals and the warmth of spices, creating a scent that is as captivating as it is sophisticated. Designed for both men and women who appreciate depth and complexity, this extrait de parfum envelops you in a veil of elegance and mystery. With its unique fusion of incense, raspberry, and amberwood, Ombrelle offers an olfactory experience that is both intoxicating and refined—perfect for those who crave something truly special.<br>
Fragrance NotesTop Notes: Agarwood, Incense, RoseThe journey begins with the bold richness of agarwood (oud) and smoky incense, creating a mysterious, almost sacred atmosphere. A soft touch of rose adds a layer of elegance and freshness, making the opening both powerful and beautifully balanced. 🌹🔥🌿<br>
Middle Notes: Raspberry, SaffronAs the fragrance evolves, the heart reveals a vibrant yet sensual blend of ripe raspberry and exotic saffron. The fruitiness of raspberry adds a juicy sweetness, while the warmth and spice of saffron bring depth and complexity, making the heart of this fragrance both inviting and intriguing. 🍇✨<br>
Base Notes: Amberwood, Birch, Benzoin, GeraniumThe base settles into a luxurious blend of amberwood and birch, creating a smoky, woody foundation that feels both strong and refined. Benzoin adds a sweet, resinous warmth, while geranium adds a subtle, herbaceous freshness that rounds out the composition beautifully. 🌲💨🌺<br>
Paris Belle Ombrelle is a scent for those who love fragrances that are bold yet refined, sophisticated yet warm. It’s an intoxicating blend that feels at once timeless and modern, with a complexity that lingers long after the first spray. Ideal for evening wear, special occasions, or whenever you want to leave a lasting impression, this fragrance is an exquisite expression of depth, elegance, and unforgettable allure. ✨🖤</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","Decant, Paris Belle, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,460.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Belle-Ombrelli.png?v=1780381596,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,extrait,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
