decant-partial-of-pendora-scents-clasico-de-intense-edp,Decant/Partial Of Pendora Scents Clasico De Intense EDP,"<p>Pendora Scents Clasico De Intense 100ml EDP for Men – Bold. Fresh. Timeless. ✨<br>
Crafted in the UAE, Pendora Scents Clasico De Intense is a long-lasting Eau de Parfum designed for the modern man who thrives on confidence and charisma. This fragrance opens with an exhilarating burst of lime, lemon, bergamot, jasmine, orange, mandarin, and neroli, delivering a zesty, fresh wave that instantly energizes your senses.<br>
The heart reveals a refreshing marine elegance with sea notes, calone, and peach, balanced by the floral softness of jasmine, freesia, cyclamen, hyacinth, violet, and rose. A hint of rosemary, coriander, nutmeg, and mignonette adds a spicy, aromatic twist, making the mid-notes vibrant and intriguing.<br>
Finally, the base settles into a captivating and masculine depth of white musk, cedar, oakmoss, patchouli, and amber — leaving a smooth, sensual trail that lingers for hours.<br>
Ideal for both day and evening wear, Clasico De Intense combines freshness with sophistication, making it perfect for office meetings, casual outings, or evening occasions. With its long-lasting projection and versatile character, it’s a fragrance that ensures you’re remembered long after you’ve left the room.<br>
