decant-partial-of-pendora-scents-saviour-intense-edp,Decant/Partial Of Pendora Scents Saviour Intense EDP,"<p>Pendora Scents Saviour Intense 100ML EDP: The Pinnacle of Luxury and Longevity 🌟</p>

<p>Discover the allure of Pendora Scents Saviour Intense, a premium Eau De Parfum crafted with excellence in the UAE. This long-lasting fragrance epitomizes luxury and sophistication, offering a rich, high-quality scent that leaves an indelible mark.</p>

<p>🌿 Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: The invigorating blend of Calabrian bergamot and pepper creates a fresh, vibrant introduction that captivates the senses.<br>
Middle Notes: A harmonious fusion of Sichuan pepper, lavender, pink pepper, vetiver, patchouli, geranium, and elemi forms the heart of Saviour Intense, providing a complex and enticing aroma.<br>
Base Notes: The fragrance culminates in a warm, sensual trail with ambroxan, cedar, and labdanum, ensuring a memorable and enduring finish.</p>

