decant-partial-of-pendora-scents-tobacco-rouge-edp,Decant/Partial Of Pendora Scents Tobacco Rouge EDP,"<p>Pendora Scents presents Tobacco Rouge, a captivating 100ML Eau de Parfum that weaves an olfactory tapestry of opulence and sophistication. Unveil a world of timeless masculinity with this super long-lasting fragrance, an olfactory journey that transcends time.</p>

<p>At the first spritz, the top notes tantalize the senses with a rich blend of Cinnamon, Agarwood (Oud), Incense, Saffron, Nutmeg, Green Apple, and White Pear. This initial burst is an aromatic symphony that sets the stage for the olfactory masterpiece to come. As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes emerge, featuring the earthy allure of Patchouli and the delicate sweetness of Jasmine. Together, they create a harmonious balance, adding depth and complexity to the composition.</p>

<p>The allure deepens with the base notes, a magnetic combination of Tobacco, Madagascar Vanilla, Amber, Sandalwood, Guaiac Wood, White Musk, and Haitian Vetiver. This foundation exudes warmth and sensuality, leaving an indelible impression. The lingering trail is a testament to the craftsmanship behind Pendora Scents, enveloping you in an aura of distinguished elegance.</p>

<p>Tobacco Rouge is not just a fragrance; it's an experience. A homage to luxury and style, it mirrors the essence of the highly sought-after Red Tobacco by Mancera. This perfume captures the spirit of the original, offering a great Inspired that aligns with the finest standards of fragrance craftsmanship. Pendora Scents brings you an affordable alternative without compromising on quality, allowing you to indulge in the allure of luxury without breaking the bank.</p>

<p>In every drop of Pendora Scents Tobacco Rouge, discover a symphony of notes that echo the sophistication and richness of the Red Tobacco legacy, an olfactory masterpiece that stands the test of time.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Partial, Pendora Scents",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,340.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/pendora-tobacco-rouge.png?v=1779880122,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
