decant-partial-of-pendora-scents-absolute-complements-edp,Decant/Partial Of Pendora Scents Absolute Complements EDP,"<p>Pendora Scents Absolute Complements, a 100ml Eau de Parfum for men that redefines longevity and sophistication. This fragrance is a captivating symphony of olfactory notes designed for the modern man who appreciates both strength and subtlety. Unleashing an enduring allure, Absolute Complements is the epitome of a long-lasting perfume.</p>

<p>At the top, this fragrance opens with the distinguished scent of Leather, immediately making a bold and memorable statement. The heart notes reveal a refined blend of Cypress and Patchouli, creating a harmonious accord that resonates with both freshness and depth. These middle notes lend a distinctive character to the fragrance, capturing the essence of nature's allure.</p>

<p>As the scent unfolds, the base notes of Woody Notes and Vetiver anchor the composition with a warm, earthy foundation. The interplay of these elements crafts a fragrance that is as enduring as it is alluring, lingering on the skin throughout the day and into the night.</p>

<p>What sets Absolute Complements apart is its uncanny resemblance to the iconic Gucci Guilty Absolute by Gucci, offering a luxurious experience at a fraction of the cost. This fragrance serves as a testament to Pendora Scents' commitment to providing high-quality alternatives, making opulence accessible to all.</p>

<p>Embrace the timeless sophistication of Pendora Scents Absolute Complements, a fragrance that transcends trends and leaves an indelible mark wherever you go. Immerse yourself in the rich tapestry of notes that define this fragrance, and let it become an integral part of your distinctive persona.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Men, Partial, Pendora Scents",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,335.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/pendora-absolute-complements.png?v=1779880124,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
