decant-partial-of-pendora-scents-harrier-edp,Decant/Partial Of Pendora Scents Harrier EDP,"<p>Pendora Scents Harrier, a captivating olfactory journey enclosed in a sleek 100ML Eau de Parfum for men. Crafted with precision, this fragrance is a testament to sophistication and endurance, offering an aromatic symphony that resonates for an extended duration.</p>

<p>The top notes dance with a lively fusion of freshness, where zesty grapefruit, invigorating marine accord, and the citrusy embrace of bergamot converge. This initial burst sets the stage for an exhilarating experience, capturing the essence of vitality and dynamism.</p>

<p>As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes unfold a nuanced blend of floral and herbal elegance. Geranium, known for its floral charm, intertwines with the distinctive aroma of bay leaf and the delicate allure of jasmine. This harmonious composition adds a layer of refinement to the fragrance, transitioning seamlessly from the invigorating top notes.</p>

<p>The base notes anchor the scent in a rich tapestry of masculinity. Laurel woods bring a hint of earthiness, seamlessly merging with the warmth of red amber. The deep and resonant tones of patchouli contribute a touch of mystery and sensuality to the fragrance, creating a captivating and lasting impression.</p>

<p>Pendora Scents Harrier distinguishes itself not only through its intricate composition but also as a remarkable alternative to the renowned Invictus by Paco Rabanne. This fragrance captures the essence of the expensive original, providing an affordable yet equally enchanting option for those who appreciate luxury and style. Immerse yourself in the allure of Pendora Scents Harrier, a fragrance that lingers in the memory, leaving an indelible mark of sophistication and charm.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Men, Partial, Pendora Scents",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,335.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Pendora-Scents-Harrier.png?v=1779880127,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
