decant-partial-of-pendora-scents-bombinate-edp,Decant/Partial Of Pendora Scents Bombinate EDP,"<p>Pendora Scents Bombinate For Women, a captivating olfactory symphony that transcends time with its enduring allure. Encased in a sleek 100ML Eau de Parfum flacon, this fragrance is more than a scent; it's an experience that lingers throughout the day, a testament to its exceptional longevity.</p>

<p>At the forefront of Bombinate's aromatic journey are invigorating top notes that dance on the senses. Passionfruit, Grapefruit, Pineapple, Tangerine, and Big Strawberry interweave to create a vibrant opening that is both sweet and citrusy, setting the stage for the olfactory masterpiece that follows.</p>

<p>The heart of this fragrance unveils a floral tapestry, where Peony, Vanilla Orchid, Red Berries, Jasmine, and Lily-of-the-Valley converge. This harmonious blend evokes a sense of femininity and sophistication, captivating those around you with its subtle yet enchanting presence.</p>

<p>As Bombinate gradually settles into its essence, the base notes emerge, leaving a trail of Musk, Woody Notes, and Oakmoss. This foundation imparts a sensuous depth, grounding the fragrance in a warm and comforting embrace that lingers on the skin.</p>

<p>What makes Pendora Scents Bombinate truly exceptional is its remarkable resemblance to the iconic Bombshell by Victoria's Secret, offering an affordable luxury for women who appreciate sophistication without compromise. This fragrance serves as a splendid Inspired, recreating the allure of the expensive original with remarkable fidelity.</p>

<p>Top notes are Passionfruit, Grapefruit, Pineapple, Tangerine and Big Strawberry</p>

<p>Middle notes are Peony, Vanilla Orchid, Red Berries, Jasmine and Lily-of-the-Valley</p>

<p>Base notes are Musk, Woody Notes and Oakmoss.</p>

<p>Pendora Scents Bombinate For Women is not merely a perfume; it's an ode to timeless elegance and a celebration of individuality. Envelop yourself in the captivating embrace of this long-lasting fragrance and let its notes weave a symphony that accompanies you throughout your day, leaving an indelible mark wherever you go.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Partial, Pendora Scents, Women",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,335.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/pendora-scents-bombinate.png?v=1779880128,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
