decant-partial-of-pendora-scents-azul-pour-homme-edp,Decant/Partial Of Pendora Scents Azul Pour Homme EDP,"<p>Pendora Scents Azul Pour Homme, a captivating olfactory journey encapsulated in a 100ML Eau de Parfum for men, promising an enduring fragrance experience that stands the test of time. This aromatic symphony opens with a distinctive blend of top notes, where the warm embrace of Cardamom mingles seamlessly with the rich, woody allure of Sandalwood. The initial burst sets the stage for an olfactory expedition that unfolds with unparalleled longevity.</p>

<p>In the heart of Azul Pour Homme, a masterful composition of Middle notes takes center stage. The spicy essence of Ginger, the crisp freshness of Juniper, and the exotic touch of Galanga converge to create a harmonious blend that exudes sophistication and dynamism. This multifaceted core adds depth and complexity to the fragrance, ensuring a memorable trail wherever you go.</p>

<p>As the fragrance evolves, the Base notes emerge, leaving an indelible impression. A fusion of Tobacco Blossom introduces a hint of sweetness, artfully balanced by the robust and earthy aroma of Teak Wood. Green Leaves add a touch of nature, creating a captivating final act that lingers on the skin, making Pendora Scents Azul Pour Homme a signature scent for the modern man.</p>

<p>Top: Cardamom, Sandalwood</p>

<p>Middle: Ginger, Juniper, Galanga</p>

<p>Base: Tobacco blossom, Teak Wood, Green Leaves</p>

<p>Notably, Azul Pour Homme pays homage to the iconic BLV Pour Homme by Bvlgari, presenting itself as an exquisite Inspired that captures the essence of the renowned and expensive fragrance. This makes Azul Pour Homme not only a testament to craftsmanship but also an affordable indulgence for those seeking luxury in every spritz. Elevate your senses with this enduring and evocative fragrance, a beacon of style and refinement in the realm of men's perfumery.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Men, Partial, Pendora Scents",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,335.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/pendora-scents-azul.png?v=1779880128,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
