decant-partial-of-pendora-scents-night-of-the-man-edp,Decant/Partial Of Pendora Scents Night Of The Man EDP,"<p>Introducing Pandora Scents Night Of The Man, a captivating olfactory experience that transcends time with its powerful and enduring allure. This 100ML Eau de Parfum for men is not just a fragrance; it's a journey through the night, an embodiment of sophistication and mystery. Unleashing an intense and long-lasting aroma, it becomes a companion for those who seek to make a lasting impression.</p>

<p>The top note of Cardamom introduces a spicy warmth, setting the stage for a mesmerizing aromatic journey. As the night unfolds, the middle notes of Lavender, Virginia Cedar, and Bergamot intertwine seamlessly, creating a harmonious blend that exudes refinement and charm. Lavender adds a touch of floral elegance, while Virginia Cedar brings a woody depth that resonates with the wearer's inner strength. Bergamot, with its citrusy brightness, adds a dash of zest to this symphony of scents.</p>

<p>The base notes of Vetiver and Caraway anchor the fragrance with a sensual and earthy richness. Vetiver, known for its smoky and sweet facets, adds a layer of complexity, while Caraway contributes a hint of spice, completing the fragrance with an irresistible depth.</p>

<p>Top note is Cardamom</p>

<p>Middle notes are Lavender, Virginia Cedar and Bergamot</p>

<p>Base notes are Vetiver and Caraway.</p>

<p>Pendora Scents Night Of The Man proudly embraces its identity as a remarkable alternative to the renowned La Nuit de l'Homme by Yves Saint Laurent. This fragrance mirrors the sophistication and allure of its expensive counterpart, offering a budget-friendly option without compromising on quality. Immerse yourself in the enigmatic essence of the night, leaving an indelible mark with a scent that lingers in the air long after you've departed. With Pendora Scents Night Of The Man, the night is yours to command.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Men, Partial, Pendora Scents",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,335.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Pendora-Scents-Night-Of-The-Man.png?v=1779880130,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
