decant-partial-of-pendora-scents-saviour-elixir-edp,Decant/Partial Of Pendora Scents Saviour Elixir EDP,"<p>Pendora Scents introduces the Saviour Elixir, a 100ml Eau de Parfum designed for the modern man who seeks an enduring olfactory experience. This fragrance is not just a scent; it's a statement, a lingering essence that defines and elevates.</p>

<p>The top notes of Nutmeg, Cinnamon, Cardamom, and Grapefruit weave together a spicy and citrusy overture, setting the stage for a fragrance that is as dynamic as it is sophisticated. As the scent develops, a singular middle note of Lavender emerges, introducing a touch of floral elegance that adds depth and balance.</p>

<p>What truly distinguishes Saviour Elixir is its impressive longevity. This perfume is crafted to endure, offering a fragrance journey that lasts throughout the day and transcends fleeting moments. The base notes of Licorice, Sandalwood, Amber, Patchouli, and Haitian Vetiver intertwine to create a rich and robust foundation. Sandalwood and Amber provide a warm, woody embrace, while Patchouli and Vetiver add a touch of earthiness and depth. The inclusion of Licorice introduces a subtle sweetness, rounding off the composition with a unique and memorable signature.</p>

<p>Top: Cinnamon, Nutmeg, Cardamom, Grapefruit</p>

<p>Middle: Lavender</p>

<p>Base: Licorice, Sandalwood, Amber, Patchouli, Haitian Vetiver</p>

<p>Pendora Scents takes pride in presenting Saviour Elixir as a remarkable alternative to the luxurious Sauvage Elixir by Dior. This creation pays homage to the iconic fragrance, capturing its essence and sophistication at a fraction of the price. It stands as a testament to the brand's commitment to offering high-quality, long-lasting scents that make a lasting impression. Saviour Elixir is more than a fragrance; it's a revelation, a sensory journey that unfolds with each passing hour, leaving an indelible mark of style and distinction.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Partial, Pendora Scents",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,335.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/pendora-scents-saviour-elixir.png?v=1779880131,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
