decant-partial-of-pendora-scents-la-nuit-pendora-edp,Decant/Partial Of Pendora Scents La Nuit Pendora EDP,"<p>Pendora Scents' La Nuit Pendora, a captivating fragrance that weaves a tale of sophistication and sensuality. This 100ml Eau de Parfum for women is a symphony of notes that linger, making it a true testament to its super long-lasting formula.</p>

<p>At the top, La Nuit Pendora opens with a burst of freshness, combining the succulence of Pear, the zestiness of Tangerine, and the timeless allure of Bergamot. This initial impression sets the stage for a journey into the heart of the fragrance, where Strawberry, Vanilla Orchid, Black Rose, and Passionfruit interlace in a dance of sweet, floral, and fruity harmonies. The middle notes create a luscious and romantic aura that is both alluring and unforgettable.</p>

<p>Top: Pear, Tangerine and Bergamot</p>

<p>Middle: Vanilla orchid, Strawberry, Black, Rose and Passionfruit</p>

<p>Base: Praline, Caramel, Litchi, Patchouli, Vanilla,</p>

<p>As the fragrance unfolds further, the base notes come into play, leaving an indelible impression. A rich and complex blend of Praline, Caramel, Litchi, Vanilla, Patchouli, Incense, Coffee, Licorice, Coumarin, and Papyrus creates a deep and mysterious foundation. This amalgamation of scents lends La Nuit Pendora a unique signature, reminiscent of the luxurious La Nuit Trésor by Lancôme.</p>

<p>What makes La Nuit Pendora truly exceptional is its ability to capture the essence of a high-end fragrance at a fraction of the cost. This perfume is not merely a scent; it's an experience that unfolds over time, leaving an enchanting trail wherever you go. Indulge in the opulence of La Nuit Pendora – a budget-friendly masterpiece that mirrors the allure of the iconic La Nuit Trésor.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Partial, Pendora Scents, Women",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,335.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/la-nuit-pendora.png?v=1779880132,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
decant-partial-of-pendora-scents-la-nuit-pendora-edp,,,,,,,,,90ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1211.00,2999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Decant_Image.png?v=1781928894,2,"",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,
decant-partial-of-pendora-scents-flawsome-edp,Decant/Partial Of Pendora Scents Flawsome EDP,"<p>Pendora Scents presents ""Flawsome,"" a captivating fragrance designed for the modern, confident woman. This 100ml Eau de Parfum is a harmonious blend of floral and citrus notes, evoking an air of sophistication and charm.</p>

<p>At first spritz, Flawsome opens with a burst of vibrant energy. The top notes dance on your skin with the enchanting essence of peony, lending a sweet and delicate aura. Citruses and mandarin orange add a zesty, sparkling twist, instantly uplifting your spirits. It's as if a bouquet of freshly bloomed flowers meets the sun-kissed zest of citrus groves.</p>

<p>As Flawsome evolves, the heart of the fragrance reveals a romantic symphony. Osmanthus and rose intertwine gracefully, exuding an alluring and feminine aroma. The osmanthus brings a fruity apricot-like sweetness, while the rose infuses a timeless, elegant charm. This combination creates a floral masterpiece that is both tender and passionate.</p>

<p>The base notes of sandalwood, patchouli, and pink pepper ground Flawsome with a warm and sensual embrace. Sandalwood provides a creamy, woody depth, while patchouli adds an earthy richness. Pink pepper adds a subtle hint of spiciness, creating a captivating contrast that lingers on your skin.</p>

<p>Flawsome, with its impeccable blend of notes, captures the essence of elegance and grace. This fragrance is Inspired by the iconic Flora by Gucci Eau de Parfum, reimagined for the modern woman who embodies both her flaws and her awesomeness with confidence. It's a fragrance that tells a story of individuality and timeless beauty, making it a must-have for every woman's collection.</p>

<p>Top notes are Peony, Citruses and Mandarin Orange</p>

<p>Middle notes are Osmanthus and Rose</p>

<p>Base notes are Sandalwood, Patchouli and Pink Pepper.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","best seller, Date Night Picks, Decant, Partial, Pendora Scents",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,335.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Pendora-Scents-Flawsome-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779880133,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
