decant-partial-of-playboy-play-it-wild-edt,Decant/Partial Of Playboy Play It Wild EDT,"<p>Playboy Play It Wild for Him 100ml EDT – Unleash Your Wild Side 🌟</p>

<p>Experience the daring allure of Playboy Play It Wild for Him, a captivating fragrance for men that exudes confidence and charm. Made in the United States, this dynamic scent is perfect for those who live boldly and stand out in any crowd.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Lemon, Grapefruit, Nutmeg<br>
(A zesty, invigorating burst that energizes your senses.)<br>
Heart Notes: Cinnamon, Blueberry, Chords of Chocolate, Pineapple<br>
(A deliciously rich and playful blend that adds depth and allure.)<br>
Base Notes: Tonka, Leather, Amber<br>
(A warm and sensual foundation that leaves a lasting impression.)</p>

<p>Just a few spritzes in the morning create a refreshing rush of citrus, seamlessly transitioning into sweet, spicy, and masculine undertones. The fragrance is housed in an attractive flacon, adorned with a bold military-print bunny design, making it as stylish as it is intriguing.</p>

<p>Whether you’re heading out for a casual day or an exciting night, Playboy Play It Wild keeps you at the top of the pack. Unleash your wild side with this irresistible scent that guarantees to leave a trail of admiration.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Decant, Men, Partial, Playboy",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,294.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Playboy-Play-It-Wild-for-Him.png?v=1779880139,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
