decant-partial-of-ralph-lauren-polo-green-edt,Decant/Partial Of Ralph Lauren Polo Green EDT,"<p>Ralph Lauren Polo Green 118ml EDT For Men: A Timeless Ode to Classic Elegance</p>

<p>Step into a world of refined masculinity with Ralph Lauren Polo Green, a fragrance that epitomizes the spirit of enduring sophistication. Launched in 1978 by the skilled nose of Carlos Benaim, this iconic 118ml Eau De Toilette for men has stood the test of time, becoming a timeless classic in the realm of fragrances.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: The journey commences with a burst of freshness, a symphony of juniper berries, basil, artemisia, caraway, coriander, and bergamot. This invigorating blend sets the stage for the olfactory experience that follows.<br>
Middle Notes: As the fragrance evolves, the heart reveals an intricate blend of pine tree needles, leather, chamomile, pepper, carnation, geranium, jasmine, and rose. This aromatic medley creates a rich and dynamic core that captures the essence of Polo Green.<br>
Base Notes: The grand finale unfolds with a base that exudes warmth and depth. Tobacco, oakmoss, patchouli, cedar, vetiver, musk, and amber converge to create a lingering trail of timeless sophistication. A harmonious blend that resonates with both tradition and modernity.</p>

<p>A Woody Chypre Masterpiece: Ralph Lauren Polo Green stands as a testament to the Woody Chypre fragrance family, a category that embodies the union of earthy and citrusy notes. This composition elevates the wearer into an aura of natural elegance, making it the perfect choice for those who appreciate classic, yet contemporary, aromas.</p>

<p>Carlos Benaim's Timeless Creation: Crafted by the renowned perfumer Carlos Benaim, Polo Green transcends trends, offering a fragrance experience that defies the constraints of time. Each spritz encapsulates a journey through the ages, a celebration of enduring style and sophistication.</p>

<p>🛒 Discover Fragrance Excellence at Fragstalk.in: Elevate your fragrance experience with 100% original niche and designer fragrances. Fragstalk.in, your go-to destination for all fragrance needs in India, offers a curated selection at amazing prices.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Decant, Partial, Ralph Lauren",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,666.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Ralph-Lauren-Polo-Green.png?v=1779880143,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
