decant-partial-of-rayhaan-terra-edp,Decant/Partial Of Rayhaan Terra EDP,"<p>Rayhaan Terra 100ML EDP For Men – The Spirit of the Untamed Wilderness 🌍✨Embrace the wild allure of nature with Rayhaan Terra, a luxurious Eau de Parfum crafted in the UAE and Inspired by the adventurous spirit of Outlands by Amouage. Bold, magnetic, and unapologetically rugged, this fragrance embodies the essence of a man who dares to roam the untamed, yet possesses the sophistication of refined elegance.<br>
