decant-partial-of-rayhaan-corium-edp,Decant/Partial Of Rayhaan Corium EDP,"<p>Rayhaan Corium 100ml EDP For Men – Power, Strength, and Elegance 🌟</p>

<p>Rayhaan Corium is a luxurious, long-lasting fragrance crafted in the UAE, designed for men who exude confidence and boldness. Inspired by - Emporio Armani Stronger With You Leather, this high-quality scent captures the essence of power and strength, making it the perfect choice for those who dare to stand out.</p>

