decant-partial-of-rayhaan-dahliya-edp,Decant/Partial Of Rayhaan Dahliya EDP,"<p>Rayhaan Dahliya 100ml EDP For Women – A Dream of Elegance and Freshness 🌸</p>

<p>Experience the enchanting allure of Rayhaan Dahliya, a long-lasting, premium fragrance crafted in the UAE. This exquisite perfume is inspired by the iconic J'adore by Dior, offering a perfect blend of simplicity and sophistication.</p>

<p>Dahliya opens with a juicy burst of Pear, Melon, Magnolia, Peach, Mandarin Orange, and Bergamot, creating a fresh and vibrant introduction that feels light and uplifting.</p>

