decant-partial-of-rayhaan-pacific-for-him-edp,Decant/Partial Of Rayhaan Pacific For Him EDP,"<p>Rayhaan Pacific For Him 100ML EDP: The Essence of Confidence and Vitality 🌊</p>

<p>Rayhaan Pacific For Him 100ML EDP is a remarkable fragrance crafted for the modern man who embodies success and confidence. Made in the UAE, this long-lasting perfume is synonymous with high quality and sophistication, leaving a rich, memorable scent that lingers throughout the day.</p>

<p>🌿 Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: The fragrance opens with a burst of fresh bergamot, lemon, tangerine, and cardamom, invigorating your senses and filling you with energy and vitality. This vibrant blend sets the tone for an uplifting and refreshing experience.<br>
Middle Notes: At the heart of Pacific lies a harmonious mix of lavender, laurel, and cypress. The lavender adds a calming, aromatic touch, while cypress introduces a sense of masculinity and strength, giving the fragrance its distinctive character.<br>
Base Notes: The scent concludes with a deep and captivating base of woody, marine, amber, and musky notes. These elements create a robust foundation that exudes power and elegance, making Pacific a truly unique and individualistic fragrance.</p>

<p>Rayhaan Pacific is more than just a perfume; it's a statement. Perfect for the man who dares to challenge the world, this fragrance is the ultimate expression of success and self-confidence.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Daily Wear, Decant, Partial, Rayhaan",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,375.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rayhaan-Pacific-For-Him.png?v=1779880178,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
