decant-partial-of-remy-marquis-pour-femme-edp,Decant/Partial Of Remy Marquis Pour Femme EDP,"<p>Marquis by Remy Marquis is a Amber Woody fragrance for women. Marquis was launched in 1999. Remy Marquis Pour Femme is a captivating and long-lasting unisex perfume designed to celebrate the essence of both men and women. This unique fragrance is a harmonious blend of delicate white flowers, exotic oriental notes, and invigorating citruses.At its heart, Remy Marquis Pour Femme showcases the elegance and beauty of white flowers, infusing the perfume with a soft and feminine aura.</p>

<p>These blossoms create an enchanting and alluring effect, capturing the attention of those around you.Complementing the floral notes are the warm and rich scents of sandalwood and patchouli, which add depth and sensuality to the fragrance. These woody and earthy accords enhance the perfume's overall character, exuding a feeling of confidence and allure.To invigorate the senses, Remy Marquis Pour Femme incorporates vibrant citruses that provide a refreshing burst of energy. These zesty and uplifting notes awaken the wearer and those around them, creating an invigorating and joyful atmosphere.Finally, green notes are sprinkled throughout the fragrance, adding a touch of natural freshness and vitality.</p>

<p>These verdant accords harmoniously blend with the other notes, enhancing the overall olfactory experience and creating a unique and memorable scent.Whether worn by men or women, Remy Marquis Pour Femme is a captivating and long-lasting fragrance that leaves an indelible impression. This unisex perfume is perfect for those seeking a harmonious and versatile scent that combines the best of both worlds.</p>

