decant-partial-of-riiffs-surge-and-spectra-extrait-de-parfum,Decant/Partial Of Riiffs Surge And Spectra Extrait De Parfum,"<p>⚡ Riiffs Surge and Spectra 100ml Extrait De Parfum for Men</p>

<p>🔥 Riiffs Surge – The Power of Momentum ⚡</p>

<p>Unleash the spirit of confidence and drive with Riiffs Surge, an Extrait De Parfum crafted in the UAE for the modern man who thrives on energy and purpose. Dynamic, fresh, and irresistibly masculine, Surge channels strength through a vibrant fusion of citrus, spice, and wood.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Kumquat, Grapefruit, Pepper<br>
A bold, zesty opening that bursts with brightness and refined spice. 🍊🌶️</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Melon, Narcissus, Coconut, Orris<br>
A unique heart of freshness and depth — smooth, floral, and quietly powerful. 🌿🥥</p>

<p>Base Notes: Cedar, Tonka Bean, Cashmeran, Vanilla, Haitian Vetiver<br>
Warm woods and creamy tonka create a lasting trail of strength and sophistication. 🌲✨</p>

<p>Riiffs Surge is momentum in motion — confident, daring, and undeniably magnetic.</p>

<p>🖤 Riiffs Spectra – The Essence of Distinction ✨</p>

<p>Discover refined masculinity with Riiffs Spectra, a fragrance that embodies charisma and depth in every note. Crafted in the UAE, Spectra is a masterful blend of spicy warmth, amber sweetness, and elegant woods — designed for men who command attention effortlessly.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Orange Blossom, White Pepper, Green Almond<br>
An intriguing start — crisp, spicy, and subtly aromatic. 🍊🌰</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Osmanthus, Violet, Amber, Sugar, Nutmeg<br>
A heart of floral elegance and ambered sweetness with a sensual edge. 🌸🔥</p>

<p>Base Notes: Amber, Vanilla Bean, Patchouli, Benzoin, Orris<br>
Rich and resinous woods linger with creamy vanilla warmth and timeless allure. 🌌💎</p>

