decant-partial-of-riiffs-fleurie-emerald-edp,Decant/Partial Of Riiffs Fleurie Emerald EDP,"<p>Riiffs Fleurie Emerald – Boldly Unexpected, Irresistibly Addictive 🍋🍬<br>
Dare to be different with Fleurie Emerald by Riiffs—a vibrant unisex Eau de Parfum that blends zesty freshness with dark, gourmand warmth. This scent is a dazzling contradiction: citrusy and creamy, aromatic and sweet, bright yet deeply mysterious. A fragrance crafted for those who crave the unconventional.<br>
Fragrance Notes:<br>
