decant-partial-of-riiffs-prive-platinum-edp,Decant/Partial Of Riiffs Prive Platinum EDP,"<p>Riiffs Prive Platinum, a 100ml Eau de Parfum designed for men who appreciate sophistication and enduring scent experiences. This fragrance is a testament to timeless masculinity, presenting an olfactory journey that lingers throughout the day, making it an ideal choice for those who seek a perfume that goes the distance.</p>

<p>The top notes of Riiffs Prive Platinum create a striking introduction with a blend of Bergamot, Blackcurrant, Galbanum, and Orange. This symphony of citrus and resinous elements sets the stage for an invigorating and bold fragrance experience. As the scent evolves, the heart notes unfold, revealing a delicate yet powerful combination of Tea and an Ozonic Accord. This aromatic heart adds a touch of modernity and freshness to the composition.</p>

<p>The base notes of Sandalwood and Musk anchor the fragrance with an alluring warmth and sensuality. The interplay between these elements creates a captivating dry-down that is both comforting and enticing. Riiffs Prive Platinum is not just a perfume; it's a statement of refined taste and enduring style.</p>

<p>What makes Riiffs Prive Platinum truly exceptional is its remarkable longevity. This Eau de Parfum is designed to accompany you throughout your day and into the night, ensuring that its captivating aura remains with you.</p>

<p>Top notes are Bergamot and Mandarin Orange</p>

<p>Middle notes are Green Tea and Black Currant</p>

<p>Base notes are Musk, Petitgrain, Sandalwood and Galbanum.</p>

<p>Notably, Riiffs Prive Platinum is celebrated for being an exquisite and budget-friendly alternative to the highly sought-after Silver Mountain Water by Creed. It captures the essence of the iconic Creed fragrance, allowing you to indulge in luxury without compromise. Embrace the allure of Riiffs Prive Platinum and experience a fragrance that transcends time and leaves an indelible impression.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, men, Partial, Riiffs",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,8,deny,manual,479.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Riiffs-prive-platinum.png?v=1779880224,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
decant-partial-of-riiffs-prive-platinum-edp,,,,,,,,,80ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,2232.00,3099.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Decant_Image.png?v=1781928894,2,"",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,
decant-partial-of-riiffs-prive-noir-edp,Decant/Partial Of Riiffs Prive Noir EDP,"<p>Riiffs Prive Noir is an olfactory masterpiece, encapsulating the essence of sophistication and masculine allure in every drop of its 100ml Eau de Parfum. Unveiling an enduring aromatic journey, this fragrance is renowned for its exceptional longevity, making it a steadfast companion throughout the day and into the night.</p>

<p>At the first encounter, the top notes burst forth with a symphony of Pineapple, Bergamot, Black Currant, and Apple. This harmonious blend creates an invigorating and fruity introduction that captures attention and sets the stage for the olfactory narrative that follows.</p>

<p>The heart of Prive Noir unfolds with a rich tapestry of scents. Birch and Patchouli bring a woody depth, intertwining seamlessly with the exotic allure of Moroccan Jasmine and the timeless elegance of Rose. This medley of middle notes crafts a fragrance that is both contemporary and timeless, resonating with the man who appreciates the complexity of life.</p>

<p>As the scent story evolves, the base notes come to life, leaving an indelible impression. Musk, Oak Moss, Ambergris, and Vanille create a foundation that is sensuous and inviting, leaving a lingering trail that captivates those in your presence.</p>

<p>Prive Noir stands as a remarkable alternative to the iconic Aventus by Creed, offering a budget-friendly option without compromising on quality or distinction. Its ability to emulate the opulence of Aventus speaks to the craftsmanship behind Riiffs, making it a coveted choice for those who desire luxury without the exorbitant price tag. Embrace the allure of Riiffs Prive Noir, where each spray is an invitation into a world of timeless elegance and undeniable masculinity.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Partial, Riiffs",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,479.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Riiffs-prive-noir.png?v=1779880225,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
decant-partial-of-riiffs-prive-noir-edp,,,,,,,,,50ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,999.00,3099.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Decant_Image.png?v=1781928894,2,"",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,
decant-partial-of-riiffs-enamor-edp,Decant/Partial Of Riiffs Enamor EDP,"<p>Riiffs Enamor, a captivating olfactory symphony that transcends time, embodying the essence of sophistication and allure. In its 100ml Eau de Parfum for men, Riiffs Enamor is not just a fragrance; it's an experience, a narrative woven through layers of complexity and resonance.</p>

<p>This remarkable scent boasts an extraordinary longevity, an olfactory masterpiece that unfolds throughout the day, ensuring you leave an indelible impression wherever you go. The top notes set the stage with a harmonious blend of woody accords, delicate powdery undertones, and the grounding embrace of cedar. As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes reveal themselves—a rich tapestry of leather, invoking a sense of rugged elegance, intertwined with the warmth of spicy nuances that add depth and complexity.</p>

<p>Delve deeper, and the base notes tell a story of timeless sophistication. Violet, with its subtle floral grace, mingles seamlessly with the warmth of amber, creating an aura of magnetic allure. Cardamom, with its aromatic spice, adds the perfect finishing touch to an already exquisite composition.</p>

<p>Riiffs Enamor is not merely a fragrance; it's a revelation. Those familiar with the opulent Santal 33 by Le Labo will find in Enamor a kindred spirit—a budget-friendly alternative that doesn't compromise on quality or allure. It's a carefully crafted homage, a great Inspired that captures the essence of Santal 33, allowing you to indulge in luxury without restraint.</p>

<p>Top: Woody, Powdery, Cedar</p>

<p>Heart: Leather, Warm Spicy</p>

<p>Base: Violet, Amber, Cardamon</p>

<p>In every spritz of Riiffs Enamor, find yourself transported to a realm where time stands still, and the essence of sophistication lingers in the air—a fragrance that defines not just your presence but leaves an enduring legacy in your wake.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, men, Partial, Riiffs",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,330.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Riiffs-Enamor.png?v=1779880226,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
