decant-partial-of-riiffs-la-femme-bloom-edp,Decant/Partial Of Riiffs La Femme Bloom EDP,"<p>Riiffs La Femme Bloom EDP 100ml – Elegance in Full Bloom 🌸✨Crafted in the UAE, La Femme Bloom by Riiffs is a sophisticated Eau de Parfum for women who embrace passion, grace, and confidence. This long-lasting scent unfolds like a love story—intoxicatingly sweet, yet grounded with elegance.<br>
Inspired by Mon Paris by Yves Saint Laurent, it evokes the thrill of a romantic escape through Parisian gardens—vibrant, feminine, and irresistibly modern.<br>
Fragrance Notes:Top Notes: Strawberry, Raspberry🍓 A bright burst of juicy berries creates a playful and flirty opening.<br>
Middle Notes: Peony, Jasmine🌺 Soft florals emerge at the heart, infusing the scent with femininity and timeless charm.<br>
