decant-partial-of-roger-gallet-open-perfume,Decant/Partial Of Roger & Gallet Open Perfume,"Roger &amp; Gallet Open Perfume For Men 100ml – Timeless Elegance 🇫🇷✨
Unleash your charm with Roger &amp; Gallet Open, a sophisticated woody aromatic fragrance crafted in France. Designed for the modern gentleman, this long-lasting perfume envelops you in a captivating blend of freshness and warmth, making it an ideal companion for every occasion.

Fragrance Notes:
Top Notes: Lavender, Amalfi Lemon, and Bergamot
(A zesty burst of citrus and aromatic lavender introduces the fragrance with a refreshing and invigorating vibe.)

Middle Notes: Thyme and Sage
(An herbaceous heart of thyme and sage adds depth and masculinity, exuding timeless sophistication.)

Base Notes: Tobacco, Vetiver, and Patchouli
(A warm and earthy base of tobacco, vetiver, and patchouli delivers an irresistible, lingering finish.)

