decant-partial-of-rue-broca-pride-pour-femme-edp,Decant/Partial Of Rue Broca Pride Pour Femme EDP,"<p>Rue Broca Pride Pour Femme 100ml EDP – Fresh. Feminine. Unforgettable. 🌸✨Long Lasting • Made in UAE<br>
Rue Broca Pride Pour Femme is a celebration of modern elegance — crafted for the woman who carries herself with confidence, grace, and effortless charm. This fragrance blends sparkling freshness with soft florals and a warm, sensual base, creating an aura that feels both uplifting and irresistibly feminine.<br>
Fragrance Notes:<br>
Top Notes: Bergamot, Green Apple, Mandarin Orange 🍋🍏🍊The opening is bright, juicy, and full of life. Zesty bergamot and mandarin burst with citrus energy, while crisp green apple adds a refreshing, youthful sweetness. A radiant start that instantly captivates.<br>
Middle Notes: Orange Blossom, Neroli, Jasmine 🌼🌿🌸At its heart, a bouquet of white florals blooms beautifully. Orange blossom brings soft sweetness, neroli adds fresh, airy elegance, and jasmine wraps the fragrance in a silky floral glow. This combination creates a graceful, feminine charm that feels effortlessly sophisticated.<br>
