decant-partial-of-rue-broca-hooked-azure-pour-homme-edp,Decant/Partial Of Rue Broca Hooked Azure Pour Homme EDP,"<p>Rue Broca Hooked Azure Pour Homme – Electrifying Charm, Effortless Cool 🔵⚡100ml Eau de Parfum | Inspired by La Nuit de L’Homme Bleu Électrique by Yves Saint Laurent | Made in UAE<br>
Rue Broca Hooked Azure Pour Homme captures the pulse of midnight allure — a magnetic blend of freshness, spice, and sensual depth that embodies the modern man’s duality: calm yet captivating, refined yet irresistibly daring. This Eau de Parfum doesn’t just make an impression — it defines one.<br>
Fragrance Notes:<br>
Top Notes: Pear, Cardamom, LavenderIt opens with a crisp burst — juicy pear and cool lavender wrapped in the exotic warmth of cardamom, creating an invigorating introduction that’s both playful and sophisticated.<br>
