(A bouquet of delicate florals adds depth and femininity.)<br>
Base Notes: Woody Notes, Vanilla, Musk<br>
(A warm, sensual base that lingers beautifully.)</p>

<p>The fragrance opens with a burst of vibrant bergamot and the soft sweetness of orange blossom, creating an inviting and luminous start. Its heart reveals a stunning blend of jasmine, tuberose, and white flowers, enveloping you in elegance. The base is grounded with warm woody notes, creamy vanilla, and sensual musk, leaving a captivating and long-lasting trail.</p>

<p>Rue Broca Theoreme Pour Femme is the epitome of grace and sophistication, making it perfect for any occasion. Few fragrances can rival its allure, making it a must-have for your collection.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","best seller, Decant, Partial, Rue Broca",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,411.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rue-Broca-Theoreme-Pour-Femme.png?v=1779880334,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
