Middle Note: As the citrusy top note gently fades, the heart of the fragrance reveals a delicate blend of floral notes. These soft, aromatic florals add a layer of elegance and sophistication, perfectly balancing the initial freshness with a refined and captivating aroma.<br>
Base Notes: The fragrance culminates in a robust and sensual base of musk and woody notes. This combination creates a warm, deep, and enduring foundation that lingers on your skin, providing a strong and memorable finish that defines Sapil Solid Black's unique character.</p>

<p>🌞 Versatile and Adaptable: Designed to suit all occasions, Sapil Solid Black transitions seamlessly from day to night. Whether you're in a professional setting or enjoying a casual outing, this versatile fragrance complements your style and enhances your presence. Its adaptability makes it an essential addition to any man’s fragrance collection.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Decant, men, Partial, Sapil",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,330.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Sapil-Solid-Black-Perfume.png?v=1779880344,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
