decant-partial-of-sarah-creations-awwal-oud-edp,Decant/Partial Of Sarah Creations Awwal Oud EDP,"Sarah Creations Awwal Oud 100ml EDP – Pure Oud Power with Amber Warmth 🖤🔥For Men &amp; Women | Woody • Amber • Oud
Sarah Creations Awwal Oud is a bold and minimalistic unisex fragrance that celebrates the raw beauty of oud. With aromatic woods at the top, a warm amber heart, and a deep oud base, it delivers a strong, long-lasting Middle Eastern scent profile.

Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Aromatic &amp; Woody Accords 🌿🌳A clean yet intense opening with aromatic woods sets a refined, confident tone.
Middle Notes: Amber 🔥The heart glows with rich amber, adding warmth, smoothness, and depth to the composition.
Base Notes: Oud 🖤A powerful and long-lasting oud base dominates the dry-down, leaving a dark, smoky, and luxurious trail.
Perfect for evening wear, winter, special occasions, and true oud lovers, Awwal Oud suits those who prefer strong, straight-forward oud fragrances with amber warmth and high longevity.
