decant-partial-of-swiss-arabian-shaghaf-oud-edp,Decant/Partial Of Swiss Arabian Shaghaf Oud EDP,"<p>Oud Bouquet Eau de Parfum by Lancôme is a Amber Vanilla fragrance for women and men. SHAGHAF OUDShaghaf Oud is an oriental oud fragrance that surrounds your passionate heart with the peerlessbeauty of rich, golden oud.Shaghaf Oud opens with precious strands of saffron, also known as red gold. It merges with theseam of agarwood thatstarts like the source of a river, and threads itself with growing intensitythrough each layer of the fragrance. As the oud reaches the heart of the fragrance, it awakens anexquisite rose and nuances of delicious praline. Growing in intensity, the oud meets the warmembrace of vanilla, showering you in the perfect combination of rich, resonant agarwood and goldensweetness.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Saffron, Oud</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Rose, Praline, Oud</p>

<p>Base Notes: Oud, Amber, Vanilla</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, men, Partial, Party, Swiss Arabian, Women",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,640.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Swiss-Arabian-Shaghaf-Oud-75ML-EDP.png?v=1779880409,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,oud,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
