decant-partial-of-tom-ford-velvet-orchid-edp,Decant/Partial Of Tom Ford Velvet Orchid EDP,"<p>Tom Ford Velvet Orchid 100ml EDP For Women – Lush Femininity with Golden Glamour 💜✨Opulent • Sensual • Radiant<br>
Tom Ford Velvet Orchid is a rich and intoxicating fragrance that celebrates feminine glamour in its most luxurious form. Decadent, floral, and warmly seductive, this scent is a more luminous and velvety interpretation of the iconic Black Orchid—crafted for women who love elegance with a bold, sensual edge.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes ✨<br>
Top Notes: Rum, Honey, Mandarin Orange, Bergamot 🍯🍊The opening is indulgent and glowing. Sweet honey and rum create a warm, boozy richness, while mandarin and bergamot add a sparkling citrus brightness that lifts the composition.<br>
