decant-partial-of-tom-ford-costa-azzurra-edp,Decant/Partial Of Tom Ford Costa Azzurra EDP,"Tom Ford Costa Azzurra 100ml EDP For Men &amp; Women – A Luxurious Mediterranean Escape 🌊
Tom Ford Costa Azzurra is a refined and evocative unisex Eau de Parfum that captures the raw beauty of the Mediterranean coastline—where salty sea air meets sun-warmed woods and aromatic herbs. Elegant yet untamed, this fragrance blends marine freshness with woody depth, making it a perfect choice for those who enjoy sophisticated, natural, and effortlessly luxurious scents.

