Tom Ford Costa Azzurra is ideal for those who love marine-woody fragrances with aromatic freshness and depth. Versatile and unisex, it’s perfect for daytime wear, warm climates, travel, and moments when you want a scent that feels free-spirited, elegant, and naturally luxurious.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Partial, Tom Ford",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1600.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Tom-Ford-Costa-Azzura.png?v=1779880450,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
