decant-partial-of-tom-ford-lost-cherry-edp,Decant/Partial Of Tom Ford Lost Cherry EDP,"Tom Ford Lost Cherry 100ml EDP For Men &amp; Women – A Decadent Cherry Temptation 🍒
Tom Ford Lost Cherry is a bold, sensual, and irresistibly indulgent unisex Eau de Parfum that blurs the line between innocence and temptation. Lush, boozy, and provocatively sweet, this iconic fragrance wraps rich cherry accords in warm spices, creamy woods, and gourmand depth—making it a true statement scent for evenings and special occasions.

Fragrance Notes 🍒
Top Notes: Bitter Almond, Black Cherry, Cherry Liqueur 🌰🍒The opening is intoxicating and playful. Juicy black cherry and boozy cherry liqueur create a rich, syrupy sweetness, while bitter almond adds a slightly nutty edge that keeps the fragrance sophisticated and intriguing.
Middle Notes: Sour Cherry, Plum, Turkish Rose, Jasmine Sambac 🌸🍑At the heart, layers of cherry deepen with tart sour cherry and velvety plum. Floral notes of Turkish rose and jasmine sambac add elegance and sensuality, beautifully balancing the fruity richness with refined floral charm.
Base Notes: Vanilla, Tonka Bean, Cinnamon, Peru Balsam, Sandalwood, Benzoin, Cloves, Cedar, Patchouli, Vetiver 🍦🌿The dry-down is warm, spicy, and long-lasting. Creamy vanilla and tonka bean enhance the gourmand sweetness, while cinnamon and cloves add spicy warmth. Woods, resins, and earthy patchouli and vetiver ground the fragrance with depth and sophistication.
Tom Ford Lost Cherry is ideal for those who love bold gourmand-fruity fragrances with a seductive, luxurious edge. Sweet yet dark, playful yet intense, it’s a captivating scent that leaves an unforgettable trail.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Partial, Tom Ford, Women",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,3450.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Tom-Ford-Lost-Cherry.png?v=1779880461,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,oriental,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
