decant-partial-of-tom-ford-ombre-leather-parfum,Decant/Partial Of Tom Ford Ombre Leather Parfum,"<p>Tom Ford Ombré Leather 100ml Parfum For Men – Intense Leather, Refined to Perfection 🖤<br>
Tom Ford Ombré Leather Parfum is a deeper, richer, and more opulent interpretation of the iconic Ombré Leather. Crafted for men who appreciate bold elegance and uncompromising luxury, this parfum concentration amplifies the smooth leather signature with refined florals and smoky warmth—making it ideal for evening wear, cooler weather, and statement moments.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes 🖤<br>
Top Notes: Violet Leaf, Cedar 🌿🌲The opening is crisp and sophisticated. Green violet leaf brings a refined freshness, while cedar adds a clean, dry woody structure that sets a confident tone.<br>
Middle Notes: Jasmine Sambac, Orris 🌸✨At the heart, jasmine sambac introduces a subtle floral sensuality, beautifully balancing the composition, while orris adds a powdery, luxurious smoothness that elevates the leather accord.<br>
Base Notes: Leather, Woody Notes, Tobacco 🧥🔥The dry-down is deep, smoky, and commanding. Rich leather dominates with intensity, supported by dark woody notes and a touch of tobacco that adds warmth, masculinity, and long-lasting depth.<br>
Tom Ford Ombré Leather Parfum is ideal for men who love bold, luxurious leather fragrances with depth and refinement. Powerful yet elegant, it’s a confident signature scent for nights, special occasions, and moments that demand presence and style.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, men, Partial, Tom Ford",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1860.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Tom-Ford-Ombre-Leather-Parfum.png?v=1779880471,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
