decant-partial-of-tom-ford-oud-minerale-edp,Decant/Partial Of Tom Ford Oud Minerale EDP,"<p>Tom Ford Oud Minérale 100ml EDP For Men And Women – Oceanic Depth Meets Dark Oud 🌊🖤<br>
Tom Ford Oud Minérale is a striking contrast of raw nature and refined luxury, where salty marine freshness collides with the dark intensity of oud. Unisex and unconventional, this fragrance captures the feeling of standing on a rugged coastline—waves crashing, mineral-rich air rising, and deep woods lingering in the background.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes 🌊<br>
Top Notes: Marine Notes 🌬️🌊The opening is fresh, salty, and invigorating, evoking ocean air and wet stones. These marine notes bring a clean yet mysterious brightness that instantly sets Oud Minérale apart.<br>
Heart Notes: Oud Blend 🌑🪵At the heart, a smooth, smoky oud emerges—earthy, resinous, and refined rather than animalic. It adds depth and darkness, perfectly balancing the freshness from the top.<br>
Base Notes: Ambergris Accord ⚓✨The base is warm, mineral, and slightly musky, with an ambergris accord that enhances longevity and gives the fragrance its signature salty-amber trail.<br>
Tom Ford Oud Minérale is ideal for those who enjoy unique, niche-style fragrances that blend freshness with depth. Perfect for day or night, especially in warm weather, it’s a bold choice for men and women who want something modern, artistic, and unforgettable.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Partial, Tom Ford",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1600.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Tom-Ford-Oud-Minerale.png?v=1779880472,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,oud,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
