decant-partial-of-udv-black-edt,Decant/Partial Of UDV Black EDT,"<p>UDV Black For Men 100ml EDT – Timeless Sophistication 🍃🍏<br>
UDV Black for Men is a bold, aromatic fragrance crafted to embody strength, freshness, and an enduring appeal. Made in France, this long-lasting perfume balances invigorating fruitiness with earthy undertones, creating a scent that feels both energizing and refined.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:<br>
Top Notes: Grapefruit, Bergamot, Green Apple<br>
(The fragrance opens with a vibrant mix of zesty grapefruit, refreshing bergamot, and crisp green apple, offering a burst of energy and sophistication.)</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Pine Tree, Rosemary, Geranium, White Flowers<br>
(The heart reveals a fresh, herbal blend of pine tree and rosemary, intertwined with the delicate floral touch of geranium and white flowers, adding depth and complexity to the composition.)</p>

<p>Base Notes: Musk, Tobacco<br>
(A rich base of musk and tobacco emerges, leaving a lasting, sensual trail that evokes a sense of rugged elegance and warmth.)</p>

<p>Inspired by the modern man who thrives on confidence and style, UDV Black is perfect for both day and evening wear, ensuring you leave a lasting impression wherever you go. Ideal for any occasion, this fragrance blends sophistication with strength for a timeless, masculine appeal.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Decant, Partial, UDV",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,303.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/UDV-Black-For-Men.png?v=1779880476,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
