decant-partial-of-udv-edt,Decant/Partial Of UDV EDT,"<p>UDV For Men 100ml EDT – Bold Freshness, Virile Sophistication 🌟</p>

<p>UDV For Men is a long-lasting, powerful fragrance designed for the confident man who embraces both freshness and strength. Crafted with precision, this scent blends aromatic energy with earthy depth, making it the ideal choice for those who seek to make an impact.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Mandarin, Lemon, Artemisia, Rosemary, Tarragon, Spearmint<br>
(A vibrant and invigorating fusion, offering an aromatic freshness that energizes and awakens the senses.)</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Geranium, Jasmine, Neroli<br>
(Floral complexity with warmth and sophistication, grounding the fragrance and adding a soft contrast to the crisp opening.)</p>

<p>Base Notes: Vetiver, Cedar, Honey, Tobacco, Musk<br>
(A deep, woody finish with an animalistic allure, creating a lasting impression of sensuality and virility.)</p>

<p>Inspired by the classic Woody Fougere Oriental structure, UDV For Men radiates masculinity with its dynamic blend of freshness and rich depth. Perfect for evening wear or cooler seasons, this fragrance leaves a powerful trail of confidence and sophistication. Embrace the strength and allure of UDV For Men—where freshness meets boldness in perfect harmony.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Decant, Partial, UDV",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,303.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/UDV-For-Men.png?v=1779880480,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
