decant-partial-of-united-colors-of-benetton-united-dreams-love-yourself-edt,Decant/Partial Of United Colors Of Benetton United Dreams Love Yourself EDT,"<p>Miss Dior Blooming Bouquet (Made in UAE) – A Whiff of Elegance 🌸✨<br>
Step into a world of grace and charm with Miss Dior Blooming Bouquet, a radiant floral fragrance Inspired by the iconic Dior scent loved by celebrities. Crafted in the UAE, this enchanting perfume is a celebration of femininity, blending soft florals with a delicate fruity freshness.<br>
Fragrance Notes:🌟 Top Notes: Raspberry, Pear, Bergamot, ApricotA luscious burst of juicy fruits introduces the fragrance with a fresh and playful allure.<br>
