Base Notes: Amberwood, Tonka Bean, Cedar, Vetiver, Olibanum(A warm, woody base that wraps the skin in sensual intensity and masculine charm.) 🌲💫<br>
Perfect for evenings, parties, or any moment you want to stand out — YSL Y EDP is more than just a fragrance; it’s a statement of power and allure. In India, it has earned a cult status among men who love strong, sexy, and luxurious designer scents that last. One spray, and you’re unforgettable. 💎</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Men, Partial, Yves Saint Laurent",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,1300.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Yves-Saint-Laurent-Y-Eau-De-Parfum.png?v=1779880582,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
