decant-partial-of-al-rehab-french-coffee-edp,Decant/Partial Of Al Rehab French Coffee EDP,"<p>Indulge in the captivating and aromatic world of Al Rehab French Coffee Eau de Parfum, a delightful olfactory masterpiece that knows no gender boundaries. This 100ml fragrance transcends conventional norms, presenting a symphony of scents that enchant both men and women alike. Crafted with precision and passion, this long-lasting perfume becomes a sensory adventure, skillfully blending the finest elements to evoke the essence of a French coffeehouse.</p>

<p>At the heart of this exquisite creation lies the essence of Coffee itself, its rich and robust aroma wafting through the senses like a warm morning brew. The intoxicating allure of Vanilla and the sweet temptation of Caramel intertwine, lending an irresistibly smooth and creamy character to the composition. Notes of Milk and Sugar further enhance the comforting embrace, evoking memories of cozy moments shared over a cup of coffee.</p>

<p>A delightful twist of Cacao adds a subtle touch of bittersweet charm, adding depth and complexity to the fragrance. Completing the symphony is the subtle warmth of Cinnamon, sprinkling a hint of spice that infuses the air with a touch of sensual allure.</p>

<p>Al Rehab French Coffee is a remarkable fragrance that holds the power to transport you to a bustling café on the streets of Paris, its delectable aroma mingling with the laughter and chatter of locals and travelers alike. Perfect for coffee enthusiasts, this fragrance captivates the senses, enveloping you in its delightful essence throughout the day.</p>

<p>Whether you're a man or a woman, if you crave the rich aroma of coffee and desire a long-lasting fragrance experience, Al Rehab French Coffee is an enchanting and unique choice that will undoubtedly leave a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>Main Notes: Coffee, Vanilla, Caramel, Milk, Sugar, Cacao, Cinnamon</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Al Rehab, Date Night Picks, Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,350.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Al-Rehab-French-Coffee-100ml-EDP.png?v=1779880586,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,sandalwood; woody; rose,al-rehab,,,edp,,made-in-uae,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/ALREHAB-PERFUMES/Choco-Musk-Eau-de-Parfum-88083.html,unisex,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,vanilla; warm-spicy; chocolate; powdery; sweet,,spices; amber; cinnamon,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,vanilla; chocolate; musk,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
