decant-partial-of-rasasi-rafan-edp,Decant/Partial Of Rasasi Rafan EDP,"<p>Rasasi Rafan 100ml EDP – Marine Freshness with Woody Depth 🌊🌿For Men | Aquatic • Fresh • Woody<br>
Rasasi Rafan (Men) is a refreshing and modern fragrance that captures the essence of the ocean with a clean, masculine twist. It blends salty marine notes with earthy woods, creating a crisp yet grounded scent perfect for everyday wear.</p>

<p>🌿 Fragrance Notes<br>
Top Notes:🌊 Sea Salt – A breezy, oceanic freshness that feels clean and invigorating.🌶️ Ginger – A subtle spicy kick that adds energy and brightness.<br>
Heart Notes:🌿 Seaweed – Deep marine character that enhances the aquatic vibe.🌱 Vetiver – Earthy and slightly smoky note that adds sophistication.<br>
Base Notes:🌲 Oakmoss – Green, slightly damp woody tone that gives natural depth.🌳 Cedarwood – Dry, clean woodiness for a masculine finish.<br>
Rafan opens with a fresh salty breeze, evolves into a marine-earthy heart, and settles into a clean woody base that feels crisp and long-lasting.<br>
Perfect for office wear, summer days, gym, and casual outings, it suits men who enjoy fresh aquatic fragrances with a natural woody touch.<br>
🌊✨ Rafan – the freshness of the ocean, refined for everyday wear.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Partial, Rasasi",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,499.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rasasi-Rafan-Homme_7e1aa10e-1152-4f4a-afb8-df87107dcfad.png?v=1779882470,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
