decant-partial-of-rayhaan-wolf-edp,Decant/Partial Of Rayhaan Wolf EDP,"<p data-start=""0"" data-end=""153""><strong data-start=""0"" data-end=""116""><span class=""hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline""><span class=""whitespace-normal"">Rayhaan</span></span> Wolf 100ml EDP – Addictive Cardamom &amp; Toffee with Powerful Amberwood 🐺🔥✨</strong><br data-start=""116"" data-end=""119"">For Men | Sweet • Spicy • Ambery</p>
<p data-start=""155"" data-end=""446""><strong data-start=""155"" data-end=""171"">Rayhaan Wolf</strong> is a bold, charismatic fragrance inspired by the vibe of <strong data-start=""229"" data-end=""270""><span class=""hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline""><span class=""whitespace-normal"">The Most Wanted</span></span></strong>. Built around a simple yet highly addictive blend of spicy cardamom, rich toffee, and warm amberwood, it delivers a modern scent that is both seductive and attention-grabbing.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""68u3xr"" data-start=""448"" data-end=""470"">🌿 Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p data-start=""472"" data-end=""574""><strong data-start=""472"" data-end=""485"">Top Note:</strong><br data-start=""485"" data-end=""488"">🌶️ <strong data-start=""492"" data-end=""504"">Cardamom</strong> – Fresh, aromatic spice that creates a vibrant and masculine opening.</p>
<p data-start=""576"" data-end=""691""><strong data-start=""576"" data-end=""592"">Middle Note:</strong><br data-start=""592"" data-end=""595"">🍬 <strong data-start=""598"" data-end=""608"">Toffee</strong> – Rich caramel-like sweetness that adds warmth and an irresistible gourmand touch.</p>
<p data-start=""693"" data-end=""813""><strong data-start=""693"" data-end=""707"">Base Note:</strong><br data-start=""707"" data-end=""710"">🔥 <strong data-start=""713"" data-end=""726"">Amberwood</strong> – Deep woody amber accord that provides strength, projection, and lasting performance.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""11ro6m1"" data-start=""815"" data-end=""841"">✨ Fragrance Experience</h3>
<p data-start=""843"" data-end=""1062"">Wolf opens with a <strong data-start=""861"" data-end=""888"">burst of spicy cardamom</strong>, quickly revealing a <strong data-start=""910"" data-end=""941"">smooth, creamy toffee heart</strong>. As it dries down, the fragrance becomes <strong data-start=""983"" data-end=""1018"">warm, woody, and slightly sweet</strong>, leaving behind a powerful amberwood trail.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""15kws0e"" data-start=""1064"" data-end=""1079"">🎯 Best For</h3>
<p data-start=""1081"" data-end=""1211"">✔️ Date Nights<br data-start=""1095"" data-end=""1098"">✔️ Parties &amp; Clubbing<br data-start=""1119"" data-end=""1122"">✔️ Evening Wear<br data-start=""1137"" data-end=""1140"">✔️ Fall &amp; Winter Seasons<br data-start=""1164"" data-end=""1167"">✔️ Men who enjoy sweet, seductive fragrances</p>
<p data-start=""1213"" data-end=""1284"" data-is-last-node="""" data-is-only-node="""">🐺🔥 <strong data-start=""1218"" data-end=""1284"" data-is-last-node="""">Rayhaan Wolf – confident, addictive, and impossible to ignore.</strong></p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Daily Wear, Decant, men, Partial, Rayhaan",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,8,deny,manual,480.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/RayhaanWolf.png?v=1780631060,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,amberwood,rayhaan,, Oriental Woody,edp,,inspired-by-azzaro-the-most-wanted,,oriental; woody,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Rayhaan/Wolf-130798.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,azzaro-the-most-wanted,6-8-hours,warm-spicy; amber; woody; sweet; aromatic,,toffee,,,,,,,,,,,party,,new-arrival,,cardamom,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
