decant-partial-of-naseem-candlelight-in-december-parfum,Decant/Partial Of Naseem Candlelight In December Parfum,"<p data-start=""0"" data-end=""180""><strong><span class=""hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline""><span class=""whitespace-normal"">Naseem</span></span> Candlelight In December Parfum 80ML – Soft Citrus Floral Warmth with Cozy Winter Woods 🕯️❄️✨</strong><br data-start=""135"" data-end=""138"">For Men &amp; Women | Floral • Sweet • Woody</p>
<p data-start=""182"" data-end=""398"">Naseem Candlelight In December is a warm, elegant unisex fragrance that blends bright citrus, soft florals, and a creamy woody-vanilla base. It feels cozy, romantic, and slightly powdery—perfect for winter moods.</p>
<h6 data-section-id=""1hd3x4f"" data-start=""400"" data-end=""424"">🌿 Fragrance Notes</h6>
<p data-start=""426"" data-end=""593""><strong data-start=""426"" data-end=""440"">Top Notes:</strong><br data-start=""440"" data-end=""443"">🍊 Bergamot &amp; Mandarin – Fresh citrus opening that feels bright and uplifting.<br data-start=""525"" data-end=""528"">🌿 Lavandin – Clean aromatic freshness adding smooth balance.</p>
<p data-start=""595"" data-end=""830""><strong data-start=""595"" data-end=""612"">Middle Notes:</strong><br data-start=""612"" data-end=""615"">🌸 Orange Blossom &amp; Jasmine – Soft floral heart with elegant sweetness.<br data-start=""690"" data-end=""693"">🍑 Peach Blossom – Fruity-floral softness adding a delicate charm.<br data-start=""763"" data-end=""766"">🌸 Heliotrope – Powdery, slightly almond-like floral warmth.</p>
<p data-start=""832"" data-end=""1052""><strong data-start=""832"" data-end=""847"">Base Notes:</strong><br data-start=""847"" data-end=""850"">🌿 Patchouli – Earthy depth grounding the sweetness.<br data-start=""906"" data-end=""909"">🍦 Vanilla – Creamy warmth adding comfort and softness.<br data-start=""968"" data-end=""971"">🌲 Sandalwood &amp; Vetiver – Smooth woody finish giving structure and longevity.</p>
<p data-start=""1054"" data-end=""1256"">Candlelight In December opens with a fresh citrus-aromatic glow, melts into a soft floral-powdery heart, and settles into a warm creamy woody base that feels cozy, elegant, and long-lasting.</p>
