decant-partial-of-swiss-arabian-shaghaf-nectar-blush-edp,Decant/Partial Of Swiss Arabian Shaghaf Nectar Blush EDP,"<p data-start=""0"" data-end=""164""><strong data-start=""0"" data-end=""121"">Swiss Arabian Shaghaf Nectar Blush 75ml EDP – Juicy Fruity Florals with Creamy Vanilla Musk 🍐🌸✨</strong><br data-start=""121"" data-end=""124"">For Women | Fruity • Floral • Gourmand</p>
<p data-start=""166"" data-end=""406""><strong data-start=""166"" data-end=""204"">Swiss Arabian Shaghaf Nectar Blush</strong> is a radiant and feminine fragrance that combines juicy fruits, delicate white florals, and a creamy vanilla-musky base. Bright, playful, and elegant, it offers a sweet yet sophisticated scent profile.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""68u3xr"" data-start=""408"" data-end=""430"">🌿 Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p data-start=""432"" data-end=""757""><strong data-start=""432"" data-end=""446"">Top Notes:</strong><br data-start=""446"" data-end=""449"">🍋 <strong data-start=""452"" data-end=""460"">Yuzu</strong> – Sparkling citrus freshness with a vibrant character.<br data-start=""515"" data-end=""518"">🍐 <strong data-start=""521"" data-end=""538"">Williams Pear</strong> – Juicy, succulent sweetness.<br data-start=""568"" data-end=""571"">🫐 <strong data-start=""574"" data-end=""591"">Black Currant</strong> – Fruity tartness adding depth.<br data-start=""623"" data-end=""626"">🍏 <strong data-start=""629"" data-end=""638"">Apple</strong> – Crisp freshness with natural sweetness.<br data-start=""680"" data-end=""683"">🌸 <strong data-start=""686"" data-end=""710"">Neroli &amp; Elderflower</strong> – Soft floral brightness enhancing femininity.</p>
<p data-start=""759"" data-end=""1041""><strong data-start=""759"" data-end=""776"">Middle Notes:</strong><br data-start=""776"" data-end=""779"">🌼 <strong data-start=""782"" data-end=""805"">Gardenia &amp; Magnolia</strong> – Creamy white floral elegance.<br data-start=""837"" data-end=""840"">🌸 <strong data-start=""843"" data-end=""861"">Orange Blossom</strong> – Sweet floral warmth adding sophistication.<br data-start=""906"" data-end=""909"">🌊 <strong data-start=""912"" data-end=""929"">Aquatic Notes</strong> – Fresh airy touch that keeps the fragrance uplifting.<br data-start=""984"" data-end=""987"">🌲 <strong data-start=""990"" data-end=""1003"">Cedarwood</strong> – Smooth woody nuance adding balance.</p>
<p data-start=""1043"" data-end=""1374""><strong data-start=""1043"" data-end=""1058"">Base Notes:</strong><br data-start=""1058"" data-end=""1061"">🍦 <strong data-start=""1064"" data-end=""1075"">Vanilla</strong> – Rich creamy sweetness that lingers beautifully.<br data-start=""1125"" data-end=""1128"">🤍 <strong data-start=""1131"" data-end=""1139"">Musk</strong> – Soft sensual finish that enhances longevity.<br data-start=""1186"" data-end=""1189"">🍮 <strong data-start=""1192"" data-end=""1206"">Tonka Bean</strong> – Warm sweet depth with a gourmand feel.<br data-start=""1247"" data-end=""1250"">🌿 <strong data-start=""1253"" data-end=""1266"">Patchouli</strong> – Earthy richness providing contrast.<br data-start=""1304"" data-end=""1307"">🔥 <strong data-start=""1310"" data-end=""1325"">Peru Balsam</strong> – Smooth balsamic warmth adding luxurious depth.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""11ro6m1"" data-start=""1376"" data-end=""1402"">✨ Fragrance Experience</h3>
<p data-start=""1404"" data-end=""1631"">Shaghaf Nectar Blush opens with a <strong data-start=""1438"" data-end=""1484"">burst of juicy fruits and sparkling citrus</strong>, transitions into a <strong data-start=""1505"" data-end=""1528"">creamy floral heart</strong>, and dries down into a <strong data-start=""1552"" data-end=""1584"">soft vanilla-tonka musk base</strong> that feels elegant, comforting, and addictive.</p>
