<p data-start=""1928"" data-end=""1995"" data-is-last-node="""" data-is-only-node="""">🔥🍫✨ <strong data-start=""1934"" data-end=""1995"" data-is-last-node="""">Incense 01 – where sacred smoke meets decadent sweetness.</strong></p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1190.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/SwissArabianIncense01.png?v=1780655186,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,frankincense; vanilla; dark-chocolate; sandalwood; cedarwood; moss,swiss-arabian,,Woody Spicy,,,made-in-uae,,woody; spicy; amber,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Swiss-Arabian/Incense-01-102415.html,unisex,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,woody; fresh-spicy; amber; aromatic; sweet,,fig; hazelnut; almond; lily-of-the-valley,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,frankincense; juniper; rum; bergamot,,,unisex,,'1,,alcohol-24,orange,bottle,woody; spicy; citrus; floral,,,glass; plastic,special-occasion,oriental; woody; gourmand,,,liquid,winter,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
