decant-partial-of-swiss-arabian-edge-women-edp,Decant/Partial Of Swiss Arabian Edge Women EDP,"<p data-start=""0"" data-end=""155""><strong data-start=""0"" data-end=""116""><span class=""hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline""><span class=""whitespace-normal"">Swiss Arabian</span></span> Edge Women 100ml EDP – Delicate Floral Elegance with Soft Musky Warmth 🌹✨</strong><br data-start=""116"" data-end=""119"">For Women | Floral • Musky • Fresh</p>
<p data-start=""157"" data-end=""421""><strong data-start=""157"" data-end=""185"">Swiss Arabian Edge Women</strong> is a graceful and feminine fragrance that celebrates the beauty of blooming flowers wrapped in a soft musky embrace. Fresh, romantic, and effortlessly elegant, it is perfect for women who love classic floral scents with a modern touch.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""68u3xr"" data-start=""423"" data-end=""445"">🌿 Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p data-start=""447"" data-end=""687""><strong data-start=""447"" data-end=""461"">Top Notes:</strong><br data-start=""461"" data-end=""464"">🌹 <strong data-start=""467"" data-end=""475"">Rose</strong> – Romantic floral sweetness that immediately captivates.<br data-start=""532"" data-end=""535"">🌸 <strong data-start=""538"" data-end=""549"">Freesia</strong> – Fresh, airy floral accord adding brightness.<br data-start=""596"" data-end=""599"">🌿 <strong data-start=""602"" data-end=""617"">Green Notes</strong> – Crisp natural freshness that keeps the opening light and uplifting.</p>
<p data-start=""689"" data-end=""928""><strong data-start=""689"" data-end=""706"">Middle Notes:</strong><br data-start=""706"" data-end=""709"">🌹 <strong data-start=""712"" data-end=""720"">Rose</strong> – A richer rose accord forms the heart of the fragrance.<br data-start=""777"" data-end=""780"">🌺 <strong data-start=""783"" data-end=""792"">Peony</strong> – Soft, delicate floral sweetness with a fresh character.<br data-start=""850"" data-end=""853"">🤍 <strong data-start=""856"" data-end=""867"">Jasmine</strong> – Elegant white floral note adding sophistication and depth.</p>
<p data-start=""930"" data-end=""1112""><strong data-start=""930"" data-end=""945"">Base Notes:</strong><br data-start=""945"" data-end=""948"">🤍 <strong data-start=""951"" data-end=""965"">White Musk</strong> – Clean, soft sensuality that lingers beautifully on the skin.<br data-start=""1028"" data-end=""1031"">🌲 <strong data-start=""1034"" data-end=""1048"">Sandalwood</strong> – Creamy woody warmth providing a smooth and comforting finish.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""11ro6m1"" data-start=""1114"" data-end=""1140"">✨ Fragrance Experience</h3>
<p data-start=""1142"" data-end=""1374"">Edge Women opens with a <strong data-start=""1166"" data-end=""1217"">fresh bouquet of rose, freesia, and green notes</strong>, blossoms into a <strong data-start=""1235"" data-end=""1288"">romantic floral heart of rose, peony, and jasmine</strong>, and settles into a <strong data-start=""1309"" data-end=""1339"">soft musky-sandalwood base</strong> that feels elegant and comforting.</p>
<p data-start=""1376"" data-end=""1502"">The fragrance is light, feminine, and versatile, making it ideal for everyday wear while maintaining a sophisticated presence.</p>
