decant-partial-of-armaf-club-de-nuit-oud-1-105ml-parfum,Decant/Partial Of Armaf Club De Nuit Oud 1 -105ml Parfum,"<p data-start=""0"" data-end=""154""><span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;""><strong data-start=""0"" data-end=""63"">Armaf Club De Nuit Oud 1 Parfum 105ml – A Collector’s Pride</strong></span> 💎🔥<br data-start=""68"" data-end=""71""><em data-start=""71"" data-end=""107"">Luxurious • Opulent • Long-Lasting</em><br data-start=""107"" data-end=""110""><em data-start=""110"" data-end=""148"">Inspired by <span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;""><strong data-start=""123"" data-end=""147"">Erba Pura by Xerjoff</strong></span></em> ✨🍑</p>
<p data-start=""156"" data-end=""458"">Armaf <span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;""><strong data-start=""162"" data-end=""184"">Club De Nuit Oud 1</strong></span> is a lavish unisex parfum crafted for those who appreciate rich fruity elegance blended with refined oud. Bold yet smooth, this collector’s edition fragrance delivers a radiant sweetness balanced by depth and warmth, making it a true statement of luxury and sophistication.</p>
<h3 data-start=""460"" data-end=""487"">
<span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol; font-size: 14pt;""><strong data-start=""464"" data-end=""483"">Fragrance Notes</strong></span> ✨</h3>
<p data-start=""489"" data-end=""763""><span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;""><strong data-start=""489"" data-end=""556"">Top Notes: Peach, Pear, Passionfruit, Pineapple, Plum, Bergamot</strong></span> 🍑🍍<br data-start=""561"" data-end=""564"">The opening is vibrant and juicy, bursting with a medley of ripe fruits. Peach and pear add softness, passionfruit and pineapple bring tropical brightness, while bergamot adds a fresh citrus sparkle.</p>
<p data-start=""765"" data-end=""1023""><span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;""><strong data-start=""765"" data-end=""829"">Middle Notes: Cashmere Wood, Jasmine, Freesia, Violet Leaves</strong></span> 🌸🌿<br data-start=""834"" data-end=""837"">The heart introduces elegance and smoothness. Cashmere wood adds a creamy texture, jasmine and freesia lend floral refinement, while violet leaves bring a green, slightly powdery nuance.</p>
<p data-start=""1025"" data-end=""1274""><span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;""><strong data-start=""1025"" data-end=""1084"">Base Notes: Musk, Cambodian Oud, Vanilla, Crystal Amber</strong></span> 🪵🤍<br data-start=""1089"" data-end=""1092"">The base is rich and sensual. Cambodian oud adds depth without overpowering, musk enhances longevity, vanilla brings smooth sweetness, and crystal amber leaves a warm, glowing trail.</p>
<p data-start=""1276"" data-end=""1459"">Perfect for <span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;""><strong data-start=""1288"" data-end=""1354"">all-season wear, special occasions, and signature scent lovers</strong>,</span> Club De Nuit Oud 1 is ideal for those who enjoy <span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;""><strong data-start=""1404"" data-end=""1458"">fruity-amber fragrances with a luxurious oud twist</strong>.</span></p>
<p data-start=""1461"" data-end=""1576"" data-is-last-node="""" data-is-only-node="""">🔥 <span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;""><strong data-start=""1464"" data-end=""1512"">Radiant, addictive, and unmistakably premium</strong></span>—this is a fragrance made to be collected, worn, and remembered.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,797.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Armaf-Club-De-Nuit-Oud-1_f9fb2b1f-6da6-4d9e-8a18-7be42b460809.png?v=1781067526,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,clear,spray,fruity; woody; vanilla; jasmine,,,glass; metal,special-occasion,fruity; woody; musky,,,liquid,spring; summer; fall; winter,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
