decant-partial-of-lattafa-fakhar-men-edp,Decant/Partial Of Lattafa Fakhar Men EdP,"<p data-end=""607"" data-start=""40""><strong>Fakhar for Men</strong> is a bold and modern fragrance launched in 2022, crafted for men who embody confidence and sophistication. The scent opens with an energetic blend of crisp apple, sparkling bergamot, and spicy ginger, creating a fresh and vibrant first impression. At its heart, aromatic lavender and sage mingle with juniper berries and geranium, adding depth, elegance, and a refined masculine character. The fragrance settles into a rich, long-lasting base of tonka bean, cedar, amberwood, and vetiver, leaving a warm, woody, and irresistibly smooth trail.</p>
<p data-end=""628"" data-start=""609""><strong data-end=""628"" data-start=""609"">Fragrance Notes</strong></p>
