</ul>
<p data-is-only-node="""" data-is-last-node="""" data-end=""935"" data-start=""788"">A versatile and long-lasting fragrance, Fakhar Black is ideal for both daytime and evening wear, making it a distinctive choice for the modern man.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,455.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Fakhar.png?v=1781176929,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,tonka-bean; cedar; amberwood; vetiver,lattafa,,,edp,,lattafa; inspired-by-y-eau-de-parfum,,fruity,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Lattafa-Perfumes/Fakhar-Black-70465.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,inspired-by-y-eau-de-parfum,8-12-hours,aromatic; fresh-spicy; woody; fruity; fresh,,lavender; sage; juniper-berries; geranium,,,,,,,,,,,daily-wear,,,,apple; bergamot; ginger,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
