decant-partial-of-fragrance-world-roses-demotion-edp,Decant/Partial Of Fragrance World Roses D'emotion EDP,"<p data-start=""0"" data-end=""73""><strong data-start=""0"" data-end=""71""><span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;"">Fragrance World Roses D’Emotion 100ml EDP – A Bloom of Elegance</span> 🌹✨</strong></p>
<p data-start=""75"" data-end=""398"">A tribute to grace and resilience, <span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;""><strong data-start=""110"" data-end=""129"">Roses D’Emotion</strong></span> is an enchanting floral fragrance crafted for the modern woman who embodies strength and sophistication. Made in the UAE and <span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;""><strong>Inspired by Byredo’s Rose of No Man’s Land</strong></span>, this long-lasting Eau de Parfum unfolds like a delicate bouquet kissed by warmth and mystery.</p>
<p data-start=""400"" data-end=""422""><span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;""><strong data-start=""400"" data-end=""420"">Fragrance Notes:</strong></span></p>
<ul data-start=""424"" data-end=""1015"">
<li data-start=""424"" data-end=""633"">
<p data-start=""426"" data-end=""633""><strong data-start=""426"" data-end=""439"">T<span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;"">op Notes</span></strong><span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;"">: <strong data-start=""441"" data-end=""470"">Turkish Rose, Pink Pepper</strong></span> 🌸🌶️<br data-start=""476"" data-end=""479""><em data-start=""481"" data-end=""631"">A vibrant fusion of lush Turkish rose and a subtle hint of pink pepper introduces the scent with a floral yet spicy charm, exuding refined elegance.</em></p>
</li>
<li data-start=""635"" data-end=""836"">
<p data-start=""637"" data-end=""836""><span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;""><strong data-start=""637"" data-end=""653"">Middle Notes</strong>: <strong data-start=""655"" data-end=""682"">Turkish Rose, Raspberry</strong></span> 🍇🌹<br data-start=""687"" data-end=""690""><em data-start=""692"" data-end=""834"">The heart deepens with another layer of Turkish rose, enriched by the luscious sweetness of raspberry, creating a velvety and romantic aura.</em></p>
</li>
<li data-start=""838"" data-end=""1015"">
<p data-start=""840"" data-end=""1015""><span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;""><strong data-start=""840"" data-end=""854"">Base Notes</strong>: <strong data-start=""856"" data-end=""880"">White Amber, Papyrus</strong></span> 🌿🌟<br data-start=""885"" data-end=""888""><em data-start=""890"" data-end=""1013"">A seductive blend of white amber and papyrus delivers a warm, woody, and slightly musky finish that lingers irresistibly.</em></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=""1017"" data-end=""1170"" data-is-last-node="""" data-is-only-node="""">Perfect for <span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;""><strong data-start=""1029"" data-end=""1078"">daytime sophistication or an intimate evening</strong></span>, Roses D’Emotion is a timeless floral masterpiece—elegant, alluring, and unforgettable. 💖✨</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Fragrance World, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,525.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Fragrance-World-Roses-Demotion_db974829-0d5f-4c97-91ec-4d43a9cfe957.png?v=1781248285,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,pink,spray,floral; woody; spicy,gift-box,,glass; metal; paper,everyday; special-occasion,floral; woody; musky,,,liquid,,female,,,,,,,kg,,,active
