decant-partial-of-french-avenue-x-aromatix-naughty-dates-extrait-de-parfum,Decant/Partial Of French Avenue X Aromatix Naughty Dates Extrait De Parfum,"<p data-start=""0"" data-end=""191""><strong data-start=""0"" data-end=""143""><span class=""hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline""><span class=""whitespace-normal"">French Avenue</span></span> X Aromatix Naughty Dates 100ml Extrait De Parfum – Decadent Dates, Coffee &amp; Caramel Indulgence ☕🍯🌴✨</strong><br data-start=""143"" data-end=""146"">For Men &amp; Women | Gourmand • Sweet • Ambery</p>
<p data-start=""193"" data-end=""505""><strong data-start=""193"" data-end=""235"">French Avenue X Aromatix Naughty Dates</strong> is a rich, addictive gourmand fragrance that blends luscious dates, roasted coffee, golden honey, and creamy caramel into a luxurious scent experience. Warm, sweet, and deeply comforting, it's a fragrance that feels like an indulgent dessert wrapped in amber and woods.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""68u3xr"" data-start=""507"" data-end=""529"">🌿 Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p data-start=""531"" data-end=""696""><strong data-start=""531"" data-end=""545"">Top Notes:</strong><br data-start=""545"" data-end=""548"">🌶️ <strong data-start=""552"" data-end=""564"">Cardamom</strong> – Warm aromatic spice that adds immediate richness.<br data-start=""616"" data-end=""619"">🍊 <strong data-start=""622"" data-end=""645"">Bergamot &amp; Mandarin</strong> – Bright citrus freshness balancing the sweetness.</p>
<p data-start=""698"" data-end=""1137""><strong data-start=""698"" data-end=""715"">Middle Notes:</strong><br data-start=""715"" data-end=""718"">☕ <strong data-start=""720"" data-end=""730"">Coffee</strong> – Dark roasted depth that gives the fragrance character.<br data-start=""787"" data-end=""790"">🌴 <strong data-start=""793"" data-end=""802"">Dates</strong> – Rich, syrupy sweetness and the star of the composition.<br data-start=""860"" data-end=""863"">🍯 <strong data-start=""866"" data-end=""875"">Honey</strong> – Golden warmth adding smooth gourmand richness.<br data-start=""924"" data-end=""927"">🌰 <strong data-start=""930"" data-end=""942"">Hazelnut</strong> – Creamy nutty sweetness enhancing the dessert-like feel.<br data-start=""1000"" data-end=""1003"">🌶️ <strong data-start=""1007"" data-end=""1019"">Cinnamon</strong> – Warm spice that adds coziness and depth.<br data-start=""1062"" data-end=""1065"">🪵 <strong data-start=""1068"" data-end=""1082"">Ebony Wood</strong> – Dark woody elegance that balances the sweeter notes.</p>
<p data-start=""1139"" data-end=""1447""><strong data-start=""1139"" data-end=""1154"">Base Notes:</strong><br data-start=""1154"" data-end=""1157"">🍮 <strong data-start=""1160"" data-end=""1171"">Caramel</strong> – Rich buttery sweetness that feels irresistibly smooth.<br data-start=""1228"" data-end=""1231"">🍦 <strong data-start=""1234"" data-end=""1245"">Vanilla</strong> – Creamy warmth that softens and enriches the dry down.<br data-start=""1301"" data-end=""1304"">🔥 <strong data-start=""1307"" data-end=""1316"">Amber</strong> – Deep golden warmth adding longevity and sensuality.<br data-start=""1370"" data-end=""1373"">🌲 <strong data-start=""1376"" data-end=""1390"">Sandalwood</strong> – Smooth woody creaminess that rounds out the fragrance.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""11ro6m1"" data-start=""1449"" data-end=""1475"">✨ Fragrance Experience</h3>
<p data-start=""1477"" data-end=""1761"">Naughty Dates opens with a <strong data-start=""1504"" data-end=""1528"">spicy citrus sparkle</strong>, quickly revealing a <strong data-start=""1550"" data-end=""1602"">rich heart of coffee, honey, dates, and hazelnut</strong>. As it dries down, the fragrance becomes a <strong data-start=""1646"" data-end=""1684"">creamy caramel-vanilla amber blend</strong> with soft woods, creating an intensely comforting and luxurious scent trail.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""15kws0e"" data-start=""1763"" data-end=""1778"">🎯 Best For</h3>
<p data-start=""1780"" data-end=""1893"">✔️ Winter &amp; Cool Weather<br data-start=""1804"" data-end=""1807"">✔️ Evening Wear<br data-start=""1822"" data-end=""1825"">✔️ Date Nights<br data-start=""1839"" data-end=""1842"">✔️ Special Occasions<br data-start=""1862"" data-end=""1865"">✔️ Gourmand Fragrance Lovers</p>
<p data-start=""1895"" data-end=""2012"" data-is-last-node="""" data-is-only-node="""">☕🍯🌴✨ <strong data-start=""1902"" data-end=""2012"" data-is-last-node="""">Naughty Dates – a delicious fusion of dates, coffee, caramel, and amber that feels irresistibly addictive.</strong></p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,660.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/AromatixNaughtyDates.png?v=1781248629,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,caramel; vanilla; amber; sandalwood,fragrance-world,,New Arrival,,,made-in-uae,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Aromatix-X-French-Avenue/Naughty-Dates-122285.html,unisex,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,sweet; warm-spices; coffee; caramel; woody,,coffee; dates; honey; hazelnut; cinnamon,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,cardamom; bergamot; mandarin,,,unisex,,,,,brown,spray,spicy; citrus; woody; vanilla; sandalwood,gift-box,,glass; metal,special-occasion; everyday,gourmand; woody; aromatic,,,liquid,winter,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
