<p data-start=""186"" data-end=""482""><strong data-start=""186"" data-end=""219"">French Avenue Sh'mallow Fluff</strong> is a deliciously playful gourmand fragrance inspired by the vibe of <strong data-start=""288"" data-end=""329""><span class=""hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline""><span class=""whitespace-normal"">Yum Boujee Marshmallow 81</span></span></strong>. Bursting with juicy fruits, fluffy marshmallow, and creamy vanilla praline, it delivers a fun, addictive scent that's sweet without being overwhelming.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""68u3xr"" data-start=""484"" data-end=""506"">🌿 Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p data-start=""508"" data-end=""792""><strong data-start=""508"" data-end=""522"">Top Notes:</strong><br data-start=""522"" data-end=""525"">🍓 <strong data-start=""528"" data-end=""542"">Strawberry</strong> – Juicy candy-like sweetness that instantly delights.<br data-start=""596"" data-end=""599"">🍋 <strong data-start=""602"" data-end=""611"">Lemon</strong> – Bright citrus sparkle adding freshness.<br data-start=""653"" data-end=""656"">🍏 <strong data-start=""659"" data-end=""668"">Apple</strong> – Crisp fruity sweetness with a vibrant feel.<br data-start=""714"" data-end=""717"">🥥 <strong data-start=""720"" data-end=""731"">Coconut</strong> – Creamy tropical smoothness enhancing the gourmand profile.</p>
<p data-start=""794"" data-end=""1044""><strong data-start=""794"" data-end=""811"">Middle Notes:</strong><br data-start=""811"" data-end=""814"">🍬 <strong data-start=""817"" data-end=""832"">Marshmallow</strong> – Soft, fluffy sweetness that forms the heart of the fragrance.<br data-start=""896"" data-end=""899"">🌸 <strong data-start=""902"" data-end=""913"">Jasmine</strong> – Elegant floral nuance balancing the sugary notes.<br data-start=""965"" data-end=""968"">🌼 <strong data-start=""971"" data-end=""989"">Orange Blossom</strong> – Sweet floral brightness adding femininity and charm.</p>
<p data-start=""1046"" data-end=""1332""><strong data-start=""1046"" data-end=""1061"">Base Notes:</strong><br data-start=""1061"" data-end=""1064"">🍦 <strong data-start=""1067"" data-end=""1078"">Vanilla</strong> – Rich creamy sweetness that lingers beautifully.<br data-start=""1128"" data-end=""1131"">🍫 <strong data-start=""1134"" data-end=""1145"">Praline</strong> – Nutty caramelized gourmand warmth.<br data-start=""1182"" data-end=""1185"">🤍 <strong data-start=""1188"" data-end=""1196"">Musk</strong> – Soft, clean sensuality that smooths the dry down.<br data-start=""1248"" data-end=""1251"">✨ <strong data-start=""1253"" data-end=""1269"">Ambrox Super</strong> – Modern musky-amber depth enhancing projection and longevity.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""11ro6m1"" data-start=""1334"" data-end=""1360"">✨ Fragrance Experience</h3>
<p data-start=""1362"" data-end=""1559"">Sh'mallow Fluff opens with a <strong data-start=""1391"" data-end=""1442"">burst of juicy strawberries, apple, and coconut</strong>, melts into a <strong data-start=""1457"" data-end=""1485"">fluffy marshmallow heart</strong>, and settles into a <strong data-start=""1506"" data-end=""1537"">creamy vanilla-praline base</strong> wrapped in soft musk.</p>
<p data-start=""1561"" data-end=""1652"">The result is a fragrance that feels <strong data-start=""1598"" data-end=""1651"">playful, comforting, sweet, and utterly addictive</strong>.</p>
