decant-partial-of-french-avenue-zenith-deep-edp,Decant/Partial Of French Avenue Zenith Deep EDP,"<p data-start=""0"" data-end=""165""><strong data-start=""0"" data-end=""114""><span class=""hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline""><span class=""whitespace-normal"">French Avenue</span></span> Zenith Deep 100ml EDP – Fresh Citrus Energy with Spicy Amber Woods 🌊🔥✨</strong><br data-start=""114"" data-end=""117"">For Men &amp; Women | Fresh • Spicy • Woody-Ambery</p>
<p data-start=""167"" data-end=""424""><strong data-start=""167"" data-end=""196"">French Avenue Zenith Deep</strong> is a vibrant and sophisticated fragrance that blends sparkling citrus, cooling mint, warm spices, and deep woody resins. Fresh at the top yet rich in the dry down, it delivers a balanced scent that's both energetic and elegant.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""68u3xr"" data-start=""426"" data-end=""448"">🌿 Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p data-start=""450"" data-end=""696""><strong data-start=""450"" data-end=""464"">Top Notes:</strong><br data-start=""464"" data-end=""467"">🍊 <strong data-start=""470"" data-end=""502"">Grapefruit, Lemon &amp; Bergamot</strong> – Bright citrus trio creating a crisp and refreshing opening.<br data-start=""564"" data-end=""567"">🌿 <strong data-start=""570"" data-end=""578"">Mint</strong> – Cooling freshness that adds an invigorating touch.<br data-start=""631"" data-end=""634"">🌶️ <strong data-start=""638"" data-end=""648"">Pepper</strong> – Sharp spicy kick adding character and energy.</p>
<p data-start=""698"" data-end=""939""><strong data-start=""698"" data-end=""715"">Middle Notes:</strong><br data-start=""715"" data-end=""718"">🌶️ <strong data-start=""722"" data-end=""741"">Ginger &amp; Nutmeg</strong> – Warm aromatic spices bringing depth and sophistication.<br data-start=""799"" data-end=""802"">🍈 <strong data-start=""805"" data-end=""814"">Melon</strong> – Juicy fruity sweetness that softens the spices.<br data-start=""864"" data-end=""867"">🌸 <strong data-start=""870"" data-end=""881"">Jasmine</strong> – Elegant floral nuance adding smoothness and refinement.</p>
<p data-start=""941"" data-end=""1235""><strong data-start=""941"" data-end=""956"">Base Notes:</strong><br data-start=""956"" data-end=""959"">🔥 <strong data-start=""962"" data-end=""973"">Incense</strong> – Smoky resinous depth adding mystery and richness.<br data-start=""1025"" data-end=""1028"">🌲 <strong data-start=""1031"" data-end=""1057"">Sandalwood &amp; Cedarwood</strong> – Smooth woody foundation with lasting elegance.<br data-start=""1106"" data-end=""1109"">✨ <strong data-start=""1111"" data-end=""1120"">Amber</strong> – Warm golden richness enhancing longevity.<br data-start=""1164"" data-end=""1167"">🌿 <strong data-start=""1170"" data-end=""1182"">Labdanum</strong> – Resinous sweetness that adds depth and complexity.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""11ro6m1"" data-start=""1237"" data-end=""1263"">✨ Fragrance Experience</h3>
<p data-start=""1265"" data-end=""1460"">Zenith Deep opens with a <strong data-start=""1290"" data-end=""1337"">burst of sparkling citrus, mint, and pepper</strong>, transitions into a <strong data-start=""1358"" data-end=""1380"">spicy-fruity heart</strong>, and settles into a <strong data-start=""1401"" data-end=""1459"">warm woody-amber base enriched with incense and resins</strong>.</p>
<p data-start=""1462"" data-end=""1584"">The fragrance feels <strong data-start=""1482"" data-end=""1526"">fresh, confident, versatile, and refined</strong>, making it suitable for both casual and formal occasions.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""15kws0e"" data-start=""1586"" data-end=""1601"">🎯 Best For</h3>
