<p data-start=""1748"" data-end=""1819"" data-is-last-node="""" data-is-only-node="""">🌊🔥✨ <strong data-start=""1754"" data-end=""1819"" data-is-last-node="""">Zenith Deep – fresh energy meeting deep woody sophistication.</strong></p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,565.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/ZenithDeep.png?v=1781253099,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,incense; sandalwood; amber; cedarwood; labdanum,french-avenue,,,,,made-in-uae,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/French-Avenue/Zenith-Deep-120870.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,fresh-spicy; citrus; amber; aromatic; woody,,ginger; melon; nutmeg-1; jasmine,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,grapefruit; pepper; lemon; mint; bergamot,,,for-men,,,,,white,spray,citrus; woody; spicy; herbal,,,glass; paper; cardboard,everyday; formal,fresh; citrus; woody; aromatic,,,liquid,spring; summer; fall,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
