decant-partial-of-pendora-scents-armour-code-uomo-edp,Decant/Partial Of Pendora Scents Armour Code Uomo EDP,"<p>Pendora  Scents Armour Code Uomo is a captivating and long-lasting fragrance designed for both men and women. Embodying sophistication and allure, this 100ml Eau de Parfum is a fusion of exquisite notes that create a memorable olfactory experience. <strong>Inspired</strong> of <b>Armani Code Profumo</b> by <b>Giorgio Armani</b></p>
<p>At its inception, the fragrance tantalizes the senses with an invigorating blend of top notes. The spicy warmth of Cardamom is complemented by the crisp and juicy aroma of Green Apple. Harmoniously intertwined with a zesty twist of Green Mandarin, these initial notes exude freshness and energy, setting the stage for the journey ahead.</p>
<p>As the fragrance unfolds, the heart notes take center stage, revealing a refined and captivating aura. Nutmeg infuses a sense of allure with its aromatic spice, while Lavender adds a touch of floral elegance. The enchanting and delicate scent of Orange Blossom weaves through, creating a harmonious and enchanting composition that lingers on the skin.</p>
<p>Finally, Pendora Armour Code Uomo leaves a lasting impression with its indulgent base notes. The rich and sweet essence of Tonka Bean provides a comforting and luxurious foundation, enhanced by the warm and inviting embrace of Amber. To add a touch of sensuality and depth, the fragrance is enriched with a subtle hint of Leather, leaving a trail of captivating sophistication in its wake.</p>
<p>This extraordinary fragrance by Pendora embraces the duality of both strength and grace, making it an ideal choice for confident individuals who seek a signature scent that effortlessly transitions from day to night. Pendora Armour Code Uomo 100ml EDP is a celebration of timeless elegance and a true testament to the art of perfumery.</p>
<p><strong>Top </strong><b>Notes:</b> Cardamom, Green Apple, Green Mandarin</p>
<p><b>Heart Notes: </b>Nutmeg, Lavender, Orange Blossom</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes :</strong>Tonka Bean, Amber And Leather.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Partial, Pendora Scents",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,350.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Pendora-Scents-Armour-Code-Uomo.png?v=1781255704,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,pendora-scents,,,,,inspired-by-armani-code-profumo; pendora-scents,,oriental,,,,,6-8-hours,,,,,,,,,,,,,,date-night,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,black,spray,spicy; fruity; woody; citrus; floral,,,glass; plastic,everyday; special-occasion,aromatic; woody; musky; citrus; floral,,,liquid,,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
