decant-partial-of-pendora-eau-de-blanc-edp,Decant/Partial Of Pendora Eau De Blanc EDP,"<p>Pendora Scents Eau De Blanc Parfum is an exquisite and long-lasting fragrance tailored for the modern man who appreciates sophistication and allure. Crafted by master perfumers, this captivating scent showcases a harmonious fusion of carefully selected notes, resulting in an alluring olfactory experience that leaves a lasting impression. <strong>Inspired</strong> Of <b>L'Eau d'Issey Pour Homme</b> by <b>Issey Miyake</b></p>
<p>At the top, the fragrance bursts open with a refreshing blend of zesty Bergamot, vibrant Lemon, and aromatic Tarragon. This invigorating combination creates an immediate sense of vitality and freshness, setting the stage for the journey ahead.</p>
<p>As the scent evolves, the heart notes gracefully emerge, featuring the intriguing fusion of aromatic Nutmeg and the delicate essence of Water Lily. These middle notes add depth and complexity to the fragrance, striking a perfect balance between masculine strength and gentle sensuality.</p>
<p>The allure deepens as the fragrance settles into its base notes, where a rich and robust blend of Tobacco, sensual Sandalwood, earthy Vetiver, majestic Cedar, and velvety Musk create a captivating and lingering trail. This warm and sophisticated base ensures the fragrance lasts throughout the day, captivating those around with its undeniable charm.</p>
<p>Pendora Eau De Blanc 100ml EDP is a remarkable and versatile scent, perfect for both daytime and evening wear. Its charismatic aura will leave an indelible mark wherever the man goes, exuding confidence and magnetism. Whether for special occasions or daily wear, this fragrance will become an essential element of the modern man's grooming ritual, elevating his presence and leaving a lasting memory in the minds of those he encounters.</p>
<p><strong>Top</strong>: Bergamot, lemon, tarragon</p>
<p><strong>Middle</strong>: Nutmeg, water lily</p>
<p><strong>Base</strong>: Tobacco, sandalwood, vetiver, cedar, musk</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,335.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Pendora-Eau-De-Blanc-100ml-EDP.png?v=1781256345,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,clear,spray,citrus; woody; spicy,,,glass; plastic,everyday; special-occasion,citrus; fresh; woody; musky,,,liquid,,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
decant-partial-of-pendora-eau-de-blanc-edp,,,,,,,,,90ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1214.00,2000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Decant_Image.png?v=1781928894,2,"",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,
decant-partial-of-pendora-scents-tudor-edp,Decant/Partial Of Pendora Scents Tudor EDP,"<p>Pendora Tudor for Men, a captivating olfactory masterpiece that encapsulates sophistication and longevity in every spray. This fragrance is a symphony of exquisite notes carefully curated to leave a lasting impression, making it an essential addition to any man's collection.</p>
<p>From the moment it graces your skin, Pendora Tudor unveils a powerful and long-lasting aura. The top notes of Violet Leaf, Coriander, and Bergamot create an invigorating introduction, with the fresh, green aroma of violet leaf harmonizing perfectly with the zesty citrus notes, setting the stage for the scent journey ahead.</p>
<p>As this fragrance evolves, the heart notes of Rose, Black Pepper, and Lily-of-the-Valley take center stage. The romantic and slightly spicy essence of rose blends with the subtle heat of black pepper, while the delicate lily-of-the-valley adds a touch of floral elegance, creating a distinctive and alluring character.</p>
<p>Pendora Tudor's base notes of Ambergris, Patchouli, and Bourbon Vanilla provide a deep and sensual foundation. Ambergris imparts a rich, slightly aquatic element, while patchouli adds a woody and earthy dimension. The final touch of Bourbon Vanilla adds a sweet, creamy undertone, leaving a memorable, lingering trail.</p>
<p><strong>Top Notes: </strong>Violet Leaf, Coriander, Bergamot</p>
<p><strong>Middle Notes: </strong>Rose, Black Pepper, Lily-of-the-Valley</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes: </strong>Ambergris, Patchouli, Bourbon Vanilla.</p>
<p>Notably, Pendora Tudor is celebrated for its similarity to the beloved <strong>Tuxedo by Yves Saint Laurent</strong>, making it an affordable alternative for those who appreciate this iconic fragrance. Embrace Pendora Tudor and experience the charm and charisma of a classic scent that endures throughout the day, ensuring you leave a remarkable impression wherever you go.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Partial, Pendora Scents",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,330.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Pendora-Tudor-perfume.png?v=1781256340,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,pendora-scents,,,edp,,pendora-scents,,,,,,,6-8-hours,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,clear,spray,fresh; citrus; floral; woody; vanilla,,,glass; paper; plastic,everyday,fresh; citrus; floral; woody; musky,,,liquid,,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
