decant-partial-of-pendora-club-intense-homme-edp,Decant/Partial Of Pendora Club Intense Homme EDP,"<p>Pandora Club Intense Homme 100ML Eau de Parfum for Men is an olfactory masterpiece that exudes luxury and sophistication. This exceptionally long-lasting fragrance is a testament to fine craftsmanship and an excellent alternative to the renowned and pricey Dior Homme Intense.</p>
<p>Opening with a crisp and invigorating top note of lavender, this perfume immediately captures your attention, offering a fresh and elegant introduction. As it evolves, the heart notes of iris, ambrette (musk mallow), and pear emerge, creating a harmonious blend of floral, musky, and fruity accords. The iris lends an exquisite powdery depth, while ambrette adds a sensual, warm touch, and pear provides a delightful hint of sweetness.</p>
<p>The base notes of Virginia cedar and vetiver ground this fragrance with a woody and earthy foundation. The combination of these base notes ensures that Pandora Club Intense Homme not only lingers on your skin but also leaves a memorable and enticing trail wherever you go.</p>
<p><strong>Top note</strong> is Lavender</p>
<p><strong>Middle notes</strong> are Iris, Ambrette (Musk Mallow) and Pear</p>
<p><strong>Base notes</strong> are Virginia Cedar and Vetiver.</p>
<p>What makes this fragrance truly exceptional is its resemblance to the iconic <strong>Dior Homme Intense</strong>, making it a remarkable option for those who appreciate fine fragrances but prefer a more budget-friendly alternative. With Pandora Club Intense Homme, you get a similar level of elegance and allure without breaking the bank, making it an ideal choice for the modern man who wants to make a lasting impression. This Eau de Parfum is a testament to your refined taste, making it an essential addition to your fragrance collection.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,330.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Club-intense-homme.png?v=1781256463,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,blue,spray,fresh; floral; woody; spicy,,,glass; paper,everyday; special-occasion,fresh; floral; woody; musky; fruity,,,liquid,,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
decant-partial-of-pendora-club-intense-homme-edp,,,,,,,,,90ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1169.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Decant_Image.png?v=1781928894,2,"",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,
decant-partial-of-pendora-milano-edp,Decant/Partial Of Pendora Milano EDP,"<p>Pendora Milano 100ml Eau de Parfum for Men, a captivating olfactory journey that defines sophistication and charm. This fragrance is a masterful creation, offering an enchanting blend of notes that elevates your presence to new heights. Crafted for the modern man who exudes confidence and charisma, Pendora Milano exquisitely captures the essence of luxury and allure.</p>
<p>At its heart, this fragrance boasts a unique fusion of Tuberose and Monoi Oil, infusing the composition with a rich floral depth that's both elegant and exotic. The addition of Solar Notes and Salt lends an invigorating freshness, reminiscent of sun-kissed Mediterranean shores. These elements blend seamlessly with the warm, sensual embrace of Ambergris, Leather, and Cashmeran, creating an aura of irresistible magnetism.</p>
<p>As the scent evolves, Labdanum and Pine introduce an intriguing complexity, offering a subtle, smoky undertone that enhances the fragrance's depth. This dynamic blend is a symphony of contrasts, marrying the brightness of the sun with the richness of leather, culminating in an unforgettable sensory experience.</p>
<p>Pendora Milano 100ml EDP for Men is inspired by the iconic <strong>1 Million Parfum by Paco Rabanne</strong>, and it mirrors the essence of this leather fragrance masterfully. It's a statement of opulence and style, designed for the man who appreciates the finer things in life. Whether you're heading to a high-powered business meeting or a romantic evening out, Pendora Milano will be your trusted companion, leaving a lasting impression that lingers in the memory of all who encounter it. Embrace the power of scent with Pendora Milano, and let your charisma shine.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Partial, Pendora Scents",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,335.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Pendora-Milano-100ml-EDP.png?v=1781256625,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,yellow,spray,woody; floral; citrus,,,glass; paper; metal,special-occasion; everyday,aromatic; woody; musky,,,liquid,,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
