decant-partial-of-pendora-titan-wood-intense-edp,Decant/Partial Of Pendora Titan Wood Intense EDP,"<p>Pendora Titan Wood Intense is the epitome of masculine elegance, encapsulated in a 100ml Eau de Parfum for men. This fragrance is a captivating olfactory journey, reminiscent of a walk through a lush forest at dawn. Crafted for those with discerning taste, it offers a remarkable and long-lasting scent experience that lingers throughout the day.</p>
<p>At first spray, the top notes burst forth with a zesty blend of citruses, enriched with a touch of sugary sweetness, creating an invigorating and refreshing opening. The interplay of Lemon Zest and Coriander Leaf adds a subtle complexity, setting the stage for what's to come.</p>
<p>As the fragrance develops, the heart notes emerge, revealing a harmonious blend of Cypress, Cedar, and Vetiver. These earthy and woody notes evoke the essence of a dense forest, exuding strength and confidence. The heart notes strike a perfect balance between ruggedness and sophistication, making it an ideal choice for the modern man.</p>
<p>The base note of Benzoin adds depth and warmth to the composition, ensuring a memorable dry-down that leaves a lasting impression. This fragrance embodies the spirit of nature, embodying the essence of the great outdoors.</p>
<p>Pendora Titan Wood Intense is an homage to<strong> Bvlgari Man Wood Essence</strong>, offering an affordable alternative without compromising on quality. It captures the same woody allure, making it a must-have for those who appreciate the timeless appeal of wood-infused fragrances. Make your presence felt with this enchanting scent that speaks volumes about your refined taste and adventurous spirit.</p>
<p><strong>Top notes</strong> are citruses with sugar, Lemon Zest and Coriander Leaf</p>
<p><strong>Middle notes</strong> are Cypress, Cedar and Vetiver</p>
<p><strong>Base note</strong> is Benzoin.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,334.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Pendora-Titan-Wood-Intense-100ml-EDP.png?v=1781257499,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,black,spray,citrus; woody; herbal,,,glass; plastic,everyday,citrus; woody; earthy,,,liquid,,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
