decant-partial-of-pendora-voyager-deep-blue-edp,Decant/Partial Of Pendora Voyager Deep Blue EDP,"<p>Pendora Scents Voyager Deep Blue Eau de Parfum is a long-lasting fragrance crafted for the modern man seeking to embark on a sensory journey like no other. Presented in a sleek 100ml bottle, this scent encapsulates the spirit of adventure, mystery, and sophistication. <strong>Inspired </strong> Of <b>Explorer Ultra Blue</b> by <b>Montblanc</b></p>
<p>At the first spritz, the top notes immediately tantalize the senses with a burst of invigorating Sicilian Bergamot, blending harmoniously with the subtle spiciness of Pink Pepper and the tantalizing sweetness of Exotic Fruits. This vibrant opening sets the stage for the voyage that lies ahead.</p>
<p>As the scent unfolds, the heart reveals the essence of the sea with its refreshing Sea Notes, transporting you to the depths of the ocean, where the aquatic harmony melds seamlessly with the magnetic allure of Ambergris. The middle notes add depth and complexity to the fragrance, evoking a sense of exhilaration and tranquility.</p>
<p>The fragrance journey culminates in the mesmerizing base notes, where the woody richness engulfs your senses, encompassing Woodsy Notes that evoke images of pristine forests. The Indonesian Patchouli Leaf adds an earthy element, blending seamlessly with the sensual and evocative aroma of Leather. This exquisite combination of base notes provides a lasting impression, leaving a trail of enigmatic elegance in your wake.</p>
<p>Pendora Voyager Deep Blue EDP is a masterpiece designed for the modern man who craves an olfactory experience that embodies strength, confidence, and a desire for exploration. With its unique fusion of invigorating top notes, refreshing heart, and alluring base notes, this fragrance encapsulates the essence of a daring adventurer navigating uncharted waters. Whether you wear it for a special occasion or as your signature scent, Pendora Voyager Deep Blue promises to be your trusted companion, standing the test of time and leaving an indelible mark on everyone you encounter.</p>
<p><strong>Top notes</strong> are Sicilian Bergamot, Pink Pepper and Exotic Fruits</p>
<p><strong>Middle notes</strong> are Sea Notes and Ambergris</p>
<p><strong>Base notes</strong> are Woodsy Notes, Indonesian Patchouli Leaf and Leather.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Partial, Pendora Scents",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,330.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Pendora-Voyager-Deep-Blue-100ml-EDP.png?v=1781257695,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,blue,spray,aquatic; woody; spicy; citrus,,,glass; metal; paper,special-occasion; everyday,aquatic; citrus; woody; earthy,,,liquid,,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
