decant-partial-of-xlnc-bakhoor-edp,Decant/Partial Of XLNC Bakhoor EDP,"<p class=""isSelectedEnd""><strong><span>XLNC Bakhoor 100ml EDP – Smoky Oriental Luxury 🔥✨</span></strong></p>
<p class=""isSelectedEnd""><strong><span>For Men &amp; Women | Smoky • Woody • Oriental</span></strong></p>
<p class=""isSelectedEnd""><strong><span>XLNC Bakhoor</span></strong><span> is a rich and elegant fragrance inspired by the timeless Middle Eastern bakhoor tradition. It opens with spicy </span><strong><span>Pink Pepper</span></strong><span>, unfolds into a refined floral heart of </span><strong><span>Geranium</span></strong><span> and </span><strong><span>Lily</span></strong><span>, and settles into a luxurious base of </span><strong><span>Incense, Honey, Leather, Cedarwood, Vetiver, Musk, and Ambergris</span></strong><span>.</span></p>
<p class=""isSelectedEnd""><span>The result is a warm, smoky, and sophisticated scent that perfectly balances traditional Arabic richness with modern wearability.</span></p>
<h3><span>🌿 Fragrance Notes</span></h3>
