<p class=""isSelectedEnd""><strong><span>Base:</span></strong><span> 🔥 Incense, 🍯 Honey, 🖤 Leather, 🌲 Cedarwood, 🌿 Vetiver, ✨ Musk, 🌊 Ambergris</span></p>
<h3><span>🎯 Perfect For</span></h3>
<p class=""isSelectedEnd""><span>✔️ Evening Wear</span><br><span>✔️ Special Occasions</span><br><span>✔️ Fall &amp; Winter</span><br><span>✔️ Lovers of Smoky Oriental Fragrances</span></p>
