decant-partial-of-dumont-nitro-pour-homme-edp,Decant/Partial Of Dumont Nitro Pour Homme EDP,"<h3>Dumont Nitro Pour Homme 100ml EDP – The Rush of Modern Masculinity ⚡🍊</h3>
<p>Ignite your presence with Dumont Nitro Pour Homme 100ml EDP, a dynamic and energetic fragrance designed for the confident modern man. Bursting with vibrant citrus, aromatic spices, and smooth woody notes, this long-lasting Eau de Parfum delivers a fresh yet powerful scent trail that commands attention wherever you go.</p>
<p><strong>Fragrance Notes:</strong></p>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong> Mandarin Orange, Grapefruit, Cardamom, Bergamot, Lemon, Nutmeg 🍊🍋🌿<br>A vibrant explosion of juicy citrus fruits blended with aromatic cardamom and warm nutmeg creates an invigorating and energetic opening.</p>
<p><strong>Middle Notes:</strong> Orange Blossom, Jasmine, Cedar 🌼🌿🪵<br>The heart reveals a refined blend of fresh florals and elegant cedarwood, adding sophistication and masculine depth.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong> Musk, Cedar, Sandalwood, Tonka Bean, Guaiac Wood 🌲✨🌰<br>A smooth and comforting dry-down of creamy sandalwood, warm tonka bean, soft musk, and rich woods ensures lasting appeal and character.</p>
<p>Perfect for daily wear, office settings, casual outings, and warm-weather occasions, Dumont Nitro Pour Homme embodies freshness, confidence, and effortless style. Make every moment count with a fragrance that fuels your ambition.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Dumont, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,465.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/DumontNitroPourHomme.png?v=1781772993,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,musk; cedar; sandalwood; tonka-beans; guaiac-wood,dumont,,,edp,,dumont,,floral; sandalwood,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Dumont/Nitro-Pour-Homme-73020.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,citrus; white-floral; woody; aromatic; powdery,,orange-blossom-1; jasmine; cedar,,,,,,,,,,,summer,,,,mandarin-orange; grapefruit; cardamom; bergamot; lemon; nutmeg-1,,,for-men,,,,,orange; brown,spray,citrus; spicy; woody; floral,,,glass; paper; metal,everyday; casual,citrus; aromatic; woody; musky,,,liquid,summer,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
