decant-partial-of-pendora-noir-en-leather-edp,Decant/Partial Of Pendora Noir En Leather EDP,"<p>Pendora Noir En Leather, a 100ML Eau de Parfum for men that transcends the ordinary, offering an olfactory journey through sophistication and luxury. Crafted for those who appreciate the enduring allure of leather, this fragrance is a testament to refinement and distinction, boasting an exceptional longevity that resonates with power and elegance.</p>
<p>At the pinnacle of this aromatic masterpiece is the intoxicating allure of cardamom, a top note that sets the stage for the sensory experience to unfold. The heart of Noir En Leather reveals a harmonious blend of sumptuous leather, delicate jasmine, and the exotic essence of Sambac. This symphony of scents intertwines seamlessly, creating a rich and captivating aura.</p>
<p>As the fragrance matures, the base notes of amber, moss, and patchouli emerge, leaving an indelible impression of sophistication and depth. The interplay of these elements culminates in a fragrance that is simultaneously bold and refined, making it an ideal choice for individuals who exude suave charm, a hint of arrogance, and a profound awareness of their success in life.</p>
<p>Noir En Leather stands as a cleaner, classier, and more balanced alternative to other leather-based fragrances. Its moderate to strong leather projection is complemented by fruity and musky undertones, adding a sweet touch that enhances its complexity. The severe presence of this Eau de Parfum is encapsulated in a specially designed bottle, making it a perfect gift for those who appreciate the finer things in life.</p>
<p><strong>Top</strong>: Cardamom</p>
<p><strong>Middle</strong>: Leather, Jasmine, Sambac</p>
<p><strong>Base</strong>: Amber, Moss, Patchouli</p>
<p>This fragrance is not just an indulgence; it's an ode to opulence. As a great Inspired of the esteemed <strong>Ombré Leather by Tom Ford</strong>, Noir En Leather offers a budget-friendly option without compromising on the essence of luxury. Immerse yourself in the allure of Pendora Noir En Leather, where each spray is an invitation to revel in the timeless sophistication of leather.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,335.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Pendora-Noir-En-Leather_fdaf0a1e-fca6-4de5-ac34-49e85bb9f6ff.png?v=1781254537,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,black,spray,woody; spicy; floral,,,glass; plastic,special-occasion,woody; oriental,,,liquid,fall; winter,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
