decant-partial-of-rasasi-nylaa-54-le-journal-edp,Decant/Partial Of Rasasi Nylaa 54 Le Journal EDP,"<p><strong>Rasasi Nylaa 54 Le Journal 100ml EDP – Aromatic Freshness Wrapped in Sweet Vanilla &amp; Honey ✨🍯</strong></p>
<p>For Men &amp; Women | Aromatic • Sweet • Spicy</p>
<p><strong>Rasasi Nylaa 54 Le Journal</strong> is a captivating fragrance that masterfully blends fresh aromatic notes with warm spices and a deliciously sweet base. Modern, smooth, and versatile, it delivers an elegant scent profile that feels both comforting and sophisticated.</p>
<h3>🌿 Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong><br>💜 <strong>Lavender</strong> – Clean aromatic freshness that instantly uplifts the senses.<br>🌿 <strong>Mint</strong> – Cool, invigorating freshness that adds a vibrant touch.<br>🍋 <strong>Bergamot</strong> – Bright citrus sparkle that enhances the opening.</p>
<p><strong>Heart Notes:</strong><br>🌶️ <strong>Cardamom</strong> – Warm aromatic spice that brings depth and character.<br>✨ <strong>Cinnamon</strong> – Sweet spicy warmth that enriches the fragrance.<br>🍮 <strong>Tonka Bean</strong> – Creamy sweetness with a smooth gourmand touch.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong><br>🤍 <strong>Musk</strong> – Soft sensuality that lingers beautifully on the skin.<br>🍯 <strong>Honey</strong> – Golden sweetness adding richness and warmth.<br>🍦 <strong>Vanilla</strong> – Creamy comforting sweetness that completes the dry down.</p>
<h3>✨ Fragrance Experience</h3>
<p>Nylaa 54 Le Journal opens with a <strong>refreshing blend of lavender, mint, and bergamot</strong>, creating an energetic and sophisticated introduction. The heart reveals <strong>warm cardamom, cinnamon, and tonka bean</strong>, adding depth and sweetness. As it settles, <strong>musk, honey, and vanilla</strong> create a smooth, comforting, and addictive trail.</p>
<p>The result is a fragrance that feels <strong>fresh, warm, sweet, and effortlessly elegant</strong>, making it suitable for both casual and special occasions.</p>
<h3>🎯 Best For</h3>
<p>✔️ Daily Wear<br>✔️ Evening Outings<br>✔️ Date Nights<br>✔️ Fall &amp; Winter<br>✔️ Lovers of Sweet Aromatic Fragrances</p>
<p>🍯✨ <strong>Nylaa 54 Le Journal – where aromatic freshness meets irresistible honeyed warmth.</strong></p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Partial, Rasasi",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,540.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Nylaa54LeJournal.png?v=1781776418,1,"",false,Rasasi Nylaa 54 Le Journal 100ml EDP,"Rasasi Nylaa 54 Le Journal 100ml EDP – Aromatic Freshness Wrapped in Sweet Vanilla & Honey ✨🍯 For Men & Women | Aromatic • Sweet • Spicy Rasasi Nylaa 54 Le Journal is a captivating fragrance that masterfully blends fresh aromatic notes with warm spices and a deliciously sweet base. Modern, smooth, and versatile, it delivers an elegant scent profile that feels both comforting and sophisticated. 🌿 Fragrance Notes Top Notes:💜 Lavender – Clean aromatic freshness that instantly uplifts the senses.🌿 Mint – Cool, invigorating freshness that adds a vibrant touch.🍋 Bergamot – Bright citrus sparkle that enhances the opening. Heart Notes:🌶️ Cardamom – Warm aromatic spice that brings depth and character.✨ Cinnamon – Sweet spicy warmth that enriches the fragrance.🍮 Tonka Bean – Creamy sweetness with a smooth gourmand touch. Base Notes:🤍 Musk – Soft sensuality that lingers beautifully on the skin.🍯 Honey – Golden sweetness adding richness and warmth.🍦 Vanilla – Creamy comforting sweetness that completes the dry down. ✨ Fragrance Experience Nylaa 54 Le Journal opens with a refreshing blend of lavender, mint, and bergamot, creating an energetic and sophisticated introduction. The heart reveals warm cardamom, cinnamon, and tonka bean, adding depth and sweetness. As it settles, musk, honey, and vanilla create a smooth, comforting, and addictive trail. The result is a fragrance that feels fresh, warm, sweet, and effortlessly elegant, making it suitable for both casual and special occasions. 🎯 Best For ✔️ Daily Wear✔️ Evening Outings✔️ Date Nights✔️ F