decant-partial-of-birra-adornment-edp,Decant/Partial Of Birra Adornment EDP,"<h3>Birra Adornment 100ml EDP – The Charm of Timeless Elegance ✨🌹</h3>
<p>Enhance your presence with Birra Adornment 100ml EDP, a graceful and captivating fragrance that blends sparkling citrus, delicate florals, and creamy vanilla into an unforgettable expression of sophistication. Designed for those who appreciate elegance with a modern touch, this long-lasting Eau de Parfum leaves a refined and alluring impression.</p>
<p><strong>Fragrance Notes:</strong></p>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong> Calabrian Bergamot, Sicilian Orange, Lemon 🍊🍋✨<br>A vibrant burst of Mediterranean citrus creates a fresh, luminous, and uplifting opening.</p>
<p><strong>Middle Notes:</strong> Fruity Notes, Jasmine, Rose 🍑🌸🌹<br>The heart blooms with juicy fruity accords, elegant jasmine, and romantic rose, adding softness and charm.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong> Madagascar Vanilla, Tonka Bean, White Musk, Patchouli, Labdanum 🍦🌰✨<br>A luxurious dry-down of creamy vanilla and tonka bean, enriched by soft white musk, earthy patchouli, and warm labdanum for lasting depth and sensuality.</p>
