decant-partial-of-ajmal-wisal-dhahab-edp,Decant/Partial Of Ajmal Wisal Dhahab EDP,"<p>Ajmal Wisal Dhahab 50ml EDP – A Timeless Oriental Gem for Men and Women 🌟</p>

<p>Ajmal Wisal Dhahab 50ml Eau De Parfum is a captivating fragrance, designed to leave a lasting impression. Made in the UAE, this long-lasting perfume is perfect for those who appreciate high-quality, rich, and luxurious scents. Suitable for both men and women, it embodies the essence of elegance and charm, making it a versatile choice for any occasion.</p>

<p>🌀 Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: The scent opens with a burst of fresh, fruity aromas from pear, peach, apple, grapefruit, and mandarin orange, creating a vibrant and inviting introduction.<br>
Middle Notes: At its heart, a blend of rose, orchid, jasmine, and geranium blooms beautifully, adding floral sophistication to the composition.<br>
Base Notes: The fragrance settles into a warm, earthy base of sandalwood, musk, patchouli, and cedar, providing a rich, deep finish that lingers throughout the day.</p>

<p>Ajmal Wisal Dhahab is a high-quality, oriental fragrance that offers a luxurious and exotic experience. Its unique blend of fruity, floral, and woody notes creates a scent that is both fresh and warm, making it an irresistible choice for fragrance lovers.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Ajmal, Decant, men, Partial, Party",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,7,deny,manual,780.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Ajmal-Wisal-Dhahab-1.png?v=1779820432,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,sandalwood; musk; cedar; patchouli,ajmal,,Oriental Fragrance,edp,,ajmal,,oriental,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Ajmal/Wisal-Dhahab-35888.html,unisex,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,rose; woody; fruity; powdery; floral; musky; sweet,,rose; orchid; jasmine; geranium,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,pear; apple; peach; grapefruit; mandarin-orange,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Decant_Image.png?v=1781928894,kg,,,active
