decant-partial-of-ajmal-cyan-oud-edp,Decant/Partial Of Ajmal Cyan Oud EDP,"<p data-start=""0"" data-end=""162""><strong><span class=""hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline""><span class=""whitespace-normal"">Ajmal</span></span> Cyan Oud 100ml EDP – Fresh Marine Citrus with Luxurious Oud Amber Depth</strong><strong data-start=""0"" data-end=""119""> 🌊🖤✨</strong><br data-start=""119"" data-end=""122"">For Men &amp; Women | Fresh • Oud • Ambery</p>
<p data-start=""164"" data-end=""429""><strong data-start=""164"" data-end=""182"">Ajmal Cyan Oud</strong> is a modern unisex fragrance inspired by the vibe of <strong data-start=""236"" data-end=""277""><span class=""hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline""><span class=""whitespace-normal"">Erba Pura</span></span></strong>. It combines sparkling marine freshness and bright citrus notes with a rich oud-amber base, creating a scent that is both refreshing and sophisticated.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""1hd3x4f"" data-start=""431"" data-end=""455"">🌿 Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p data-start=""457"" data-end=""633""><strong data-start=""457"" data-end=""471"">Top Notes:</strong><br data-start=""471"" data-end=""474"">🌊 Marine Notes – Clean aquatic freshness that feels airy and invigorating.<br data-start=""553"" data-end=""556"">🍋 Bergamot &amp; Lemon – Crisp citrus brightness adding energy and vibrance.</p>
<p data-start=""635"" data-end=""815""><strong data-start=""635"" data-end=""651"">Heart Notes:</strong><br data-start=""651"" data-end=""654"">🌶️<strong> </strong>Fresh Spicy Accords – Aromatic spices that bring character and warmth.<br data-start=""732"" data-end=""735"">🌸 Soft Floral Accords – Elegant floral nuances that smooth the composition.</p>
<p data-start=""817"" data-end=""1100""><strong data-start=""817"" data-end=""832"">Base Notes:</strong><br data-start=""832"" data-end=""835"">🖤 Oud – Rich woody depth that adds luxury and presence.<br data-start=""895"" data-end=""898"">🔥 Amber – Warm golden sweetness enhancing richness and longevity.<br data-start=""968"" data-end=""971"">🌿 Patchouli – Earthy sophistication adding depth.<br data-start=""1025"" data-end=""1028"" data-is-only-node="""">🤍 Musk – Clean sensual finish that lingers beautifully on the skin.</p>
<p data-start=""1102"" data-end=""1293"">Cyan Oud opens with a bright marine-citrus burst, develops into a fresh spicy-floral heart, and settles into a warm oud-amber base that feels refined, versatile, and long-lasting.</p>
<p data-start=""1295"" data-end=""1446"">Perfect for daily wear, office, evenings, and year-round use, it suits those who enjoy fresh fragrances with a luxurious woody-amber character.</p>
<p data-start=""1448"" data-end=""1515"" data-is-last-node="""" data-is-only-node="""">🌊🖤✨ <strong data-start=""1454"" data-end=""1515"" data-is-last-node="""">Cyan Oud – oceanic freshness meets timeless oud elegance.</strong></p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Decant, Partial",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,500.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,420.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/AjmalCyanOud.png?v=1780462313,1,"",false,Decant/Partial Of Ajmal Cyan Oud EDP | FragsTalk,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,oud; amber; patchouli; musk,ajmal,,Most Demanded,edp,,ajmal; inspired-by-erba-pura-by-xerjoff,,,,unisex,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,erba-pura-by-xerjoff,6-8-hours,,,citrus-spicy; floral,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,vibrant-marine; bergamot; lemon,,,unisex,,,,,blue,spray,citrus; woody; spicy; floral,,,glass; plastic,everyday; special-occasion,fresh; citrus; woody; musky,,,liquid,,unisex,,,,,,,g,,,active
