ibraheem-al-qurashi-brazilian-tobacco-200ml-extrait-de-parfum,Ibraheem Al Qurashi Brazilian Tobacco 200ml Extrait De Parfum,"<p><strong>Ibraheem Al Qurashi Brazilian Tobacco 200ml Extrait De Parfum – Bold Tobacco Elegance with Spicy Oud &amp; Leather 🔥🌿✨</strong></p>
<p>For Men &amp; Women | Tobacco • Woody • Spicy</p>
<p><strong>Ibraheem Al Qurashi Brazilian Tobacco</strong> is a luxurious extrait de parfum that blends vibrant spices, rich tobacco, precious oud, and smooth leather accords. Powerful yet refined, this fragrance creates a warm and captivating presence with a deep oriental character.</p>
<h3>🌿 Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong><br>🍊 <strong>Bergamot</strong> – Fresh citrus brightness that lifts the opening.<br>🌶️ <strong>Pink Pepper &amp; Red Chilli Pepper</strong> – Spicy intensity adding a bold and energetic character.<br>💜 <strong>Lavender</strong> – Clean aromatic freshness that balances the spices.</p>
<p><strong>Middle Notes:</strong><br>🚬 <strong>Tobacco</strong> – Rich, warm, and sophisticated note creating the heart of the fragrance.<br>🖤 <strong>Oud</strong> – Deep woody luxury adding strength and mystery.<br>🌲 <strong>Cedarwood</strong> – Dry woody elegance bringing structure.<br>🍒 <strong>Cherry</strong> – Sweet fruity richness adding a unique twist.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong><br>🖤 <strong>Leather</strong> – Smooth, powerful leather accord with a luxurious feel.<br>🌿 <strong>Patchouli</strong> – Earthy depth enhancing the richness.<br>🌱 <strong>Vetiver</strong> – Fresh woody-green finish adding refinement.</p>
<h3>✨ Fragrance Experience</h3>
<p>Brazilian Tobacco opens with a <strong>burst of citrus and fiery spices</strong>, transitions into a <strong>rich heart of tobacco, oud, cedarwood, and cherry</strong>, and settles into a <strong>deep leather-patchouli-vetiver base</strong> that feels bold, sophisticated, and long-lasting.</p>
<p>The fragrance perfectly balances <strong>spice, sweetness, woods, and smoky warmth</strong>, making it an ideal choice for those who love powerful oriental compositions.</p>
<h3>🎯 Best For</h3>
<p>✔️ Evening Wear<br>✔️ Special Occasions<br>✔️ Winter &amp; Cool Weather<br>✔️ Signature Scent Lovers<br>✔️ Fans of Tobacco &amp; Oud Fragrances</p>
<p>🔥🌿✨ <strong>Brazilian Tobacco – a statement fragrance of power, luxury, and unforgettable depth.</strong></p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,4999.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/BrazilianTobacco200ml.png?v=1781777657,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,adults,,,spray,citrus; woody; spicy; lavender; aquatic,,,glass; cardboard,special-occasion; everyday,oriental; woody; spicy,,,liquid,winter,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
birra-adornment-100ml-edp,Birra Adornment 100ml EDP,"<h3>Birra Adornment 100ml EDP – The Charm of Timeless Elegance ✨🌹</h3>
<p>Enhance your presence with Birra Adornment 100ml EDP, a graceful and captivating fragrance that blends sparkling citrus, delicate florals, and creamy vanilla into an unforgettable expression of sophistication. Designed for those who appreciate elegance with a modern touch, this long-lasting Eau de Parfum leaves a refined and alluring impression.</p>
<p><strong>Fragrance Notes:</strong></p>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong> Calabrian Bergamot, Sicilian Orange, Lemon 🍊🍋✨<br>A vibrant burst of Mediterranean citrus creates a fresh, luminous, and uplifting opening.</p>
<p><strong>Middle Notes:</strong> Fruity Notes, Jasmine, Rose 🍑🌸🌹<br>The heart blooms with juicy fruity accords, elegant jasmine, and romantic rose, adding softness and charm.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong> Madagascar Vanilla, Tonka Bean, White Musk, Patchouli, Labdanum 🍦🌰✨<br>A luxurious dry-down of creamy vanilla and tonka bean, enriched by soft white musk, earthy patchouli, and warm labdanum for lasting depth and sensuality.</p>
<p>Perfect for daily wear, special occasions, and year-round enjoyment, Birra Adornment embodies beauty, sophistication, and effortless allure. Leave a trail of elegance wherever you go. ✨🌹💫</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Birra, Full",true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,2349.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Adornment1.png?v=1781776396,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,madagascar-vanilla; tonka-bean; white-musk; patchouli; labdanum,birra,,,edp,,birra,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Birra-Fragrances/Adornment-134139.html,women,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,citrus; vanilla; sweet; amber; musky; woody,,fruity-notes; jasmine; rose,,,,,,,,,,,party,,,,calabrian-bergamot; sicilian-orange; lemon,,,for-women,,,,,pink; brown,spray,citrus; floral; vanilla; woody,,,glass; metal; paper,everyday; special-occasion,citrus; floral; woody; musky,,,liquid,,female,,,,,,,kg,,,active
