rayhaan-tonquin-giza-100ml-edp-1,Rayhaan Tonquin Giza 100ml EDP,"<p><strong>Rayhaan Tonquin Giza 100ml EDP – Decadent Cacao, Tonka &amp; Vanilla Indulgence 🍫✨</strong></p>
<p>For Men &amp; Women | Gourmand • Sweet • Spicy</p>
<p><strong>Rayhaan Tonquin Giza</strong> is a rich and addictive gourmand fragrance that wraps you in the irresistible aroma of dark cacao, creamy tonka bean, and smooth vanilla. Warm spices and nutty accords add depth and sophistication, creating a scent that feels both comforting and luxurious.</p>
<h3>🌿 Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong><br>🌶️ <strong>Spices</strong> – Warm aromatic spices that create an inviting and captivating opening.<br>🍫 <strong>Cacao</strong> – Rich dark chocolate nuances that instantly draw you in.</p>
<p><strong>Middle Notes:</strong><br>🌰 <strong>Bitter Almond</strong> – Smooth nutty richness with a sophisticated edge.<br>🍮 <strong>Coumarin</strong> – Sweet, warm, and slightly creamy, enhancing the gourmand character.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong><br>🍦 <strong>Tonka Bean</strong> – Rich creamy sweetness with hints of almond and vanilla.<br>🤍 <strong>Vanilla</strong> – Soft, comforting warmth that lingers beautifully on the skin.</p>
<h3>✨ Fragrance Experience</h3>
<p>Tonquin Giza opens with a <strong>warm blend of spices and decadent cacao</strong>, evolves into a <strong>creamy almond-coumarin heart</strong>, and settles into a <strong>luxurious tonka-vanilla base</strong> that feels smooth, cozy, and irresistibly addictive.</p>
<p>The result is a fragrance that perfectly balances <strong>sweetness, warmth, and sophistication</strong>, making it an excellent choice for gourmand fragrance lovers.</p>
<h3>🎯 Best For</h3>
<p>✔️ Evening Wear<br>✔️ Date Nights<br>✔️ Fall &amp; Winter<br>✔️ Cozy Gatherings<br>✔️ Lovers of Chocolate &amp; Vanilla Fragrances</p>
<p>🍫✨ <strong>Rayhaan Tonquin Giza – a deliciously rich blend of cacao, almond, tonka, and vanilla that leaves a lasting impression.</strong></p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,11,deny,manual,2799.00,3599.00,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/RayhaanTonquinGinza.png?v=1781775282,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,tonka; vanilla,rayhaan,, Oriental Vanilla,,,made-in-uae,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Rayhaan/Tonquin-Giza-122844.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,vanilla; sweet; almond; warm-spicy; aromatic,,bitter-almond; coumarin,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,spices; cacao,,,for-men,,,,,orange,spray,spicy; vanilla,,,glass; metal,special-occasion,gourmand; spicy; woody,,,liquid,fall; winter,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
