birra-oneness-100ml-edp,Birra oneness 100ml EDP,"<h3>Birra Oneness 100ml EDP – The Spirit of Fresh Harmony ☀️🌿</h3>
<p>Discover the essence of balance and modern elegance with Birra Oneness 100ml EDP. Crafted for those who embrace simplicity and confidence, this refreshing fragrance blends bright citrus, radiant solar accords, and smooth woods into a clean and uplifting scent that feels effortlessly sophisticated.</p>
<p><strong>Fragrance Notes:</strong></p>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong> Bergamot, Galbanum 🍋🌿<br>A crisp and invigorating opening of sparkling bergamot and green galbanum creates a fresh, vibrant first impression.</p>
<p><strong>Middle Notes:</strong> Solar Notes, Ginger ☀️🫚<br>The heart radiates with warm solar accords and a touch of spicy ginger, adding energy, brightness, and modern character.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong> Sandalwood, Cedarwood 🌲✨<br>A smooth and comforting blend of creamy sandalwood and refined cedarwood delivers a clean, woody finish with lasting elegance.</p>
<p>Perfect for daily wear, office settings, and warm-weather occasions, Birra Oneness is a celebration of freshness, clarity, and effortless style. Embrace unity and confidence with every spray. ☀️🌿✨</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Birra, Full",true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,2149.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Oneness.png?v=1781774431,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,sandalwood; cedarwood,birra,,,edp,,birra,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Birra-Fragrances/Oneness-134140.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,woody; fresh-spicy; citrus; green; aromatic,,solar-notes; ginger,,,,,,,,,,,winter,,,,bergamot; galbanum,,,for-men,,,,,yellow,spray,citrus; fresh; woody; spicy,,,glass; metal; paper,everyday; casual,fresh; citrus; woody,,,spray; liquid,summer,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
