rayhaan-imperia-legacy-100ml-edp,Rayhaan Imperia Legacy 100ml EDP,"<p><strong>Rayhaan Imperia Legacy 100ml EDP – A Timeless Blend of Power, Elegance &amp; Prestige 👑✨</strong></p>
<p>For Men | Aromatic • Spicy • Woody-Ambery</p>
<p><strong>Rayhaan Imperia Legacy</strong> is a sophisticated fragrance that embodies classic masculinity with a modern touch. Richly layered with aromatic herbs, warm spices, florals, leather, and sensual amber notes, it creates a bold and distinguished scent profile that commands attention while remaining effortlessly elegant.</p>
<h3>🌿 Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong><br>🍋 <strong>Bergamot</strong> – Fresh citrus brightness that energizes the opening.<br>🌿 <strong>Artemisia &amp; Clary Sage</strong> – Aromatic herbal notes adding refinement and character.<br>✨ <strong>Aldehydes</strong> – Clean, sparkling freshness that elevates the composition.<br>🌱 <strong>Coriander</strong> – Spicy-green nuances that enhance complexity.</p>
<p><strong>Middle Notes:</strong><br>🌸 <strong>Carnation &amp; Jasmine</strong> – Elegant florals adding depth and sophistication.<br>🌺 <strong>Geranium</strong> – Fresh aromatic floral touch with masculine appeal.<br>🌿 <strong>Patchouli &amp; Vetiver</strong> – Earthy woody richness that strengthens the heart.<br>🌶️ <strong>Cinnamon</strong> – Warm spicy sweetness that adds charm and warmth.<br>🤍 <strong>Orris Root</strong> – Smooth powdery elegance enhancing refinement.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong><br>🖤 <strong>Leather</strong> – Rich masculine depth with luxurious character.<br>🤍 <strong>Musk</strong> – Clean sensuality that lingers beautifully.<br>🌿 <strong>Oakmoss</strong> – Classic earthy-green sophistication.<br>🍯 <strong>Honey</strong> – Subtle sweetness that softens the composition.<br>🔥 <strong>Amber</strong> – Warm golden richness providing depth and longevity.<br>🍮 <strong>Tonka Bean</strong> – Creamy sweetness with a smooth finish.<br>🍦 <strong>Vanilla</strong> – Soft comforting warmth that rounds out the fragrance.<br>✨ <strong>Civet</strong> – Animalic richness adding a distinctive vintage luxury feel.</p>
<h3>✨ Fragrance Experience</h3>
<p>Imperia Legacy opens with a <strong>fresh burst of citrus, aldehydes, and aromatic herbs</strong>, evolving into a <strong>rich floral-spicy heart</strong> filled with patchouli, cinnamon, and vetiver. The dry down reveals a <strong>luxurious blend of leather, amber, honey, musk, and vanilla</strong>, creating a scent that feels powerful, elegant, and remarkably long-lasting.</p>
<h3>🎯 Best For</h3>
<p>✔️ Formal Occasions<br>✔️ Evening Wear<br>✔️ Business &amp; Executive Settings<br>✔️ Fall &amp; Winter<br>✔️ Men Who Appreciate Classic Luxury Fragrances</p>
<p>👑✨ <strong>Rayhaan Imperia Legacy – a fragrance that celebrates heritage, power, and timeless masculine sophistication.</strong></p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Rayhaan",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1750.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rayhaan-Imperia-Legacy.png?v=1781774586,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,geometric,spray,citrus; herbal; woody; spicy; floral; vanilla,,,glass; metal,special-occasion; formal,aromatic; woody; musky; citrus,,,liquid,fall; winter,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
dumont-nitro-pour-homme-100ml-edp,Dumont Nitro Pour Homme 100ml EDP,"<h3>Dumont Nitro Pour Homme 100ml EDP – The Rush of Modern Masculinity ⚡🍊</h3>
<p>Ignite your presence with Dumont Nitro Pour Homme 100ml EDP, a dynamic and energetic fragrance designed for the confident modern man. Bursting with vibrant citrus, aromatic spices, and smooth woody notes, this long-lasting Eau de Parfum delivers a fresh yet powerful scent trail that commands attention wherever you go.</p>
<p><strong>Fragrance Notes:</strong></p>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong> Mandarin Orange, Grapefruit, Cardamom, Bergamot, Lemon, Nutmeg 🍊🍋🌿<br>A vibrant explosion of juicy citrus fruits blended with aromatic cardamom and warm nutmeg creates an invigorating and energetic opening.</p>
<p><strong>Middle Notes:</strong> Orange Blossom, Jasmine, Cedar 🌼🌿🪵<br>The heart reveals a refined blend of fresh florals and elegant cedarwood, adding sophistication and masculine depth.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong> Musk, Cedar, Sandalwood, Tonka Bean, Guaiac Wood 🌲✨🌰<br>A smooth and comforting dry-down of creamy sandalwood, warm tonka bean, soft musk, and rich woods ensures lasting appeal and character.</p>
