arabiyat-prestige-raees-luxury-edition-180ml-edp,Arabiyat Prestige Raees Luxury Edition 180ml EDP,"<h3>Arabiyat Prestige Raees Luxury Edition 180ml EDP – The Aura of Refined Elegance ✨🌊</h3>
<p>Experience timeless sophistication with Arabiyat Prestige Raees Luxury Edition 180ml EDP, a distinguished fragrance that balances fresh aquatic notes with smoky incense and warm woody accords. Crafted for those who appreciate understated luxury, this long-lasting Eau de Parfum leaves a memorable trail of elegance and confidence.</p>
<p><strong>Fragrance Notes:</strong></p>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong> Calone, Clary Sage, Lemon 🌊🍋🌿<br>A refreshing burst of aquatic calone and zesty lemon, complemented by aromatic clary sage for a clean and invigorating opening.</p>
<p><strong>Middle Notes:</strong> Incense, Freesia 🔥🌸<br>The heart unfolds with mystical incense and delicate freesia, creating a unique blend of smoky depth and floral refinement.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong> Patchouli, Cedar, Amber, Musk 🌲🪵✨<br>A smooth and sophisticated dry-down of earthy patchouli, rich cedarwood, warm amber, and soft musk delivers lasting elegance and character.</p>
<p>Perfect for daily wear, formal occasions, and year-round use, Arabiyat Prestige Raees Luxury Edition is a statement of class, freshness, and modern luxury. Leave an impression of effortless sophistication with every spray. 👑✨</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Arabiyat Prestige, Full",true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,3099.00,4999.00,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/RaeesLuxuryEdition.avif?v=1781771983,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,patchouli; cedar; amber; musk,arabiyat-prestige,,,edp,,arabiyat-prestige; inspired-by-acqua-di-gio-profumo,,citrus; woody,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Arabiyat-Prestige/Raees-Luxury-Edition-115541.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,acqua-di-gio-profumo,6-8-hours,fresh; ozonic; woody; aromatic; amber; citrus,,incense; freesia,,,,,,,,,,,summer,,,fresh-clean,calone; clary-sage; lemon,,,for-men,,,,,black,spray,aquatic; citrus; woody; spicy,,,,everyday; special-occasion,aquatic; citrus; woody; musky,,,liquid,,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
