rayhaan-pharaoh-100ml-edp,Rayhaan Pharaoh 100ml EDP,"<h3>Rayhaan Pharaoh 100ml EDP – The Essence of Mystery &amp; Power 🖤🔥</h3>
<p>Step into a world of luxury with Rayhaan Pharaoh 100ml EDP, a bold and captivating fragrance crafted for those who command attention. Rich, smoky, and irresistibly seductive, this long-lasting Eau de Parfum blends exotic spices, dark coffee, smooth suede, and creamy vanilla into a powerful statement of sophistication.</p>
<p><strong>Fragrance Notes:</strong></p>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong> Cardamom, Cade Oil, Saffron, Boozy Notes 🌿🥃✨<br>A striking opening of aromatic cardamom and luxurious saffron, enhanced by smoky cade oil and warm boozy accords for an intense first impression.</p>
<p><strong>Middle Notes:</strong> Suede, Coffee, Benzoin ☕🧥🌰<br>The heart reveals a rich blend of smooth suede and roasted coffee, wrapped in sweet resinous benzoin for depth and elegance.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong> Vanilla, Tonka Bean, Guaiac Wood, Labdanum, Amberwood 🍦🌲🔥<br>A sensual dry-down of creamy vanilla and tonka bean, layered with smoky woods, rich resins, and warm amberwood for exceptional longevity.</p>
<p>Perfect for evening wear, special occasions, and cooler weather, Rayhaan Pharaoh embodies confidence, luxury, and undeniable presence. Rule with the spirit of a king in every spray. 👑🔥</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,56,deny,manual,2599.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Pharaoh.png?v=1781768008,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,black,spray,spicy; woody; vanilla,,,glass; metal,special-occasion; everyday,aromatic; spicy; woody; musky,,,liquid,fall; winter,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
