fragrance-world-gris-the-one-only-100ml-edp-1,Fragrance World Gris The One & Only 100ml Edp,"<p><strong>Fragrance World Gris The One &amp; Only For Men EDP 100ml – Timeless Sophistication in Every Spray 🌟🔥</strong></p>
<p>For Men | Spicy • Tobacco • Woody</p>
<p><strong>Fragrance World Gris The One &amp; Only</strong> is a refined and charismatic fragrance inspired by the iconic <strong>The One for Men Eau de Parfum</strong>. Crafted in the UAE, this long-lasting Eau de Parfum blends vibrant citrus, warm spices, and rich tobacco notes to create an elegant scent that exudes confidence and sophistication.</p>
<h3>🌟 Inspiration</h3>
<p><strong>Inspired By:</strong> <strong>The One for Men Eau de Parfum</strong></p>
<h3>🌿 Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong><br>🍊 <strong>Grapefruit</strong> – Fresh citrus brightness that energizes the opening.<br>🌿 <strong>Coriander</strong> – Aromatic spice adding complexity and character.<br>🌱 <strong>Basil</strong> – Crisp herbal freshness that enhances the masculine appeal.</p>
<p><strong>Middle Notes:</strong><br>🌶️ <strong>Cardamom</strong> – Warm aromatic spice creating elegance and depth.<br>🫚 <strong>Ginger</strong> – Fresh spicy kick that keeps the fragrance vibrant.<br>🌼 <strong>Orange Blossom</strong> – Smooth floral sweetness adding refinement.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong><br>🔥 <strong>Amber</strong> – Rich warmth that enhances longevity and sensuality.<br>🚬 <strong>Tobacco</strong> – Deep, sophisticated richness that defines the fragrance's character.<br>🌲 <strong>Cedarwood</strong> – Dry woody elegance providing a smooth masculine finish.</p>
<h3>✨ Fragrance Experience</h3>
<p>Gris The One &amp; Only opens with a <strong>fresh citrus-herbal burst</strong>, transitions into a <strong>warm spicy heart of cardamom and ginger</strong>, and settles into a <strong>luxurious tobacco-amber base</strong> enriched by smooth cedarwood.</p>
<p>The result is a fragrance that feels <strong>elegant, masculine, versatile, and effortlessly sophisticated</strong>.</p>
<h3>🎯 Best For</h3>
<p>✔️ Office &amp; Professional Wear<br>✔️ Evening Outings<br>✔️ Date Nights<br>✔️ Fall &amp; Winter<br>✔️ Men Who Enjoy Warm Spicy Tobacco Fragrances</p>
<p>🌟🔥 <strong>Gris The One &amp; Only – a signature scent of confidence, elegance, and timeless masculine charm.</strong></p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1599.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Fragrance-world-Gris-The-OneOnly-For-Man_20a9946c-d786-4124-8539-0ea3121da0bb.png?v=1781757278,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,fragrance-world,,,,,inspired-by-dolce-gabbanas-the-one,,,,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,inspired-by-dolce-gabbanas-the-one,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,clear,spray,citrus; spicy; woody; herbal; floral,,,glass; metal; paper,everyday; special-occasion,citrus; aromatic; woody,,,liquid,fall; winter,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
jacques-bogart-one-man-show-24k-edition-100ml-edp,Jacques Bogart One Man Show 24K Edition 100Ml EDP,"<p><strong>Jacques Bogart One Man Show 24K Edition 100ml EDP – Pure Luxury, Pure Power ✨👑</strong></p>
<p>For Men | Spicy • Woody • Oud-Ambery</p>
<p><strong>Jacques Bogart One Man Show 24K Edition</strong> is a luxurious reinterpretation of the legendary One Man Show collection. Bold, elegant, and commanding, this Eau de Parfum is crafted for men who appreciate sophistication, confidence, and a powerful signature scent.</p>
<p>From the very first spray, it delivers an aura of prestige and refinement that leaves a lasting impression.</p>
<h3>🌿 Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong><br>🍊 <strong>Tangerine</strong> – Bright citrus freshness with an energetic character.<br>🌶️ <strong>Cardamom</strong> – Warm aromatic spice adding depth and sophistication.<br>✨ <strong>Pink Pepper</strong> – Vibrant spicy sparkle that creates a captivating opening.</p>
<p><strong>Middle Notes:</strong><br>🌹 <strong>Rose</strong> – Rich floral elegance with a refined touch.<br>🌼 <strong>Geranium</strong> – Fresh aromatic floral nuances enhancing masculinity.<br>🌟 <strong>Saffron</strong> – Exotic warmth that adds a luxurious golden richness.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong><br>🖤 <strong>Oud</strong> – Deep woody richness that exudes luxury and character.<br>🌲 <strong>Sandalwood</strong> – Smooth creamy woods adding warmth and elegance.<br>🔥 <strong>Amber</strong> – Rich golden warmth with excellent longevity.<br>🌿 <strong>Cypriol Oil (Nagarmotha)</strong> – Earthy smoky depth that enhances the masculine profile.</p>
<h3>✨ Fragrance Experience</h3>
<p>One Man Show 24K Edition opens with a <strong>vibrant blend of citrus and spices</strong>, evolves into a <strong>rich floral-saffron heart</strong>, and settles into a <strong>powerful oud, sandalwood, and amber base</strong> that feels luxurious, warm, and long-lasting.</p>
<p>The fragrance strikes a perfect balance between <strong>freshness, spice, woods, and oriental richness</strong>, making it ideal for men who want to make a statement.</p>
<h3>🎯 Best For</h3>
<p>✔️ Evening Wear<br>✔️ Special Occasions<br>✔️ Formal Events<br>✔️ Fall &amp; Winter<br>✔️ Men Who Love Rich Oud &amp; Amber Fragrances</p>
