albait-aldimashqi-leau-dissey-noir-amber-75ml-edp,Albait Aldimashqi Leau Dissey Noir Amber 75ml EDP,"<p><strong>Albait Aldimashqi L'eau Dissey Noir Amber 75ml EDP – Spiced Amber Elegance with Smoky Woods &amp; Leather 🖤🔥✨</strong><br>For Men | Spicy • Woody • Ambery</p>
<p><strong>Albait Aldimashqi L'eau Dissey Noir Amber</strong> is a rich and sophisticated fragrance inspired by <strong>L'Eau d'Issey Pour Homme Noir Ambre</strong>. It masterfully combines exotic spices, smoky woods, refined leather, and a warm amber-vanilla base to create a scent that feels luxurious, elegant, and deeply masculine.</p>
<h3>🌟 Inspiration</h3>
<p><strong>Inspired By:</strong> <strong>L'Eau d'Issey Pour Homme Noir Ambre</strong></p>
<h3>🌿 Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong><br>🌶️ <strong>Saffron</strong> – Exotic warmth with a luxurious character.<br>🌰 <strong>Nutmeg</strong> – Rich spicy depth that enhances sophistication.<br>✨ <strong>Cinnamon</strong> – Sweet spicy warmth adding comfort and richness.<br>🌿 <strong>Coriander</strong> – Aromatic freshness balancing the spices.</p>
<p><strong>Heart Notes:</strong><br>📜 <strong>Papyrus</strong> – Dry smoky woody character that adds uniqueness.<br>🌲 <strong>Cedarwood</strong> – Clean woody strength and refinement.<br>🌿 <strong>Vetiver</strong> – Earthy elegance adding depth and masculinity.<br>🖤 <strong>Leather</strong> – Smooth and sophisticated leather accord.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong><br>🔥 <strong>Amber</strong> – Warm golden richness with excellent longevity.<br>🍦 <strong>Vanilla</strong> – Creamy sweetness that softens the composition.<br>🍮 <strong>Tonka Bean</strong> – Smooth gourmand warmth with subtle sweetness.</p>
<h3>✨ Fragrance Experience</h3>
<p>The fragrance opens with a <strong>luxurious blend of saffron, nutmeg, and cinnamon</strong>, creating a warm spicy introduction. As it develops, <strong>papyrus, cedarwood, vetiver, and leather</strong> bring a smoky woody sophistication. The dry down reveals a <strong>rich amber, vanilla, and tonka bean base</strong> that feels smooth, comforting, and irresistibly elegant.</p>
<h3>🎯 Best For</h3>
<p>✔️ Evening Wear<br>✔️ Formal Occasions<br>✔️ Fall &amp; Winter<br>✔️ Date Nights<br>✔️ Lovers of Spicy Amber Fragrances</p>
<p>🖤🔥✨ <strong>L'eau Dissey Noir Amber – a refined fusion of spices, leather, woods, and glowing amber warmth.</strong></p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,2299.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Albait1.png?v=1781756523,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,amber; vanilla; tonka-bean,albait-aldimashqi,,,,,inspired-by-l-eau-d-issey-pour-homme-noir-ambre,,vanilla; spicy; amber,,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,inspired-by-l-eau-d-issey-pour-homme-noir-ambre,,,,leather; cedar; vetiver,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,saffron; cinnamon; nutmeg-1; coriander,,,for-men,,,,,brown,bottle,spicy; woody; vanilla,,,glass; plastic,special-occasion; everyday,aromatic; woody; musky; gourmand,,,liquid,fall; winter,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
fragrance-world-des-tentations-100ml-edp-1,Fragrance World Des Tentations 100ml Edp,"<p><span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;""><strong>Fragrance World Des Tentations Edp 100ml for Men</strong> 🌟</span></p>
<p>Discover the allure of Fragrance World Des Tentations, a 100ml Eau de Parfum crafted for men who exude confidence and sophistication. Made in the UAE, this long-lasting fragrance ensures you remain enveloped in its captivating scent from morning till night, making it a perfect companion for any occasion.</p>
<p><span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;"">💐 <strong>Fragrance Notes:</strong></span></p>
<ul>
<li>
<span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;""><strong>Top Notes:</strong></span> The journey begins with a refreshing burst of mint, green apple, and lemon, creating a vibrant and invigorating introduction that awakens the senses.</li>
<li>
<span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;""><strong>Middle Notes:</strong></span> As the fragrance unfolds, the heart reveals a harmonious blend of tonka bean, ambroxan, and geranium. This combination adds depth and warmth, creating an enticing and masculine core.</li>
<li>
<span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;""><strong>Base Notes:</strong></span> The scent concludes with a rich and sensual base of Madagascar vanilla, Virginian cedar, Atlas cedar, vetiver, and oakmoss. These notes provide a lasting and luxurious finish, leaving a memorable trail wherever you go.</li>
</ul>
<p>Fragrance World Des Tentations is not just any perfume; it's a testament to high quality and rich aroma, making it a standout in your collection. Known as the best <span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;""><strong>Inspired of Eros by Versace</strong></span>, this fragrance embodies the essence of luxury and sophistication. Elevate your scent game with Des Tentations and leave an unforgettable impression.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1599.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Fragrance-World-Des-Tentations_f95045e3-0798-4a68-9929-f4d3221417f6.png?v=1781755279,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,blue,spray,fresh; citrus; spicy,,,glass; metal,everyday; special-occasion,fresh; citrus; woody; musky,,,liquid,,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
zimaya-zukhruf-peach-please-100ml-edp,Zimaya Zukhruf Peach Please 100ml EDP,"<p><strong><span class=""hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline""><span class=""whitespace-normal"">Zimaya</span></span> Zukhruf Peach Please 100ml EDP – Juicy Peach Delight with Creamy Caramel &amp; Vanilla 🍑🍮✨</strong><br>For Women &amp; Men | Fruity • Gourmand • Sweet</p>
<p><strong>Zimaya Zukhruf Peach Please</strong> is a deliciously addictive gourmand fragrance that combines juicy peach, tropical fruits, creamy vanilla, and rich caramel. Playful yet sophisticated, it delivers a mouthwatering scent that feels warm, sweet, and comforting.</p>
<h3>🌿 Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong><br>🍑 <strong>Peach</strong> – Luscious, juicy sweetness that takes center stage.<br>🍦 <strong>Vanilla</strong> – Smooth creamy warmth adding immediate comfort.<br>🥭 <strong>Guava</strong> – Tropical fruity freshness that enhances the playful opening.</p>
<p><strong>Middle Notes:</strong><br>🍮 <strong>Caramel</strong> – Rich buttery sweetness that feels indulgent and addictive.<br>🌸 <strong>Vanilla Orchid</strong> – Creamy floral elegance with a sweet touch.<br>🌶️ <strong>Cinnamon</strong> – Warm spice adding depth and richness.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong><br>🌿 <strong>Cardamom</strong> – Aromatic spice that balances the sweetness beautifully.<br>🔥 <strong>Amber</strong> – Warm golden richness providing depth and longevity.<br>🤍 <strong>Musk</strong> – Soft sensual finish that lingers on the skin.</p>
<h3>✨ Fragrance Experience</h3>
<p>Peach Please opens with a <strong>burst of juicy peach and tropical guava</strong>, melts into a <strong>creamy caramel-vanilla heart</strong>, and settles into a <strong>warm amber-musky base</strong> accented by soft spices.</p>
<p>The result is a fragrance that feels <strong>sweet, playful, cozy, and irresistibly delicious</strong>—perfect for those who love fruity gourmand scents.</p>
<h3>🎯 Best For</h3>
<p>✔️ Daily Wear<br>✔️ Date Nights<br>✔️ Fall &amp; Winter<br>✔️ Casual Outings<br>✔️ Lovers of Sweet Gourmand Fragrances</p>
<p>🍑🍮✨ <strong>Peach Please – a tempting blend of juicy peach, creamy caramel, and warm vanilla sweetness.</strong></p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,2360.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/ZukhrufPeachPlease.png?v=1781755013,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
armaf-bucephalus-100ml-edp,Armaf Bucephalus 100ml EDP,"<p><strong><span class=""hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline""><span class=""whitespace-normal"">Armaf</span></span> Bucephalus 100ml EDP – Fresh Citrus Power with Spicy Woody Depth ⚔️🍊✨</strong><br>For Men | Fresh • Spicy • Woody-Musky</p>
<p><strong>Armaf Bucephalus</strong> is a vibrant and masculine fragrance that blends sparkling citrus fruits with aromatic spices and a smooth woody-musky base. Energetic, modern, and versatile, it delivers a fresh yet powerful scent profile suitable for everyday wear.</p>
<h3>🌿 Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong><br>🍊 <strong>Bergamot, Mandarin Orange &amp; Grapefruit</strong> – A bright citrus trio that creates a fresh, juicy, and invigorating opening.</p>
<p><strong>Middle Notes:</strong><br>🌶️ <strong>Black Pepper</strong> – Warm spicy character adding depth and masculinity.<br>🌊 <strong>Watery Notes</strong> – Fresh aquatic nuances that keep the fragrance airy and uplifting.<br>🌿 <strong>Violet Leaf</strong> – Crisp green freshness with a subtle aromatic touch.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong><br>🌿 <strong>Patchouli</strong> – Earthy woody richness adding sophistication and longevity.<br>🍮 <strong>Tonka Bean</strong> – Smooth creamy sweetness balancing the spices.<br>🤍 <strong>Musk</strong> – Clean sensuality that leaves a lasting impression.</p>
<h3>✨ Fragrance Experience</h3>
<p>Bucephalus opens with a <strong>burst of sparkling citrus freshness</strong>, develops into a <strong>spicy aquatic heart</strong>, and settles into a <strong>smooth patchouli-tonka-musky base</strong> that feels clean, masculine, and refined.</p>
<p>The fragrance strikes an excellent balance between <strong>freshness, spice, and woody warmth</strong>, making it highly versatile for various occasions.</p>
<h3>🎯 Best For</h3>
