tea-rose-56ml-2fl-edt,Tea Rose 56ml/2fl EDT,"<p>What makes a true perfume classic? Some might say it’s a scent that celebrates the most quintessential ingredients in the perfumer’s palette, the raw materials that have brought us pleasure and delight for centuries. Others might say it’s a scent designed with the all the elegance of traditional fragrance structure. Some might argue that it’s neither ingredients nor design, but proof of real staying power on the marketplace.. Perfumer’s Workshop Tea Rose is a true perfume classic because it represents all three: timeless ingredients, traditional structure, and a market performer prized by generations of women around the globe. For forty years, Perfumer’s Workshop tea Rose has enchanted women-and the men who adore them-with true, classic, well-balanced and authentic rose aroma. Topnotes of crisp and velvety green violet leaves blend with the zing of sparkling aldehydes to capture the natural brisk freshness of roses on a misty morning breeze. Heartnotes of pure blooming tea roe are enhanced by sensuous jasmine and the warmth of spicy clove. In the drydown, soft and warm tones of violet wood help to support and sustain the overall impression of a living, natural rose. There is no rose fragrance on the market today that is more timeless, more honest, or more classic than Perfumer’s Workshop Tea Rose.</p>
<p>NOTES:</p>
<p>TOP: Peony, Chamomile</p>
<p>MID:   Tea Rose, Damask Rose, Bulgarian Rose</p>
<p>DRY:  Geranium Leaves, Violet Leaves, Cedarwood</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,899.00,1299.00,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Tea-Rose-EDT-56ml-2fl.-oz-Unisex-Fragrance-300x300.png?v=1781494549,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,geranium; violet-leaves; cedarwood,,,,edt,,,,,,,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,,,tea-rose; damask-rose; bulgarian-rose,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,peony,,,for-women,,,,,yellow,spray,rose; jasmine; floral; woody,,,glass; paper; metal,everyday,floral; woody; fresh,,,liquid,,female,,,,,,,kg,,,active
xlnc-ambre-santal-50ml-edp,XLNC Ambre Santal 50ml EDP,"<p><strong>XLNC Ambre Santal 50ml EDP – A Special Collaboration with Lalit Fragrance 🔥🌲✨</strong><br>For Men &amp; Women | Ambery • Woody • Spicy</p>
<p><strong>XLNC Ambre Santal</strong> is a premium fragrance developed in collaboration with <strong>Lalit Fragrance</strong>, blending rich amber accords, creamy sandalwood, exotic spices, and luxurious oud into a sophisticated and long-lasting scent.</p>
<h3>🤝 Special Collaboration</h3>
<p>✨ <strong>Crafted by XLNC in collaboration with Lalit Fragrance</strong>, Ambre Santal showcases the expertise of both fragrance houses, delivering a refined fragrance with exceptional depth and character.</p>
<h3>🌟 Inspiration</h3>
<p><strong>Inspired By:</strong> <strong>Ambre Levant <em>with a unique XLNC twist</em></strong>, offering a richer, warmer interpretation while maintaining the elegant amber-woody DNA that fragrance enthusiasts admire.</p>
<h3>🌿 Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong><br>🌶️ <strong>Cinnamon</strong> – Warm spicy sweetness that creates an inviting opening.<br>🍊 <strong>Mandarin</strong> – Bright citrus freshness adding energy and balance.</p>
<p><strong>Middle Notes:</strong><br>🔥 <strong>Incense</strong> – Smoky resinous depth bringing sophistication and mystery.<br>🌶️ <strong>White Pepper</strong> – Crisp spice enhancing complexity.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong><br>🌲 <strong>Sandalwood</strong> – Creamy woody richness that anchors the fragrance.<br>✨ <strong>Amber &amp; Ambergris</strong> – Warm, radiant depth with impressive longevity.<br>🖤 <strong>Oud</strong> – Luxurious woody richness adding character and strength.<br>🔥 <strong>Labdanum</strong> – Resinous amber sweetness that enhances the dry down.</p>
<h3>✨ Fragrance Experience</h3>
<p>Ambre Santal opens with a <strong>vibrant blend of mandarin and cinnamon</strong>, transitions into a <strong>smoky-spicy heart of incense and white pepper</strong>, and settles into a <strong>rich amber-sandalwood base infused with oud and labdanum</strong>.</p>
<p>The result is a fragrance that feels <strong>elegant, luxurious, warm, and highly distinctive</strong>, making it perfect for those who appreciate sophisticated amber-woody creations.</p>
<h3>🎯 Best For</h3>
<p>✔️ Evening Wear<br>✔️ Special Occasions<br>✔️ Fall &amp; Winter<br>✔️ Signature Scent Lovers<br>✔️ Fans of Rich Amber &amp; Sandalwood Fragrances</p>
<p>🔥🌲✨ <strong>Ambre Santal – inspired by Ambre Levant, reimagined through the creative vision of XLNC and Lalit Fragrance.</strong></p>
<p> </p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,500.0,shopify,13,deny,manual,2899.00,4999.00,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/AmbreXLNC-13_jpg.webp?v=1781494184,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,sandalwood; amber; ambergris; oud; labdanum,,,Oriental Woody,,,inspired-by-ambre-levant-by-louis-vuitton,,,,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,inspired-by-ambre-levant-by-louis-vuitton-with-twist,,spicy; woody; amber; oud,,incense; white-peach,,,,,,,,,,,,,most-reordered,,cinnamon; mandarin,,29,for-men,,,,,brown,spray,woody; spicy; citrus,,,glass,everyday; special-occasion,woody; oriental,,,liquid,fall; winter,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
