swiss-arabian-essence-of-casablanca-100ml-edp,Swiss Arabian Essence of Casablanca 100ml EDP,"<h3 data-section-id=""3kwsvm"" data-start=""0"" data-end=""59"">Swiss Arabian Essence of Casablanca Eau de Parfum 100ml</h3>
<p data-start=""61"" data-end=""306"">Elegant, rich, and irresistibly smooth, <strong data-start=""101"" data-end=""126"">Essence of Casablanca</strong> is a luxurious fragrance that blends juicy fruits with sophisticated florals and a warm amber-vanilla base. Perfect for those who enjoy a refined and long-lasting signature scent.</p>
<p data-start=""308"" data-end=""328""><strong data-start=""308"" data-end=""328"">Fragrance Notes:</strong></p>
<p data-start=""330"" data-end=""449""><strong data-start=""330"" data-end=""344"">Top Notes:</strong> Grapes, Apple<br data-start=""358"" data-end=""361""><strong data-start=""361"" data-end=""377"">Heart Notes:</strong> Patchouli, Orris<br data-start=""394"" data-end=""397""><strong data-start=""397"" data-end=""412"">Base Notes:</strong> Vanilla, Musk, Amber, Balsamic Notes</p>
<p data-start=""451"" data-end=""559""><strong data-start=""451"" data-end=""472"">Fragrance Family:</strong> Fruity Amber<br data-start=""485"" data-end=""488""><strong data-start=""488"" data-end=""501"">Best For:</strong> Evening wear, special occasions, and year-round elegance.</p>
<p data-start=""561"" data-end=""704"" data-is-last-node="""" data-is-only-node="""">A captivating fusion of sweet fruits, earthy patchouli, and creamy vanilla creates a sophisticated fragrance with a warm and memorable trail. ✨</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,11,deny,manual,5699.00,7000.00,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/essence_of_casablanca.png?v=1781257981,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,vanilla; musk; amber,swiss-arabian,,,edp,,swiss-arabian,,vanilla,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Swiss-Arabian/ESSENCE-OF-CASABLANCA-85514.html,unisex,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,fruity; vanilla; powdery; musky; sweet,,patchouli; orris,,,,,,,,,,,daily-wear,,,,grapes; apple,,,unisex,,,,,white,spray,fruity; vanilla; woody,,,glass; paper; cardboard,special-occasion,fruity; woody; musky,,,liquid,,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
pendora-voyager-deep-blue-100ml-edp,Pendora Voyager Deep Blue 100ml EDP,"<p>Pendora Scents Voyager Deep Blue Eau de Parfum is a long-lasting fragrance crafted for the modern man seeking to embark on a sensory journey like no other. Presented in a sleek 100ml bottle, this scent encapsulates the spirit of adventure, mystery, and sophistication. <strong>Inspired </strong> Of <b>Explorer Ultra Blue</b> by <b>Montblanc</b></p>
<p>At the first spritz, the top notes immediately tantalize the senses with a burst of invigorating Sicilian Bergamot, blending harmoniously with the subtle spiciness of Pink Pepper and the tantalizing sweetness of Exotic Fruits. This vibrant opening sets the stage for the voyage that lies ahead.</p>
<p>As the scent unfolds, the heart reveals the essence of the sea with its refreshing Sea Notes, transporting you to the depths of the ocean, where the aquatic harmony melds seamlessly with the magnetic allure of Ambergris. The middle notes add depth and complexity to the fragrance, evoking a sense of exhilaration and tranquility.</p>
<p>The fragrance journey culminates in the mesmerizing base notes, where the woody richness engulfs your senses, encompassing Woodsy Notes that evoke images of pristine forests. The Indonesian Patchouli Leaf adds an earthy element, blending seamlessly with the sensual and evocative aroma of Leather. This exquisite combination of base notes provides a lasting impression, leaving a trail of enigmatic elegance in your wake.</p>
<p>Pendora Voyager Deep Blue EDP is a masterpiece designed for the modern man who craves an olfactory experience that embodies strength, confidence, and a desire for exploration. With its unique fusion of invigorating top notes, refreshing heart, and alluring base notes, this fragrance encapsulates the essence of a daring adventurer navigating uncharted waters. Whether you wear it for a special occasion or as your signature scent, Pendora Voyager Deep Blue promises to be your trusted companion, standing the test of time and leaving an indelible mark on everyone you encounter.</p>
<p><strong>Top notes</strong> are Sicilian Bergamot, Pink Pepper and Exotic Fruits</p>
<p><strong>Middle notes</strong> are Sea Notes and Ambergris</p>
<p><strong>Base notes</strong> are Woodsy Notes, Indonesian Patchouli Leaf and Leather.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Pendora Scents",true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,1299.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Pendora-Voyager-Deep-Blue-100ml-EDP.png?v=1781257695,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,blue,spray,aquatic; woody; spicy; citrus,,,glass; metal; paper,special-occasion; everyday,aquatic; citrus; woody; earthy,,,liquid,,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
pendora-scents-octavia-100-ml-edp,Pendora Scents Octavia  100 ml EDP,"<h3 data-section-id=""16sbzlv"" data-start=""0"" data-end=""46"">Pendora Scents Octavia Eau de Parfum 100ml</h3>
<p data-start=""48"" data-end=""251"">Fresh, elegant, and effortlessly captivating, <strong data-start=""94"" data-end=""105"">Octavia</strong> blends bright citrus and delicate florals with creamy vanilla and warm woody notes. A versatile fragrance that radiates sophistication and charm.</p>
<p data-start=""253"" data-end=""273""><strong data-start=""253"" data-end=""273"">Fragrance Notes:</strong></p>
<p data-start=""275"" data-end=""422""><strong data-start=""275"" data-end=""289"">Top Notes:</strong> Water Jasmine, Ginger Flower, Green Mandarin<br data-start=""334"" data-end=""337""><strong data-start=""337"" data-end=""353"">Heart Notes:</strong> Salt, Vanilla<br data-start=""367"" data-end=""370""><strong data-start=""370"" data-end=""385"">Base Notes:</strong> Ambergris, Cashmere Wood, Sandalwood</p>
<p data-start=""424"" data-end=""538""><strong data-start=""424"" data-end=""445"">Fragrance Family:</strong> Floral Aquatic Woody<br data-start=""466"" data-end=""469""><strong data-start=""469"" data-end=""482"">Best For:</strong> Daily wear, casual outings, and warm-weather occasions.</p>
<p data-start=""540"" data-end=""689"" data-is-last-node="""" data-is-only-node="""">A refreshing blend of floral freshness, soft vanilla, and smooth woods creates a modern and long-lasting scent that is both graceful and memorable. ✨</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Pendora Scents",true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1300.00,1999.00,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Octavia.png?v=1781257460,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,pendora-scents,,,edp,,pendora-scents,,,,women,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,orange,spray,citrus; floral; woody; vanilla,,,glass; metal; paper,everyday; casual,fresh; floral; woody; musky,,,liquid,summer,female,,,,,,,kg,,,active
pendora-titan-wood-intense-100ml-edp,Pendora Titan Wood Intense 100ml EDP,"<p>Pendora Titan Wood Intense is the epitome of masculine elegance, encapsulated in a 100ml Eau de Parfum for men. This fragrance is a captivating olfactory journey, reminiscent of a walk through a lush forest at dawn. Crafted for those with discerning taste, it offers a remarkable and long-lasting scent experience that lingers throughout the day.</p>
<p>At first spray, the top notes burst forth with a zesty blend of citruses, enriched with a touch of sugary sweetness, creating an invigorating and refreshing opening. The interplay of Lemon Zest and Coriander Leaf adds a subtle complexity, setting the stage for what's to come.</p>
<p>As the fragrance develops, the heart notes emerge, revealing a harmonious blend of Cypress, Cedar, and Vetiver. These earthy and woody notes evoke the essence of a dense forest, exuding strength and confidence. The heart notes strike a perfect balance between ruggedness and sophistication, making it an ideal choice for the modern man.</p>
<p>The base note of Benzoin adds depth and warmth to the composition, ensuring a memorable dry-down that leaves a lasting impression. This fragrance embodies the spirit of nature, embodying the essence of the great outdoors.</p>
<p>Pendora Titan Wood Intense is an homage to<strong> Bvlgari Man Wood Essence</strong>, offering an affordable alternative without compromising on quality. It captures the same woody allure, making it a must-have for those who appreciate the timeless appeal of wood-infused fragrances. Make your presence felt with this enchanting scent that speaks volumes about your refined taste and adventurous spirit.</p>
<p><strong>Top notes</strong> are citruses with sugar, Lemon Zest and Coriander Leaf</p>
<p><strong>Middle notes</strong> are Cypress, Cedar and Vetiver</p>
<p><strong>Base note</strong> is Benzoin.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,8,deny,manual,1340.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Pendora-Titan-Wood-Intense-100ml-EDP.png?v=1781257499,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,black,spray,citrus; woody; herbal,,,glass; plastic,everyday,citrus; woody; earthy,,,liquid,,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
pendora-tot-vip-homme-100ml-edp,Pendora TOT VIP Homme 100ml EDP,"<p>Pendora Scents TOT VIP Homme, a captivating and long-lasting fragrance designed for the modern man. This 100ml Eau de Parfum is a masterpiece that embodies sophistication, confidence, and irresistible charm. Crafted with precision, it blends an exquisite array of notes to create an unforgettable olfactory experience. <strong>Inspired</strong> Of <b>212 VIP Men</b> by <b>Carolina Herrera</b></p>
<p>At the top, the fragrance bursts open with a lively and refreshing combination of Finger lime, Mint, and Black pepper. The zesty citrus essence of Finger lime entwines with the coolness of Mint and the spicy allure of Black pepper, creating an invigorating and invincible first impression.</p>
<p>Moving to the heart of the scent, a daring and magnetic blend awaits. The vivacious Ginger harmonizes with the spirited essence of Vodka, adding an alluring edge to the composition. The succulent and crisp notes of Apple complement this accord, creating a balance between intensity and freshness.</p>
<p>As the scent reaches its grand finale, it settles into a warm and sensual base that lingers on the skin for hours. The rich and opulent blend of Amber and Tonka bean create a deep, velvety undertone that is both inviting and intoxicating. Adding an enigmatic touch, Kingwood brings a woody sophistication that captivates the senses. The final touch is the presence of Leather, which exudes masculinity and elegance.</p>
<p>Pendora TOT VIP Homme 100ml EDP is the embodiment of refined masculinity, making it a perfect companion for the charismatic and modern man. With its alluring combination of notes and its long-lasting quality, this fragrance is destined to leave a lasting impression wherever it goes. Be ready to embrace the power of Pendora and step into a realm of luxury and allure.</p>
<p><strong>Top</strong>: Finger lime, Mint, Black pepper</p>
<p><strong>Middle</strong>: Ginger, Vodka, Apple</p>
<p><strong>Base</strong>: Amber, Tonka bean, Kingwood, Leather</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1299.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Pendora-TOT-VIP-Homme-100ml-EDP.png?v=1781257170,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,black,spray,citrus; spicy; woody,,,glass; metal,special-occasion,citrus; fresh; spicy; woody; musky,,,liquid,,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
pendora-one-100ml-edp,Pendora One 100ML EDP,"<p>Pandora One Parfum for Men is a remarkable olfactory journey, capturing the essence of timeless elegance and modern masculinity. This exquisite fragrance boasts exceptional longevity, ensuring that you stay invigorated and confident throughout the day and into the night.</p>
<p>At the top, Pandora One opens with an enchanting burst of Fougeres, imparting a fresh and green aroma that sets the stage for what's to come. This initial note is a blend of aromatic herbs and mossy ferns, creating a harmonious, masculine introduction that leaves a lasting impression.</p>
<p>The heart of Pandora One unveils a delicate balance of White Flowers and Powdery notes, adding a touch of refinement and subtlety to the composition. The interplay between these elements creates a gentle, floral nuance with a powdery, comforting undertone, perfect for any occasion.</p>
<p>As the scent evolves, it gracefully transitions into a warm and inviting base. The combination of Woody and Citrus notes in the final stage creates a smooth and sophisticated dry down that lingers on the skin. This combination brings a sense of grounding and depth, making Pandora One a truly versatile fragrance that suits both daytime and evening wear.</p>
<p>What sets Pandora One apart is its undeniable resemblance to the iconic <strong>CK One by Calvin Klein</strong>. It serves as a fantastic and budget-friendly alternative to this renowned fragrance, offering a similar olfactory experience at a fraction of the cost.</p>
<p><strong>Top Notes</strong> - Fougeres<br><strong>Heart Notes</strong> - White Flowers, Powdery<br><strong>Base Notes</strong> - Woody, Citrus</p>
<p>In conclusion, Pandora One is a long-lasting, high-quality Eau de Parfum designed for the modern man. With its well-balanced notes, it embodies a sense of timeless sophistication and versatility, making it the perfect choice for those who appreciate quality scents without breaking the bank.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Pendora Scents",true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1340.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Pendora-One_1.png?v=1781257030,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,white,spray,fresh; woody; citrus; floral,,,glass; metal; paper,everyday; special-occasion,aromatic; fresh; woody; citrus; floral,,,liquid,,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
pendora-blue-wave-100ml-edp,Pendora Blue Wave 100ML EDP,"<p>Pandora Blue Wave, a captivating 100ML Eau de Parfum for men, is an olfactory journey that embodies the essence of the deep blue sea. This exceptional fragrance boasts extraordinary longevity, ensuring that its wearer remains enveloped in its invigorating aura throughout the day.</p>
<p>At first spray, the top notes burst forth like a refreshing ocean breeze. Sea water, lavender, mint, and a symphony of green notes awaken the senses, creating an initial wave of cool, aquatic freshness. Rosemary, coriander, and the intriguing calone add depth to this maritime melody, making the fragrance as invigorating as a coastal escape.</p>
<p>As Pandora Blue Wave evolves, the heart notes come into play. Sandalwood provides a creamy, woody contrast to the floral elegance of neroli, geranium, and jasmine. This fusion of elements is reminiscent of a walk through a lush coastal garden, where sea meets sand, and life meets serenity.</p>
<p>The fragrance's base notes deliver a sensual and lasting impression. Musk, oakmoss, tobacco, cedar, and ambergris create a warm, masculine foundation that resonates with depth and sophistication. This scent is a tribute to strength and sensuality, echoing the depth and mystery of the ocean's hidden treasures.</p>
<p><strong>Top Notes -</strong> Sea water, Lavender, Mint, Green Notes<br><strong>Middle Notes -</strong> Rosemary, Calone, Coriander, Sandalwood, Neroli<br><strong>Base Notes - </strong>Geranium, Jasmine, Musk, Tobacco, Oakmoss, Cedar And Amber</p>
<p>Notably, Pandora Blue Wave is celebrated for its striking similarity to the iconic <strong>Cool Water by Davidoff</strong>. It offers an affordable alternative to a beloved classic while delivering exceptional performance and a unique twist with its extended longevity. This fragrance is a beacon of freshness and allure, perfect for those who seek a signature scent that mirrors the vastness of the sea and the charm of timeless masculinity.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,1349.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Pendora-Blue-Wave.png?v=1781256869,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,blue,spray,aquatic; fresh; woody; spicy,,,glass; plastic,everyday,aquatic; fresh; green; woody; musky,,,liquid,summer; spring,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
pendora-milano-100ml-edp,Pendora Milano 100ml EDP,"<p>Pendora Milano 100ml Eau de Parfum for Men, a captivating olfactory journey that defines sophistication and charm. This fragrance is a masterful creation, offering an enchanting blend of notes that elevates your presence to new heights. Crafted for the modern man who exudes confidence and charisma, Pendora Milano exquisitely captures the essence of luxury and allure.</p>
<p>At its heart, this fragrance boasts a unique fusion of Tuberose and Monoi Oil, infusing the composition with a rich floral depth that's both elegant and exotic. The addition of Solar Notes and Salt lends an invigorating freshness, reminiscent of sun-kissed Mediterranean shores. These elements blend seamlessly with the warm, sensual embrace of Ambergris, Leather, and Cashmeran, creating an aura of irresistible magnetism.</p>
<p>As the scent evolves, Labdanum and Pine introduce an intriguing complexity, offering a subtle, smoky undertone that enhances the fragrance's depth. This dynamic blend is a symphony of contrasts, marrying the brightness of the sun with the richness of leather, culminating in an unforgettable sensory experience.</p>
<p>Pendora Milano 100ml EDP for Men is inspired by the iconic <strong>1 Million Parfum by Paco Rabanne</strong>, and it mirrors the essence of this leather fragrance masterfully. It's a statement of opulence and style, designed for the man who appreciates the finer things in life. Whether you're heading to a high-powered business meeting or a romantic evening out, Pendora Milano will be your trusted companion, leaving a lasting impression that lingers in the memory of all who encounter it. Embrace the power of scent with Pendora Milano, and let your charisma shine.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Pendora Scents",true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,1349.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Pendora-Milano-100ml-EDP.png?v=1781256625,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,yellow,spray,woody; floral; citrus,,,glass; paper; metal,special-occasion; everyday,aromatic; woody; musky,,,liquid,,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
pendora-club-intense-homme-100ml-edp,Pendora Club Intense Homme 100ML EDP,"<p>Pandora Club Intense Homme 100ML Eau de Parfum for Men is an olfactory masterpiece that exudes luxury and sophistication. This exceptionally long-lasting fragrance is a testament to fine craftsmanship and an excellent alternative to the renowned and pricey Dior Homme Intense.</p>
<p>Opening with a crisp and invigorating top note of lavender, this perfume immediately captures your attention, offering a fresh and elegant introduction. As it evolves, the heart notes of iris, ambrette (musk mallow), and pear emerge, creating a harmonious blend of floral, musky, and fruity accords. The iris lends an exquisite powdery depth, while ambrette adds a sensual, warm touch, and pear provides a delightful hint of sweetness.</p>
<p>The base notes of Virginia cedar and vetiver ground this fragrance with a woody and earthy foundation. The combination of these base notes ensures that Pandora Club Intense Homme not only lingers on your skin but also leaves a memorable and enticing trail wherever you go.</p>
<p><strong>Top note</strong> is Lavender</p>
<p><strong>Middle notes</strong> are Iris, Ambrette (Musk Mallow) and Pear</p>
<p><strong>Base notes</strong> are Virginia Cedar and Vetiver.</p>
<p>What makes this fragrance truly exceptional is its resemblance to the iconic <strong>Dior Homme Intense</strong>, making it a remarkable option for those who appreciate fine fragrances but prefer a more budget-friendly alternative. With Pandora Club Intense Homme, you get a similar level of elegance and allure without breaking the bank, making it an ideal choice for the modern man who wants to make a lasting impression. This Eau de Parfum is a testament to your refined taste, making it an essential addition to your fragrance collection.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,5,deny,manual,1299.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Club-intense-homme.png?v=1781256463,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,blue,spray,fresh; floral; woody; spicy,,,glass; paper,everyday; special-occasion,fresh; floral; woody; musky; fruity,,,liquid,,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
pendora-scents-tudor-100ml-edp,Pendora Scents Tudor 100ML EDP,"<p>Pendora Tudor for Men, a captivating olfactory masterpiece that encapsulates sophistication and longevity in every spray. This fragrance is a symphony of exquisite notes carefully curated to leave a lasting impression, making it an essential addition to any man's collection.</p>
<p>From the moment it graces your skin, Pendora Tudor unveils a powerful and long-lasting aura. The top notes of Violet Leaf, Coriander, and Bergamot create an invigorating introduction, with the fresh, green aroma of violet leaf harmonizing perfectly with the zesty citrus notes, setting the stage for the scent journey ahead.</p>
<p>As this fragrance evolves, the heart notes of Rose, Black Pepper, and Lily-of-the-Valley take center stage. The romantic and slightly spicy essence of rose blends with the subtle heat of black pepper, while the delicate lily-of-the-valley adds a touch of floral elegance, creating a distinctive and alluring character.</p>
<p>Pendora Tudor's base notes of Ambergris, Patchouli, and Bourbon Vanilla provide a deep and sensual foundation. Ambergris imparts a rich, slightly aquatic element, while patchouli adds a woody and earthy dimension. The final touch of Bourbon Vanilla adds a sweet, creamy undertone, leaving a memorable, lingering trail.</p>
<p><strong>Top Notes: </strong>Violet Leaf, Coriander, Bergamot</p>
<p><strong>Middle Notes: </strong>Rose, Black Pepper, Lily-of-the-Valley</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes: </strong>Ambergris, Patchouli, Bourbon Vanilla.</p>
<p>Notably, Pendora Tudor is celebrated for its similarity to the beloved <strong>Tuxedo by Yves Saint Laurent</strong>, making it an affordable alternative for those who appreciate this iconic fragrance. Embrace Pendora Tudor and experience the charm and charisma of a classic scent that endures throughout the day, ensuring you leave a remarkable impression wherever you go.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Pendora Scents",true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1299.00,2099.00,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Pendora-Tudor-perfume.png?v=1781256340,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,pendora-scents,,,edp,,pendora-scents,,,,,,,6-8-hours,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,clear,spray,fresh; citrus; floral; woody; vanilla,,,glass; paper; plastic,everyday,fresh; citrus; floral; woody; musky,,,liquid,,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
pendora-eau-de-blanc-100ml-edp,Pendora Eau De Blanc 100ml EDP,"<p>Pendora Scents Eau De Blanc Parfum is an exquisite and long-lasting fragrance tailored for the modern man who appreciates sophistication and allure. Crafted by master perfumers, this captivating scent showcases a harmonious fusion of carefully selected notes, resulting in an alluring olfactory experience that leaves a lasting impression. <strong>Inspired</strong> Of <b>L'Eau d'Issey Pour Homme</b> by <b>Issey Miyake</b></p>
<p>At the top, the fragrance bursts open with a refreshing blend of zesty Bergamot, vibrant Lemon, and aromatic Tarragon. This invigorating combination creates an immediate sense of vitality and freshness, setting the stage for the journey ahead.</p>
<p>As the scent evolves, the heart notes gracefully emerge, featuring the intriguing fusion of aromatic Nutmeg and the delicate essence of Water Lily. These middle notes add depth and complexity to the fragrance, striking a perfect balance between masculine strength and gentle sensuality.</p>
<p>The allure deepens as the fragrance settles into its base notes, where a rich and robust blend of Tobacco, sensual Sandalwood, earthy Vetiver, majestic Cedar, and velvety Musk create a captivating and lingering trail. This warm and sophisticated base ensures the fragrance lasts throughout the day, captivating those around with its undeniable charm.</p>
<p>Pendora Eau De Blanc 100ml EDP is a remarkable and versatile scent, perfect for both daytime and evening wear. Its charismatic aura will leave an indelible mark wherever the man goes, exuding confidence and magnetism. Whether for special occasions or daily wear, this fragrance will become an essential element of the modern man's grooming ritual, elevating his presence and leaving a lasting memory in the minds of those he encounters.</p>
<p><strong>Top</strong>: Bergamot, lemon, tarragon</p>
<p><strong>Middle</strong>: Nutmeg, water lily</p>
<p><strong>Base</strong>: Tobacco, sandalwood, vetiver, cedar, musk</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1349.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Pendora-Eau-De-Blanc-100ml-EDP.png?v=1781256345,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,clear,spray,citrus; woody; spicy,,,glass; plastic,everyday; special-occasion,citrus; fresh; woody; musky,,,liquid,,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
pendora-puremale-100ml-edp,Pendora Puremale 100ml EDP,"<p>Pendora Puremale 100ml Eau de Parfum for men, a scent that embodies sophistication and sensuality. Crafted to captivate the senses, this fragrance is a harmonious blend of exquisite notes that exude confidence and charm.</p>
<p>At the very first whiff, the top notes of Pendora Puremale burst forth with a refreshing and invigorating combination of juicy Pear, aromatic Lavender, cool Mint, zesty Bergamot, and zesty Lemon. This opening is a tantalizing introduction that sets the stage for the olfactory journey ahead.</p>
<p>As the scent evolves, the heart notes reveal themselves, featuring the warm and spicy embrace of Cinnamon, the herbal allure of Clary Sage, and the subtle hint of Caraway. These middle notes add depth and complexity, creating an intriguing contrast to the initial freshness.</p>
<p>The base notes of Pendora Puremale leave a lasting impression, lingering on the skin and in the memory. A rich blend of Black Vanilla Husk, Amber, earthy Patchouli, and woody Cedar combine to create a seductive and masculine foundation that lingers throughout the day and into the night.</p>
<p>Pendora Puremale is a homage to the iconic <strong>Ultra Male by Jean Paul Gaultier</strong>, known for its Amber Fougere character. This fragrance captures the essence of the original while adding its own unique twist, making it a perfect choice for those who appreciate the timeless appeal of Ultra Male.</p>
<p>In a sleek 100ml bottle, Pendora Puremale is more than just a fragrance; it's an expression of individuality and charisma. Whether worn during the day or for a night out, this scent is the epitome of masculine elegance, leaving a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>
<p> </p>
<p><strong>Top notes</strong> are Pineapple, Bergamot, Black Currant and Apple</p>
<p><strong>Middle notes</strong> are Birch, Patchouli, Moroccan Jasmine and Rose</p>
<p><strong>Base notes</strong> are Musk, oak moss, Ambergris and Vanille.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1299.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Pendora-Puremale-100ml-EDP.png?v=1781256067,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,blue,spray,citrus; spicy; woody; vanilla; floral,,,glass; plastic,everyday; special-occasion,fresh; citrus; spicy; woody; musky,,,liquid,,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-qissa-blue-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Qissa Blue 100ml EDP,"<p data-start=""0"" data-end=""166""><strong data-start=""0"" data-end=""121""><span class=""hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline""><span class=""whitespace-normal"">Paris Corner</span></span> Qissa Blue 100ml EDP – Citrus Freshness with Smoky Leather &amp; Amber Elegance 🔵✨</strong><br data-start=""121"" data-end=""124"">For Men &amp; Women | Fresh • Woody • Ambery</p>
<p data-start=""168"" data-end=""409""><strong data-start=""168"" data-end=""195"">Paris Corner Qissa Blue</strong> is a sophisticated unisex fragrance that combines sparkling citrus notes with smoky leather, aromatic florals, and a rich amber-musky base. Fresh yet mysterious, it offers a unique balance of brightness and depth.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""68u3xr"" data-start=""411"" data-end=""433"">🌿 Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p data-start=""435"" data-end=""781""><strong data-start=""435"" data-end=""449"">Top Notes:</strong><br data-start=""449"" data-end=""452"">🍋 <strong data-start=""455"" data-end=""483"">Citrus, Bergamot &amp; Lemon</strong> – Crisp, refreshing citrus burst that feels energetic and uplifting.<br data-start=""552"" data-end=""555"">🌼 <strong data-start=""558"" data-end=""573"">Ylang-Ylang</strong> – Soft floral sweetness adding elegance.<br data-start=""614"" data-end=""617"">🌿 <strong data-start=""620"" data-end=""633"">Artemisia</strong> – Aromatic green freshness with a slightly herbal touch.<br data-start=""690"" data-end=""693"">🖤 <strong data-start=""696"" data-end=""717"">Leather &amp; Incense</strong> – Smoky sophistication that adds immediate character and depth.</p>
<p data-start=""783"" data-end=""1089""><strong data-start=""783"" data-end=""800"">Middle Notes:</strong><br data-start=""800"" data-end=""803"">🍊 <strong data-start=""806"" data-end=""822"">Sweet Orange</strong> – Juicy citrus sweetness enhancing the freshness.<br data-start=""872"" data-end=""875"">🌶️ <strong data-start=""879"" data-end=""889"">Ginger</strong> – Warm spicy kick that energizes the heart.<br data-start=""933"" data-end=""936"">🌸 <strong data-start=""939"" data-end=""961"">Jasmine &amp; Magnolia</strong> – Smooth floral elegance balancing the woody and smoky notes.<br data-start=""1023"" data-end=""1026"">🌿 <strong data-start=""1029"" data-end=""1042"">Patchouli</strong> – Earthy richness adding depth and complexity.</p>
<p data-start=""1091"" data-end=""1369""><strong data-start=""1091"" data-end=""1106"">Base Notes:</strong><br data-start=""1106"" data-end=""1109"">🤍 <strong data-start=""1112"" data-end=""1120"">Musk</strong> – Clean sensual softness that lingers beautifully.<br data-start=""1171"" data-end=""1174"">🌿 <strong data-start=""1177"" data-end=""1188"">Oakmoss</strong> – Green earthy depth adding a classic touch.<br data-start=""1233"" data-end=""1236"">🌶️ <strong data-start=""1240"" data-end=""1251"">Saffron</strong> – Warm exotic spice enhancing luxury.<br data-start=""1289"" data-end=""1292"">🔥 <strong data-start=""1295"" data-end=""1304"">Amber</strong> – Rich golden warmth providing a smooth and long-lasting finish.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""11ro6m1"" data-start=""1371"" data-end=""1397"">✨ Fragrance Experience</h3>
<p data-start=""1399"" data-end=""1579"">Qissa Blue opens with a <strong data-start=""1423"" data-end=""1455"">bright citrus-leather accord</strong>, evolves into a <strong data-start=""1472"" data-end=""1500"">fresh spicy-floral heart</strong>, and settles into a <strong data-start=""1521"" data-end=""1546"">warm amber-musky base</strong> enriched by oakmoss and saffron.</p>
<p data-start=""1581"" data-end=""1679"">The result is a fragrance that feels <strong data-start=""1618"" data-end=""1678"">fresh, refined, slightly smoky, and effortlessly elegant</strong>.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""15kws0e"" data-start=""1681"" data-end=""1696"">🎯 Best For</h3>
<p data-start=""1698"" data-end=""1835"">✔️ Daily Wear<br data-start=""1711"" data-end=""1714"">✔️ Office &amp; Professional Settings<br data-start=""1747"" data-end=""1750"">✔️ Evening Outings<br data-start=""1768"" data-end=""1771"">✔️ Spring, Autumn &amp; Winter<br data-start=""1797"" data-end=""1800"">✔️ Lovers of Fresh Woody Fragrances</p>
<p data-start=""1837"" data-end=""1931"" data-is-last-node="""" data-is-only-node="""">🔵✨ <strong data-start=""1841"" data-end=""1931"" data-is-last-node="""">Qissa Blue – a captivating story of citrus freshness, smoky leather, and amber warmth.</strong></p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,1649.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/QissaBlue.png?v=1781255709,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,musk; oakmoss; saffron; amber,paris-corner,,,edp,,made-in-uae,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/PARIS-CORNER/Qissa-Blue-98579.html,women,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,citrus; fresh-spicy; fresh; aromatic; herbal,,orange; ginger; jasmine; magnolia-1; patchouli,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,citruses; bergamot; lemon; ylang-ylang; artemisia,,,for-women,,,,,blue,spray,citrus; woody; spicy; floral,,,glass; metal,everyday; special-occasion,citrus; woody; fresh,,,liquid,spring; fall; winter,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
pendora-armour-code-uomo-100ml-edp,Pendora Scents Armour Code Uomo 100ml EDP,"<p>Pendora  Scents Armour Code Uomo is a captivating and long-lasting fragrance designed for both men and women. Embodying sophistication and allure, this 100ml Eau de Parfum is a fusion of exquisite notes that create a memorable olfactory experience. <strong>Inspired</strong> of <b>Armani Code Profumo</b> by <b>Giorgio Armani</b></p>
<p>At its inception, the fragrance tantalizes the senses with an invigorating blend of top notes. The spicy warmth of Cardamom is complemented by the crisp and juicy aroma of Green Apple. Harmoniously intertwined with a zesty twist of Green Mandarin, these initial notes exude freshness and energy, setting the stage for the journey ahead.</p>
<p>As the fragrance unfolds, the heart notes take center stage, revealing a refined and captivating aura. Nutmeg infuses a sense of allure with its aromatic spice, while Lavender adds a touch of floral elegance. The enchanting and delicate scent of Orange Blossom weaves through, creating a harmonious and enchanting composition that lingers on the skin.</p>
<p>Finally, Pendora Armour Code Uomo leaves a lasting impression with its indulgent base notes. The rich and sweet essence of Tonka Bean provides a comforting and luxurious foundation, enhanced by the warm and inviting embrace of Amber. To add a touch of sensuality and depth, the fragrance is enriched with a subtle hint of Leather, leaving a trail of captivating sophistication in its wake.</p>
<p>This extraordinary fragrance by Pendora embraces the duality of both strength and grace, making it an ideal choice for confident individuals who seek a signature scent that effortlessly transitions from day to night. Pendora Armour Code Uomo 100ml EDP is a celebration of timeless elegance and a true testament to the art of perfumery.</p>
<p><strong>Top </strong><b>Notes:</b> Cardamom, Green Apple, Green Mandarin</p>
<p><b>Heart Notes: </b>Nutmeg, Lavender, Orange Blossom</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes :</strong>Tonka Bean, Amber And Leather.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Pendora Scents",true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1499.00,2099.00,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Pendora-Scents-Armour-Code-Uomo.png?v=1781255704,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,pendora-scents,,,,,inspired-by-armani-code-profumo; pendora-scents,,oriental,,,,,6-8-hours,,,,,,,,,,,,,,date-night,,,,,,,for-men,,'1,,,black,spray,spicy; fruity; woody; citrus; floral,,,glass; plastic,everyday; special-occasion,aromatic; woody; musky; citrus; floral,,,liquid,,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
ministry-of-oud-oud-indonesian-100ml-extrait-de-perfume,Ministry of Oud Oud Indonesian 100ML Extrait De Perfume,"<p>Ministry of Oud Oud Indonesian Extrait De Perfume, a 100ml olfactory masterpiece designed exclusively for men. This fragrance is a celebration of luxury, mystique, and timeless sophistication. Crafted with meticulous attention to detail, it offers a sensory journey through the enchanting Indonesian forests, capturing the essence of pure oud in every drop.</p>
<p>At the first encounter, the top notes of Rose and Bergamot dance gracefully on your skin, creating an initial burst of floral and citrusy freshness. This initial impression is like the first rays of dawn breaking through the lush Indonesian foliage, invigorating and captivating.</p>
<p>As the fragrance evolves, the heart note of Patchouli emerges, infusing depth and character. It's a nod to the earthy richness of the Indonesian soil, where patchouli thrives, adding a hint of green and woody complexity.</p>
<p>But it's in the base notes that the true magic of Ministry of Oud Oud Indonesian Extrait De Perfume unfolds. The robust, woody embrace of Agarwood (Oud) takes center stage, transporting you to the heart of the Indonesian oud forests. This rare and precious ingredient is complemented by the warmth of Amber, creating an irresistibly seductive and long-lasting finish that lingers on your skin for hours.</p>
<p>It's worth noting that this fragrance is an exquisite Inspired of the <strong>iconic Indonesian Oud Eau de Toilette by Ermenegildo Zegna</strong>, known for its amber woody profile. Ministry of Oud Oud Indonesian Extrait De Perfume encapsulates the same allure, making it an ideal choice for those who appreciate the distinguished elegance of Zegna's creation but seek a more concentrated and intense experience.</p>
<p><strong>Top notes</strong> are Rose and Bergamot</p>
<p><strong>Middle note</strong> is Patchouli</p>
<p><strong>Base notes</strong> are Agarwood (Oud) and Amber.</p>
<p>In every spray of Ministry of Oud Oud Indonesian, you're not just wearing a fragrance; you're wearing an olfactory masterpiece inspired by the rich heritage of Indonesian oud, designed to envelop you in its alluring aura, leaving a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,1749.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Ministry-of-Oud-Oud-Indonesian-100ML-Extrait-De-Perfume.png?v=1781255366,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,adults,,,spray,woody; citrus; floral,,,glass; paper; metal,special-occasion,citrus; floral; woody,,,liquid,,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
pendora-dream-catcher-100ml-edp,Pendora Dream Catcher 100ML EDP,"<p>Pandora Dream Catcher 100ML Eau de Parfum for Men is a captivating and enduring fragrance that offers a sensory journey through a harmonious blend of top-quality ingredients. This scent exudes charisma and allure, making it a must-have for the modern man who appreciates a long-lasting and distinguished aroma.</p>
<p>At the top, Pandora Dream Catcher opens with a burst of freshness, featuring invigorating notes of zesty grapefruit, aromatic coriander, and the earthy richness of basil. These top notes create an immediate and memorable impression, setting the stage for what's to come.</p>
<p>In the heart of this fragrance, a compelling combination of ginger, cardamom, and the delicate sweetness of orange blossom unfolds. This complex blend adds a layer of sophistication and depth to the scent, evoking a sense of intrigue and sensuality.</p>
<p>As the fragrance settles into its base notes, Pandora Dream Catcher reveals a warm and woody foundation. Amber provides a luxurious and ambery sweetness, while the richness of tobacco and the sturdy presence of cedarwood add a masculine and enduring quality to the composition.</p>
<p>Notably, Pandora Dream Catcher is celebrated for being an outstanding alternative to the iconic <strong>The One for Men by Dolce &amp; Gabbana</strong>. It captures the essence of the original fragrance while offering a unique and longer-lasting experience.</p>
<p><strong>Top:</strong> Grapefruit, Coriander and Basil</p>
<p><strong>Middle: </strong>Ginger, Cardamom and Orange Blossom</p>
<p><strong>Base: </strong>Amber, Tobacco and Cedar</p>
<p>In summary, Pandora Dream Catcher is a fragrant masterpiece that lingers on the skin for hours, making it an ideal choice for the modern man seeking a high-quality scent that leaves a lasting impression. With its carefully selected notes and its resemblance to a beloved classic, it's a fragrance that embodies elegance and allure.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,1849.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Dream-catcher-perfume.png?v=1781255143,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,'1,,,orange,spray,citrus; woody; spicy,,,glass,everyday,citrus; aromatic; woody,,,liquid,,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
french-avenue-saffron-elixir-100ml-edp,French Avenue Saffron Elixir 100ml EDP,"<h3 data-section-id=""1ox3gtd"" data-start=""0"" data-end=""52"">French Avenue Saffron Elixir Eau de Parfum 100ml</h3>
<p data-start=""54"" data-end=""269"">Rich, warm, and luxurious, <strong data-start=""81"" data-end=""99"">Saffron Elixir</strong> is an enchanting fragrance that blends exotic spices with sweet amber accords and deep woody notes. Perfect for those who appreciate elegance and lasting sophistication.</p>
