<p data-start=""408"" data-end=""519""><strong data-start=""408"" data-end=""429"">Fragrance Family:</strong> Oriental Woody Amber<br data-start=""450"" data-end=""453""><strong data-start=""453"" data-end=""466"">Best For:</strong> Evening wear, special occasions, and cooler weather.</p>
<p data-start=""521"" data-end=""670"" data-is-last-node="""" data-is-only-node="""">A captivating fusion of spicy saffron, smooth caramel, and smoky woods creates a refined scent that leaves a powerful and unforgettable impression. ✨</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Fragrance World, French Avenue, Full",true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,2249.00,2800.00,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/SaffronElixir.png?v=1781254184,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,sandalwood; incense; oakmoss,french-avenue,,,edp,,french-avenue,,saffron,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/French-Avenue/Saffron-Elixir-100006.html,unisex,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,warm-spicy; amber; woody; metallic; smoky,,amber; caramel,,,,,,,,,,,party,,,,saffron; cardamom,,,unisex,,,,,white; black,spray,woody; spicy; vanilla,,,,special-occasion,oriental; woody,,,liquid,fall; winter,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
