milestone-mouj-iceage-95ml-edp,Milestone Mouj Iceage 95ml EDP,"<p><strong>Discover Elegance Redefined: Milestone Mouj Iceage Woman 95ml EDP</strong> 🌟</p>
<p>Embark on an olfactory journey like no other with Milestone Mouj Iceage Woman, a true masterpiece in the world of perfumery. Crafted by the renowned nose, Karine Vinchon Spehner, this fragrance embodies sophistication, allure, and timeless elegance. Inspired by the opulence of Lineage by Amouage, it stands as a remarkable tribute, offering an unparalleled experience to fragrance enthusiasts worldwide.</p>
<p>🔥 <strong>Unveiling the Fragrance Notes:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<strong>Top Notes:</strong> Delight in the tantalizing blend of ginger, Sichuan pepper, saffron, and Peruvian pepper. A burst of spicy warmth greets your senses, awakening them to the richness that lies ahead.</li>
<li>
<strong>Middle Notes:</strong> Journey deeper into a heart of exquisite complexity, where olibanum, myrrh, and fenugreek intertwine to create a tapestry of resinous opulence. Experience a sense of reverence as the fragrance evolves on your skin, revealing its intricate layers.</li>
<li>
<strong>Base Notes:</strong> Revel in the luxurious embrace of olibanum, myrrh, labdanum, vetiver, benzoin, and patchouli. A symphony of earthy, woody, and balsamic accords creates a lasting impression, leaving a trail of sophistication wherever you go.</li>
</ul>
<p>🌞 <strong>Perfect for All Weather, Long-Lasting Performance:</strong> Milestone Mouj Iceage Woman is not just a fragrance; it's an expression of luxury that transcends seasons. Whether under the blazing sun or amidst the cool embrace of winter, its enduring performance ensures you stand out in every climate. Embrace confidence that lasts from dawn to dusk, no matter the weather.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1349.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Mouj-Iceage.png?v=1781254858,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
pendora-noir-en-leather-100ml-edp,Pendora Noir En Leather 100ML EDP,"<p>Pendora Noir En Leather, a 100ML Eau de Parfum for men that transcends the ordinary, offering an olfactory journey through sophistication and luxury. Crafted for those who appreciate the enduring allure of leather, this fragrance is a testament to refinement and distinction, boasting an exceptional longevity that resonates with power and elegance.</p>
<p>At the pinnacle of this aromatic masterpiece is the intoxicating allure of cardamom, a top note that sets the stage for the sensory experience to unfold. The heart of Noir En Leather reveals a harmonious blend of sumptuous leather, delicate jasmine, and the exotic essence of Sambac. This symphony of scents intertwines seamlessly, creating a rich and captivating aura.</p>
<p>As the fragrance matures, the base notes of amber, moss, and patchouli emerge, leaving an indelible impression of sophistication and depth. The interplay of these elements culminates in a fragrance that is simultaneously bold and refined, making it an ideal choice for individuals who exude suave charm, a hint of arrogance, and a profound awareness of their success in life.</p>
<p>Noir En Leather stands as a cleaner, classier, and more balanced alternative to other leather-based fragrances. Its moderate to strong leather projection is complemented by fruity and musky undertones, adding a sweet touch that enhances its complexity. The severe presence of this Eau de Parfum is encapsulated in a specially designed bottle, making it a perfect gift for those who appreciate the finer things in life.</p>
<p><strong>Top</strong>: Cardamom</p>
<p><strong>Middle</strong>: Leather, Jasmine, Sambac</p>
<p><strong>Base</strong>: Amber, Moss, Patchouli</p>
<p>This fragrance is not just an indulgence; it's an ode to opulence. As a great Inspired of the esteemed <strong>Ombré Leather by Tom Ford</strong>, Noir En Leather offers a budget-friendly option without compromising on the essence of luxury. Immerse yourself in the allure of Pendora Noir En Leather, where each spray is an invitation to revel in the timeless sophistication of leather.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,1349.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Pendora-Noir-En-Leather_fdaf0a1e-fca6-4de5-ac34-49e85bb9f6ff.png?v=1781254537,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
french-avenue-zenith-deep-100ml-edp,French Avenue Zenith Deep 100ml EDP,"<p data-start=""0"" data-end=""165""><strong data-start=""0"" data-end=""114""><span class=""hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline""><span class=""whitespace-normal"">French Avenue</span></span> Zenith Deep 100ml EDP – Fresh Citrus Energy with Spicy Amber Woods 🌊🔥✨</strong><br data-start=""114"" data-end=""117"">For Men &amp; Women | Fresh • Spicy • Woody-Ambery</p>
<p data-start=""167"" data-end=""424""><strong data-start=""167"" data-end=""196"">French Avenue Zenith Deep</strong> is a vibrant and sophisticated fragrance that blends sparkling citrus, cooling mint, warm spices, and deep woody resins. Fresh at the top yet rich in the dry down, it delivers a balanced scent that's both energetic and elegant.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""68u3xr"" data-start=""426"" data-end=""448"">🌿 Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p data-start=""450"" data-end=""696""><strong data-start=""450"" data-end=""464"">Top Notes:</strong><br data-start=""464"" data-end=""467"">🍊 <strong data-start=""470"" data-end=""502"">Grapefruit, Lemon &amp; Bergamot</strong> – Bright citrus trio creating a crisp and refreshing opening.<br data-start=""564"" data-end=""567"">🌿 <strong data-start=""570"" data-end=""578"">Mint</strong> – Cooling freshness that adds an invigorating touch.<br data-start=""631"" data-end=""634"">🌶️ <strong data-start=""638"" data-end=""648"">Pepper</strong> – Sharp spicy kick adding character and energy.</p>
<p data-start=""698"" data-end=""939""><strong data-start=""698"" data-end=""715"">Middle Notes:</strong><br data-start=""715"" data-end=""718"">🌶️ <strong data-start=""722"" data-end=""741"">Ginger &amp; Nutmeg</strong> – Warm aromatic spices bringing depth and sophistication.<br data-start=""799"" data-end=""802"">🍈 <strong data-start=""805"" data-end=""814"">Melon</strong> – Juicy fruity sweetness that softens the spices.<br data-start=""864"" data-end=""867"">🌸 <strong data-start=""870"" data-end=""881"">Jasmine</strong> – Elegant floral nuance adding smoothness and refinement.</p>
<p data-start=""941"" data-end=""1235""><strong data-start=""941"" data-end=""956"">Base Notes:</strong><br data-start=""956"" data-end=""959"">🔥 <strong data-start=""962"" data-end=""973"">Incense</strong> – Smoky resinous depth adding mystery and richness.<br data-start=""1025"" data-end=""1028"">🌲 <strong data-start=""1031"" data-end=""1057"">Sandalwood &amp; Cedarwood</strong> – Smooth woody foundation with lasting elegance.<br data-start=""1106"" data-end=""1109"">✨ <strong data-start=""1111"" data-end=""1120"">Amber</strong> – Warm golden richness enhancing longevity.<br data-start=""1164"" data-end=""1167"">🌿 <strong data-start=""1170"" data-end=""1182"">Labdanum</strong> – Resinous sweetness that adds depth and complexity.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""11ro6m1"" data-start=""1237"" data-end=""1263"">✨ Fragrance Experience</h3>
<p data-start=""1265"" data-end=""1460"">Zenith Deep opens with a <strong data-start=""1290"" data-end=""1337"">burst of sparkling citrus, mint, and pepper</strong>, transitions into a <strong data-start=""1358"" data-end=""1380"">spicy-fruity heart</strong>, and settles into a <strong data-start=""1401"" data-end=""1459"">warm woody-amber base enriched with incense and resins</strong>.</p>
<p data-start=""1462"" data-end=""1584"">The fragrance feels <strong data-start=""1482"" data-end=""1526"">fresh, confident, versatile, and refined</strong>, making it suitable for both casual and formal occasions.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""15kws0e"" data-start=""1586"" data-end=""1601"">🎯 Best For</h3>
<p data-start=""1603"" data-end=""1746"">✔️ Daily Wear<br data-start=""1616"" data-end=""1619"">✔️ Office &amp; Professional Settings<br data-start=""1652"" data-end=""1655"">✔️ Evening Outings<br data-start=""1673"" data-end=""1676"">✔️ Spring, Summer &amp; Autumn<br data-start=""1702"" data-end=""1705"">✔️ Lovers of Fresh Spicy Woody Fragrances</p>
<p data-start=""1748"" data-end=""1819"" data-is-last-node="""" data-is-only-node="""">🌊🔥✨ <strong data-start=""1754"" data-end=""1819"" data-is-last-node="""">Zenith Deep – fresh energy meeting deep woody sophistication.</strong></p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,3649.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/ZenithDeep.png?v=1781253099,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,incense; sandalwood; amber; cedarwood; labdanum,french-avenue,,,,,made-in-uae,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/French-Avenue/Zenith-Deep-120870.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,fresh-spicy; citrus; amber; aromatic; woody,,ginger; melon; nutmeg-1; jasmine,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,grapefruit; pepper; lemon; mint; bergamot,,,for-men,,,,,white,spray,citrus; woody; spicy; herbal,,,glass; paper; cardboard,everyday; formal,fresh; citrus; woody; aromatic,,,liquid,spring; summer; fall,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
french-avenue-chaos-extrait-100ml-edp,French Avenue CHAOS Extrait 100ml EDP,"<h3 data-section-id=""1pu666b"" data-start=""0"" data-end=""47"">French Avenue CHAOS Extrait de Parfum 100ml</h3>
<p data-start=""49"" data-end=""251"">Bold, mysterious, and irresistibly addictive, <strong data-start=""95"" data-end=""112"">CHAOS Extrait</strong> combines juicy fruits with elegant iris and a rich leathery-vanilla base. A distinctive fragrance crafted for those who dare to stand out.</p>
<p data-start=""253"" data-end=""273""><strong data-start=""253"" data-end=""273"">Fragrance Notes:</strong></p>
<p data-start=""275"" data-end=""372""><strong data-start=""275"" data-end=""289"">Top Notes:</strong> Cherry, Red Fruits<br data-start=""308"" data-end=""311""><strong data-start=""311"" data-end=""326"">Heart Note:</strong> Iris<br data-start=""331"" data-end=""334""><strong data-start=""334"" data-end=""349"">Base Notes:</strong> Leather, Vanilla, Moss</p>
<p data-start=""374"" data-end=""479""><strong data-start=""374"" data-end=""395"">Fragrance Family:</strong> Fruity Leather<br data-start=""410"" data-end=""413""><strong data-start=""413"" data-end=""426"">Best For:</strong> Evening wear, special occasions, and cooler seasons.</p>
<p data-start=""481"" data-end=""611"" data-is-last-node="""" data-is-only-node="""">A captivating blend of sweet cherry, refined iris, and smooth leather creates a unique scent with a lasting and memorable trail. ✨</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,3599.00,4500.00,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Chaos.png?v=1781252706,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,leather; vanilla; moss,french-avenue,,,edp,,french-avenue,,leather,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/French-Avenue/Chaos-101177.html,unisex,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,8-12-hours,leather; cherry; sweet; fruity; vanilla,,iris,,,,,,,,,,,party,,,,cherry; red-fruits,,,unisex,,,,,geometric,spray,fruity; vanilla; woody,,,glass; metal; paper,special-occasion,fruity; woody,,,liquid,fall; winter,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
french-avenue-shmallow-fluff-100ml-extrait-de-parfum,French Avenue Sh'mallow Fluff 100ml Extrait De Parfum,"<p data-start=""0"" data-end=""184""><strong data-start=""0"" data-end=""136""><span class=""hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline""><span class=""whitespace-normal"">French Avenue</span></span> Sh'mallow Fluff 100ml Extrait De Parfum – Fluffy Marshmallow Bliss with Fruity Sweetness 🍓🍬✨</strong><br data-start=""136"" data-end=""139"">For Men &amp; Women | Gourmand • Sweet • Fruity</p>
<p data-start=""186"" data-end=""482""><strong data-start=""186"" data-end=""219"">French Avenue Sh'mallow Fluff</strong> is a deliciously playful gourmand fragrance inspired by the vibe of <strong data-start=""288"" data-end=""329""><span class=""hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline""><span class=""whitespace-normal"">Yum Boujee Marshmallow 81</span></span></strong>. Bursting with juicy fruits, fluffy marshmallow, and creamy vanilla praline, it delivers a fun, addictive scent that's sweet without being overwhelming.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""68u3xr"" data-start=""484"" data-end=""506"">🌿 Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p data-start=""508"" data-end=""792""><strong data-start=""508"" data-end=""522"">Top Notes:</strong><br data-start=""522"" data-end=""525"">🍓 <strong data-start=""528"" data-end=""542"">Strawberry</strong> – Juicy candy-like sweetness that instantly delights.<br data-start=""596"" data-end=""599"">🍋 <strong data-start=""602"" data-end=""611"">Lemon</strong> – Bright citrus sparkle adding freshness.<br data-start=""653"" data-end=""656"">🍏 <strong data-start=""659"" data-end=""668"">Apple</strong> – Crisp fruity sweetness with a vibrant feel.<br data-start=""714"" data-end=""717"">🥥 <strong data-start=""720"" data-end=""731"">Coconut</strong> – Creamy tropical smoothness enhancing the gourmand profile.</p>
<p data-start=""794"" data-end=""1044""><strong data-start=""794"" data-end=""811"">Middle Notes:</strong><br data-start=""811"" data-end=""814"">🍬 <strong data-start=""817"" data-end=""832"">Marshmallow</strong> – Soft, fluffy sweetness that forms the heart of the fragrance.<br data-start=""896"" data-end=""899"">🌸 <strong data-start=""902"" data-end=""913"">Jasmine</strong> – Elegant floral nuance balancing the sugary notes.<br data-start=""965"" data-end=""968"">🌼 <strong data-start=""971"" data-end=""989"">Orange Blossom</strong> – Sweet floral brightness adding femininity and charm.</p>
<p data-start=""1046"" data-end=""1332""><strong data-start=""1046"" data-end=""1061"">Base Notes:</strong><br data-start=""1061"" data-end=""1064"">🍦 <strong data-start=""1067"" data-end=""1078"">Vanilla</strong> – Rich creamy sweetness that lingers beautifully.<br data-start=""1128"" data-end=""1131"">🍫 <strong data-start=""1134"" data-end=""1145"">Praline</strong> – Nutty caramelized gourmand warmth.<br data-start=""1182"" data-end=""1185"">🤍 <strong data-start=""1188"" data-end=""1196"">Musk</strong> – Soft, clean sensuality that smooths the dry down.<br data-start=""1248"" data-end=""1251"">✨ <strong data-start=""1253"" data-end=""1269"">Ambrox Super</strong> – Modern musky-amber depth enhancing projection and longevity.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""11ro6m1"" data-start=""1334"" data-end=""1360"">✨ Fragrance Experience</h3>
<p data-start=""1362"" data-end=""1559"">Sh'mallow Fluff opens with a <strong data-start=""1391"" data-end=""1442"">burst of juicy strawberries, apple, and coconut</strong>, melts into a <strong data-start=""1457"" data-end=""1485"">fluffy marshmallow heart</strong>, and settles into a <strong data-start=""1506"" data-end=""1537"">creamy vanilla-praline base</strong> wrapped in soft musk.</p>
<p data-start=""1561"" data-end=""1652"">The result is a fragrance that feels <strong data-start=""1598"" data-end=""1651"">playful, comforting, sweet, and utterly addictive</strong>.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""15kws0e"" data-start=""1654"" data-end=""1669"">🎯 Best For</h3>
<p data-start=""1671"" data-end=""1807"">✔️ Dessert-Lovers &amp; Gourmand Fans<br data-start=""1704"" data-end=""1707"">✔️ Casual Outings<br data-start=""1724"" data-end=""1727"">✔️ Date Nights<br data-start=""1741"" data-end=""1744"">✔️ Fall &amp; Winter<br data-start=""1760"" data-end=""1763"">✔️ Anyone Who Loves Sweet Marshmallow Scents</p>
<p data-start=""1809"" data-end=""1898"" data-is-last-node="""" data-is-only-node="""">🍓🍬✨ <strong data-start=""1815"" data-end=""1898"" data-is-last-node="""">Sh'mallow Fluff – a dreamy cloud of marshmallow, vanilla, and fruity sweetness.</strong></p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,3399.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/SHMALLOWFluff.png?v=1781252091,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,vanilla; ambroxan; praline; musk,fragrance-world,,Floral Fruity Gourmand,,,inspired-by-yum-boujee-marshmallow-81-by-kayali-fragrances,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/French-Avenue/SH-MALLOW-Fluff-112019.html,women,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,sweet; fruity; citrus; powdery,,jasmine; orange-blossom-1,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,strawberry; lemon; apple; coconut,,,for-women,,,,,red,spray,strawberry; citrus; floral; vanilla; woody,,,plastic,everyday; special-occasion,gourmand; fruity; citrus,,,liquid,fall; winter,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
fragrance-world-mythical-gryphon-100ml-edp,Fragrance World Mythical Gryphon 100ml EDP,"<h3 data-section-id=""1wbuii2"" data-start=""0"" data-end=""56"">Fragrance World Mythical Gryphon Eau de Parfum 100ml</h3>
<p data-start=""58"" data-end=""282"">Unleash the power of <strong data-start=""79"" data-end=""99"">Mythical Gryphon</strong>, a bold and captivating fragrance that blends exotic spices, rich woods, and warm amber accords. Perfect for those who appreciate a strong, sophisticated scent with lasting presence.</p>
<p data-start=""284"" data-end=""304""><strong data-start=""284"" data-end=""304"">Fragrance Notes:</strong></p>
<p data-start=""306"" data-end=""473""><strong data-start=""306"" data-end=""320"">Top Notes:</strong> Saffron, Pepper, Bergamot, Cardamom<br data-start=""356"" data-end=""359""><strong data-start=""359"" data-end=""375"">Heart Notes:</strong> Akigalawood, Rose, Bark, Cedarwood, Cinnamon<br data-start=""420"" data-end=""423""><strong data-start=""423"" data-end=""438"">Base Notes:</strong> Vetiver, Amber, Patchouli, Vanilla</p>
<p data-start=""475"" data-end=""583""><strong data-start=""475"" data-end=""496"">Fragrance Family:</strong> Woody Spicy Amber<br data-start=""514"" data-end=""517""><strong data-start=""517"" data-end=""530"">Best For:</strong> Evening wear, special occasions, and cooler weather.</p>
<p data-start=""585"" data-end=""722"" data-is-last-node="""" data-is-only-node="""">A powerful fusion of spicy freshness, elegant woods, and smooth vanilla creates a distinctive scent that leaves a memorable impression. ✨</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Fragrance World, French Avenue, Full",true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,3999.00,4200.00,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/MythicalGryphon.png?v=1781249382,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,vetiver; amber; patchouli; vanilla,fragrance-world,,,edp,,fragrance-world,,spicy,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/French-Avenue/Mythical-Gryphon-106167.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,8-12-hours,woody; warm-spicy; oud; rose; fresh-spicy,,akigalawood; rose; bark; cedarwood; cinnamon,,,,,,,,,,,party,,,,saffron; white-pepper; bergamot; cardamom,,,for-men,,,,,brown,spray,woody; spicy; vanilla,,,glass; metal,special-occasion,woody; spicy; musky,,,liquid,fall,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
french-avenue-x-aromatix-naughty-dates-100ml-extrait-de-parfum,French Avenue X Aromatix Naughty Dates 100ml Extrait De Parfum,"<p data-start=""0"" data-end=""191""><strong data-start=""0"" data-end=""143""><span class=""hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline""><span class=""whitespace-normal"">French Avenue</span></span> X Aromatix Naughty Dates 100ml Extrait De Parfum – Decadent Dates, Coffee &amp; Caramel Indulgence ☕🍯🌴✨</strong><br data-start=""143"" data-end=""146"">For Men &amp; Women | Gourmand • Sweet • Ambery</p>
<p data-start=""193"" data-end=""505""><strong data-start=""193"" data-end=""235"">French Avenue X Aromatix Naughty Dates</strong> is a rich, addictive gourmand fragrance that blends luscious dates, roasted coffee, golden honey, and creamy caramel into a luxurious scent experience. Warm, sweet, and deeply comforting, it's a fragrance that feels like an indulgent dessert wrapped in amber and woods.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""68u3xr"" data-start=""507"" data-end=""529"">🌿 Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p data-start=""531"" data-end=""696""><strong data-start=""531"" data-end=""545"">Top Notes:</strong><br data-start=""545"" data-end=""548"">🌶️ <strong data-start=""552"" data-end=""564"">Cardamom</strong> – Warm aromatic spice that adds immediate richness.<br data-start=""616"" data-end=""619"">🍊 <strong data-start=""622"" data-end=""645"">Bergamot &amp; Mandarin</strong> – Bright citrus freshness balancing the sweetness.</p>
<p data-start=""698"" data-end=""1137""><strong data-start=""698"" data-end=""715"">Middle Notes:</strong><br data-start=""715"" data-end=""718"">☕ <strong data-start=""720"" data-end=""730"">Coffee</strong> – Dark roasted depth that gives the fragrance character.<br data-start=""787"" data-end=""790"">🌴 <strong data-start=""793"" data-end=""802"">Dates</strong> – Rich, syrupy sweetness and the star of the composition.<br data-start=""860"" data-end=""863"">🍯 <strong data-start=""866"" data-end=""875"">Honey</strong> – Golden warmth adding smooth gourmand richness.<br data-start=""924"" data-end=""927"">🌰 <strong data-start=""930"" data-end=""942"">Hazelnut</strong> – Creamy nutty sweetness enhancing the dessert-like feel.<br data-start=""1000"" data-end=""1003"">🌶️ <strong data-start=""1007"" data-end=""1019"">Cinnamon</strong> – Warm spice that adds coziness and depth.<br data-start=""1062"" data-end=""1065"">🪵 <strong data-start=""1068"" data-end=""1082"">Ebony Wood</strong> – Dark woody elegance that balances the sweeter notes.</p>
<p data-start=""1139"" data-end=""1447""><strong data-start=""1139"" data-end=""1154"">Base Notes:</strong><br data-start=""1154"" data-end=""1157"">🍮 <strong data-start=""1160"" data-end=""1171"">Caramel</strong> – Rich buttery sweetness that feels irresistibly smooth.<br data-start=""1228"" data-end=""1231"">🍦 <strong data-start=""1234"" data-end=""1245"">Vanilla</strong> – Creamy warmth that softens and enriches the dry down.<br data-start=""1301"" data-end=""1304"">🔥 <strong data-start=""1307"" data-end=""1316"">Amber</strong> – Deep golden warmth adding longevity and sensuality.<br data-start=""1370"" data-end=""1373"">🌲 <strong data-start=""1376"" data-end=""1390"">Sandalwood</strong> – Smooth woody creaminess that rounds out the fragrance.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""11ro6m1"" data-start=""1449"" data-end=""1475"">✨ Fragrance Experience</h3>
<p data-start=""1477"" data-end=""1761"">Naughty Dates opens with a <strong data-start=""1504"" data-end=""1528"">spicy citrus sparkle</strong>, quickly revealing a <strong data-start=""1550"" data-end=""1602"">rich heart of coffee, honey, dates, and hazelnut</strong>. As it dries down, the fragrance becomes a <strong data-start=""1646"" data-end=""1684"">creamy caramel-vanilla amber blend</strong> with soft woods, creating an intensely comforting and luxurious scent trail.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""15kws0e"" data-start=""1763"" data-end=""1778"">🎯 Best For</h3>
<p data-start=""1780"" data-end=""1893"">✔️ Winter &amp; Cool Weather<br data-start=""1804"" data-end=""1807"">✔️ Evening Wear<br data-start=""1822"" data-end=""1825"">✔️ Date Nights<br data-start=""1839"" data-end=""1842"">✔️ Special Occasions<br data-start=""1862"" data-end=""1865"">✔️ Gourmand Fragrance Lovers</p>
<p data-start=""1895"" data-end=""2012"" data-is-last-node="""" data-is-only-node="""">☕🍯🌴✨ <strong data-start=""1902"" data-end=""2012"" data-is-last-node="""">Naughty Dates – a delicious fusion of dates, coffee, caramel, and amber that feels irresistibly addictive.</strong></p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,13,deny,manual,4599.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/AromatixNaughtyDates.png?v=1781248629,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,caramel; vanilla; amber; sandalwood,fragrance-world,,New Arrival,,,made-in-uae,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Aromatix-X-French-Avenue/Naughty-Dates-122285.html,unisex,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,sweet; warm-spices; coffee; caramel; woody,,coffee; dates; honey; hazelnut; cinnamon,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,cardamom; bergamot; mandarin,,,unisex,,,,,brown,spray,spicy; citrus; woody; vanilla; sandalwood,gift-box,,glass; metal,special-occasion; everyday,gourmand; woody; aromatic,,,liquid,winter,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
fragrance-world-roses-demotion-100ml-edp,Fragrance World Roses D'emotion 100ml EDP,"<p data-start=""0"" data-end=""73""><strong data-start=""0"" data-end=""71""><span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;"">Fragrance World Roses D’Emotion 100ml EDP – A Bloom of Elegance</span> 🌹✨</strong></p>
<p data-start=""75"" data-end=""398"">A tribute to grace and resilience, <span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;""><strong data-start=""110"" data-end=""129"">Roses D’Emotion</strong></span> is an enchanting floral fragrance crafted for the modern woman who embodies strength and sophistication. Made in the UAE and <span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;""><strong>Inspired by Byredo’s Rose of No Man’s Land</strong></span>, this long-lasting Eau de Parfum unfolds like a delicate bouquet kissed by warmth and mystery.</p>
<p data-start=""400"" data-end=""422""><span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;""><strong data-start=""400"" data-end=""420"">Fragrance Notes:</strong></span></p>
<ul data-start=""424"" data-end=""1015"">
<li data-start=""424"" data-end=""633"">
<p data-start=""426"" data-end=""633""><strong data-start=""426"" data-end=""439"">T<span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;"">op Notes</span></strong><span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;"">: <strong data-start=""441"" data-end=""470"">Turkish Rose, Pink Pepper</strong></span> 🌸🌶️<br data-start=""476"" data-end=""479""><em data-start=""481"" data-end=""631"">A vibrant fusion of lush Turkish rose and a subtle hint of pink pepper introduces the scent with a floral yet spicy charm, exuding refined elegance.</em></p>
</li>
<li data-start=""635"" data-end=""836"">
<p data-start=""637"" data-end=""836""><span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;""><strong data-start=""637"" data-end=""653"">Middle Notes</strong>: <strong data-start=""655"" data-end=""682"">Turkish Rose, Raspberry</strong></span> 🍇🌹<br data-start=""687"" data-end=""690""><em data-start=""692"" data-end=""834"">The heart deepens with another layer of Turkish rose, enriched by the luscious sweetness of raspberry, creating a velvety and romantic aura.</em></p>
</li>
<li data-start=""838"" data-end=""1015"">
<p data-start=""840"" data-end=""1015""><span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;""><strong data-start=""840"" data-end=""854"">Base Notes</strong>: <strong data-start=""856"" data-end=""880"">White Amber, Papyrus</strong></span> 🌿🌟<br data-start=""885"" data-end=""888""><em data-start=""890"" data-end=""1013"">A seductive blend of white amber and papyrus delivers a warm, woody, and slightly musky finish that lingers irresistibly.</em></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=""1017"" data-end=""1170"" data-is-last-node="""" data-is-only-node="""">Perfect for <span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;""><strong data-start=""1029"" data-end=""1078"">daytime sophistication or an intimate evening</strong></span>, Roses D’Emotion is a timeless floral masterpiece—elegant, alluring, and unforgettable. 💖✨</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Fragrance World, Full",true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,3249.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Fragrance-World-Roses-Demotion_db974829-0d5f-4c97-91ec-4d43a9cfe957.png?v=1781248285,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,pink,spray,floral; woody; spicy,gift-box,,glass; metal; paper,everyday; special-occasion,floral; woody; musky,,,liquid,,female,,,,,,,kg,,,active
