<h1 data-end=""65"" data-start=""0"" data-section-id=""12txxpz"">Fragrance World Liquid Brun Limited Edition Eau de Parfum 150ml</h1>
<p data-end=""135"" data-start=""67""><strong data-end=""135"" data-start=""67"">An Elegant Blend of Freshness, Warmth, and Sophisticated Vanilla</strong></p>
<p data-end=""506"" data-start=""137"">Experience the refined character of <strong data-end=""220"" data-start=""173"">Fragrance World Liquid Brun Limited Edition</strong>, a luxurious Eau de Parfum that balances fresh citrus notes, aromatic spices, rich florals, and a warm woody-vanilla base. Crafted for fragrance lovers who appreciate depth and versatility, this scent delivers a memorable presence suitable for both special occasions and everyday wear.</p>
<p data-end=""506"" data-start=""137""><strong>Fragrance Notes</strong></p>
<h3 data-end=""541"" data-start=""528"" data-section-id=""5yezta"">Top Notes</h3>
<ul data-end=""572"" data-start=""542"">
<li data-end=""552"" data-start=""542"" data-section-id=""zoj8mq"">Cardamom</li>
<li data-end=""561"" data-start=""553"" data-section-id=""1usqtxe"">Citrus</li>
<li data-end=""572"" data-start=""562"" data-section-id=""1309ld7"">Lavender</li>
</ul>
<p data-end=""703"" data-start=""574"">A fresh and aromatic opening where bright citrus accords meet the spicy warmth of cardamom and the soothing elegance of lavender.</p>
<h3 data-end=""720"" data-start=""705"" data-section-id=""ofrdcf"">Heart Notes</h3>
<ul data-end=""758"" data-start=""721"">
<li data-end=""737"" data-start=""721"" data-section-id=""1dfz6qj"">Orange Blossom</li>
<li data-end=""751"" data-start=""738"" data-section-id=""16be1lv"">Guaiac Wood</li>
<li data-end=""758"" data-start=""752"" data-section-id=""1j4e61v"">Rose</li>
</ul>
<p data-end=""895"" data-start=""760"">The heart unfolds with a sophisticated blend of floral orange blossom and rose, enriched by the smooth, smoky character of guaiac wood.</p>
<h3 data-end=""911"" data-start=""897"" data-section-id=""873hyo"">Base Notes</h3>
<ul data-end=""952"" data-start=""912"">
<li data-end=""921"" data-start=""912"" data-section-id=""vqfptl"">Vanilla</li>
<li data-end=""934"" data-start=""922"" data-section-id=""4drdxb"">Tonka Bean</li>
<li data-end=""942"" data-start=""935"" data-section-id=""16yjrap"">Amber</li>
<li data-end=""952"" data-start=""943"" data-section-id=""1rzd5hr"">Oakmoss</li>
</ul>
<p data-end=""1112"" data-start=""954"">A rich and comforting foundation of creamy vanilla and tonka bean is enhanced by warm amber and earthy oakmoss, creating a long-lasting and captivating trail.</p>
<h2 data-end=""1134"" data-start=""1114"" data-section-id=""9wr7bb"">Fragrance Profile</h2>
<ul data-end=""1367"" data-start=""1135"">
<li data-end=""1181"" data-start=""1135"" data-section-id=""bbkk34"">
<strong data-end=""1158"" data-start=""1137"">Fragrance Family:</strong> Oriental Woody Vanilla</li>
<li data-end=""1222"" data-start=""1182"" data-section-id=""nhxmbi"">
<strong data-end=""1202"" data-start=""1184"">Concentration:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)</li>
<li data-end=""1240"" data-start=""1223"" data-section-id=""1ttu6tj"">
<strong data-end=""1234"" data-start=""1225"">Size:</strong> 100ml</li>
<li data-end=""1270"" data-start=""1241"" data-section-id=""10nfqyq"">
<strong data-end=""1257"" data-start=""1243"">Longevity:</strong> Long-lasting</li>
<li data-end=""1367"" data-start=""1271"" data-section-id=""mh4fli"">
<strong data-end=""1286"" data-start=""1273"">Best For:</strong> Evening wear, special occasions, cooler weather, and signature scent enthusiasts</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-end=""1390"" data-start=""1369"" data-section-id=""1vtcvuy"">Why You'll Love It</h2>
<p data-end=""1631"" data-start=""1391"">✔ Fresh, spicy, and aromatic opening<br data-end=""1430"" data-start=""1427"">✔ Elegant floral and woody heart notes<br data-end=""1471"" data-start=""1468"">✔ Warm vanilla-amber dry down<br data-end=""1503"" data-start=""1500"">✔ Long-lasting Eau de Parfum concentration<br data-end=""1548"" data-start=""1545"">✔ Suitable for both men and women<br data-end=""1584"" data-start=""1581"">✔ Perfect balance of sophistication and comfort</p>
<p data-is-only-node="""" data-is-last-node="""" data-end=""1933"" data-start=""1633""><strong data-end=""1664"" data-start=""1633"">Liquid Brun Limited Edition</strong> is a fragrance that seamlessly combines freshness and warmth, evolving from a vibrant aromatic opening into a rich, creamy, and woody finish. Its luxurious composition makes it an excellent choice for those seeking a distinctive scent that leaves a lasting impression.</p>
</div>
