lattafa-fakhar-men-100ml-edp,Lattafa Fakhar Men 100ml EdP,"<p data-end=""607"" data-start=""40""><strong>Fakhar for Men</strong> is a bold and modern fragrance launched in 2022, crafted for men who embody confidence and sophistication. The scent opens with an energetic blend of crisp apple, sparkling bergamot, and spicy ginger, creating a fresh and vibrant first impression. At its heart, aromatic lavender and sage mingle with juniper berries and geranium, adding depth, elegance, and a refined masculine character. The fragrance settles into a rich, long-lasting base of tonka bean, cedar, amberwood, and vetiver, leaving a warm, woody, and irresistibly smooth trail.</p>
<p data-end=""628"" data-start=""609""><strong data-end=""628"" data-start=""609"">Fragrance Notes</strong></p>
<ul data-end=""786"" data-start=""629"">
<li data-end=""669"" data-start=""629"" data-section-id=""17wg3hj"">
<strong data-end=""645"" data-start=""631"">Top Notes:</strong> Apple, Bergamot, Ginger</li>
<li data-end=""730"" data-start=""670"" data-section-id=""1gab3hp"">
<strong data-end=""688"" data-start=""672"">Heart Notes:</strong> Lavender, Sage, Juniper Berries, Geranium</li>
<li data-end=""786"" data-start=""731"" data-section-id=""1jtkmyz"">
<strong data-end=""748"" data-start=""733"">Base Notes:</strong> Tonka Bean, Cedar, Amberwood, Vetiver</li>
</ul>
<p data-is-only-node="""" data-is-last-node="""" data-end=""935"" data-start=""788"">A versatile and long-lasting fragrance, Fakhar Black is ideal for both daytime and evening wear, making it a distinctive choice for the modern man.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,20,deny,manual,2549.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Fakhar.png?v=1781176929,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,tonka-bean; cedar; amberwood; vetiver,lattafa,,,edp,,lattafa; inspired-by-y-eau-de-parfum,,fruity,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Lattafa-Perfumes/Fakhar-Black-70465.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,inspired-by-y-eau-de-parfum,8-12-hours,aromatic; fresh-spicy; woody; fruity; fresh,,lavender; sage; juniper-berries; geranium,,,,,,,,,,,daily-wear,,,,apple; bergamot; ginger,,,for-men,,'2,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
