musk-safi-6ml-attar,Musk Safi 6ml Attar,"<p data-start=""0"" data-end=""88""><strong data-start=""0"" data-end=""88"">Musk Safi Attar 6ml — A Pure Blend of Soft Florals, Clean Musk &amp; Gentle Warmth ✨🤍🌸</strong></p>
<p data-start=""90"" data-end=""485"">Musk Safi is a beautifully refined <strong data-start=""125"" data-end=""147"">alcohol-free attar</strong> that celebrates the timeless elegance of white musk. Soft, clean, and effortlessly comforting, this fragrance is designed for those who appreciate subtle sophistication and long-lasting freshness. Blending delicate florals with velvety musk and warm woods, Musk Safi creates a serene and inviting scent that is perfect for everyday wear.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""qnxdsc"" data-start=""487"" data-end=""506"">Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p data-start=""508"" data-end=""758""><strong data-start=""508"" data-end=""541"">Top Notes: Lily of the Valley</strong><br data-start=""541"" data-end=""544"">The fragrance opens with the fresh, delicate charm of lily of the valley. Light, airy, and slightly green, it brings a graceful floral brightness that feels pure and uplifting from the very first application. 🌸✨🌿</p>
<p data-start=""760"" data-end=""983""><strong data-start=""760"" data-end=""788"">Middle Notes: White Musk</strong><br data-start=""788"" data-end=""791"">As the scent develops, luxurious white musk takes center stage. Smooth, clean, and softly powdery, it wraps the skin in a comforting aura that is both elegant and effortlessly appealing. 🤍☁️✨</p>
<p data-start=""985"" data-end=""1256""><strong data-start=""985"" data-end=""1018"">Base Notes: Sandalwood, Amber</strong><br data-start=""1018"" data-end=""1021"">The dry-down reveals a warm and soothing foundation. Creamy sandalwood adds a silky woody richness, while amber imparts a subtle golden warmth, creating a soft and long-lasting finish that lingers beautifully throughout the day. 🌳🧡🌙</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""11jcyy1"" data-start=""1258"" data-end=""1280"">Why You'll Love It</h3>
<ul data-start=""1281"" data-end=""1543"">
<li data-section-id=""quwsbb"" data-start=""1281"" data-end=""1329"">
<strong data-start=""1283"" data-end=""1305"">Alcohol-free attar</strong> suitable for daily use.</li>
<li data-section-id=""iifr2g"" data-start=""1330"" data-end=""1374"">Clean and comforting white musk fragrance.</li>
<li data-section-id=""1xfg8lv"" data-start=""1375"" data-end=""1430"">Soft floral freshness balanced with warm woody notes.</li>
<li data-section-id=""11ytd45"" data-start=""1431"" data-end=""1471"">Long-lasting concentrated perfume oil.</li>
<li data-section-id=""1sto6og"" data-start=""1472"" data-end=""1543"">Perfect for both men and women who enjoy elegant, understated scents.</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=""1545"" data-end=""1772"" data-is-last-node="""" data-is-only-node=""""><strong data-start=""1545"" data-end=""1568"">Musk Safi Attar 6ml</strong> is ideal for everyday wear, prayer, work, and special moments when you want to feel fresh, clean, and effortlessly refined. A timeless fragrance that embodies purity, comfort, and quiet elegance.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,13,deny,manual,999.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/MuskSafi6mlAttar.png?v=1781156088,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,sandalwood; amber,naseem,,,concentrated-perfume-oil,,naseem,,,,unisex,,,8-12-hours,,,white-musk,,,,,,,,,,,daily-wear,,,,lily-of-the-valley,,,unisex,,,adults,,,bottle,floral; woody,,,glass,everyday; special-occasion,floral; musky; woody,,alcohol-free,oil,,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
