armaf-club-de-nuit-oud-105ml-parfum-1,Armaf Club De Nuit Oud 105ml Parfum,"<p><strong>Armaf Club De Nuit Oud 105ml Parfum: A Collector's Pride</strong> 🌟</p>
<p>Embark on a sensory journey like no other with Armaf Club De Nuit Oud 105ml Parfum – a masterpiece that transcends time and captivates the senses. Crafted to perfection, this fragrance stands as a testament to elegance, sophistication, and luxury, earning its place as a collector's pride.</p>
<p>🔥 <strong>Unveiling the Fragrance Notes:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<strong>Top Notes:</strong> Dive into a luscious blend of peach, passionfruit, pear, pineapple, plum, and bergamot, where each note dances harmoniously to create a symphony of fruity delight. Experience the invigorating freshness that sets the stage for an unforgettable olfactory experience.</li>
<li>
<strong>Middle Notes:</strong> Delve deeper into the heart of Club De Nuit Oud, where jasmine, cashmere wood, freesia, and violet leaves intertwine to weave a tapestry of floral elegance. Let the floral bouquet envelop you in a veil of sophistication and grace.</li>
<li>
<strong>Base Notes:</strong> The grand finale unfolds with musk, crystal amber, vanilla, and Cambodian oud, leaving an indelible mark of sensuality and allure. Experience the richness of the oriental oud, balanced by the warmth of vanilla and the earthiness of musk, culminating in a mesmerizing symphony of scent.</li>
</ul>
<p>🌞 <strong>Perfect for All Weather:</strong> Armaf Club De Nuit Oud is designed to transcend seasonal boundaries, making it the perfect companion for all weather conditions. Whether it's the crisp freshness of spring, the balmy days of summer, the golden hues of autumn, or the frosty chill of winter, this fragrance adapts effortlessly, ensuring you exude sophistication year-round.</p>",FragsTalk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,10200.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Armaf-Club-de-Nuit-Oud-parfum.png?v=1781067296,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,clear; beige,spray,fruity; floral; woody; vanilla,,,glass; metal; stone,everyday,fruity; floral; woody; oriental,,,liquid,spring; summer; fall; winter,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
