swiss-arabian-edge-women-100ml-edp,Swiss Arabian Edge Women 100ml EDP,"<p data-start=""0"" data-end=""155""><strong data-start=""0"" data-end=""116""><span class=""hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline""><span class=""whitespace-normal"">Swiss Arabian</span></span> Edge Women 100ml EDP – Delicate Floral Elegance with Soft Musky Warmth 🌹✨</strong><br data-start=""116"" data-end=""119"">For Women | Floral • Musky • Fresh</p>
<p data-start=""157"" data-end=""421""><strong data-start=""157"" data-end=""185"">Swiss Arabian Edge Women</strong> is a graceful and feminine fragrance that celebrates the beauty of blooming flowers wrapped in a soft musky embrace. Fresh, romantic, and effortlessly elegant, it is perfect for women who love classic floral scents with a modern touch.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""68u3xr"" data-start=""423"" data-end=""445"">🌿 Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p data-start=""447"" data-end=""687""><strong data-start=""447"" data-end=""461"">Top Notes:</strong><br data-start=""461"" data-end=""464"">🌹 <strong data-start=""467"" data-end=""475"">Rose</strong> – Romantic floral sweetness that immediately captivates.<br data-start=""532"" data-end=""535"">🌸 <strong data-start=""538"" data-end=""549"">Freesia</strong> – Fresh, airy floral accord adding brightness.<br data-start=""596"" data-end=""599"">🌿 <strong data-start=""602"" data-end=""617"">Green Notes</strong> – Crisp natural freshness that keeps the opening light and uplifting.</p>
<p data-start=""689"" data-end=""928""><strong data-start=""689"" data-end=""706"">Middle Notes:</strong><br data-start=""706"" data-end=""709"">🌹 <strong data-start=""712"" data-end=""720"">Rose</strong> – A richer rose accord forms the heart of the fragrance.<br data-start=""777"" data-end=""780"">🌺 <strong data-start=""783"" data-end=""792"">Peony</strong> – Soft, delicate floral sweetness with a fresh character.<br data-start=""850"" data-end=""853"">🤍 <strong data-start=""856"" data-end=""867"">Jasmine</strong> – Elegant white floral note adding sophistication and depth.</p>
<p data-start=""930"" data-end=""1112""><strong data-start=""930"" data-end=""945"">Base Notes:</strong><br data-start=""945"" data-end=""948"">🤍 <strong data-start=""951"" data-end=""965"">White Musk</strong> – Clean, soft sensuality that lingers beautifully on the skin.<br data-start=""1028"" data-end=""1031"">🌲 <strong data-start=""1034"" data-end=""1048"">Sandalwood</strong> – Creamy woody warmth providing a smooth and comforting finish.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""11ro6m1"" data-start=""1114"" data-end=""1140"">✨ Fragrance Experience</h3>
<p data-start=""1142"" data-end=""1374"">Edge Women opens with a <strong data-start=""1166"" data-end=""1217"">fresh bouquet of rose, freesia, and green notes</strong>, blossoms into a <strong data-start=""1235"" data-end=""1288"">romantic floral heart of rose, peony, and jasmine</strong>, and settles into a <strong data-start=""1309"" data-end=""1339"">soft musky-sandalwood base</strong> that feels elegant and comforting.</p>
<p data-start=""1376"" data-end=""1502"">The fragrance is light, feminine, and versatile, making it ideal for everyday wear while maintaining a sophisticated presence.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""15kws0e"" data-start=""1504"" data-end=""1519"">🎯 Best For</h3>
<p data-start=""1521"" data-end=""1636"">✔️ Daily Wear<br data-start=""1534"" data-end=""1537"">✔️ Office &amp; College<br data-start=""1556"" data-end=""1559"">✔️ Spring &amp; Summer<br data-start=""1577"" data-end=""1580"">✔️ Daytime Outings<br data-start=""1598"" data-end=""1601"">✔️ Lovers of Soft Floral Fragrances</p>
<p data-start=""1638"" data-end=""1706"" data-is-last-node="""" data-is-only-node="""">🌹✨ <strong data-start=""1642"" data-end=""1706"" data-is-last-node="""">Edge Women – timeless floral beauty with a soft musky touch.</strong></p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,2349.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/EDGEWOMEN.png?v=1780724303,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,white-musk; sandalwood,,,Floral Woody Musk,,,made-in-uae,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Swiss-Arabian/Edge-22990.html,women,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,floral; rose; green; fresh; musky,,rose; peony; jasmine,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,rose; freesia; green-notes,,,for-women,,,,,black,spray,floral; rose; jasmine; woody,,,glass; metal; paper,everyday; casual,floral; musky; woody,,,liquid,spring; summer,female,,,,,,,kg,,,active
swiss-arabian-edge-man-100ml-edp,Swiss Arabian Edge Man 100ml EDP,"<p data-start=""0"" data-end=""152""><strong data-start=""0"" data-end=""113""><span class=""hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline""><span class=""whitespace-normal"">Swiss Arabian</span></span> Edge Man 100ml EDP – Fresh Aromatic Energy with Smooth Spicy Woods 🌿⚡✨</strong><br data-start=""113"" data-end=""116"">For Men | Aromatic • Fresh • Woody</p>
<p data-start=""154"" data-end=""431""><strong data-start=""154"" data-end=""180"">Swiss Arabian Edge Man</strong> is a versatile and modern masculine fragrance that combines refreshing herbs and citrus with elegant florals, warm spices, and a clean woody-musky base. Fresh yet refined, it's designed for the confident man who wants an easy-to-wear signature scent.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""68u3xr"" data-start=""433"" data-end=""455"">🌿 Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p data-start=""457"" data-end=""728""><strong data-start=""457"" data-end=""471"">Top Notes:</strong><br data-start=""471"" data-end=""474"">🌿 <strong data-start=""477"" data-end=""489"">Lavender</strong> – Clean aromatic freshness with a classic masculine appeal.<br data-start=""549"" data-end=""552"">🌱 <strong data-start=""555"" data-end=""563"">Mint</strong> – Cool and invigorating freshness.<br data-start=""598"" data-end=""601"">🌺 <strong data-start=""604"" data-end=""616"">Geranium</strong> – Green floral nuance adding sophistication.<br data-start=""661"" data-end=""664"">🍋 <strong data-start=""667"" data-end=""676"">Lemon</strong> – Bright citrus sparkle that energizes the opening.</p>
<p data-start=""730"" data-end=""966""><strong data-start=""730"" data-end=""747"">Middle Notes:</strong><br data-start=""747"" data-end=""750"">🌸 <strong data-start=""753"" data-end=""770"">Orchid &amp; Rose</strong> – Elegant floral heart that adds smoothness and depth.<br data-start=""825"" data-end=""828"">🌶️ <strong data-start=""832"" data-end=""844"">Cardamom</strong> – Aromatic spice bringing warmth and character.<br data-start=""892"" data-end=""895"">✨ <strong data-start=""897"" data-end=""909"">Cinnamon</strong> – Subtle sweet-spicy richness enhancing the composition.</p>
<p data-start=""968"" data-end=""1187""><strong data-start=""968"" data-end=""983"">Base Notes:</strong><br data-start=""983"" data-end=""986"">🌲 <strong data-start=""989"" data-end=""1003"">Sandalwood</strong> – Creamy woody smoothness with lasting warmth.<br data-start=""1050"" data-end=""1053"">🪵 <strong data-start=""1056"" data-end=""1069"">Cedarwood</strong> – Dry woody structure that adds refinement.<br data-start=""1113"" data-end=""1116"">🤍 <strong data-start=""1119"" data-end=""1133"">White Musk</strong> – Clean, soft finish that lingers throughout the day.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""11ro6m1"" data-start=""1189"" data-end=""1215"">✨ Fragrance Experience</h3>
<p data-start=""1217"" data-end=""1424"">Edge Man opens with a <strong data-start=""1239"" data-end=""1288"">refreshing blend of lavender, mint, and lemon</strong>, develops into a <strong data-start=""1306"" data-end=""1328"">spicy-floral heart</strong>, and settles into a <strong data-start=""1349"" data-end=""1376"">smooth woody-musky base</strong> that feels clean, masculine, and sophisticated.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""15kws0e"" data-start=""1426"" data-end=""1441"">🎯 Best For</h3>
