<p data-start=""1580"" data-end=""1645"" data-is-last-node="""" data-is-only-node="""">🌿⚡✨ <strong data-start=""1585"" data-end=""1645"" data-is-last-node="""">Edge Man – fresh confidence with a refined woody finish.</strong></p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,5,deny,manual,2349.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/SwissArabianEdgeMen_79b9ca30-dc49-4ddb-a7ba-fe244c127a07.png?v=1780893564,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,sandalwood; cedar; white-musk,,, Woody Aromatic,,,made-in-uae,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Swiss-Arabian/Edge-22991.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,aromatic; woody; warm-spicy; fresh-spicy; powdery,,orchid; rose; cardamom; cinnamon,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,lavender; mint; geranium; lemon,,,for-men,,,,,black,spray,fresh; citrus; floral; woody; spicy; herbal,,,glass; metal; paper,everyday; casual,aromatic; fresh; citrus; floral; woody; musky; spicy,,,liquid,spring; summer,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-pendora-one-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Pendora One 100ML EDP,"<p>Pandora One Parfum for Men is a remarkable olfactory journey, capturing the essence of timeless elegance and modern masculinity. This exquisite fragrance boasts exceptional longevity, ensuring that you stay invigorated and confident throughout the day and into the night.</p>
<p>At the top, Pandora One opens with an enchanting burst of Fougeres, imparting a fresh and green aroma that sets the stage for what's to come. This initial note is a blend of aromatic herbs and mossy ferns, creating a harmonious, masculine introduction that leaves a lasting impression.</p>
<p>The heart of Pandora One unveils a delicate balance of White Flowers and Powdery notes, adding a touch of refinement and subtlety to the composition. The interplay between these elements creates a gentle, floral nuance with a powdery, comforting undertone, perfect for any occasion.</p>
<p>As the scent evolves, it gracefully transitions into a warm and inviting base. The combination of Woody and Citrus notes in the final stage creates a smooth and sophisticated dry down that lingers on the skin. This combination brings a sense of grounding and depth, making Pandora One a truly versatile fragrance that suits both daytime and evening wear.</p>
<p>What sets Pandora One apart is its undeniable resemblance to the iconic <strong>CK One by Calvin Klein</strong>. It serves as a fantastic and budget-friendly alternative to this renowned fragrance, offering a similar olfactory experience at a fraction of the cost.</p>
<p><strong>Top Notes</strong> - Fougeres<br><strong>Heart Notes</strong> - White Flowers, Powdery<br><strong>Base Notes</strong> - Woody, Citrus</p>
<p>In conclusion, Pandora One is a long-lasting, high-quality Eau de Parfum designed for the modern man. With its well-balanced notes, it embodies a sense of timeless sophistication and versatility, making it the perfect choice for those who appreciate quality scents without breaking the bank.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1349.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Pendora-One.png?v=1780722854,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,white,spray,fresh; woody; citrus; floral,,,glass; metal; paper,everyday; special-occasion,aromatic; fresh; woody; citrus; floral,,,liquid,,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
jacques-bogart-story-red-100ml-edt,Jacques Bogart Story Red 100ML EDT,"<p data-start=""0"" data-end=""115""><strong data-start=""0"" data-end=""77""><span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;"">Jacques Bogart Story Red 100ml EDT – Spicy Freshness with Warm Depth</span> 🔥🌿</strong><br data-start=""77"" data-end=""80""><em data-start=""80"" data-end=""115"">For Men | Aromatic • Spicy • Warm</em></p>
<p data-start=""117"" data-end=""370"">Jacques Bogart Story Red is a refined and charismatic fragrance crafted for the modern man. It blends fresh aromatic top notes with a subtly floral heart and a warm, sensual base, delivering a balanced scent that’s both invigorating and sophisticated.</p>
<p data-start=""372"" data-end=""395""><span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;""><strong data-start=""372"" data-end=""393"">Fragrance Notes ✨</strong></span></p>
<p data-start=""397"" data-end=""656""><span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;""><strong data-start=""397"" data-end=""411"">Top Notes:</strong></span> Mint, Green Cardamom &amp; Lavender 🌿💚<br data-start=""448"" data-end=""451"">The opening is crisp and energizing, with cool mint and spicy green cardamom creating an immediate burst of freshness. Lavender adds a classic aromatic touch, giving the scent a clean and confident vibe.</p>
<p data-start=""658"" data-end=""908""><span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;""><strong data-start=""658"" data-end=""675"">Middle Notes:</strong></span> Lavender, Orange Blossom &amp; Cedarwood 🌸🌲<br data-start=""717"" data-end=""720"">The heart deepens with soft lavender layered with delicate orange blossom for a subtle floral nuance. Cedarwood adds a refined woody structure, giving the fragrance elegance and balance.</p>
<p data-start=""910"" data-end=""1116""><span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;""><strong data-start=""910"" data-end=""925"">Base Notes:</strong> </span>Amber, Labdanum &amp; Vanilla 🤎🍦<br data-start=""956"" data-end=""959"">The dry-down is warm, smooth, and addictive, where golden amber and resinous labdanum merge with creamy vanilla to create a comforting, long-lasting trail.</p>
<p data-start=""1118"" data-end=""1273"">Perfect for daytime wear, office settings, and evening outings, Story Red is ideal for men who enjoy a fresh-spicy fragrance with a warm, elegant finish.</p>
<p data-start=""1275"" data-end=""1355"" data-is-last-node="""" data-is-only-node="""">🔥🌿 <span style=""font-family: twentiethcentury-bol;""><strong data-start=""1280"" data-end=""1355"" data-is-last-node="""">Jacques Bogart Story Red – freshness that excites, warmth that lingers.</strong></span></p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,2649.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Bogart-Story-Red.png?v=1780722663,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,mint; labdanum; cedar,jacques-bogart,,,edt,,jacques-bogart,,floral; aromatic,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Jacques-Bogart/Bogart-Story-Red-24889.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,amber; white-floral; aromatic; lavender; warm-spicy; citrus,,amber; lavender; cardamom,,,,,,,,,,,party,,,,orange-blossom-1,,,for-men,,,,,,spray,spicy; woody; vanilla; floral,,,glass; plastic,everyday; special-occasion,fresh; aromatic; floral; woody; musky,,,liquid,,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
jacques-bogart-story-red-100ml-edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Story-Red-Bogart.png?v=1780722663,2,"",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
rayhaan-tonquin-giza-100ml-edp,Rayhaan Tonquin Giza 100ml EDP,"<p data-start=""0"" data-end=""167""><strong data-start=""0"" data-end=""120""><span class=""hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline""><span class=""whitespace-normal"">Rayhaan</span></span> Tonquin Giza 100ml EDP – Dark Cacao &amp; Tonka Indulgence with Creamy Vanilla 🍫✨</strong><br data-start=""120"" data-end=""123"">For Men &amp; Women | Gourmand • Sweet • Spicy</p>
<p data-start=""169"" data-end=""413""><strong data-start=""169"" data-end=""193"">Rayhaan Tonquin Giza</strong> is a rich and addictive fragrance built around decadent cacao, creamy tonka bean, and smooth vanilla. Warm spices and nutty accords add depth, creating a luxurious gourmand scent that feels comforting yet sophisticated.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""68u3xr"" data-start=""415"" data-end=""437"">🌿 Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p data-start=""439"" data-end=""604""><strong data-start=""439"" data-end=""453"">Top Notes:</strong><br data-start=""453"" data-end=""456"">🌶️ <strong data-start=""460"" data-end=""470"">Spices</strong> – Warm aromatic spices that create an inviting opening.<br data-start=""526"" data-end=""529"">🍫 <strong data-start=""532"" data-end=""541"">Cacao</strong> – Rich dark chocolate nuance adding immediate gourmand appeal.</p>
<p data-start=""606"" data-end=""778""><strong data-start=""606"" data-end=""623"">Middle Notes:</strong><br data-start=""623"" data-end=""626"">🌰 <strong data-start=""629"" data-end=""646"">Bitter Almond</strong> – Smooth nutty character with a slightly creamy edge.<br data-start=""700"" data-end=""703"">🍮 <strong data-start=""706"" data-end=""718"">Coumarin</strong> – Sweet hay-like warmth that enhances the gourmand profile.</p>
<p data-start=""780"" data-end=""948""><strong data-start=""780"" data-end=""795"">Base Notes:</strong><br data-start=""795"" data-end=""798"">🍦 <strong data-start=""801"" data-end=""815"">Tonka Bean</strong> – Rich, creamy sweetness with hints of vanilla and almond.<br data-start=""874"" data-end=""877"">🤍 <strong data-start=""880"" data-end=""891"">Vanilla</strong> – Smooth, comforting sweetness that lingers beautifully.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""11ro6m1"" data-start=""950"" data-end=""976"">✨ Fragrance Experience</h3>
<p data-start=""978"" data-end=""1174"">Tonquin Giza opens with a <strong data-start=""1004"" data-end=""1031"">warm spicy cacao accord</strong>, develops into a <strong data-start=""1049"" data-end=""1081"">creamy almond-coumarin heart</strong>, and settles into a <strong data-start=""1102"" data-end=""1134"">luxurious tonka-vanilla base</strong> that feels smooth, cozy, and addictive.</p>
<p data-start=""1176"" data-end=""1334"">The fragrance delivers a delicious blend of <strong data-start=""1220"" data-end=""1275"">dark chocolate, roasted almonds, and creamy vanilla</strong>, making it ideal for those who enjoy rich gourmand scents.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""15kws0e"" data-start=""1336"" data-end=""1351"">🎯 Best For</h3>
<p data-start=""1353"" data-end=""1482"">✔️ Winter &amp; Cool Weather<br data-start=""1377"" data-end=""1380"">✔️ Evening Wear<br data-start=""1395"" data-end=""1398"">✔️ Date Nights<br data-start=""1412"" data-end=""1415"">✔️ Cozy Indoor Settings<br data-start=""1438"" data-end=""1441"">✔️ Lovers of Chocolate &amp; Tonka Fragrances</p>
<p data-start=""1484"" data-end=""1568"" data-is-last-node="""" data-is-only-node="""">🍫✨ <strong data-start=""1488"" data-end=""1568"" data-is-last-node="""">Tonquin Giza – a decadent journey through cacao, almond, and creamy vanilla.</strong></p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Rayhaan",true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,11,deny,manual,2799.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/TonquinGiza.png?v=1780658748,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,tonka; vanilla,rayhaan,,Oriental Vanilla,,,made-in-uae,,vanilla,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Rayhaan/Tonquin-Giza-122844.html,unisex,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,vanilla; sweet; almond; warm-spicy; aromatic,,bitter-almond; coumarin,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,spices; cacao,,,unisex,,,,,red,spray,spicy; vanilla,,,glass; paper; metal,special-occasion; everyday,gourmand; spicy; woody,,,liquid,winter,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
swiss-arabian-incense-01-50ml-extrait,Swiss Arabian Incense 01 50ml Extrait,"<p data-start=""0"" data-end=""165""><strong data-start=""0"" data-end=""115""><span class=""hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline""><span class=""whitespace-normal"">Swiss Arabian</span></span> Incense 01 50ml Extrait – Smoky Incense Meets Boozy Gourmand Luxury 🔥🍫✨</strong><br data-start=""115"" data-end=""118"">For Men &amp; Women | Oriental • Gourmand • Woody</p>
<p data-start=""167"" data-end=""419""><strong data-start=""167"" data-end=""195"">Swiss Arabian Incense 01</strong> is a rich and distinctive extrait de parfum that masterfully combines smoky incense, boozy accords, roasted nuts, and creamy woods. Deep, luxurious, and highly addictive, it offers a unique niche-style fragrance experience.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""68u3xr"" data-start=""421"" data-end=""443"">🌿 Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p data-start=""445"" data-end=""736""><strong data-start=""445"" data-end=""459"">Top Notes:</strong><br data-start=""459"" data-end=""462"">🔥 <strong data-start=""465"" data-end=""481"">Frankincense</strong> – Sacred smoky resin that creates a mysterious opening.<br data-start=""537"" data-end=""540"">🌲 <strong data-start=""543"" data-end=""554"">Juniper</strong> – Aromatic freshness adding brightness.<br data-start=""594"" data-end=""597"">🥃 <strong data-start=""600"" data-end=""607"">Rum</strong> – Warm boozy sweetness that feels rich and inviting.<br data-start=""660"" data-end=""663"">🍊 <strong data-start=""666"" data-end=""678"">Bergamot</strong> – A touch of citrus freshness balancing the darker notes.</p>
<p data-start=""738"" data-end=""991""><strong data-start=""738"" data-end=""755"">Middle Notes:</strong><br data-start=""755"" data-end=""758"">🍈 <strong data-start=""761"" data-end=""768"">Fig</strong> – Creamy fruity sweetness with a green nuance.<br data-start=""815"" data-end=""818"">🌰 <strong data-start=""821"" data-end=""856"">Hazelnut, Roasted Nuts &amp; Almond</strong> – Delicious gourmand richness adding warmth and texture.<br data-start=""913"" data-end=""916"">🌸 <strong data-start=""919"" data-end=""941"">Lily of the Valley</strong> – Soft floral touch that smooths the composition.</p>
<p data-start=""993"" data-end=""1354""><strong data-start=""993"" data-end=""1008"">Base Notes:</strong><br data-start=""1008"" data-end=""1011"">🔥 <strong data-start=""1014"" data-end=""1030"">Frankincense</strong> – Returns with deeper smoky resinous character.<br data-start=""1078"" data-end=""1081"">🍦 <strong data-start=""1084"" data-end=""1095"">Vanilla</strong> – Creamy sweetness softening the darker accords.<br data-start=""1144"" data-end=""1147"">🍫 <strong data-start=""1150"" data-end=""1168"">Dark Chocolate</strong> – Rich gourmand depth with a luxurious feel.<br data-start=""1213"" data-end=""1216"">🌲 <strong data-start=""1219"" data-end=""1245"">Sandalwood &amp; Cedarwood</strong> – Smooth woody warmth adding sophistication.<br data-start=""1290"" data-end=""1293"">🌿 <strong data-start=""1296"" data-end=""1304"">Moss</strong> – Earthy green finish that grounds the fragrance.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""11ro6m1"" data-start=""1356"" data-end=""1382"">✨ Fragrance Experience</h3>
<p data-start=""1384"" data-end=""1630"">Incense 01 opens with a <strong data-start=""1408"" data-end=""1453"">smoky-boozy blend of frankincense and rum</strong>, evolves into a <strong data-start=""1470"" data-end=""1508"">rich heart of fig and roasted nuts</strong>, and settles into a <strong data-start=""1529"" data-end=""1580"">dark chocolate, vanilla, and woody incense base</strong> that feels warm, sophisticated, and long-lasting.</p>
<p data-start=""1632"" data-end=""1768"">The fragrance delivers a perfect balance of <strong data-start=""1676"" data-end=""1730"">smoky resins, gourmand sweetness, and creamy woods</strong>, making it both unique and memorable.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""15kws0e"" data-start=""1770"" data-end=""1785"">🎯 Best For</h3>
<p data-start=""1787"" data-end=""1926"">✔️ Winter &amp; Cool Weather<br data-start=""1811"" data-end=""1814"">✔️ Evening Wear<br data-start=""1829"" data-end=""1832"">✔️ Special Occasions<br data-start=""1852"" data-end=""1855"">✔️ Niche Fragrance Enthusiasts<br data-start=""1885"" data-end=""1888"">✔️ Lovers of Incense &amp; Gourmand Scents</p>
