swiss-arabian-rose-01-50ml-extrait,Swiss Arabian Rose 01 50ml Extrait,"<p data-start=""0"" data-end=""150""><strong data-start=""0"" data-end=""110""><span class=""hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline""><span class=""whitespace-normal"">Swiss Arabian</span></span> Rose 01 50ml Extrait – Elegant Rose Luxury with Fruity Sweetness 🌹✨</strong><br data-start=""110"" data-end=""113"">For Women | Floral • Fruity • Musky</p>
<p data-start=""152"" data-end=""433""><strong data-start=""152"" data-end=""177"">Swiss Arabian Rose 01</strong> is a luxurious extrait de parfum inspired by the elegance of <strong data-start=""239"" data-end=""280""><span class=""hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline""><span class=""whitespace-normal"">Delina</span></span></strong>. It beautifully blends juicy fruits, exquisite roses, and a creamy musky base to create a fragrance that feels feminine, sophisticated, and captivating.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""68u3xr"" data-start=""435"" data-end=""457"">🌿 Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p data-start=""459"" data-end=""683""><strong data-start=""459"" data-end=""473"">Top Notes:</strong><br data-start=""473"" data-end=""476"">🍒 <strong data-start=""479"" data-end=""489"">Litchi</strong> – Juicy, sweet fruitiness that instantly captures attention.<br data-start=""550"" data-end=""553"">🍊 <strong data-start=""556"" data-end=""568"">Bergamot</strong> – Sparkling citrus freshness adding brightness.<br data-start=""616"" data-end=""619"">🌶️ <strong data-start=""623"" data-end=""638"">Pink Pepper</strong> – Delicate spice creating a vibrant opening.</p>
<p data-start=""685"" data-end=""929""><strong data-start=""685"" data-end=""702"">Middle Notes:</strong><br data-start=""702"" data-end=""705"">🌹 <strong data-start=""708"" data-end=""726"">Bulgarian Rose</strong> – Rich, velvety rose that forms the heart of the fragrance.<br data-start=""786"" data-end=""789"">🌸 <strong data-start=""792"" data-end=""801"">Peony</strong> – Soft floral elegance adding freshness and femininity.<br data-start=""857"" data-end=""860"">🌰 <strong data-start=""863"" data-end=""873"">Nutmeg</strong> – Warm spicy nuance enhancing depth and sophistication.</p>
<p data-start=""931"" data-end=""1155""><strong data-start=""931"" data-end=""946"">Base Notes:</strong><br data-start=""946"" data-end=""949"">🤍 <strong data-start=""952"" data-end=""960"">Musk</strong> – Soft sensuality that lingers beautifully on the skin.<br data-start=""1016"" data-end=""1019"">🍦 <strong data-start=""1022"" data-end=""1033"">Vanilla</strong> – Creamy sweetness adding warmth and comfort.<br data-start=""1079"" data-end=""1082"">🪵 <strong data-start=""1085"" data-end=""1098"">Cashmeran</strong> – Smooth woody-musky accord creating a luxurious finish.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""11ro6m1"" data-start=""1157"" data-end=""1183"">✨ Fragrance Experience</h3>
<p data-start=""1185"" data-end=""1402"">Rose 01 opens with a <strong data-start=""1206"" data-end=""1266"">sparkling blend of juicy litchi, citrus, and pink pepper</strong>, blossoms into a <strong data-start=""1284"" data-end=""1332"">romantic bouquet of Bulgarian rose and peony</strong>, and settles into a <strong data-start=""1353"" data-end=""1379"">soft vanilla-musk base</strong> with creamy cashmeran.</p>
<p data-start=""1404"" data-end=""1501"">The result is a fragrance that feels <strong data-start=""1441"" data-end=""1500"">elegant, feminine, romantic, and effortlessly luxurious</strong>.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""15kws0e"" data-start=""1503"" data-end=""1518"">🎯 Best For</h3>
