<p data-start=""1043"" data-end=""1374""><strong data-start=""1043"" data-end=""1058"">Base Notes:</strong><br data-start=""1058"" data-end=""1061"">🍦 <strong data-start=""1064"" data-end=""1075"">Vanilla</strong> – Rich creamy sweetness that lingers beautifully.<br data-start=""1125"" data-end=""1128"">🤍 <strong data-start=""1131"" data-end=""1139"">Musk</strong> – Soft sensual finish that enhances longevity.<br data-start=""1186"" data-end=""1189"">🍮 <strong data-start=""1192"" data-end=""1206"">Tonka Bean</strong> – Warm sweet depth with a gourmand feel.<br data-start=""1247"" data-end=""1250"">🌿 <strong data-start=""1253"" data-end=""1266"">Patchouli</strong> – Earthy richness providing contrast.<br data-start=""1304"" data-end=""1307"">🔥 <strong data-start=""1310"" data-end=""1325"">Peru Balsam</strong> – Smooth balsamic warmth adding luxurious depth.</p>
