swiss-arabian-patchouli-01-50ml-extrait,Swiss Arabian Patchouli 01 50ml Extrait,"<p><strong>Swiss Arabian Patchouli 01 50ml Extrait – Fresh Fruity Aromatics with Rich Patchouli Woods 🌿🍍✨</strong><br>For Men &amp; Women | Fresh • Woody • Patchouli</p>
<p><strong>Swiss Arabian Patchouli 01</strong> is a sophisticated unisex fragrance that blends sparkling citrus, aromatic herbs, juicy fruits, and a luxurious patchouli-driven base. Fresh yet deep, it offers a modern niche-style composition with excellent versatility.</p>
<h3>🌿 Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong><br>🌶️ <strong>Pink Pepper &amp; Cardamom</strong> – Warm spices adding vibrancy and character.<br>🍊 <strong>Bergamot &amp; Grapefruit</strong> – Bright citrus freshness with an energetic feel.<br>🌿 <strong>Lavender</strong> – Clean aromatic elegance.<br>🫐 <strong>Blackcurrant</strong> – Fruity sweetness with a slightly tart edge.<br>🌊 <strong>Aquatic Notes</strong> – Fresh watery accords enhancing the airy opening.</p>
<p><strong>Middle Notes:</strong><br>🍍 <strong>Pineapple</strong> – Juicy tropical sweetness adding brightness.<br>🌸 <strong>Orange Blossom &amp; Lily of the Valley</strong> – Soft floral elegance.<br>🌿 <strong>Mint</strong> – Refreshing green freshness.<br>🌱 <strong>Geranium &amp; Elemi</strong> – Aromatic and resinous depth that enriches the heart.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong><br>🌿 <strong>Patchouli</strong> – Deep earthy richness and the star of the fragrance.<br>🪵 <strong>Cashmere Wood &amp; Oak</strong> – Smooth woody warmth with a refined character.<br>🍦 <strong>Tonka Bean &amp; Vanilla</strong> – Creamy sweetness softening the composition.<br>🔥 <strong>Labdanum &amp; Olibanum</strong> – Resinous amber-like richness adding depth and longevity.</p>
<h3>✨ Fragrance Experience</h3>
<p>Patchouli 01 opens with a <strong>fresh citrus-spicy burst</strong>, develops into a <strong>fruity aromatic heart</strong>, and settles into a <strong>rich patchouli-woody base</strong> enhanced by creamy vanilla and warm resins.</p>
<h3>🎯 Best For</h3>
<p>✔️ Daily Wear<br>✔️ Office &amp; Professional Settings<br>✔️ Evening Outings<br>✔️ Spring, Autumn &amp; Winter<br>✔️ Lovers of modern patchouli-based fragrances</p>
<p>🌿✨ <strong>Patchouli 01 – fresh sophistication wrapped in rich patchouli elegance.</strong></p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"",Full,true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,4949.00,,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/SwissArabianPatchouli01.png?v=1780648612,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,patchouli; cashmere-wood; tonka; labdanum; olibanum; vanilla; oak,swiss-arabian,,Oriental Woody,,,made-in-uae,,aromatic; woody; spicy,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Swiss-Arabian/Patchouli-01-125829.html,unisex,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,aromatic; woody; fresh-spicy; citrus; amber,,pineapple; orange-blossom; mint; geranium; elemi; lily-of-the-valley,,,,,,,,,,,,,new-arrival,,pink-pepper-1; bergamot; cardamom; lavender; black-currant; aquatic-1,,,unisex,,,adults,,,spray,,,,glass; plastic,,,,,liquid,,unisex,,,,,,,kg,,,active
