rayhaan-nocturno-elixir-100ml,Rayhaan Nocturno Elixir 100ML EDP,"<p data-start=""0"" data-end=""327"">Discover the fresh yet mysterious charm of Rayhaan Nocturno Elixir 100ML EDP For Men — a sophisticated fragrance crafted for men who thrive after dark. Smooth, aromatic, and effortlessly masculine, this scent balances vibrant freshness with woody elegance, making it perfect for both everyday confidence and evening allure. 🌙✨</p>
<h5 data-section-id=""qnxdsc"" data-start=""329"" data-end=""348"">Fragrance Notes</h5>
<p data-start=""350"" data-end=""596""><strong data-start=""350"" data-end=""364"">Top Notes:</strong> Lemon Zest, Artemisia, Bergamot, Mint<br data-start=""402"" data-end=""405"">The fragrance opens with a refreshing burst of citrusy Lemon Zest and Bergamot, uplifted by cool Mint and the aromatic green touch of Artemisia for an energetic and invigorating start. 🍋🌿❄️</p>
<p data-start=""598"" data-end=""834""><strong data-start=""598"" data-end=""615"">Middle Notes:</strong> Geranium, Lavender, Pineapple<br data-start=""645"" data-end=""648"">At the heart, elegant Lavender and Geranium bring a clean aromatic sophistication, while juicy Pineapple adds a subtle fruity sweetness that enhances the fragrance’s modern appeal. 🌸🍍✨</p>
<p data-start=""836"" data-end=""1027""><strong data-start=""836"" data-end=""850"">Base Note:</strong> Sandalwood<br data-start=""861"" data-end=""864"">The dry-down settles into smooth and creamy Sandalwood, leaving behind a warm, refined, and long-lasting woody trail that feels both comforting and seductive. 🌲🤍</p>
<p data-start=""1029"" data-end=""1234"" data-is-last-node="""" data-is-only-node="""">Perfect for daily wear, evening outings, office settings, and casual special occasions, Rayhaan Nocturno Elixir is made for the modern man who values freshness, elegance, and understated sophistication. 🌟</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Rayhaan",true,Title,Default Title,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,5,deny,manual,2799.00,4500.00,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/NocturnoElixir1.png?v=1780641835,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,sandalwood,rayhaan,,,,,inspired-by-bleu-de-chanel-l-exclusif-by-chanel,,aromatic; spicy,,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,aromatic; fresh-spicy; herbal; citrus; woody,,geranium; lavender; pineapple,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,lemon-zest; artemisia; bergamot; mint,,,for-men,,,,,black,spray,,,,glass; plastic,,,,,liquid,,male,,,,,,,kg,,,active
