naseem-azura-aqua-90ml-parfum,Naseem Azura Aqua 90ML Parfum,"<h4 data-start=""0"" data-end=""163"">
<strong>Naseem Azura Aqua 90ML Parfum  – Crisp Citrus Freshness with Clean Musky Vibes 🌊🍏✨</strong><br data-start=""118"" data-end=""121""><strong>For Men &amp; Women | Fresh • Citrus • Musky</strong>
</h4>
<p data-start=""165"" data-end=""387"">Naseem Azura Aqua is a refreshing and energetic unisex fragrance that combines sparkling citrus fruits with aromatic lavender and a clean musky finish. Light, modern, and versatile, it’s perfect for everyday freshness.</p>
<h6 data-section-id=""1hd3x4f"" data-start=""389"" data-end=""413"">🌿<strong> Fragrance Notes</strong>
</h6>
<p data-start=""415"" data-end=""586""><strong>Top Notes:</strong><br data-start=""429"" data-end=""432"">🍊 Grapefruit &amp; Lemon Zest – Bright citrus burst that feels crisp and uplifting.<br data-start=""516"" data-end=""519"">🍏 Green Apple – Juicy fruity freshness adding a vibrant touch.</p>
<p data-start=""588"" data-end=""739""><strong data-start=""588"" data-end=""605"">Middle Notes:</strong><br data-start=""605"" data-end=""608"">🌿 Lavender – Smooth aromatic freshness with a calming feel.<br data-start=""672"" data-end=""675"">🌱 Vetiver – Fresh earthy-woody depth adding sophistication.</p>
<p data-start=""741"" data-end=""829""><strong data-start=""741"" data-end=""756"">Base Notes:</strong><br data-start=""756"" data-end=""759"">🤍 Musk – Clean, soft finish that lingers beautifully on the skin.</p>
<p data-start=""831"" data-end=""999"">Azura Aqua opens with a zesty citrus-fruity burst, develops into a fresh aromatic heart, and settles into a clean musky base that feels airy and refreshing.</p>
<p data-start=""1001"" data-end=""1149"">Perfect for summer, gym, office, daily wear, and daytime outings, it suits those who enjoy clean fresh fragrances with a crisp aquatic vibe.</p>
<p data-start=""1151"" data-end=""1204"">🌊✨ Azura Aqua – pure freshness in every spray.</p>
