<p data-start=""166"" data-end=""354""><strong data-start=""166"" data-end=""186"">Naseem Heat Wave</strong> is a bold, energetic unisex fragrance that combines sharp spices, fresh citrus, and a smooth woody-amber base. It feels dynamic, modern, and powerful—built for impact.</p>
