<p data-start=""382"" data-end=""610""><strong data-start=""382"" data-end=""396"">Top Notes:</strong><br data-start=""396"" data-end=""399"">🌶️ Black Pepper – Sharp spicy opening that grabs attention.<br data-start=""463"" data-end=""466"">🌿 Elemi – Resinous freshness adding brightness and depth.<br data-start=""528"" data-end=""531"">🍊 Bergamot &amp; Grapefruit – Zesty citrus duo giving a fresh, energetic lift.</p>
