naseem-candlelight-in-december-parfum-80ml,Naseem Candlelight In December Parfum 80ML,"<p data-start=""0"" data-end=""180""><strong><span class=""hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline""><span class=""whitespace-normal"">Naseem</span></span> Candlelight In December Parfum 80ML – Soft Citrus Floral Warmth with Cozy Winter Woods 🕯️❄️✨</strong><br data-start=""135"" data-end=""138"">For Men &amp; Women | Floral • Sweet • Woody</p>
<p data-start=""182"" data-end=""398"">Naseem Candlelight In December is a warm, elegant unisex fragrance that blends bright citrus, soft florals, and a creamy woody-vanilla base. It feels cozy, romantic, and slightly powdery—perfect for winter moods.</p>
<h6 data-section-id=""1hd3x4f"" data-start=""400"" data-end=""424"">🌿 Fragrance Notes</h6>
<p data-start=""426"" data-end=""593""><strong data-start=""426"" data-end=""440"">Top Notes:</strong><br data-start=""440"" data-end=""443"">🍊 Bergamot &amp; Mandarin – Fresh citrus opening that feels bright and uplifting.<br data-start=""525"" data-end=""528"">🌿 Lavandin – Clean aromatic freshness adding smooth balance.</p>
<p data-start=""595"" data-end=""830""><strong data-start=""595"" data-end=""612"">Middle Notes:</strong><br data-start=""612"" data-end=""615"">🌸 Orange Blossom &amp; Jasmine – Soft floral heart with elegant sweetness.<br data-start=""690"" data-end=""693"">🍑 Peach Blossom – Fruity-floral softness adding a delicate charm.<br data-start=""763"" data-end=""766"">🌸 Heliotrope – Powdery, slightly almond-like floral warmth.</p>
<p data-start=""832"" data-end=""1052""><strong data-start=""832"" data-end=""847"">Base Notes:</strong><br data-start=""847"" data-end=""850"">🌿 Patchouli – Earthy depth grounding the sweetness.<br data-start=""906"" data-end=""909"">🍦 Vanilla – Creamy warmth adding comfort and softness.<br data-start=""968"" data-end=""971"">🌲 Sandalwood &amp; Vetiver – Smooth woody finish giving structure and longevity.</p>
<p data-start=""1054"" data-end=""1256"">Candlelight In December opens with a fresh citrus-aromatic glow, melts into a soft floral-powdery heart, and settles into a warm creamy woody base that feels cozy, elegant, and long-lasting.</p>
<p data-start=""1258"" data-end=""1422"">Perfect for winter evenings, romantic wear, gatherings, and cozy daily use, it suits those who enjoy soft floral fragrances with warm vanilla-woody comfort.</p>
<p data-start=""1424"" data-end=""1479"" data-is-last-node="""" data-is-only-node="""">🕯️✨ <strong data-start=""1429"" data-end=""1479"" data-is-last-node="""">Candlelight In December – warmth you can wear.</strong></p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Naseem",true,Size,80ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1999.00,2000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Candlelight_In_December_Naseem.png?v=1780634224,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,patchouli; vanilla; sandalwood; vetiver,,,,,,made-in-uae,,floral; citrus,,unisex,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,floral; citrus; sweet; woody; aromatic,,orange-blossom-1; jasmine; peach; heliotrope,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,bergamot; lavender; mandarin,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
ajmal-dakhoon-almas-bakhoor-200-gms,Ajmal Dakhoon Almas Bakhoor 200 GMS,"<p data-start=""0"" data-end=""171""><strong data-start=""0"" data-end=""123""><span class=""hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline""><span class=""whitespace-normal"">Ajmal</span></span> Dakhoon Almas Bakhoor 200 GMS – Luxurious Smoky Floral Amber Home Fragrance 🌿🔥✨</strong><br data-start=""123"" data-end=""126"">For Home Use | Floral • Amber • Woody-Smoke</p>
<p data-start=""173"" data-end=""411"">Ajmal Dakhoon Almas Bakhoor is a rich traditional Arabic incense that transforms your space with a warm, elegant and long-lasting aroma. It blends soft florals with resinous amber and deep smoky woods for a truly luxurious atmosphere.</p>
<h6 data-section-id=""1hd3x4f"" data-start=""413"" data-end=""437"">🌿 Fragrance Notes</h6>
<p data-start=""439"" data-end=""618""><strong data-start=""439"" data-end=""453"">Top Notes:</strong><br data-start=""453"" data-end=""456"">🌸 Fresh Floral Accords – Light, airy floral freshness that gently opens the scent.<br data-start=""543"" data-end=""546"">🍯 Light Sweetness – Subtle sweetness that adds softness and warmth.</p>
<p data-start=""620"" data-end=""782""><strong data-start=""620"" data-end=""637"">Middle Notes:</strong><br data-start=""637"" data-end=""640"">🔥 Resinous Accords – Deep aromatic richness that builds intensity.<br data-start=""711"" data-end=""714"">✨ Amber – Warm golden sweetness creating a cozy, luxurious feel.</p>
<p data-start=""784"" data-end=""981""><strong data-start=""784"" data-end=""799"">Base Notes:</strong><br data-start=""799"" data-end=""802"">🌳 Deep Woody Notes – Strong earthy foundation for long-lasting depth.<br data-start=""876"" data-end=""879"">🌫️ Smoky Accords – Traditional bakhoor-style smoke that fills the space with richness and warmth.</p>
<p data-start=""983"" data-end=""1164"">Dakhoon Almas opens with a soft floral-sweet aroma, develops into a warm amber-resin heart, and settles into a deep smoky woody base that lingers beautifully in the air.</p>
<p data-start=""1166"" data-end=""1328"">Perfect for home, majlis, special gatherings, and spiritual ambiance, it suits those who enjoy traditional Arabic bakhoor with a refined, luxurious touch.</p>
<p data-start=""1330"" data-end=""1406"" data-is-last-node="""" data-is-only-node="""">🌿🔥 <strong data-start=""1335"" data-end=""1406"" data-is-last-node="""">Dakhoon Almas – elevate your space with timeless Arabian fragrance.</strong></p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Ajmal, Bakhoor, Full",true,Size,200gm,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,949.00,1200.00,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/DAKHOONRAASHID_200GMS_3.webp?v=1779820410,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,woody; smoke,ajmal,,,bakhoor,,ajmal; made-in-uae,,,,,,,,floral; amber; woody; smoky,,amber,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,floral,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
rayhaan-wolf-100ml-edp,Rayhaan Wolf 100ml EDP,"<p data-start=""0"" data-end=""153""><strong data-start=""0"" data-end=""116""><span class=""hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline""><span class=""whitespace-normal"">Rayhaan</span></span> Wolf 100ml EDP – Addictive Cardamom &amp; Toffee with Powerful Amberwood 🐺🔥✨</strong><br data-start=""116"" data-end=""119"">For Men | Sweet • Spicy • Ambery</p>
<p data-start=""155"" data-end=""446""><strong data-start=""155"" data-end=""171"">Rayhaan Wolf</strong> is a bold, charismatic fragrance inspired by the vibe of <strong data-start=""229"" data-end=""270""><span class=""hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline""><span class=""whitespace-normal"">The Most Wanted</span></span></strong>. Built around a simple yet highly addictive blend of spicy cardamom, rich toffee, and warm amberwood, it delivers a modern scent that is both seductive and attention-grabbing.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""68u3xr"" data-start=""448"" data-end=""470"">🌿 Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p data-start=""472"" data-end=""574""><strong data-start=""472"" data-end=""485"">Top Note:</strong><br data-start=""485"" data-end=""488"">🌶️ <strong data-start=""492"" data-end=""504"">Cardamom</strong> – Fresh, aromatic spice that creates a vibrant and masculine opening.</p>
<p data-start=""576"" data-end=""691""><strong data-start=""576"" data-end=""592"">Middle Note:</strong><br data-start=""592"" data-end=""595"">🍬 <strong data-start=""598"" data-end=""608"">Toffee</strong> – Rich caramel-like sweetness that adds warmth and an irresistible gourmand touch.</p>
<p data-start=""693"" data-end=""813""><strong data-start=""693"" data-end=""707"">Base Note:</strong><br data-start=""707"" data-end=""710"">🔥 <strong data-start=""713"" data-end=""726"">Amberwood</strong> – Deep woody amber accord that provides strength, projection, and lasting performance.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""11ro6m1"" data-start=""815"" data-end=""841"">✨ Fragrance Experience</h3>
<p data-start=""843"" data-end=""1062"">Wolf opens with a <strong data-start=""861"" data-end=""888"">burst of spicy cardamom</strong>, quickly revealing a <strong data-start=""910"" data-end=""941"">smooth, creamy toffee heart</strong>. As it dries down, the fragrance becomes <strong data-start=""983"" data-end=""1018"">warm, woody, and slightly sweet</strong>, leaving behind a powerful amberwood trail.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""15kws0e"" data-start=""1064"" data-end=""1079"">🎯 Best For</h3>
