swiss-arabian-shaghaf-75ml-edp,Swiss Arabian Shaghaf 75ml EDP,"<p>Shaghaf Women by Swiss Arabian is a Floral Fruity Gourmand fragrance for women. Shaghaf opens with invigorating lime and lemon, just like her zest for life. The fresh citrus notes lead you down a path towards a sweet floral heart. Notes of sweet praline melt into pretty pink peony petals and crisp, fresh apple. Shaghaf has an irresistible and long-lasting base accord that gently swathes you in sensual musk and cedarwood, bringing out your inner glow.</p>

<p>Top notes are Lime and Lemon</p>

<p>Middle notes are Praline, Apple and Peony</p>

