nike-up-or-down-75ml-edt,Nike Up Or Down 75ml EDT,"<p>Nike Up or Down Men 75ml EDT – Elevate Your Aura! 🌟</p>

<p>Step into a world of confidence and energy with Nike Up or Down Men, a long-lasting Eau de Toilette crafted for the modern man. This dynamic fragrance strikes the perfect balance between boldness and sophistication, making it an ideal companion for any occasion.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Artemisia, Kalamansi, Salvia Sclarea, Ginger Root<br>
(A vibrant fusion of zesty and herbal accords that invigorates your senses with a fresh and uplifting start.)<br>
Middle Notes: Musk, Hedione, Cardamom, Tiare Flower<br>
(A warm and spicy heart enriched with subtle floral nuances, creating a balanced and charismatic core.)<br>
Base Notes: Amber, Vetiver, Cedar Leaves, Palissander Wood<br>
(A seductive blend of earthy and woody tones, leaving a lingering impression of depth and masculinity.)</p>

<p>Perfect for day-to-night transitions, this fragrance enhances your presence with its powerful yet elegant aura. Whether conquering challenges at work or enjoying a night out, Nike Up or Down Men ensures you stay confident and unforgettable.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Daily Wear, Full, Long Lasting Perfume, men, Nike, Office Perfume",true,Size,75ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1599.00,1500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Nike-up-or-down-woman.webp?v=1780379714,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
