Crafted in the UAE, this fragrance is a delightful gourmand fantasy, balancing creamy sweetness with sheer sophistication. Perfect for cozy evenings or uplifting daytime wear, it wraps you in a deliciously addictive aura. Wear it, and let your presence be as irresistible as dessert itself. 🍯💛",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Paris Corner",false,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,2849.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,,,,false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,draft
al-rehab-french-coffee-100ml-edp,Al Rehab French Coffee 100ml EDP,"<p>Indulge in the captivating and aromatic world of Al Rehab French Coffee Eau de Parfum, a delightful olfactory masterpiece that knows no gender boundaries. This 100ml fragrance transcends conventional norms, presenting a symphony of scents that enchant both men and women alike. Crafted with precision and passion, this long-lasting perfume becomes a sensory adventure, skillfully blending the finest elements to evoke the essence of a French coffeehouse.</p>

<p>At the heart of this exquisite creation lies the essence of Coffee itself, its rich and robust aroma wafting through the senses like a warm morning brew. The intoxicating allure of Vanilla and the sweet temptation of Caramel intertwine, lending an irresistibly smooth and creamy character to the composition. Notes of Milk and Sugar further enhance the comforting embrace, evoking memories of cozy moments shared over a cup of coffee.</p>

<p>A delightful twist of Cacao adds a subtle touch of bittersweet charm, adding depth and complexity to the fragrance. Completing the symphony is the subtle warmth of Cinnamon, sprinkling a hint of spice that infuses the air with a touch of sensual allure.</p>

<p>Al Rehab French Coffee is a remarkable fragrance that holds the power to transport you to a bustling café on the streets of Paris, its delectable aroma mingling with the laughter and chatter of locals and travelers alike. Perfect for coffee enthusiasts, this fragrance captivates the senses, enveloping you in its delightful essence throughout the day.</p>

<p>Whether you're a man or a woman, if you crave the rich aroma of coffee and desire a long-lasting fragrance experience, Al Rehab French Coffee is an enchanting and unique choice that will undoubtedly leave a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>Main Notes: Coffee, Vanilla, Caramel, Milk, Sugar, Cacao, Cinnamon</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Al Rehab, Date Night Picks, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1499.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Al-Rehab-French-Coffee-100ml-EDP.png?v=1779880586,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,sandalwood; woody; rose,al-rehab,,,edp,,made-in-uae,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/ALREHAB-PERFUMES/Choco-Musk-Eau-de-Parfum-88083.html,unisex,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,vanilla; warm-spicy; chocolate; powdery; sweet,,spices; amber; cinnamon,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,vanilla; chocolate; musk,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
al-rehab-choco-musk-50ml-edp,Al Rehab Choco Musk 50ml EDP,"<p>Al Rehab Choco Musk, presented in a 50ml Eau de Parfum for both women and men, is an olfactory masterpiece that unveils the delectable allure of chocolate in a remarkably enduring fragrance experience. This scent is more than just a perfume; it's an aromatic journey into the world of rich cocoa and sensual vanilla, skillfully crafted to captivate the senses for an extended period.</p>

<p>Opening with a burst of white musk, the top notes immediately set a velvety backdrop. The heart of Choco Musk unveils a symphony of milk chocolate and vanilla, creating a luscious and indulgent core. Cinnamon and a touch of rose add a subtle hint of spice and floral elegance, while the warm embrace of sandalwood and amber forms a sophisticated base. The interplay of these notes results in a fragrance that is sweet, alluring, and irresistibly rich.</p>

<p>Choco Musk isn't just a scent; it's an olfactory delight that lingers throughout the day, making it perfect for those who seek a long-lasting and enchanting chocolate-based perfume. As you embrace the day, the fragrance evolves, revealing different facets of its character with each passing hour.</p>

<p>This fragrance is not just an ordinary creation; it's a brilliant alternative to the opulent Chocolate Greedy by Montale, offering an affordable yet equally luxurious olfactory experience. Choco Musk by Al Rehab is the embodiment of sophistication and sweetness, a unisex fragrance that transcends gender boundaries to envelop the wearer in a cloud of delicious allure.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Al Rehab, Full, New Arrivals",true,Size,50ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,949.00,1500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Choco-musk-perfume.png?v=1779880585,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,musky,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
al-rehab-choco-musk-100ml-edp,Al Rehab Choco Musk 100ml EDP,"Al Rehab Choco Musk 100ml EDP – Sweet Chocolate Vanilla with Warm Musky Spice 🍫✨For Men &amp; Women | Gourmand • Sweet • Musky
Al Rehab Choco Musk is a deliciously comforting unisex fragrance that blends creamy chocolate and vanilla with soft musk and warm spices. Cozy, addictive, and long-lasting, it’s perfect for those who love sweet gourmand scents with a smooth woody finish.

🌿 Fragrance Notes
Top Notes:🍫 Chocolate &amp; Vanilla – A rich, creamy opening that feels warm, sweet, and indulgent.
Heart Notes:🤍 Musk – Clean softness that balances the sweetness.🌶️ Cinnamon &amp; Spices – Warm spicy notes adding depth and coziness.
Base Notes:🌳 Sandalwood &amp; Oriental Woody Notes – Smooth woody warmth that grounds the fragrance.🌹 Rose – A subtle floral touch that adds elegance and balance.
Choco Musk opens with a sweet gourmand burst, transitions into a warm musky-spicy heart, and settles into a soft woody-floral base that lingers beautifully.
Perfect for daily wear, winter, cozy evenings, and casual outings, it suits those who enjoy sweet dessert-like fragrances with a warm comforting vibe.
🍫✨ Choco Musk – sweet, cozy, and irresistibly comforting.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Al Rehab, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,7,deny,manual,1649.00,2200.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Al-Rehab-Choco-Musk.png?v=1779880583,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,musky,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
yves-saint-laurent-y-eau-de-parfum-100ml,Yves Saint Laurent Y Eau De Parfum 100ml,"<p>Yves Saint Laurent Y Eau De Parfum 100ml – The Iconic Blue Seduction 💙<br>
Y Eau De Parfum by Yves Saint Laurent is the definition of modern masculinity — bold, confident, and irresistibly sexy. Designed for the man who dares to chase his dreams, this long-lasting blue fragrance exudes freshness with a seductive edge that lingers through the day and night. ✨<br>
Fragrance Notes:Top Notes: Apple, Ginger, Bergamot(A vibrant fusion that opens with a crisp, energetic freshness, sparking instant attraction.) 🍏🌿<br>
Middle Notes: Sage, Juniper Berries, Geranium(Aromatic and slightly spicy heart that adds depth and magnetic sophistication.) 🌸🔥<br>
Base Notes: Amberwood, Tonka Bean, Cedar, Vetiver, Olibanum(A warm, woody base that wraps the skin in sensual intensity and masculine charm.) 🌲💫<br>
Perfect for evenings, parties, or any moment you want to stand out — YSL Y EDP is more than just a fragrance; it’s a statement of power and allure. In India, it has earned a cult status among men who love strong, sexy, and luxurious designer scents that last. One spray, and you’re unforgettable. 💎</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Men, Yves Saint Laurent",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,10999.00,12000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Yves-Saint-Laurent-Y-Eau-De-Parfum.png?v=1779880582,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
yves-saint-laurent-y-100ml-edt,Yves Saint Laurent Y 100ml EDT,"<p>Yves Saint Laurent Y EDT 100ml For Men – Clean Confidence, Modern Masculinity ⚡✨Fresh • Aromatic • Versatile<br>
Yves Saint Laurent Y Eau de Toilette is a crisp and energetic fragrance designed for the modern man who is driven, confident, and effortlessly stylish. Fresh yet refined, this scent blends aromatic herbs with smooth woods, making it a perfect everyday signature for work, casual wear, and beyond.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes ✨<br>
