Middle Notes: Lavender, Clary Sage, Geranium 🌿💐The heart is aromatic and masculine. Lavender brings a classic clean feel, clary sage adds herbal depth, and geranium introduces a refined green-floral nuance that keeps the scent modern and balanced.<br>
Base Notes: Ambergris, Cedar, Vanilla, Olibanum 🪵🤍The base is smooth and comforting. Cedarwood adds structure and warmth, ambergris enhances freshness and longevity, vanilla softens the dry-down, and olibanum provides a subtle resinous elegance.<br>
Ideal for daily wear, office use, spring and summer, Y EDT is perfect for men who prefer fresh, clean, and versatile fragrances with a confident yet understated presence.<br>
✨ Simple. Sharp. Timeless. YSL Y EDT is freshness done right.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Full, Men, Yves Saint Laurent",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,8699.00,10000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Y_EDT.webp?v=1780379864,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
yves-saint-laurent-opium-90ml-edt,Yves Saint Laurent Opium 90ml EDT,"<p>Yves Saint Laurent Opium EDT 90ml For Men – Exotic Mystery, Timeless Seduction 🔥✨Warm • Spicy • Iconic<br>
