viktor-rolf-spicebomb-extreme-90ml-eau-de-parfum,Viktor & Rolf Spicebomb Extreme 90ml Eau De Parfum,"Viktor &amp; Rolf Spicebomb Extreme 90ml Eau De Parfum: Unleashing the Pinnacle of Long-Lasting Luxury

Dive into the world of unparalleled elegance with Viktor &amp; Rolf Spicebomb Extreme, a true masterpiece in the realm of fragrances. Specifically curated for the vibrant and diverse climate of India, this 90ml Eau De Parfum is designed to be a fragrance powerhouse, enduring even the most demanding weather conditions.

Beast Mode Longevity: Viktor &amp; Rolf Spicebomb Extreme stands out as a beacon of enduring allure. Its unparalleled longevity ensures you stay enveloped in its captivating essence from dawn to dusk. Step confidently through your day, leaving an everlasting impression that transcends time.

Fragrance Notes Unveiled:

Top Notes: The journey begins with a burst of freshness, as grapefruit, pimento, and black pepper unite to create a vibrant and invigorating introduction. Feel the zesty allure that sets the stage for what lies ahead.
Middle Notes: The heart of Spicebomb Extreme unveils a rich tapestry of cinnamon, cumin, and saffron. This aromatic blend adds depth and complexity, creating a warm and enticing core that resonates with sophistication.
Base Notes: The grand finale is a symphony of sensuality, where tobacco, amber, vanilla, and cistus merge to craft a lingering trail of opulence. Embrace the lingering warmth and richness that defines the essence of Viktor &amp; Rolf Spicebomb Extreme.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Date Night Picks, Full, men, Party Collection, Viktor & Rolf",true,Size,90ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,8499.00,12900.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rolf-Spicebomb-Extreme.png?v=1779880513,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,spicy,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
versace-eros-100ml-eau-de-toilette,Versace Eros 100ml Eau De Toilette,"<p>Versace Eros Perfume</p>

<p>Indulge in the captivating allure of Versace Eros, a fragrance that embodies passion, seduction, and strength. This sensual fragrance, created for both men and women, reveals a symphony of invigorating notes crafted to leave a lasting impression.</p>

<p>Top Notes: The fragrance opens with a burst of zesty Italian lemon and mandarin, infusing a vibrant and fresh energy. Delicate hints of mint oil add a cool and refreshing touch, while the tantalizing scent of candied apple brings a sweet and irresistible allure.</p>

<p>Heart Notes: At the heart of Versace Eros lies a bouquet of enchanting floral essences. The delicate geranium flower blooms gracefully, intertwining with the aromatic clary sage essence. These ingredients evoke a sense of elegance and intrigue, while the rich and warm ambermax note adds depth and sensuality to the fragrance.</p>

<p>Base Notes: The base notes of Versace Eros provide a strong and lasting foundation. The blend of Cedarwood Atlas and Virginia creates a woody and earthy aroma that exudes confidence and power. The essence of vetiver orpur adds a touch of smokiness, while the patchouli coeur orpour essence enhances the depth and complexity of the fragrance. A touch of sandalwood brings a creamy and creamy undertone, while the sweet and comforting scent of vanilla wraps the composition in a warm and seductive embrace.</p>

<p>Versace Eros is a captivating fragrance that effortlessly blends citrusy freshness, floral elegance, and woody sensuality. It epitomizes the essence of desire and allure, making it a perfect choice for those seeking a fragrance that leaves an unforgettable impression.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Date Night Picks, Designer Perfume, Full, men, Versace",false,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,6650.00,8100.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Versace-Eros-100Ml-Eau-De-Toilette.png?v=1779880511,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,draft
versace-eros-100ml-edp,Versace Eros 100ml EDP,"<p>Versace Eros 100ml Eau de Parfum For Men: A Symphony of Irresistible Seduction</p>

<p>Indulge in the essence of modern masculinity with Versace Eros Eau de Parfum. This 100ml masterpiece is a celebration of strength, passion, and sophistication. Crafted to captivate, Eros weaves an aromatic tale that resonates with the confident spirit of the contemporary man.</p>

<p>Refreshing Top Notes: The fragrance opens with a burst of freshness, where invigorating notes of mint, candy apple, lemon, and mandarin orange dance together, creating an energetic and vibrant symphony that sets the stage for the olfactory journey ahead.</p>

<p>Heart of Seduction: As the scent unfolds, the middle notes reveal a captivating blend of ambroxan, geranium, and clary sage. This heart of Eros adds depth and complexity, embodying the magnetic allure that draws others closer, leaving an indelible mark.</p>

<p>Sensual Base Notes: The grand finale is a harmonious union of vanilla, cedar, sandalwood, bitter orange, patchouli, and leather. These base notes ground the fragrance in a warm and sensual embrace, leaving a lingering trail of sophistication and masculinity.</p>

