Base Notes: The allure of Versace Red Jeans is anchored by a warm and sensual base, where musk, vanilla, and sandalwood cast a lingering spell of sophistication and allure. Bask in the comforting embrace of creamy vanilla and velvety sandalwood, as the scent gracefully fades into the skin, leaving a trail of irresistible allure.</p>

