united-colors-of-benetton-we-are-tribe-90ml-edt,United Colors Of Benetton We Are Tribe 90ml EDT,"<p>United Colors of Benetton We Are Tribe 90ml EDT for Men – The Essence of Modern Charisma ✨<br>
Step into a world of confidence and adventure with We Are Tribe, a fragrance crafted for the man who dares to lead. This dynamic Eau de Toilette, made in the UAE, blends zesty freshness with sensual depth, evoking an aura of irresistible charm. Inspired by King of Seduction Absolute by Antonio Banderas, it is a statement of power, elegance, and bold masculinity.<br>
Fragrance Notes:<br>
Top Notes: Kumquat, Grapefruit, Pink Pepper 🍊🌶️(A vibrant fusion of citrus and spice introduces the scent with an invigorating energy, exuding freshness and excitement.)</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Lemon Verbena, Lavender, Tonka Bean 🌿💜(The aromatic depth of lavender and lemon verbena balances the fragrance with a refined yet comforting warmth.)</p>

<p>Base Notes: Vetiver, Cypriol Oil (Nagarmotha), Amber 🌾🔥(A seductive blend of woody vetiver, smoky nagarmotha, and golden amber delivers a lingering, magnetic finish.)<br>
