udv-100ml-edt,UDV 100ml EDT,"<p>UDV For Men 100ml EDT – Bold Freshness, Virile Sophistication 🌟</p>

<p>UDV For Men is a long-lasting, powerful fragrance designed for the confident man who embraces both freshness and strength. Crafted with precision, this scent blends aromatic energy with earthy depth, making it the ideal choice for those who seek to make an impact.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Mandarin, Lemon, Artemisia, Rosemary, Tarragon, Spearmint<br>
(A vibrant and invigorating fusion, offering an aromatic freshness that energizes and awakens the senses.)</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Geranium, Jasmine, Neroli<br>
(Floral complexity with warmth and sophistication, grounding the fragrance and adding a soft contrast to the crisp opening.)</p>

<p>Base Notes: Vetiver, Cedar, Honey, Tobacco, Musk<br>
(A deep, woody finish with an animalistic allure, creating a lasting impression of sensuality and virility.)</p>

<p>Inspired by the classic Woody Fougere Oriental structure, UDV For Men radiates masculinity with its dynamic blend of freshness and rich depth. Perfect for evening wear or cooler seasons, this fragrance leaves a powerful trail of confidence and sophistication. Embrace the strength and allure of UDV For Men—where freshness meets boldness in perfect harmony.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Full, UDV",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,1030.00,1500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/UDV-For-Men.png?v=1779880480,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
udv-wild-100ml-edt,UDV Wild 100ml EDT,"UDV Wild For Men 100ml EDT – Bold &amp; Lasting Power 🌿💪

UDV Wild For Men by Ulric de Varens is an oriental woody fragrance that exudes masculine allure with an irresistibly captivating scent. Crafted in France 🇫🇷, this fragrance is a perfect balance of freshness, warmth, and sensuality, designed to leave a lasting impression throughout the day. 🌟

Fragrance Notes: 

Top Notes: Apple, Cinnamon, Bergamot
(The fragrance opens with a lively burst of crisp apple, warm cinnamon, and zesty bergamot, creating an invigorating and energizing introduction.)

Middle Notes: Labdanum, Rosemary, Elemi
(The heart reveals a refined blend of resinous labdanum, aromatic rosemary, and bright elemi, adding depth and complexity to the composition.)

Base Notes: Sandalwood, Musk, Patchouli
(An earthy, woody foundation of sandalwood, sensual musk, and rich patchouli provides a smooth and enduring finish that lingers seductively.)

With its bold combination of fresh and earthy tones, UDV Wild For Men is perfect for daytime wear. 🌞 It provides lasting power, ensuring your presence is felt and remembered wherever you go. ✨",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Full, UDV",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,1030.00,1500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/UDV-Wild-For-Men.png?v=1779880478,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
udv-night-100ml-edt,UDV Night 100ml EDT,"<p>UDV Night For Men 100ml EDT – Bold, Invincible, and Long-lasting 🌙</p>

<p>UDV Night by Ulric de Varens is a sophisticated and long-lasting fragrance designed to accompany the modern man through every adventure. Made in France, this Woody Aromatic scent reveals an energizing yet refined composition that lingers on the skin, ensuring a captivating presence from dawn till dusk.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:<br>
