<p>Middle Notes: Cinnamon, Orange Blossom, Cedar<br>
(The warmth of cinnamon and cedarwood adds depth and richness, while the delicate orange blossom offers a touch of floral elegance.)</p>

<p>Base Notes: Tonka Bean, Woody Notes, Teak Wood<br>
(A smooth, woody base creates a grounded and sensual finish, leaving a lasting, seductive trace that is both warm and refined.)</p>

<p>Inspired by a confident, dynamic spirit, UDV Night For Men is perfect for evening wear or special occasions. Its enduring scent ensures you make an unforgettable impression, making it the ideal choice for those who seek a fragrance that mirrors their strength and sophistication.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Full, UDV",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1030.00,1500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/UDV-Night-For-Men.png?v=1779880477,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
udv-black-100ml-edt,UDV Black 100ml EDT,"<p>UDV Black For Men 100ml EDT – Timeless Sophistication 🍃🍏<br>
UDV Black for Men is a bold, aromatic fragrance crafted to embody strength, freshness, and an enduring appeal. Made in France, this long-lasting perfume balances invigorating fruitiness with earthy undertones, creating a scent that feels both energizing and refined.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:<br>
