<p>Base Notes: Musk, Tobacco<br>
(A rich base of musk and tobacco emerges, leaving a lasting, sensual trail that evokes a sense of rugged elegance and warmth.)</p>

<p>Inspired by the modern man who thrives on confidence and style, UDV Black is perfect for both day and evening wear, ensuring you leave a lasting impression wherever you go. Ideal for any occasion, this fragrance blends sophistication with strength for a timeless, masculine appeal.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Full, UDV",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1030.00,1500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/UDV-Black-For-Men.png?v=1779880476,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
tom-ford-rose-prick-100ml-edp,Tom Ford Rose Prick 100ml EDP,"Tom Ford Rose Prick 100ml EDP For Men &amp; Women – Bold, Spicy Rose Statement 🌹🔥
Tom Ford Rose Prick is a daring and unapologetic rose fragrance that celebrates the raw, edgy side of florals. Crafted for those who love statement perfumes, this unisex scent blends spice, rich roses, and a sensual woody base with Tom Ford’s signature luxury.

Fragrance Notes
Top Notes: Sichuan Pepper, TurmericThe opening is sharp and spicy, with fiery Sichuan pepper and earthy turmeric creating an instant bold and modern impression.
Heart Notes: May Rose, Bulgarian Rose, Turkish RoseAt the core lies a powerful trio of roses—lush, velvety, and slightly dark—giving the fragrance its unmistakable floral intensity and depth.
Base Notes: Patchouli, Tonka BeanThe base is warm and seductive, where earthy patchouli meets smooth, slightly sweet tonka bean, adding richness and long-lasting allure.
Tom Ford Rose Prick is perfect for evening wear, special occasions, and cooler weather. It’s a confident, niche-style rose fragrance best suited for those who enjoy spicy, bold, and luxurious florals with a modern edge.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Tom Ford, Women",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,31425.00,41990.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rose-Prick-Tom-Ford.png?v=1779880475,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
tom-ford-oud-wood-100ml-edp,Tom Ford Oud Wood 100ml EDP,"Tom Ford Oud Wood 100ml EDP For Men – Timeless, Smooth &amp; Luxuriously Woody 🌲🖤
Tom Ford Oud Wood is one of the most iconic and refined oud fragrances ever created. Elegant rather than overpowering, it presents oud in a smooth, wearable, and sophisticated way—perfect for those who appreciate understated luxury.

Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Chinese Pepper, Rosewood 🌶️🌹The opening is warm and slightly spicy, with Chinese pepper adding a subtle kick while rosewood brings a polished, woody smoothness.
Heart Notes: Oud Wood, Sandalwood 🌲🪵The heart is where the magic lies—creamy sandalwood blends seamlessly with a refined, clean oud that feels elegant and modern, never harsh or animalic.
Base Notes: Tonka Bean, Vanilla 🍦🌰The dry-down is soft, warm, and slightly sweet, with tonka bean and vanilla adding depth, comfort, and excellent longevity.
Tom Ford Oud Wood is perfect for formal occasions, office wear, evening events, and cooler weather. It’s a signature-worthy fragrance for men who prefer class, confidence, and timeless appeal over loud projection.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Tom Ford",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,24000.00,30990.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Tom-Ford-Oud-Wood.png?v=1779880473,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,oud; woody,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
tom-ford-oud-minerale-100ml-edp,Tom Ford Oud Minerale 100ml EDP,"<p>Tom Ford Oud Minérale 100ml EDP For Men And Women – Oceanic Depth Meets Dark Oud 🌊🖤<br>
Tom Ford Oud Minérale is a striking contrast of raw nature and refined luxury, where salty marine freshness collides with the dark intensity of oud. Unisex and unconventional, this fragrance captures the feeling of standing on a rugged coastline—waves crashing, mineral-rich air rising, and deep woods lingering in the background.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes 🌊<br>
Top Notes: Marine Notes 🌬️🌊The opening is fresh, salty, and invigorating, evoking ocean air and wet stones. These marine notes bring a clean yet mysterious brightness that instantly sets Oud Minérale apart.<br>
Heart Notes: Oud Blend 🌑🪵At the heart, a smooth, smoky oud emerges—earthy, resinous, and refined rather than animalic. It adds depth and darkness, perfectly balancing the freshness from the top.<br>
Base Notes: Ambergris Accord ⚓✨The base is warm, mineral, and slightly musky, with an ambergris accord that enhances longevity and gives the fragrance its signature salty-amber trail.<br>
Tom Ford Oud Minérale is ideal for those who enjoy unique, niche-style fragrances that blend freshness with depth. Perfect for day or night, especially in warm weather, it’s a bold choice for men and women who want something modern, artistic, and unforgettable.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Tom Ford",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,14000.00,18000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Tom-Ford-Oud-Minerale.png?v=1779880472,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,oud,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
tom-ford-ombre-leather-100ml-parfum,Tom Ford Ombre Leather 100ml Parfum,"<p>Tom Ford Ombré Leather 100ml Parfum For Men – Intense Leather, Refined to Perfection 🖤<br>
Tom Ford Ombré Leather Parfum is a deeper, richer, and more opulent interpretation of the iconic Ombré Leather. Crafted for men who appreciate bold elegance and uncompromising luxury, this parfum concentration amplifies the smooth leather signature with refined florals and smoky warmth—making it ideal for evening wear, cooler weather, and statement moments.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes 🖤<br>
Top Notes: Violet Leaf, Cedar 🌿🌲The opening is crisp and sophisticated. Green violet leaf brings a refined freshness, while cedar adds a clean, dry woody structure that sets a confident tone.<br>
Middle Notes: Jasmine Sambac, Orris 🌸✨At the heart, jasmine sambac introduces a subtle floral sensuality, beautifully balancing the composition, while orris adds a powdery, luxurious smoothness that elevates the leather accord.<br>
Base Notes: Leather, Woody Notes, Tobacco 🧥🔥The dry-down is deep, smoky, and commanding. Rich leather dominates with intensity, supported by dark woody notes and a touch of tobacco that adds warmth, masculinity, and long-lasting depth.<br>
Tom Ford Ombré Leather Parfum is ideal for men who love bold, luxurious leather fragrances with depth and refinement. Powerful yet elegant, it’s a confident signature scent for nights, special occasions, and moments that demand presence and style.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, men, Tom Ford",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,16600.00,21400.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Tom-Ford-Ombre-Leather-Parfum.png?v=1779880471,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
tom-ford-ombre-leather-150ml-edp,Tom Ford Ombre Leather 150ml EDP,"<p>Tom Ford Ombré Leather 150ml EDP For Men – Dark Elegance Wrapped in Leather 🖤<br>
Tom Ford Ombré Leather is a refined and powerful Eau de Parfum that fuses smooth leather with aromatic spice and warm earthiness. Sophisticated yet boldly masculine, this fragrance captures modern luxury with a darker, more elegant edge—perfect for evening wear, special occasions, and cooler seasons.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes 🖤<br>
Top Note: Cardamom 🌶️The opening is warm and aromatic. Cardamom delivers a refined spicy freshness that instantly sets a confident, luxurious tone.<br>
Middle Notes: Leather, Jasmine Sambac 🧥🌸At the heart, rich leather takes center stage—smooth, deep, and commanding. Jasmine sambac adds a subtle floral elegance, softening the leather and enhancing its sensual, polished character.<br>
Base Notes: Amber, Moss, Patchouli 🌿🔥The dry-down is warm and earthy. Amber provides glowing richness, moss adds a green, slightly damp depth, and patchouli grounds the fragrance with dark, woody sophistication.<br>
Tom Ford Ombré Leather is ideal for men who enjoy luxurious leather fragrances with depth and refinement. Confident, elegant, and long-lasting, it’s a statement scent that balances power with polish—perfect for nights that demand presence and style.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, men, Tom Ford",true,Size,150ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,17500.00,22400.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Ombre-Leather-150ml-Tom-Ford.png?v=1779880469,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
