tom-ford-noir-extreme-50ml-edp,Tom Ford Noir Extreme 50ml EDP,"Tom Ford Noir Extreme 50ml EDP For Men – Intense, Indulgent &amp; Irresistibly Seductive 🔥
Tom Ford Noir Extreme is a rich and decadent Eau de Parfum crafted for men who enjoy bold luxury and refined sensuality. Warm, spicy, and gourmand at its core, this fragrance blends exotic spices with creamy sweetness and smooth woods—making it a powerful choice for evenings, special occasions, and cooler weather.

Fragrance Notes 🔥
Top Notes: Cardamom, Nutmeg, Saffron, Mandarin Orange, Neroli 🌶️🍊The opening is vibrant and opulent. Aromatic cardamom and nutmeg deliver warm spice, saffron adds exotic richness, while mandarin orange and neroli bring a bright citrus-floral lift that keeps the opening refined and inviting.
Middle Notes: Kulfi, Rose, Mastic (Lentisque), Jasmine, Orange Blossom 🍨🌸At the heart lies the signature kulfi accord—a creamy, milky dessert note that gives Noir Extreme its indulgent character. Soft rose and white florals add elegance, while mastic introduces a resinous, slightly smoky nuance that deepens the composition.
Base Notes: Vanilla, Amber, Woody Notes, Sandalwood 🍦🌲The dry-down is warm, smooth, and long-lasting. Vanilla and amber create a rich, sensual sweetness, while woody notes and creamy sandalwood provide depth and masculine sophistication.
Tom Ford Noir Extreme is ideal for men who love spicy-gourmand fragrances with luxurious depth. Bold yet elegant, it’s a statement scent that shines in evening wear, date nights, and moments when you want to leave a powerful, unforgettable impression.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, men, Tom Ford",true,Size,50ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,9500.00,12100.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Tom-Ford-Noir-Extreme-50ml.png?v=1779880467,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
