tom-ford-noir-de-noir-100ml-edp,Tom Ford Noir De Noir 100ml EDP,"Tom Ford Noir de Noir 100ml EDP For Men &amp; Women – A Dark, Decadent Rose of Pure Seduction 🖤
Tom Ford Noir de Noir is an opulent unisex Eau de Parfum that explores the sensual contrast between dark florals and earthy gourmand depth. Rich, mysterious, and intensely romantic, this fragrance is crafted for those who embrace bold elegance and dramatic presence. It’s a statement scent—perfect for evenings, intimate occasions, and moments that call for undeniable allure.

Fragrance Notes 🖤
Top Note: Saffron 🌶️The opening is warm and luxurious. Saffron introduces a spicy, leathery richness that immediately sets a dark, seductive tone.
Middle Notes: Black Rose, Truffle, Floral Notes 🌹🍄At the heart, a velvety black rose blooms with deep sensuality, wrapped in the earthy, gourmand richness of truffle. Soft floral nuances add elegance and complexity, enhancing the fragrance’s romantic and mysterious character.
Base Notes: Patchouli, Vanilla, Agarwood (Oud), Oakmoss 🌿🍦The dry-down is deep and intoxicating. Earthy patchouli and oakmoss provide a shadowy, chypre-like foundation, while creamy vanilla softens the darkness. A subtle oud accord adds richness and depth, leaving a long-lasting, seductive trail.
Tom Ford Noir de Noir is ideal for those who love dark rose fragrances with earthy, gourmand undertones. Sensual, dramatic, and unforgettable, it’s a fragrance that speaks of intimacy, luxury, and timeless seduction.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Tom Ford",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,24000.00,30990.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Tom-Ford-Noir-De-Noir.png?v=1779880463,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
tom-ford-neroli-portofino-100ml-edp,Tom Ford Neroli Portofino 100ml EDP,"Tom Ford Neroli Portofino 100ml EDP For Men &amp; Women – A Bright Mediterranean Classic 🌊
Tom Ford Neroli Portofino is a timeless unisex Eau de Parfum that captures the effortless elegance of the Italian Riviera. Fresh, crisp, and uplifting, this iconic fragrance blends sparkling citrus with aromatic herbs and luminous white florals, evoking sun-drenched coastlines, cool sea breezes, and refined summer luxury. Perfect for warm weather, daytime wear, and sophisticated everyday freshness.

Fragrance Notes 🌊
Top Notes: Bergamot, Mandarin Orange, Lemon, Bitter Orange, Lavender, Rosemary, Myrtle 🍋🌿The opening is vibrant and refreshing. A burst of zesty citrus energizes the senses, while lavender, rosemary, and myrtle add an aromatic, green freshness that feels clean, elegant, and invigorating.
Middle Notes: African Orange Flower, Neroli, Jasmine, Pittosporum 🌸At the heart, radiant white florals take center stage. Neroli and African orange flower deliver a crisp, soapy elegance, enhanced by jasmine’s soft sensuality and the creamy floral nuance of pittosporum.
Base Notes: Amber, Ambrette (Musk Mallow), Angelica 🤍The dry-down is smooth and subtle. Warm amber adds gentle depth, ambrette provides a soft musky warmth, and angelica lends a light herbal finish—keeping the fragrance refined and airy.
Tom Ford Neroli Portofino is ideal for those who love fresh citrus-floral fragrances with a clean, luxurious feel. Elegant, uplifting, and endlessly wearable, it’s a perfect signature scent for summer days, vacations, and polished daytime sophistication.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Summer Essentials, Tom Ford",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,24000.00,30990.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Tomford-Neroli-Portofino.png?v=1779880462,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
tom-ford-lost-cherry-100ml-edp,Tom Ford Lost Cherry 100ml EDP,"Tom Ford Lost Cherry 100ml EDP For Men &amp; Women – A Decadent Cherry Temptation 🍒
Tom Ford Lost Cherry is a bold, sensual, and irresistibly indulgent unisex Eau de Parfum that blurs the line between innocence and temptation. Lush, boozy, and provocatively sweet, this iconic fragrance wraps rich cherry accords in warm spices, creamy woods, and gourmand depth—making it a true statement scent for evenings and special occasions.

Fragrance Notes 🍒
Top Notes: Bitter Almond, Black Cherry, Cherry Liqueur 🌰🍒The opening is intoxicating and playful. Juicy black cherry and boozy cherry liqueur create a rich, syrupy sweetness, while bitter almond adds a slightly nutty edge that keeps the fragrance sophisticated and intriguing.
Middle Notes: Sour Cherry, Plum, Turkish Rose, Jasmine Sambac 🌸🍑At the heart, layers of cherry deepen with tart sour cherry and velvety plum. Floral notes of Turkish rose and jasmine sambac add elegance and sensuality, beautifully balancing the fruity richness with refined floral charm.
Base Notes: Vanilla, Tonka Bean, Cinnamon, Peru Balsam, Sandalwood, Benzoin, Cloves, Cedar, Patchouli, Vetiver 🍦🌿The dry-down is warm, spicy, and long-lasting. Creamy vanilla and tonka bean enhance the gourmand sweetness, while cinnamon and cloves add spicy warmth. Woods, resins, and earthy patchouli and vetiver ground the fragrance with depth and sophistication.
Tom Ford Lost Cherry is ideal for those who love bold gourmand-fruity fragrances with a seductive, luxurious edge. Sweet yet dark, playful yet intense, it’s a captivating scent that leaves an unforgettable trail.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Tom Ford, Women",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,32500.00,41900.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Tom-Ford-Lost-Cherry.png?v=1779880461,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,oriental,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
tom-ford-fucking-fabulous-50ml-edp,Tom Ford Fucking Fabulous 50ml EDP,"Tom Ford Ébène Fumé 100ml EDP For Men &amp; Women – A Smoldering Ritual of Sacred Woods 🔥
Tom Ford Ébène Fumé is a deep, meditative unisex Eau de Parfum inspired by sacred smoke, ancient woods, and ceremonial resins. Dark, smoky, and profoundly atmospheric, this fragrance feels spiritual yet powerful—crafted for those who appreciate intensity, mystery, and refined darkness. It’s a statement scent best suited for evenings, introspective moments, and cooler weather.

Fragrance Notes 🔥
Top Notes: Incense, Palo Santo, Black Pepper, Violet Leaf 🌫️🌿The opening is immediately smoky and mystical. Sacred incense and palo santo create a ceremonial aura, while black pepper adds a sharp, dry spice. Violet leaf introduces a green, slightly metallic freshness that contrasts beautifully with the smoke.
Middle Notes: Leather, Labdanum, Cade Oil, Papyrus, Rose 🧥🌹At the heart, smoldering leather and resinous labdanum deepen the darkness. Cade oil adds a charred, smoky intensity, papyrus brings dry woodiness, and a subtle rose note adds an unexpected floral softness beneath the smoke.
Base Notes: Resins, Ebony Tree, Guaiac Wood 🌲🔥The dry-down is rich, dense, and long-lasting. Dark resins melt into the deep woodiness of ebony tree, while guaiac wood adds a creamy, smoky warmth that lingers like embers.
Tom Ford Ébène Fumé is ideal for those who love smoky, woody, and incense-heavy fragrances with artistic depth. Bold, spiritual, and unforgettable, it’s a scent that feels like a sacred ritual—powerful, mysterious, and deeply evocative.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, men, Tom Ford",true,Size,50ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,24000.00,30400.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Tom-Ford-Fucking-Fabulous-50ml.png?v=1779880460,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
