tom-ford-d-ombre-leather-100ml-edp,Tom Ford D’Ombre Leather 100ml EDP,"<p>Tom Ford D’Ombré Leather 100ml EDP For Men – A Modern Icon of Refined Leather 🖤<br>
Tom Ford D’Ombré Leather is a bold yet sophisticated Eau de Parfum that redefines modern masculinity through the lens of smooth leather and warm spice. Intense, elegant, and effortlessly confident, this fragrance captures the spirit of freedom and strength, making it a perfect choice for evening wear, special occasions, and cooler seasons.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes 🖤<br>
Top Notes: Cardamom, Ginger, Coriander 🌶️The opening is vibrant and aromatic. Cardamom delivers warm spice, ginger adds a fresh, zesty bite, and coriander introduces a green, slightly citrusy nuance—creating an energizing and refined first impression.<br>
