Tom Ford D’Ombré Leather is ideal for men who appreciate bold leather fragrances with a refined, contemporary edge. Confident and charismatic, it’s a statement scent that balances strength with elegance—perfect for nights that demand presence and style.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Tom Ford",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,10500.00,13600.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Tom-Ford-DOmbre-Leather.png?v=1779880454,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
tom-ford-costa-azzurra-100ml-parfum,Tom Ford Costa Azzurra 100ml Parfum,"Tom Ford Costa Azzurra 100ml Parfum For Men &amp; Women – A Sun-Soaked Mediterranean Luxury 🌊
Tom Ford Costa Azzurra Parfum is a richer, more concentrated interpretation of the iconic Costa Azzurra, capturing the warmth of the Mediterranean coast with refined simplicity and depth. Smooth, elegant, and effortlessly luxurious, this unisex parfum blends bright citrus with noble woods and warm resins—perfect for those who appreciate understated sophistication with lasting presence.

Fragrance Notes 🌊
