Middle Notes: Cypress, Oak 🌲At the heart, aromatic cypress and sturdy oak create a refined woody structure. These notes add depth and Mediterranean character, balancing freshness with calm, masculine-feminine elegance.
Base Notes: Amber, Labdanum 🔥The dry-down is warm, smooth, and long-lasting. Amber provides a glowing, resinous warmth, while labdanum adds a rich, slightly smoky depth that lingers beautifully on the skin.
Tom Ford Costa Azzurra Parfum is ideal for those who love clean, woody-amber fragrances with a coastal soul. Sophisticated yet relaxed, it’s perfect for daytime elegance, warm weather, travel, and anyone seeking a luxurious scent that feels natural, refined, and timeless.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Tom Ford",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,16600.00,21400.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Tom-Ford-Costa-Azzurra-Parfum.png?v=1779880452,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
tom-ford-costa-azzurra-100ml-edp,Tom Ford Costa Azzurra 100ml EDP,"Tom Ford Costa Azzurra 100ml EDP For Men &amp; Women – A Luxurious Mediterranean Escape 🌊
Tom Ford Costa Azzurra is a refined and evocative unisex Eau de Parfum that captures the raw beauty of the Mediterranean coastline—where salty sea air meets sun-warmed woods and aromatic herbs. Elegant yet untamed, this fragrance blends marine freshness with woody depth, making it a perfect choice for those who enjoy sophisticated, natural, and effortlessly luxurious scents.

Fragrance Notes 🌊
Top Notes: Driftwood, Seaweed, Agarwood (Oud), Ambrette, Cardamom, Celery Seeds 🌿🪵The opening is distinctly coastal and aromatic. Salty driftwood and seaweed evoke ocean air, while ambrette adds a soft musky warmth. Cardamom and celery seeds introduce a green, spicy freshness, and a subtle oud nuance gives depth and refinement.
Middle Notes: Lemon, Cypress, Yellow Mandarin, Lavender, Myrtle, Artemisia 🍋🌲At the heart, bright citrus notes of lemon and yellow mandarin bring freshness, balanced by aromatic herbs and woods. Cypress and lavender add a clean, Mediterranean elegance, while myrtle and artemisia enhance the natural, windswept character.
Base Notes: Vetiver, Oak, Incense, Olibanum, Mastic, Vanilla 🌿🔥The dry-down is warm, woody, and resinous. Vetiver and oak provide earthy structure, incense and olibanum add smoky depth, and mastic introduces a balsamic touch. A hint of vanilla smooths the base with subtle warmth.
Tom Ford Costa Azzurra is ideal for those who love marine-woody fragrances with aromatic freshness and depth. Versatile and unisex, it’s perfect for daytime wear, warm climates, travel, and moments when you want a scent that feels free-spirited, elegant, and naturally luxurious.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Tom Ford",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,14000.00,18000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Tom-Ford-Costa-Azzura.png?v=1779880450,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
tom-ford-cafe-rose-50ml-edp,Tom Ford Cafe Rose 50ml EDP,"Tom Ford Café Rose 50ml EDP For Men &amp; Women – A Dark, Spiced Rose Infusion 🌹
Tom Ford Café Rose is a bold and sensual unisex Eau de Parfum that explores the contrast between luxurious roses and deep, roasted warmth. Mysterious and sophisticated, this fragrance blends spicy florals with rich woods and resins, creating a dramatic and intoxicating scent that feels both elegant and seductive. Perfect for evenings, special occasions, and those who love roses with depth and edge.

