Middle Notes: Turkish Rose, Bulgarian Rose, Coffee ☕🌹At the heart, a lavish trio of roses takes center stage—deep, velvety, and romantic. The addition of coffee brings a dark, roasted bitterness that adds intrigue and a modern twist, enhancing the fragrance’s depth and sensuality.
