Tom Ford Café Rose is ideal for those who enjoy bold rose fragrances with spice, darkness, and character. Elegant yet daring, it’s a statement scent that blends floral romance with smoky sophistication—perfect for nights that demand presence and allure.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Tom Ford",true,Size,50ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,10500.00,12100.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Tom-Ford-Cafe-Rose.png?v=1779880448,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
tom-ford-bois-pacifique-100ml-edp,Tom Ford Bois Pacifique 100ml EDP,"Tom Ford Bois Pacifique 100ml EDP For Men &amp; Women – A Serene Journey Through Exotic Woods 🌿
Tom Ford Bois Pacifique is a refined and contemplative unisex Eau de Parfum that captures the tranquil elegance of rare woods warmed by soft spices and resins. Sophisticated yet comforting, this fragrance feels meditative and luxurious—perfect for those who appreciate understated opulence and a smooth, woody-amber profile that works beautifully from day to evening.

Fragrance Notes 🌿
Top Notes: Cardamom, Akigalawood, Turmeric 🌶️🌿The opening is aromatic and gently spicy. Cardamom brings a warm, green freshness, while Akigalawood adds a modern, peppery-woody nuance. Turmeric introduces an earthy, golden spice that gives the fragrance a unique, refined character.
Middle Notes: Frankincense, Oak, Cedar, White Sandalwood, Iris 🌲✨At the heart, layers of noble woods unfold. Smoky frankincense adds a serene, resinous depth, balanced by oak and cedar for structure and strength. Creamy white sandalwood softens the composition, while iris lends a subtle, powdery elegance.
