Tom Ford Bois Pacifique is ideal for those who love elegant woody-spicy fragrances with a peaceful, refined aura. Versatile and unisex, it’s perfect for daily wear, professional settings, and moments when you want a scent that’s sophisticated, calming, and effortlessly refined.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Tom Ford",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,14000.00,18000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Tom-Ford-Bois-Pacifique.png?v=1779880446,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
tom-ford-black-orchid-reserve-100ml-edp,Tom Ford Black Orchid Reserve 100ml EDP,"Tom Ford Black Orchid Reserve 100ml EDP For Men &amp; Women – A Dark, Decadent Collector’s Indulgence 🖤
