tom-ford-black-orchid-50ml-edp,Tom Ford Black Orchid 50ml EDP,"Tom Ford Black Orchid 100ml EDP For Men &amp; Women – An Icon of Dark Luxury and Seduction 🖤
Tom Ford Black Orchid is a legendary unisex Eau de Parfum that redefined modern luxury perfumery with its deep, sensual, and unmistakably opulent character. Bold yet elegant, this iconic fragrance is crafted for those who gravitate toward mystery, richness, and dramatic presence. Perfect for evenings, special occasions, and statement wear, Black Orchid is a timeless classic that commands attention.

Fragrance Notes 🖤
Top Notes: Truffle, Gardenia, Black Currant, Ylang-Ylang, Jasmine, Bergamot, Mandarin Orange, Amalfi Lemon 🍋✨The opening is lush and intoxicating. Earthy truffle sets a dark, luxurious tone, balanced by creamy white florals and juicy black currant. Bright citrus notes add a sparkling contrast, creating a complex and captivating introduction.
Middle Notes: Orchid, Spices, Gardenia, Fruity Notes, Ylang-Ylang, Jasmine, Lotus 🌸🔥At the heart lies the signature black orchid accord—rich, exotic, and sensual. Warm spices intertwine with floral elegance and subtle fruity nuances, while lotus adds a smooth, watery softness that enhances the fragrance’s depth and intrigue.
Base Notes: Mexican Chocolate, Patchouli, Vanilla, Incense, Amber, Sandalwood, Vetiver, White Musk 🍫🌿The dry-down is indulgent and long-lasting. Dark chocolate and vanilla add gourmand richness, patchouli and vetiver bring earthy depth, and incense with amber create a smoky, resinous warmth. White musk smooths the composition with a velvety finish.
Tom Ford Black Orchid is ideal for those who love bold, dark, and luxurious fragrances with a seductive edge. It’s a powerful signature scent—mysterious, confident, and unforgettable.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Tom Ford",true,Size,50ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,10500.00,12100.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Tom-Ford-Black-Orchid-50ml.png?v=1779880441,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
