tom-ford-black-lacquer-50ml-edp,Tom Ford Black Lacquer 50ml EDP,"<p>Tom Ford Black Lacquer 50ml EDP For Men – A Dark, Artistic Expression of Modern Luxury 🖤<br>
Tom Ford Black Lacquer is an intensely bold and avant-garde Eau de Parfum crafted for men who embrace individuality, mystery, and refined rebellion. This fragrance feels like a piece of modern art—dark, glossy, and provocative—blending unconventional accords with refined woods and resins. It’s a statement scent designed for evenings, artistic souls, and those who prefer fragrances that stand far apart from the ordinary.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes 🖤<br>
Top Notes: Ink, Vinyl, Black Pepper, Rum ✒️🥃The opening is striking and unconventional. Inky and vinyl-like accords create a dark, glossy effect, while black pepper adds sharp spice and rum introduces a boozy warmth. This bold start immediately commands attention with its edgy character.<br>
Heart Notes: Ebony Wood, Elemi, Apricot, Peony 🌳🌸At the heart, deep ebony wood brings richness and polish, balanced by resinous elemi for a smoky nuance. A subtle touch of apricot adds an unexpected fruity softness, while peony introduces a delicate floral contrast—creating a fascinating balance between darkness and elegance.<br>
Base Note: Olibanum 🔥The dry-down is smooth, smoky, and meditative. Olibanum (frankincense) envelops the fragrance in a resinous, incense-like warmth that lingers with quiet power and sophistication.<br>
Tom Ford Black Lacquer is ideal for men who appreciate dark, artistic, and unconventional fragrances. It’s not just a scent—it’s an attitude. Perfect for evening wear, creative settings, and moments when you want to leave a bold, unforgettable impression.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Tom Ford",true,Size,50ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,23600.00,30400.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Tom-Ford-Black-Lacquer.png?v=1779880437,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
tom-ford-soleil-blanc-50ml-edp,Tom Ford Soleil Blanc 50ml EDP,"Tom Ford Soleil Blanc 50ml EDP For Men &amp; Women – Luxurious Summer Escape ☀️🥥
Tom Ford Soleil Blanc captures the feeling of a private island getaway—warm sun, creamy skin, and effortless luxury. This unisex fragrance is radiant, sensual, and perfectly balanced between fresh spice, exotic florals, and a smooth gourmand base.

Fragrance Notes
Top Notes: Pistachio, Bergamot, Cardamom, Pink PepperThe opening is bright yet creamy, where nutty pistachio blends with fresh bergamot and soft spices for a refined, sun-kissed start.
Heart Notes: Tuberose, Ylang-Ylang, JasmineThe heart is rich and floral, dominated by lush white flowers that feel tropical, elegant, and slightly intoxicating.
Base Notes: Coconut, Amber, Tonka Bean, BenzoinThe dry-down is warm, creamy, and addictive—coconut adds a beachy smoothness while amber, tonka bean, and benzoin bring depth and long-lasting sensuality.
Tom Ford Soleil Blanc is ideal for daytime wear, vacations, beach outings, and summer evenings. A perfect choice if you enjoy creamy, tropical, luxurious fragrances that feel both relaxed and elite.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Tom Ford",true,Size,50ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,17500.00,23200.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Tom-Ford-Soleil-Blanc.png?v=1779880436,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
