tom-ford-tobacco-vanille-100ml-edp,Tom Ford Tobacco Vanille 100ml EDP,"<p>Tom Ford Tobacco Vanille 100ml EDP For Men – Iconic Warmth, Timeless Luxury 🍂🔥Rich • Opulent • Long-Lasting<br>
Tom Ford Tobacco Vanille is a legendary fragrance that redefines classic masculinity with bold elegance. Deep, warm, and irresistibly luxurious, this scent blends rich tobacco with creamy vanilla to create a powerful yet refined statement. It is sophisticated, comforting, and unapologetically indulgent—perfect for men who appreciate timeless style with modern confidence.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes ✨<br>
Top Notes: Tobacco Leaf, Spicy Notes 🌿🌶️The opening is bold and aromatic, led by rich tobacco leaf wrapped in warm spices. This instantly creates a sense of depth, luxury, and old-world charm.<br>
Middle Notes: Vanilla, Cacao, Tonka Bean, Tobacco Blossom 🍫🌸At the heart, smooth vanilla melts into dark cacao and tonka bean, adding creamy sweetness and gourmand richness. Tobacco blossom softens the blend, giving it an elegant and addictive warmth.<br>
Base Notes: Dried Fruits, Woody Notes 🪵🍇The base is deep and comforting, with dried fruits adding subtle sweetness and woody notes providing a dry, refined finish that lingers beautifully on the skin.<br>
Perfect for evenings, winters, formal occasions, and signature scent lovers, Tobacco Vanille is a masterpiece of warmth and sophistication.<br>
🔥 Bold. Classic. Unforgettable. Tom Ford Tobacco Vanille is luxury in its purest form.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, men, Tom Ford",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,23600.00,30990.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Tom-Ford-Tobacco-Vanille.png?v=1779880434,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
tom-ford-tuscan-leather-100ml-edp,Tom Ford Tuscan Leather 100ml EDP,"<p>Tom Ford Tuscan Leather 100ml EDP For Men – Raw Luxury with a Dark Edge 🖤🔥Bold • Sensual • Iconic<br>
Tom Ford Tuscan Leather is a powerful and unmistakable fragrance that embodies rugged elegance and fearless masculinity. Dark, smoky, and intensely luxurious, this scent is crafted for men who appreciate bold statements and refined strength. It’s daring, addictive, and unforgettable from the very first spray.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes ✨<br>
