Middle Notes: Olibanum, Jasmine 🌸🔥At the heart, smoky olibanum brings depth and mystery, balanced by jasmine’s soft floral elegance. This contrast creates a refined yet edgy core.<br>
Base Notes: Leather, Suede, Woody Notes, Amber 🪵🖤The base is rich and deeply masculine. Luxurious leather and suede dominate, supported by dry woods and warm amber, leaving a smooth, smoky trail that lingers with confidence.<br>
Perfect for evenings, winter wear, formal occasions, and statement-makers, Tuscan Leather is not for the faint-hearted—it’s for those who own their presence.<br>
🖤 Intense. Bold. Legendary. Tom Ford Tuscan Leather is the definition of modern power and sophistication.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, men, Tom Ford",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,23600.00,30990.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Tom-Ford-Tuscan-Leather.png?v=1779880432,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
