Middle Notes: Black Orchid, Orchid, Jasmine, Heliotrope, Hyacinth, Rose Oil, Narcissus, Magnolia, Orange Blossom 🌸💐The heart unfolds into an opulent floral bouquet. Exotic orchids lead the way, surrounded by creamy jasmine, powdery heliotrope, and lush white florals, creating a deep, sensual, and irresistibly feminine core.<br>
Base Notes: Vanilla, Myrrh, Suede, Sandalwood, Peru Balsam, Labdanum 🤍🪵The base is warm and luxurious. Smooth vanilla blends with resinous myrrh and balsams, while suede and sandalwood add a soft, velvety finish that lingers beautifully on the skin.<br>
