✨ Bold yet elegant, rich yet refined—Tom Ford Velvet Orchid is femininity wrapped in luxury.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Tom Ford",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,14000.00,18000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Tom-Ford-Velvet-Orchid.png?v=1779880430,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
tom-ford-white-suede-100ml-edp,Tom Ford White Suede 100ml EDP,"<p>Tom Ford White Suede 100ml EDP For Women – Soft Luxury with a Sensual Touch 🤍✨Elegant • Intimate • Timeless<br>
