Middle Notes: Lily-of-the-Valley, Saffron, Rose 🌸🌹The heart reveals a graceful floral composition. Lily-of-the-valley adds freshness and purity, rose brings subtle romance, while saffron introduces a warm, slightly leathery nuance that adds depth and character.<br>
Base Notes: Suede, Musk, Sandalwood, Olibanum, Amber 🤍🪵The base is smooth, creamy, and sensual. Soft suede and musk create an intimate skin-like feel, enriched by warm amber, smoky olibanum, and creamy sandalwood for a long-lasting, elegant trail.<br>
Perfect for daytime elegance, office wear, intimate evenings, and all seasons, White Suede is ideal for women who love clean, musky, soft-leather fragrances with quiet confidence.<br>
✨ Subtle. Sophisticated. Seductive. Tom Ford White Suede is luxury whispered, not shouted.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Tom Ford",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,23600.00,30990.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Tom-Ford-White-Suede.png?v=1779880428,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
