🤍🌿 Tadangel Pure Touch Blanc – purity, elegance, and timeless freshness.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Tadangel, Women",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,1399.00,2499.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Tadangel-Pure-Touch-Blanc.png?v=1779880427,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
tadangel-magic-blossom-100ml-edp,Tadangel Magic Blossom 100ml EDP,"TADangel Magic Blossom 100ml EDP – Sweet Vanilla with Salty Floral Warmth 🌸✨For Women | Sweet • Floral • Amber
