🌿 Fragrance Notes
Top Notes:🍦 Vanilla – Smooth and creamy sweetness that instantly comforts.🌊 Salt &amp; Ozonic Notes – A fresh, airy twist that adds uniqueness and brightness.
Heart Notes:🌹 Rose – Elegant floral softness that adds femininity.🍬 Praline – A rich, sugary gourmand note that enhances sweetness.
Base Notes:🔥 Amber Xtreme – Strong, radiant amber for depth and projection.🌿 Patchouli – Earthy richness balancing the sweetness.🍦 Vanilla – A lingering creamy finish that ties the scent together.
Magic Blossom evolves from a sweet airy opening into a floral-gourmand heart, settling into a warm amber-vanilla base that feels cozy and long-lasting.
Perfect for evenings, date nights, winter wear, and special occasions, it suits women who love sweet fragrances with a unique fresh twist and deep warmth.
🌸✨ Magic Blossom – sweet, airy, and irresistibly captivating.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Tadangel, Women",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,1399.00,1599.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Tadangel-Magic-Blossom.png?v=1779880426,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
