tadangel-celebration-100ml-edp,Tadangel Celebration 100ml EDP,"TADangel Celebration 100ml EDP – Fruity Sparkle with Creamy Floral Musk ✨🎉
For Men &amp; Women | Fruity • Floral • Musky

TADangel Celebration is a joyful and elegant unisex fragrance that opens with a sparkling fruity freshness, blossoms into a creamy floral heart, and settles into a soft musky base. Smooth, uplifting, and versatile, it’s perfect for moments worth celebrating.
🌿 Fragrance Notes
Top Notes:
🌶️ Pink Pepper – A lively spicy sparkle that adds energy.
🍊 Bergamot – Fresh citrus brightness for a clean opening.
🍓 Raspberry – Juicy sweetness that feels playful and vibrant.

Heart Notes:
🍦 Vanilla – Creamy sweetness that adds warmth and comfort.
🌸 Jasmine &amp; Rose – A classic floral duo bringing elegance and softness.

Base Notes:
