🌿 Iris – Powdery sophistication that enhances refinement.
🤍 Musk – Clean, soft finish that lingers beautifully.

Celebration transitions from a bright fruity opening into a creamy floral heart, settling into a soft musky base that feels smooth and long-lasting.

Perfect for daily wear, parties, casual outings, and all-season use, it suits those who enjoy fresh, sweet, and elegant fragrances with a soft musky finish.

🎉✨ Celebration – every moment deserves a signature scent.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Tadangel, Women",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,1399.00,1599.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Tadangle-celebration.png?v=1779880422,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
