swiss-arabian-shaghaf-oud-aswad-75ml-edp,Swiss Arabian Shaghaf Oud Aswad 75ml EDP,"<p>Shaghaf Oud Aswad by Swiss Arabian is a Amber Woody fragrance for women and men. Shaghaf OudAswadShaghaf Oud Aswad is as complex as it is beautiful, just like the feelings of passion which inspired itscreation.Shaghaf Oud Aswad is an oriental, woody, oud fragrance that opens with an accord of floral, woodynotes, and a touch ofprized saffron. The anticipation builds with a gradual blossoming of its complexheart. Combining the heady petals of rose and jasmine with earthy patchouli and spices, each scentedfootstep leads to the golden prize.</p>

<p>Top notes are Rose, Saffron, Woody Notes and Thyme</p>

<p>Middle notes are Rose, Agarwood (Oud), Patchouli, Cumin, Coriander and Jasmine</p>

<p>Base notes are Agarwood (Oud), Leather, Amber, Sandalwood, Vanilla and Musk.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Swiss Arabian",true,Size,75ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,3049.00,4299.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Swiss-Arabian-Shaghaf-Oud-Aswad-75ML-EDP.png?v=1779880413,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
swiss-arabian-shaghaf-oud-abyad-75ml-edp,Swiss Arabian Shaghaf Oud Abyad 75ml EDP,"<p>Shaghaf Oud Abyad by Swiss Arabian is a Woody Spicy fragrance for women and men. It opens with wide-awake top notes of piquant pepper, zesty bergamot and fresh oregano. This invigorating start leads into a rich, resinous territory at the heart of the scent. With smoky incense, silky amber and the leathery floral notes of labdanum, your fragrant journey is gently led by precious myrrh into the deep and long-lasting finale. This is the signature that you leave behind: an enticing accord of sandalwood, earthy patchouli and leather, topped with a golden crown of cherished oud.</p>

<p>Top notes are Oregano, Pimento Seeds and Bergamot</p>

<p>Middle notes are Myrrh, Opoponax, Amber, Olibanum and Citruses</p>

<p>Base notes are Smoke, Agarwood (Oud), Leather, Sandalwood and Patchouli.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Swiss Arabian",true,Size,75ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,3049.00,4299.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Swiss-Arabian-Shaghaf-Oud-Abyad-75ML-EDP.png?v=1779880411,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,oud,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
swiss-arabian-shaghaf-oud-75ml-edp,Swiss Arabian Shaghaf Oud 75ml EDP,"<p>Oud Bouquet Eau de Parfum by Lancôme is a Amber Vanilla fragrance for women and men. SHAGHAF OUDShaghaf Oud is an oriental oud fragrance that surrounds your passionate heart with the peerlessbeauty of rich, golden oud.Shaghaf Oud opens with precious strands of saffron, also known as red gold. It merges with theseam of agarwood thatstarts like the source of a river, and threads itself with growing intensitythrough each layer of the fragrance. As the oud reaches the heart of the fragrance, it awakens anexquisite rose and nuances of delicious praline. Growing in intensity, the oud meets the warmembrace of vanilla, showering you in the perfect combination of rich, resonant agarwood and goldensweetness.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Saffron, Oud</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Rose, Praline, Oud</p>

<p>Base Notes: Oud, Amber, Vanilla</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, men, Party, Swiss Arabian, Women",true,Size,75ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,3299.00,4299.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Swiss-Arabian-Shaghaf-Oud-75ML-EDP.png?v=1779880409,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,oud,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
swiss-arabian-shaghaf-oud-tonka-limited-edition-75ml-edp,Swiss Arabian Shaghaf Oud Tonka Limited Edition 75ml EDP,"<p>Swiss Arabian Shaghaf Oud Tonka Limited Edition 75ML EDP: A Mesmerizing Fusion for Men and Women</p>

<p>Embark on an enchanting olfactory journey with Swiss Arabian Shaghaf Oud Tonka Limited Edition Eau De Parfum, where luxury meets allure in a captivating blend designed to captivate both men and women alike. Encased in a sleek 75ML bottle, this fragrance embodies sophistication and elegance, making it the perfect accessory for any occasion.</p>

