<p>💫 Versatility and Elegance: Swiss Arabian Shaghaf Oud Tonka Limited Edition EDP transcends gender boundaries, making it a versatile and sophisticated choice for both men and women. Whether worn during the day or evening, its luxurious blend of notes ensures you make a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Swiss Arabian",true,Size,75ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,3999.00,5999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Swiss-Arabian-Shaghaf-Oud-Tonka.png?v=1779880408,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
swiss-arabian-jannet-el-firdaus-9ml-attar,Swiss Arabian Jannet El Firdaus 9ml Attar,"<p>Swiss Arabian Jannet El Firdaus Green 9ml Original Attar: A Fragrant Oasis of Authenticity 🌿</p>

