<p>🌐 Made in UAE Excellence: Crafted with meticulous attention to detail in the fragrance capital of the UAE, Swiss Arabian Jannet El Firdaus White attar reflects the unparalleled craftsmanship and heritage of Middle Eastern perfumery. Each bottle encapsulates centuries of tradition and innovation, delivering an experience of pure luxury.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Attar, Full, Swiss Arabian",true,Size,9ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,749.00,999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Swiss-Arabian-Jannet-El-Firdaus.png?v=1779880402,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
swiss-arabian-jannet-el-firdaus-black-9ml-attar,Swiss Arabian Jannet El Firdaus Black 9ml Attar,"<p>Swiss Arabian Jannet El Firdaus Black 9ml Attar: A Timeless Elixir of Enchantment 🌹</p>

