swiss-arabian-shaghaf-oud-ahmar-75ml-edp,Swiss Arabian Shaghaf Oud Ahmar 75ml EDP,"<p>Swiss Arabian Shaghaf Oud Ahmar 75ML EDP: The Essence of Timeless Elegance 🌟</p>

<p>Experience the epitome of luxury with Swiss Arabian Shaghaf Oud Ahmar, a long-lasting fragrance crafted for both men and women. Made in the UAE, this exquisite scent captures the essence of sophistication and allure, offering a fragrance experience that transcends time.</p>

<p>💫 Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Begin your olfactory journey with the delightful blend of peach, melon, bergamot, freesia, and iris. These vibrant and refreshing notes create an invigorating opening that instantly captivates the senses.<br>
Middle Notes: The heart of Shaghaf Oud Ahmar unfolds with a rich mix of apple, tonka bean, amber, and rose. This harmonious combination adds depth and warmth, enhancing the fragrance's allure.<br>
Base Notes: The scent culminates in a luxurious base of vanilla, musk, amber, sandalwood, cedar, and oud. These enduring notes provide a sensual and lingering finish, embodying the fragrance's timeless elegance.</p>

