Top Notes: Subtle hints of fresh and aromatic accords that open the fragrance with a graceful introduction. 🌸<br>
Middle Notes: Warm, elegant heart notes that blend oriental spices and soft florals, creating a refined, unisex charm. 🫖<br>
Base Notes: Rich, woody base intertwined with creamy amber and smooth resins, leaving a long-lasting, sophisticated trail. 🌲<br>
Mukhalat Al Arais is perfect for those who appreciate classic oriental fragrances with a modern twist—luxurious, versatile, and effortlessly stylish. Its elegant composition makes it suitable for daily wear, special occasions, or moments when you want to leave a lasting impression. ✨</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Attar, Full, Swiss Arabian",true,Size,24ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,690.00,699.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Swiss-Arabian-Mukhalat-Al-Arais.png?v=1779880356,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
swiss-arabian-enigma-of-taif-100ml-extrait-de-parfum,Swiss Arabian Enigma Of Taif 100ml Extrait De Parfum,"<p>Swiss Arabian Enigma Of Taif 100ML Extrait De Parfum – Unveil the Mystique of the Rose City 🌹✨<br>
Enigma Of Taif by Swiss Arabian is a luxurious unisex extrait de parfum that captures the timeless beauty and sacred allure of Taif, the legendary city of roses. Deeply sensual yet elegantly refined, this fragrance is an olfactory journey through spice-laden air, blooming florals, and resinous warmth—crafted for those who appreciate mystery, depth, and sophistication.<br>
Fragrance Notes:<br>
Top Notes: Pink Pepper, Cardamom, Elemi, Black Pepper, Plum(The opening ignites with a vibrant fusion of pink and black pepper, delivering a bold, spicy sparkle. Aromatic cardamom and resinous elemi add warmth and intrigue, while juicy plum lends a subtle sweetness that softens the intensity.)<br>
Middle Notes: Taif Rose, Saffron, Violet, Osmanthus, Olibanum(At the heart lies the majestic Taif rose—rich, velvety, and captivating. Golden saffron weaves through delicate violet and apricot-toned osmanthus, while smoky olibanum enhances the fragrance with a sacred, incense-like depth.)<br>
Base Notes: Oak Tree, Molasses, Labdanum, Amber, Vetiver(The base unfolds into a dark, sensual embrace of earthy oak and smoky vetiver, enriched by sweet molasses and resinous labdanum. Warm amber ties everything together, leaving a long-lasting, unforgettable trail.)<br>
Enigma Of Taif is a statement fragrance—opulent, mysterious, and irresistibly powerful. 🌹🔥</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","Full, Swiss Arabian",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,5599.00,8500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Swiss-Arabian-Enigma-Of-Taif.png?v=1779880355,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,extrait,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
street-origins-manila-manic-75ml-edp,Street Origins Manila Manic 75ml EDP,"Street Origins Manila Manic 75ml EDP – Tropical Energy with Creamy Musky Warmth 🥭🌴
