rue-broca-penthouse-ginza-80ml-edp,Rue Broca Penthouse Ginza 80ml EDP,"<p>Rue Broca Penthouse Ginza, a 80ml Eau de Parfum designed for the modern man who appreciates refinement and sophistication. This fragrance is not merely a scent; it's a statement of style and power. With its extraordinary longevity, it weaves an olfactory tapestry that lingers, making an unforgettable impression.</p>

<p>At the top, Rue Broca Penthouse Ginza bursts forth with a lively symphony of scents. Crisp Bergamot offers a zesty, uplifting start, complemented by the citrusy sparkle of Grapefruit. Fresh Spicy notes infuse a dynamic, invigorating energy into this fragrance, setting the stage for the sensory journey ahead.</p>

<p>As you delve deeper into its heart, you encounter a luxurious blend of aromas. The warmth of Bay Leaf harmonizes with the lush sweetness of Jasmine, while Lavender adds a touch of herbal elegance. This middle phase of Rue Broca Penthouse Ginza resonates with a complexity that captivates the senses and keeps you spellbound.</p>

<p>The fragrance's foundation is solid and enduring, with a base note that exudes confidence. Oakmoss, Ambergris, and Patchouli create a rich, earthy depth that conveys strength and sensuality. This perfume is a magnificent homage to the timeless allure of woody, aquatic fragrances.</p>

<p>What makes Rue Broca Penthouse Ginza truly remarkable is its remarkable similarity to the famed Invictus Aqua, offering a luxurious experience at a more accessible price point. This fragrance embodies the spirit of the modern gentleman, capturing his charisma and power in a single bottle. Prepare to leave a lasting impression wherever you go with Rue Broca Penthouse Ginza.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Rue Broca",true,Size,80ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,1930.00,5000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/penthouse-ginza.png?v=1779880339,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
