<p>Crafted to last all day, Rue Broca Theoreme Matrix is ideal for any occasion, whether formal or casual. Its refined blend of fruity, woody, and musky notes ensures you make a statement wherever you go. Elevate your fragrance game with this premium, long-lasting scent.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, men, Rue Broca",true,Size,90ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,2049.00,5000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rue-Broca-Theoreme-Matrix.png?v=1779880337,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,'1,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
rue-broca-hooked-pour-homme-100ml-edp,Rue Broca Hooked Pour Homme 100ml EDP,"<p>Rue Broca Hooked Pour Homme 100ml EDP – A Bold, Long-Lasting Fragrance for Men 🌟</p>

<p>Experience the captivating allure of Rue Broca Hooked Pour Homme, a high-quality, rich-smelling fragrance crafted in the UAE. Designed for the modern man, this long-lasting scent is the perfect companion for fall, winter, and night-time occasions. Known as a great alternative to Scandal Pour Homme by Jean Paul Gaultier, this Oriental Woody fragrance exudes power and sophistication.</p>

