<p>Rue Broca Hooked Pour Homme delivers a refined balance of sweet and earthy notes, making it ideal for evening wear and colder months. The fragrance captures an aura of confidence and elegance, making a statement wherever you go. For men who enjoy strong, long-lasting scents with a touch of sweetness, this is the perfect choice to elevate your fragrance collection.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Rue Broca",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,1899.00,5000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rue-Broca-Hooked.png?v=1779880336,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
rue-broca-theoreme-pour-femme-90ml-edp,Rue Broca Theoreme Pour Femme 90ml EDP,"<p>Rue Broca Theoreme Pour Femme 90ml EDP – Graceful Elegance in Every Spray 🌸</p>

<p>Rue Broca Theoreme Pour Femme, made in the UAE, is a high-quality, rich-smelling fragrance crafted for women who embrace sophistication and charm. Inspired by the iconic My Way by Giorgio Armani, this perfume captures a timeless essence with its luxurious blend of notes.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Bergamot, Orange Blossom<br>
(A sparkling, citrusy opening that is fresh and uplifting.)<br>
Middle Notes: Jasmine, Tuberose, White Flowers<br>
(A bouquet of delicate florals adds depth and femininity.)<br>
Base Notes: Woody Notes, Vanilla, Musk<br>
(A warm, sensual base that lingers beautifully.)</p>

<p>The fragrance opens with a burst of vibrant bergamot and the soft sweetness of orange blossom, creating an inviting and luminous start. Its heart reveals a stunning blend of jasmine, tuberose, and white flowers, enveloping you in elegance. The base is grounded with warm woody notes, creamy vanilla, and sensual musk, leaving a captivating and long-lasting trail.</p>

<p>Rue Broca Theoreme Pour Femme is the epitome of grace and sophistication, making it perfect for any occasion. Few fragrances can rival its allure, making it a must-have for your collection.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","best seller, Full, Rue Broca",true,Size,90ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,1899.00,5000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rue-Broca-Theoreme-Pour-Femme.png?v=1779880334,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
