roger-gallet-open-black-100ml-perfume,Roger & Gallet Open Black 100ml Perfume,"Roger &amp; Gallet Open Black Eau de Toilette 100ml – Elegance Redefined 🌟

Immerse yourself in the timeless sophistication of Roger &amp; Gallet Open Black, an aromatic masterpiece crafted for the modern gentleman. Made in France, this long-lasting fragrance exudes confidence and charm, perfect for those who seek refinement in every stride.

Fragrance Notes:

Top Notes: Bergamot, Lemon, Lavender
(A refreshing burst of citrusy brightness and aromatic allure sets an invigorating tone.)
Middle Notes: Sage, Thyme
(The heart reveals a herbaceous blend, adding depth and a touch of classic masculinity.)
Base Notes: Tobacco, Patchouli, Vetiver
(A warm, earthy foundation creates a rich, lingering trail of sophistication.)

Ideal for evening occasions or cooler seasons, Open Black embodies the essence of effortless style. With its captivating blend of fresh, herbaceous, and smoky notes, it is more than just a scent—it is an invitation to leave a lasting impression.

Discover the power of French perfumery with Roger &amp; Gallet Open Black—a fragrance that defines elegance and masculinity.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Roger & Gallet",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1899.00,1999.00,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Roger-Gallet-Open-Black.png?v=1779880289,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
roger-gallet-open-gold-100ml-perfume,Roger & Gallet Open Gold 100ml Perfume,"Roger &amp; Gallet Open Gold Perfume for Women 100ml – A Timeless Elegance ✨

