riiffs-la-femme-bloom-100ml-edp,Riiffs La Femme Bloom 100ml EDP,"<p>Riiffs La Femme Bloom EDP 100ml – Elegance in Full Bloom 🌸✨Crafted in the UAE, La Femme Bloom by Riiffs is a sophisticated Eau de Parfum for women who embrace passion, grace, and confidence. This long-lasting scent unfolds like a love story—intoxicatingly sweet, yet grounded with elegance.<br>
