Fragrance Notes:Top Notes: Strawberry, Raspberry🍓 A bright burst of juicy berries creates a playful and flirty opening.<br>
Middle Notes: Peony, Jasmine🌺 Soft florals emerge at the heart, infusing the scent with femininity and timeless charm.<br>
Base Notes: Patchouli, Musk, Vanilla, Oakmoss🌿 A sensual, warm base of earthy patchouli, creamy vanilla, and musk leaves a luxurious, lingering trail.<br>
Perfect for day or evening wear, this fragrance is an expression of elegance and allure. Whether you're heading to a brunch or a moonlit dinner, La Femme Bloom leaves a lasting impression—romantic, radiant, and unforgettable. 💕</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Riiffs, Women",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,1980.00,2199.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Riiffs-La-Femme-Bloom-100ml-EDP-for-women.png?v=1779880267,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,all-riffs-perfumes-15-off,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
