Riiffs Ciao Pour Femme is a true Oriental fragrance, crafted for the woman who exudes confidence and elegance. Its warm, floral, and sweet composition is perfect for evening wear or special occasions, leaving a trail of allure wherever you go. Elevate your fragrance collection with Riiffs Ciao Pour Femme—a blend of luxury and charm that will make every moment memorable.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Riiffs, Women",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1980.00,2199.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Riiffs-Ciao-Pour-Femme.png?v=1779880223,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,all-riffs-perfumes-15-off,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
riiffs-mystere-80ml-edp,Riiffs Mystere 80ml EDP,"<p>Riiffs Mystere 80ml EDP For Women – Elegant Floral Allure 🌸</p>

