<p>Riiffs Mystere is an ideal choice for those who appreciate the beauty of a Floral fragrance. Its delicate yet powerful blend makes it perfect for daytime wear, adding an aura of elegance to any occasion. This scent is not only memorable but also a must-have for those who love luxury. Add a touch of timeless floral beauty to your collection with Riiffs Mystere.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Riiffs, Women",true,Size,80ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1980.00,2199.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Riiffs-Mystere.png?v=1779880221,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,all-riffs-perfumes-15-off,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
riiffs-bella-rouge-intenso-100ml-edp,Riiffs Bella Rouge Intenso 100ml EDP,"<p>RiiFFS Bella Rouge Intenso For Women 100ml EDP – The Essence of Bold Elegance 🌟</p>

