<p>RiiFFS Bella Rouge Intenso is perfect for evening wear or special occasions, enveloping you in a blend that is both feminine and powerful. Its long-lasting quality ensures you stay fragrant throughout the night, while its Oriental Fougere composition brings warmth and depth to every spray. Embrace luxury and elegance with RiiFFS Bella Rouge Intenso, and make every moment unforgettable.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Riiffs, Women",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,5,deny,manual,1980.00,2199.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/RiiFFS-Bella-Rouge-Intenso.png?v=1779880221,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,all-riffs-perfumes-15-off,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
