riiffs-eyad-100ml-edp,Riiffs Eyad 100ml EDP,"<p>Riffs Eyad 100ml EDP – The Essence of Celebration</p>

<p>Riffs Eyad is an exquisite fragrance that captures the essence of life's vibrant moments. This luxurious scent is more than just a perfume—it's an experience, designed to empower you to own every occasion with style and confidence. Crafted for those who view each day as a celebration, Riffs Eyad is your perfect companion, turning ordinary moments into extraordinary memories.</p>

<p>Inspired by vitality and elegance, this fragrance is for the individual who embraces life boldly. Whether it’s a casual gathering, a brunch date, or an evening celebration, Riffs Eyad ensures you are always at your best—fresh, confident, and unforgettable.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Zesty Bergamot, Sparkling Lemon<br>
(A burst of citrus, energizing you with a lively and uplifting opening that sets the tone for an invigorating experience.)</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Lavish Lavender, Warm Spices<br>
(A sophisticated heart, where floral lavender harmonizes with exotic spices, creating a perfect balance of warmth and elegance.)</p>

<p>Base Notes: Musky Amber, Smooth Sandalwood<br>
(A deep, rich base that leaves a sensual, long-lasting trail, wrapping you in confidence and poise.)</p>

<p>Riffs Eyad is the perfect fragrance for any occasion. Effortlessly stylish and trendy, it keeps you feeling fresh all day long while combating body odors with ease. Its compact, travel-friendly design makes it the ideal companion, no matter where life leads you.</p>

<p>Feel the surge of confidence, stand out with elegance, and enjoy each moment like never before with Riffs Eyad. A fragrance that is not only suited for every occasion but also defines your unique presence.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Riiffs",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,1299.00,1599.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Riiffs-Eyad.png?v=1779880216,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,all-riffs-perfumes-15-off,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
riiffs-inspiro-men-100ml,Riiffs Inspiro Men 100ml,"<p>Riiffs Inspiro Men 100ml – The Essence of Charismatic Confidence ✨<br>
Crafted for the modern gentleman, Riiffs Inspiro Men embodies strength, elegance, and irresistible allure. Made in the UAE, this opulent fragrance is a tribute to bold masculinity, echoing the timeless charm. Inspired by Le Male Le Parfum by Jean Paul Gaultier. A scent that exudes power and sophistication, perfect for the man who commands attention effortlessly.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:<br>
Top Notes: Cardamom, Lavender 🌿 – A striking fusion of spicy cardamom and aromatic lavender creates a fresh yet refined opening, evoking confidence from the very first spritz.<br>
Middle Notes: Tonka Bean, Amber 💫 – The warm depth of tonka bean blends seamlessly with golden amber, adding a rich, sensual heart that captivates the senses.<br>
