riiffs-exclusive-prive-mystique-pink-80ml-edp,Riiffs Exclusive Prive Mystique Pink 80ml EDP,"<p><strong>Riiffs Exclusive Prive Mystique Pink 80ml EDP – Elegant Rose &amp; Warm Spices with Sensual Woods</strong><br><strong>For Women | Floral • Spicy • Woody</strong></p>
<p>Inspired by <strong>Delina by Parfums de Marly</strong>, Riiffs Exclusive Prive Mystique Pink is a sophisticated fragrance that blends radiant florals with warm spices and rich woody accords. Feminine, confident, and effortlessly elegant, it is designed for the woman who leaves a lasting impression wherever she goes.</p>
<h3>Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong><br>Cardamom, Lavandin, Ginger, Pineapple, Nutmeg</p>
<p><strong>Middle Notes:</strong><br>Rose, Licorice, Pepper, Cinnamon, Dry Woods</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong><br>Ambergris, Moss, Vetiver, Patchouli</p>
<h3>Fragrance Experience</h3>
<p>Mystique Pink opens with a lively blend of juicy pineapple, aromatic lavandin, and sparkling ginger, enriched by the warm spice of nutmeg and the resinous freshness of elemi. As it develops, an elegant heart of velvety rose unfolds alongside sweet licorice, warm cinnamon, pepper, and smooth dry woods, creating a refined and captivating character. The fragrance settles into a rich base of ambergris, moss, vetiver, and patchouli, leaving behind a warm, woody, and irresistibly feminine trail.</p>
<h3>Best For</h3>
<p>✔️ Date Nights<br>✔️ Evening Wear<br>✔️ Special Occasions<br>✔️ Fall &amp; Winter Seasons<br>✔️ Women who enjoy elegant floral fragrances with warm spicy and woody depth</p>
<p><strong>Riiffs Exclusive Prive Mystique Pink – graceful, confident, and beautifully unforgettable.</strong></p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Riiffs",true,Size,80ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,3330.00,3699.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Riiffs-Exclusive-Prive-Mystique-Pink.png?v=1779880205,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,all-riffs-perfumes-15-off,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
