riiffs-stella-and-luna-100ml-extrait-de-parfum,Riiffs Stella And Luna 100ml Extrait De Parfum,"<p>💫 Riiffs Stella and Luna 100ml Extrait De Parfum for Women</p>

<p>🌸 Riiffs Stella – The Radiance of Grace ✨</p>

<p>Step into the world of refined femininity with Riiffs Stella, an exquisite Extrait De Parfum crafted in the UAE for the woman who glows with confidence and elegance. Luxurious, sensual, and endlessly sophisticated, Stella celebrates the art of allure with a gourmand floral blend that captivates from the first breath.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Black Currant, Cardamom, Hazelnut, Praline, Milk<br>
An indulgent opening — creamy sweetness meets fruity brightness and warm spice. 🍯🌰</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Jasmine, Rose, Iris, Cacao<br>
A floral heart blooms with romantic richness and soft, velvety depth. 🌸🍫</p>

<p>Base Notes: Lily of the Valley, Ambergris, Musk, Honey, Sandalwood, Patchouli, Vanilla, Tonka<br>
A golden trail of warmth and sophistication lingers — smooth, musky, and irresistibly feminine. 🌼✨</p>

<p>Riiffs Stella is the essence of modern grace — luminous, elegant, and unforgettable.</p>

<p>🌙 Riiffs Luna – The Serenity of Elegance 💙</p>

<p>Discover a fragrance that embodies calm sophistication and celestial beauty. Riiffs Luna is crafted in the UAE for the woman who moves with quiet strength and ethereal charm. Soft yet captivating, it’s a scent that balances purity and sensuality in perfect harmony.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Ozonic Notes, Coconut, Milk<br>
An airy, creamy freshness that feels like a breath of moonlit tranquility. 🌊🥥</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Gardenia, Jasmine, Incense<br>
Elegant white florals bloom with a whisper of mystique and allure. 🌼💫</p>

<p>Base Notes: Musk, Vanilla<br>
A gentle, velvety base leaves a comforting, lingering trail of timeless elegance. 🤍✨</p>

<p>Riiffs Luna is serenity in a bottle — pure, radiant, and beautifully feminine.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","Full, Riiffs",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,5,deny,manual,4860.00,5399.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Riiffs-Stella-And-Luna.png?v=1779880202,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,extrait,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,all-riffs-perfumes-15-off,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
riiffs-surge-and-spectra-100ml-extrait-de-parfum,Riiffs Surge And Spectra 100ml Extrait De Parfum,"<p>⚡ Riiffs Surge and Spectra 100ml Extrait De Parfum for Men</p>

<p>🔥 Riiffs Surge – The Power of Momentum ⚡</p>

<p>Unleash the spirit of confidence and drive with Riiffs Surge, an Extrait De Parfum crafted in the UAE for the modern man who thrives on energy and purpose. Dynamic, fresh, and irresistibly masculine, Surge channels strength through a vibrant fusion of citrus, spice, and wood.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Kumquat, Grapefruit, Pepper<br>
