remy-marquis-pour-femme-100ml-edp,Remy Marquis Pour Femme 100ml EDP,"<p>Marquis by Remy Marquis is a Amber Woody fragrance for women. Marquis was launched in 1999. Remy Marquis Pour Femme is a captivating and long-lasting unisex perfume designed to celebrate the essence of both men and women. This unique fragrance is a harmonious blend of delicate white flowers, exotic oriental notes, and invigorating citruses.At its heart, Remy Marquis Pour Femme showcases the elegance and beauty of white flowers, infusing the perfume with a soft and feminine aura.</p>

<p>These blossoms create an enchanting and alluring effect, capturing the attention of those around you.Complementing the floral notes are the warm and rich scents of sandalwood and patchouli, which add depth and sensuality to the fragrance. These woody and earthy accords enhance the perfume's overall character, exuding a feeling of confidence and allure.To invigorate the senses, Remy Marquis Pour Femme incorporates vibrant citruses that provide a refreshing burst of energy. These zesty and uplifting notes awaken the wearer and those around them, creating an invigorating and joyful atmosphere.Finally, green notes are sprinkled throughout the fragrance, adding a touch of natural freshness and vitality.</p>

<p>These verdant accords harmoniously blend with the other notes, enhancing the overall olfactory experience and creating a unique and memorable scent.Whether worn by men or women, Remy Marquis Pour Femme is a captivating and long-lasting fragrance that leaves an indelible impression. This unisex perfume is perfect for those seeking a harmonious and versatile scent that combines the best of both worlds.</p>

<p>Notes Are - White Flowers, Oriental notes, Sandalwood, Patchouli, Citruses, Green Notes</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Remy Marquis, Women",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1750.00,2000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Remy-Marquis-Pour-Femme-100ml-EDP.png?v=1779880188,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
remy-marquis-reemax-100ml-edt,Remy Marquis Reemax 100ml EDT,"<p>Remy Marquis Reemax 100ml EDT for Men – 🌊 A Fresh Burst of Sophistication</p>

<p>Dive into the world of refreshing elegance with Remy Marquis Reemax Eau de Toilette, a fragrance designed for the modern man who values style and charisma. This 100ml long-lasting scent masterfully balances vibrant citrus with earthy depth, creating an unforgettable aroma that transitions seamlessly from day to night.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:<br>
Top Notes: Grapefruit, Mandarin Orange<br>
(A zesty explosion of citrus greets you with an energizing and uplifting start.)</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Lavender, Basil<br>
(The herbal allure of lavender and basil forms a warm and aromatic heart, radiating confidence and charm.)</p>

