rayhaan-ocean-rush-100ml-edp,Rayhaan Ocean Rush 100ml EDP,"<p>Rayhaan Ocean Rush 100ML EDP For Men: Unleash the Power of the Ocean 🌊</p>

<p>Rayhaan Ocean Rush 100ML EDP is a fragrance that embodies strength, determination, and energy. Made in the UAE with precision and care, this long-lasting perfume is crafted for the modern man who is bold, daring, and unstoppable.</p>

<p>🌟 Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Begin your journey with a refreshing wave of Bergamot, Green Mandarin, Cascalone, and Aquozone. The zesty citrus notes are complemented by the aquatic freshness, creating an invigorating and revitalizing start.<br>
Middle Notes: As the fragrance evolves, Lavender, Lentisk (Gum Mastic), Rosemary, and Cypress emerge, adding depth and character. The herbal and woody blend offers a robust and masculine heart to the scent.<br>
Base Notes: Finally, the scent settles into a rich base of Musk, Patchouli, and Mineral Amber, leaving a lasting impression of sophistication and elegance.</p>

<p>Ocean Rush is more than just a fragrance—it's a statement. The freshness of Green Mandarin energizes your spirit, while Aquozone captures the essence of the ocean. The Mineral Amber adds a refined touch, making Ocean Rush perfect for men who are determined, ambitious, and ready to conquer any challenge. Embrace the power of the ocean with Rayhaan Ocean Rush.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Daily Wear, Full, men, Rayhaan",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,19,deny,manual,1849.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rayhaan-Ocean-Rush-1.png?v=1779880180,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
