<p>Imperia is more than just a fragrance; it’s a statement of triumph and distinction. Its rich and captivating scent is ideal for the man who seeks to conquer life’s challenges with confidence and grace. Whether worn during the day or for a night out, Rayhaan Imperia For Him ensures you leave an unforgettable trail of victory and glory.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, men, Rayhaan",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1750.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rayhaan-Imperia-For-Him.png?v=1779880178,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
