(A warm, earthy base with a hint of spice, creating a bold and captivating finish.)</p>

<p>Rayhaan Ayka’s unique combination of floral, citrus, and woody notes evokes confidence and energy, while maintaining a timeless elegance. Its longevity ensures you leave a lasting impression wherever you go. Whether you're dressing up for a special occasion or seeking an everyday scent, Ayka enhances your natural charm with every spray.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Rayhaan, Women",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1630.00,2490.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rayhaan-Ayka.png?v=1779880171,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
rayhaan-bluetiful-100ml-edp,Rayhaan Bluetiful 100ml EDP,"<p>Rayhaan Bluetiful 100ml EDP For Women – A Long-Lasting, Harmonious Scent 🌟</p>

<p>Rayhaan Bluetiful is a high-quality, rich-smelling fragrance made in the UAE, Inspired by the iconic Eternity by Calvin Klein. This long-lasting perfume is designed for women who value tranquility, elegance, and natural beauty. With its refreshing and harmonious blend of notes, Bluetiful evokes the coolness of the azure sea and the soothing embrace of a summer breeze.</p>

