<p>Bluetiful is more than just a fragrance; it's a celebration of a woman’s grace, tenderness, and sensuality. Its delicate yet lasting scent enhances the wearer’s natural beauty, making it the perfect choice for any occasion. Embrace the essence of peace and elegance with Rayhaan Bluetiful.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Rayhaan, Women",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,1630.00,2490.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rayhaan-Bluetiful-2.png?v=1779880169,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
rayhaan-pretty-in-pink-100ml-edp,Rayhaan Pretty In Pink 100ml EDP,"<p>Rayhaan Pretty In Pink 100ml EDP For Women – A Luxurious, Long-Lasting Fragrance 🌸</p>

<p>Unveil your femininity with Rayhaan Pretty In Pink 100ml EDP, a premium fragrance made in the UAE that exudes elegance and charm. This long-lasting perfume perfectly blends delicate florals and warm, sensual notes, making it a perfect choice for every woman who wants to make a lasting impression.</p>

