<p>Pretty in Pink embodies romance and femininity with its delicate yet bold character. The enchanting blend of Blackcurrant, May rose, and Ambroxan creates a fragrance that is both soft and powerful. It emphasizes the elegance and strength of its wearer, leaving behind an aura of mystery and allure. Whether it’s for a special occasion or daily wear, this high-quality, rich-smelling fragrance will keep you feeling confident and feminine all day long. Embrace your inner elegance with Rayhaan Pretty In Pink.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Rayhaan, Women",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1630.00,2490.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rayhaan-Pretty-In-Pink.png?v=1779880168,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
rayhaan-floriana-100ml-edp,Rayhaan Floriana 100ml EDP,"<p>Rayhaan Floriana 100ml EDP For Women – A Fragrance of Timeless Elegance 🌸</p>

