<p>Inspired by the scent of orange blossom and bergamot, Floriana exudes a spring-like freshness while evoking a sense of endless feminine beauty and energy. Perfect for everyday wear or special occasions, this fragrance envelops you in a feeling of grace and elegance that lasts throughout the day. Embrace the lightness and sophistication of Rayhaan Floriana – a scent that embodies timeless femininity.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","best seller, Full, Rayhaan, Women",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,20,deny,manual,1630.00,2490.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rayhaan-Floriana.png?v=1779880166,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,floral,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,rayhaan-floriana-flat-100-off,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
rayhaan-dahliya-100ml-edp,Rayhaan Dahliya 100ml EDP,"<p>Rayhaan Dahliya 100ml EDP For Women – A Dream of Elegance and Freshness 🌸</p>

