Valhalla captures the essence of paradise — smooth, woody, and seductively boozy. Perfect for night-outs, festive occasions, or when you simply want to feel divine. ✨A masterpiece for those who dare to live like legends.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Rayhaan",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,2685.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rayhaan-Valhalla.png?v=1779880152,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
