Middle Notes: Patchouli, Coriander, Anise, Cumin, Geranium, Saffron, Orange Blossom, Wormwood, RoseA complex heart reveals a spicy, herbal richness with Patchouli, Coriander, and Anise. Saffron’s golden warmth intertwines with the delicate floral notes of Rose and Orange Blossom, while Geranium and Wormwood add a touch of earthy mystery. 🌹🌿🌸<br>
Base Notes: Vanilla, Frankincense, Benzoin, Amber, Opoponax, Labdanum, Maltol, Birch, Musk, Oud, AmbergrisThe dry-down is an opulent blend of Vanilla and Frankincense, balanced with the rich depth of Amber, Benzoin, and Oud. Smoky Birch, sensual Musk, and the rare touch of Ambergris create a powerful, long-lasting finish — one that commands attention and lingers in the air like a whisper of untamed wilderness. 🌲🔥💨<br>
Rayhaan Terra is an exclusive fragrance for the man who dares to embrace his wild side while exuding refined strength and sophistication. Perfect for evening wear, special occasions, or whenever you wish to leave a lasting, unforgettable impression. 🌟</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Men, Rayhaan",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,44,deny,manual,2799.00,4500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rayhaan-Terra.png?v=1779880146,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
rayhaan-kiss-100ml-edp,Rayhaan Kiss 100ml EDP,"Rayhaan Kiss 100ML EDP For Women – Sweet Temptation, Creamy Desire 💋🌸Radiant • Tropical • Sensual
