ralph-lauren-polo-blue-125ml-edp,Ralph Lauren Polo Blue 125ml EDP,"<p>Ralph Lauren Polo Blue 125ml Eau de Parfum for Men: A Voyage of Fresh Elegance and Timeless Appeal</p>

<p>Embark on a sensory journey with Ralph Lauren Polo Blue Eau de Parfum, a fragrance that encapsulates the essence of sophistication and charisma. Launched in 2016 and crafted by the renowned perfumer Carlos Benaim, this 125ml EDP stands as an iconic representation of the Ralph Lauren legacy.</p>

<p>Top Notes – A Maritime Prelude: Polo Blue Eau de Parfum opens with a refreshing burst of sea notes, bergamot, and cardamom. The invigorating sea notes evoke the crispness of ocean air, while bergamot and cardamom add a citrusy and spicy dimension, creating an uplifting symphony that awakens the senses.</p>

<p>Middle Notes – Herbaceous Harmony: As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes unveil a herbaceous blend of basil, verbena, clary sage, and orris. This aromatic accord introduces a green and earthy dimension, lending Polo Blue EDP a balanced complexity that resonates with timeless charm.</p>

<p>Base Notes – A Trail of Distinctive Sophistication: The journey concludes with a warm and grounding embrace of suede, vetiver, woodsy notes, and patchouli. The combination of these base notes imparts a subtle sensuality and depth to the fragrance, leaving a lasting impression that seamlessly complements the wearer's natural allure.</p>

<p>A Woody Aromatic Masterpiece: Polo Blue Eau de Parfum, classified as a Woody Aromatic fragrance, perfectly encapsulates the Ralph Lauren ethos of refined elegance. Its harmonious blend of woody and aromatic elements creates an olfactory masterpiece that transcends time and trends.</p>

<p>🛒 Discover Fragrance Excellence at Fragstalk.in: Elevate your fragrance experience with 100% original niche and designer fragrances. Fragstalk.in, your go-to destination for all fragrance needs in India, offers a curated selection at amazing prices.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Men, Ralph Lauren",true,Size,125ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,5999.00,9500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Ralph-Lauren-polo-blue.png?v=1779880142,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
ralph-lauren-polo-green-118ml-edt,Ralph Lauren Polo Green 118ml EDT,"<p>Ralph Lauren Polo Green 118ml EDT For Men: A Timeless Ode to Classic Elegance</p>

<p>Step into a world of refined masculinity with Ralph Lauren Polo Green, a fragrance that epitomizes the spirit of enduring sophistication. Launched in 1978 by the skilled nose of Carlos Benaim, this iconic 118ml Eau De Toilette for men has stood the test of time, becoming a timeless classic in the realm of fragrances.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: The journey commences with a burst of freshness, a symphony of juniper berries, basil, artemisia, caraway, coriander, and bergamot. This invigorating blend sets the stage for the olfactory experience that follows.<br>
Middle Notes: As the fragrance evolves, the heart reveals an intricate blend of pine tree needles, leather, chamomile, pepper, carnation, geranium, jasmine, and rose. This aromatic medley creates a rich and dynamic core that captures the essence of Polo Green.<br>
Base Notes: The grand finale unfolds with a base that exudes warmth and depth. Tobacco, oakmoss, patchouli, cedar, vetiver, musk, and amber converge to create a lingering trail of timeless sophistication. A harmonious blend that resonates with both tradition and modernity.</p>

<p>A Woody Chypre Masterpiece: Ralph Lauren Polo Green stands as a testament to the Woody Chypre fragrance family, a category that embodies the union of earthy and citrusy notes. This composition elevates the wearer into an aura of natural elegance, making it the perfect choice for those who appreciate classic, yet contemporary, aromas.</p>

<p>Carlos Benaim's Timeless Creation: Crafted by the renowned perfumer Carlos Benaim, Polo Green transcends trends, offering a fragrance experience that defies the constraints of time. Each spritz encapsulates a journey through the ages, a celebration of enduring style and sophistication.</p>

<p>🛒 Discover Fragrance Excellence at Fragstalk.in: Elevate your fragrance experience with 100% original niche and designer fragrances. Fragstalk.in, your go-to destination for all fragrance needs in India, offers a curated selection at amazing prices.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Full, Ralph Lauren",true,Size,118ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,5499.00,9000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Ralph-Lauren-Polo-Green.png?v=1779880143,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
prada-paradoxe-90ml-edp,Prada Paradoxe 90ml EDP,"Prada Paradoxe 90ml Eau De Parfum – Radiant Floral Amber with Modern Sweet Elegance 🌸✨🍐For Women | Floral • Amber • Fresh • Sweet
Prada Paradoxe is a sophisticated and contemporary feminine fragrance that celebrates contrasts—fresh yet warm, delicate yet bold. It opens with luminous fruits, blossoms into an elegant white floral heart, and settles into a soft, sensual base. Refined and versatile, it feels effortlessly modern with a timeless allure.
Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Pear, Tangerine &amp; Bergamot 🍐🍊🍋The opening is bright and sparkling. Juicy pear adds a crisp sweetness, while tangerine and bergamot bring a zesty citrus freshness that feels clean, uplifting, and radiant.
Heart Notes: Orange Blossom, Neroli Essence, Neroli &amp; Jasmine Sambac 🌼🌸✨At the heart, the fragrance reveals its floral signature. Orange blossom shines with a soft, luminous sweetness, enhanced by the fresh green facets of neroli. Jasmine sambac adds a creamy, sensual richness, creating a beautifully balanced floral bouquet.
Base Notes: Bourbon Vanilla, Amber, White Musk &amp; Benzoin 🍦🔥🌫️The dry-down is warm, smooth, and addictive. Bourbon vanilla adds a rich creamy sweetness, amber brings depth and glow, while white musk and benzoin wrap the scent in a soft, long-lasting, slightly resinous warmth.
Perfect for both day and evening, all seasons, and elegant everyday wear, Paradoxe is a signature scent that feels both fresh and deeply feminine.
✨ Prada Paradoxe – a graceful harmony of luminous florals, creamy sweetness, and modern warmth.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Prada, Women",true,Size,90ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,10499.00,19999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Prada-Paradoxe.png?v=1779880140,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
playboy-play-it-wild-100ml-edt,Playboy Play It Wild 100ml EDT,"<p>Playboy Play It Wild for Him 100ml EDT – Unleash Your Wild Side 🌟</p>

<p>Experience the daring allure of Playboy Play It Wild for Him, a captivating fragrance for men that exudes confidence and charm. Made in the United States, this dynamic scent is perfect for those who live boldly and stand out in any crowd.</p>

