(A warm and sensual foundation that leaves a lasting impression.)</p>

<p>Just a few spritzes in the morning create a refreshing rush of citrus, seamlessly transitioning into sweet, spicy, and masculine undertones. The fragrance is housed in an attractive flacon, adorned with a bold military-print bunny design, making it as stylish as it is intriguing.</p>

<p>Whether you’re heading out for a casual day or an exciting night, Playboy Play It Wild keeps you at the top of the pack. Unleash your wild side with this irresistible scent that guarantees to leave a trail of admiration.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Full, Men, Playboy",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,935.00,1500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Playboy-Play-It-Wild-for-Him.png?v=1779880139,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
