pierre-cardin-vertige-deodorant-200ml,Pierre Cardin Vertige Deodorant 200ml,"<p>Pierre Cardin Vertige Deodorant 200ml for Men – Fresh, Energizing, and Refined 🍋🌿</p>

<p>Pierre Cardin Vertige Deodorant offers a vibrant, sophisticated scent perfect for the modern man. It blends citrus, herbs, and warm woods to keep you fresh and confident all day.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Lemon, Cyclamen, and Granny Smith Apple<br>
A fresh, zesty opening with citrus and green apple, enhanced by light floral hints.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Tarragon, Nutmeg, and Lavender<br>
A spicy, herbal heart with nutmeg and tarragon, softened by calming lavender.</p>

<p>Base Notes: Cedar and Peru Balm<br>
A warm, woody base with earthy cedar and sweet, balsamic Peru balm.</p>

<p>Ideal for daily wear, this deodorant exudes energy, elegance, and lasting freshness.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Deodorant, Full, Pierre Cardin",true,Size,200ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,599.00,1095.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Pierre-Cardin-Vertige-Deodorant-men.png?v=1779880135,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
pierre-cardin-bleu-marine-deodorant-200ml,Pierre Cardin Bleu Marine Deodorant 200ml,"<p>Pierre Cardin Bleu Marine Deodorant 200ml – Refreshing Masculinity 🌊💙</p>

<p>Pierre Cardin Bleu Marine Deodorant offers an invigorating fragrance experience that captures the essence of the ocean’s freshness. Designed for the modern man who exudes confidence, it blends aromatic herbs with citrus and green nuances, offering a sophisticated touch that lasts all day.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Artemisia, Green Notes, Bergamot<br>
(The opening is refreshing and vibrant, with a crisp burst of citrus from Bergamot, beautifully balanced by the aromatic, slightly herbaceous touch of Artemisia and the freshness of green notes.)</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Clary Sage, Basil<br>
(The heart reveals a clean, herbal warmth from Clary Sage, complemented by the rich, slightly spicy edge of Basil, adding depth and an earthy charm.)</p>

<p>Base Notes: Woody Notes<br>
(The base adds a warm, grounding effect with smooth, woody accords that evoke a sense of stability and timeless elegance.)</p>

<p>With its fresh, herbal complexity, Bleu Marine Deodorant is perfect for daily wear, evoking a sense of freedom and vitality. Ideal for warm weather or an active lifestyle, it promises to keep you feeling fresh and confident, no matter the challenge ahead.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Deodorant, Full, Pierre Cardin",true,Size,200ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,599.00,1095.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Pierre-Cardin-Bleu-Marine-Deodorant-Men.png?v=1779880134,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
pendora-scents-flawsome-100ml-edp,Pendora Scents Flawsome 100ml EDP,"<p>Pendora Scents presents ""Flawsome,"" a captivating fragrance designed for the modern, confident woman. This 100ml Eau de Parfum is a harmonious blend of floral and citrus notes, evoking an air of sophistication and charm.</p>

<p>At first spritz, Flawsome opens with a burst of vibrant energy. The top notes dance on your skin with the enchanting essence of peony, lending a sweet and delicate aura. Citruses and mandarin orange add a zesty, sparkling twist, instantly uplifting your spirits. It's as if a bouquet of freshly bloomed flowers meets the sun-kissed zest of citrus groves.</p>

<p>As Flawsome evolves, the heart of the fragrance reveals a romantic symphony. Osmanthus and rose intertwine gracefully, exuding an alluring and feminine aroma. The osmanthus brings a fruity apricot-like sweetness, while the rose infuses a timeless, elegant charm. This combination creates a floral masterpiece that is both tender and passionate.</p>

<p>The base notes of sandalwood, patchouli, and pink pepper ground Flawsome with a warm and sensual embrace. Sandalwood provides a creamy, woody depth, while patchouli adds an earthy richness. Pink pepper adds a subtle hint of spiciness, creating a captivating contrast that lingers on your skin.</p>

<p>Flawsome, with its impeccable blend of notes, captures the essence of elegance and grace. This fragrance is Inspired by the iconic Flora by Gucci Eau de Parfum, reimagined for the modern woman who embodies both her flaws and her awesomeness with confidence. It's a fragrance that tells a story of individuality and timeless beauty, making it a must-have for every woman's collection.</p>

<p>Top notes are Peony, Citruses and Mandarin Orange</p>

<p>Middle notes are Osmanthus and Rose</p>

<p>Base notes are Sandalwood, Patchouli and Pink Pepper.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","best seller, Date Night Picks, Full, Pendora Scents",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,5,deny,manual,1349.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Pendora-Scents-Flawsome-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779880133,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,'1,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
pendora-scents-la-nuit-pendora-100ml-edp,Pendora Scents La Nuit Pendora 100ml EDP,"<p>Pendora Scents' La Nuit Pendora, a captivating fragrance that weaves a tale of sophistication and sensuality. This 100ml Eau de Parfum for women is a symphony of notes that linger, making it a true testament to its super long-lasting formula.</p>

<p>At the top, La Nuit Pendora opens with a burst of freshness, combining the succulence of Pear, the zestiness of Tangerine, and the timeless allure of Bergamot. This initial impression sets the stage for a journey into the heart of the fragrance, where Strawberry, Vanilla Orchid, Black Rose, and Passionfruit interlace in a dance of sweet, floral, and fruity harmonies. The middle notes create a luscious and romantic aura that is both alluring and unforgettable.</p>

<p>Top: Pear, Tangerine and Bergamot</p>

<p>Middle: Vanilla orchid, Strawberry, Black, Rose and Passionfruit</p>

<p>Base: Praline, Caramel, Litchi, Patchouli, Vanilla,</p>

<p>As the fragrance unfolds further, the base notes come into play, leaving an indelible impression. A rich and complex blend of Praline, Caramel, Litchi, Vanilla, Patchouli, Incense, Coffee, Licorice, Coumarin, and Papyrus creates a deep and mysterious foundation. This amalgamation of scents lends La Nuit Pendora a unique signature, reminiscent of the luxurious La Nuit Trésor by Lancôme.</p>

<p>What makes La Nuit Pendora truly exceptional is its ability to capture the essence of a high-end fragrance at a fraction of the cost. This perfume is not merely a scent; it's an experience that unfolds over time, leaving an enchanting trail wherever you go. Indulge in the opulence of La Nuit Pendora – a budget-friendly masterpiece that mirrors the allure of the iconic La Nuit Trésor.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Pendora Scents, Women",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,1345.00,2999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/la-nuit-pendora.png?v=1779880132,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
pendora-scents-saviour-elixir-100ml-edp,Pendora Scents Saviour Elixir 100ml EDP,"<p>Pendora Scents introduces the Saviour Elixir, a 100ml Eau de Parfum designed for the modern man who seeks an enduring olfactory experience. This fragrance is not just a scent; it's a statement, a lingering essence that defines and elevates.</p>

<p>The top notes of Nutmeg, Cinnamon, Cardamom, and Grapefruit weave together a spicy and citrusy overture, setting the stage for a fragrance that is as dynamic as it is sophisticated. As the scent develops, a singular middle note of Lavender emerges, introducing a touch of floral elegance that adds depth and balance.</p>

<p>What truly distinguishes Saviour Elixir is its impressive longevity. This perfume is crafted to endure, offering a fragrance journey that lasts throughout the day and transcends fleeting moments. The base notes of Licorice, Sandalwood, Amber, Patchouli, and Haitian Vetiver intertwine to create a rich and robust foundation. Sandalwood and Amber provide a warm, woody embrace, while Patchouli and Vetiver add a touch of earthiness and depth. The inclusion of Licorice introduces a subtle sweetness, rounding off the composition with a unique and memorable signature.</p>

<p>Top: Cinnamon, Nutmeg, Cardamom, Grapefruit</p>

<p>Middle: Lavender</p>

<p>Base: Licorice, Sandalwood, Amber, Patchouli, Haitian Vetiver</p>

<p>Pendora Scents takes pride in presenting Saviour Elixir as a remarkable alternative to the luxurious Sauvage Elixir by Dior. This creation pays homage to the iconic fragrance, capturing its essence and sophistication at a fraction of the price. It stands as a testament to the brand's commitment to offering high-quality, long-lasting scents that make a lasting impression. Saviour Elixir is more than a fragrance; it's a revelation, a sensory journey that unfolds with each passing hour, leaving an indelible mark of style and distinction.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Pendora Scents",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1345.00,2999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/pendora-scents-saviour-elixir.png?v=1779880131,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
pendora-scents-night-of-the-man-100ml-edp,Pendora Scents Night Of The Man 100ml EDP,"<p>Introducing Pandora Scents Night Of The Man, a captivating olfactory experience that transcends time with its powerful and enduring allure. This 100ML Eau de Parfum for men is not just a fragrance; it's a journey through the night, an embodiment of sophistication and mystery. Unleashing an intense and long-lasting aroma, it becomes a companion for those who seek to make a lasting impression.</p>

<p>The top note of Cardamom introduces a spicy warmth, setting the stage for a mesmerizing aromatic journey. As the night unfolds, the middle notes of Lavender, Virginia Cedar, and Bergamot intertwine seamlessly, creating a harmonious blend that exudes refinement and charm. Lavender adds a touch of floral elegance, while Virginia Cedar brings a woody depth that resonates with the wearer's inner strength. Bergamot, with its citrusy brightness, adds a dash of zest to this symphony of scents.</p>

<p>The base notes of Vetiver and Caraway anchor the fragrance with a sensual and earthy richness. Vetiver, known for its smoky and sweet facets, adds a layer of complexity, while Caraway contributes a hint of spice, completing the fragrance with an irresistible depth.</p>

<p>Top note is Cardamom</p>

<p>Middle notes are Lavender, Virginia Cedar and Bergamot</p>

<p>Base notes are Vetiver and Caraway.</p>

<p>Pendora Scents Night Of The Man proudly embraces its identity as a remarkable alternative to the renowned La Nuit de l'Homme by Yves Saint Laurent. This fragrance mirrors the sophistication and allure of its expensive counterpart, offering a budget-friendly option without compromising on quality. Immerse yourself in the enigmatic essence of the night, leaving an indelible mark with a scent that lingers in the air long after you've departed. With Pendora Scents Night Of The Man, the night is yours to command.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Men, Pendora Scents",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1345.00,2999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Pendora-Scents-Night-Of-The-Man.png?v=1779880130,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
pendora-scents-azul-pour-homme-100ml-edp,Pendora Scents Azul Pour Homme 100ml EDP,"<p>Pendora Scents Azul Pour Homme, a captivating olfactory journey encapsulated in a 100ML Eau de Parfum for men, promising an enduring fragrance experience that stands the test of time. This aromatic symphony opens with a distinctive blend of top notes, where the warm embrace of Cardamom mingles seamlessly with the rich, woody allure of Sandalwood. The initial burst sets the stage for an olfactory expedition that unfolds with unparalleled longevity.</p>

<p>In the heart of Azul Pour Homme, a masterful composition of Middle notes takes center stage. The spicy essence of Ginger, the crisp freshness of Juniper, and the exotic touch of Galanga converge to create a harmonious blend that exudes sophistication and dynamism. This multifaceted core adds depth and complexity to the fragrance, ensuring a memorable trail wherever you go.</p>

<p>As the fragrance evolves, the Base notes emerge, leaving an indelible impression. A fusion of Tobacco Blossom introduces a hint of sweetness, artfully balanced by the robust and earthy aroma of Teak Wood. Green Leaves add a touch of nature, creating a captivating final act that lingers on the skin, making Pendora Scents Azul Pour Homme a signature scent for the modern man.</p>

<p>Top: Cardamom, Sandalwood</p>

<p>Middle: Ginger, Juniper, Galanga</p>

<p>Base: Tobacco blossom, Teak Wood, Green Leaves</p>

<p>Notably, Azul Pour Homme pays homage to the iconic BLV Pour Homme by Bvlgari, presenting itself as an exquisite Inspired that captures the essence of the renowned and expensive fragrance. This makes Azul Pour Homme not only a testament to craftsmanship but also an affordable indulgence for those seeking luxury in every spritz. Elevate your senses with this enduring and evocative fragrance, a beacon of style and refinement in the realm of men's perfumery.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Men, Pendora Scents",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1345.00,2999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/pendora-scents-azul.png?v=1779880128,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
pendora-scents-bombinate-100ml-edp,Pendora Scents Bombinate 100ml EDP,"<p>Pendora Scents Bombinate For Women, a captivating olfactory symphony that transcends time with its enduring allure. Encased in a sleek 100ML Eau de Parfum flacon, this fragrance is more than a scent; it's an experience that lingers throughout the day, a testament to its exceptional longevity.</p>

<p>At the forefront of Bombinate's aromatic journey are invigorating top notes that dance on the senses. Passionfruit, Grapefruit, Pineapple, Tangerine, and Big Strawberry interweave to create a vibrant opening that is both sweet and citrusy, setting the stage for the olfactory masterpiece that follows.</p>

<p>The heart of this fragrance unveils a floral tapestry, where Peony, Vanilla Orchid, Red Berries, Jasmine, and Lily-of-the-Valley converge. This harmonious blend evokes a sense of femininity and sophistication, captivating those around you with its subtle yet enchanting presence.</p>

