paris-belle-mahraa-100ml-extrait-de-parfum,Paris Belle Mahraa 100ml Extrait De Parfum,"<p>Paris Belle Mahraa – A Bold Symphony of Fruit, Spice, and Warmth 🍑✨100ml Extrait de Parfum for Women<br>
Paris Belle Mahraa is a fragrance that exudes sophistication, passion, and a touch of mystery. This exquisite extrait de parfum is crafted for the confident woman who embraces both elegance and adventure. The scent unfolds like a captivating story, starting with the fresh vibrancy of fruit, transitioning to an aromatic heart of spices and tobacco, and settling into a rich, warm base of amber, oud, and patchouli. Each note layers beautifully, creating a fragrance that’s as bold as it is luxurious.<br>
Fragrance NotesTop Notes: Peach, Apple, CassisThe journey begins with a burst of juicy peach, crisp apple, and the sweet tang of cassis. This fruity opening is refreshing yet enticing, creating an immediate sense of brightness and energy. 🍑🍏🍇<br>
Heart Notes: Saffron, Spicy Accords, TobaccoAs the fragrance develops, the heart reveals an exotic blend of saffron and spicy accords, balanced by the smoky warmth of tobacco. The result is an intriguing, seductive combination that adds depth and complexity to the fragrance. 🌶️💨<br>
Base Notes: Amber, Oud, PatchouliThe base is a rich, opulent mix of amber’s golden warmth, the deep intensity of oud, and the earthy allure of patchouli. Together, they create a sensual, long-lasting trail that lingers and captivates, evoking a sense of luxury and mystery. 🌑🌿💫<br>
Paris Belle Mahraa is for the woman who knows her worth and isn’t afraid to make a statement. This fragrance is a beautiful contradiction—fruity yet smoky, sweet yet spicy—making it the perfect companion for any occasion where you want to shine with confidence and allure. Bold, elegant, and unforgettable. ✨🌹</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","Full, Paris Belle",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,2599.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Belle-Mahraa.webp?v=1780381549,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,extrait,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,paris-belle-flat-300-off,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-belle-promesse-100ml-extrait-de-parfum,Paris Belle Promesse 100ml Extrait De Parfum,"<p>Paris Belle Promesse – A Fresh, Invigorating Promise of Elegance and Strength 🍋🌿100ml Extrait de Parfum for Men and Women<br>
Paris Belle Promesse is a fragrance that beautifully balances freshness with sophistication, making it the perfect scent for both men and women who appreciate a crisp, vibrant, and timeless allure. This exquisite extrait de parfum opens with a burst of citrus and tropical fruits, giving way to a soft floral heart, and settles into a warm, grounding base of rich woods and musk. The result is a fragrance that is both refreshing and powerful, with a promise of elegance and lasting allure.<br>
Fragrance NotesTop Notes: Lemon, Green Mandarin, PineappleThe fragrance opens with a bright, zesty blend of lemon and green mandarin, accompanied by the tropical sweetness of pineapple. This opening is crisp and uplifting, creating an instant sense of energy and freshness. 🍋🍊🍍<br>
Middle Notes: Marine, Cardamom, Muguet (Lily of the Valley)As the fragrance develops, the heart reveals a delicate balance of marine notes, evoking the fresh, breezy scent of the sea, complemented by the warm spice of cardamom and the floral elegance of lily of the valley (muguet). This creates a refined, clean blend that feels both invigorating and serene. 🌊🌺<br>
Base Notes: Leather, Musk, Ambergris, SandalwoodThe dry-down is rich and sophisticated, with the earthy warmth of leather, sensual musk, and the deep, animalic richness of ambergris. Sandalwood adds a creamy, woody smoothness to the base, grounding the fragrance in elegance and depth. 🪵🐾<br>
Paris Belle Promesse is for those who seek a fragrance that is both invigorating and deeply refined. It’s a scent that promises freshness and sophistication in equal measure, with a lasting presence that lingers throughout the day. Perfect for both daytime and evening wear, this fragrance is a timeless promise of elegance, balance, and unforgettable charm. ✨🌙</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","Full, Paris Belle",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,2599.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Belle-Promesse.png?v=1779880065,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,extrait,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,paris-belle-flat-300-off,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-belle-ombrelle-100ml-extrait-de-parfum,Paris Belle Ombrelle 100ml Extrait De Parfum,"<p>Paris Belle Ombrelle – A Mesmerizing Dance of Oud, Spice, and Floral Elegance 🌹✨100ml Extrait de Parfum for Men, Inspired by Ombre Nomade by Louis Vuitton<br>
Paris Belle Ombrelle is a fragrance that masterfully blends the richness of oud with the soft beauty of florals and the warmth of spices, creating a scent that is as captivating as it is sophisticated. Designed for both men and women who appreciate depth and complexity, this extrait de parfum envelops you in a veil of elegance and mystery. With its unique fusion of incense, raspberry, and amberwood, Ombrelle offers an olfactory experience that is both intoxicating and refined—perfect for those who crave something truly special.<br>
Fragrance NotesTop Notes: Agarwood, Incense, RoseThe journey begins with the bold richness of agarwood (oud) and smoky incense, creating a mysterious, almost sacred atmosphere. A soft touch of rose adds a layer of elegance and freshness, making the opening both powerful and beautifully balanced. 🌹🔥🌿<br>
Middle Notes: Raspberry, SaffronAs the fragrance evolves, the heart reveals a vibrant yet sensual blend of ripe raspberry and exotic saffron. The fruitiness of raspberry adds a juicy sweetness, while the warmth and spice of saffron bring depth and complexity, making the heart of this fragrance both inviting and intriguing. 🍇✨<br>
Base Notes: Amberwood, Birch, Benzoin, GeraniumThe base settles into a luxurious blend of amberwood and birch, creating a smoky, woody foundation that feels both strong and refined. Benzoin adds a sweet, resinous warmth, while geranium adds a subtle, herbaceous freshness that rounds out the composition beautifully. 🌲💨🌺<br>
Paris Belle Ombrelle is a scent for those who love fragrances that are bold yet refined, sophisticated yet warm. It’s an intoxicating blend that feels at once timeless and modern, with a complexity that lingers long after the first spray. Ideal for evening wear, special occasions, or whenever you want to leave a lasting impression, this fragrance is an exquisite expression of depth, elegance, and unforgettable allure. ✨🖤</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","Full, Paris Belle",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,2599.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Belle-Ombrelli.png?v=1780381596,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,extrait,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,paris-belle-flat-300-off,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
