nusuk-ajwaa-roses-100ml-edp,Nusuk Ajwaa Roses 100ml EDP,"<p>Nusuk Ajwaa Roses 100ml EDP For Women – A Symphony of Elegance and Romance 🌹</p>

<p>Experience the allure of Nusuk Ajwaa Roses, a high-quality, rich-smelling fragrance crafted in the UAE. This luxurious Eau De Parfum captures the essence of femininity with its enchanting blend of lush florals, sweet vanilla, and warm woody undertones. Perfect for women who seek a romantic and sophisticated scent, Ajwaa Roses is an ideal choice for both special occasions and daily indulgence.</p>

