nusuk-fawah-80ml-edp,Nusuk Fawah 80ml EDP,"Nusuk Fawah 80ml EDP for Men — A Bold Fusion of Fresh Energy, Futuristic Warmth &amp; Magnetic Masculinity ✨⚡🔥






Nusuk Fawah is crafted for the man who thrives on confidence, charisma, and modern edge. Inspired by the electrifying spirit of Phantom by Rabanne, this fragrance blends zesty freshness with aromatic depth and warm sensuality—creating an aura that feels both innovative and irresistibly masculine. Dynamic, smooth, and undeniably captivating, Fawah is made for the man who wants to stand out with style and leave a powerful impression wherever he goes.
Fragrance Notes:Top Notes: Lemon Zest, Lavender, LemonThe scent opens with a double burst of bright lemon and sparkling zest, delivering an instant hit of freshness. Lavender adds an aromatic, calming edge that balances the energy, creating an invigorating start that’s crisp, modern, and attention-grabbing. 🍋✨💜
Heart Notes: Earthy Notes, Patchouli, Apple, SmokeIn the heart, earthy nuances and patchouli bring bold depth, while juicy apple introduces a fruity twist. A whisper of smoky accords adds mystery and masculine intensity—forming a complex, intriguing core that feels futuristic and expressive. 🍏🔥🌿
Base Notes: Lavender, Vanilla, VetiverAs it settles, Fawah melts into a warm, smooth base. Vanilla adds creamy sweetness, lavender returns for aromatic continuity, and vetiver grounds the scent with its dry, elegant earthiness—leaving a long-lasting, sensual trail. 🌙🍨🌾
Nusuk Fawah is perfect for everyday confidence, nighttime allure, and any moment you want a scent that’s fresh, daring, and irresistibly modern. ✨🔥⚡",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Nusuk",true,Size,80ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,12,deny,manual,2949.00,3399.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Nusuk-Fawah.png?v=1779880050,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,nusuk-perfumes-special-offer,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
nusuk-fawah-midnight-edition-80ml-edp,Nusuk Fawah Midnight Edition 80ml EDP,"Nusuk Fawah Midnight Edition 80ml EDP for Men — A Deep Tale of Spiced Luxury, Dark Sweetness &amp; Seductive Power ✨🌙🔥
Nusuk Fawah Midnight Edition is crafted for the man who rules the night with quiet strength and irresistible charm. Inspired by the rich, opulent character of Oajan by Parfums de Marly, this fragrance blends smoky sweetness, warm spices, and deep leathery woods—creating an aura that is bold, mysterious, and undeniably addictive. It’s the perfect scent for evenings when intensity meets elegance.
Fragrance Notes:Top Notes: Burnt Sugar, Cardamom, Apricot BlossomThe journey begins with a decadent swirl of burnt sugar—dark, caramelized, and immediately captivating. Aromatic cardamom adds a spicy lift, while apricot blossom introduces a soft, fruity-floral glow that makes the opening both warm and enchanting. 🍯✨🌸
Heart Notes: Cinnamon, Incense, Bark, CashmeranIn the heart, rich cinnamon heats the composition, blending with smoky incense and earthy bark for a deeply textured, atmospheric feel. Cashmeran brings a smooth, musky-woody softness that wraps the spicy darkness in irresistible elegance. 🔥🌲🌫️
Base Notes: Leather, Cacao, Suede, Ambergris, PatchouliAs it settles, Midnight Edition reveals a luxuriously dark base. Supple leather and velvety suede create a sensual, masculine foundation, enriched by deep cacao and glowing ambergris. Patchouli adds earthy richness, leaving a trail that is smoky, sweet, and seductively long-lasting. 🖤🍫🌙
Nusuk Fawah Midnight Edition is ideal for evening wear, special occasions, and moments when you want to command attention with a fragrance that’s warm, spicy, and elegantly intense. A bold signature for the true night-time sophisticate. ✨🔥🌙",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Nusuk",true,Size,80ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,2949.00,3399.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Nusuk-Fawah-Midnight-Edition.png?v=1779880049,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,nusuk-perfumes-special-offer,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
nusuk-ateeq-100ml-extrait-de-parfum,Nusuk Ateeq 100ml Extrait De Parfum,"Nusuk Ateeq Extrait de Parfum 100ml — A Majestic Blend of Sweet Spice, Aromatic Warmth &amp; Timeless Elegance ✨🔥🌿
Nusuk Ateeq is an opulent unisex extrait crafted for those who appreciate depth, richness, and a touch of royal charm. Inspired by the iconic XJ 1861 Naxos by Xerjoff, it marries honeyed sweetness, bright citrus, aromatic herbs, and creamy woods—creating a fragrance that feels both noble and irresistibly modern. Ateeq is bold yet smooth, powerful yet inviting, making it a perfect statement scent for men and women who command presence effortlessly.
Fragrance Notes:Top Notes: Cinnamon, Honey, Amber, Grapefruit, LimeThe opening shines with a radiant blend of warm cinnamon and velvety honey—sweet, spicy, and instantly captivating. Amber adds a golden glow, while grapefruit and lime burst through with zesty freshness, energizing the composition with vibrant citrus brightness. 🍯✨🍋🔥
Heart Notes: Tobacco, Lavender, JasmineAs it unfolds, Ateeq transitions into a refined aromatic heart. Rich tobacco brings depth and sophistication, lavender adds calm herbaceous elegance, and jasmine infuses soft floral sensuality. This balance of sweet, smoky, and airy notes creates a mesmerizing, textured core. 🌿💜🌸
