naseem-aqua-80ml-perfume,Naseem Aqua 80ml Perfume,"<p>Naseem Aqua Parfume 80ml Alcohol-Free for Men is an olfactory masterpiece that combines lasting power with a refreshing aura. This fragrance opens with a burst of invigorating top notes, where the zesty blend of Ginger, Bergamot, and Grapefruit creates an uplifting and energetic introduction. The heart of the fragrance reveals a sophisticated fusion, intertwining the floral elegance of Jasmine and Orris Root with the earthy allure of Vetiver.</p>

<p>As time unfolds, the base notes emerge, leaving an irresistible and enduring trail. Musk provides a sensual foundation, while the warm and slightly sweet nuances of Ambergris add depth and complexity. The fragrance reaches its harmonious conclusion with the soothing and creamy essence of Sandalwood.</p>

<p>Top notes are Ginger, Bergamot and Grapefruit</p>

<p>Middle notes are Jasmine, Orris Root and Vetiver</p>

<p>Base notes are Musk, Ambergris and Sandalwood.</p>

<p>Naseem Aqua is not just a scent; it's an experience. The absence of alcohol ensures a skin-friendly application, while its remarkable longevity means that a single spritz in the morning will accompany you throughout the day. Unleash the revitalizing power of Naseem Aqua, a fragrance that encapsulates sophistication and dynamism in every drop.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","best seller, Daily Wear, Full, Naseem, Summer Essentials",true,Size,80ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,5,deny,manual,1249.00,1500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Naseem-aqua-perfume-alcohol-free.png?v=1779880037,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,ambergris; sandalwood; musk,naseem,,Woody Aquatic,parfum,,made-in-uae,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Naseem/Aqua-75219.html,unisex,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,citrus; fresh-spicy; woody; powdery; amber,,jasmine; vetiver,,,,,,,,,,,daily-wear,,most-reordered,,ginger; bergamot; grapefruit,,,for-men,,'6,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
naseem-oud-80ml-perfume,Naseem Oud 80ml Perfume,"<p>Naseem Oud Parfum for Men is an olfactory masterpiece that captivates the senses with its rich and complex fragrance profile. Encased in an 80ml bottle, this alcohol-free perfume is a celebration of longevity, ensuring that its enchanting aroma lingers throughout the day.</p>

<p>At the top, the fragrance unfolds with the regal essence of Agarwood, entwined with the soothing notes of Lavender and a dash of spice, creating an initial impression that is both exotic and invigorating. The heart notes reveal a symphony of Incense, delicate florals, and the grounding embrace of Cedarwood, adding depth and sophistication to the composition.</p>

<p>The base notes of Naseem Oud Parfum are a testament to luxury, featuring the mystical Oud, revered for its resinous allure. Moss contributes a touch of earthiness, while Ambergris provides a subtle hint of maritime muskiness, culminating in a fragrance that is both timeless and contemporary.</p>

<p>Top Notes Agarwood, Lavender, Spicy</p>

<p>Middle Notes Incense, Floral, Cedarwood</p>

<p>Base Notes Oud, Moss, Ambergris</p>

<p>This fragrance not only emanates a captivating blend of aromatic elements but also stands as a testament to meticulous craftsmanship, offering a scent that is not just worn but experienced. Naseem Oud Parfum is an embodiment of refined masculinity, an enduring journey of scent that defines and redefines sophistication.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Naseem",true,Size,80ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,1200.00,1500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Naseem-oud-peerfume-alcohol-free.png?v=1779880035,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,oud,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
naseem-inferno-80ml-perfume,Naseem Inferno 80ml Perfume,"<p>Naseem Inferno, an 80ml masterpiece of olfactory delight designed exclusively for men. This alcohol-free fragrance is not just a scent; it's an experience that lingers, transcending time with its remarkable longevity.</p>

<p>At the top, revel in the rich embrace of Clove, Elemi, and Saffron notes, creating an entrancing aura that captivates the senses. As the scent unfolds, the heart reveals an intriguing blend of Cinnamon and Frankincense, adding depth and warmth that resonates with passion. Finally, the base notes of Vetiver, Cypriol, and Gurjum bring a grounding and seductive allure, leaving an unforgettable trail that defines sophistication.</p>

