<p>Naseem Inferno is more than just a fragrance; it's an expression of timeless masculinity. The amalgamation of spice, resin, and earthy elements not only makes it an enduring olfactory experience but also a signature scent that sets you apart. Elevate your presence with Naseem Inferno, where each note tells a story, and every drop encapsulates the essence of lasting allure.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Naseem",true,Size,80ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,1200.00,1500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Naseem-inferno-perfume-alcohol-free.png?v=1779880034,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
naseem-aura-80ml-perfume,Naseem Aura 80ml Perfume,"<p>Indulge your senses in the captivating allure of Naseem Aura Parfume, an exquisite fragrance crafted for both men and women. This 80ml masterpiece, notable for being alcohol-free, offers a unique olfactory experience that transcends gender boundaries.</p>

<p>Naseem Aura is renowned for its unparalleled longevity, making it a beacon of endurance in the world of perfumery. The top notes of Bergamot and Saffron create a harmonious symphony that is both refreshing and invigorating, setting the stage for a sensorial journey. As the fragrance evolves, the middle notes of Orris, Jasmine, and Ozonic accord weave a delicate tapestry of floral and airy tones, adding sophistication to its character.</p>

<p>The grand finale unfolds with the base notes of Amber, Sandalwood, and Moss, leaving an indelible imprint that resonates throughout the day. This well-balanced composition emanates a subtle yet commanding aura, making it a versatile choice for any occasion.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Bergamot, Saffron</p>

