<p>Middle Notes Jasmine, Rose, Powdery Note, Orris</p>

<p>Base Notes Patchouli, Moss, Leather, Woody, Amber, Cedarwood</p>

<p>Naseem Urban Beat is not merely a scent; it's an experience, an ode to the urban man who navigates life with confidence and charisma. Immerse yourself in the allure of Naseem Urban Beat, where each drop tells a story that lingers throughout the day, making it a timeless addition to your olfactory repertoire.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Naseem",true,Size,75ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,2250.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Naseem-Urban-Beat.png?v=1779880014,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,naseem-n-series,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
naseem-twin-paradise-75ml-perfume,Naseem Twin Paradise 75ml Perfume,"<p>Indulge your senses in the captivating allure of Naseem Twin Paradise, a mesmerizing fragrance designed exclusively for men. This elixir, delicately crafted without alcohol, is a testament to sophistication and longevity.</p>

<p>As the aromatic symphony unfolds, the top notes dance with vibrancy, weaving together the sweetness of peach, the floral elegance of orange blossom, the citrusy zest of bergamot, and the exotic touch of tropical shell, reminiscent of sun-kissed coconut palms. This harmonious blend creates an opening that is both refreshing and tantalizing.</p>

<p>In the heart of the fragrance, a bouquet of middle notes emerges, embracing the wearer with the soft, powdery allure of heliotrope, the delicate charm of orris, the intoxicating richness of gardenia, the heady sensuality of tuberose, and the timeless elegance of jasmine. This symphony of floral tones adds depth and complexity, creating an olfactory experience that evolves with every passing moment.</p>

<p>Top Notes Peach, Orange Blossom, Bergamot, Tropical Shell(coconut)</p>

<p>Middle Notes Heliotrope, Orris, Gardenia, Tuberose, Jasmine</p>

<p>Base Notes Woody, Sandalwood, Ambergris, Vanilla</p>

<p>As the fragrance gracefully settles, the base notes take center stage, grounding the composition in a warm and inviting embrace. The woody accord, coupled with the creamy richness of sandalwood, the mysterious allure of ambergris, and the sweet warmth of vanilla, leaves an indelible impression. Naseem Twin Paradise is more than a scent; it's an enduring journey through a paradise of olfactory sensations, a fragrance that lingers on the skin, making every moment unforgettable.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Naseem",true,Size,75ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,2250.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Naseem-twin-paradise.png?v=1779880012,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,naseem-n-series,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
naseem-hypnotic-passion-75ml-perfume,Naseem Hypnotic Passion 75ml Perfume,"<p>Naseem Hypnotic Passion Parfum, a captivating olfactory symphony designed for men, is an unparalleled sensorial journey housed in a flacon that boasts an alcohol-free formulation. Unveiling an alluring and intense experience, this fragrance is a testament to sophistication and allure.</p>

<p>Renowned for its extraordinary longevity, Naseem Hypnotic Passion is an olfactory masterpiece that transcends time. The top notes burst forth with a dynamic blend of Raspberry, Blueberry, Pink Pepper, and Litchee, creating an invigorating and fruity prelude that captures attention from the first spritz. The heart of the fragrance reveals a floral tapestry with notes of Rose, Peony, and Lily of the Valley, weaving a delicate and harmonious bouquet that lingers in the air.</p>

<p>As the scent evolves, the base notes of Musk, Vanilla, and Cotton Candy emerge, adding depth and warmth to the composition. The musky embrace intertwines seamlessly with the sweet and creamy allure of vanilla, while the subtle hint of Cotton Candy creates a whimsical and irresistible charm.</p>

<p>Top Notes Raspberry, Blueberry, Pink Pepper, Litchee</p>

<p>Middle Notes Rose, Peony. Lily Of The Valley</p>

<p>Base Notes Musk, Vanilla, Cotton Candy</p>

<p>Naseem Hypnotic Passion stands out not only for its enchanting aroma but also for its remarkable longevity, ensuring that the fragrance endures throughout the day, leaving a captivating trail wherever you go. This fragrance is a manifestation of passion and allure, making it an essential addition to the olfactory wardrobe of the modern, sophisticated man.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Naseem",true,Size,75ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,2250.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Naseem-Hypnotic-Passion.png?v=1779880012,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,naseem-n-series,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
naseem-love-me-now-75ml-perfume,Naseem Love Me Now 75ml Perfume,"<p>Naseem Love Me Now Parfum for Men, presented in a generous bottle, redefines luxury with its enchanting blend of notes that evoke sophistication and charisma. Crafted without alcohol, this fragrance offers a unique olfactory experience that is not only rich but also gentle on the skin.</p>

<p>This fragrance boasts an extraordinary longevity, making it the perfect companion for those who desire a scent that endures throughout the day and into the night. The top notes of Saffron and Raspberry introduce a captivating and spicy opening, setting the stage for an unforgettable aromatic journey.</p>

<p>As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes of Rose, Jasmine, and Magnolia emerge, creating a floral symphony that adds depth and elegance. These middle notes intertwine harmoniously, embodying a sense of romance and allure.</p>

<p>The base notes of Oud, Patchouli, Amber, Vanilla, and Musk provide a warm and sensual foundation. The richness of Oud and the earthy allure of Patchouli blend seamlessly with the sweetness of Amber and Vanilla, leaving a lasting impression that lingers in the air.</p>

<p>Top Notes Saffron, Raspberry</p>

<p>Middle Notes Rose, Jasmine, Magnolia</p>

<p>Base Notes Oud, Patchouli, Amber, Vanilla, Musk</p>

<p>Naseem Love Me Now Parfum for Men is a masterpiece that transcends time, making it a timeless addition to any collection. Its alcohol-free formulation ensures a gentle caress on the skin, making it suitable for daily wear. Embrace the allure of this fragrance, where every note tells a story of passion and refinement.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Naseem",true,Size,75ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,2250.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Naseem-Love-me-Now.png?v=1779880010,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,naseem-n-series,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
naseem-signature-silver-aqua-parfume-100ml,Naseem Signature Silver Aqua Parfume 100ml,"<p>Naseem Signature Silver Aqua Parfum 100ml: A Symphony of Timeless Elegance 🌟</p>

<p>Immerse yourself in the essence of refined masculinity with Naseem Signature Silver Aqua Parfum, a meticulously crafted fragrance that transcends time and captivates the senses. This distinguished scent, carefully curated for men, unveils an unparalleled olfactory journey, marked by its premium quality and long-lasting allure.</p>

<p>🍋 Top Notes: The fragrance opens with a burst of citrus freshness, where zesty lime dances harmoniously with the sweet vibrancy of orange. This invigorating blend immediately sets the stage for a fragrance experience that is both lively and uplifting.</p>

<p>💐 Middle Notes: As the heart of the perfume unfolds, a captivating symphony of spice, aromatic nuances, and delicate florals emerges. The spicy elements add a touch of warmth and complexity, while the aromatic and floral accords bring a sophisticated and alluring depth to the composition.</p>

<p>🌿 Base Notes: The grand finale unfolds with a rich and robust foundation of vetiver, sandalwood, amber, and musk. These base notes intertwine to create a velvety, sensuous trail that lingers on the skin, leaving an unforgettable impression of strength and sophistication.</p>

<p>🌌 Alcohol-Free Formula: Naseem Signature Silver Aqua Parfum is thoughtfully crafted without alcohol, ensuring a gentle and skin-friendly experience. The absence of alcohol allows the fragrance to develop more subtly, embracing the wearer in a comforting aura without overwhelming the senses.</p>

<p>🕰️ Long-Lasting Elegance: Experience a fragrance that stands the test of time. Naseem Signature Silver Aqua Parfum boasts remarkable longevity, ensuring that the captivating aroma accompanies you throughout your day and into the night, making it a perfect choice for any occasion.</p>

<p>💎 Premium Sensation: This fragrance is not merely a scent; it's an embodiment of sophistication and luxury. The premium aroma resonates with discerning individuals who appreciate the finer things in life, making it an ideal companion for the modern, refined man.</p>

<p>Indulge in the timeless allure of Naseem Signature Silver Aqua Parfum – a masterpiece that transcends fragrance, embodying the very essence of a distinguished lifestyle. Elevate your presence with this exceptional and premium-scented creation.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Naseem",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,3999.00,5000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Naseem-signature-for-men.png?v=1779880010,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
naseem-date-night-aqua-parfume-100ml,Naseem Date Night Aqua Parfume 100ml,"<p>Naseem Date Night For Men Aqua Parfume: A Symphony of Elegance and Allure</p>

<p>Embark on a sensorial journey with Naseem Date Night For Men Aqua Parfume, a masterpiece meticulously crafted for the modern man seeking sophistication and everlasting allure. Immerse yourself in the magic of a fragrance that transcends time, elevating your presence with every spray.</p>

<p>🌿 Alcohol-Free Luxury: This exquisite parfum boasts an alcohol-free formulation, offering a refined and gentle touch on the skin. Naseem Date Night is not just a fragrance; it's an experience, carefully designed to leave a lasting impression.</p>

<p>🌅 Top Notes: Bergamot, Pink Pepper, Mandarin: The journey begins with a burst of freshness and vitality. Crisp Bergamot entwines with the invigorating zing of Pink Pepper, while Mandarin adds a touch of citrusy vibrancy. This trio of top notes sets the stage for a captivating olfactory experience.</p>

<p>💜 Middle Notes: Lavender: As the fragrance evolves, Lavender takes center stage, introducing a calming and aromatic facet. This middle note adds a layer of sophistication, creating a harmonious balance between the dynamic top notes and the deep, resonant base.</p>

<p>🌳 Base Notes: Moss, Amber, Musk, Patchouli: The foundation of Naseem Date Night is built upon a rich tapestry of base notes. Earthy Moss and sensual Amber create a warm and inviting aura, while Musk adds a hint of sensuality. The journey concludes with the lingering embrace of Patchouli, leaving an indelible mark of refinement.</p>

<p>🌌 Long-Lasting, Premium-Smelling Fragrance: Naseem Date Night is more than a fragrance; it's an expression of timeless elegance. Experience the longevity of this premium scent, as it weaves its enchanting spell throughout the day and into the night.</p>

<p>🎩 For the Modern Gentleman: This fragrance is a celebration of the modern gentleman who appreciates the finer things in life. Whether it's a romantic evening or a special occasion, Naseem Date Night For Men Aqua Parfume is your companion in making a statement of sophistication and style.</p>

<p>Indulge in the allure of Naseem Date Night – where every note tells a story, and every spray leaves an everlasting impression.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Date Night Picks, Full, Naseem",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,3999.00,5000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Naeem-Date-night-for-men.png?v=1779880009,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
naseem-ocean-enigma-75ml-perfume,Naseem Ocean Enigma 75ml Perfume,"<p>🌊 Dive into Luxury with Naseem Ocean Enigma Parfume 75ml Alcohol-Free 🌊</p>

<p>Embark on a sensory journey with Naseem Ocean Enigma, an exquisite fragrance that captures the essence of the deep blue sea. This 75ml elixir is a testament to opulence and sophistication, meticulously crafted for the modern man seeking a premium olfactory experience.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Lemon, Bergamot, Grapefruit The journey begins with a burst of citrus freshness. The zesty notes of lemon, bergamot, and grapefruit dance together, creating a vibrant and invigorating opening that sets the stage for the olfactory adventure ahead.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Pink Pepper, Artemisia, Thyme, Vetiver As the fragrance evolves, a spicy and herbal symphony unfolds. Pink pepper adds a touch of warmth, while artemisia and thyme infuse a herbal complexity. Vetiver, with its earthy allure, intertwines seamlessly, creating a harmonious heart that is both intriguing and sophisticated.</p>

<p>Base Notes: Vanilla, Ambery, Woody The grand finale unveils a rich and lasting foundation. Vanilla adds a sweet and creamy depth, complemented by the warm embrace of amber. The woody notes anchor the fragrance, leaving a lasting impression that is both powerful and memorable.</p>

<p>Naseem Ocean Enigma stands as an alcohol-free masterpiece, ensuring a gentle and luxurious application that won't overpower the senses. Its longevity is unparalleled, allowing you to revel in the captivating aroma throughout the day and into the night.</p>

<p>Inspired by the iconic Elysium by Roja Dove, Naseem Ocean Enigma exudes the same air of prestige and luxury. Immerse yourself in the sophisticated allure of this fragrance, designed for the discerning man who appreciates the finer things in life.</p>

<p>Indulge in the oceanic symphony that is Naseem Ocean Enigma – where every drop is a celebration of timeless elegance and unparalleled craftsmanship. Elevate your fragrance collection with this premium scent that mirrors the grandeur of the vast and mysterious ocean. 🌟</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Naseem",true,Size,75ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,24,deny,manual,2249.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Naseem-ocean-enigma.png?v=1779880008,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,naseem-n-series,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
naseem-purple-blue-75ml-perfume,Naseem Purple Blue 75ml Perfume,"<p>Naseem Purple Blue Parfume 75ml: Evoke Serenity with Every Breath</p>

<p>Immerse yourself in the tranquil embrace of Naseem Purple Blue, a fragrance that transcends gender boundaries, encapsulating the essence of joy and serenity in a 75ml alcohol-free blend. Imagine a soft whisper delivering instant news that brightens your day — this is the essence of Purple Blue.</p>

<p>Opening Notes: A Symphony of Freshness As you embark on this olfactory journey, the fragrance unfolds with dreamy and enveloping top notes of watery pear, green apple, and a delightful medley of tropical fruits. Picture a joyous interplay of flavors that dance on your senses, instantly uplifting your mood and setting a harmonious tone.</p>

