naseem-lost-in-the-woods-75ml-perfume,Naseem Lost In The Woods 75ml Perfume,"<p>Naseem Lost In The Woods Parfum 75ml (Alcohol-Free): An Odyssey of Citrusy and Aromatic Elegance 🌲</p>

<p>Immerse yourself in the enchanting world of Naseem Lost In The Woods Parfum, a 75ml alcohol-free fragrance crafted to perfection for the modern man. This long-lasting scent weaves a tapestry of citrus, amber, and aromatic notes, creating a symphony of elegance and allure that is both captivating and enduring.</p>

<p>🌟 Unmatched Longevity: Naseem Lost In The Woods Parfum is designed to stand the test of time, ensuring you remain enveloped in its captivating essence throughout the day. Its alcohol-free formulation not only makes it gentle on the skin but also ensures the fragrance’s true notes are revealed and preserved, offering a pure olfactory experience.</p>

<p>💐 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: The fragrance opens with a vibrant and invigorating blend of Italian Lemon, Grapefruit, Incense, Pink Pepper, Bergamot, and Ginger. This dazzling combination creates an immediate burst of freshness, awakening the senses and setting a lively, spirited tone.<br>
Middle Notes: At its heart, Lost In The Woods reveals a lush bouquet of Geranium, Neroli, Jasmine, and Rose. These floral notes intermingle to add depth and sophistication, balancing the initial citrusy burst with a warm, aromatic embrace.<br>
Base Notes: The base of this exquisite fragrance is a rich and complex blend of Benzoin, Cedar, Sandalwood, Patchouli, Leather, Vetiver, Amber, and Musk. These earthy and resinous notes provide a strong, enduring foundation, enveloping you in a trail of woody elegance and masculine warmth.</p>

<p>🌞 Perfect for Every Occasion: Ideal for the dynamic lifestyle of the modern man, Naseem Lost In The Woods Parfum transitions effortlessly from daytime adventures to evening sophistication. Whether you’re at a formal event or an outdoor gathering, this fragrance ensures you leave a lasting impression.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Naseem",true,Size,75ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,2250.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Naseem-Lost-In-The-Woods.png?v=1779880006,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,woody,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,naseem-n-series,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
