(A sensual, earthy finish that leaves a lingering, memorable impression.)</p>

<p>Naseem Signature Gold combines sweetness, spice, and earthiness in a beautifully balanced fragrance. With its alcohol-free formula, it’s gentle on the skin while delivering long-lasting performance. Perfect for various occasions, this scent exudes sophistication, making it a versatile choice for those seeking a fragrance that is both alluring and refined. Embrace the elegance of Naseem Signature Gold and experience a luxurious fusion of aromas that’s sure to leave a lasting mark.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Naseem",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,3999.00,5000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Naseem-Signature-Gold.png?v=1779880002,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
naseem-marine-adventure-50ml-perfume,Naseem Marine Adventure 50ml Perfume,"<p>Marine Adventure Aqua by Naseem Perfumes is a luxurious, alcohol-free fragrance for men who love the thrill of exploration. Part of the Prestige Collection, this 50ml scent is crafted in the UAE and inspired by the boundless beauty of the sea.</p>

<p>The fragrance opens with the fresh, invigorating touch of salty ocean air, blending with the rugged essence of ciste. This creates an energizing start that captures the excitement of setting sail. As the scent develops, exotic notes of davana, warm benzoin, and vibrant saffron emerge, adding a rich layer that’s both unique and unforgettable.</p>

<p>Finally, the fragrance settles into a bold base of wood, musk, and moss, leaving a lasting, masculine finish that lingers beautifully. Marine Adventure Aqua is perfect for those who seek a long-lasting scent as adventurous as they are. With its sophisticated blend, this fragrance mirrors the spirit of the ocean and the allure of unexplored horizons.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Naseem",true,Size,50ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1400.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Naseem-Marine-Adventure-50ml.png?v=1779880001,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
naseem-peak-pulse-50ml-perfume,Naseem Peak Pulse 50ml Perfume,"<p>Naseem Peak Pulse Aqua Perfume for Men is a luxurious, alcohol-free fragrance crafted in the UAE as part of the prestigious Prestige Collection. This bold, masculine scent captures the exhilarating thrill of skiing down the Swiss Alps, immersing you in an unforgettable adventure with every spray.</p>

<p>Peak Pulse opens with a fresh burst of bergamot and lemon, creating an invigorating and crisp introduction. As it settles, the heart unfolds with a balanced blend of rose and sandalwood, adding a touch of rugged elegance that speaks to the allure of high-altitude peaks. In the base, a sophisticated fusion of amber, jasmine, and musk combines with rich woody notes, providing a warm, confident finish that feels timeless and enduring.</p>

<p>This long-lasting fragrance is perfect for the modern man who seeks a scent as powerful as his ambitions and as captivating as his journey. Whether for daily wear or special occasions, Peak Pulse is designed to make a lasting impression, enveloping you in a fresh yet earthy aroma that mirrors the natural beauty of the Alps. Ideal for those who dare to conquer, this fragrance leaves an aura of refinement and strength.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Naseem",true,Size,50ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1400.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/naseem-peak-pulse.png?v=1779880000,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
naseem-paradise-escape-50ml-perfume,Naseem Paradise Escape 50ml Perfume,"<p>Naseem Paradise Escape Aqua from the Prestige Collection captures the essence of a luxurious getaway in every spray. This alcohol-free, long-lasting fragrance opens with vibrant top notes of mandarin, bergamot, and lemon, creating an instant splash of fresh, zesty energy. As it unfolds, heart notes of cardamom, leather, and fruity hints blend with earthy coriander and aromatic ciste, adding warmth and an exotic, bold touch to the fragrance. This unique composition then deepens with a rich, grounding base of woody tones, musk, amber, and patchouli, evoking the tranquil, lush beauty of a private paradise.</p>

<p>Crafted in the UAE, Paradise Escape Aqua is designed for the modern man who values sophistication and timeless appeal. The fragrance takes you on an olfactory journey, from invigorating freshness to a warm, earthy finish, creating an aura that feels both comforting and adventurous. This is the perfect scent for those who want to leave a lasting impression with a blend that’s luxurious, captivating, and reminiscent of an unforgettable escape.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Naseem",true,Size,50ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,1400.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/naseem-paradise-escape.png?v=1779879999,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
naseem-midnight-love-50ml-perfume,Naseem Midnight Love 50ml Perfume,"<p>Discover an alluring fragrance with Naseem Midnight Love Aqua Perfume for Men, part of the Prestige Collection, crafted to enchant and captivate. This luxurious 50ml perfume, made in the UAE, is alcohol-free, ensuring a pure scent experience and remarkable longevity. Midnight Love opens with the lively burst of bergamot, mingling with the warmth of pink pepper and a touch of mandarin for an invigorating, spicy twist. In the heart, delicate notes of orris, jasmine, and ylang ylang blossom gracefully, adding a layer of soft, floral elegance that embodies refined masculinity.</p>

<p>As the fragrance settles, it unveils a rich, comforting base, where creamy sandalwood, earthy moss, and sensual musk blend seamlessly with the sweetness of vanilla and woody undertones. This sophisticated composition offers a balanced scent journey—bold yet smooth, vibrant yet calming. Midnight Love Aqua captures the essence of romance and mystery, making it ideal for evening wear or special occasions. Perfect for the modern man who values luxury and charm, this fragrance leaves a lasting impression, enveloping you in a veil of elegance from dusk till dawn.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Naseem",true,Size,50ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1400.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/naseem-midnight-love.png?v=1779879998,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
naseem-burhan-gift-set,Naseem Burhan Gift Set,"<p>The Naseem Burhan Gift Set, crafted in the UAE, offers a luxurious alcohol-free fragrance experience. This elegant set includes an 80ml Burhan Parfum, a 20ml perfume oil, and a 50g body cream—all sharing the same sophisticated scent.</p>

<p>Burhan opens with refreshing citrus and fresh notes that evoke the lively charm of Moroccan streets, where zesty aromas blend with the cool mist of courtyard fountains. At its heart, rich floral notes of Orris, Rose, and Jasmine bring a timeless elegance, perfectly balanced between heritage and modernity. The fragrance finishes with a warm, inviting base of Amber, Musk, and Sandalwood, creating a lasting, earthy allure.</p>

<p>This gift set is perfect for those who appreciate refined, alcohol-free scents. Burhan’s fragrance journey feels like a stroll through vibrant souks, capturing the beauty and mystique of a distant land. An ideal choice for gifting or for indulging yourself in a scent that’s rich in culture, sophistication, and romance.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Naseem",true,Size,Gift Set,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1200.00,2000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Naseem-Burhan-Gift-Set.png?v=1779879997,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
naseem-sadaat-gift-set,Naseem Sadaat Gift Set,"<p>Naseem Sadaat Gift Set is a luxurious, alcohol-free fragrance collection crafted in the UAE, perfect for those who appreciate a tropical and floral escape. This elegant set includes an 80ml Sadaat perfume, a 20ml perfume oil, and a 50g body cream—all sharing the same enchanting scent for a harmonious layering experience.</p>

<p>Sadaat opens with a vibrant blend of pineapple, strawberry, and rose, capturing the essence of a tropical garden in bloom. This fruity start is complemented by a heart of jasmine and peach, bringing a soft, floral sweetness underscored by the warmth of Madagascar vanilla. These middle notes evoke a sense of exotic allure, blending seamlessly into the fragrance's rich, earthy base.</p>

<p>The base notes feature patchouli and musk, which add depth and balance to the scent, grounding the floral and fruity top layers with a woody elegance. Sadaat’s blend of fresh fruits, white florals, and a touch of vanilla and patchouli creates a truly unforgettable fragrance—ideal for any occasion and suitable for those seeking an alcohol-free, long-lasting scent experience.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Naseem",true,Size,Gift Set,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,999.00,2000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Naseem-Sadaat-Gift-Set.png?v=1779879995,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
naseem-serene-aqua-parfum-55ml,Naseem Serene Aqua Parfum 55ml,"<p>Naseem Serene Aqua Parfum 55ml (Alcohol-Free): A Symphony of Elegance and Freshness 🌊</p>

<p>Experience the perfect harmony of freshness, elegance, and warmth with Naseem Serene Aqua Parfum, a long-lasting alcohol-free fragrance made in the UAE. Specially crafted for the modern woman, this exquisite scent embodies confidence and refinement.</p>

<p>✨ Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Begin your journey with the invigorating freshness of pear, green apple, and zesty lemon. These uplifting notes awaken your senses, setting the stage for a memorable day.<br>
Heart Notes: The fragrance blooms with a floral-fruity medley of delicate freesia, luscious raspberry, juicy peach, and enchanting jasmine. These notes create a captivating aura of sensual sophistication.<br>
Base Notes: As it settles, Serene Aqua reveals a warm and comforting blend of patchouli, tonka bean, musk, and creamy vanilla. This rich foundation lingers beautifully, leaving a lasting impression.</p>

<p>💧 Why Choose Serene Aqua?<br>
Designed for those who seek luxury and subtlety, this alcohol-free parfum ensures a gentle yet impactful experience. Its long-lasting formula is perfect for Indian weather, seamlessly adapting from daytime elegance to evening charm.</p>

<p>Elevate your fragrance collection with Naseem Serene Aqua—where timeless sophistication meets modern allure. Perfect for special moments or everyday confidence! 🌺</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Naseem",true,Size,55ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,499.00,799.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Naseem-Serene-Aqua-Parfum.png?v=1779879994,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
