naseem-paris-oud-75ml-aqua-parfum,Naseem Paris Oud 75ml Aqua Parfum,"<p>Naseem Paris Oud 75ml – Timeless Elegance, Alcohol-Free 🌙✨Indulge in the luxurious charm of Paris Oud by Naseem—a majestic, alcohol-free Aqua Parfum crafted in the UAE. A fragrance that whispers sophistication and warmth, this scent evokes the golden glow of twilight in Paris. Inspired by the iconic Grand Soir by Maison Francis Kurkdjian, it offers a deep, enveloping experience that is both sensual and serene.<br>
