my-perfumes-mpf-the-eternal-club-200ml-edp,My Perfumes MPF The Eternal Club 200ml EDP,"<p>My Perfumes MPF The Eternal Club 200ml EDP For Men – A Refined Fresh-Woody Masterpiece ✨<br>
My Perfumes MPF The Eternal Club is a bold and sophisticated Eau de Parfum crafted for the modern man who appreciates fresh vibrancy balanced with deep, smoky elegance. Inspired by Bleu de Chanel EDP, this fragrance offers a clean, citrus-mint opening that evolves into a spicy floral heart and settles into a rich, woody-resinous base—making it perfect for both daytime confidence and nighttime charm.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes ✨<br>
Top Notes: Grapefruit, Lemon, Mint, Pink Pepper 🍋🌿The opening is fresh, energetic, and uplifting. Juicy grapefruit and zesty lemon bring a crisp citrus spark, while cool mint adds refreshing clarity and pink pepper introduces a subtle spicy edge—setting a confident and invigorating tone from the first spray.<br>
Heart Notes: Ginger, Nutmeg, Jasmine 🌼✨In the heart, warm spices like ginger and nutmeg add depth and a refined kick, giving the fragrance a masculine warmth. Jasmine softens the spice with elegant floral facets, adding a smooth balance to the composition.<br>
Base Notes: Incense, Vetiver, Caledonian Sandalwood, Patchouli, Labdanum, White Musk 🌲🔥The dry-down is rich, smoky, and sophisticated. Incense creates an alluring depth, while vetiver and sandalwood add earthy woody strength. Patchouli and labdanum contribute resinous warmth, and white musk provides a smooth, sensual finish that lingers beautifully on the skin.<br>
My Perfumes MPF The Eternal Club is ideal for men who enjoy fresh yet refined fragrances with bold depth and longevity. Versatile and charismatic, it’s perfect for everyday presence, evenings out, formal occasions, and anytime you want a scent that feels elegant and confidently memorable.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, My Perfumes MPF",true,Size,200ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1799.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/My-Perfumes-MPF-The-Eternal-Club.png?v=1779879914,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
my-perfumes-mpf-fabulicious-100ml-edp,My Perfumes MPF Fabulicious 100ml EDP,"My Perfumes MPF Fabulicious 100ml EDP For Men – A Bold &amp; Stylish Leather-Gourmand Fragrance ✨
My Perfumes MPF Fabulicious is a striking and sophisticated Eau de Parfum crafted for men who embrace daring elegance with a modern twist. Inspired by F*cking Fabulous by Tom Ford, this scent blends fresh aromatic herbs with a rich leathery heart and smooth, gourmand warmth—perfect for evenings, special occasions, or any moment you want a fragrance that’s distinct, charismatic, and confidently stylish.

Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Bergamot, Sage, Rosemary 🍊🌿The opening is crisp and aromatic, with zesty bergamot delivering a bright freshness while sage and rosemary bring a refined herbal elegance. This aromatic start feels modern and intriguing, setting the stage for a compelling journey.
Heart Notes: Jasmine, Leathery, Carrot 🥕🌸At the heart, a bold leather accord takes center stage—smooth, luxurious, and unmistakably masculine. The floral touch of jasmine adds subtle sophistication, while carrot adds a unique, slightly earthy nuance that enhances the fragrance’s complexity and depth.
Base Notes: Sandalwood, Tonka Bean, Benzoin 🌲🍬The dry-down is warm and indulgent. Creamy sandalwood provides a rich, woody foundation, while tonka bean and benzoin add sweet, resinous gourmand facets. This base brings smooth longevity and a cozy, memorable finish.
My Perfumes MPF Fabulicious is ideal for men who enjoy refined yet bold fragrances with character and depth. Its aromatic opening, leathery heart, and warm gourmand dry-down create a sophisticated scent that’s perfect for evening wear, date nights, and standout moments. A confident choice for those who want a fragrance that leaves a lasting impression.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, My Perfumes MPF",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,1599.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/My-Perfumes-MPF-Fabulicious.png?v=1779879914,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
my-perfumes-mpf-just-oud-and-wood-100ml-edp,My Perfumes MPF Just Oud And Wood 100ml EDP,"<p>My Perfumes MPF Just Oud and Wood 100ml EDP For Men – A Refined Oud-Woody Classic ✨<br>
My Perfumes MPF Just Oud and Wood is a masculine and elegant Eau de Parfum crafted for those who appreciate the timeless sophistication of deep woods and subtle spices. Inspired by Tom Ford Oud Wood, this fragrance weaves a refined tapestry of aromatic cardamom, rich woods, and warm resins—making it an ideal choice for evening wear, cooler seasons, formal occasions, and moments when you want to leave a quietly powerful impression.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes ✨<br>
