Heart Notes: Patchouli, Sandalwood 🌲At the heart, creamy sandalwood and earthy patchouli create a beautifully balanced woody core. These notes enhance the fragrance’s depth and add a smooth, sophisticated character that feels both modern and timeless.<br>
Base Notes: Amber, Musk 🤍🔥The dry-down is warm and sensual, with amber lending a resinous glow and musk adding softness and longevity. This base leaves a lingering trail that feels smooth, masculine, and understatedly luxurious.<br>
My Perfumes MPF Just Oud and Wood is perfect for men who enjoy refined woody fragrances with subtle spicy and resinous depth. It’s versatile enough for daily wear yet rich enough for evening elegance—a confident, sophisticated scent that’s both modern and enduring.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, My Perfumes MPF",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1599.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/My-Perfumes-MPF-Just-Oud-and-Wood.png?v=1779879912,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,woody,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
my-perfumes-mpf-leather-100ml-edp,My Perfumes MPF Leather 100ml EDP,"My Perfumes MPF Leather 100ml EDP For Men – A Bold &amp; Luxurious Leather Masterpiece ✨
My Perfumes MPF Leather is a rich and commanding Eau de Parfum crafted for men who want a fragrance with strength, sophistication, and unmistakable presence. Inspired by the iconic Tom Ford Tuscan Leather, this scent combines spicy warmth and deep woody facets with a powerful leathery core and a warm, musky finish—perfect for evenings, special occasions, or anytime you want to make a confident statement.

Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Cardamom, Wood 🌿🪵The opening is aromatic and intense, with spicy cardamom adding a refined, intriguing edge while wood elements bring an earthy backbone. This creates a bold, memorable start that sets the tone for the rich journey ahead.
Heart Notes: Patchouli, Sandalwood 🌲At the heart, smoky patchouli and creamy sandalwood deepen the composition with earthy depth and smooth sophistication. These woody notes enhance the leathery character and give the fragrance a layered, masculine richness.
Base Notes: Amber, Musk 🤍🔥The dry-down is warm, sensual, and enduring. Amber delivers a resinous glow, while musk adds a soft, velvety finish that lingers confidently on the skin—balancing the bold leather and woods with elegant warmth.
My Perfumes MPF Leather is ideal for men who enjoy rich leather fragrances with bold spice, deep woods, and warm amber-musky depth. It’s sophisticated yet daring—perfect for evening wear, cooler seasons, and moments when you want a scent that’s powerful, distinctive, and unforgettable.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, My Perfumes MPF",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1599.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/My-Perfumes-MPF-Leather.png?v=1779879911,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
my-perfumes-mpf-murano-100ml-edp,My Perfumes MPF Murano 100ml EDP,"<p>My Perfumes MPF Murano 100ml EDP For Women – A Jewel-Like Floral-Citrus Elegance ✨<br>
My Perfumes MPF Murano is a sophisticated and luminous Eau de Parfum crafted for women who love airy freshness balanced with gentle floral depth and a smooth, warm finish. Inspired by Versace Crystal Noir, this fragrance opens with sparkling citrus and fruity facets, blooms into a delicate floral heart, and settles into a velvety base that lingers with graceful warmth—making it perfect for daytime chic, evening elegance, and special moments.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes ✨<br>
