Heart Notes: Peony, Magnolia, Lotus Flower 🌸✨At the heart, a refined floral bouquet unfolds. Soft peony and creamy magnolia blend with delicate lotus flower, bringing a light and elegant floral charm that feels romantic yet sophisticated.<br>
Base Notes: Musk, Amberwood, Cashmere 🤍🌿The dry-down is warm and velvety. Smooth musk lays the foundation with gentle sensuality, while amberwood adds a rich warmth and cashmere accords provide soft, comforting depth—creating a lasting and beautifully smooth finish.<br>
My Perfumes MPF Murano is ideal for women who enjoy fresh-floral fragrances with a graceful warmth. It’s elegant yet modern, perfect for everyday wear, brunches, casual evenings, or anytime you want a light but memorable signature scent.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, My Perfumes MPF",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1499.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/My-Perfumes-MPF-Murano.webp?v=1780382048,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
my-perfumes-mpf-orchid-noir-100ml-edp,My Perfumes MPF Orchid Noir 100ml EDP,"My Perfumes MPF Orchid Noir 100ml EDP For Women &amp; Men – A Dark, Sensual Floral-Gourmand Classic ✨
My Perfumes MPF Orchid Noir is a bold, luxurious unisex Eau de Parfum crafted for those who appreciate depth, mystery, and seductive sophistication. Inspired by the iconic Black Orchid by Tom Ford, this scent artfully blends spicy brightness, rich florals, creamy sweetness, and warm sensuality—making it a perfect signature for evening wear, special occasions, and moments when you want a fragrance that commands attention.

Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Bergamot, Nutmeg, Cedarwood 🍋🌰🌲The opening introduces a refined spark of bergamot’s citrus freshness, warmed by spicy nutmeg and grounded with cedarwood’s smooth, woody strength. This intriguing start sets a bold and elegant tone that draws you in.
