Base Notes: Musk, Vanilla, Jasmine 🤍🌸🍦The dry-down is rich, sensual, and unforgettable. Soft musk and warm vanilla create a smooth, inviting base, while jasmine’s floral elegance adds a luminous contrast. Together, they leave a lingering trail that’s both seductive and refined.
My Perfumes MPF Orchid Noir is ideal for anyone who enjoys intense, deep, and magnetic fragrances with a beautiful interplay of spice, florals, woods, and sweet warmth. It’s a confident, memorable scent that works beautifully for nights out, romantic evenings, and any time you want to make a striking impression.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, My Perfumes MPF",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,1599.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/My-Perfumes-MPF-Orchid-Noir.png?v=1779879909,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
my-perfumes-mpf-sensitive-100ml-edp,My Perfumes MPF Sensitive 100ml EDP,"My Perfumes MPF Sensitive 100ml EDP For Women – A Graceful &amp; Elegant Floral-Fruity Signature ✨
