montblanc-individuel-75ml-edt,Montblanc Individuel 75ml EDT,"<p>Montblanc Individuel 75ml EDT For Men: A Symphony of Timeless Elegance</p>

<p>Embark on a journey of sophistication and individuality with Montblanc Individuel, a 75ml Eau de Toilette designed to embody the essence of refined masculinity. Crafted with precision and care, this fragrance reflects the timeless elegance synonymous with the Montblanc legacy.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: A captivating blend of lavender, cinnamon, pineapple, juniper berries, mint, bergamot, rosemary, cardamom, and coriander opens the olfactory voyage. This aromatic medley sets the stage for an intriguing and invigorating experience.<br>
Middle Notes: The heart of Montblanc Individuel unfolds with the delicate infusion of orange blossom, violet, geranium, and jasmine. This harmonious composition adds a touch of floral allure, creating a balanced and sophisticated core.<br>
Base Notes: The grand finale is a masterful arrangement of raspberry, vanilla, sandalwood, dark chocolate, musk, amber, patchouli, vetiver, and oakmoss. This rich and complex foundation leaves an indelible trail of warmth and sensuality.</p>

<p>Timeless Elegance for the Modern Man: Montblanc Individuel is a celebration of individuality, tailor-made for the modern man who appreciates the artistry of fine fragrances. With a perfect balance of freshness, warmth, and depth, it seamlessly transitions from day to night, making it an ideal companion for various occasions.</p>

<p>Fragstalk.in – Your Fragrance Destination: Indulge in the world of 100% original niche and designer fragrances with Fragstalk.in, the official site for all your fragrance needs in India. Discover a curated collection of scents at amazing prices, ensuring you experience the luxury of authentic fragrances.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Full, MontBlanc",true,Size,75ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,4399.00,6000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/montblanc-individuel.png?v=1779879904,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
montblanc-explorer-100ml-edp,Montblanc Explorer 100ml EDP,"<p>Montblanc Explorer 100ml Eau de Parfum for Men: Embark on a Journey of Timeless Elegance</p>

<p>Indulge in the essence of sophistication with Montblanc Explorer, a fragrance that encapsulates the spirit of adventure and refinement. Immerse yourself in a world of olfactory delights as you explore the intriguing layers of this 100ml Eau de Parfum, a true testament to the artistry of fine perfumery.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

