montblanc-femme-individuelle-75ml-edt,Montblanc Femme Individuelle 75ml EDT,"Montblanc Femme Individuelle 75ml Eau De Toilette – Soft Spicy Floral with Elegant Warmth 🌹✨🌿For Women | Floral • Spicy • Warm • Musky
Montblanc Femme Individuelle is a graceful and understated feminine fragrance that blends gentle spice with delicate florals and a smooth, comforting base. Sophisticated yet easy to wear, it carries a quiet elegance—perfect for those who prefer subtle charm over bold statements.
Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Pink Pepper, Red Currant &amp; Bay Leaf 🌶️🍒🌿The opening is fresh with a soft spicy twist. Pink pepper adds a light rosy spice, while red currant introduces a gentle fruity tartness. Bay leaf brings a green aromatic touch that keeps the opening crisp and refined.
Heart Notes: Rose, Lotus &amp; Hawthorn 🌹🌸💧At the heart, the fragrance becomes delicately floral. Rose adds classic femininity, lotus brings a clean, watery softness, and hawthorn introduces a slightly sweet, airy floral nuance that feels calm and elegant.
Base Notes: Patchouli, Vanilla, Amber &amp; Musk 🍦🌿🔥🌫️The dry-down is warm and comforting. Vanilla adds a soft sweetness, amber gives a gentle glow, patchouli adds depth, and musk wraps everything in a smooth, skin-like finish.
Perfect for everyday wear, office settings, and those who enjoy soft, refined scents, Femme Individuelle is subtle, feminine, and timeless.
✨ Montblanc Femme Individuelle – a delicate harmony of soft spice, gentle florals, and warm musky sweetness.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Full, MontBlanc",true,Size,75ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,4099.00,19999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Montblanc-Femme-Individuelle.png?v=1779879875,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
mancera-cedrat-boise-intense-120ml-extrait-de-parfum,Mancera Cedrat Boise Intense 120ml Extrait De Parfum,"Mancera Cedrat Boise Intense 120ml Extrait De Parfum – Bold Citrus Power with Smoky Oud &amp; Creamy Depth 🍋🔥🌳For Men | Citrus • Woody • Leathery • Intense
Mancera Cedrat Boise Intense is a richer, deeper take on a modern classic—blending vibrant citrus with dark woods and smooth gourmand warmth. It opens bright yet powerful, quickly revealing a smoky, leathery heart before settling into a creamy, musky base. The fragrance feels confident and long-lasting, striking a balance between freshness and intensity with a luxurious edge.
Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Sicilian Citruses, Spices &amp; Black Currant 🍋🌶️🫐The opening is sharp and energetic. Sicilian citruses bring a sparkling freshness, while spices add a warm kick. Black currant introduces a slightly tart, fruity depth that gives the fragrance a bold, modern twist.
Heart Notes: Leather, Cambodian Oud, White Sandalwood &amp; Patchouli Leaf 🖤🌳🌿At the heart, the scent turns dark and sophisticated. Leather adds a smooth, rugged richness, while Cambodian oud brings a smoky, woody intensity. Sandalwood softens the blend with a creamy texture, and patchouli enhances depth with earthy warmth.
Base Notes: Vanilla, Ambergris, Oakmoss &amp; White Musk 🍦🌊🌱🤍The dry-down is warm, smooth, and long-lasting. Vanilla adds a subtle creamy sweetness, ambergris lends a refined, slightly salty warmth, oakmoss provides a green earthy touch, and white musk creates a clean, soft trail.
Perfect for evenings, special occasions, and cooler weather, Cedrat Boise Intense is powerful, refined, and unmistakably luxurious.
✨ Mancera Cedrat Boise Intense – a striking fusion of citrus brightness, smoky woods, and creamy musky warmth.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","Full, Mancera",true,Size,120ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,10349.00,16999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Mancera-Cedrat-Boise-Intense.png?v=1779879875,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,extrait,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
maison-de-profumo-spice-vanilla-50ml-edp,Maison De Profumo Spice Vanilla 50ml EDP,"<p>Maison De Profumo Spice Vanilla 50ml EDP For Men: Unleashing an Opulent Symphony of Sensuality 🌟</p>

<p>Indulge in the allure of Maison De Profumo Spice Vanilla, a fragrance that transcends the ordinary to redefine sophistication. This 50ml Eau De Parfum is meticulously crafted to be a beacon of irresistible charm, captivating your senses with its longevity and intensity.</p>

<p>🔥 Beast Mode Longevity: Maison De Profumo Spice Vanilla stands as a testament to enduring allure, enveloping you in a captivating embrace that lasts throughout the day. Embrace the confidence that comes with a fragrance that outlasts expectations, making a bold statement wherever you go.</p>

<p>💐 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: The olfactory journey begins with a burst of freshness, as apple, rosemary, bergamot, and cinnamon unite to create a vibrant and invigorating introduction. Experience the crisp and spicy blend that sets the tone for the richness to come.<br>
Middle Notes: The heart of this fragrance unveils a sophisticated blend of amyris, mahogany, and coffee. This harmonious accord adds depth and complexity, creating a warm and enticing core that resonates with refinement.<br>
Base Notes: The grand finale is a symphony of sensuality, where vanilla, sandalwood, caramel, and amber merge to create a rich and indulgent trail. Immerse yourself in the luxurious warmth and depth that defines the essence of Maison De Profumo Spice Vanilla.</p>

<p>🌍 Quality Beyond Borders: Maison De Profumo takes pride in adhering to the highest international standards in fragrance creation. Spice Vanilla is a testament to our commitment to excellence, blending premium ingredients to ensure a scent that is not only long-lasting but also rich and captivating.</p>

<p>🌬️ Intensified Longevity: To elevate the longevity of this fragrance, we have carefully selected high concentrations of fragrance oil and incorporated top-notch fragrance fixatives. This meticulous process ensures that Spice Vanilla lingers on the skin, creating an olfactory experience that is truly unforgettable.</p>

<p>🛍️ Indulge in Spice Vanilla: Immerse yourself in the luxury of Maison De Profumo Spice Vanilla. This Eau De Parfum is more than a fragrance; it's an expression of timeless elegance and enduring sophistication. Unleash the extraordinary with every spray!</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Maison De Profumo",true,Size,50ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,1199.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-De-Profumo-Spice-Vanilla-1.png?v=1779879873,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,vanilla; spicy,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
maison-de-profumo-oud-glory-50ml-edp,Maison De Profumo Oud Glory 50ml EDP,"<p>Maison De Profumo Oud Glory 50ml Eau de Parfum For Men: A Symphony of Opulence Unveiled 🌟</p>

<p>Embark on a fragrance journey with Maison De Profumo's Oud Glory, a 50ml Eau de Parfum designed exclusively for men. This olfactory masterpiece stands as a testament to timeless luxury, offering an immersive experience that transcends the ordinary.</p>

<p>🔥 Beast Mode Longevity: Oud Glory isn't just a fragrance; it's an aromatic saga that unfolds and persists. Behold the awe-inspiring endurance, as this scent establishes itself as a beacon of lasting allure. It's more than a fragrance; it's a statement that accompanies you through every chapter of your day.</p>

<p>💫 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: The journey commences with a dance of opulent notes. Immerse yourself in the harmonious blend of rose, pepper, and raspberry, creating a symphony of freshness and vibrancy that captivates the senses.<br>
Middle Notes: The heart of Oud Glory reveals an intricate tapestry of sophistication. Opoponax, oud, ambergris, and labdanum intertwine, crafting a rich and compelling core that exudes depth and mystery.<br>
Base Notes: The grand finale unfolds with an indulgent blend of leather, sandalwood, suede, and amber. This robust foundation resonates with strength, leaving an indelible trail of timeless masculinity.</p>

<p>🌺 Richness in Every Drop: Oud Glory is not just a fragrance; it's an embodiment of richness. The meticulously selected ingredients adhere to the highest international standards, ensuring a scent that is not only luxurious but also profoundly captivating. Each note is carefully curated to deliver an olfactory experience that defines opulence.</p>

<p>💎 Exceptional Quality and Concentration: To amplify the longevity of this fragrance, Maison De Profumo spares no expense. Oud Glory boasts a high concentration of fragrance oil coupled with premium fragrance fixatives. This careful formulation guarantees an enduring scent that lingers, making a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>🛍️ Indulge in Oud Glory: Elevate your fragrance ritual with Maison De Profumo Oud Glory. Immerse yourself in a world of enduring luxury and unparalleled sophistication. Unveil the glory in every drop!</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Maison De Profumo",true,Size,50ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,1199.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-De-Profumo-Oud-Glory.png?v=1779879871,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,oud,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
maison-de-profumo-green-world-50ml-edp,Maison De Profumo Green World 50ml EDP,"<p>Maison De Profumo Green World 50ml EDP For Men: A Symphony of Nature's Elegance Unleashed 🌍</p>

<p>Embark on an olfactory journey that encapsulates the essence of a lush, verdant paradise with Maison De Profumo's Green World 50ml Eau De Parfum. Designed for the modern man who appreciates sophistication and lasting impact, this fragrance is a true beast-mode sensation, promising an enduring trail of captivating allure.</p>

<p>💨 Long-Lasting Beast Mode: Green World asserts itself as a force to be reckoned with in the world of fragrances, offering a beast-mode longevity that lingers throughout the day. Envelop yourself in an aromatic embrace that adapts effortlessly to your dynamic lifestyle, ensuring you leave an indelible mark wherever you go.</p>

