louis-cardin-credible-noir-100ml-edp,Louis Cardin Credible Noir 100ml EDP,"<p>Louis Cardin Credible Noir 100ml EDP For Men – A Bold and Refined Modern Classic ✨<br>
Louis Cardin Credible Noir is a sophisticated and versatile Eau de Parfum crafted for men who appreciate a powerful presence with refined elegance. Inspired by the iconic Aventus by Creed, this fragrance balances fresh, fruity energy with a rich, masculine depth—making it perfect for both day and evening wear, formal events, and confident everyday style.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes ✨<br>
Top Notes: Bergamot, Orange, Lemon, Green Notes 🍋🍊Credible Noir opens with a vibrant burst of citrus and fresh green accords. Juicy bergamot, bright orange, zesty lemon, and crisp green notes create an invigorating and uplifting start that feels dynamic and confident.<br>
Middle Notes: Rose, Jasmine, Lily of the Valley, Melon, Pear, Redberry 🌸🍐At the heart, elegant florals and juicy fruits intertwine. Rose and jasmine offer a refined floral character, while lily of the valley adds a clean, fresh touch. Melon, pear, and redberry bring a fruity sweetness that deepens the composition and adds a modern twist.<br>
Base Notes: Musk, Ambergris, Leather, Vanilla, Cedarwood, Patchouli 🤍🔥The dry-down is rich and masculine. Warm ambergris and soft musk create a luxurious foundation, while leather and cedarwood add strength and structure. Vanilla and patchouli lend a smooth, sensual depth that rounds off the scent with a long-lasting, memorable trail.<br>
Louis Cardin Credible Noir is ideal for men who love fresh yet sophisticated fragrances with a strong, charismatic character. It delivers a refined mix of freshness, fruit, and woody warmth—perfect for making a statement without being overpowering. Whether you’re heading to a meeting, a night out, or a special occasion, Credible Noir is a confident and versatile choice.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Louis Cardin",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,1299.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Louis-Cardin-Credible-Noir.png?v=1779879839,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
louis-cardin-credible-homme-100ml-edp,Louis Cardin Credible Homme 100ml EDP,"Louis Cardin Credible Homme 100ml EDP For Men – A Refined Fresh-Woody Elegance ✨
