louis-cardin-ray-100ml-edp,Louis Cardin Ray 100ml EDP,"Louis Cardin Ray 100ml EDP For Men – A Warm Honeyed Oud Sophistication ✨Louis Cardin Ray is a bold and luxurious Eau de Parfum crafted for men who appreciate rich sweetness blended with deep woody intensity. It opens with a smooth, golden warmth, unfolds into a refined floral heart, and settles into a powerful woody-oud base—perfect for evening wear, special occasions, and confident statements.Fragrance Notes ✨Top Notes: Honey &amp; Saffron 🍯🔥The opening is warm, sweet, and captivating. Honey delivers a rich, golden sweetness, while saffron adds an exotic, spicy depth—creating a striking and memorable introduction.Heart Note: Rose 🌹At the heart, rose brings refined floral elegance, softening the sweetness with a sophisticated, velvety touch that enhances the fragrance’s luxurious character.Base Notes: Cashmirwood, Agarwood (Oud) &amp; Sandalwood 🌲🤎The dry-down is deep, woody, and sensual. Cashmirwood offers smooth warmth, agarwood (oud) provides dark, resinous richness, and sandalwood adds creamy depth—leaving a long-lasting, powerful trail.Louis Cardin Ray is ideal for men who desire a fragrance that is sweet yet bold—warm and spicy at first, elegantly floral at heart, and intensely woody and refined at the finish. A statement scent of strength and sophistication.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Louis Cardin",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,5,deny,manual,1249.00,2000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Louis-Cardin-Ray.png?v=1779879809,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
louis-cardin-credible-oud-100ml-edp,Louis Cardin Credible Oud 100ml EDP,"Louis Cardin Credible Oud 100ml EDP For Women &amp; Men – A Sophisticated Ode to Oud ✨
Louis Cardin Credible Oud is a refined and luxurious Eau de Parfum crafted for both women and men who appreciate rich woody florals with a deep, elegant heart. This unisex scent opens with a warm and intriguing spice, transitions through a beautiful floral‑oud fusion, and settles into a smooth, sensual base—making it perfect for evening wear, date nights, and moments when you want a fragrance that feels both powerful and graceful.

Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Note: Saffron 🌶️The opening is bold and captivating with saffron’s luxurious spice. It immediately draws attention with its warm, slightly floral, and subtly exotic character—setting the stage for a rich aromatic journey.
Middle Notes: Jasmine, Agarwood (Oud), Rose 🌸🪵At the heart, jasmine and rose create a balanced, elegant floral bouquet. Deep within lies agarwood (oud), adding a resinous woody richness that gives the fragrance depth and complexity—smooth yet compelling, and beautifully unisex.
Base Notes: Musk, White Cedar Extract, Sandalwood 🤍🌲The dry‑down is warm and comforting as soft musk blends with creamy sandalwood and refined white cedar extract. This combination leaves a lasting, velvety trail that feels luxurious, masculine‑leaning yet still wearable for all genders.
Louis Cardin Credible Oud is ideal for anyone who enjoys sophisticated woody floral fragrances with a spicy opening, rich oud center, and smooth, sensual finish. It’s elegant, enduring, and perfect for both formal and intimate evening occasions.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Louis Cardin",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,5,deny,manual,1299.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Louis-Cardin-Credible-Oud.png?v=1779879841,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,oud,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lomani-el-paso-100ml-edt,Lomani El Paso 100ml EDT,"<p>El Paso by Lomani is a Aromatic Fougere fragrance for men. El Paso was launched in 2002. It's a master classy fragrance with long-lasting performance.</p>

