lalique-encre-noire-a-l-extreme-100ml-edp,Lalique Encre Noire A L’Extreme 100ml EDP,"<p>Lalique Encre Noire A L'Extreme 100ml Eau de Parfum for Men: A Pinnacle of Distinctive Elegance</p>

<p>Embark on an olfactory journey with Lalique's Encre Noire A L'Extreme, a fragrance that transcends boundaries, redefining sophistication for the modern man. This 100ml Eau de Parfum is a testament to Lalique's commitment to crafting unique and captivating scents that stand the test of time.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Cypress, Elemi Resin, and Bergamot: The initial impression is one of freshness and vitality, as the crisp notes of cypress intertwine with the invigorating elemi resin and the citrusy spark of bergamot. This aromatic symphony captivates the senses, setting the stage for the deeper layers that follow.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Haitian Vetiver, Vetiver, Incense, and Orris: Encre Noire A L'Extreme delves into the heart of its composition, revealing a rich tapestry of earthy vetiver, both Haitian and traditional, seamlessly blended with the mystical allure of incense. Orris adds a touch of floral sophistication, creating a mesmerizing and enigmatic core.</p>

<p>Base Notes: Benzoin, Sandalwood, and Patchouli: As the fragrance evolves, the base notes emerge to leave an unforgettable trail. Benzoin imparts a warm and sweet resinous quality, while sandalwood adds a creamy and velvety texture. The earthy and woody nuances of patchouli anchor the composition, leaving a lasting and luxurious impression.</p>

<p>Fragstalk.in - Your Fragrance Destination in India: Indulge in the allure of Lalique Encre Noire A L'Extreme by securing your bottle from Fragstalk.in, your ultimate destination for 100% original niche and designer fragrances in India. Experience the artistry of Lalique with confidence, knowing you are investing in a scent that reflects your distinctive style.</p>

<p>Elevate Your Scent Game with Lalique: Encre Noire A L'Extreme - a captivating expression of masculinity, sophistication, and timeless elegance. Unleash the extraordinary with Lalique.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Lalique",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,3399.00,7999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/lalique-encre-noire-a-lextreme.png?v=1779879776,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lalique-encre-noire-100ml-edt,Lalique Encre Noire 100ml EDT,"<p>Lalique Encre Noire 100ml EDT For Men: A Journey into Timeless Sophistication</p>

<p>Embark on an olfactory odyssey with Lalique Encre Noire, a fragrance that transcends time and encapsulates the essence of timeless sophistication. This 100ml Eau De Toilette for Men is a manifestation of refined masculinity, a true masterpiece that graces the wearer with an aura of distinction.</p>

<p>Distinctive Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: The initial encounter with Lalique Encre Noire is marked by the crisp and invigorating blend of vetiveryl acetate and cypress. This harmonious fusion of notes creates a fresh and captivating opening, setting the stage for the olfactory journey that unfolds.<br>
Middle Notes: As the fragrance evolves, the heart reveals the depth of character with the infusion of bourbon vetiver and Haitian vetiver. The rich and earthy middle notes add layers of complexity, creating a sense of mystery and allure that captivates the senses.<br>
Base Notes: Lalique Encre Noire's grand finale unfolds with the warm embrace of cashmere wood and musk. The base notes bring forth a subtle yet persistent trail, leaving an indelible mark of sophistication and elegance.</p>

<p>For the Modern Gentleman: Lalique Encre Noire is a fragrance for the modern gentleman who appreciates the artistry of perfumery. It seamlessly blends tradition with contemporary sensibilities, making it a perfect companion for every facet of life.</p>

<p>Fragstalk.in: Your Fragrance Destination in India: Indulge in the luxury of Lalique Encre Noire and explore an array of 100% original niche and designer fragrances at Fragstalk.in. As your one-stop destination for all fragrance needs in India, we bring you authentic scents at amazing prices. Elevate your sensory experience and let your fragrance speak volumes about your unique style.</p>

<p>Discover Lalique Encre Noire: Immerse yourself in the world of Lalique Encre Noire – a fragrance that transcends time, embraces sophistication, and defines the epitome of distinguished masculinity. Unleash the allure of Lalique Encre Noire and make every moment unforgettable.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Full, Lalique",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,2999.00,7550.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/lalique-encre-noire.png?v=1779879777,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,'1,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lalique-encre-noire-sport-100ml-edt,Lalique Encre Noire Sport 100ml EDT,"<p>Lalique Encre Noire Sport 100ml EDT For Men: A Symphony of Elegance and Dynamism</p>

<p>Embark on a journey of olfactory excellence with Lalique Encre Noire Sport, a fragrance that captures the spirit of modern masculinity. This 100ml Eau De Toilette is a testament to Lalique's commitment to crafting timeless scents that resonate with the discerning man.</p>

<p>Top Notes: An Invigorating Prelude The fragrance unfolds with a burst of freshness as grapefruit, bergamot, and nutmeg dance together in perfect harmony. This lively concoction sets the stage for an invigorating and uplifting experience, creating an immediate sense of vitality.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: A Tranquil Interlude As the journey progresses, the heart of Encre Noire Sport reveals a tranquil interlude with notes of cypress, watery elements, and lavender. This nuanced blend brings a sense of balance and sophistication, reminiscent of a serene oasis amidst the bustling energy of life.</p>

<p>Base Notes: A Resolute Finale The fragrance concludes with a resolute finale, anchored by the richness of bourbon vetiver, Haitian vetiver, cashmere wood, and musk. This base notes ensemble provides a solid foundation, leaving a lasting impression of strength, depth, and a touch of sensuality.</p>

<p>Fragstalk.in: Your Fragrance Haven in India Indulge in the world of original niche and designer fragrances with Fragstalk.in, your premier destination for authentic scents in India. Immerse yourself in a collection curated to cater to your diverse fragrance needs, ensuring you experience luxury and authenticity with every purchase.</p>

<p>👉 Experience Lalique Excellence: Unveil the allure of Lalique Encre Noire Sport – a fragrance that encapsulates the essence of a modern man's journey, available now at Fragstalk.in. Redefine your signature scent and make a statement wherever you go.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Full, Lalique",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,3399.00,7999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lalique-Encre-Noire-Sport.png?v=1779879774,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
