khadlaj-shiyaaka-blue-100ml-edp,Khadlaj Shiyaaka Blue 100ml EDP,"<p class=""isSelectedEnd""><strong><span>Khadlaj Shiyaaka Blue For Men 100ml EDP – Fresh Citrus with Woody Sophistication ✨</span></strong><br><strong><span>Inspired By: Bleu de Chanel</span></strong></p>
