khadlaj-onyx-100ml-edp,Khadlaj Onyx 100ml EDP,"Khadlaj Onyx 100ml EDP For Men – Smooth Power, Refined Seduction 🖤✨Aromatic • Creamy • Confident
Khadlaj Onyx is a modern masculine fragrance that balances freshness, softness, and depth with effortless confidence. Designed for men who appreciate understated luxury, this Eau de Parfum delivers a clean yet sensual character that feels polished from day to night. Smooth, aromatic, and comforting, Onyx leaves a calm but memorable impression—never loud, always refined.
Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Aromatic Notes &amp; Vanilla 🌿🤍The opening is instantly inviting. Fresh aromatic accords create a clean, masculine start, gently wrapped in creamy vanilla that adds warmth and subtle sweetness without overpowering the senses.
Heart Notes: Lavender &amp; Powdery Notes 💜🌫️At the heart, classic lavender brings timeless elegance and calm sophistication. Powdery notes soften the composition, giving it a smooth, velvety texture that feels comforting, refined, and effortlessly stylish.
Base Notes: Vetiver &amp; Musk 🌲🤍The dry-down is clean, earthy, and sensual. Vetiver adds a subtle woody depth, while musk creates a skin-like warmth that lingers gracefully, enhancing longevity and masculine appeal.
Perfect for office wear, casual evenings, and men who enjoy clean, aromatic fragrances with a creamy-powdery finish, Khadlaj Onyx is confidence in its most refined form.
✨ Sleek, smooth, and quietly powerful—Onyx defines modern masculinity.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Khadlaj",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,5,deny,manual,2599.00,4500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Khadlaj-Onyx.png?v=1779879717,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
khadlaj-shiyaaka-snow-100ml-edp,Khadlaj Shiyaaka Snow 100ml EDP,"Khadlaj Shiyaaka Snow 100ml EDP For Men &amp; Women – Crisp Brilliance, Spiced Elegance ❄️✨ Inspired by Meteore by Louis VuittonFresh • Spicy • Sophisticated
Khadlaj Shiyaaka Snow is a luminous unisex fragrance that blends icy freshness with warm spices, creating a refined contrast that feels modern and effortlessly chic. Clean yet expressive, this Eau de Parfum is made for those who love fragrances that are energizing at first spray and quietly captivating as they settle on the skin. It’s versatile, stylish, and perfectly balanced for all seasons.
Fragrance Notes ✨
