Heart Notes: Pink Pepper, Nutmeg &amp; Neroli 🌸🌶️At the heart, pink pepper adds a soft, rosy spice, while nutmeg introduces gentle warmth and depth. Neroli brings a smooth floral-citrus elegance that keeps the composition airy and refined.
Base Notes: Cardamom &amp; Vetiver 🌿🌱The dry-down is warm, earthy, and sophisticated. Cardamom adds aromatic spice, while vetiver grounds the fragrance with a clean, woody finish that lingers gracefully.
Ideal for daily wear, office settings, and anyone who enjoys fresh-spicy scents with a polished, unisex appeal, Khadlaj Shiyaaka Snow is cool, confident, and beautifully composed.
✨ Fresh like snow, warm at the core—Shiyaaka Snow is elegance in contrast.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Khadlaj",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,11,deny,manual,2849.00,4500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Khadlaj-Shiyaaka-Snow.png?v=1779879716,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,'1,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
