Khadlaj Titan is a powerful and confident men’s Eau de Parfum Inspired by Emporio Armani Stronger With You Parfum. Rich, warm, and irresistibly smooth, this fragrance blends spicy freshness with creamy sweetness and a deep, sensual base. Designed for men who project strength with style, Titan is perfect for evenings, cooler weather, and moments when you want your presence to be felt.
