khadlaj-rose-couture-100ml-edp,Khadlaj Rose Couture 100ml EDP,"Khadlaj Rose Couture 100ml EDP – Luxurious Rose Elegance with Sweet Warmth 🌹🍐For Women | Floral • Fruity • Woody
