khadlaj-gaith-100ml-edp,Khadlaj Gaith 100ml EDP,"Khadlaj Gaith 100ml EDP – Spicy Boldness with Smoky Elegance 🌶️🌲
For Men | Spicy • Woody • Oriental

Khadlaj Gaith is a daring and sophisticated fragrance for men who command attention. It combines fiery spices with smoky incense and warm, sensual woods to create a bold, long-lasting scent that is both modern and timeless.

Fragrance Notes ✨

Top Notes: Pepper, Pink Peppercorns &amp; Ginger 🌶️💥
The opening is sharp and invigorating, with spicy black pepper and pink peppercorns accented by zesty ginger, delivering an immediate burst of energy and confidence.

Middle Notes: Incense, Lavender &amp; Cypress 🌿🔥
At the heart, smoky incense and aromatic cypress intertwine with calming lavender, adding a refined, mysterious, and elegant depth to the spicy opening.

Base Notes: Patchouli, Labdanum &amp; Vanilla 🤎🍦
The dry-down is warm, rich, and addictive. Earthy patchouli blends with resinous labdanum and creamy vanilla, leaving a long-lasting trail that is both sensual and sophisticated.

Perfect for evening wear, special occasions, or cooler seasons, Khadlaj Gaith is ideal for men who love bold, spicy-woody fragrances with a smoky, luxurious edge.

🌶️✨ Khadlaj Gaith – spice, smoke, and warm sophistication in one unforgettable scent.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Khadlaj",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,2099.00,2999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Khadlaj-Gaith.png?v=1779879711,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
