joovan-musk-59ml-cologne,Joovan Musk 59ml Cologne,"<p>Joovan Musk Eau de Cologne for Women 59ml – A Fresh, Elegant Essence 🌸</p>

<p>Experience the timeless elegance of Joovan Musk Eau de Cologne, a refined fragrance made in France. This enchanting perfume offers a delicate balance of floral, citrus, and warm spicy notes, creating a scent that’s both refreshing and alluring. Perfect for the modern woman who appreciates sophistication and subtlety, Joovan Musk is designed to leave a lasting impression.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Note: White Floral Musk<br>
(A fresh and clean opening with soft, floral musk, setting a delicate tone.)<br>
Middle Note: Citrus<br>
(A burst of zesty citrus that adds a vibrant, energizing heart to the fragrance.)<br>
Base Note: Spicy Amber Facets<br>
(Warm, spicy amber that lingers and creates a rich, sensual finish.)</p>

<p>Joovan Musk Eau de Cologne is ideal for everyday wear, offering a long-lasting, balanced scent that can be worn for both casual and special occasions. Its light yet captivating aroma makes it a perfect choice for those who seek elegance without being overpowering. Embrace the essence of French sophistication with Joovan Musk Eau de Cologne and indulge in a fragrance that exudes both freshness and warmth.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Joovan",true,Size,59ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1010.00,1400.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Joovan-Musk-Eau-de-Cologne.png?v=1779879704,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
joovan-sex-appeal-88ml-cologne,Joovan Sex Appeal 88ml Cologne,"<p>Joovan Sex Appeal Eau De Cologne for Men 88ml – Unleash Your Confidence 🌟</p>

<p>Experience the irresistible allure of Joovan Sex Appeal Eau De Cologne for Men, an aromatic spicy fragrance crafted in France. Designed for the modern man, this cologne combines the perfect balance of musk, spices, and woods, creating a scent that exudes masculinity and confidence.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes:<br>
Fresh and invigorating, the fragrance opens with a blend of aromatic spices that awaken the senses.<br>
Middle Notes:<br>
A rich heart of musky and woody accords that add depth and sophistication.<br>
Base Notes:<br>
A warm, sensual base with earthy woods that linger on the skin, leaving a lasting impression.</p>

<p>This long-lasting cologne ensures that you stay confident and captivating throughout the day. Whether for a casual outing or a night out, Joovan Sex Appeal will help you make a statement with every spray. Embrace the essence of masculinity and elevate your scent game with this timeless, unforgettable fragrance. Perfect for those who seek a bold and confident presence.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Joovan",true,Size,88ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1099.00,1500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Joovan-Sex-Appeal-Eau-De-Cologne.png?v=1779879704,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
joovan-platinum-musk-59ml-cologne-spray,Joovan Platinum Musk 59ml Cologne Spray,"<p>Joovan Platinum Musk For Men Cologne Spray 59ml – A Refined and Invigorating Scent 🌟</p>

<p>Joovan Platinum Musk For Men is a sophisticated cologne spray made in France that brings an energetic yet refined fragrance experience. This versatile scent is perfect for the modern man who enjoys a refreshing, long-lasting fragrance with a touch of sensuality.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes:<br>
Fresh and citrusy notes, such as lemon and bergamot, provide a vibrant, uplifting opening that instantly awakens the senses.<br>
Base Notes:<br>
The heart of the fragrance reveals delicate floral notes, often including jasmine or rose, blended seamlessly with musk, creating a soft yet captivating bouquet.<br>
Base Notes:<br>
The scent finishes with warm, sensual musky notes, sometimes enhanced with a subtle hint of amber or wood, offering a comforting and lasting depth.</p>

<p>Joovan Platinum Musk is a perfect balance of freshness and warmth, making it an ideal choice for day-to-night wear. Whether you're heading to work, a casual outing, or a special occasion, this fragrance ensures you make a lasting impression. Elevate your scent game with this high-quality, sophisticated cologne.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Joovan",true,Size,59ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,999.00,1500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Joovan-Plantinum-Musk.png?v=1779879703,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
