jaguar-classic-100ml-edt,Jaguar Classic 100ml EDT,"The perfumes draw on the DNA of the Jaguar aesthetic and its iconic heritage. They are a constant source of surprise and inspiration, combining powerful character and proud dynamism.

""THE INSTINCT OF THE IRRESISTIBLE""

A fragrance that is fresh and seductive, that inspires the senses and appeals to the natural instinct of modern man for the exceptional and the exclusive. A captivating, pure, incomparable, and masculine design inspired by the sleekly elegant shape of the modern generation of Jaguar automobiles. The core values of this fragrance are sensuality, masculinity, power, and elegance.""
Top Notes: Bergamont, Anis Star, Grapefruit
Heart Notes: Lavender, Lotus Flower, Ginger
Base Notes: Sandalwood, White Musk, Benzoin
 

The refreshing note perceived at first contact comes from the refined blend of mandarin, bergamot and orange. This pleasing prelude flows immediately into the aromatic accord of lavender, juniper berry, basil and anise star. It evolves into a fine heart note in which the delicacy of lotus flowers and orange blossom blends seductively with the spiciness of ginger. It is the subtle woody and balsamic notes, accompanied by luxurious sandalwood, sumptuous benzoin and white musk, which are responsible for the lasting sensuousness of this fragrance.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Full, Jaguar",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,2399.00,4500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Jaguar-Classic-100-ml-EDT.png?v=1779879694,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
jaguar-classic-black-100ml-edt,Jaguar Classic Black 100ml EDT,"<p>Jaguar Classic Black 100 ml EDT – Power Meets Elegance 🖤✨<br>
Jaguar Classic Black is a bold and sophisticated fragrance crafted for the modern man who values both charm and confidence. Designed in the tradition of oriental-fougère compositions, it strikes the perfect balance between invigorating freshness and seductive warmth, making it a timeless everyday signature.<br>
Fragrance Notes:Top Notes: Green Apple, Tangerine, Orange(A vibrant citrus-fruity burst opens the scent with energy and crisp freshness, instantly uplifting the mood.)<br>
Middle Notes: Cardamom, Nutmeg, Black Tea(Spicy and aromatic accords create a refined heart, blending warmth with elegance, while black tea adds depth and intrigue.)<br>
Base Notes: Sandalwood, White Musk, Cedarwood(A smooth and sensual dry-down of creamy woods and musk lingers with sophistication and masculine strength.)<br>
Jaguar Classic Black is perfect for office wear, evening outings, and special occasions where you want to leave a lasting impression. Its versatile character makes it an essential in every fragrance wardrobe.<br>
Confident, sensual, and undeniably masculine, Jaguar Classic Black is more than a fragrance—it’s a statement of refined power and timeless elegance. 🖤</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Full, Jaguar",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1949.00,4500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Jaguar-Classic-Black-100-ml-EDT.png?v=1779879694,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
jaguar-classic-electric-sky-100ml-edt,Jaguar Classic Electric Sky 100ml EDT,"<p>Classic Electric Sky by Jaguar is a Aromatic Fougere fragrance for men. This is a new fragrance. Classic Electric Sky was launched in 2020. The nose behind this fragrance is Alexandra Monet. Top notes are Violet Leaf, Grapefruit and Sichuan Pepper; middle notes are Geranium, Lavender and Clary Sage; base notes are Amberwood, Oakmoss and Tonka Bean.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Full, Jaguar",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1899.00,3300.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/JAGUAR-Classic-Electric-Sky-Men-EDT100-ml.png?v=1779879691,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
jaguar-imperial-100ml-edt,Jaguar Imperial 100ml EDT,"<p>Jaguar Imperial Eau de Toilette is a conspicuously masculine fragrance that will give you self-confidence at any time of the day.</p>

<p>Britains Jaguar is a car manufacturer founded in 1922, although it only changed its name to Jaguar in 1945. Sir William Lyons and William Walmsley embarked on the production of luxury and sports cars, which over time have become sought-after luxury sports cars.</p>

<p>Jaguar is popular amongst many well-known celebrities. The first Jaguar perfume was created in 1986. Like the car, it is of high quality, original, and full of power and luxury. Jaguar fragrance is not just produced for men but women too who like to treat themselves and allow themselves to be dominated by a unique sensuality.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes :</p>

<p>Top Notes : Artemisia, Elemi, Italian Mandarin<br>
Middle Notes : Ginger, Nutmeg, Violet Leaves<br>
Base Notes : Cypress, Tonka Beans, Vetiver</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Full, Jaguar",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1899.00,3300.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Jaguar-Imperial-For-Men-100-ML-Edt.png?v=1779879691,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
jaguar-prive-100ml-edt,Jaguar Prive 100ml EDT,"<p>The top opens with sweet and warm bergamot orange for a cheerful and compelling citrus wave. A hint of tropical air permeates the first impression for an added delight. Aromatic lavender creates a sunny, minty heart for a relaxed yet distinctly elegant impact, including undertones of green herbs. The base has an intense, hearty woodiness for a timeless aroma; the earthy tones of birch join seductive benzoin and animalic musk for aroma depth and a strongly masculine yet clean essence.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Full, Jaguar",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1899.00,3300.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/JAGUAR-FOR-MEN-PRIVE-EDT-100ML.webp?v=1780383001,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
