jaguar-excellence-100ml,Jaguar Excellence 100ml,"<p>Excellence by Jaguar is a Amber Spicy fragrance for men. Excellence was launched in 2012. The nose behind this fragrance is Richard Ibanez.</p>

<p>Top notes are Pink Pepper, Grapefruit and Mandarin Orange</p>

<p>Middle notes are iris, Orange Blossom and Lily-of-the-Valley</p>

<p>Base notes are Vanilla, Tonka Bean and Amber.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Jaguar",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1999.00,3300.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Jaguar-Excellence-For-Men-100-ml.png?v=1779879689,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
jacques-bogart-one-man-show-100ml,Jacques Bogart One Man Show 100ml,"<p>One Man Show by Jacques Bogart is a Chypre fragrance for men. Very classic fragrance and reminds you of the old days. One of the best masculine chypres and hugely underrated in the grand scheme of things. Quite distinctive and complex with pine needles, herbs, spice, incense, and woods and smells equally cold and warm. Nose piercing aromatic top notes of basil, bergamot, galbanum, caraway, and interestingly artemisia up there which gives it a cold industrial somber feel while I imagine the industrial site is surrounded by a woody pine forest. The florals are fairly restrained and the keynotes throughout are the basil, pine, and incense. Has an underlying woody-spicy warmth and a dirty earthiness from the patchouli, moss, and vetiver plus some warm spices and animatics. As a whole excellent quality for the price and very interesting and innovative use of notes. A powerhouse classic and a thrilling piece of perfumery.</p>

<p>The nose behind this fragrance is Roger Pellegrino.</p>

<p>Top notes are Basil, Bergamot, Caraway, Artemisia, Galbanum and Brazilian Rosewood</p>

<p>Middle notes are Pine Tree Needles, Carnation, Nutmeg, Patchouli, Spices, Vetiver, Geranium, Labdanum, Rose and Jasmine</p>

<p>Base notes are Oakmoss, Leather, Cedar, Sandalwood, Styrax, Amber, Tonka Bean, Castoreum, Vanilla, and Coconut.</p>

<p>Main accords: Woody, Aromatic, Fresh spicy</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Jacques Bogart",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1899.00,2000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Jacques-Bogart-One-Man-Show-Perfume-100-ml.png?v=1779879688,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,oakmoss; leather; cedar; styrax; sandalwood; castoreum; amber; tonka-bean; coconut,jacques-bogart,,,edt,,jacques-bogart,,spicy; floral,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Jacques-Bogart/One-Man-Show-7795.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,woody; aromatic; fresh-spicy; warm-spicy; green,,pine-tree-needles; carnation; patchouli; nutmeg-1; spices; vetiver; geranium; labdanum; rose; jasmine,,,,,,,,,,,daily-wear,,,fresh-clean,basil; bergamot; caraway; artemisia; galbanum; brazilian-rosewood,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
jacques-bogart-one-man-show-oud-100ml,Jacques Bogart One Man Show Oud 100ml,"<p>Jacques Bogart One Man Show Oud Edition is one of the most classic woody-spicy and little sweet fragrances with long-lasting and beast performance. The main fragrance notes in this fragrance are oud, leather, warm spices so it's totally aromatic fragrance with a hint of tobacco. Its masculine and strong fragrance.</p>

<p>One Man Show Oud Edition by Jacques Bogart is a Woody Aromatic fragrance for men.</p>

