ibraheem-al-qurashi-blue-oud-100ml-edp,Ibraheem Al Qurashi Blue Oud 100ml EDP,"<p>Ibraheem Al Qurashi Blue Oud 100ML Eau De Parfum: A Symphony of Elegance and Allure</p>

<p>Embark on a journey of sophistication and refinement with Ibraheem Al Qurashi Blue Oud Eau De Parfum. This exquisite fragrance, housed in a 100ml bottle, is a testament to timeless elegance and unparalleled allure. Crafted with precision and care, it captivates the senses and leaves an indelible impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>🔥 Beast Mode Longevity: Experience the epitome of longevity with Ibraheem Al Qurashi Blue Oud. Its formidable staying power ensures you remain enveloped in its enchanting aura from dawn to dusk, and beyond. Step confidently through every moment, knowing that your fragrance speaks volumes about your refined taste.</p>

<p>💐 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: The journey begins with a mesmerizing blend of blue lily and oud, creating a captivating opening that entices the senses and sets the stage for the olfactory voyage ahead.<br>
Middle Notes: As the fragrance unfolds, notes of patchouli and leather emerge, adding depth and complexity to the composition. Feel the subtle interplay of earthy and leathery accords, creating a harmonious balance that resonates with sophistication.<br>
Base Notes: The grand finale is a rich tapestry of amber and tobacco, infusing the fragrance with warmth and sensuality. Immerse yourself in the luxurious embrace of these base notes, leaving a lasting trail of elegance wherever you go.</p>

<p>🌦️ Suitable for All Weather: Whether it's a scorching summer day or a chilly winter evening, Ibraheem Al Qurashi Blue Oud is your perfect companion. Its versatility makes it suitable for all weather conditions, ensuring you exude confidence and charm regardless of the forecast.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","best seller, Full, Ibraheem Al Qurashi",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,11,deny,manual,3899.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Ibraheem-Al-Qurashi-Blue-Oud.png?v=1779879670,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,tobacco; amber,ibraheem-al-qurashi,,,edp,,made-in-uae,,oud,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Ibraheem-AlQurashi/Blue-Oud-100576.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,oud; leather; patchouli; tobacco; animalic,,leather; patchouli,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,oud; blue-lilies,,,for-men,,'1,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
ibraheem-al-qurashi-cuban-tobacco-100ml-extrait-de-parfum,Ibraheem Al Qurashi Cuban Tobacco 100ml Extrait De Parfum,"<p>Experience Timeless Masculinity with Ibraheem Al Qurashi Cuban Tobacco 100ML Extrait de Parfum for Men 🌟</p>

<p>Embrace the essence of refined masculinity with Ibraheem Al Qurashi's Cuban Tobacco, an Extrait de Parfum meticulously crafted to captivate the senses and leave an indelible impression. Made in the UAE, this fragrance epitomizes sophistication and endurance, ensuring you exude confidence and allure throughout the day and into the night.</p>

<p>🔥 Unparalleled Longevity: Prepare to embark on an olfactory journey that transcends time. Ibraheem Al Qurashi's Cuban Tobacco boasts exceptional longevity, enveloping you in its intoxicating embrace from dawn till dusk. Revel in the assurance that your presence will linger long after you've departed, leaving a trail of undeniable magnetism in your wake.</p>

<p>💨 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

