<p>🏙️ Made in UAE: Crafted with precision in the United Arab Emirates, Ibraheem Al Qurashi's Cuban Tobacco pays homage to the rich heritage of perfumery in the region. Each bottle encapsulates the essence of luxury and sophistication, ensuring an unparalleled sensory experience for the discerning gentleman.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","Full, Ibraheem Al Qurashi",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,4499.00,6999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Ibraheem-Al-Qurashi-Cuban-Tobacco.png?v=1779879668,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,honey; coconut,ibraheem-al-qurashi,,,extrait,,made-in-uae,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Ibraheem-AlQurashi/Cuban-Tobacco-132201.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,tobacco; sweet; woody; warm-spicy; honey,,sandalwood; leather; vanilla,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,tobacco; cocoa,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
