ibraheem-al-qurashi-sandalwood-100ml-edp,Ibraheem Al Qurashi Sandalwood 100ml EDP,"<p>Ibraheem Al Qurashi Sandalwood 100ML Eau De Parfum: A Symphony of Elegance and Longevity 🌟</p>

<p>Experience the epitome of luxury with Ibraheem Al Qurashi Sandalwood 100ML Eau De Parfum, a fragrance crafted to perfection in the UAE. This long-lasting perfume envelops you in an aura of sophistication and timeless appeal, suitable for both men and women.</p>

<p>💐 Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: The scent journey begins with the enchanting blend of Damask Rose and Raspberry, introducing a sweet and floral opening that is both captivating and refreshing.<br>
Heart Notes: The heart of the fragrance reveals a harmonious blend of Powder and Cedarwood, adding a layer of warmth and depth that resonates with elegance.<br>
Base Notes: The grand finale is a rich and opulent base of Amber and Sandalwood, creating a lingering trail of sophistication and sensuality.</p>

<p>🌟 High-Quality Craftsmanship: Ibraheem Al Qurashi Sandalwood is renowned for its exceptional quality and rich scent profile. This high-quality fragrance is a testament to the art of perfumery, offering a luxurious and immersive olfactory experience.</p>

<p>🌐 Versatile and Enduring: Ideal for both men and women, this sandalwood fragrance is designed to adapt to any occasion, ensuring you leave a lasting impression. Its long-lasting nature guarantees that you stay enveloped in its exquisite scent throughout the day and night.</p>

<p>Indulge in the allure of Ibraheem Al Qurashi Sandalwood and elevate your fragrance collection with this timeless masterpiece.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Ibraheem Al Qurashi",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,4899.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/ibraheem-al-qurashi-sandalwood.png?v=1779879659,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,sandalwood; amber,ibraheem-al-qurashi,,,edp,,made-in-uae,,woody,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Ibraheem-AlQurashi/Sandalwood-100577.html,,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,powdery; woody; amber; fruity; sweet,,powdery-notes; cedarwood,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,raspberry; damask-rose,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
ibraheem-al-qurashi-golden-amber-100ml-edp,Ibraheem Al Qurashi Golden Amber 100ml EDP,"<p>Ibraheem Al Qurashi Golden Amber 100ML Eau De Parfum – The Essence of Timeless Luxury 🌟</p>

<p>Indulge in the captivating scent of Ibraheem Al Qurashi Golden Amber, a high-quality, long-lasting attar made in the UAE. This rich-smelling fragrance weaves together musky and woody elements, creating an enchanting experience that elevates your senses. Inspired by the Alps, it is a perfect blend of indulgence, strength, and timeless elegance.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Bergamot and Nutmeg<br>
(A refreshing burst of citrus and spice that uplifts and awakens the senses.)<br>
Middle Notes: Violet and Cistus Incanus<br>
(A soft, floral heart with calming sweetness, adding depth and elegance to the fragrance.)<br>
Base Notes: Ambergris and Patchouli<br>
(Warm, earthy, and musky notes that linger, offering a luxurious and lasting finish.)</p>

<p>Golden Amber opens with the vibrant freshness of Bergamot and Nutmeg, which seamlessly blend into the heart of Violet and Cistus Incanus, offering a comforting floral touch. The Ambergris and Patchouli base add a layer of warmth and depth, creating a long-lasting, indulgent fragrance. Floating over the Alps, the fragrance carries a musky woody scent, balanced by citrus notes that revive your inner youth and energy. Perfect for any occasion, Ibraheem Al Qurashi Golden Amber envelops you in a world of refined elegance.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Ibraheem Al Qurashi",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,12,deny,manual,4999.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Ibraheem-Al-Qurashi-Golden-Amber.png?v=1779879659,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,birch; citruses,ibraheem-al-qurashi,,Oriental Woody,edp,,made-in-uae,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Ibraheem-AlQurashi/Golden-Amber-100575.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,leather; amber; floral; smoky; citrus,,leather; rose,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,amber; carnation,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
ibraheem-al-qurashi-mexican-tobacco-100ml-extrait-de-parfum,Ibraheem Al Qurashi Mexican Tobacco 100ml Extrait De Parfum,"<p>Ibraheem Al Qurashi Mexican Tobacco 100ml Extrait De Parfum – A Bold Tapestry of Elegance and Intrigue 🌿🍫<br>
An intoxicating blend of rich woods, decadent chocolate, and smoky tobacco, Mexican Tobacco by Ibraheem Al Qurashi is a statement of refined luxury. Crafted in the UAE with an Extrait de Parfum concentration, this fragrance offers unparalleled longevity and depth.<br>
