ibraheem-al-qurashi-musk-al-fajr-75ml-edp,Ibraheem Al Qurashi Musk Al Fajr 75ml EDP,"<p>Ibraheem Al Qurashi Musk Al Fajr 75ml EDP – The Dawn of Pure Elegance 🌅✨<br>
Musk Al Fajr by Ibraheem Al Qurashi is an enchanting Eau de Parfum that captures the serene beauty of dawn — a moment where light, freshness, and softness awaken the senses. Inspired by Gaultier Divine by Jean Paul Gaultier, this fragrance radiates luminous femininity and refined grace, wrapping the wearer in a soft yet empowering aura of purity and sophistication.<br>
The fragrance opens with a bright and sparkling blend of calypsone, bergamot, and red berries — a refreshing, juicy introduction that evokes the crisp air of early morning. This radiant beginning gives way to a delicate floral heart of lily, ylang-ylang, and jasmine. Together, they bloom in harmony, embodying elegance, sensuality, and an inner glow that feels effortlessly divine.<br>
As the scent settles, the base reveals the signature warmth of musk intertwined with the creamy sweetness of meringue and the subtle depth of patchouli. This comforting, velvety foundation lingers beautifully on the skin, leaving behind a trail that is both modern and timeless.<br>
Fragrance Notes:<br>
Top Notes: Calypsone, Bergamot, Red Berries<br>
Middle Notes: Lily, Ylang-Ylang, Jasmine<br>
Base Notes: Musk, Meringue, Patchouli<br>
Musk Al Fajr is for those who embrace new beginnings with confidence and grace. Elegant, long-lasting, and exquisitely balanced, it is a fragrance that shines softly — like the first light of dawn touching your skin. 🌸☀️</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Ibraheem Al Qurashi",true,Size,75ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,2599.00,5000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Musk-Al-Fajr.png?v=1779879621,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,musk; patchouli,ibraheem-al-qurashi,,Floral Fruity Gourmand,edp,,made-in-uae,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Ibraheem-AlQurashi/Musk-Al-Fajr-100503.html,unisex,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,sweet; aquatic; musky; white-floral; powdery,,ylang-ylang; lily; jasmine,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,calypsone; bergamot; red-berries,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
ibraheem-al-qurashi-cullinan-diamond-iris-150ml-extrait-de-parfum,Ibraheem Al Qurashi Cullinan Diamond Iris 150ml Extrait De Parfum,"<p>Ibraheem Al Qurashi Cullinan Diamond Iris 150ML Extrait de Parfum: A Gem of Elegance 🌟</p>

<p>Experience the epitome of luxury with Ibraheem Al Qurashi Cullinan Diamond Iris 200ML Extrait de Parfum, a fragrance crafted to perfection in the UAE. This long-lasting scent envelops you in an aura of sophistication and opulence, making it the ultimate choice for those who seek a rich and high-quality fragrance.</p>

<p>💎 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: The journey begins with a refreshing burst of pineapple, grapefruit, and bergamot. These vibrant, fruity notes create an invigorating introduction that captivates the senses.<br>
Middle Notes: At the heart of Cullinan Diamond lies a harmonious blend of cedar, patchouli, and jasmine. This aromatic combination adds depth and complexity, infusing the fragrance with a warm and enticing essence.<br>
Base Notes: The scent culminates in a luxurious blend of oakmoss and woody notes. These rich, earthy tones provide a lasting and elegant finish, leaving a memorable trail that lingers throughout the day.</p>

<p>🌞 Inspired by Hacivat by Nishane: Cullinan DiamondIris stands as the best Inspired of the renowned Hacivat by Nishane, capturing its essence with unmatched quality. Each spray of this exquisite perfume transports you to a realm of elegance and sophistication, making it the perfect choice for any occasion.</p>

