ibraheem-al-qurashi-pink-diamond-sakura-150ml-extrait-de-parfum,Ibraheem Al Qurashi Pink Diamond Sakura 150ml Extrait De Parfum,"<p>Ibraheem Al Qurashi Pink Diamond Sakura 150ML Extrait de Parfum: A Blossom of Timeless Elegance 🌸<br>
Indulge in the allure of Ibraheem Al Qurashi Pink Diamond Sakura 150ML Extrait de Parfum, a fragrance that radiates feminine grace and sophistication. Crafted with meticulous attention to detail in the heart of the UAE, this perfume envelops you in an exquisite bouquet of floral and fruity notes, offering an experience that transcends time and trends.<br>
💎 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:<br>
Top Notes: The fragrance opens with a bright and refreshing fusion of orange blossom, peony, and mandarin, offering a sparkling introduction that dances on the skin with vibrant sweetness. The delicate blend of citrus and florals sets the stage for an unforgettable scent.<br>
Middle Notes: At the heart of this masterpiece lies a captivating blend of lily, rose, and cherry blossom. These timeless floral notes infuse the fragrance with a sense of elegance, wrapping you in a soft, romantic embrace that lingers gracefully.<br>
Base Notes: The scent evolves to a warm and sensual foundation of white musk, amber, and sandalwood. These rich, creamy notes create a luxurious base that enhances the fragrance’s depth, leaving behind a mesmerizing trail of sophistication that lasts throughout the day.<br>
🌞 Inspired by Stellar Times by Louis Vuitton: Pink Diamond Sakura mirrors the essence of Stellar Times by Louis Vuitton, capturing its refined beauty with unmatched craftsmanship. Each spray evokes the image of a serene garden at dawn, where floral beauty meets the clarity of a crisp morning air.<br>
Embrace the elegance of Ibraheem Al Qurashi Pink Diamond Sakura, and let its floral symphony enhance your every moment. A fragrance that embodies grace, luxury, and the timeless beauty of nature.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","Full, Ibraheem Al Qurashi",true,Size,150ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,4699.00,7000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Pink-Diamond-Sakura.png?v=1779879616,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,white-musk; amber; sandalwood,ibraheem-al-qurashi,,,extrait,,made-in-uae,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Ibraheem-AlQurashi/Pink-Diamond-Sakura-100546.html,women,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,,,lily; rose; cherry,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,orange-blossom-1; peony; mandarin,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
