ibraheem-al-qurashi-black-diamond-incense-150ml-edp,Ibraheem Al Qurashi Black Diamond Incense 150ml EDP,"<p>Ibraheem Al Qurashi Black Diamond Incense 150ML EDP For Men: A Legacy of Power and Prestige 🖤</p>

<p>Step into a world of bold sophistication with Ibraheem Al Qurashi Black Diamond Incense, a commanding fragrance crafted for the modern man who leaves an unforgettable mark. Created in the UAE with exceptional artistry, this scent is an expression of strength, mystery, and refined masculinity—where freshness meets smoke, and elegance meets intensity.</p>

<p>💎 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: The journey opens with a striking burst of aquatic notes, black currant, and birch. This fresh yet slightly dark introduction delivers a crisp, invigorating edge, balancing cool waters with a subtle smoky nuance that immediately captivates the senses.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: At its heart, incense weaves seamlessly with creamy vanilla and smooth sandalwood. This refined core brings warmth and depth, blending spiritual smokiness with soft sweetness, creating a magnetic contrast that feels both luxurious and addictive.</p>

<p>Base Notes: The fragrance settles into a powerful base of amber, smoke, leather, and oud. Rich, dark, and intensely masculine, these notes leave a long-lasting trail that exudes confidence, opulence, and undeniable presence.</p>

<p>🔥 Inspired by Layton by Parfums de Marly: Black Diamond Incense captures the seductive balance of freshness and warmth found in Layton, reimagined with Ibraheem Al Qurashi’s signature depth and Middle Eastern soul.</p>

<p>A statement fragrance for evenings, special occasions, and men who command attention without saying a word.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Ibraheem Al Qurashi",true,Size,140ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,4199.00,7000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Ibraheem-Al-Ourashi-Black-Diamond-Intense.png?v=1779879609,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,amber; smoke; leather; oud,ibraheem-al-qurashi,,Oriental Woody,edp,,made-in-uae,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Ibraheem-AlQurashi/Black-Diamond-Incense-100548.html,,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,woody; smoky; vanilla; amber; powdery,,vanilla; sandalwood; incense,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,black-current; birch; aquatic-1,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
ibraheem-al-qurashi-blue-diamond-aqua-150ml-edp,Ibraheem Al Qurashi Blue Diamond Aqua 150ml EDP,"<p>Ibraheem Al Qurashi Blue Diamond Aqua 150ML EDP For Men: The Power of the Endless Horizon 🌊💎</p>

<p>Immerse yourself in the refreshing depth of Ibraheem Al Qurashi Blue Diamond Aqua, a fragrance that captures the spirit of open seas and boundless confidence. Expertly crafted in the UAE, this scent is designed for the man who thrives on freedom, clarity, and understated strength—where aquatic freshness meets refined warmth.</p>

<p>💎 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: The fragrance opens with an invigorating wave of sea notes, enriched by the exotic touch of saffron and the sparkling brightness of bergamot. This opening is crisp, mineral, and slightly spicy, evoking the cool breeze of the ocean at dawn.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: At the heart, vibrant citruses blend effortlessly with aromatic rosemary and the soft floral nuance of ylang ylang. This balanced composition adds energy and elegance, creating a clean yet sophisticated core that feels effortlessly modern.</p>

<p>Base Notes: As the scent deepens, incense, musk, and patchouli form a smooth, sensual foundation. Smoky and earthy undertones anchor the freshness, leaving a refined and long-lasting trail that radiates confidence and calm authority.</p>

<p>🌊 Inspired by Imperial Valley by Gissah: Blue Diamond Aqua mirrors the majestic freshness and depth of Imperial Valley, infused with Ibraheem Al Qurashi’s signature richness and craftsmanship.</p>

<p>A versatile fragrance perfect for day or night, Blue Diamond Aqua is a statement of freshness, elegance, and timeless masculine allure.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Ibraheem Al Qurashi",true,Size,150ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,4499.00,7000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Ibraheem-Al-Qurashi-Blue-Diamond-Aqua.png?v=1779879607,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,incense; musk; patchouli,ibraheem-al-qurashi,,Aromatic Aquatic,edp,,made-in-uae,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Ibraheem-AlQurashi/Blue-Diamond-Aqua-100549.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,aromatic; citrus; fresh-spicy; marine; musky,,rosemary; citruses; ylang-ylang,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,sea-note; saffron; bergamot,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
