ibraheem-al-qurashi-vicuna-lthr-75ml-edp,Ibraheem Al Qurashi Vicuna LTHR 75ml EDP,"Ibraheem Al Qurashi Vicuna LTHR 75ml EDP For Men &amp; Women 🖤✨Made in UAE
Ibraheem Al Qurashi Vicuna LTHR is a deeply sophisticated Eau de Parfum designed for men and women who appreciate bold aromatic freshness blended with rich oriental resins and a smooth leathery-woody foundation. Complex, elegant, and long-lasting, this fragrance moves through layers of herbs, spices, incense, and warm woods—creating a scent that feels powerful, refined, and timelessly luxurious.
