hugo-boss-bottled-deodorant-150ml,Hugo Boss Bottled Deodorant 150ml,"<p>Hugo Boss Bottled Deodorant 150ml – A Bold Signature of Confidence and Style 💼✨</p>

<p>Hugo Boss Bottled Deodorant is an invigorating fragrance experience that exudes sophistication and energy. Designed for the modern man, it blends vibrant freshness with an understated elegance that lasts throughout the day. This deodorant offers a refined balance of zesty, aromatic, and earthy notes, creating a lasting impression of strength and refinement.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Passionfruit, Mint<br>
(A refreshing burst of passionfruit paired with cool mint creates an uplifting opening, evoking a sense of vigor and clarity.)</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Geranium<br>
(The heart reveals a crisp floral note of geranium, adding a layer of subtle sophistication and warmth, balancing the freshness of the top notes.)</p>

<p>Base Notes: Vetiver<br>
(Vetiver grounds the fragrance with its earthy, woody essence, leaving a clean, refined finish that endures throughout the day.)</p>

<p>Ideal for daytime wear, this deodorant is perfect for work, casual outings, or any occasion that requires a touch of boldness and elegance. Its long-lasting formula ensures you stay fresh and confident from morning to night, making it an essential part of your grooming routine.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Deodorant, Full, Hugo Boss",true,Size,150ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1299.00,1650.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Hugo-Boss-Bottled-Deodorant.png?v=1779879565,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
hugo-boss-man-deodorant-spray-150ml,Hugo Boss Man Deodorant Spray 150ml,"<p>Boss Man Deodorant Spray 150ml – Energizing Freshness on the Go 🚿<br>
Unleash your confidence with the Boss Man Deodorant Spray, designed for the modern, driven man. A blend of invigorating freshness and enduring charisma, this spray ensures you stay fresh, energized, and ready for anything. Perfect for daily use, it keeps body odor at bay while delivering a sophisticated scent that lingers.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:<br>
Top Notes: Crisp Green Apple<br>
(A zesty and refreshing opening that awakens your senses and sets an energetic tone.)</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Vibrant Aromatic Notes<br>
(A bold and lively heart with herbaceous and slightly spicy nuances that exude confidence.)</p>

<p>Base Notes: Smoky Fir Balsam<br>
(A grounding and masculine finish that leaves a lasting impression of warmth and resilience.)</p>

<p>Stay fresher for longer with this dynamic fragrance, perfectly tailored for the active, ambitious lifestyle. Pair it with the full Boss Man lineup to create a complete, empowering grooming experience. Whether you’re heading to work, the gym, or a night out, this deodorant is your perfect companion.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Deodorant, Full, Hugo Boss",true,Size,150ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1299.00,1650.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Hugo-Boss-Man-Deodorant.png?v=1779879564,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
hugo-boss-number-one-100ml-edt,Hugo Boss Number One 100ml EDT,"Hugo Boss No.1 100ml Eau De Toilette – Classic Power with Aromatic Warmth &amp; Smoky Depth 🖤🌿🔥For Men | Aromatic • Woody • Spicy • Classic
Hugo Boss No.1 is a bold, old-school masculine fragrance that speaks of confidence, authority, and timeless style. It opens with a vibrant burst of citrus and herbs, evolves into a rich floral-aromatic heart, and finishes with a deep, smoky, and slightly sweet base. The composition feels complex yet balanced—perfect for those who appreciate classic perfumery with strong character.
Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Artemisia, Juniper, Bergamot, Lemon, Green Apple, Caraway, Basil &amp; Grapefruit 🍏🍋🌿The opening is fresh, green, and energetic. Citrus notes like bergamot, lemon, and grapefruit add brightness, while green apple introduces a crisp sweetness. Herbs and spices like basil, artemisia, juniper, and caraway create a sharp, aromatic edge.
Heart Notes: Honey, Lavender, Rose, Jasmine, Sage, Geranium, Lily of the Valley &amp; Orris Root 🍯🌸🌿At the heart, the fragrance becomes warm and slightly sweet. Honey adds a rich golden touch, while lavender and sage keep it aromatic. Florals like rose and jasmine soften the composition, and orris root adds a refined powdery nuance.
Base Notes: Tobacco, Oakmoss, Patchouli, Sandalwood, Musk, Amber, Cinnamon &amp; Cedar 🌳🔥🚬The dry-down is deep and masculine. Tobacco and oakmoss bring a smoky, earthy richness, patchouli enhances depth, while sandalwood and cedar add woody smoothness. Amber, musk, and a hint of cinnamon create a warm, lasting finish.
Perfect for formal occasions, evening wear, and lovers of classic scents, Hugo Boss No.1 is powerful, sophisticated, and undeniably timeless.
✨ Hugo Boss No.1 – a commanding blend of fresh aromatics, rich florals, and smoky woody warmth.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Full, Hugo Boss",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,4950.00,5099.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Boss-Number-One.png?v=1779879563,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
hermes-h24-100ml-edp,Hermes H24 100ml EDP,"<p>Hermes H24 For Men 100ml Eau de Parfum: A Modern Olfactory Masterpiece</p>

<p>Discover a new dimension of sophistication with Hermes H24, an olfactory symphony that redefines the essence of masculinity. This 100ml Eau de Parfum embodies the spirit of the modern man – bold, refined, and irresistibly charismatic.</p>

<p>Fragrance Unveiled:</p>

<p>Clary Sage: At the forefront of this aromatic journey is the enigmatic clary sage, a herbaceous note that introduces an herbal freshness, setting the stage for an olfactory exploration. This vibrant top note adds an invigorating touch, making H24 a fragrance that intrigues right from the first spritz.<br>
Oak Moss: As the scent evolves, the heart reveals the timeless allure of oak moss. Earthy and woody, this note adds depth and complexity, creating a robust and enduring core that resonates with natural elegance. It's a nod to the classic, seamlessly interwoven with modernity.<br>
Sclarene: The inclusion of sclarene in the composition introduces a hint of sweetness, adding a subtle sensuality to the fragrance. It bridges the herbal and woody facets, creating a harmonious blend that captivates the senses with every nuance.<br>
Metallic Note: The metallic note in H24 is the avant-garde touch that sets this fragrance apart. A contemporary twist, it introduces an industrial edge, symbolizing strength and innovation. This unexpected element adds an intriguing dimension to the olfactory journey, making H24 a scent that defies convention.</p>

<p>A Symphony of Elegance: Hermes H24 is a modern symphony of elegance, encapsulated in a 100ml Eau de Parfum. It transcends time and trends, offering a fragrance experience that is both timeless and cutting-edge. The sleek and minimalist bottle design mirrors the essence of the fragrance – refined simplicity.</p>

<p>🛒 Discover Fragrance Excellence at Fragstalk.in: Elevate your fragrance experience with 100% original niche and designer fragrances. Fragstalk.in, your go-to destination for all fragrance needs in India, offers a curated selection at amazing prices.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Hermes",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,7999.00,10000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Hermes-H24.png?v=1779879562,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
hermes-terre-d-hermes-75ml-parfum,Hermes Terre D’Hermes 75ml Parfum,"<p>Hermès Terre D'Hermès Parfum 75ml For Men: A Journey Through Nature's Elegance</p>

<p>Embark on an olfactory expedition with Hermès Terre D'Hermès Parfum, a fragrance that encapsulates the spirit of refined masculinity. This 75ml masterpiece is a testament to the artistry of Hermès, marrying sophistication with the raw beauty of nature.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Citrus Symphony of Orange and Grapefruit The symphony begins with a burst of citrus vitality, as zesty orange and invigorating grapefruit intertwine to create a refreshing opening act. A harmonious blend that immediately captivates the senses, embodying the essence of a sunlit orchard.</p>

<p>Middle Note: The Elemental Elegance of Flint At the heart of Terre D'Hermès Parfum lies the distinctive note of flint. This uncommon element introduces an earthy and mineral quality, reminiscent of the rugged terrain of nature. The middle note adds depth and complexity, resonating with the spirit of adventure.</p>

<p>Base Notes: Woodsy Serenity with Oak Moss and Benzoin The fragrance gracefully descends into a serene conclusion, where the richness of woods, the timeless allure of oak moss, and the warmth of benzoin converge. These base notes create a lasting impression, leaving a trail of sophistication that lingers on the skin.</p>

<p>A Timeless Ode to Nature: Terre D'Hermès Parfum is an ode to the beauty of the natural world, capturing the essence of earth and sky in a bottle. This fragrance is a celebration of the harmony between man and nature, offering a unique blend that resonates with the discerning gentleman.</p>

<p>Versatile Elegance for Every Occasion: Suited for the modern man who appreciates timeless elegance, Terre D'Hermès Parfum seamlessly transitions from boardroom to evening soirees. Its versatile nature makes it a signature scent, leaving a lasting impression wherever the journey takes you.</p>

<p>🛒 Discover Fragrance Excellence at Fragstalk.in: Elevate your fragrance experience with 100% original niche and designer fragrances. Fragstalk.in, your go-to destination for all fragrance needs in India, offers a curated selection at amazing prices.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Hermes",true,Size,75ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,8500.00,10000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Terre-Dhermes-Parfum.png?v=1779879561,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
hermes-terre-d-hermes-100ml-edt,Hermes Terre D’Hermes 100ml EDT,"<p>Hermes Terre D'Hermes 100ml EDT For Men: A Symphony of Earthly Elegance</p>

<p>Embark on a sensory journey with Hermes Terre D'Hermes, a fragrance that captures the essence of nature's boundless beauty. This 100ml Eau de Toilette for men is an olfactory masterpiece that unfolds in layers, revealing a harmonious blend of citrus, spice, and earthy undertones.</p>

<p>Citrus Freshness: The top notes of Terre D'Hermes radiate a vibrant burst of freshness, where the zesty allure of orange intertwines with the invigorating essence of grapefruit. This initial aromatic dance sets the stage for a fragrance experience that is both uplifting and refined.</p>

<p>Spicy Heart: As the journey continues, the heart of the fragrance emerges with a spicy embrace. Pepper, pelargonium, and flint create a dynamic and intriguing interplay. The warmth of pepper, the floral sophistication of pelargonium, and the smoky touch of flint converge to form a compelling aromatic symphony.</p>

<p>Earthy Resonance: The base notes of Terre D'Hermes unveil a deep and grounding experience. Vetiver, cedar, patchouli, and benzoin come together to evoke the richness of the earth. This foundation exudes an unmistakable sense of sophistication and masculinity, leaving a lasting impression that resonates with strength and timeless allure.</p>

<p>🏆 Award-Winning Excellence: Terre D'Hermes stands as a testament to its exceptional quality and craftsmanship, earning the prestigious FiFi Award for Fragrance Of The Year Men's Luxe in 2007. This accolade solidifies its status as an iconic fragrance that has captured the hearts of connoisseurs worldwide.</p>

<p>A Fragrance for the Modern Explorer: Perfectly suited for the modern man who embraces his connection to the natural world, Terre D'Hermes embodies a spirit of exploration and refinement. Whether worn during the day or for an evening rendezvous, this fragrance is a timeless companion that complements every facet of a man's journey.</p>

<p>🛒 Discover Fragrance Excellence at Fragstalk.in: Elevate your fragrance experience with 100% original niche and designer fragrances. Fragstalk.in, your go-to destination for all fragrance needs in India, offers a curated selection at amazing prices.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Full, Hermes",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,8275.00,10000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/terre-dhermes-edt.png?v=1779879560,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
havoc-silver-75ml-edt,Havoc Silver 75ml EDT,"<p>It is a very rare and hard to find perfume. This fragrance was originally produced back in the 1970 by mary quant which is skin friendly and natural by product.</p>

