hamidi-sandal-rose-10ml-attar,Hamidi Sandal Rose 10ml Attar,"<p>Hamidi Sandal Rose Attar 10ml – A Soothing Elixir for Daily Bliss 🌹🌿<br>
Crafted in the heart of the UAE, Hamidi Sandal Rose Attar blends the richness of traditional ingredients with a calming essence that soothes the mind and uplifts the soul. This concentrated perfume oil carries a serene aroma that transforms everyday moments into a luxurious escape.<br>
Fragrance Notes:<br>
Top Notes: Velvety Rose and Warm Amber(A delicate floral opening with a touch of warmth.)<br>
Middle Notes: Powdery Musk(A soft, musky heart that enhances its comforting appeal.)<br>
Base Notes: Sandalwood and Amber(A deep, woody finish that lingers gracefully.)<br>
Renowned for its stress-relieving and anxiety-reducing properties, this attar promotes deep relaxation and a restful sleep. Its powdery, amber, musky, and woody profile makes it perfect for daily use, leaving a subtle yet captivating trail that soothes the senses.<br>
Ideal for meditation, unwinding after a long day, or simply elevating your everyday aura, Hamidi Sandal Rose Attar is a timeless treasure that brings peace and positivity to your life. 🌸✨</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Attar, Full, Hamidi",true,Size,10ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,599.00,625.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Hamidi-Sandal-Rose.png?v=1779879555,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
