hamidi-addicted-intense-110ml-pure-parfum,Hamidi Addicted Intense 110ml Pure Parfum,"<p>Hamidi Addicted Intense Pure Parfum, a sensational olfactory journey designed exclusively for the modern man who seeks sophistication and longevity in his scent. This 120ml masterpiece offers an extraordinary aromatic experience, guaranteeing to leave an indelible impression.</p>

<p>There is no difference in UAE and French Batch Both have some performance and Oil concentrations. Currently, we have French-made</p>

<p>The fragrance opens with an electrifying burst of top notes that invigorate the senses. A harmonious blend of Pineapple, Bergamot, Black Currant, and Apple creates a fresh and fruity introduction, setting the stage for what's to come.</p>

<p>As the scent evolves, the heart notes take center stage, weaving a captivating tapestry of scents. Birch and Patchouli add a woody, smoky depth, while Moroccan Jasmine and Rose infuse an element of floral elegance, striking a perfect balance between masculinity and sensuality.</p>

<p>What truly sets Hamidi Addicted Intense Pure Parfum apart is its exceptional longevity. This fragrance boasts an unrivaled staying power, making it ideal for all-day wear and long evenings. The base notes of Musk, Oak Moss, Ambergris, and Vanille create a warm, rich, and inviting aura that lingers on the skin for hours on end.</p>

<p>For connoisseurs of fine fragrances, Hamidi Addicted Intense Pure Parfum is reminiscent of the legendary Creed Aventus, offering a similar allure but at a more accessible price point. It captures the essence of Aventus, making it an enticing choice for those who desire a sophisticated and long-lasting scent without breaking the bank.</p>

<p>Top Notes are Pineapple, Bergamot, Black Currant and Apple</p>

<p>Middle Notes are Birch, Patchouli, Moroccan Jasmine and Rose</p>

<p>Base Notes are Musk, oak moss, Ambergris and Vanille.</p>

<p>Hamidi Addicted Intense Pure Parfum 110ml for Men is not just a fragrance; it's a statement of refinement and endurance. Embrace the power of scent and leave a lasting impression wherever you go with this remarkable fragrance for the modern man.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Hamidi",true,Size,110ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,2249.00,4000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Hamidi-Addicted-Intense.png?v=1779879533,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,musk; ambergris; patchouli; vanilla,hamidi,,,edp,,hamidi,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Hamidi/Addicted-Intense-94301.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,fruity; citrus; leather; sweet; woody,,birch; jasmine; rose,,,,,,,,,,,daily-wear,,,,pineapple; bergamot; lemon; black-currant; apple,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
hamidi-addicted-madame-120ml-pure-parfum,Hamidi Addicted Madame 120ml Pure Parfum,"<p>Hamidi Addicted Madame Pure Parfum, a captivating olfactory masterpiece designed for women who exude confidence and allure. This enchanting fragrance is not just long-lasting; it's an enduring testament to the sophistication of its wearer.</p>

<p>Top Notes: The scent opens with a burst of citrus brilliance, blending the zesty freshness of Sicilian Orange, the sun-kissed allure of Calabrian Bergamot, and the crisp, invigorating notes of Lemon. These top notes instantly elevate your senses, leaving a trail of intrigue in your wake.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: As the fragrance develops, it unfurls into a lush bouquet of femininity. Delicate Rose petals entwine with a medley of Fruity Notes, adding a touch of sweetness, while the timeless elegance of Jasmine weaves an aromatic tapestry of floral beauty. This heart of the perfume is where its true essence shines, evoking a sense of grace and charm.</p>

<p>Base Notes: The allure deepens as the scent settles into its base notes. Here, Patchouli lends an earthy depth, while Madagascar Vanilla and Tonka Bean introduce a creamy sweetness that lingers on your skin. White Musk and Labdanum add a sensual, mysterious touch, creating a harmonious and unforgettable trail.</p>

<p>Hamidi Addicted Madame Pure Parfum pays homage to the timeless Coco Mademoiselle Intense by Chanel, capturing its essence with remarkable fidelity. It's a fragrance that encapsulates the essence of a confident, modern woman, mirroring her elegance and sophistication.</p>

<p>Top Notes are Sicilian Orange, Calabrian bergamot and Lemon</p>

<p>Middle Notes are Rose, Fruity Notes and Jasmin</p>

<p>Base Notes are Patchouli, Madagascar Vanilla, Tonka Bean, White Musk and Labdanum.</p>

<p>This 120ml bottle of pure parfum is more than just a scent; it's an accessory, a signature, and an embodiment of timeless allure. Whether worn during the day or for a special evening out, this fragrance is your secret weapon for leaving a lasting impression, making every moment unforgettable. Elevate your presence with Hamidi Addicted Madame Pure Parfum, where sophistication meets longevity in every exquisite drop.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Hamidi",true,Size,120ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,2799.00,4000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Hamidi-Addicted-Madame-Pure-Parfum-120ml.png?v=1779879532,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,patchouli; vanilla; musk; vetiver,hamidi,,,edp,,hamidi,,fresh,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Hamidi/Addicted-Madame-94315.html,women,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,citrus; rose; fresh-spicy; patchouli; aromatic,,rose; geranium; jasmine; litchi,,,,,,,,,,,party,,,,peach; bergamot; orange; grapefruit,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
hamidi-addicted-imperial-120ml-pure-parfum,Hamidi Addicted Imperial 120ml Pure Parfum,"<p>Hamidi Addicted Imperial Pure Parfum, a mesmerizing fragrance designed for both men and women. This exquisite scent is a testament to timeless elegance and enduring sophistication. Crafted with the utmost precision, it is a true olfactory masterpiece, offering a symphony of notes that tantalize the senses and leave an indelible impression.</p>

<p>Long-Lasting Luxury: Hamidi Addicted Imperial Pure Parfum is a testament to luxury that lasts. This fragrant masterpiece lingers on your skin, enveloping you in an aura of refinement and allure throughout the day and night. Its longevity is unrivaled, ensuring that you stay captivating wherever you go.</p>

<p>Notes of Opulence: At the heart of this fragrance lies a harmonious blend of top notes featuring the invigorating essence of Fruity Notes and the salty allure of Sea Salt. As it develops, the fragrance gracefully transitions into a captivating bouquet of Sicilian Lemon, Bergamot, Iris, and Mandarin Orange, adding a zesty and floral depth that is both alluring and sophisticated. Finally, the base notes of Sea Notes, Musk, and Woody Notes anchor the scent, leaving a trail of sheer opulence wherever you roam.</p>

<p>A Tribute to Timelessness: Hamidi Addicted Imperial Pure Parfum pays homage to the iconic Millésime Impérial by Creed, capturing its essence and elegance in every drop. It embodies the spirit of timeless luxury, allowing both men and women to revel in its exquisite charm.</p>

<p>Top Notes are Fruity Notes and Sea Salt</p>

<p>Middle Notes are Sicilian Lemon, Bergamot, Iris and Mandarin Orange</p>

<p>Base Notes are Sea Notes, Musk and Woody Notes.</p>

<p>Indulge in the allure of Hamidi Addicted Imperial Pure Parfum, an olfactory journey that transcends time and gender, leaving an unforgettable imprint of sophistication and allure wherever you go. Elevate your presence, make an impression, and embrace the essence of enduring luxury with every spray.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Hamidi",true,Size,120ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,2799.00,4000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Hamidi-Addicted-Imperial-Pure-Parfum-120ml.png?v=1779879531,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,ambroxan; musk; vetiver,hamidi,,,edp,,hamidi,,citrus; marine,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Hamidi/Addicted-Imperial-94307.html,women,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,aromatic; musky; citrus; marine; woody; powdery,,white-woods; violet; sandalwood,,,,,,,,,,,daily-wear,,,,bergamot; sea-note; red-fruits,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
hamidi-addicted-silver-120ml-pure-parfum,Hamidi Addicted Silver 120ml Pure Parfum,"<p>Hamidi Addicted Silver Pure Parfum, a captivating fragrance designed for the modern, confident woman. This 120ml bottle of pure luxury promises an enduring olfactory experience that lingers throughout the day and into the night. Crafted with precision, it is a remarkable tribute to elegance and style.</p>

<p>At the heart of this exquisite scent are top notes of Bergamot and Mandarin Orange. These citrusy overtones open the perfume with a burst of freshness, invoking the image of a sun-kissed orchard in bloom. As the scent evolves, the middle notes of Green Tea and Black Currant gently emerge, adding a touch of sophistication and intrigue. These elements create a delightful harmony that's perfect for both daytime and evening wear.</p>

<p>The base notes of Musk, Petitgrain, Sandalwood, and Galbanum anchor the fragrance with a warm and sensual foundation. They infuse the perfume with depth and character, leaving an unforgettable impression wherever you go. The musky allure combined with the woody and earthy undertones make this perfume truly distinctive.</p>

<p>Hamidi Addicted Silver Pure Parfum is a homage to the iconic Silver Mountain Water by Creed. It captures the essence of the original while offering a more affordable alternative, making luxury accessible to all. This long-lasting perfume for women is not just a fragrance; it's an experience that elevates your presence and leaves an indelible mark. Embrace the allure of sophistication and enchantment with every spritz of this exquisite perfume.</p>

<p>Top Notes are Bergamot and Mandarin Orange</p>

<p>Middle Notes are Green Tea and Black Currant</p>

<p>Base Notes are Musk, Petitgrain, Sandalwood and Galbanum</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Hamidi",true,Size,120ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,2799.00,4000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Hamidi-Addicted-Silver-Pure-Parfum-120ml.png?v=1779879530,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,musk; ambroxan; cedar; sandalwood,hamidi,,,edp,,hamidi,,aromatic,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Hamidi/Addicted-Silver-94314.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,citrus; musky; aromatic; rose; fresh-spicy; woody,,rose; jasmine; iris,,,,,,,,,,,daily-wear,,,,bergamot; lemon; lime; violet-leaves; black-currant; ginger,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
hamidi-prestige-esteem-80ml-edp,Hamidi Prestige Esteem 80ml EDP,"<p>Introducing Hamidi Prestige Esteem, an opulent olfactory experience in specially crafted for women who revel in luxury and allure. This remarkable fragrance is not only a sensory masterpiece but also boasts an alcohol-free formulation, making it gentle on the skin. Lasting power is elevated to an extraordinary level, ensuring that the captivating essence lingers throughout the day and into the night.</p>

<p>At the top, a symphony of citrus unfolds with the zesty dance of Blood Orange and Mandarin Orange, creating a bright and invigorating opening. The heart of the fragrance is a lush bouquet featuring the floral elegance of Honey, Gardenia, Orange Blossom, Jasmine, and Peach. This harmonious blend evokes a sense of femininity and sophistication. The base notes of Vanilla, Caramel, and Patchouli add a sweet and earthy depth, leaving a lingering trail of sensuality.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Blood Orange and Mandarin Orange.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Honey, Gardenia, Orange Blossom, Jasmine, and Peach.</p>

<p>Base Notes: Vanilla, Caramel, Patchouli</p>

<p>Hamidi Prestige Esteem is not just a fragrance; it's an affordable luxury that mirrors the allure of the iconic Scandal by Jean Paul Gaultier. This scent encapsulates the essence of its high-end counterpart, providing a great dupe for those who seek sophistication without compromising their budget. Unveil an aura of prestige and indulge in the lasting embrace of Hamidi Prestige Esteem.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Hamidi",true,Size,80ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,2399.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Hamidi-Prestige-Esteem.png?v=1779879529,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,patchouli; vanilla; caramel,hamidi,,,edp,,hamidi,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Hamidi/Esteem-88255.html,women,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,white-floral; sweet; citrus; fruity; lactonic,,orange-blossom-1; gardenia; jasmine; peach; honey,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,mandarin-orange; blood-orange,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
hamidi-prestige-status-80ml-edp,Hamidi Prestige Status 80ml EDP,"<p>Introducing Hamidi Prestige Status, an exquisite olfactory experience captured in an Eau de Parfum that transcends the ordinary. This alcohol-free formulation signifies a commitment to sophistication and subtlety, making it the epitome of modern masculinity. The fragrance boasts unparalleled longevity, ensuring that each spritz is a lingering testament to refined elegance throughout the day.</p>

<p>At the pinnacle of its aromatic symphony are invigorating top notes, where the zesty dance of Grapefruit and Lemon meets the cool breeze of Mint, underscored by the subtle heat of Pink Pepper. The heart of the fragrance unfolds with a magnetic blend of dynamic elements, including the spicy embrace of Ginger and Nutmeg, the floral allure of Jasmine, and the enigmatic presence of Iso E Super. As the fragrance settles, the base notes reveal a profound and lasting impression — a fusion of the mystical with the earthy. Incense intertwines with the grounding essences of Vetiver, Cedar, and Patchouli, while the warmth of Sandalwood and Labdanum converges with the ethereal trail of White Musk.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Grapefruit, Lemon, Mint and Pink Pepper.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Ginger, Nutmeg, Jasmine and Iso E Super.</p>

<p>Base Notes Incense, Vetiver, Cedar, Sandalwood, Patchouli, Labdanum and White Musk</p>

<p>Hamidi Prestige Status stands as a remarkable alternative to the iconic Bleu de Chanel by Chanel, capturing its essence with finesse. This fragrance is more than a mere dupe; it's an homage to timeless sophistication, offering an affordable yet luxurious option for those who appreciate the allure of prestige in every drop.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Hamidi",true,Size,80ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,2399.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Hamidi-Prestige-Status-Alcohol-free-perfume.png?v=1779879528,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,sandalwood; incense; patchouli; labdanum; white-musk; vetiver; cedar,hamidi,,,edp,,hamidi,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Hamidi/Status-88253.html,unisex,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,woody; citrus; amber; musky; warm-spicy; balsamic,,iso-e-super; jasmine; nutmeg-1; ginger,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,grapefruit; pink-pepper-1; lemon; mint,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
hamidi-prestige-fame-80ml-edp,Hamidi Prestige Fame 80ml EDP,"<p>Hamidi Prestige Fame, an Eau de Parfum that transcends traditional boundaries, is a captivating olfactory experience for both men and women. This remarkable fragrance is renowned for its exceptional longevity, ensuring you stay enveloped in its alluring aroma throughout the day and into the night.</p>

<p>At the pinnacle of this olfactory symphony are the top notes, a harmonious blend of Cognac and Saffron. These accords unfold an opulent and spirited introduction, setting the stage for an olfactory journey that is both luxurious and memorable. As the fragrance evolves, the heart reveals a captivating fusion of Cinnamon and Tonka Bean. This aromatic core adds depth and complexity, embodying sophistication and allure.</p>

<p>The journey concludes with a rich and lingering base, where Praline, Vanilla, and Sandalwood unite to leave an indelible impression. This trifecta of base notes imparts a creamy sweetness and a warm, woody sensuality that lingers on the skin, creating an irresistible allure.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Cognac, saffron.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Cinnamon, Tonka Bean.</p>

<p>Base Notes Praline, Vanilla and Sandalwood</p>

<p>Notably, Hamidi Prestige Fame is celebrated for being a superb alternative to the exquisitely expensive and popular fragrance, Angels' Share by By Kilian. This makes it a wallet-friendly option without compromising on the luxurious experience, making it an ideal choice for those who appreciate opulence and value. Immerse yourself in the prestige of Hamidi Fame, where enduring elegance meets affordability.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Hamidi",true,Size,80ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,2399.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/hamidi-prestige-fame.png?v=1779879527,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,vanilla; praline; sandalwood,hamidi,,,edp,,hamidi,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Hamidi/Fame-88254.html,women,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,warm-spicy; woody; sweet; cinnamon; vanilla,,cinnamon; tonka-bean,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,cognac; saffron,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
hamidi-addicted-absolutely-intense-110ml-parfum,Hamidi Addicted Absolutely Intense 110ml Parfum,"<p>Hamidi Addicted Absolutely Intense Parfum 110ml – The Power of Bold Seduction 🔥Crafted in the UAE, Hamidi Addicted Absolutely Intense captures the essence of unwavering confidence and timeless masculinity. This powerful extrait de parfum draws inspiration from Absolu Aventus by Creed, offering an irresistible blend of spice, warmth, and depth.<br>
