gulf-orchid-tahiti-colada-100ml-edp,Gulf Orchid Tahiti Colada 100ml EDP,"Gulf Orchid Tahiti Colada 100ml Eau De Parfum – Tropical Creamy Escape with Coconut Bliss 🥥🍍✨For Men &amp; Women | Tropical • Gourmand • Creamy • Fresh
Gulf Orchid Tahiti Colada is a vibrant unisex fragrance that captures the essence of a tropical getaway in a bottle. Bright, creamy, and irresistibly smooth, it blends juicy fruits with sun-kissed florals and a luscious gourmand base. Think beachside cocktails, warm breezes, and golden sunsets—playful yet relaxing, fresh yet indulgent.
Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Pineapple, Coconut, Aquatic Notes &amp; Liquor 🍍🥥🌊🍹The opening is refreshing and uplifting. Juicy pineapple bursts with tropical sweetness, while creamy coconut adds a soft, exotic touch. Aquatic notes bring a breezy freshness, and a hint of liquor gives it a fun, cocktail-like twist.
Heart Notes: Monoi Oil, Coconut &amp; Tuberose 🌺🥥✨At the heart, the fragrance turns sun-kissed and floral. Monoi oil delivers a warm, beachy glow, enhanced by creamy coconut. Tuberose adds a rich, velvety floral sweetness that feels both lush and radiant.
Base Notes: Vanilla, Whipped Cream, Sandalwood &amp; Musk 🍦🍨🌿🌫️The dry-down is smooth and addictive. Vanilla and whipped cream create a soft, dessert-like sweetness, while sandalwood adds a creamy woody depth. Musk wraps everything in a clean, lingering warmth.
Perfect for vacations, summer days, and relaxed evenings, Tahiti Colada is a cheerful, creamy tropical scent with a refreshing yet indulgent vibe.
✨ Gulf Orchid Tahiti Colada – a dreamy fusion of juicy fruits, creamy coconut, and sunlit sweetness.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Gulf Orchid",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,2780.00,4747.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Gulf-Orchid-Tahiti-Colada-1.png?v=1779879525,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
gulf-orchid-mango-ice-100ml-edp,Gulf Orchid Mango Ice 100ml EDP,"Gulf Orchid Mango Ice 100ml Eau De Parfum – Juicy Mango Freshness with Sweet Icy Twist 🥭❄️✨For Men &amp; Women | Fruity • Sweet • Fresh • Gourmand
Gulf Orchid Mango Ice is a lively unisex fragrance that blends the juicy brightness of tropical fruits with a cool, sweet gourmand finish. Playful and refreshing, it feels like a chilled mango dessert on a warm day—vibrant, slightly tangy, and irresistibly smooth with a cozy undertone.
Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Mango, Lemon, Ginger &amp; Rhubarb 🥭🍋🌿The opening is bright and energetic. Ripe mango takes center stage with its juicy sweetness, lifted by zesty lemon and a tangy hint of rhubarb. Ginger adds a subtle spicy kick, giving the fragrance a sparkling, refreshing edge.
Heart Notes: White Flowers, Amber &amp; Licorice 🌸🔥🍬At the heart, the scent becomes richer and more intriguing. White flowers bring a soft, airy elegance, while amber adds warmth. Licorice introduces a slightly dark, sweet twist that balances the fruity freshness beautifully.
Base Notes: Musk, Vanilla, Caramel &amp; Chestnut 🍦🌰🌫️The dry-down is smooth and comforting. Vanilla and caramel create a creamy sweetness, chestnut adds a warm nutty depth, and musk leaves a clean, soft trail that lingers gently on the skin.
Perfect for daytime wear, summer outings, and cheerful moods, Mango Ice delivers a refreshing burst of fruit wrapped in a creamy, sweet finish.
✨ Gulf Orchid Mango Ice – a delicious fusion of juicy mango, zesty freshness, and creamy warmth.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Gulf Orchid",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,3349.00,5499.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Gulf-Orchid-Mango-Ice.png?v=1779879524,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
gulf-orchid-cherry-kokomo-100ml-edp,Gulf Orchid Cherry Kokomo 100ml EDP,"Gulf Orchid Cherry Kokomo 100ml Eau De Parfum – Playful Cherry Gourmand with Fluffy Sweetness 🍒🍬✨For Men &amp; Women | Fruity • Gourmand • Sweet • Soft
Gulf Orchid Cherry Kokomo is a fun, addictive unisex fragrance that blends juicy red fruits with airy sweetness and a smooth, creamy base. Bright and cheerful at first spray, it धीरे-धीरे melts into a soft, candy-like warmth that feels youthful, cozy, and irresistibly charming—like a cherry dessert with a fluffy twist.
Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Cherry, Raspberry &amp; Mandarin 🍒🍓🍊The opening is vibrant and juicy. Sweet cherry leads with a rich, slightly tart bite, while raspberry enhances the berry sweetness. Mandarin adds a fresh citrus sparkle, making the first impression lively and uplifting.
Heart Notes: Cherry, Marshmallow, Rose &amp; White Blossom 🌸🍬✨At the heart, the fragrance becomes soft and dreamy. Cherry returns with a deeper sweetness, wrapped in fluffy marshmallow that gives a creamy, sugary feel. Rose and white blossoms add a gentle floral elegance, balancing the gourmand richness with a delicate touch.
Base Notes: Vanilla, Musk &amp; Ambergris 🍦🌫️🔥The dry-down is smooth and comforting. Vanilla adds creamy warmth, musk creates a clean softness, and ambergris leaves a subtle, long-lasting sensual trail.
