gucci-intense-oud-90ml-edp,Gucci Intense Oud 90ml EDP,"<p><strong>Gucci Intense Oud 90ml EDP: A Luxurious Symphony of Oud, Resins &amp; Dark Elegance | A Bold Unisex Fragrance of Pure Sophistication</strong></p>
<p>Gucci Intense Oud 90ml Eau De Parfum is a rich and opulent fragrance that embodies deep oriental luxury with a modern designer touch. Blending smoky resins, luscious fruits, precious florals, and powerful oud, this captivating scent is crafted for those who appreciate intensity, sophistication, and unmistakable presence. It delivers a dark, sensual aura that feels both refined and powerfully charismatic.</p>
<p>🔥 <strong>Unveiling the Fragrance Notes:</strong></p>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong> The fragrance opens with a striking fusion of frankincense, juicy raspberry, warm saffron, and crisp pear. This unique combination creates a smoky-sweet introduction that is both exotic and intriguing, setting a luxurious and mysterious tone from the very first spray.</p>
<p><strong>Heart Notes:</strong> At its heart, the elegance of Damask rose blends seamlessly with soft musk and radiant orange blossom. This floral-musky accord adds depth and smoothness, balancing the richness of the opening with a refined and sensual sophistication.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong> As the fragrance settles, it reveals a powerful base of agarwood (oud), leather, patchouli, and ambergris. These deep, smoky, and earthy notes create an intense and long-lasting trail, leaving behind a bold signature of warmth, strength, and timeless luxury.</p>
<p>🌿 <strong>Crafted for True Oud Connoisseurs:</strong> Gucci Intense Oud is more than just a fragrance—it is an expression of prestige and refined taste. Perfect for evening wear, formal occasions, and special moments, this Eau De Parfum is designed for individuals who seek a commanding, long-lasting scent with unmistakable depth and elegance.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Gucci",true,Size,90ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,10775.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/GucciIntenseOud.png?v=1783059064,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
