gucci-bloom-100ml-edp,Gucci Bloom 100ml EDP,"<p><strong>Gucci Bloom 100ml EDP – Pure White Floral Elegance with Timeless Femininity</strong> ✨</p>
<p>Discover <strong>Gucci Bloom EDP</strong>, a beautifully crafted fragrance that celebrates a rich bouquet of white florals in their most natural and expressive form. Soft yet powerful from the very first spray, this scent unfolds into a creamy floral heart before settling into a delicate, powdery floral trail that feels effortlessly elegant and graceful.</p>
<p>🌿 <strong>Fragrance Notes:</strong></p>
<p><strong>Top:</strong> Jasmine – A radiant burst of jasmine opens the fragrance with a luminous, fresh floral sweetness that feels pure and captivating.</p>
<p><strong>Heart:</strong> Tuberose – Creamy and opulent tuberose adds depth and sensuality, creating a rich white floral heart with a luxurious, velvety texture.</p>
<p><strong>Base:</strong> Rangoon Creeper – A unique floral accord that adds a soft, powdery, slightly sweet finish, giving the fragrance its signature modern and romantic character.</p>
<p>✨ <strong>Gucci Bloom</strong> is perfect for daily wear, special occasions, and intimate moments—a fragrance that embodies natural beauty, elegance, and timeless femininity with lasting charm.</p>
<p><strong>Long Lasting • EDP • Women</strong></p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Gucci",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,8650.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/GucciBloom.png?v=1782977023,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
gucci-flora-gorgeous-gardenia-100ml-edp,Gucci Flora Gorgeous Gardenia 100ml EDP,"Gucci Flora Gorgeous Gardenia 100ml Eau De Parfum – Bright Floral Sweetness with Playful Fruity Charm 🌸🍓✨For Women | Floral • Fruity • Sweet • Soft
Gucci Flora Gorgeous Gardenia is a joyful, feminine fragrance that radiates positivity and elegance. Light, sweet, and effortlessly charming, it blends juicy fruits with creamy white florals and a soft sugary base. The result is a scent that feels uplifting, delicate, and beautifully modern—like a blooming garden kissed by sunshine.
Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Pear Blossom, Red Berries &amp; Italian Mandarin 🍐🍓🍊The opening is fresh and sparkling. Pear blossom brings a soft fruity-floral brightness, while red berries add a juicy sweetness. Italian mandarin gives a zesty citrus lift, making the first impression vibrant and cheerful.
Heart Notes: Gardenia, Jasmine &amp; Frangipani 🌸✨🌼At the heart, the fragrance blooms into a creamy floral bouquet. Gardenia takes center stage with its rich, velvety sweetness, while jasmine adds a soft sensual touch. Frangipani enhances the composition with a smooth, tropical floral warmth.
Base Notes: Brown Sugar &amp; Patchouli 🍬🌿The dry-down is warm and gently addictive. Brown sugar adds a delicate caramelized sweetness, while patchouli provides a subtle earthy depth that balances the sugary softness.
Perfect for daytime wear, spring and summer seasons, and those who love light, sweet florals, this fragrance feels youthful, radiant, and easy to wear.
✨ Gucci Flora Gorgeous Gardenia – a delightful blend of blooming florals, juicy fruits, and soft sugary warmth.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, Gucci",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,10999.00,19999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Gucci-Flora-Gorgeous-Gardenia_0e549609-e100-4091-92f6-bbfdcd6c66f1.webp?v=1780383730,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
grandeur-elite-soaked-sun-exclusif-100ml-edp,Grandeur Elite Soaked Sun Exclusif 100ml EDP,"<p>Grandeur Elite Soaked Sun Exclusif 100ml EDP for Men: A Refreshing Oasis of Luxury 🌟</p>

<p>Discover the epitome of sophistication with Grandeur Elite Soaked Sun Exclusif, a 100ml Eau De Parfum crafted to embody the essence of freshness and lasting allure. Made in the UAE, this fragrance stands as a testament to meticulous craftsmanship and superior quality.</p>

<p>🍋 Captivating Fragrance Journey:</p>

<p>Top Note: A burst of zesty lemon awakens the senses, offering a refreshing start that instantly uplifts and energizes.<br>
Middle Notes: Delve deeper into a harmonious blend of mandarin and bergamot, adding a layer of citrus sophistication that is both invigorating and elegant.<br>
Base Notes: The allure concludes with a warm embrace of blood orange, orange, and grapefruit, creating a lingering trail of vibrant freshness that leaves a lasting impression.</p>

