french-avenue-aromatix-sun-kissed-100ml-extrait-de-parfum,French Avenue Aromatix Sun Kissed 100ml Extrait De Parfum,"<p>French Avenue Aromatix Sun Kissed 100ml Extrait de Parfum – A Golden Summer That Never Fades ☀️🍹<br>
Bask in eternal warmth with French Avenue Aromatix Sun Kissed, an extrait de parfum that captures the glow of a never-ending summer. Inspired by Never-ending Summer by Maison Martin Margiela, this fragrance is a radiant escape—where citrus-drenched afternoons melt into creamy, carefree evenings, and time seems to slow beneath a golden sky.<br>
Fragrance Notes:<br>
🍊 Top Notes: Bitter Orange, Pomelo, BergamotThe opening shimmers with sunlit citrus—bitter orange and juicy pomelo wrapped in sparkling bergamot. Fresh, luminous, and uplifting, it feels like sunlight on warm skin and the first breath of salty summer air.<br>
🫖 Middle Notes: Tea, Cream Soda, Aperol, CardamomAt the heart, an unexpected indulgence unfolds. Soft tea accords blend with fizzy cream soda and the bittersweet glow of Aperol, creating a nostalgic yet modern cocktail effect. Cardamom adds a gentle spice, warming the composition with effortless sophistication.<br>
