Sun Kissed is luminous, addictive, and endlessly comforting—a fragrance for those who carry summer in their soul, all year long. ✨</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","French Avenue, Full, Summer Essentials",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,4699.00,5250.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Aromatix-Sun-Kissed.png?v=1779879442,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,extrait,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
