Perfect for evening wear and special occasions, Obsidian is a statement of depth, confidence, and timeless masculinity. Leave a lasting impression—dark, smooth, unforgettable.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","French Avenue, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,4449.00,6999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/French-Avenue-Obsidian.png?v=1779879423,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
french-avenue-zenith-tobacco-100ml-edp,French Avenue Zenith Tobacco 100ml EDP,"French Avenue Zenith Tobacco 100ml Eau De Parfum – Dark Sweet Indulgence with Smoky Depth 🍫🔥🌿For Men | Gourmand • Sweet • Woody • Warm
French Avenue Zenith Tobacco is a rich and addictive men’s fragrance that blends decadent sweetness with deep, smoky undertones. Bold yet smooth, it delivers a luxurious balance of chocolatey warmth, golden honey, and earthy woods—perfect for those who enjoy intense, statement-making scents.
Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Chocolate &amp; Mandarin 🍫🍊The opening is both indulgent and vibrant. Dark chocolate brings a rich, velvety sweetness, while mandarin adds a subtle citrus brightness that lifts and balances the composition.
Heart Notes: Honey, Patchouli &amp; Caramel 🍯🌿🍬At the heart, the fragrance becomes warm and opulent. Golden honey and caramel create a luscious gourmand core, while patchouli introduces an earthy depth that keeps the sweetness grounded and masculine.
Base Notes: Tolu Balsam, Tonka &amp; Moss 🌲🔥🌫️The dry-down is deep, resinous, and long-lasting. Tolu balsam adds a smooth, slightly smoky richness, while tonka bean enhances the creamy sweetness. Moss provides a subtle green, earthy finish that lingers with sophistication.
Perfect for evenings, special occasions, and cooler weather, this Eau de Parfum offers strong projection and a bold, comforting aura.
✨ French Avenue Zenith Tobacco – a luxurious fusion of chocolate sweetness, smoky warmth, and woody depth.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","French Avenue, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,5,deny,manual,3880.00,5000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/French-Avenue-Zenith-Tobacco.png?v=1779879422,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
french-avenue-zenith-noire-100ml-edp,French Avenue Zenith Noire 100ml EDP,"<p>French Avenue Zenith Noire 100ml Eau De Parfum – Smoky Minimalism with Deep Amber Warmth 🔥🌫️🌿For Men | Woody • Amber • Smoky • Warm<br>
French Avenue Zenith Noire is a bold and refined men’s fragrance built on simplicity and depth. With just a few powerful notes, it creates a dark, atmospheric scent that feels mysterious, elegant, and quietly intense. Smooth transitions and a clean structure make it perfect for those who appreciate minimal yet impactful compositions.<br>
Fragrance Notes ✨<br>
Top Note: Incense 🌫️🔥The opening is immediately captivating, with rich incense setting a smoky, resinous tone. It’s deep, slightly spiritual, and creates a mysterious first impression that draws you in.<br>
Middle Note: Amber 🔥✨As it evolves, warm amber takes center stage, adding a golden, slightly sweet richness. This note softens the smokiness while enhancing the fragrance’s warmth and depth.<br>
Base Note: Vetiver 🌿🌲The dry-down is earthy and grounding. Vetiver brings a clean, woody sharpness with a subtle green edge, giving the scent a refined, masculine finish that lingers with quiet confidence.<br>
Perfect for evenings, formal settings, and cooler weather, this Eau de Parfum offers a sophisticated, long-lasting presence without overwhelming complexity.<br>
✨ French Avenue Zenith Noire – a dark harmony of smoke, warmth, and earthy elegance.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","French Avenue, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,5,deny,manual,3880.00,5499.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/french-Avenue-Zenith-Noir.png?v=1779879421,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
french-avenue-zenith-vanilla-100ml-edp,French Avenue Zenith Vanilla 100ml EDP,"French Avenue Zenith Vanilla 100ml Eau De Parfum – Boozy Citrus Warmth with Creamy Vanilla Depth 🍊🥃🍦For Men | Gourmand • Amber • Sweet • Woody
