franck-olivier-oud-touch-100ml-edp,Franck Olivier Oud Touch 100ml EDP,"<p>Franck Olivier Oud Touch 100ML EDP for Men is an exquisite olfactory masterpiece that embodies opulence, longevity, and sensuality. This fragrance is a symphony of notes expertly blended to create an unforgettable, long-lasting olfactory experience.</p>

<p>At the top, Oud Touch opens with a captivating burst of Caramel, Raspberry, and Orange. This initial fruity sweetness is layered with citrusy brightness, offering an enticing and inviting introduction. As the fragrance develops, it reveals a heart of Rose, Olibanum (frankincense), Patchouli, Violet, and Jasmine. These middle notes bring depth and complexity, with the sultry and exotic allure of Oud adding a rich, woody dimension.</p>

<p>The base notes of Amber, Vanilla, and Musk create a warm, sweet, and inviting foundation that lingers for hours. This sensuous blend wraps you in a comforting embrace, leaving a trail of elegance wherever you go.</p>

<p>What sets Franck Olivier Oud Touch apart is its remarkable resemblance to the luxurious and much pricier Oud Ispahan by Dior. It's a testament to the skill of the perfumer and the quality of the ingredients used in its creation. This fragrance provides an affordable option for those who appreciate the sophistication and allure of high-end scents but don't want to break the bank.</p>

<p>Top notes are Caramel, Raspberry and Orange</p>

<p>Middle notes are Rose, Olibanum, Patchouli, Violet and Jasmine</p>

<p>Base notes are Amber, Vanilla and Musk.</p>

<p>In conclusion, Franck Olivier Oud Touch 100ML EDP for Men is an enchanting, long-lasting fragrance that oozes sophistication and luxury. It's a remarkable Inspired of the distinguished Oud Ispahan by Dior, making it an excellent choice for those who desire a high-quality scent without the extravagant price tag. This fragrance is an olfactory journey that will leave a lasting impression wherever you wear it.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Franck Olivier, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,2149.00,4000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/fanck-Olivier-oud-touch.webp?v=1780384849,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,oud,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
franck-olivier-black-touch-100ml-edp,Franck Olivier Black Touch 100ml EDP,"<p>Franck Olivier Black Touch 100ML Eau de Parfum for Men is an olfactory masterpiece that captivates with its unparalleled longevity. This fragrance is a sophisticated and compelling blend of notes, making it the perfect choice for the modern man seeking a scent that exudes confidence and refinement.</p>

<p>The top notes open with an invigorating burst of spices, paired with the zesty freshness of grapefruit and the warmth of cardamom and bergamot. This initial accord is a harmonious fusion of contrasting elements, setting the stage for what's to come.</p>

<p>In the heart of Black Touch, you'll discover a captivating bouquet of geranium, African orange flower, jasmine, and magnolia. These floral notes add an intriguing layer of complexity to the fragrance, balancing the earlier spice and citrus with an elegant, aromatic touch.</p>

<p>The base notes are a masterful blend of vetiver, Virginia cedar, patchouli, musk, and vanilla. This combination of earthy, woody, and sweet elements creates a foundation that's deep, sensuous, and undeniably alluring.</p>

<p>What sets Black Touch apart is its striking similarity to the renowned Terre d'Hermès by Hermès. It shares the same earthy and citrusy elegance but at a budget-friendly price point, making it an ideal choice for those who appreciate luxury scents without the premium price tag.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Spices, Grapefruit, Bergamot, and Cardamom<br>
Heart Notes: Geranium, Jasmine, African Orange Flower, and Magnolia<br>
Base Notes: Vetiver, Cedar, Patchouli, Vanilla, and Musk</p>

<p>Overall, Franck Olivier Black Touch is an exceptional fragrance designed for the modern gentleman. Its impressive longevity ensures that you'll be enveloped in its magnetic allure all day and night, making it a must-have addition to your collection. It's a fragrance that exudes sophistication, confidence, and timeless appeal, making it a perfect choice for any occasion.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Franck Olivier, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1920.00,4000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/franck-olivier-black-touch.png?v=1779879417,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
franck-olivier-white-touch-100ml-edp,Franck Olivier White Touch 100ml EDP,"<p>Franck Olivier White Touch Eau de Parfum for Women is an enchanting fragrance that weaves a story of elegance and freshness, capturing the essence of contemporary femininity. This 100ml EDP is not just a fragrance; it's a signature that lingers for an extended period, ensuring you feel confident and beautiful throughout the day.</p>

<p>At the very first spritz, the top notes burst forth in a symphony of freshness, with Water Lily, Melon, Pear, and Black Currant. These notes create an invigorating and juicy introduction that awakens the senses. As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes, including Jasmine, Artemisia, Violet, Freesia, and Rose, delicately intertwine to create a captivating floral bouquet that exudes elegance and grace.</p>

<p>The base notes of Musk and Sandalwood add depth and sensuality to the composition, leaving a soft, warm trail that is as inviting as it is enduring. This fragrance possesses a remarkable longevity that ensures you'll carry its enchanting aura with you from morning to night.</p>

<p>Top notes are Water Lily, Melon, Pear and Black Currant</p>

