<p>Base notes are Musk and Sandalwood.</p>

<p>What sets Franck Olivier White Touch apart is its remarkable resemblance to the iconic DKNY Be Delicious by Donna Karan. It's a brilliant Inspired of this beloved fragrance, offering a budget-friendly alternative without compromising on quality or lasting power. Franck Olivier White Touch is the ideal choice for the modern, confident, and sophisticated woman who appreciates a long-lasting, alluring scent that mirrors the allure of a timeless classic.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Franck Olivier, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,1999.00,4000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/franck-olivier-white-touch.png?v=1779879416,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
franck-olivier-oud-vanille-100ml-edp,Franck Olivier Oud Vanille 100ml EDP,"<p>Franck Olivier Oud Vanille 100ML Eau de Parfum for Men is a captivating olfactory journey that marries the exquisite sensuality of oud with the sweet, warm embrace of vanilla. This fragrance is a masterpiece of olfactory artistry, offering an enticing and long-lasting experience that captivates the senses.</p>

<p>At the top, you're greeted with a sweet and fruity symphony of caramel, raspberry, and orange, creating an inviting and delectable opening. As it evolves, the heart notes unfold a rich and mystical blend of incense, rose, patchouli, violet, and jasmine, lending a harmonious balance of floral and oriental accords.</p>

<p>The base notes are where the true magic happens. Here, the fragrance culminates in a lavish crescendo of vanilla, woody notes, spices, and musk, forming a sumptuous, creamy, and deeply sensual foundation that lingers on your skin for hours.</p>

<p>What sets Franck Olivier Oud Vanille apart is its remarkable resemblance to the much-celebrated Oud Bouquet Eau de Parfum by Lancôme, making it an outstanding budget-friendly alternative. This fragrance is a testament to the brand's dedication to quality and craftsmanship.</p>

