<p>Base notes are Vanilla, Woody Notes, Spices and Musk.</p>

<p>Franck Olivier Oud Vanille is a fragrance that exudes confidence, refinement, and allure. It's the perfect choice for those seeking a long-lasting, luxurious scent that will leave a lasting impression wherever you go. With its rich and complex composition, it's sure to become your signature scent, a fragrant testament to your individuality and sophistication.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Franck Olivier, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,2235.00,3900.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/franck-olivier-Oud-vanille.png?v=1779879415,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,oud,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
franck-olivier-pure-addiction-100ml-edp,Franck Olivier Pure Addiction 100ml EDP,"<p>Franck Olivier Pure Addiction for Men is an olfactory masterpiece that captivates the senses with its luxurious blend of notes. This fragrance is a testament to both longevity and artistry, making it an exceptional choice for the modern man.</p>

<p>The top note of Orange opens the olfactory journey with a burst of citrusy freshness, providing a tantalizing introduction. As it evolves, the heart of the fragrance reveals a rich and exotic fusion of Saffron, Tagetes, and Jasmine. These middle notes infuse the scent with a warm, spicy, and slightly floral character, making it a complex and intriguing composition.</p>

<p>The base notes of White Amber, Praline, Moss, and White Cedar Extract bring depth and sensuality to Pure Addiction. White Amber and Praline add a sweet and resinous quality, while Moss and White Cedar Extract contribute an earthy and woody dimension to the fragrance.</p>

<p>Pure Addiction is known for its exceptional longevity, ensuring that you stay enveloped in its captivating aura throughout the day and into the night. This makes it a perfect choice for those who appreciate a long-lasting, high-quality fragrance.</p>

<p>Top note is Orange</p>

<p>Middle notes are Saffron, Tagetes and Jasmine</p>

<p>Base notes are White Amber, Praline, Moss and White Cedar Extract.</p>

<p>What sets Pure Addiction apart is its striking similarity to the iconic Baccarat Rouge 540 by Maison Francis Kurkdjian. It offers a more budget-friendly alternative without compromising on the fragrance's allure and complexity. Whether you're looking for a signature scent or a versatile fragrance for special occasions, Franck Olivier Pure Addiction is a compelling choice that will leave a lasting impression.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Franck Olivier, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,2235.00,4000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/franck-olivier-pure-addiction.png?v=1779879414,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
franck-olivier-blue-touch-100ml-edp,Franck Olivier Blue Touch 100ml EDP,"<p>Experience Timeless Sophistication with Franck Olivier Blue Touch 100ML EDP For Men 🌟</p>

<p>Indulge in the epitome of refined masculinity with Franck Olivier Blue Touch, a fragrance masterpiece crafted in the heart of the France. This 100ml Eau De Parfum for men embodies sophistication, allure, and enduring elegance, making it a timeless addition to any gentleman's collection.</p>

<p>🔥 Long-Lasting Luxury: Experience the enchanting allure of Blue Touch, designed to linger on the skin for hours on end. Its long-lasting formula ensures you exude confidence and charm from morning meetings to evening soirées, leaving a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>💎 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: A burst of freshness greets your senses as lemon, bergamot, green notes, tangerine, and pink pepper intertwine to create a vibrant and invigorating opening. Feel the zesty allure that sets the stage for the olfactory journey ahead.<br>
Middle Notes: The heart of Blue Touch reveals a harmonious blend of melon, patchouli, woody notes, vetiver, sage, and galbanum. This sophisticated medley adds depth and complexity, evoking an aura of refined masculinity.<br>
