flavia-martine-pour-homme-100ml-edp,Flavia Martine Pour Homme 100ml EDP,"<p>Flavia Martine Pour Homme 100ml EDP – Elegance Redefined 🌟</p>

<p>Flavia Martine Pour Homme is the epitome of sophistication and charm, crafted for the modern man who values refinement and style. This long-lasting Eau de Parfum is a perfect balance of freshness, warmth, and masculinity, making it an ideal companion for every occasion.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Lavender, Lemon, Mint, Ginger<br>
A lively burst of citrus and mint awakens the senses with an energizing and aromatic start.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Apple, Geranium, Cardamom<br>
A heart of crisp apple and spicy cardamom blended with the soft florals of geranium adds warmth and character.</p>

<p>Base Notes: Tonka Bean, Vetiver<br>
A deep, sensual foundation of tonka bean and earthy vetiver lingers with a captivating finish.</p>

