emper-chifon-belle-100ml-edp,Emper Chifon Belle 100ml EDP,"<p>Emper Perfumes Chifon Belle For Women EDP 100ml is a captivating fragrance designed for women seeking a blend of fruity and floral notes with a touch of sweetness. This exquisite perfume opens with invigorating top notes of a luscious assortment of fruits, creating a refreshing aura that instantly uplifts the senses.</p>

<p>As the fragrance settles, the heart notes emerge, unveiling a bouquet of sweetness, patchouli, and jasmine. The combination of these notes adds a layer of sophistication and elegance to the perfume, evoking feelings of grace and femininity. The sweet note wraps the wearer in a comforting embrace, while the patchouli and jasmine bring depth and complexity.</p>

<p>The base notes of Emper Perfumes Chifon Belle For Women EDP 100ml reveal a sensual and warm accord. The creamy vanilla note dominates, casting a creamy and alluring veil over the composition. It is accompanied by the soft and subtle musk, which adds a hint of sensuality to the fragrance, creating a captivating and long-lasting impression.</p>

<p>Overall, Emper Perfumes Chifon Belle For Women EDP 100ml is a fragrance that seamlessly combines fruity, sweet, and floral elements, balanced with a woody and musky foundation. This enchanting perfume is perfect for women who desire a scent that is both elegant and memorable, making it an ideal choice for special occasions or everyday wear.</p>

<p>TOP NOTES<br>
Fruity</p>



<p>HEART NOTES<br>
Sweet, Patchouli, Jasmine</p>



<p>BASE NOTE<br>
Vanilla, Musk</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Emper, Full, Women",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1299.00,2000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Emper-Chifon-belle-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779879363,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
emper-thesaurus-men-100ml-edp,Emper Thesaurus Men 100ml EDP,"<p>Emper Thesaurus Men 100ML EDP is a sophisticated and captivating fragrance designed for men. Its composition combines an intriguing blend of citrus herbs, ruby, mandarin orange, grapefruit, and mint to create a refreshing and invigorating top note. This opening is bright and zesty, imparting an energetic and lively vibe.</p>

<p>Moving to the heart notes, Emper Thesaurus Men reveals a spicy floral accord, which is enriched by the inclusion of rose absolute, cinnamon, and a variety of other spices. These warm and aromatic ingredients add depth and complexity to the fragrance, evoking a sense of allure and sensuality.</p>

<p>The fragrance settles into a rich and inviting base, characterized by woody amber, leather, patchouli, white woods, and amber. This combination lends a warm and earthy undertone to the scent, creating a comforting and masculine aura that lingers on the skin.</p>

<p>Emper Thesaurus Men is a versatile fragrance that can be worn for various occasions, making it suitable for both daytime and evening wear. Its carefully crafted blend of notes ensures a long-lasting and memorable experience, leaving a lasting impression wherever it is worn.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Citrus Herbs, Ruby, Mandarin Orange, Grapefruit, Mint<br>
Heart notes: spicy floral, rose absolute, cinnamon, spices<br>
Base Notes: Woody Amber, Leather, Patchouli, White Woods, Amber</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Emper, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1399.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Emper-Thesaurus-Men-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779879362,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
emper-unicorn-men-100ml-edp,Emper Unicorn Men 100ml EDP,"<p>The Emper Unicorn Men 100ML EDP is a captivating fragrance designed to leave a lasting impression. With a harmonious blend of carefully selected notes, this perfume offers a unique olfactory experience.</p>

<p>The top notes of Bergamot, Apple, Mandarin orange, and Lavender create a refreshing and invigorating opening. The sharp citric notes of Bergamot and Mandarin orange blend flawlessly with the crisp sweetness of Apple, while the soothing aroma of Lavender adds a touch of tranquility to the composition.</p>

<p>As the fragrance develops, the heart notes of Jasmine, Geranium, and Violet take center stage. The delicate floral scent of Jasmine lends its intoxicating and romantic essence. Combined with the slightly spicy and green facets of Geranium, it creates a balanced and alluring heart. The addition of Violet adds a powdery softness, lending a touch of elegance.</p>

<p>Finally, the base notes of Vanilla, Sandalwood, Patchouli, and Cardamomv provide warmth and depth to the fragrance. The creamy sweetness of Vanilla blends with the smooth and woody character of Sandalwood, creating a rich and comforting base. The earthy and slightly herbal notes of Patchouli add complexity, while Cardamomv brings a touch of spice that adds an exotic twist.</p>

<p>Overall, Emper Unicorn Men 100ML EDP is a sophisticated fragrance that combines fruity, floral, and woody elements to create a multi-dimensional and alluring scent. Whether worn during the day or for special occasions, this fragrance is perfect for those who seek a unique and memorable olfactory experience.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Bergamot, Apple, Mandarin orange, Lavender</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Jasmine, Geranium, Violet</p>

<p>Base Notes: Vanilla, Sandalwood, Patchouli, Cardamon</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Emper, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1349.00,2000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Emper-Unicorn-Men-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779879360,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
emper-intimation-milestone-100ml-edp,Emper Intimation Milestone 100ml EDP,"<p>Emper Intimation Milestone EDP 100ml For Men: A Journey of Timeless Sophistication 🌟</p>

<p>Embark on a voyage of unparalleled elegance with Emper Intimation Milestone, an exceptional Eau De Parfum meticulously crafted for the discerning gentleman. Designed to encapsulate the essence of refined masculinity, this 100ml masterpiece is a testament to exquisite taste and enduring allure, proudly made in the UAE.</p>

<p>🔥 Long-Lasting Luxury: Indulge in the allure of longevity as Emper Intimation Milestone envelops you in its captivating embrace. Crafted with precision, this fragrance ensures you leave a lasting impression wherever you go, from morning meetings to evening soirées.</p>

<p>💼 A Symbol of Prestige: Emper Intimation Milestone exudes an aura of sophistication and class, making it the perfect companion for every milestone in your journey. Whether conquering the boardroom or enjoying a night out on the town, this fragrance elevates your presence with its refined charm.</p>

<p>💐 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Experience a burst of freshness with citron, Calabrian bergamot, and Sicilian orange. This vibrant blend sets the stage for the captivating journey that lies ahead, awakening the senses with its invigorating citrusy notes.<br>
Middle Notes: Delve into a heart of richness and warmth, where Tunisian neroli, Nigerian ginger, and Ceylon cinnamon converge in perfect harmony. This aromatic symphony adds depth and complexity, evoking a sense of confidence and allure.<br>
Base Notes: The journey concludes with a lingering trail of sophistication, as Chinese black tea, ambroxan, guaiac wood, and olibanum create a captivating finish. Bask in the sensuality of these exquisite base notes, leaving a memorable impression in your wake.</p>

<p>👑 Best Inspired of Imagination by Louis Vuitton: Emper Intimation Milestone stands as the epitome of excellence, renowned as the best Inspired of Imagination by Louis Vuitton. Embrace the essence of luxury and sophistication, reimagined in every spray of this remarkable fragrance.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Emper, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1349.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Emper-Intimation.png?v=1779879359,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
emper-selina-100ml-edp,Emper Selina 100ml EDP,"<p>Emper Selina for Women 100ML EDP: Exquisite Freshness and Long-Lasting Elegance 🌸</p>

<p>Experience the epitome of sophistication with Emper Selina, a luxurious Eau de Parfum crafted for women. Made in the UAE, this fragrance embodies the essence of freshness and longevity, ensuring you stay enveloped in its captivating aroma all day long. Perfect for any weather, Selina is the ultimate choice for those who appreciate high-quality, rich-smelling perfumes.</p>

<p>💐 Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Begin your olfactory journey with the vibrant and zesty blend of litchi, rhubarb, bergamot, and nutmeg. These notes create a refreshing and invigorating opening that instantly uplifts your senses.<br>
Middle Notes: The heart of Selina unfolds with a romantic bouquet of Turkish rose, peony, musk, petalia, and vanilla. This harmonious combination adds a touch of elegance and warmth, enveloping you in a delicate yet alluring embrace.<br>
Base Notes: The fragrance concludes with the deep and sophisticated base notes of cashmeran, incense, cedar, and Haitian vetiver. These rich and earthy undertones provide a lasting impression of luxury and refinement.</p>

<p>🌞 Perfect for All Weather: Whether it's a scorching summer day or a cool winter evening, Emper Selina adapts effortlessly, making it a versatile companion for any season.</p>

<p>✨ Best Inspired of Delina by Parfums de Marly: Emper Selina is celebrated as the finest Inspired of the renowned Delina by Parfums de Marly, offering a similar exquisite experience at an exceptional value.</p>

<p>Indulge in the timeless elegance of Emper Selina and let its enchanting fragrance elevate your everyday moments.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Date Night Picks, Emper, Full, Women",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1399.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Emper-Selina.png?v=1779879358,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
