Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Quince, Ginger, Lotus, Raspberry &amp; Peach 🍑🍓🌸A vibrant and sparkling opening with juicy quince and raspberry, soft peach, fresh lotus, and a hint of spicy ginger creates an alluring and energetic first impression.
Middle Notes: Orchid, Pink Freesia, Apricot &amp; Papaya 🌺🍑🌼The heart blooms with exotic orchid and delicate freesia, blended with sweet apricot and tropical papaya, adding richness and feminine sophistication.
Base Notes: Sandalwood, Hinoki Wood, Amber, Red Amber, White Tea &amp; Cedar 🌳🔥🤍A warm and elegant base of creamy sandalwood, smooth hinoki wood, glowing amber, soft white tea, and dry cedar leaves a sensual, long-lasting, and refined trail.
Perfect for evening wear, dates, and special occasions, Provocative Woman suits women who love fruity-floral fragrances with a warm, seductive woody finish.
💃🌸 Elizabeth Arden Provocative Woman – daring beauty, unforgettable charm.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Elizabeth Arden, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,2749.00,6200.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Elizabeth-Arden-Provocative_EDP_Women_100ml_1.png?v=1779879333,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
dunhill-desire-red-100ml-edt,Dunhill Desire Red 100ml EDT,"<p>Dunhill Desire Red 100ml EDT: A Symphony of Passion and Elegance for Men</p>

<p>Embark on a journey of timeless allure with Dunhill Desire Red, a 100ml Eau de Toilette crafted to captivate and inspire. This fragrance epitomizes the essence of sophistication, embodying the desires of the modern man with its charismatic and invigorating notes.</p>

<p>Fragrance Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: A burst of freshness greets you with a harmonious blend of apple, lemon, bergamot, and orange blossom. The initial impression is crisp and invigorating, setting the stage for the captivating journey that follows.<br>
Middle Notes: The heart of Desire Red unfolds with the richness of rose, teak wood, and patchouli. This aromatic core exudes a subtle complexity, seamlessly combining floral and woody elements for a well-rounded and enchanting experience.<br>
Base Notes: As the fragrance evolves, it settles into a warm and inviting embrace of vanilla and musk. These base notes add depth and sensuality, leaving a lasting trail that lingers in the memory.</p>

<p>Timeless Appeal: Dunhill Desire Red is a testament to the timeless appeal of classic masculinity. Whether for a day at the office, a night on the town, or a special occasion, this fragrance effortlessly complements the diverse facets of the modern man's life.</p>

