dunhill-icon-100ml-edp,Dunhill Icon 100ml EDP,"<p>Dunhill Icon 100ml EDP Perfume for Men: A Symphony of Elegance and Timeless Sophistication</p>

<p>Embark on a journey of refinement and allure with Dunhill Icon, a 100ml Eau de Parfum curated exclusively for the discerning man. This fragrance, a testament to the legacy of Dunhill, is a harmonious blend of invigorating top notes, captivating middle notes, and a lingering base that encapsulates the essence of true luxury.</p>

<p>Captivating Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: The olfactory adventure begins with a burst of freshness, as Neroli, Bergamot, Black Pepper, and Petitgrain harmonize to create an invigorating and citrusy symphony. This initial impression sets the stage for the sophistication that follows.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Delve into the heart of Dunhill Icon, where Black Pepper, Lavender, Cardamom, Juniper Berries, and Sage converge. This aromatic blend weaves a story of complexity, unveiling a nuanced and magnetic character that leaves an indelible mark.</p>

<p>Base Notes: The final act of this olfactory masterpiece unfolds with Vetiver, Oakmoss, Iris, Leather, and Agarwood (Oud). This rich and robust base lingers, adding depth and sensuality to the overall composition. The fusion of earthy, woody, and leathery notes creates a lasting impression that resonates long after the initial application.</p>

