dunhill-icon-absolute-100ml-edp,Dunhill Icon Absolute 100ml EDP,"Dunhill Icon Absolute EDP 100ml – Dark Spiced Oud with Smoky Leather Depth 🖤🔥🌙For Men | Spicy • Woody • Smoky • Intense
Dunhill Icon Absolute is a bold and luxurious fragrance that embodies power, mystery, and refined masculinity. Rich spices, dark florals, and deep woody accords come together to create a scent that feels opulent and commanding. It opens sharp and vibrant, then evolves into a warm, smoky heart before settling into an intense, long-lasting base that leaves a memorable impression.
Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Black Pepper &amp; Bergamot 🌶️🍋The opening is crisp yet fiery. Bergamot adds a fresh citrus brightness, while black pepper delivers a spicy kick that immediately sets a bold and energetic tone.
Heart Notes: Saffron, Black Rose &amp; Jasmine 🌹✨🌿At the heart, the fragrance becomes rich and exotic. Saffron brings a warm, slightly leathery spice, while black rose adds a dark floral elegance. Jasmine softens the blend with a subtle, smooth floral nuance.
Base Notes: Oud, Leather &amp; Tobacco Leaf 🌳🖤🚬The dry-down is deep, smoky, and intensely masculine. Oud provides a rich woody depth, leather adds a rugged sophistication, and tobacco leaf introduces a warm, slightly sweet smokiness that lingers.
Perfect for evenings, formal occasions, and cooler seasons, Icon Absolute is powerful, elegant, and undeniably charismatic.
✨ Dunhill Icon Absolute – a commanding fusion of spice, dark florals, and smoky oud intensity.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Dunhill, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,7699.00,8999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Dunhill-Icon-Absolute-EDP-100ml.png?v=1779879322,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
