dumont-nitro-platinum-100ml-edp,Dumont Nitro Platinum 100ml EDP,"Dumont Nitro Platinum 100ml Eau De Parfum for Men – Power Meets Elegance ⚡🔥Bold • Modern • Addictive
Dumont Nitro Platinum is a dynamic and charismatic fragrance crafted for men who command attention with confidence and style. This powerful scent blends fresh fruits, warm spices, and rich woody notes to create an irresistible signature that feels both energetic and refined—perfect for the modern man.

Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Orange, Blackcurrant, Apple, Bergamot, Pink Pepper &amp; Cardamom 🍊🍎The fragrance opens with a vibrant burst of citrus and juicy fruits. Orange, apple, and bergamot bring a fresh, uplifting brightness, while blackcurrant adds a subtle sweetness. Pink pepper and cardamom introduce a spicy edge, making the opening bold and captivating.
Middle Notes: Vanilla, Amber, Sugar, Dry Wood, Saffron &amp; Lily of the Valley 🌸The heart is warm and seductive. Creamy vanilla and amber blend beautifully with a touch of sugar for a smooth, slightly gourmand feel. Saffron and dry woods add depth, while lily of the valley lends a refined floral softness.
Base Notes: Cedarwood, Vanilla, Amber, Guaiac Wood, Musk &amp; Moss 🌿The dry-down is rich and long-lasting. Smoky woods, sensual musk, and earthy moss create a masculine, elegant trail that lingers effortlessly.
Perfect for daily wear, evenings, and special occasions, Dumont Nitro Platinum is a statement fragrance for men who thrive on confidence and sophistication. 💎",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Dumont, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,2699.00,4999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Dumont-NItro-Platinum.png?v=1779879314,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
dior-sauvage-100ml-edt,Dior Sauvage 100ml EDT,"<p>Dior Sauvage 100ML EDT Perfume For Men: A Symphony of Timeless Elegance</p>

<p>Embark on an olfactory journey with Dior Sauvage, a fragrance that transcends boundaries and embodies the essence of untamed masculinity. Crafted by the visionary François Demachy, this 100ml Eau de Toilette is an epitome of sophistication and allure, making it an indispensable addition to the modern man's collection.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: The adventure begins with the exhilarating blend of Calabrian bergamot and pepper, creating a burst of freshness that awakens the senses. A harmonious dance between citrus and spice sets the stage for the captivating layers that follow.<br>
Middle Notes: Sichuan pepper, lavender, pink pepper, vetiver, patchouli, geranium, and elemi converge in the heart of Sauvage, creating a complex and dynamic composition. Lavender adds a touch of tranquility, while the spices infuse a sense of mystery and allure.<br>
Base Notes: The grand finale unfolds with the alluring trio of ambroxan, cedar, and labdanum. Ambroxan lends a modern and sophisticated edge, seamlessly blending with the warmth of cedar and the resinous richness of labdanum. Together, they leave an indelible mark that lingers long after the initial application.</p>

<p>Your Fragrance Destination: Fragstalk.in is your ultimate destination for acquiring 100% original fragrances at amazing prices. Elevate your scent game and explore a diverse collection that caters to every preference and occasion. Trust in authenticity and quality, only at Fragstalk.in.</p>

<p>Dior Sauvage EDT: A Signature Scent of Distinction: Immerse yourself in the timeless elegance of Dior Sauvage. With its captivating notes and impeccable craftsmanship, this fragrance stands as a testament to the artistry of François Demachy, promising an experience of sophistication, allure, and undeniable charm.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Dior, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,11500.00,19900.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Dior-Sauvage-EDT.png?v=1779879312,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
dior-sauvage-200ml-edp,Dior Sauvage 200ml EDP,"<p>Dior Sauvage Eau de Parfum 200ml: Redefining Masculine Elegance 🌟</p>

<p>Prepare to embark on an olfactory journey like no other with Dior Sauvage Eau de Parfum for Men, an iconic fragrance that epitomizes sophistication and allure. Crafted to perfection, this 200ml masterpiece exudes an aura of timeless masculinity, captivating hearts with its magnetic charm.</p>

<p>💨 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

