Middle Notes: Delve deeper into the heart of Sauvage Eau de Parfum, where a harmonious blend of Sichuan pepper, lavender, star anise, and nutmeg awaits. This aromatic bouquet is a testament to refinement, evoking images of rugged landscapes and untamed wilderness.<br>
Base Notes: As the fragrance settles, it leaves a lasting impression with the warm embrace of ambroxan and vanilla. These base notes add depth and sensuality, enveloping you in a cloak of irresistible allure that lingers long after the initial spray.</p>

<p>🌬️ Seasonal Versatility: Dior Sauvage Eau de Parfum transcends the boundaries of seasons, making it a versatile companion for every occasion.</p>

