Spring: Welcome the arrival of spring with a burst of freshness, as the invigorating bergamot infuses the air with renewed energy.<br>
Summer: Beat the summer heat with the crisp and refreshing aroma of Sauvage Eau de Parfum, its citrusy undertones offering a cool and revitalizing sensation.<br>
Fall: As the leaves change colors, indulge in the rich and aromatic notes of nutmeg and star anise, capturing the essence of autumn's enchanting beauty.</p>

