dior-poison-100ml-edt,Dior Poison 100ml EDT,"<p>Dior Poison Woman EDT 100ml: Captivating Elegance in Every Spray 🌹</p>

<p>Indulge in the allure of Dior Poison Woman EDT, a timeless fragrance that embodies sophistication and mystery. With its enchanting blend of notes, this 100ml Eau De Toilette is a captivating companion, perfect for the winter season and cool evenings. Let's dive into the essence of this exquisite perfume, exploring its fragrance journey through the top, middle, and base notes.</p>

