Base Notes: The journey culminates in a rich and velvety finale, where vanilla, amber, sandalwood, heliotrope, musk, vetiver, and Virginia cedar create a seductive and lingering trail. Wrap yourself in the luxurious embrace of these mesmerizing base notes, leaving a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>🍂 Perfect for Winter, Fall, Nights, and Cool Weather: Dior Poison Woman EDT is tailor-made for the cooler seasons, exuding a warmth that complements the crisp air of winter and the cozy ambiance of fall. Its intoxicating aroma is ideal for evening wear, adding an extra layer of allure to your nighttime adventures.</p>

<p>🌟 Experience the Magic of Dior Poison Woman EDT: Elevate your fragrance collection with the timeless elegance of Dior Poison Woman EDT. Enchanting, alluring, and undeniably sophisticated, it's the perfect scent for those who dare to embrace their inner mystery and allure.</p>

