dolce-gabbana-k-100ml-edt,Dolce & Gabbana K 100ml EDT,"Dolce &amp; Gabbana K Man EDT 100ml: A Timeless Ode to Masculine Elegance 🌟

Elevate your essence with Dolce &amp; Gabbana K Man EDT, a masterpiece crafted for the modern man who exudes confidence and sophistication. With its captivating blend of notes and versatile appeal, this fragrance transcends seasons and occasions, ensuring you make a lasting impression wherever you go.

💫 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:

Top Notes: Begin your olfactory journey with a burst of freshness, as juniper berries, citruses, blood orange, and Sicilian lemon dance harmoniously on your skin. Feel the invigorating citrusy embrace that sets the stage for the adventure ahead.
Middle Notes: Delve deeper into the heart of K Man, where a captivating blend of pimento, lavender, clary sage, and geranium awaits. This aromatic fusion adds depth and complexity, evoking a sense of confidence and refinement.
