dolce-gabbana-the-one-100ml-edt,Dolce & Gabbana The One 100ml EDT,"Dolce &amp; Gabbana The One 100ml Eau De Toilette – Warm Spiced Elegance with Smooth Tobacco Charm 🍊🔥🌿For Men | Spicy • Woody • Warm • Sophisticated
Dolce &amp; Gabbana The One is a refined and charismatic fragrance that blends fresh brightness with warm, sensual depth. It opens crisp and slightly spicy, transitions into an aromatic, gently sweet heart, and settles into a smooth, masculine base. The overall feel is modern yet timeless—effortlessly elegant without being overpowering.
Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Grapefruit, Coriander &amp; Basil 🍊🌿✨The opening is fresh and lively. Grapefruit delivers a bright citrus spark, while coriander adds a subtle spicy edge. Basil introduces a green, aromatic freshness that keeps the blend clean and uplifting.
