Base Notes: Amber, Tobacco &amp; Cedar 🔥🌳🚬The dry-down is rich and comforting. Amber provides a warm glow, tobacco adds a smooth, slightly sweet smokiness, and cedar gives a clean woody structure that lingers on the skin.
Perfect for evenings, date nights, and year-round wear, The One is smooth, masculine, and quietly seductive.
