<p>Indulge in the timeless allure of DAVIDOFF Cool Water EDT, a fragrance that captures the essence of vitality and sophistication. This 125ml masterpiece is a celebration of freshness and intensity, curated to accompany the modern man through every facet of life.</p>

<p>Top Notes: A Brisk Wave of Freshness At the forefront of this olfactory journey, the swells of peppermint and lavender burst forth, creating a crisp and invigorating sensation. The aromatic dance of these top notes sets the stage for a refreshing experience that resonates with the spirit of adventure.</p>

