davidoff-cool-water-deodorant-stick-70g,Davidoff Cool Water Deodorant Stick 70g,"<p>Introducing the Original Davidoff Cool Water Deodorant Stick, a timeless classic that combines invigorating freshness with long-lasting protection. Immerse yourself in the revitalizing sensation of Cool Water, a fragrance that has captured the essence of the ocean since its inception. This deodorant stick embodies the spirit of adventure and brings a wave of confidence to your daily grooming routine.</p>

<p>It will stay with you all day long and keep you fresh. you can also wear any fresh fragrance with this deodorant stick it will improve the performance of the fragrance. many of our customers use this with Davidoff Cool Water perfumes and they are getting mind-blowing its a must-buy item if you want to smell fresh all day long.</p> 

<p>Crafted with meticulous care, the Original Davidoff Cool Water Deodorant Stick offers reliable all-day odor protection. Its powerful yet gentle formula effectively combats body odor, ensuring you feel and smell fresh throughout the day. Say goodbye to the worries of unpleasant odors and embrace the cool, crisp aura that surrounds you.</p>

<p>The deodorant stick glides effortlessly onto your skin, providing a smooth and soothing application. Its solid, compact design makes it perfect for traveling, allowing you to take the refreshing sensation of Cool Water with you wherever you go. Feel confident and prepared for any occasion, whether it's a day at the office, an evening out, or a weekend adventure.</p>

<p>Imbued with the iconic Cool Water fragrance, this deodorant stick is an olfactory delight. The aromatic top notes of mint and green nuances awaken your senses, while lavender and coriander heart notes lend a touch of elegance and sophistication. Finally, the base notes of musk and ambergris wrap you in a warm embrace, leaving a lasting impression that lingers on your skin.</p>

<p>The Original Davidoff Cool Water Deodorant Stick is a testament to the brand's commitment to quality and excellence. Created for the modern man who values timeless style and the allure of the sea, this deodorant stick complements your personal grooming routine and enhances your overall appeal.</p>

<p>Indulge in the revitalizing power of the Original Davidoff Cool Water Deodorant Stick and experience the essence of freshness that has captivated men around the world for decades. Embrace the invigorating breeze of the ocean and make a statement with your confident presence wherever you go.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","DAVIDOFF, Deodorant, Full",true,Size,70g,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,1499.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Davidoff-Cool-Water-Deodorant-Stick-70g.png?v=1779879280,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
davidoff-cool-water-women-100ml-edt,Davidoff Cool Water Women 100ml EDT,"<p>Davidoff Cool Water Women EDT 100ml: A Refreshing Oasis of Feminine Elegance 🌸</p>

<p>Transport yourself to a serene paradise with Davidoff Cool Water Women EDT 100ml, an iconic fragrance that embodies the essence of freshness and sophistication. Crafted for the modern woman who exudes confidence and grace, this exquisite scent is a celebration of femininity in its purest form.</p>

<p>🌺 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: A vibrant symphony of melon, lotus, lemon, pineapple, quince, calone, lily, and black currant greets your senses with a burst of refreshing energy. Experience the invigorating allure of citrus and aquatic accords that awaken your spirit and captivate your soul.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Delve deeper into a heart of floral enchantment, where lotus, water lily, lily-of-the-valley, jasmine, honey, hawthorn, and rose intertwine to create a delicate and alluring bouquet. Feel the intoxicating sweetness and subtle nuances that evoke a sense of romance and femininity.</p>

<p>Base Notes: As the fragrance settles, indulge in the warmth of musk, vetiver, violet root, raspberry, blackberry, peach, sandalwood, and vanilla. These sensual base notes add depth and sophistication, leaving a trail of irresistible allure that lingers on your skin long after the initial application.</p>

<p>☀️ Ideal for Hot Weather and Daytime Wear: Davidoff Cool Water Women EDT is perfectly suited for hot weather or daytime wear, offering a refreshing and uplifting experience that revitalizes your senses and keeps you feeling cool and confident throughout the day. Whether you're lounging by the poolside or exploring the bustling city streets, this fragrance is your ultimate companion for every summertime adventure.</p>

<p>🌿 Long-Lasting Performance: Embrace the enduring charm of Davidoff Cool Water Women EDT, as its long-lasting formula ensures you stay enveloped in its refreshing embrace from morning until night. Revel in the compliments and admiring glances that follow you wherever you go, as this timeless fragrance leaves an unforgettable impression on everyone you encounter.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","DAVIDOFF, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,3299.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/davidoff-cool-water-woman.png?v=1779879278,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
davidoff-cool-water-100ml-parfum,Davidoff Cool Water 100ml Parfum,"<p>DAVIDOFF Cool Water Parfum 100ml For Men – A Deeper, More Intense Fresh Masculinity 🌊<br>
DAVIDOFF Cool Water Parfum reimagines the iconic freshness of Cool Water with a richer, more intense character. Crafted for men who appreciate clean elegance with depth and modern strength, this parfum concentration delivers long-lasting freshness balanced with smooth woods. It’s a versatile scent—perfect for daily wear, office settings, and refined evening moments.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes 🌊<br>
Top Notes: Lemon, Pink Pepper 🍋🌶️The opening is crisp and invigorating. Zesty lemon brings a burst of freshness, while pink pepper adds a subtle spicy sparkle, creating a clean yet energetic first impression.<br>
Middle Note: Haitian Vetiver 🌿At the heart, Haitian vetiver takes center stage—earthy, green, and refined. It adds depth and masculinity while maintaining the signature Cool Water freshness with a modern, elegant twist.<br>
Base Note: Sandalwood 🌲The dry-down is smooth and comforting. Creamy sandalwood provides a warm woody foundation, giving the fragrance a polished, long-lasting finish that feels both calm and confident.<br>
DAVIDOFF Cool Water Parfum is ideal for men who enjoy fresh-woody fragrances with a clean, sophisticated edge. Perfect for everyday wear, professional environments, and warm climates, it offers timeless freshness with a deeper, more mature intensity.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","DAVIDOFF, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,4599.00,6200.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Davidoff-Cool-Water-Parfum.png?v=1779879276,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
davidoff-cool-water-intense-125ml-edp,Davidoff Cool Water Intense 125ml EDP,"<p>Davidoff Cool Water Intense EDP 125ml – Fresh Citrus with Creamy Amber Depth 🌊🍊<br>
For Men | Fresh • Creamy • Amber</p>

<p>Cool Water Intense by Davidoff reimagines the iconic aquatic signature with a richer, more addictive twist. This Eau de Parfum delivers a vibrant burst of citrus freshness layered over creamy tropical warmth and a smooth amber base. Modern, confident, and effortlessly masculine, it’s designed for men who appreciate freshness with lasting depth.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes ✨</p>

<p>Top Note: Green Mandarin 🍊<br>
A sparkling splash of green mandarin opens the fragrance with crisp, juicy brightness — refreshing and energizing from the very first spray.</p>

<p>Heart Note: Coconut Nectar 🥥<br>
At the heart, creamy coconut nectar adds a smooth tropical warmth, creating a subtle sweetness that feels both relaxed and refined.</p>

<p>Base Note: Amber 🔥<br>
The scent settles into a sensual amber base, delivering warmth, longevity, and a magnetic masculine trail that lingers beautifully on the skin.</p>

<p>Perfect for daily wear, warm weather, and casual evenings, Cool Water Intense is fresh yet bold — ideal for men who want a clean scent with a creamy, modern edge.</p>

<p>✨ Cool Water Intense – vibrant freshness meets warm, addictive depth.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","DAVIDOFF, Full",true,Size,125ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,4399.00,5900.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Davidoff-Cool-Water-Intense.png?v=1779879274,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
