coach-new-york-blue-100ml-edt,Coach New York Blue 100ml EDT,"<p>Coach New York Blue 100ml EDT for Men: A Scent of Timeless Sophistication</p>

<p>Embark on a journey of refined masculinity with Coach New York Blue 100ml Eau de Toilette, an olfactory masterpiece that captures the essence of modern elegance. This fragrance is more than a scent; it's an expression of confidence, individuality, and a nod to the timeless allure of the Coach brand.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Green Nashi Pear, Bergamot The fragrance opens with a burst of freshness and vibrancy, as the crispness of Green Nashi Pear intertwines with the zesty notes of Bergamot. This dynamic duo creates an invigorating top layer that sets the stage for the rich symphony of scents that follows.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Cardamom, Coriander As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes emerge, introducing a captivating blend of Cardamom and Coriander. These spicy and aromatic elements add depth and complexity, infusing the composition with a touch of sophistication that resonates with the modern man.</p>

