calvin-klein-be-100ml-edt,Calvin Klein Be 100ml EDT,"Calvin Klein CK Be for Him 100ml Eau De Toilette – Clean Minimalism with Soft Musky Warmth 🌿🤍✨For Men | Fresh • Floral • Musky • Soft Woody
Calvin Klein CK Be is a calm, intimate, and effortlessly modern fragrance that feels like second skin. Designed with simplicity in mind, it blends airy florals, a gentle fruity touch, and a smooth musky base. The result is a clean, comforting scent that is subtle yet memorable—perfect for those who prefer understated elegance over loud projection.
Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Jasmine, Orchid, Freesia &amp; Magnolia 🌸🌼🌿The opening is soft, airy, and floral. Jasmine and orchid bring a delicate elegance, while freesia and magnolia add a fresh, slightly watery floral brightness that feels clean and soothing.
Heart Note: Fresh Peach 🍑✨At the heart, a light hint of peach introduces a gentle fruity sweetness. It remains subtle, adding a smooth and juicy softness without overpowering the clean character of the fragrance.
Base Notes: Cedar, Amber, Musk, Sandalwood &amp; Vanilla 🌳🔥🌰🤍The dry-down is warm, smooth, and comforting. Cedar provides a dry woody backbone, amber adds warmth, while musk creates a skin-like softness. Sandalwood and vanilla round out the composition with a creamy, slightly sweet finish.
Perfect for daily wear, office settings, and relaxed moments, CK Be is simple, clean, and quietly sensual.
✨ Calvin Klein CK Be – a minimalist blend of airy florals, soft fruit, and musky woody warmth.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Calvin Klein, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,3949.00,4700.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/CK-be-100ml-EDT.png?v=1779879248,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
