brut-classic-original-100ml-edt,Brut Classic Original 100ml EDT,"<p>Brut Classic Original 100 ML EDT Perfume for Men: Timeless Elegance, Unmatched Longevity 🌟</p>

<p>Experience the essence of masculinity with Brut Classic Original, a legendary fragrance that has stood the test of time. Crafted for the modern gentleman, this 100ml Eau De Toilette embodies sophistication and allure, leaving a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>🔥 Long-Lasting Powerhouse: Brut Classic Original is not just a fragrance; it's a statement. With its exceptional longevity, this EDT ensures you stay enveloped in its captivating aura from morning meetings to evening soirées. Revel in the confidence of knowing your scent will endure through every moment.</p>

<p>💐 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Lavender, anise, bergamot, basil, and lemon converge to create a refreshing and invigorating opening. The citrusy zest of bergamot blends seamlessly with the herbal nuances of basil and the aromatic warmth of lavender, setting the stage for the olfactory journey ahead.<br>
Middle Notes: A floral heart of geranium, jasmine, and ylang-ylang adds depth and complexity to the composition. Delicate yet impactful, these middle notes infuse the fragrance with a subtle hint of floral elegance, balancing the vibrant top notes with grace.<br>
Base Notes: The foundation of Brut Classic Original is anchored by a rich blend of oakmoss, patchouli, vetiver, tonka bean, sandalwood, and vanilla. This robust base lends depth and sensuality to the scent, leaving a lingering trail of masculine allure that commands attention.</p>

<p>🌿 A Timeless Classic for Every Occasion: Whether it's a day at the office or a night out on the town, Brut Classic Original complements every facet of the modern man's lifestyle. Its versatility makes it a staple in any fragrance collection, offering sophistication and style with every spritz.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Brut, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,11,deny,manual,949.00,1499.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Brut-Classic.png?v=1779879227,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
