birra-acqua-men-105ml-edp,Birra Acqua Men 105ml EDP,"<p>Introducing Birra Acqua Men, a captivating fragrance that embodies the essence of masculinity and strength. This long-lasting, fresh perfume is designed to leave a lasting impression, enveloping you in an irresistible aura of confidence and allure.</p>

<p>At the heart of this fragrance lies the enchanting blend of bergamot and a spicy edge, creating a dynamic opening that instantly grabs attention. The bergamot's spicy notes add a touch of intrigue and mystery, drawing you into its spellbinding essence.</p>

<p>As the fragrance develops, a harmonious symphony of cashmere, cedar, and mint notes begins to unfold. The warm, woody tones of cashmere intertwine effortlessly with the timeless elegance of cedar, creating a luxurious and refined aromatic experience. The mint adds a dash of coolness, invigorating the senses and providing a refreshing burst of energy.</p>

<p>Birra Acqua Men is akin to an aquatic fantasy, evoking images of vast oceans and limitless horizons. It perfectly captures the invigorating qualities of water, reminding you of its fluidity and power. This fragrance accurately symbolizes masculinity and strength, making it an ideal choice for the modern man who exudes confidence and vitality.</p>

<p>Unleash your inner charm and allure with Birra Acqua Men. Its long-lasting formula ensures that you can enjoy this captivating fragrance throughout the day, leaving an indelible impression on those around you. Immerse yourself in the mysterious world of this fresh, enchanting scent and experience the captivating magic it brings to your life.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Birra, Full",true,Size,105ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,1099.00,1790.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Birra-Acqua-Men-EDP-100ml.png?v=1779879224,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,musk; tobacco; oakmoss,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,aromatic; fresh-spicy; woody; tobacco,,sandalwood; geranium,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,sea-water; lavender; mint,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
birra-acqua-sport-extreme-100ml-edp,Birra Acqua Sport Extreme 100ml EDP,"<p>**Birra Acqua Sport Extreme Men Perfume**</p>

<p>Description:<br>
Experience the invigorating power of Birra Acqua Sport Extreme Men, a remarkable fragrance designed for the adventurous man who craves new experiences and refuses to be constrained. Dive into a world of limitless possibilities with this captivating blend of aquatic freshness, citrus vibrancy, and mineral amber undertones.</p>

<p>Fragrance Profile:<br>
Birra Acqua Sport Extreme Men opens with a refreshing burst of crisp, sun-kissed citrus notes that awaken your senses like a splash of cool water on a hot summer's day. The zesty essence of bergamot and zingy lemon energizes and sets the tone for the vibrant journey ahead.</p>

<p>As the fragrance evolves, a captivating aquatic accord emerges, conjuring images of vast oceans and crashing waves. The marine notes transport you to a world of boundless exploration, evoking a sense of freedom and liberation. Enveloped within this aquatic embrace, you'll find the rhythm of crashing waves, beautifully encapsulated in each spray.</p>

<p>The base notes introduce an alluring element of mineral amber, grounding the fragrance with a touch of warmth and sensuality. These subtle yet captivating tones provide a solid foundation, symbolizing the unwavering determination and confidence of the wearer. Birra Acqua Sport Extreme Men leaves an indelible impression, lingering on the skin like treasured memories of unforgettable moments.</p>

<p>Long-lasting and Refreshing:<br>
With its exceptional longevity, Birra Acqua Sport Extreme Men is a fragrance that endures, accompanying you throughout the day and well into the night. Its carefully crafted composition ensures that the scent remains vibrant and invigorating, keeping you fresh and confident in any situation.</p>

<p>Perfect for the Adventurous Man:<br>
This fragrance was tailor-made for the man unafraid to embrace new challenges and seize every moment. Dive headfirst into uncharted territories and let your spirit soar without restraint. Birra Acqua Sport Extreme Men is the olfactory representation of a bold and adventurous spirit that knows no boundaries.</p>

<p>Indulge in this captivating scent that encapsulates the essence of the great outdoors, the thrill of exploration, and the remarkable resilience that lies within. Birra Acqua Sport Extreme Men empowers you to break free from the ordinary, inviting you to conquer new horizons with confidence and style.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Birra, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1124.00,1290.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Birra-Acqua-Sport-Extreme-EDP-100ml.png?v=1779879222,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,oakmoss; tobacco; musk,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,aromatic; fresh-spicy; woody; mossy; tobacco,,sandalwood; geranium,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,sea-water; lavender; mint,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
birra-lovestruck-100ml-edp,Birra Lovestruck 100ml EDP,"<p>Birra Lovestruck A Unique French-Inspired Fragrance for Women<br>
Description:<br>
Birra Lovestruck is a captivating fragrance that embodies the elegance and allure of French femininity. Inspired by the romantic ambiance of Parisian streets and gardens, this unique perfume is designed to enhance your life with its exquisite scent, leaving you feeling beautiful and enchanting.<br>
The scent of Birra Lovestruck is initially greeted by the vibrant and luscious notes of blackberry, which add a touch of fruity allure to the composition. Combined with the delicate and floral essence of orange blossom, the top notes create a captivating burst of freshness and sweetness that gracefully sets the stage for the fragrance journey.<br>
The heart of Birra Lovestruck is where the fragrance truly shines with its unique blend of French feminine style aroma. These carefully curated notes capture the essence of Parisian elegance, radiating sophistication, and refinement. This captivating aroma is a celebration of femininity, inviting you to embrace the charm and grace that lies within.<br>
The base notes of Birra Lovestruck harmoniously intertwine to create an alluring and mysterious undertone. These notes add depth and richness to the fragrance, leaving an unforgettable impression. With every subtle whiff, you will be reminded of the beauty and allure that surrounds you.<br>
Longevity and Application:<br>
Birra Lovestruck is carefully formulated to provide long-lasting performance, allowing its enchanting scent to accompany you throughout the day. The captivating aroma lingers delicately on your skin, leaving a trail of romance and elegance wherever you go. To fully indulge in the beauty of this fragrance, apply it to your pulse points, such as the wrists, neck, and décolletage.<br>
This perfume is perfect for:<br>
Birra Lovestruck is the perfect fragrance for women who appreciate a unique and sophisticated scent that complements their style and enhances their femininity. It is designed for the modern woman who exudes confidence and embraces the beauty of life. Whether you're attending a romantic dinner, a special occasion, or simply want to feel uplifted, this fragrance will beautifully accentuate your aura.<br>
Experience the enchanting aroma of Birra Lovestruck and embrace the grace and elegance that it brings into your life. Let the captivating notes of blackberry and orange blossom intertwine, enveloping you in a loving embrace, and beautifying your every moment.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Birra, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1064.00,1190.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Birra-Lovestruck-EDP-100ml.png?v=1779879217,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
birra-milano-max-100ml-edp,Birra Milano Max 100ml EDP,"<p>Birra Milano Max A Timeless Elixir of Italian Charm<br>
Description:<br>
Introducing Birra Milano Max, a fragrance that embodies the essence of old-time Italian charm. Encased in a uniquely designed bottle, this perfume captures the spirit of elegance and sophistication. Crafted with meticulous attention to detail, Birra Milano Max is an exquisite scent that transports you to the romantic streets of Milan.<br>
The journey begins with a vibrant and refreshing symphony of lavender, bergamot, and pink berries. Lavender brings a touch of sophistication, while bergamot adds a burst of citrusy freshness. The pink berries contribute a tantalizing sweetness, creating an enticing and invigorating blend that sets the stage for an unforgettable olfactory experience.<br>
Longevity and Application:<br>
Birra Milano Max has been masterfully formulated to ensure its longevity, allowing its captivating aura to accompany you throughout the day and night. Apply this enchanting fragrance to your pulse points, such as the wrists and neck, to fully experience its captivating essence.<br>
This perfume is perfect for:<br>
Birra Milano Max is designed for discerning individuals who seek to embrace the timeless allure of Italian charm. Whether you're strolling through the bustling streets of Milan or attending an elegant soirée, this fragrance will become your signature scent, leaving a lingering impression of sophistication and refinement.<br>
With its captivating blend of lavender, bergamot, and pink berries, Birra Milano Max is the fragrance of choice for those who appreciate the finer things in life. Immerse yourself in the enchanting scents of old-time Italy and let Birra Milano Max transport you to a world of timeless elegance and charm.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Birra, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1450.00,1790.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Birra-Milano-Max-EDP-100ml.png?v=1779879215,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,ambergris; musk; cedar,,,,edp,,,,citrus,,men,,,,fresh; aromatic; woody,,violet-leaf; apple; sage,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,aldehydes; bergamot; ginger,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
birra-trugold-100ml-edp,Birra Trugold 100ml EDP,"<p>Birra Trugold A Captivating and Enchanting Fragrance for Women<br>
Description:<br>
Birra Trugold is a mesmerizing fragrance that embodies the essence of femininity and grace. Skillfully crafted, this captivating perfume is designed to captivate hearts and leave a lasting impression. With its exquisite blend of floral and woody notes, Birra Trugold is the perfect choice for the modern woman who radiates confidence and individuality.<br>
Fragrance Notes:<br>
Top Notes - Green Notes, Freesia, Sage, Mandarin Orange.<br>
The journey begins with a refreshing burst of lush green notes, expertly harmonized with the vibrant zing of mandarin orange. A delicate bouquet of freesia adds a touch of elegance and grace, while sage contributes a savory aromatic accent, creating a captivating introduction to this enchanting fragrance.<br>
Heart Notes - Carnation, Lily of the Valley, Narcissus, Marigold, Violet, Rose, Jasmine.<br>
As the fragrance develops, the heart notes blossom, unfolding an intricate tapestry of captivating floral aromas. The seductive allure of carnation intertwines with the delicate sweetness of lily of the valley, narcissus, marigold, and violet. A soft embrace of rose and jasmine reveals a blooming garden of floral splendor, expressing a harmonious blend of femininity and beauty.<br>
Base Notes - Heliotrope, Musk, Sandalwood, Amber, Patchouli.<br>
The base notes of Birra Trugold provide a sensuous and enduring foundation, weaving together a complex symphony of woody and musky nuances. The creamy richness of heliotrope is enhanced by the warmth of amber and the distinctive allure of musk. Sandalwood adds a touch of sophistication, while patchouli delivers an earthy and mystical aroma, completing this captivating olfactory experience.<br>
Longevity and Application:<br>
Birra Trugold is exquisitely formulated to have remarkable longevity, ensuring that its enchanting scent accompanies you throughout the day and into the night. Apply the fragrance to pulse points like your wrists and neck to fully experience its captivating and lingering aura.<br>
This perfume is perfect for:<br>
Birra Trugold is the perfect fragrance for the modern woman who embraces her femininity and leaves a lasting impression wherever she goes. Whether you're attending a formal event or enjoying a casual outing, this enchanting perfume will enhance your presence and captivate those around you. The harmonious blend of floral and woody notes makes it suitable for any season, allowing you to express your individuality and allure.<br>
Indulge in the captivating allure of Birra Trugold and allow this remarkable fragrance to enhance your charm and grace, leaving a trail of enchantment wherever you wander.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Birra, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1064.00,1190.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Birra-Trugold-EDP-100ml.png?v=1779879214,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,heliotrope; musk; sandalwood; amber; patchouli,,,,edp,,,,,,women,,,6-8-hours,floral; woody,,carnation; lily-of-the-valley; narcissus-1; marigold; violet; rose; jasmine,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,green-notes; freesia; sage; mandarin-orange,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
birra-trulove-100ml-edp,Birra Trulove 100ml EDP,"<p>Birra Trulove A Captivating Fragrance for the Modern Woman<br>
Description:<br>
Birra Trulove is a captivating perfume that embodies the essence of femininity and grace. Crafted with precision and artistic flair, this exquisite fragrance celebrates the modern woman's charm and elegance, leaving a trail of enchantment wherever she goes.<br>
Fragrance Notes:<br>
Top Notes - Apple, Peach, Freesia.<br>
The fragrance journey begins with a radiant combination of juicy apple, succulent peach, and delicate freesia. The crispness of apple adds a refreshing and sweet note, while the lusciousness of peach provides a velvety undertone. The delicate touch of freesia adds a floral nuance, setting the stage for a mesmerizing olfactory experience.<br>
Heart Notes - Muguet, Mimosa, Jasmine, Tuberose.<br>
As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes unfold, revealing a delightful blend of muguet, mimosa, jasmine, and tuberose. Muguet, also known as lily of the valley, lends a clean and dewy facet, while mimosa imparts a delicate and powdery softness. The exquisite aroma of jasmine adds an intoxicating floral allure, and the rich and creamy tuberose creates a captivating and voluptuous character.<br>
Base Notes - Sandalwood, Ylang-Ylang, Oakmoss, Musk.<br>
The base notes of Birra Trulove provide a sophisticated and lasting foundation. The woody warmth of sandalwood mingles with the exotic essence of ylang-ylang, creating a sensual and seductive aura. Oakmoss adds a touch of earthiness and depth, while musk imparts a subtle allure that lingers on the skin, leaving a lasting impression.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Birra, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1710.00,1790.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Birra-Trulove-EDP-100ml.png?v=1779879212,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
birra-verdict-100ml-edp,Birra Verdict 100ml EDP,"<p>Birra Verdict Men Fragrance<br>
Indulge your senses in the captivating allure of Birra Verdict Men, an exceptional fragrance designed to leave a lasting impression. Combining freshness and power, this remarkable scent intertwines a harmonious fusion of invigorating elements that evoke masculinity and confidence.<br>
Fragrance Notes:<br>
Top Notes: The fragrance opens with an invigorating burst of herbaceous grapefruit, infused with a touch of aromatic bay leaf. These zesty essences entwine to create an initial impression that is vibrant and refreshing.<br>
Heart Notes: As the fragrance settles, the heart notes take center stage, revealing an alluring blend of guaiac wood and marine accord. The warm and woody elements of guaiac wood lend a sophisticated and masculine touch, while the marine accord adds a bracing aquatic freshness that is both captivating and distinctive.<br>
Base Notes: The base notes of Birra Verdict Men exude an air of charm and sensuality. With its lingering trail, this fragrance incorporates earthy and slightly sweet nuances that enhance the overall composition. The combination of guaiac wood and marine accord is further accentuated, creating a captivating aroma that lingers long after the application.<br>
Long-lasting and Distinctive:<br>
Birra Verdict Men is crafted to ensure longevity, making it an ideal choice for those seeking a fragrance that endures throughout the day. Its powerfully fresh composition is designed to leave an indelible mark, setting you apart from the rest. Whether you're attending a formal event or exploring the outdoors, this fragrance remains steadfast, accompanying you on your journey.<br>
The Essence of Masculinity:<br>
This masterpiece embodies masculinity in a unique and enticing way. The combination of refreshing grapefruit, verdant bay leaf, aromatic guaiac wood, and invigorating marine accord perfectly balances strength and elegance. Birra Verdict Men is an olfactory representation of the modern man who exudes confidence and charisma, leaving an unforgettable impression wherever he goes.<br>
Experience Birra Verdict Men:<br>
Embrace the enchanting allure of Birra Verdict Men and experience the powerful freshness and lasting magnetism it offers. This fragrance captivates the senses with its impeccably balanced blend of herbaceous notes and aromatic elements, creating a signature scent that speaks volumes about your refined taste and distinguished presence.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Birra, Full",false,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,5,deny,manual,0.00,1790.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Birra-Verdict-EDP-100ml.png?v=1779879210,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,draft
birra-epic-80ml-edp,Birra Epic 80ml EDP,"<p>Birra Epic Men Perfume<br>
Birra Epic Men is an extraordinary fragrance designed exclusively for men, capturing the essence of sophistication and boundless masculinity. This intoxicating scent weaves together a harmonious blend of refreshing top notes, delicate heart notes, and captivating base notes, culminating in a truly remarkable olfactory experience.<br>
Top Notes: The fragrance opens with a burst of freshness, as vibrant notes of zesty Bergamot dance gracefully with the invigorating essence of Lemon. These citrusy elements awaken the senses, leaving an energizing trail that is sure to make an impression. The inclusion of Green notes adds a touch of earthiness, lending depth and complexity to the composition.<br>
Heart Notes: At the heart of Birra Epic Men lies a captivating bouquet of floral notes that exudes elegance and refinement. Delicate Freesia petals release their tender fragrance, intertwining with the graceful charm of Lily of the valley. As the scent continues to unfold, the blooming Magnolia takes center stage, providing a velvety and luxurious touch to the overall composition. Together, these heart notes create an intoxicating blend that enchants and enthralls.<br>
Base Notes: The base notes of Birra Epic Men evoke a sense of strength and sensuality, leaving an unforgettable impression that lingers long after the initial application. The rich and woody scent of Cedar provides a solid foundation, while the embracing warmth of White Musk entices the senses, creating an aura of irresistible magnetism. Finally, the inclusion of Ambergris adds a touch of mystery and allure, leaving a trail of sophistication and confidence.<br>
Overall Impression: Birra Epic Men is an exceptional fragrance that not only captivates the senses but also stands the test of time. With its invigorating top notes, elegant heart notes, and alluring base notes, this remarkable perfume combines freshness, grace, and strength. This long-lasting fragrance is the perfect companion for the modern man who seeks to make a lasting impression, be it in a sophisticated evening setting or during the day's adventures. Indulge in the irresistible allure of Birra Epic Men and experience a fragrance that epitomizes masculinity at its finest.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Birra, Full",true,Size,80ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,990.00,1790.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Birra-Epic-EDP-80ml.png?v=1779879209,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
birra-glacier-80ml-edp,Birra Glacier 80ml EDP,"<p>Introducing Birra Glacier Men, an exquisite fragrance crafted for the discerning modern man. This captivating scent is designed to leave a lasting impression, enveloping you in a refreshing and masculine aura throughout the day.<br>
Top Notes: The fragrance opens with an invigorating burst of zesty Grapefruit, complemented by the subtle allure of Violet Leaf. This vibrant combination sets the stage for the olfactory journey ahead, immediately capturing attention and awakening the senses.<br>
Heart Notes: As the scent develops, it reveals a harmonious blend of Sea Notes, Violet Wood, and Rosewood. The mesmerizing Sea Notes transport you to the captivating depths of the ocean, while the Violet Wood adds a touch of earthiness and sophistication. Completing this captivating heart accord, the luxurious Rosewood notes emerge, infusing the fragrance with a warm, woody elegance.<br>
Base Notes: Finally, the base notes of Birra Glacier Men settle in, leaving a memorable and seductive trail. The sensuous blend of Ambergris unveils a hint of marine muskiness, evoking a sense of adventure and allure. Intertwined with the lingering embrace of Amberwood, the fragrance exudes a confident and sophisticated masculinity that lingers on the skin.<br>
Birra Glacier Men is an epitome of longevity and refined craftsmanship. Its carefully curated notes intertwine to create a fragrance that truly stands out from the crowd, making a statement wherever you go. With its invigorating top notes, captivating heart, and alluring base, this fragrance serves as a fine testament to the art of perfumery and the essence of modern masculinity.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Birra, Full",true,Size,80ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,990.00,1790.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Birra-Glacier-EDP-80ml.png?v=1779879208,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
birra-impulse-attar-concentrated-perfume-oil,Birra Impulse Attar Concentrated Perfume Oil,"Birra Impulse Attar (Concentrated Perfume Oil)Fresh Citrus • Spicy Floral • Amber SweetnessFor Men &amp; Women
Birra Impulse is a vibrant unisex attar that captures instant freshness with a warm, addictive depth—designed for those who move on instinct and leave a lasting impression. Bright, cooling notes awaken the senses, while a romantic, spiced heart melts into a smooth amber-tonka embrace that lingers beautifully on the skin.
Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Ruby Mandarin &amp; Peppermint 🍊❄️The fragrance opens with a juicy burst of ruby mandarin, delivering sparkling citrus sweetness, sharpened by the cool, energizing freshness of peppermint for an immediate uplifting effect.
Heart Notes: Rose Absolute &amp; Cinnamon 🌹🔥At the heart, luxurious rose absolute blooms with richness and elegance, wrapped in warm cinnamon spice that adds depth, sensuality, and a subtle gourmand warmth.
Base Notes: Amber &amp; Tonka Beans 🌟🌰The dry down is smooth and comforting, where golden amber blends seamlessly with creamy tonka beans, leaving behind a soft, sweet, and slightly powdery trail that feels both modern and timeless.
Perfect for daily wear, special moments, and all seasons, Birra Impulse Attar is long-lasting, intimate, and effortlessly versatile.
✨ Birra Impulse – bottled energy, refined warmth.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Attar, Birra, Full",true,Size,6ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,510.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/impulse02_1000x-1.webp?v=1779879207,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
