birra-soulmate-attar-concentrated-perfume-oil,Birra Soulmate Attar Concentrated Perfume Oil,"Birra Soulmate Attar (Concentrated Perfume Oil)Citrus Spice • Floral Amber • Warm WoodsFor Men &amp; Women
Birra Soulmate is an intimate, emotionally rich attar created to feel instantly familiar—yet impossible to forget. This concentrated perfume oil blends sparkling citrus, soft florals, and creamy amber-woods into a scent that feels comforting, romantic, and deeply personal.
Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Citrus-Spicy Accord 🍋🌿🌶️A lively opening of lemon and bergamot brings radiant freshness, uplifted by pink pepper and subtle spicy nuances that add warmth and vibrancy from the very first moment.
Heart Notes: Floral-Ambery Blend 🌸🔥The heart blooms with elegant jasmine and romantic rose, balanced by fresh geranium. A smooth amber accord weaves through the florals, adding softness, depth, and a gentle glow.
