birra-alden-100ml-edp,Birra Alden 100ml EDP,"<p>Introducing Birra Alden Men, a truly captivating fragrance that embodies strength, ambition, and accomplishment. Mystifying and invigorating, this perfume is tailored for the modern man who knows how to get things done.</p>

<p>The aroma of Birra Alden Men is an ode to boundless energy and self-assurance. Its initial burst ignites the senses with a thrilling blend of zesty citrus notes, stimulating the mind and awakening the spirit. As the fragrance settles, a harmonious fusion of woody accords and aromatic spices emerges, adding depth and complexity to its character.</p>

<p>Enveloped in the captivating essence of Birra Alden Men, the wearer exudes an air of confidence, drawing attention and leaving a lasting impression wherever he goes. The longevity of this fragrance is exceptional, ensuring that its captivating aura remains with you throughout the day, effortlessly transforming any situation into an opportunity for success.</p>

<p>Crafted with exquisite attention to detail, Birra Alden Men is a fragrance that strikes the perfect balance between refinement and power. Its intriguing composition captures the essence of a man who thrives on challenges, effortlessly navigating through life's endeavors with conviction and prowess.</p>

<p>Whether it's a business meeting, a social gathering, or a casual outing, Birra Alden Men is the ideal companion for the man who commands attention and radiates undeniable magnetism. Experience the allure of this magnificent fragrance and unlock your true potential today.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Birra, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,12,deny,manual,1495.00,1790.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Birra-Alden-EDP-100ml.png?v=1779879220,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
