birra-dark-side-100ml-edp,Birra Dark Side 100ml EDP,"<p>Birra Dark Side Men An Enigmatic and Long-lasting Fragrance<br>
Description:<br>
Birra Dark Side Men is an exceptional fragrance that encapsulates the essence of mystery and allure. Crafted with great care, this captivating perfume celebrates the modern man's dynamic personality, leaving a lasting impression wherever he goes.<br>
Fragrance Notes:<br>
Top Notes - Lavender, Green Coriander.<br>
The scent journey begins with a burst of freshness created by the invigorating blend of lavender and green coriander. Lavender adds a touch of aromatic sophistication, while green coriander adds a lively and herbal accent, setting the stage for an extraordinary experience.<br>
Heart Notes - Green Notes, Orange Blossom, Neroli.<br>
As the fragrance develops, the heart notes emerge, revealing an intriguing blend of green notes, orange blossom, and neroli. Green notes provide a crisp, earthy aroma that evokes the lushness of nature, while orange blossom and neroli add a touch of sensuality and brightness, perfectly balancing the composition.<br>
Base Notes - Cedarwood, Patchouli.<br>
The rich and grounding base notes of cedarwood and patchouli provide an enduring foundation to this alluring fragrance. Cedarwood adds a touch of warmth and elegance, while patchouli delivers a deep, earthy aroma that creates a sense of mystery and allure, enveloping you in its captivating embrace.<br>
Longevity and Application:<br>
Birra Dark Side Men is expertly formulated to have remarkable longevity, allowing its captivating scent to accompany you throughout the day and well into the night. Apply the fragrance to your pulse points, such as the wrists and neck, to fully experience its captivating aura.<br>
This perfume is perfect for:<br>
Birra Dark Side Men is the perfect choice for the modern man who exudes confidence and embraces his individuality. Whether you're heading to a formal event or a casual outing, this long-lasting fragrance will enhance your presence and leave a lasting impression on everyone you meet. The enigmatic combination of fresh and woody notes makes it suitable for any season, accentuating your style and charm.<br>
Indulge in the captivating allure of Birra Dark Side Men and let this remarkable fragrance express your unique personality.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Birra, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,12,deny,manual,1495.00,2999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Birra-Dark-Side-EDP-100ml.png?v=1779879219,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
