birra-cool-zone-him-premium-attar-concentrated-perfume-oil,Birra Cool Zone Him Premium Attar Concentrated Perfume Oil,"Birra Cool Zone Him Premium Attar (Concentrated Perfume Oil)
Fresh Aquatic • Aromatic Greens • Woody Amber
For Men

Birra Cool Zone Him is a refreshing yet powerful attar crafted for men who thrive on confidence and clarity. This premium concentrated perfume oil captures the cool rush of the sea, aromatic herbs, and deep woods—creating a long-lasting scent that feels clean, modern, and effortlessly masculine.

Fragrance Notes ✨

Top Notes: Sea Water, Lavender, Mint, Green Notes, Rosemary, Calone &amp; Coriander 🌊🌿❄️
The fragrance opens with an invigorating marine freshness, blended with cooling mint and aromatic lavender. Green notes, rosemary, calone, and coriander add a crisp, herbal sharpness that instantly energizes the senses.

Middle Notes: Sandalwood, Geranium, Neroli &amp; Jasmine 🌸🌳
At the heart, smooth sandalwood provides creamy warmth, balanced by fresh geranium and luminous neroli. A touch of jasmine adds subtle floral refinement without overpowering the masculine character.

Base Notes: Musk, Tobacco, Oakmoss, Cedar &amp; Amber 🌟🌲
The dry down is rich and enduring—clean musk blends with smoky tobacco, earthy oakmoss, dry cedarwood, and warm amber, leaving a confident, long-lasting trail.

Perfect for daily wear, office use, warm climates, and all-season freshness, Birra Cool Zone Him Premium Attar is bold, refreshing, and unmistakably masculine.

