birra-faakir-premium-attar-concentrated-perfume-oil,Birra Faakir Premium Attar Concentrated Perfume Oil,"Birra Faakir Premium Attar (Concentrated Perfume Oil)
Fresh Citrus • Elegant Florals • Warm Woody Musk
For Men &amp; Women

Birra Faakir Premium Attar is a refreshing yet sophisticated fragrance that balances lively citrus energy with delicate florals and a warm, grounding woody base. Crafted as a luxurious concentrated perfume oil, it evolves gracefully on the skin—bright, elegant, and enduring, perfect for those who seek a fragrance that is both uplifting and refined.

Fragrance Notes ✨

Top Notes: Citrus, Fruity, Bergamot, Lemon &amp; Peach 🍋🍑
The opening bursts with sparkling citrus, highlighted by zesty bergamot and fresh lemon, softened by juicy peach. This fruity-citrus combination is vibrant, energizing, and immediately uplifting.

Middle Notes: Floral, Jasmine, Peony &amp; Orange Blossom 🌸🌼
At the heart, delicate florals bloom, blending romantic jasmine, soft peony, and the sweet freshness of orange blossom. This floral core adds elegance and harmony, creating a luminous and captivating bouquet.

Base Notes: Woody, Mossy, Amber &amp; Musk 🌳🤍
The base grounds the fragrance with earthy woody and mossy notes, enriched by warm amber and sensual musk. This long-lasting foundation leaves a subtle, refined trail that is comforting yet memorable.

Perfect for daytime wear, casual elegance, or moments when you want to feel fresh and sophisticated, Birra Faakir Premium Attar is vibrant, graceful, and enduring.

✨ Birra Faakir – the art of freshness, elegance, and warmth in one luxurious attar.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Attar, Birra, Full",true,Size,6ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,500.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Birra-Faakir.webp?v=1779879151,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
