birra-sheer-oud-50ml-edp,Birra Sheer Oud 50ml EDP,"<p>Birra Sheer Oud 50ml EDP – Smoky Oud Sweetened with Golden Honey 🖤🍯For Men | Oud • Smoky • Warm Sweet<br>
Birra Sheer Oud is a premium fragrance crafted for men who appreciate the richness of traditional oud blended with a modern sweet warmth. Deep, bold, and smooth, it delivers a luxurious scent experience with strong presence and lasting depth.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes ✨<br>
