Pristine Florals • Gentle Serenity • Soothing Elegance</p>

<p>Birra Bakhoor Maliki is a celebration of purity, calm, and refined beauty. Designed for those who seek peace in their surroundings, this exquisite bakhoor releases a soft, floral aroma that feels instantly clean, calming, and uplifting. As it burns gently, the fragrance spreads effortlessly through every space, creating an atmosphere of quiet luxury and soothing comfort.</p>

<p>Each note is carefully balanced to ensure the scent remains light yet captivating—never overwhelming, always graceful. Birra Bakhoor Maliki transforms everyday moments into serene rituals, making it perfect for prayer, relaxation, or welcoming guests into a tranquil environment.</p>

<p>Experience Notes ✨</p>

<p>Pristine Floral Harmony 🌸<br>
Delicate floral notes bloom softly, bringing a sense of freshness and purity that refreshes both mind and space.</p>

<p>Gentle, Soothing Burn 🕊️<br>
Crafted to burn smoothly, this bakhoor releases its aroma slowly and evenly, filling rooms with a calming, lingering presence.</p>

<p>Serenity in Every Moment 🌿<br>
Ideal for daily use or moments of reflection, Birra Bakhoor Maliki creates a peaceful ambiance that restores balance and inner calm.</p>

<p>✨ Birra Bakhoor Maliki – gentle florals, pure tranquility, timeless serenity.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Bakhoor, Birra, Full",true,Size,50g,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,5,deny,manual,749.00,790.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Birra-Bakhoor-Maliki.webp?v=1779879128,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
birra-bakhoor-manaqib-50g,Birra Bakhoor Manaqib 50g,"<p>Birra Bakhoor Manaqib 50 GMS<br>
Traditional Orient • Earthy Musk • Mystical Grace</p>

<p>Birra Bakhoor Manaqib is a soulful tribute to the richness of oriental tradition, blended seamlessly with a contemporary sensibility. Deeply grounding and quietly powerful, this bakhoor unfolds with earthy and musky notes that transport you to a place of comfort, balance, and inner happiness. From the moment it begins to burn, its aroma feels familiar yet intriguing—like returning to your happy place, wrapped in warmth and serenity.</p>

<p>The fragrance carries a graceful depth, where raw earthiness meets soft musk, creating an aura that is both calming and mysterious. Manaqib burns smoothly, releasing its scent gradually to fill every corner with a sense of timeless elegance and spiritual calm. It’s a fragrance that lingers gently, leaving behind an impression of quiet strength and refined tradition.</p>

<p>Experience Notes ✨</p>

<p>Earthy Foundations 🌍<br>
Rich, grounding notes evoke nature and stability, creating a deeply comforting and centering atmosphere.</p>

<p>Musky Oriental Depth 🖤<br>
Warm musks add sensuality and mystique, enhancing the traditional character of this enchanting bakhoor.</p>

<p>A Journey Beyond Time 🌙<br>
Perfect for reflection, gatherings, or moments of peace, Birra Bakhoor Manaqib blends the old and the new into one unforgettable aromatic experience.</p>

<p>✨ Birra Bakhoor Manaqib – where tradition meets mystery, and every moment feels sacred.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Bakhoor, Birra, Full",true,Size,50g,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,649.00,690.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Birra-Bakhoor-Manaqib.webp?v=1779879127,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
