birra-amber-oud-premium-attar-concentrated-perfume-oil,Birra Amber Oud Premium Attar Concentrated Perfume Oil,"Birra Rose Oud Premium Attar (Concentrated Perfume Oil)
Spiced Rose • Floral Woods • Ambery Honeyed Musk
For Men &amp; Women

Birra Rose Oud Premium Attar is a masterful fusion of romantic florals and deep woody richness, inspired by the timeless elegance of Arabian perfumery. Crafted as a luxurious concentrated perfume oil, it opens with a radiant rose touched by warm spices, unfolds into a complex floral-woody heart, and settles into an opulent, resinous base. Sophisticated and intense, this attar is made for those who love depth, character, and lasting presence.

Fragrance Notes ✨

Top Notes: Floral, Spicy, Rose, Saffron &amp; Coriander 🌹🌶️
The opening is luminous and captivating—velvety rose takes the lead, enriched by exotic saffron and aromatic coriander, creating a warm, spicy-floral introduction.

Middle Notes: Floral, Woody, Rose, Iris, Patchouli &amp; Agarwood 🌳🌸
At the heart, rose continues to bloom alongside powdery iris and earthy patchouli, grounded by precious agarwood. This layer is rich, elegant, and beautifully balanced between floral softness and woody depth.

Base Notes: Woody, Ambery, Vetiver, Labdanum, Honey, Benzoin &amp; Musk 🤍🔥
The base is deep, warm, and long-lasting. Resinous labdanum and benzoin blend with golden honey, smoky vetiver, amber, and soft musk, leaving a luxurious, sensual trail that lingers on the skin.

Perfect for evenings, formal occasions, or signature wear, Birra Rose Oud Premium Attar is opulent, romantic, and unforgettable.

✨ Birra Rose Oud – where timeless rose meets the power of oud.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Attar, Birra, Full",true,Size,6ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,350.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Amber-Oud-Birra.webp?v=1779879120,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
