bentley-black-edition-100ml-edp,Bentley Black Edition 100ml EDP,"<p>Bentley Black Edition For Men 100ml EDP: A Symphony of Elegance and Power</p>

<p>Embark on a journey of sophistication with Bentley Black Edition, a distinguished fragrance that encapsulates the essence of refinement and masculinity. This 100ml Eau de Parfum is a testament to the craftsmanship synonymous with the Bentley name, providing an olfactory experience that is both captivating and timeless.</p>

<p>Top Notes: A Burst of Invigoration Bentley Black Edition opens with a dynamic blend of violet, tangerine, pink pepper, and nutmeg. This unique combination creates an invigorating top note, setting the stage for a fragrance journey that is as vibrant as it is sophisticated. The initial burst is an ode to freshness and modernity.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Earthy Allure and Floral Harmony As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes reveal a captivating blend of papyrus, earthy notes, patchouli, sweet notes, and jasmine. This intricate fusion creates a harmonious middle layer that resonates with both depth and warmth. Bentley Black Edition effortlessly balances the natural earthiness with a touch of floral elegance.</p>

<p>Base Notes: A Trail of Timeless Luxury The grand finale unfolds with base notes that linger in the memory. Atlas cedar, moss, incense, tobacco, and tonka bean weave together to form a rich and indulgent foundation. This base layer not only imparts longevity to the fragrance but also leaves a trail of sophistication that is both memorable and luxurious.</p>

<p>A Signature Scent for the Modern Gentleman: Bentley Black Edition is more than a fragrance; it's an embodiment of the modern gentleman's spirit. The juxtaposition of freshness, earthiness, and opulence creates a versatile scent that seamlessly transitions from day to night, making it the perfect companion for every facet of life.</p>

<p>🛒 Discover Fragrance Excellence at Fragstalk.in: Elevate your fragrance experience with 100% original niche and designer fragrances. Fragstalk.in, your go-to destination for all fragrance needs in India, offers a curated selection at amazing prices.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Bentley, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,3799.00,5000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Bentley-for-men-Black-Edition.png?v=1779879115,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
bentley-azure-100ml-edt,Bentley Azure 100ml EDT,"<p>Bentley Azure For Men 100ml EDT: A Symphony of Elegance and Power</p>

<p>Embark on a sensory journey with Bentley Azure For Men, a 100ml Eau De Toilette that encapsulates the essence of refined masculinity. This olfactory masterpiece by Bentley resonates with sophistication and charisma, making it an iconic choice for the discerning gentleman.</p>

<p>Dynamic Fragrance Unleashed: Bentley Azure For Men is a celebration of automotive-inspired luxury, translating the power and precision of Bentley's craftsmanship into an intoxicating fragrance. As you spritz on this 100ml EDT, envision yourself stepping into a world of sleek sophistication and timeless style.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

