ard-al-zaafaran-dirham-12ml-concentrated-perfume-oil,Ard Al Zaafaran Dirham 12ml Concentrated Perfume Oil,"<p><strong>Ard Al Zaafaran Dirham 12ml Concentrated Perfume Oil</strong></p>
<p><strong>Fresh Citrus Florals with Musky Warmth ✨🌿</strong></p>
<p><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Fresh • Floral • Musky<br><strong>Gender:</strong> Unisex</p>
<p>Ard Al Zaafaran Dirham is a beautifully balanced concentrated perfume oil that combines sparkling citrus freshness with elegant florals and a soft musky base. Bright and uplifting from the first application, it evolves into a refined floral heart before settling into a warm, comforting trail that lingers throughout the day.</p>
<h3>Fragrance Notes</h3>
<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong> 🍋 Citrus, Fresh &amp; Fruity Accords<br>A vibrant opening of zesty citrus fruits blended with crisp fresh notes and juicy fruity nuances, creating an instantly refreshing and energetic impression.</p>
<p><strong>Heart Notes:</strong> 🌸 Freesia, Geranium &amp; Jasmine<br>A graceful floral bouquet that feels clean, elegant, and airy, adding a touch of sophistication and subtle sweetness.</p>
<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong> 🔥 Ambergris, Moss &amp; Musk<br>A smooth and comforting foundation of musk, moss, and ambergris that provides depth, warmth, and excellent longevity.</p>
<h3>Why You'll Love It</h3>
<p>✔ Fresh, clean, and versatile scent profile<br>✔ Alcohol-free concentrated perfume oil<br>✔ Long-lasting performance<br>✔ Perfect for daily wear, office use, and all seasons<br>✔ Suitable for both men and women</p>
<p><strong>Dirham is the perfect blend of fresh citrus brightness, elegant florals, and soft musky warmth—an everyday signature scent that feels effortlessly refined.</strong> ✨🌿</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Ard Al Zaafaran, Full",true,Size,12ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,1649.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Dirham-Attar.png?v=1779879056,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,sandalwood; vetiver; musk,ard-al-zaafaran,,,concentrated-perfume-oil,,ard-al-zaafaran,,citrus,,men,,,8-12-hours,fresh-citrus,,rose; jasmine; lavender,,,,,,,,,,,daily-wear,,,,citruses; bergamot; cardamom,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
