ard-al-khaleej-sheikh-zayed-blue-100ml-edp,Ard Al Khaleej Sheikh Zayed Blue 100ml EDP,"<p>""Ard Al Khaleej Sheikh Zayed Blue 100ml EDP for Men: A Masterpiece of Luxury and Longevity 🌟</p>

<p>Immerse yourself in the opulence of Ard Al Khaleej Sheikh Zayed Blue, a 100ml Eau De Parfum crafted for the discerning gentleman. This exceptional fragrance exudes sophistication and elegance, perfect for the modern man who seeks a long-lasting and distinguished scent.</p>

<p>Super Long Lasting and best Inspired of Sauvage by Dior</p>

<p>🔥 Unmatched Longevity: Experience the enduring allure of Sheikh Zayed Blue, designed to keep you enveloped in its rich aroma from morning till night. Its exceptional staying power ensures you make a lasting impression, no matter where you go.</p>

<p>💐 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

 <p>Top Notes: The journey begins with the exotic and luxurious scent of Cambodian Oud, setting a majestic and captivating tone from the very first spray.<br>
 Middle Notes: As the fragrance unfolds, the smooth and alluring Blue Musk takes center stage, adding depth and a touch of mystery to the composition.<br>
 Base Notes: The scent concludes with the warm and earthy richness of Indian Agar Oud, leaving a trail of sophistication and timeless elegance.</p>

<p>🌟 High-Quality Craftsmanship: Ard Al Khaleej Sheikh Zayed Blue is renowned for its high-quality ingredients and meticulous craftsmanship. This rich-smelling fragrance is a testament to luxury, perfect for those who appreciate the finer things in life.</p>

<p>Indulge in the luxury of Ard Al Khaleej Sheikh Zayed Blue 100ml EDP and let its exquisite blend of notes elevate your fragrance collection to new heights.""</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Ard Al Khaleej, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,2099.00,4999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Ard-Al-Khaleej-Sheikh-Zayed-Blue.png?v=1779879052,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,indian-agar-oud,ard-al-khaleej,,,edp,,ard-al-khaleej,,woody; amber,,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,fresh-spicy; citrus; amber; aromatic,,blue-musk,,,,,,,,,,,daily-wear,,,,cambodian-oud,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
aramis-classic-110ml-edt,Aramis Classic 110ml EDT,"Aramis Classic 110ml Eau de Toilette – Timeless Power with Bold Leather Elegance 🖤🌿🔥For Men | Woody • Aromatic • Leather • Classic
Aramis Classic is a legendary masculine fragrance that exudes confidence, tradition, and unmistakable strength. Rich aromatics, sharp herbs, and deep leather notes create a scent that feels bold, mature, and enduringly sophisticated. It opens with a complex burst of green and spicy freshness, evolves into a refined aromatic heart, and settles into a powerful, leathery base that defines its iconic character.
Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Aldehydes, Myrrh, Artemisia, Clover, Thyme, Bergamot &amp; Gardenia 🌿🍋✨The opening is sharp, green, and slightly soapy. Aldehydes add a crisp brightness, while herbs like thyme and artemisia create an aromatic intensity. Bergamot lifts the blend with citrus freshness, and hints of myrrh and gardenia add depth and a subtle floral nuance.
Heart Notes: Patchouli, Sage, Jasmine, Cardamom &amp; Orris Root 🌱🌸🌶️At the heart, the fragrance becomes warm and sophisticated. Patchouli and sage bring earthy richness, jasmine softens with a touch of floral elegance, while cardamom adds gentle spice. Orris root introduces a powdery, refined texture.
Base Notes: Leather, Oakmoss &amp; Amber 🖤🌳🔥The dry-down is bold and unmistakable. Leather dominates with a rugged, masculine edge, oakmoss adds a deep green earthiness, and amber provides a warm, lasting glow.
Perfect for formal wear, evenings, and those who appreciate classic perfumery, Aramis Classic is strong, confident, and timeless.
✨ Aramis Classic – a powerful blend of aromatic herbs, rich woods, and iconic leather depth.
",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Aramis, Full",true,Size,110ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,3049.00,4200.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Aramis-100ml-EDT.png?v=1779879051,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
arabiyat-prestige-al-noor-100ml-edp,Arabiyat Prestige Al Noor 100ml EDP,"<p>Arabiyat Prestige Al Noor 100ml EDP – The Essence of Bold Elegance ✨<br>
Crafted in the heart of the UAE, Arabiyat Prestige Al Noor is a fragrance that embodies sophistication, mystery, and timeless masculinity. Designed for the modern man who values both tradition and luxury, this long-lasting Eau de Parfum is inspired by the iconic BDK Parfums Gris Charnel, offering a similar aura at an accessible value.<br>
From the very first spray, Al Noor enchants with a spiced opening of cardamom, saffron, and nutmeg, delivering warmth, vibrancy, and an irresistible touch of sensuality. As it settles, the fragrance reveals a soulful heart of iris, vetiver, labdanum, and fig fruit, blending earthy depth with subtle floral elegance. Finally, the scent rests on a luxurious base of vanilla, tonka bean, patchouli, and leather, leaving behind a bold, smoky-sweet trail that lingers for hours.<br>
Fragrance Notes:<br>
Top Notes: Cardamom, Saffron, Nutmeg 🌶️<br>
Heart Notes: Iris, Vetiver, Ciste, Labdanum, Fig Fruit 🌿<br>
Base Notes: Vanilla, Tonka, Patchouli, Leather 🌌<br>
Al Noor is more than a perfume—it is a statement of power, passion, and refinement. Perfect for evenings, special occasions, and moments when you want to leave an unforgettable impression.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Arabiyat Prestige, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,3099.00,4999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Arabiyat-Prestige-Al-Noor.png?v=1779879050,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,leather; tonka-bean; patchouli; vanilla,arabiyat-prestige,,,edp,,arabiyat-prestige; inspired-by-gris-charnel-extrait,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Arabiyat-Prestige/Al-Noor-115515.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,inspired-by-gris-charnel-extrait,6-8-hours,warm-spicy; leather; woody; aromatic; sweet; fruity,,fig; iris; labdanum; vetiver,,,,,,,,,,,winter,arabiyat-prestige-special-offer,,,cardamom; saffron; nutmeg-1,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
arabiyat-prestige-safa-100ml-edp,Arabiyat Prestige Safa 100ml EDP,"Arabiyat Prestige Safa 100ml EDP for Women – The Essence of Timeless Elegance ✨🌸
Crafted in the UAE, Arabiyat Prestige Safa is a fragrance designed for the modern woman who desires luxury, charm, and confidence in every step. With its long-lasting allure, this Eau de Parfum draws Inspiration from the iconic Delina Exclusif by Parfums de Marly, offering an opulent scent experience at a truly remarkable value.
Fragrance Notes:
Top Notes: Red Fruits, Lychee &amp; HazelnutA luscious burst of sweetness opens the fragrance, where juicy red fruits meet the exotic charm of lychee, softened by the creamy warmth of hazelnut. This vibrant opening feels playful yet sophisticated.
Middle Notes: Cypriol, Magnolia &amp; RoseAt the heart, delicate florals bloom gracefully, with magnolia and rose lending a soft romantic aura. The earthy depth of cypriol balances the bouquet, adding a modern, oriental twist.
Base Notes: Ambergris, Vanilla &amp; Edible NotesThe base settles into a sensual embrace of creamy vanilla, smooth ambergris, and gourmand hints, leaving an irresistible trail of elegance and warmth.
