arabiyat-prestige-aariz-l-absolu-100ml-edp,Arabiyat Prestige Aariz L’Absolu 100ml EDP,"Arabiyat Prestige Aariz L’Absolu 100ml EDP — A Sensual Symphony of Warmth &amp; Modern Elegance ✨
Embrace the art of refinement with Aariz L’Absolu, an exquisite unisex Eau de Parfum crafted for those who move through the world with quiet confidence and undeniable charm. Inspired by the velvety sophistication of Velvet Tonka by BDK Parfums, this luxurious UAE-crafted fragrance wraps you in a cocoon of warmth, sweetness, and sensual depth.
Fragrance Notes:Top Notes: Almond, Cinnamon, Bark, MandarinAariz L’Absolu opens with a delectable blend of toasted almond and spicy cinnamon, intertwined with fresh mandarin and woody bark. This inviting introduction feels both cozy and luminous — a perfect balance of comfort and spark.
Middle Notes: Amber, Rose, OrangeAt its heart, glowing amber merges with soft rose and zesty orange, creating a smooth, radiant warmth. The florals whisper elegance, while the citrus note adds a modern, uplifting twist.
Base Notes: Tonka, Vanilla, SandalwoodThe fragrance settles into a creamy, addictive finale where tonka bean and vanilla melt into silky sandalwood. This lingering trail is rich, seductive, and utterly unforgettable.
Ideal for day or night, Aariz L’Absolu is more than a scent — it’s a signature of sophistication, comfort, and timeless allure. ✨",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Arabiyat Prestige, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,3099.00,4999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Arabiyat-Prestige-Aariz-Labsulo.png?v=1779879025,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,tonka; vanilla; sandalwood,arabiyat-prestige,,,edp,,arabiyat-prestige,,vanilla; amber,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Arabiyat-Prestige/Aariz-L-Absolu-103371.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,8-12-hours,vanilla; almond; sweet; amber; warm-spicy,,rose; amber; orange,,,,,,,,,,,winter,arabiyat-prestige-special-offer,,,almond; cinnamon; mandarin; bark,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
arabiyat-prestige-aariz-100ml-edp,Arabiyat Prestige Aariz 100ml EDP,"Arabiyat Prestige Aariz 100ml EDP — A Luminous Expression of Freshness &amp; Modern Luxury ✨
Discover Aariz, a captivating unisex Eau de Parfum crafted for individuals who radiate confidence, elegance, and effortless charm. Inspired by the vibrant sophistication of Vibrato by Sospiro Perfumes, this fragrance delivers an uplifting blend of fresh florals, soft spice, and warm woods — a sensory experience that feels both refined and irresistibly modern.
Fragrance Notes:Top Notes: Grapefruit, Bergamot, Magnolia, JasmineA dazzling burst of citrus and blossoms opens the scent, where juicy grapefruit and sparkling bergamot intertwine with velvety magnolia and airy jasmine. The result is bright, inviting, and instantly energizing.
Middle Notes: Powdery Notes, Ginger, Herbal Notes, HeliotropeThe heart unfolds with a powdery softness enriched by the subtle heat of ginger and the comforting whisper of herbal accords. Heliotrope adds a dreamy, almond-like sweetness, wrapping the composition in delicate sophistication.
Base Notes: Musk, Cedarwood, Sandalwood, Amber, Orris, Patchouli, VanillaAs it settles, Aariz deepens into a beautifully textured base: creamy sandalwood and cedarwood meet sensual musk, glowing amber, earthy patchouli, and the elegant floral-woody character of orris. A touch of vanilla softens the edges, leaving a warm, long-lasting trail.
