arabiyat-prestige-nayel-oud-70ml-edp,Arabiyat Prestige Nayel Oud 70ml EDP,"<p>Arabiyat Prestige Nayel Oud 70ml EDP for Men and Women — A Timeless Symphony of Elegance, Oud, and Floral Sophistication ✨<br>
Step into a world of refined luxury with Nayel Oud, a captivating Eau de Parfum that embodies the essence of opulence, power, and undeniable grace. Inspired by the iconic Tuxedo by Yves Saint Laurent, this unisex fragrance is a masterful blend of rich florals, smoky oud, and smooth vanilla — an unforgettable scent for those who appreciate both boldness and sophistication.<br>
Fragrance Notes:Top Notes: Violet Leaf, BergamotThe fragrance opens with a fresh, slightly green burst of violet leaf, perfectly balanced by the bright, citrusy freshness of bergamot. This opening is sophisticated and invigorating, setting the stage for a fragrance that is as polished as it is dynamic.<br>
Middle Notes: Lily of the Valley, Cedarwood, Rose OilAt its heart, Nayel Oud reveals a beautiful floral composition. The delicate, fresh scent of lily of the valley mingles with the warmth of cedarwood, while rose oil adds a rich, velvety depth. This combination brings a sense of timeless elegance and complexity to the fragrance, with each note weaving seamlessly together.<br>
Base Notes: Oud, Patchouli, Amber, VanillaAs the fragrance settles, the base unfolds into an intoxicating blend of oud and patchouli, bringing a deep, earthy sophistication to the scent. Amber adds warmth and depth, while vanilla softens the composition, leaving a smooth, sensual finish that lingers beautifully.<br>
Nayel Oud is the ultimate expression of modern luxury — a fragrance that combines bold oud with delicate florals and creamy vanilla to create a scent that is both powerful and refined. Perfect for evening wear, special occasions, or whenever you wish to leave an unforgettable impression, Nayel Oud is for those who seek a fragrance that commands respect and admiration. ✨</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Arabiyat Prestige, Full",true,Size,70ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,3099.00,4999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Arabiyat-Prestige-Nayel-Oud.png?v=1779879015,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,patchouli; oud; amber; vanilla,arabiyat-prestige,,,edp,,arabiyat-prestige; inspired-by-tuxedo-1,,woody,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Arabiyat-Prestige/Nayel-Oud-103379.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,inspired-by-tuxedo,6-8-hours,woody; patchouli; ozonic; oud; amber,,cedarwood; lily-of-the-valley; rose-oil,,,,,,,,,,,winter,arabiyat-prestige-special-offer,,,violet-leaf; bergamot,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
arabiyat-prestige-portrait-80ml-edp,Arabiyat Prestige Portrait 80ml EDP,"<p>Arabiyat Prestige Portrait 80ml EDP for Men and Women — A Vibrant Celebration of Freshness and Warmth ✨<br>
Portrait by Arabiyat Prestige is a fragrance that encapsulates timeless elegance and modern charm, making it the perfect scent for both men and women who crave balance between warmth, freshness, and light-hearted sophistication. A vibrant composition of citrus, florals, and soft musk, Portrait is the ideal fragrance for those who embrace life with passion and confidence.<br>
Fragrance Notes:Top Notes: Cinnamon, LemonThe fragrance opens with a delightful contrast of warm, spicy cinnamon and the bright zest of lemon. The spicy warmth of cinnamon evokes a sense of comfort and richness, while the tangy lemon adds an invigorating, energizing kick to the scent. Together, these notes create an exciting and dynamic opening.<br>
Middle Notes: Orange Blossom, AppleAt its heart, Portrait blooms with the delicate sweetness of orange blossom, offering a floral note that is fresh yet rich. This is beautifully complemented by the crisp, fruity note of apple, which brings a light, juicy, and uplifting aspect to the fragrance.<br>
Base Note: MuskThe fragrance settles into a soft, sensual base of musk. This base note provides a smooth, comforting finish that lingers close to the skin, adding depth and warmth to the overall composition.<br>
Arabiyat Prestige Portrait is a fresh, yet sophisticated scent that can be worn all year round. It effortlessly transitions from day to night, making it perfect for those seeking a versatile fragrance that exudes both elegance and energy. Whether worn casually or for a special occasion, this is a fragrance that will make a lasting impression with its blend of zesty citrus, fresh florals, and soft musk. ✨</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Arabiyat Prestige, Full",true,Size,80ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,5,deny,manual,3099.00,4999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Arabiyat-Prestige-Portrait.png?v=1779879014,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,musk,arabiyat-prestige,,,edp,,arabiyat-prestige,,citrus,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Arabiyat-Prestige/Portrait-103375.html,unisex,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,citrus; white-floral; musky; cinnamon; fruity; warm-spicy,,orange-blossom-1; apple,,,,,,,,,,,summer,arabiyat-prestige-special-offer,,,cinnamon; lemon,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
arabiyat-prestige-fahad-regal-100ml-edp,Arabiyat Prestige Fahad Regal 100ml EDP,"<p>Arabiyat Prestige Fahad Regal 100ml EDP for Men and Women — A Majestic Fusion of Elegance and Mystery ✨<br>
Fahad Regal by Arabiyat Prestige is an extraordinary fragrance that celebrates the harmonious balance of strength, sensuality, and sophistication. Crafted for both men and women, it is a fragrance that speaks to those who exude confidence and grace, leaving an unforgettable impression wherever they go.<br>
Fragrance Notes:<br>
Top Note: Cyclamen<br>
The fragrance opens with the delicate, airy scent of cyclamen, offering a fresh and slightly powdery note that evokes feelings of elegance and tranquility. This captivating first impression is both light and invigorating, creating an inviting atmosphere.<br>
Middle Note: Labdanum<br>
At its heart, Fahad Regal unveils the rich, resinous warmth of labdanum. This deep, slightly sweet note adds an air of mystery and complexity, grounding the fragrance in a layer of luxurious depth.<br>
Base Notes: Cedarwood, Vanilla, Musk<br>
As the fragrance settles, it reveals a harmonious blend of cedarwood, vanilla, and musk. The cedarwood adds a crisp, earthy touch, while the vanilla brings a soft sweetness, enveloping the wearer in warmth. The musk provides a velvety, sensual finish, creating a captivating aura that lingers.<br>
Arabiyat Prestige Fahad Regal is a versatile fragrance that transitions effortlessly from day to night, making it an ideal choice for those seeking a scent that is both refined and enduring. With its blend of fresh florals, warm resins, and soft woods, it exudes a sense of regal sophistication that is perfect for any occasion. ✨</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Arabiyat Prestige, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,3099.00,4999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Arabiyat-Prestige-Fahad-Regal.png?v=1779879013,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,vanilla; cedarwood; musk,arabiyat-prestige,,,edp,,arabiyat-prestige; inspired-by-vanille-antique,,vanilla,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Arabiyat-Prestige/Fahad-Regal-115518.html,unisex,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,inspired-by-vanille-antique,6-8-hours,vanilla; woody; powdery; musky; floral,,labdanum,,,,,,,,,,,daily-wear,arabiyat-prestige-special-offer,,,cyclamen,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
arabiyat-prestige-fahad-gaze-100ml-edp,Arabiyat Prestige Fahad Gaze 100ml EDP,"<p>Arabiyat Prestige Fahad Gaze 100ml EDP for Men — A Bold Reflection of Power and Presence ✨<br>
Fahad Gaze by Arabiyat Prestige is a commanding fragrance crafted for the modern man who carries strength, confidence, and quiet intensity in every step. This masterful composition blends spicy vibrance, aromatic florals, and deep sensual warmth, creating a scent that is as arresting as it is refined. Designed for men who leave a lasting impression, Fahad Gaze is a statement of character, charisma, and unmistakable allure.<br>
Fragrance Notes:Top Notes: Spicy Notes, Metallic Notes, ElemiThe fragrance opens with a striking fusion of spicy accents and cool metallic freshness, instantly capturing attention. Elemi adds a resinous, citrus-tinged depth, creating an energetic and modern introduction that feels bold yet impeccably balanced.<br>
Middle Notes: Orange Blossom, Patchouli, IncenseAt its heart, Fahad Gaze reveals a sophisticated trio—bright, elegant orange blossom; earthy, charismatic patchouli; and smoky incense that adds mystery and intensity. These notes intertwine beautifully, lending the fragrance a rich, magnetic aura.<br>
Base Notes: Vanilla, Ambergris, MossAs it settles, the scent melts into a warm, sensual base of creamy vanilla, refined ambergris, and earthy moss. This smooth and lingering foundation enhances both depth and masculinity, leaving a confident trail that lasts.<br>
Arabiyat Prestige Fahad Gaze is perfect for men who embody strength and sophistication—ideal for evening wear, special occasions, or whenever you want your presence felt long after you’ve left the room. ✨</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Arabiyat Prestige, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,3099.00,4999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Arabiyat-Prestige-Fahad-Gaze.png?v=1779879012,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,vanilla; ambergris; moss,arabiyat-prestige,,,edp,,arabiyat-prestige; inspired-by-guilty-elixir-de-parfum,,floral; amber; spicy,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Arabiyat-Prestige/Fahad-Gaze-115519.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,inspired-by-guilty-elixir-de-parfum,6-8-hours,white-floral; vanilla; warm-spicy; balsamic; amber,,orange-blossom-1; patchouli; incense,,,,,,,,,,,winter,arabiyat-prestige-special-offer,,,metallic-notes; spicy-notes; elemi,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
arabiyat-prestige-kohl-luminous-100ml-edp,Arabiyat Prestige Kohl Luminous 100ml EDP,"<p>Arabiyat Prestige Kohl Luminous 100ml EDP for Men and Women — A Radiant Expression of Energy and Elegance ✨<br>
Kohl Luminous by Arabiyat Prestige is a brilliantly crafted unisex fragrance that celebrates vibrancy, contrast, and refined sophistication. Designed for those who embrace life with confidence and creativity, this scent brings together bright fruits, lush florals, and deep woody warmth, creating an unforgettable olfactory journey that shines from the first spritz to the final lingering note.<br>
Fragrance Notes:Top Notes: Lemon, Mango, Rhubarb, GingerKohl Luminous opens with a burst of lively citrus and exotic sweetness. Zesty lemon meets juicy, sun-ripened mango, while tart rhubarb adds a refreshing twist. A hint of spicy ginger brings warmth and sparkle, creating an energetic and uplifting introduction.<br>
Middle Notes: Jasmine, Praline, Violet, Pink PepperAt its heart, the fragrance blossoms with a smooth bouquet of jasmine and violet, offering soft floral elegance. This is enriched by the indulgent sweetness of praline, balanced with the subtle heat of pink pepper. The result is a beautifully layered middle that feels both comforting and captivating.<br>
Base Notes: Moss, Tonka Bean, Ambergris, CedarwoodAs Kohl Luminous settles, it reveals a luxurious base of earthy moss and creamy tonka bean, deepened by the refined sensuality of ambergris. Cedarwood adds a polished woody finish, giving the scent lasting power and sophistication.<br>
Arabiyat Prestige Kohl Luminous is perfect for those who seek a versatile, radiant fragrance that transitions effortlessly from day to night. With its vibrant opening, elegant heart, and warm, alluring base, it is a scent that truly lives up to its name—luminous, memorable, and undeniably enchanting. ✨</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Arabiyat Prestige, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,30,deny,manual,3099.00,4999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Arabiyat-Prestige-Kohl-Luminous.png?v=1779879011,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,ambergris; moss; cedarwood; tonka-bean,arabiyat-prestige,,,edp,,arabiyat-prestige; inspired-by-god-of-fire,,sweet,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Arabiyat-Prestige/Kohl-Luminous-115527.html,women,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,inspired-by-god-of-fire,6-8-hours,sweet; citrus; fruity; tropical; woody,,violet; jasmine; praline; pink-pepper-1,,,,,,,,,,,winter,arabiyat-prestige-special-offer,,,lemon; mango; ginger; rhubarb,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
arabiyat-prestige-swar-seduire-100ml-edp,Arabiyat Prestige Swar Seduire 100ml EDP,"Arabiyat Prestige Swar Séduire 100ml EDP for Men and Women — A Captivating Dance of Warmth, Sweetness &amp; Sensual Luxury ✨
Swar Séduire by Arabiyat Prestige is a mesmerizing unisex fragrance crafted for those who command attention with quiet confidence and irresistible charm. Rich, warm, and indulgently exotic, this scent weaves together sweet gourmand nuances, deep leather accents, and luxurious woods to create an aura that is both magnetic and unforgettable.
