arabiyat-prestige-mahd-al-dhahab-100ml-edp,Arabiyat Prestige Mahd Al Dhahab 100ml EDP,"<p>Arabiyat Prestige Mahd Al Dhahab 100ml EDP for Men and Women — A Luxurious Journey of Radiance and Depth ✨<br>
Mahd Al Dhahab by Arabiyat Prestige is a regal unisex fragrance inspired by golden warmth, timeless elegance, and refined richness. Designed for those who embrace sophistication with effortless confidence, this scent combines bright citrus, glowing amber, and velvety woods into an irresistibly harmonious composition. It is a fragrance that commands presence—subtle yet powerful, radiant yet deeply grounded.<br>
Fragrance Notes:Top Notes: Bergamot, Spices, LemonThe journey begins with a brilliant burst of fresh bergamot and zesty lemon, energizing the senses with crisp citrus brightness. A nuanced blend of spices adds warmth and intrigue, creating an opening that is both refreshing and boldly charismatic.<br>
Middle Notes: Amber, Patchouli, OudAt its heart, the fragrance reveals a luxurious trio of amber, patchouli, and oud. Amber brings a golden, resinous glow, while earthy patchouli deepens the composition with natural richness. The oud adds a touch of opulent mystery, giving the fragrance its unmistakable Middle Eastern character and depth.<br>
Base Notes: Vanilla, White Musk, SandalwoodAs Mahd Al Dhahab settles, it softens into a smooth, comforting base. Creamy vanilla blends beautifully with clean white musk, while sandalwood adds a silky, woody warmth that lingers elegantly on the skin.<br>
Arabiyat Prestige Mahd Al Dhahab is a versatile, enchanting fragrance suitable for both day and evening wear. With its radiant citrus top, luxurious heart, and warm, alluring finish, it embodies the perfect balance of freshness, richness, and timeless sophistication—truly a scent worthy of its golden name. ✨</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Arabiyat Prestige, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,3499.00,4999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Mahd-Al-Dhahab-Arabiyat-Prestige.png?v=1779879008,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,vanilla; sandalwood; white-musk,arabiyat-prestige,,,edp,,arabiyat-prestige,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Arabiyat-Prestige/Mahd-Al-Dhahab-107083.html,unisex,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,inspired-by-drunk-lovers,6-8-hours,powdery; vanilla; woody; citrus; warm-spicy; amber,,amber; patchouli; oud,,,,,,,,,,,summer,arabiyat-prestige-special-offer,,,bergamot; spices; lemon,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
arabiyat-prestige-lutfah-first-love-80ml-edp,Arabiyat Prestige Lutfah First Love 80ml EDP,"Arabiyat Lutfah First Love 80ml EDP for Men — A Captivating Tale of Freshness, Charm &amp; Warm Seduction ✨
Arabiyat Lutfah First Love is a modern masculine fragrance crafted for the man who leads with charm and finishes with irresistible warmth. Inspired by the excitement of first moments and the confidence of lasting impressions, it blends invigorating freshness with soft florals and creamy sweetness to create an exceptionally balanced scent. Elegant, expressive, and effortlessly appealing, First Love is designed to accompany the contemporary gentleman through every chapter of his day.
Fragrance Notes:Top Notes: Lemon, Classic Accord, Peach, CypressThe journey opens with a lively burst of zesty lemon, uplifted by a refined “classic” aromatic accord that adds sophistication from the very first spray. Juicy peach brings a subtle fruity softness, while crisp cypress introduces a green, masculine edge—an energizing start that is both clean and intriguing.
Heart Notes: Jasmine, Ylang-Ylang, Lactonic, VioletAt its heart, the fragrance blooms into a graceful floral symphony. Jasmine and ylang-ylang deliver soft sensuality, balanced by a lactonic creaminess that smooths the composition beautifully. Violet adds a delicate powdery touch, enhancing the fragrance’s romantic and expressive character.
Base Notes: Vanilla, Caramel, Heliotrope, MuskAs it settles, First Love transforms into a warm, comforting embrace. Vanilla and caramel create a delectable sweetness, heliotrope adds a velvety almond-like nuance, and musk wraps the scent in gentle, lasting softness.
