arabiyat-lamsat-harir-red-100ml-edp,Arabiyat Lamsat Harir Red 100ml EDP,"Arabiyat Lamsat Harir 100ml EDP For Men &amp; Women – A Silky Touch of Elegance 🍇🌸Inspired by Sì by Giorgio Armani | Sophisticated • Modern • Addictive
Arabiyat Lamsat Harir is a graceful and luxurious fragrance that celebrates confidence, elegance, and timeless charm. Designed for both men and women, this scent beautifully balances fruity sweetness with soft florals and a warm, sensual base—making it effortlessly classy and universally appealing.

Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Grapes, Black Currant 🍇The fragrance opens with a rich, juicy burst of grapes and black currant, delivering a sweet yet refined fruity introduction that feels bold and elegant from the very first spray.
Middle Notes: Tuberose, Jasmine, Heliotrope 🌼The heart unfolds into a creamy floral bouquet. Tuberose and jasmine add depth and sophistication, while heliotrope brings a soft, powdery smoothness that enhances the fragrance’s silky character.
Base Notes: Patchouli, Musk, Cedar 🌿The dry-down is warm and sensual. Patchouli adds depth and longevity, musk creates a soft skin-like trail, and cedarwood lends a subtle woody elegance that grounds the composition beautifully.
Perfect for daily wear, office use, evening outings, and special occasions, Lamsat Harir is ideal for those who love elegant fruity-floral fragrances with a smooth, musky finish.
