arabiyat-intense-oud-100ml-edp,Arabiyat Intense Oud 100ml EDP,"Arabiyat Intense Oud 100ml EDP – Bold Oud Fusion with Sweet Leather Depth 🖤🔥For Men &amp; Women | Oud • Sweet • Woody
Arabiyat Intense Oud is a powerful unisex fragrance that blends fresh citrus, aromatic herbs, leather, and deep woody notes with a sweet gourmand touch, creating a rich and long-lasting oud-centric profile.

