zimaya-fatima-parfum-100ml-edp,Zimaya Fatima Parfum 100ml EDP,"<p>Experience the allure of Zimaya Fatima Eau De Parfum Spray, a refined and enduring fragrance suitable for both men and women. Immerse yourself in the captivating journey of Zimaya Fatima with our meticulously crafted 100ml bottle. Elevate your daily routine with this opulent scent, a harmonious blend of subtlety and sophistication featuring a complex mix of musk, sandalwood, and amber.</p>

