zimaya-zukhruf-black-100ml-edp,Zimaya Zukhruf Black 100ml EDP,"<p>Zimaya Zukhruf Black 100ml EDP For Men 🌟</p>

<p>Unveil a world of opulent fragrance with Zimaya Zukhruf Black, a distinguished Eau De Parfum crafted in the UAE. This long-lasting scent is a testament to high-quality, rich-smelling elegance, embodying the essence of sophistication.</p>

<p>🔥 Fragrance Profile:</p>

<p>Top Notes: A dynamic introduction of grapefruit, cinnamon, nutmeg, and black pepper creates a bold and invigorating start. These notes blend seamlessly to deliver a powerful and fresh opening.<br>
Middle Notes: As the fragrance evolves, lavender, iris, woodsy notes, and coffee come forth, offering a complex and intriguing heart. This blend brings depth and warmth, evoking a sense of refined elegance.<br>
