zimaya-wujood-100ml-edp,Zimaya Wujood 100ml EDP,"<p>Zimaya Wujood 100ml EDP – Warm Elegance, Confident Presence 🔥✨Inspired by Rosendo Mateu Nº 5 Floral | Made in UAE<br>
