rasasi-hawas-100ml-edp,Rasasi Hawas 100ml EDP,"<p>Rasasi Hawas For Men 100ml Eau De Parfum: The Essence of Timeless Elegance 🌟</p>

<p>Discover the allure of Rasasi Hawas For Men, a premium 100ml Eau De Parfum crafted to perfection in the UAE. This long-lasting fragrance epitomizes luxury and sophistication, making it a favorite among fragrance aficionados.</p>

<p>🍏 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Begin your journey with a fresh and invigorating blend of apple, bergamot, lemon, and cinnamon. This vibrant combination sets a dynamic and captivating opening.<br>
Middle Notes: The heart of Rasasi Hawas reveals a harmonious mix of watery notes, plum, cardamom, and orange blossom. These elements create a rich, aromatic core that exudes refinement and charm.<br>
Base Notes: The fragrance settles into a warm and sensual base of ambergris, musk, patchouli, and driftwood. This enduring trail leaves an impression of timeless elegance and strength.</p>

<p>🌦️ All-Weather Versatility: Rasasi Hawas For Men is designed to be an all-weather fragrance, seamlessly transitioning through any season. Its versatile nature makes it the perfect companion for every occasion, ensuring you stay fresh and captivating year-round.</p>

<p>🌐 High Quality and Rich Aroma: Crafted with the highest quality ingredients, Rasasi Hawas boasts a rich and opulent scent profile. Its superior longevity ensures you remain enveloped in its luxurious aroma throughout the day, making it highly appreciated by fragrance lovers worldwide.<br>
✅ How to Check Authenticity of Rasasi Hawas :<br>
Check the Rasasi Logo embossed on the bottle cap.<br>
Look for the Importer Tag on the cellophane wrapping.<br>
The perfume liquid must be a rich purple color – not pale or off-shade.<br>
Batch Number should be printed clearly at the bottom of the box.<br>
Inspect the edges of the bottle and cap – they must have a flawless, super-finished surface with no roughness or uneven lines.<br>
When you place the Cap on Bottle, there must be a satisfying click sound indicating solid metal – a sign of premium construction.<br>
Overall Juice Quality and Box Presentation will tell the truth.<br>
As you Know fake products circulating in the market, we strongly advise purchasing only from trusted and verified sellers. Your trust and satisfaction are our top priority. We Promise 100% Authentic Products As Always.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","best seller, Daily Wear, Date Night Picks, Full, men, Office Perfumes, Rasasi, Summer Essentials",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,94,deny,manual,2999.00,6000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rasasi-hawas-for-Men-100-ml.png?v=1779878836,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,ambergris; musk; patchouli; driftwood,rasasi,,Aromatic Aquatic,edp,,inspired-by-hawas-for-him-by-rasasi,,floral; citrus,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Rasasi/Hawas-for-Him-46890.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,fruity; citrus; aquatic; fresh; warm-spicy,,watery-notes; plum; orange-blossom-1; cardamom,,,,,,,,,,,party,,,,apple; bergamot; lemon; cinnamon,,,for-men,,'3,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
