rasasi-marha-pour-homme-100ml-edp,Rasasi Marha Pour Homme 100ml EDP,"<p>Rasasi Marha is an exceptional fragrance designed for men who appreciate the allure of leather-based scents. With its captivating blend of blue-theme and leather-based fruity citrusy notes, Marha strikes the perfect balance for any occasion throughout the year. This aromatic masterpiece is not only an excellent choice for leather fragrance enthusiasts, but it also offers a remarkable similarity to the renowned Tom Ford Tuscan Leather, all within a budget-friendly range.</p>

<p>At the top, Marha unveils an intriguing combination of Raspberry, Saffron, and Thyme, creating a tantalizing and inviting introduction. As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes of Olibanum and Jasmine emerge, infusing an element of sophistication and elegance. Finally, the base notes settle into a warm embrace of Leather, Suede, Woody Notes, and Amber, leaving a lasting impression of sensuality and depth.</p>

<p>Rasasi Marha stands as a testament to the art of perfumery, captivating the senses with its unique blend of notes. Whether it's an important business meeting or a casual outing with friends, this fragrance envelops the wearer in an air of confidence and allure, making it an exceptional choice for the modern man.</p>

<p>Its a long-lasting fragrance for men.</p>

<p>Notes</p>

<p>Top notes are Raspberry, Saffron and Thyme;<br>
Middle notes are Olibanum and Jasmine<br>
Base notes are Leather, Suede, Woody Notes and Amber.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Rasasi",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1379.00,1799.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rasasi-Marha-Pour-Homme-EDP-100-ml.png?v=1779878803,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
rasasi-radi-100ml-edp,Rasasi Radi 100ml EDP,"<p>Introducing Rasasi Radi Perfume: A Captivating Aromatic Fruity Fragrance for Men and Women</p>

<p>Rasasi, a renowned brand in the fragrance industry, has unveiled its latest creation, Rasasi Radi Perfume. This exquisite scent is a delightful blend of aromatic and fruity notes that tantalize the senses and leave a lasting impression. Crafted for both men and women, Rasasi Radi Perfume is a true masterpiece.</p>

<p>The top notes of Blood Orange, Pink Pepper, and Calabrian Bergamot immediately captivate with their vibrant and zesty accord. As the fragrance evolves, the heart reveals a harmonious composition of Rose, Passionfruit, and Texas Cedar, adding a touch of floral elegance and earthy warmth.</p>

<p>The base notes of Musk, Indian Oud, Bourbon Vanilla, Amber, and Sandalwood create a sensuous and enchanting foundation, leaving a trail of irresistible allure. The interplay between these rich and luxurious ingredients makes Rasasi Radi Perfume a truly mesmerizing olfactory experience.</p>

<p>Rasasi Radi Perfume is a testament to Rasasi's commitment to creating distinctive fragrances that transcend gender boundaries. With its aromatic fruity fusion and a captivating blend of notes, this fragrance is sure to become a staple in the collection of fragrance enthusiasts. Experience the allure of Rasasi Radi Perfume and let its enchanting aroma envelop you in a world of beauty and sophistication.</p>

<p>New launch budget-friendly Rasasi Radi Perfumes which smell similar to ultra Luxury Lamaat Musk Tabriz Attar Al Boruzz</p>

<p>Notes</p>

<p>Top notes are Blood Orange, Pink Pepper and Calabrian bergamot<br>
Middle notes are Rose, Passionfruit and Texas Cedar<br>
Base notes are Musk, Indian Oud, Bourbon Vanilla, Amber and Sandalwood.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Rasasi",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1720.00,2399.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rasasi-Radi-EDP-100ML.png?v=1779878802,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
rasasi-oudh-al-boruzz-asrar-indonesia-50ml-edp,Rasasi Oudh Al Boruzz Asrar Indonesia 50ml EDP,"<p>Asrar Indonesia Unisex is an oriental fragrance and is sophisticated, elegant, and precious rich splendor of unmistakable Indonesian oudh.<br>
Asrar Indonesia, is one of the five majestic symphonies of timeless Arabian heritage. Boruzz by Rasasi is our masterpiece; a mystifying voyage of east meets west, orchestrated to magnify your captivating luminosity. Surround yourself, with the richest traditional ingredients, re imagined, as timeless fragrances like never before.<br>
A sophisticated and fresh interpretation of woody Indonesian oudh, Asrar Indonesia is an elegant blend of refreshing Mediterranean indulgence and precious Eastern aromas.<br>
The crisp freshness of sun-warmed Italian citrus notes leads to the dramatic deep woody tones of an oriental forest at midnight, revealing the rich splendor of unmistakable Indonesian oudh.</p>





<p>Top Notes: Italian Bergamot, grapefruit and ginger<br>
Middle Notes: Italian orris, cedarwood, vetiver, Indonesian oudh<br>
Base Notes: Amber, musk, tea and Indian oudh</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Rasasi",true,Size,50ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,12999.00,20099.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rasasi-Oudh-Al-Boruzz-Asrar-Indonesia-50ml.png?v=1779878801,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
rasasi-la-yuqawam-75ml-edp,Rasasi La Yuqawam 75ml EDP,"<p>Introducing Rasasi La Yuqawam 75 ml Eau de Parfum, a captivating fragrance designed for the modern man seeking sophistication and timeless allure. Crafted with precision, this perfume is a testament to the art of perfumery, offering a long-lasting scent experience that leaves a lasting impression.</p>

<p>At the very first spray, the top notes enchant the senses with a delectable blend of succulent Raspberry, exotic Saffron, and aromatic Thyme. This invigorating combination sets the stage for the journey ahead, captivating the attention of those around you.</p>

<p>As the fragrance evolves, the heart reveals a rich and opulent bouquet. Olibanum, known for its mystical and resinous aroma, entwines with the sweet elegance of Jasmine and the herbaceous charm of Artemisia. This mesmerizing blend creates a harmonious fusion that exudes confidence and sophistication.</p>

<p>The base notes provide a solid foundation to this olfactory masterpiece, as they evoke a sense of strength and sensuality. Luxurious Leather and sumptuous Suede come together, accentuated by a warm and earthy embrace of Woody Notes. Completing the captivating symphony is the alluring essence of Amber, adding a touch of elegance and depth to the fragrance.</p>

<p>Rasasi La Yuqawam for men embodies the essence of a refined gentleman with an air of mystery. Its long-lasting nature ensures that you remain confident and alluring throughout the day and into the night, leaving a trail of elegance and charm wherever you go. This exceptional fragrance invites you to embrace the timeless allure of traditional Middle Eastern perfumery, making it a must-have addition to your collection.</p>

<p>Top notes are Raspberry, Saffron and Thyme;</p>

<p>Middle notes are Olibanum, Jasmine and Artemisia</p>

<p>Base notes are Leather, Suede, Woody Notes and Amber.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, men, Party, Rasasi",true,Size,75ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,5399.00,9000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rasasi-La-Yuqawam-75-ml-EDP.png?v=1779878800,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
rasasi-amber-alive-100ml-edp,Rasasi Amber Alive 100ml EDP,"<p>Rasasi Amber Alive For Men 100ML Eau de Parfum, a captivating and enduring fragrance designed to resonate with the modern man. This fragrance exudes a timeless allure and is an affordable alternative to the classic Drakkar Noir by Guy Laroche. Inspired of Drakkar Noir by Guy Laroche</p>

<p>Top Notes: Rasasi Amber Alive opens with an invigorating burst of lavender and artemisia oil, creating an initial freshness that awakens the senses. The combination of tarragon oil, lemon oil, and pine oil adds a zesty and slightly woody undertone, setting the stage for the journey ahead.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: As the fragrance develops, the heart reveals a complex blend of clove bud, black pepper oil, and leather notes. This accord strikes a harmonious balance between spice and sophistication, while the infusion of rose oil and geranium lends a subtle floral dimension, adding depth and intrigue.</p>

<p>Base Notes: The dry-down is where Rasasi Amber Alive truly shines, as it settles into a warm and inviting embrace. Earthy patchouli oil and the subtle woody notes of tree amber create a solid foundation, leaving a lasting impression that is both grounding and seductive.</p>

<p>Rasasi Amber Alive For Men is characterized by its remarkable longevity, ensuring that you stay confidently refreshed throughout the day and into the night. This budget-friendly fragrance offers an enticing alternative to the iconic Drakkar Noir, making it accessible without compromising on quality.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Lavender, Artemesia, Tarragon, Lemon, Pine</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Clove, Black Pepper, Leather Notes, Rose, Geranium.</p>

<p>Base Notes: Earthy Patchouli Oil, Tree. Amber</p>

<p>Whether worn casually or for special occasions, Rasasi Amber Alive For Men is an olfactory journey that evolves with time, leaving a trail of masculinity and sophistication. It's the perfect companion for the modern man who seeks a lasting and affordable fragrance experience. Unleash your inner charisma with Rasasi Amber Alive For Men, a fragrance that truly comes alive on your skin.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Rasasi",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1499.00,2300.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rasasi-Amber-Alive-For-Men-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878798,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
rasasi-brilliant-silver-100ml-edp,Rasasi Brilliant Silver 100ml EDP,"<p>Rasasi Brilliant Silver For Men, a 100ML Eau de Parfum that redefines sophistication and allure. Crafted for the modern man, this fragrance is a symphony of notes that captivate the senses, promising a long-lasting olfactory experience that's both distinctive and memorable.</p>

<p>At the very first encounter, the top notes of Mandarin and Saffron dance together in a harmonious blend. The zesty, citrusy burst of Mandarin is perfectly complemented by the rich and exotic aroma of saffron, setting the stage for what's to come.</p>

<p>As the scent unfolds, the heart of Brilliant Silver emerges, showcasing delicate yet powerful notes of Jasmine and Violet. The floral bouquet adds a touch of elegance and sensuality, evoking an air of mystery and sophistication.</p>

<p>But it's in the base notes that the true character of this fragrance comes to life. Cedarwood lends a woody, masculine depth while Leather adds a luxurious and slightly smoky intensity. Together, they create a warm and inviting aura that lingers on the skin, leaving an indelible impression.</p>

<p>Rasasi Brilliant Silver For Men is reminiscent of two iconic fragrances: the sultry Tobacco Blaze by Rasasi and the enigmatic Black Saffron by Byredo. It combines the best elements of these beloved scents, offering a budget-friendly alternative without compromising on quality or longevity.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Mandarin, Saffron.</p>

<p>Middle Noes:Jasmine, Violet.</p>

<p>Base Notes: cedar wood, Leather</p>

<p>This fragrance is more than a mere accessory; it's a statement. Whether you're heading to a business meeting or a romantic evening out, Rasasi Brilliant Silver For Men will be your trusted companion, exuding confidence and charm that's simply irresistible. Elevate your presence and make a lasting impression with every spray of this exquisite Eau de Parfum.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Rasasi",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1599.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rasasi-Brilliant-Silver-For-Men-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878797,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
rasasi-youth-ikon-100ml-edp,Rasasi Youth Ikon 100ml EDP,"Rasasi Youth Ikon For Men is an exceptional fragrance that captures the essence of modern masculinity. With a generous 100ML of Eau de Parfum, it promises enduring sophistication and charm, making it the perfect choice for the contemporary man.

This long-lasting perfume opens with a burst of freshness, blending zesty lemon with the sweet, floral notes of violet and the soothing allure of lavender. These top notes create an invigorating and uplifting introduction that awakens the senses.

As the scent settles, the heart notes emerge, featuring the intriguing blend of geranium, crisp apple, and the timeless richness of sandalwood. These middle notes contribute to a warm, inviting aroma that is both confident and approachable.

The fragrance reaches its peak with the base notes of cedarwood, tonka, and musk. This combination adds depth and complexity, leaving a lasting impression that is both memorable and irresistible.

Rasasi Youth Ikon For Men bears a striking resemblance to two beloved fragrances: Fierce by Abercrombie &amp; Fitch and Legend by Montblanc. It combines the magnetic appeal of Fierce with the timeless sophistication of Legend, making it an ideal choice for any occasion, whether it's a casual day out or a formal evening event.

Top Notes: Lemon, Violet, Lavander.

Middle Notes: Geranium, Apple, Sandalwood.

Base Notes: Cedarwood, Tonka, Musk

This fragrance is a symbol of youthful exuberance and timeless elegance, making it a must-have addition to any man's grooming arsenal. Rasasi has once again proven its mastery in crafting scents that resonate with the modern man's sense of style and sophistication. With Youth Ikon, you're not just wearing a fragrance; you're making a statement.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Rasasi",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1499.00,2300.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rasasi-Youth-Ikon-For-Men-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878796,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
rasasi-style-ikon-100ml-edp,Rasasi Style Ikon 100ml EDP,"<p>Rasasi Style Ikon, a captivating 100ML Eau de Parfum designed for the modern man who exudes confidence and charm. This fragrance is not just a scent; it's a statement that lingers, a signature for those who appreciate long-lasting quality.</p>

<p>Top Notes: The scent opens with a burst of freshness, combining the zesty notes of Mandarin, Grapefruit, Apple, and Pineapple. These top notes create an invigorating and energetic introduction that instantly awakens the senses.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: As the fragrance settles, the heart reveals a harmonious blend of Clary Sage, Lavender, and a hint of Caramel. This unique combination adds depth and sophistication to the composition, creating a captivating olfactory experience.</p>

<p>Base Notes: Style Ikon's allure deepens as it dries down, with rich and warm base notes that include Tonka Bean, Amber, Sandalwood, Vetiver, and Patchouli. The subtle sweetness of Vanilla adds a touch of sensuality that lingers on the skin.</p>

<p>This fragrance evokes Memories of the popular Invictus by Paco Rabanne but offers a delightful twist. While it shares the invigorating freshness, it diverges with its omission of Bay Leaf and sharp green notes. Instead, Style Ikon presents a more fruity and fresh aquatic interpretation of this beloved genre, making it a must-try for those seeking a unique and contemporary take on a classic.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Mandarin, Grapefruit, Apple. Pineapple</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Clary Sage, Lavender, Caramel.</p>

<p>Base Notes: Tonka Bean, Amber, Sandalwood, Vetiver, Patchouli Vanilla</p>

<p>Rasasi Style Ikon for Men is more than just a scent; it's an embodiment of modern masculinity. With its long-lasting formula, it's the perfect companion for a day at the office, a night on the town, or any occasion where you want to leave a lasting impression. Embrace the charm of Style Ikon, and make it your signature fragrance today.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Rasasi",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,1499.00,2300.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rasasi-Style-Ikon-For-Men-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878795,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
rasasi-its-essential-100ml-edp,Rasasi Its Essential 100ml EDP,"<p>Rasasi Its Essential For Men a captivating and enduring fragrance designed exclusively for men. This 100ml Eau de Parfum is a true olfactory masterpiece that will leave a lasting impression wherever you go. Crafted with a meticulous blend of notes, this fragrance is a symphony of scents that unfolds over time, revealing its complexity and depth.</p>

<p>At the top, you'll experience a burst of freshness and vitality with vibrant notes of Orange, Bergamot, and Pear. These zesty elements combine to create an invigorating opening that immediately uplifts your senses.</p>

<p>As the fragrance settles into its heart, a bouquet of Geranium, Lavender, Magnolia, and Jasmine emerges. These floral middle notes add a touch of elegance and sophistication to the composition, evoking a sense of refinement and charm.</p>

<p>Finally, the base notes of Cinnamon, Cardamom, Tobacco, Guaiac, Vanilla, and Cedarwood lend a warm and sensuous depth to the fragrance. This intriguing blend creates a rich and enticing trail that lingers on the skin for hours, making ""Its Essential For Men"" a long-lasting and captivating scent.</p>

<p>Notably, this fragrance draws inspiration from the timeless appeal of Dior Sauvage EDT and EDP, not in different directions it's not an exact Inspired but takes reference to sauvage. it has more powdery elements. making it a versatile choice suitable for all seasons and occasions. Whether you're heading to the office, a casual outing, or a formal event, this fragrance complements your style effortlessly.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Orange, Bergamot, Pear.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Geranium, Lavender, Magnolia, Jasmine.</p>

<p>Base Notes: Cinnamon, Cardamom, Tobacco, Guaiac, Vanilla, Cedarwood.</p>

<p>In summary, Rasasi ""Its Essential For Men"" is more than just a perfume; it's an experience. With its harmonious blend of notes and remarkable longevity, it's an essential addition to any modern man's grooming arsenal, leaving you feeling confident and sophisticated all day long.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Full, Rasasi",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1499.00,2300.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rasasi-Its-Essential-For-Men-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878794,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
rasasi-elite-man-100ml-edp,Rasasi Elite Man 100ml EDP,"<p>Rasasi Elite Man, presented in a generous 100ML Eau de Parfum, is a captivating olfactory masterpiece designed for men who seek a fragrance that effortlessly blends sophistication and allure. Crafted with longevity in mind, this scent is a testament to timeless elegance.</p>

<p>At the very first spritz, the top notes of Rasasi Elite Man burst forth with a fresh and invigorating blend of Bergamot, Pineapple, Pepper, and Black Currant. The citrusy zest of Bergamot mingles harmoniously with the fruity sweetness of Pineapple, while the spiciness of Pepper and the depth of Black Currant add a tantalizing dimension.</p>

<p>As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes emerge, revealing a rich and complex character. Birch Tar lends an intriguing smokiness, which is beautifully balanced by the floral opulence of Jasmine and Rose. The earthy allure of Patchouli adds depth and complexity to the heart, creating an aroma that is both daring and refined.</p>

<p>In the dry-down, Rasasi Elite Man reveals its true essence. Base notes of Amber, Vanilla, Musk, and Moss create a warm and sensuous foundation. Amber and Vanilla provide a sweet, inviting embrace, while Musk adds a touch of animalic sensuality. Moss contributes an earthy, green undertone, completing the fragrance with a hint of nature's rugged elegance.</p>

<p>Many connoisseurs have drawn comparisons between Rasasi Elite Man and the iconic Aventus by Creed. Both share an exhilarating and versatile character that makes them suitable for all seasons and occasions. Rasasi Elite Man embodies the spirit of a confident, modern man who leaves an indelible impression wherever he goes. With its long-lasting sillage and impeccable blend of notes, it's an olfactory journey worth embarking on.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Bergamot, Pineapple, Pepper, Black Currant</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Birch Tar, Jasmine, Rose, Patchouli.</p>

<p>Base Notes: Amber, Vanilla, Musk, Moss</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Rasasi",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1599.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rasasi-Elite-Man-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878791,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
rasasi-wood-excess-pour-homme-100ml-edp,Rasasi Wood Excess Pour Homme 100ml EDP,"<p>Rasasi Wood Excess Pour Homme 100ML EDP is the epitome of timeless elegance and masculine sophistication. Crafted for the modern man who exudes confidence and charisma, this long-lasting perfume is a symphony of captivating notes that will leave a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>At first spray, the top notes of citrus, green, and pineapple burst forth, creating an invigorating and refreshing aura. This initial burst is like a breath of fresh air, setting the stage for what's to come.</p>

<p>As the fragrance unfolds, you'll be enchanted by the heart notes of rose, jasmine, orange blossom, and violet. These floral elements infuse the composition with a subtle, yet alluring, sweetness that perfectly balances the freshness of the top notes. It's a harmonious blend that captures the essence of a romantic evening under the stars.</p>

<p>The base notes of honey, vanilla, caramel, and amber anchor the fragrance, leaving a warm and sensual trail that lingers on your skin for hours. This rich, creamy base adds depth and complexity to Wood Excess Pour Homme, making it an ideal choice for both daytime and evening wear.</p>

