<p>In conclusion, Rasasi Wood Excess Pour Homme 100ML EDP is a testament to the artistry of perfumery. It's a fragrance that embodies elegance, sensuality, and masculinity, making it an essential addition to any man's grooming arsenal. Elevate your presence and make a statement with every spritz of this enchanting perfume.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Rasasi",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,1499.00,2300.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rasasi-Wood-Excess-Pour-Homme-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878790,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,woody,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
rasasi-deep-blue-100ml-edp,Rasasi Deep Blue 100ml EDP,"Rasasi Deep Blue For Men 100ML Eau de Parfum is the epitome of timeless elegance and masculinity, encapsulating the essence of sophistication in a bottle. This long-lasting fragrance is a masterpiece crafted for the modern man who seeks to leave a lasting impression wherever he goes.

At the very first spray, the top notes of zesty Mandarin and a hint of Pink Pepper greet your senses, creating an invigorating and refreshing burst of energy. It's a captivating opening that instantly uplifts your mood, making it perfect for daily wear or special occasions.

As the scent evolves, the heart notes take center stage, with the gentle and powdery Orris note lending an air of refinement. This floral facet adds a touch of sensuality to the composition, making it suitable for both daytime and evening wear.

The base notes of Vetiver and Leather provide a strong and confident finish to this fragrance. Vetiver brings an earthy, woody depth, while Leather adds a touch of ruggedness and masculinity. Together, they create a compelling and long-lasting dry-down that lingers on the skin, leaving a trail of sophistication wherever you go.

What makes Rasasi Deep Blue truly remarkable is its resemblance to two iconic fragrances - Grey Vetiver by Tom Ford and Fahrenheit by Dior. It combines the freshness of Grey Vetiver with the boldness of Fahrenheit, resulting in a harmonious blend that stands out in its own right.

Top Notes: Mandarin, Pink Pepper

Middle Notes: Orris.

Base Notes: Vetiver, Leather

In summary, Rasasi Deep Blue For Men is a fragrance that embodies class, longevity, and style. It's a versatile scent that pays homage to the classics while forging its own path of distinction, making it a must-have for any man who appreciates the art of fine perfumery.

