rasasi-ikon-be-your-own-ikon-100ml-edp,Rasasi Ikon Be Your Own Ikon 100ml EDP,"<p>Rasasi ""Ikon Be Your Own Ikon"" is a remarkable 100ML Eau de Parfum that stands as a testament to modern masculinity. Crafted for the discerning man who seeks a fragrance that exudes confidence and sophistication, this scent is more than just a perfume; it's an olfactory journey. Designed to be long-lasting, it ensures you make a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>The top notes of lemon and rosemary burst forth with a fresh and invigorating citrusy zest, setting the stage for what's to come. As the scent evolves, the heart notes of rose, orris root, and clove emerge, creating a harmonious blend of floral and spicy elements. These middle notes add depth and complexity, hinting at the wearer's multifaceted personality.</p>

<p>In the base, a rich and robust foundation is laid with notes of vetiver, patchouli, and sandalwood. These woody accords provide a solid, masculine core to the fragrance, while the ambroxan musk adds a touch of sensuality that lingers in the air, leaving a memorable trace of your presence.</p>

<p>""Ikon Be Your Own Ikon"" draws inspiration from two iconic Rasasi fragrances, Shuhrah Pour Homme and Tobacco Blaze, known for their bold and captivating scents. This perfume captures the essence of those classics while carving out its own unique identity, making it a perfect choice for those who appreciate the best of both worlds.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Lemon, Rosemary</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Rose, Orris Root, Clove</p>

<p>Base Notes: Vetiver, Patchouli, Sandalwood, Ambroxan Musk</p>

<p>In summary, Rasasi's ""Ikon Be Your Own Ikon"" is a long-lasting masterpiece that combines the freshness of citrus, the allure of florals and spices, and the depth of woods and musk. It's a fragrance that empowers you to be your own icon, a symbol of style and individuality.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Rasasi",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1499.00,2300.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rasasi-Ikon-Be-Your-Own-Ikon-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878788,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
rasasi-brilliant-bronze-100ml-edp,Rasasi Brilliant Bronze 100ml EDP,"<p>Rasasi Brilliant Bronze, a captivating fragrance that embodies timeless masculinity. This 100ML Eau de Parfum for men is more than just a scent; it's an olfactory journey that will leave a lasting impression. Crafted for those who appreciate sophistication and long-lasting allure, Brilliant Bronze is a fragrant masterpiece that takes inspiration from the most popular fragrances, reminiscent of Leather Oud by Dior, yet available at a budget-friendly price point.</p>

<p>At the very first spritz, you're greeted by a harmonious burst of top notes that dance on your senses. Cardamom, with its spicy and aromatic allure, mingles gracefully with the freshness of bergamot, while the exotic and oceanic whispers of ambergris create an intriguing contrast. This opening is a prelude to what's to come.</p>

<p>As Brilliant Bronze settles, the heart notes reveal themselves, creating a rich and complex tapestry. Violet adds a touch of floral elegance, beautifully balanced by the earthy depth of patchouli. This combination exudes confidence and refinement, making it suitable for any occasion.</p>

<p>The fragrance's journey concludes with a base that lingers in the memory. Oudh, known as ""liquid gold,"" brings a touch of oriental mystique, while sandalwood lends a creamy, woody warmth. Leather notes add a sensual and luxurious dimension, ensuring that Brilliant Bronze leaves a mesmerizing trail wherever you go.</p>

<p>Rasasi Brilliant Bronze is not just a fragrance; it's an experience. It captures the essence of Leather Oud by Dior while offering an affordable alternative that doesn't compromise on quality or longevity. This Eau de Parfum is designed for the modern man who seeks sophistication and confidence in every aspect of life. With its impressive sillage and long-lasting presence, Brilliant Bronze becomes a part of your identity, leaving an indelible mark wherever you venture.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Cardamom. Ambergris, Bergamot.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Violet. Patchouli.</p>

<p>Base Notes: Oudh. Sandalwood, Leather.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Rasasi",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1599.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rasasi-Brilliant-Bronze-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878786,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
rasasi-hawas-ice-100ml-edp,Rasasi Hawas Ice 100ml EDP,"<p>Rasasi Hawas Ice for Men is a fragrance that exudes a sense of icy sophistication and endless charm. With its captivating blend of notes, this scent is a declaration of strength, masculinity, and refinement.</p>

<p>Hawas Ice is not just a fragrance; it's a journey that lasts and lingers, making a statement of your presence. Its longevity is remarkable, ensuring that you stay invigorated and confident throughout the day and well into the night.</p>

<p>The top notes open with a burst of freshness, featuring zesty Bergamot, tangy Lemon, and a cooling touch of Mint. These elements create an exhilarating and uplifting introduction that sets the stage for what's to come.</p>

