rasasi-submission-100ml-edp,Rasasi Submission 100ml EDP,"<p>Rasasi Submission For Men is an olfactory masterpiece, a 100ML Eau de Parfum that transcends the ordinary, leaving an indelible mark of sophistication and allure. From the house of Rasasi, renowned for its commitment to crafting scents that embody luxury and timeless elegance, Submission For Men stands out as a true testament to the artistry of perfumery.</p>

<p>This fragrance boasts an extraordinary longevity that weaves itself into the fabric of time, making every spritz an enduring experience. The top notes introduce a harmonious blend of Mandarin and Saffron, creating an initial burst of citrusy freshness seamlessly intertwined with the warm, spicy nuances of saffron. This aromatic overture sets the stage for what unfolds as a sensory journey through layers of complexity.</p>

<p>As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes reveal a captivating bouquet where the sweet, floral essence of Jasmine meets the earthy, woody allure of Patchouli. This interplay of notes adds depth and richness, creating a magnetic allure that draws those nearby into its captivating embrace.</p>

<p>The base notes, a foundation of Dry Wood and Sandalwood, anchor the fragrance with a subtle yet commanding presence. The dry wood imparts a hint of rugged masculinity, while the timeless allure of sandalwood adds a creamy, velvety finish. Together, they create a lingering trail that resonates with sophistication.</p>

<p>Rasasi Submission For Men is not just a fragrance; it's an olfactory symphony that unfolds gradually, revealing its diverse facets over time. Whether worn for special occasions or as a daily signature scent, this Eau de Parfum is an ode to the modern man's refined taste and unwavering charisma. Embrace the allure, make a lasting impression, and let Rasasi Submission For Men be the essence of your distinct identity.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Rasasi",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1449.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rasasi-Submission-For-Men.png?v=1779878784,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
rasasi-innocence-65ml-edp,Rasasi Innocence 65ml EDP,"<p>Rasasi Innocence 65ml Eau De Parfum: Embrace the Essence of Feminine Elegance 🌸</p>

<p>Indulge in the enchanting allure of Rasasi Innocence, a captivating fragrance designed to evoke the essence of feminine grace and sophistication. Perfectly suited for the radiant days of summer, this 65ml Eau De Parfum is a delightful companion for women who embrace life with elegance and charm.</p>

<p>☀️ Summertime Serenity: As the sun dances in the azure sky, Rasasi Innocence blooms like a delicate flower, infusing the air with its refreshing aura. Ideal for the balmy days of summer, this fragrance exudes a sense of serenity and tranquility, enveloping you in a cocoon of sheer bliss.</p>

<p>🌺 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: A harmonious blend of gardenia, bergamot, and citruses greets your senses with a burst of freshness and vitality. Experience the uplifting embrace of floral and citrusy accords that awaken your spirit.<br>
Middle Notes: Delve deeper into a heart of pure elegance, where carnation, rose, and jasmine intertwine to create a bouquet of timeless beauty. Each note adds a layer of romantic allure, evoking the essence of blooming gardens in full bloom.<br>
Base Notes: The journey culminates in a symphony of warmth and sensuality, as apricot, sandalwood, vanilla, and peach caress your skin with their velvety embrace. Feel the gentle caress of these exquisite base notes, leaving a lingering trail of sophistication wherever you go.</p>

<p>🌟 Long-Lasting Performance: Experience the luxury of long-lasting performance as Rasasi Innocence weaves its magic throughout the day. From sun-kissed mornings to starlit evenings, this fragrance remains by your side, a faithful companion that whispers tales of grace and allure.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Rasasi",true,Size,65ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,999.00,1500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rasasi-innocence-Women.png?v=1779878782,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
rasasi-while-in-love-forever-80ml-edp,Rasasi While In Love Forever 80ml EDP,"<p>Rasasi While In Love Forever 80ml EDP For Women: Embrace Eternal Romance 🌸</p>

<p>Discover the essence of everlasting love with Rasasi While In Love Forever, an enchanting fragrance that captures the essence of eternal romance. This 80ml Eau De Parfum is a testament to the enduring power of affection, enveloping you in a captivating aura that transcends time.</p>

<p>🌿 A Symphony of Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Transport yourself to a whimsical garden adorned with Sicilian lemon, bellflower, and green apple. The crispness of lemon blends harmoniously with the delicate sweetness of bellflower and the refreshing aroma of green apple, creating an invigorating opening that sets the stage for a captivating olfactory journey.<br>
Middle Notes: As the fragrance unfolds, embrace the delicate allure of jasmine, bamboo, and white rose. Jasmine infuses a hint of sensuality, while bamboo adds a touch of freshness and white rose exudes timeless elegance. Together, these notes form a mesmerizing bouquet that captivates the senses with its floral splendor.<br>
Base Notes: The fragrance journey concludes with a warm embrace of cedar, amber, and musk. Cedarwood lends a comforting earthiness, while amber adds a subtle hint of sweetness. Musk provides a lingering sensuality that leaves a lasting impression, ensuring that the memory of While In Love Forever lingers in the air long after you've departed.</p>

<p>🌞 Versatile Elegance for All Seasons: Whether it's a sunny spring morning, a balmy summer afternoon, or a crisp autumn evening, While In Love Forever is the perfect companion for every season. Its versatile nature makes it suitable for all weather conditions, ensuring you radiate elegance and charm regardless of the forecast.</p>

<p>💫 Long-Lasting Performance: With its enduring formula, While In Love Forever ensures that your fragrance journey lasts throughout the day. Whether you're conquering the boardroom or indulging in a romantic evening rendezvous, this fragrance remains a steadfast companion from dawn till dusk.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Rasasi",true,Size,80ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1749.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/rasasi-while-in-love-forever.png?v=1779878781,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
rasasi-la-yuqawam-tobacco-blaze-75ml-edp,Rasasi La Yuqawam Tobacco Blaze 75ml EDP,"<p>Rasasi Tobacco Blaze 75ml Eau De Parfum for Men: Igniting Passion and Elegance 🌟</p>

<p>Prepare to embark on a journey of sophistication and allure with Rasasi Tobacco Blaze, a timeless fragrance crafted for the modern gentleman. With its captivating blend of rich notes and unparalleled complexity, this 75ml Eau De Parfum stands as a testament to refined masculinity.</p>

<p>🔥 Unveiling the Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Saffron, Neroli, and Lily-of-the-Valley converge to create a tantalizing opening that captures attention from the very first spritz. Saffron lends its exotic allure, while Neroli and Lily-of-the-Valley infuse a delicate floral freshness, setting the stage for the olfactory journey ahead.<br>
Middle Notes: As the fragrance unfolds, a symphony of Apricot, Violet, Coumarin, Amber, and Cedar unfolds. Apricot adds a juicy sweetness, while Violet and Coumarin infuse a powdery softness. Amber and Cedar bring depth and warmth, crafting a heart that exudes sophistication and charm.<br>
Base Notes: The grand finale is a harmonious blend of Leather, Agarwood (Oud), and Patchouli. Leather adds a rugged yet refined edge, while Agarwood (Oud) lends its exotic richness. Patchouli anchors the composition with its earthy allure, leaving a lasting impression that lingers in the air long after the wearer has departed.</p>

<p>🌿 A Tribute to Masculine Sensuality: Rasasi Tobacco Blaze celebrates the essence of masculine sensuality, weaving together contrasting elements to create a fragrance that is both bold and alluring. From its vibrant opening to its sensual dry-down, every facet of this scent reflects the multifaceted nature of the modern man.</p>

<p>💼 Versatile Elegance for Every Occasion: Whether it's a formal evening event or a casual daytime outing, Rasasi Tobacco Blaze is the perfect companion for every occasion. Its versatile nature effortlessly transitions from day to night, ensuring you always make a lasting impression.</p>

<p>🛍️ Indulge in Rasasi Tobacco Blaze: Elevate your fragrance game and embrace the allure of Rasasi Tobacco Blaze. With its timeless sophistication and undeniable charm, it's the ultimate expression of masculine elegance. Experience the magic today!</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Rasasi",true,Size,75ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,5399.00,9000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/rasasi-tobacco-blaze.png?v=1779878779,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
