rasasi-passion-100ml-edp,Rasasi Passion 100ml EDP,"Rasasi Passion 100ml EDP For Men &amp; Women: A Symphony of Timeless Elegance

Immerse yourself in the luxurious essence of Rasasi Passion, a 100ml Eau De Parfum meticulously crafted in the UAE. This long-lasting attar fragrance is designed to captivate both men and women, offering an exquisite blend that lingers throughout the day and night.

