Fragrance Notes:

Top Notes: Clary Sage
(A burst of herbal clarity, offering an aromatic freshness that invigorates the senses.)

Middle Notes: Marine Notes, Egyptian Jasmine
(The oceanic freshness of marine notes intertwines with the elegant floral allure of Egyptian Jasmine, adding depth and sensuality to the heart of the fragrance.)

Base Notes: Mineral Notes, Amber, Ambergris
(A blend of earthy mineral notes, smooth amber, and the rich, animalistic warmth of ambergris form a lasting and seductive finish, exuding both power and mystery.)

