rasasi-shuhrah-elixir-100ml-edp,Rasasi Shuhrah Elixir 100ml EDP,"<p>Rasasi shuhrah Elixir 100ml EDP for Men — A Bold, Modern Elixir of Strength and Seduction ✨<br>
Inspired By : Tygar by Bvlgari<br>
Rasasi Shuhrah Elixir is a powerful reinterpretation of the iconic Shuhrah DNA, crafted for the modern man who embraces intensity, elegance, and irresistible charisma. This fragrance blends vibrant freshness, aromatic florals, and deep woody warmth to create a magnetic scent profile that is as confident as it is captivating.<br>
Fragrance Notes:Top Notes: Lemon, Ginger, MandarinShuhrah Elixir opens with a bright and invigorating trio—zesty lemon, spicy ginger, and juicy mandarin. This vibrant burst introduces the fragrance with refreshing energy and a hint of spice, instantly grabbing attention with its dynamic, masculine freshness.<br>
Middle Notes: Violet, Rose, AmberAt its heart, the scent reveals a refined floral accord of violet and rose, adding smooth softness and sophistication. Rich amber weaves through these florals, bringing warmth and depth that enhance the fragrance’s signature character.<br>
Base Notes: Ambroxan, Sandalwood, Patchouli, OudThe dry-down is where Shuhrah Elixir truly commands presence. Ambroxan gives the base a modern, radiant intensity, while creamy sandalwood adds grounded warmth. Patchouli brings earthy richness, and the touch of oud provides a bold, smoky allure that lingers with undeniable confidence.<br>
Rasasi Shuhrah Elixir is perfect for evening wear, special occasions, or any moment that calls for a fragrance with depth, power, and sophistication. With its fresh, floral, and woody composition, it delivers a long-lasting, magnetic aura designed for the man who leaves a lasting impression. ✨</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Rasasi",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,26,deny,manual,2799.00,4500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rasasi-shuhrah-Elixir.png?v=1779878740,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
rasasi-hawas-viper-100ml-edp,Rasasi Hawas Viper 100ml EDP,"<p>Rasasi Hawas Viper 100ml EDP For Men – Untamed Power with a Dark Seduction 🐍🔥Bold • Intense • Long-Lasting<br>
Rasasi Hawas Viper is a daring and addictive fragrance crafted for men who enjoy edgy, powerful scents with a rebellious character. Dark, aromatic, and slightly gourmand, this fragrance pushes boundaries while maintaining a refined, masculine elegance—perfect for those who like to stand out.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes ✨<br>
Top Notes: Cannabis, Saffron, Thyme, Green Notes, Davana 🌿🧡The opening is bold and unconventional. Green herbal facets blend with aromatic thyme and davana, while saffron adds a warm spicy richness, creating an intriguing and intense first impression.<br>
Middle Notes: Tobacco, Coffee, Raspberry, Cinnamon, Violet ☕🍓The heart is deep and addictive. Smoky tobacco and roasted coffee dominate, softened by juicy raspberry and warm cinnamon, while violet adds a subtle powdery elegance that balances the darkness.<br>
Base Notes: Tonka, Musk, Gurjan Balsam 🖤🌰The base is smooth and long-lasting. Creamy tonka adds sweetness, musk enhances sensuality, and gurjan balsam brings a resinous, woody warmth that lingers with confidence.<br>
Perfect for evenings, winter wear, parties, and bold personalities, Hawas Viper is ideal for men who enjoy dark, spicy, and gourmand-leaning fragrances.<br>
🔥 Dangerously charismatic and unapologetically bold—Rasasi Hawas Viper is a scent that strikes with intensity and leaves a lasting impression.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Rasasi",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,37,deny,manual,3949.00,6999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Rasasi-Hawas-For-Him-Viper.png?v=1779878738,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
rasasi-hawas-atlantis-100ml-edp,Rasasi Hawas Atlantis 100ml EDP,"<p>Rasasi Hawas Atlantis 100ml EDP For Men – Power of the Ocean, Spirit of Victory 🌊🔥Fresh • Aquatic • Long-LastingInspired by Invictus Legend by Rabanne 🏆✨<br>
