rasasi-hawas-diva-100ml-edp,Rasasi Hawas Diva 100ml EDP,"<p>Rasasi Hawas Diva 100ml EDP – Bold Femininity with a Sensual Edge 💃✨Inspired by Valentino Donna Born In Roma Intense | Made in UAE<br>
Rasasi Hawas Diva is a confident, glamorous fragrance crafted for women who love to make a statement. Modern, seductive, and powerfully feminine, this scent blends vibrant fruits with smoky florals and a creamy, musky base—perfect for evenings when you want all eyes on you.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes 🌹<br>
Top Notes: Red Fruits, Rhubarb, Lychee 🍒🍓A juicy and slightly tart opening that feels bold and addictive, bursting with fruity brightness and youthful energy.<br>
