paris-corner-kaheela-lux-85ml-edp,Paris Corner Kaheela Lux 85ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Kaheela Lux, an opulent and captivating Eau de Parfum designed exclusively for the modern man who exudes sophistication and confidence. This distinguished fragrance is a harmonious blend of rich and indulgent notes, making it an alluring and unforgettable scent that leaves a lasting impression.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: The journey begins with an enticing interplay of indulgent scents. The opening notes are an elegant fusion of velvety Tobacco Leaf, tantalizing Sour Cherry, and golden Honey, creating an initial burst of luxury. Underlying these delectable aromas is the allure of luscious Chocolate and the nutty richness of Hazelnut, adding a touch of warmth and sensuality.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: As the fragrance develops, a captivating heart of aromatic and floral accords comes into play. The warm and spicy Ceylon Cinnamon takes center stage, enveloping the senses in its exotic charm. The ethereal bouquet of May Rose and Damask Rose adds a romantic and velvety touch to the composition, while a zesty twist of Citrus Leaf brings a vibrant and refreshing essence to the heart.</p>

<p>Base Notes: In the final stage of this fragrance symphony, a captivating base of woody and oriental notes lingers, leaving an alluring trail. Rich and smooth Amber intertwines with the exotic and enticing Agarwood (Oud), creating a hypnotic and mysterious foundation. Creamy Vanilla and Benzoin add a sweet and creamy facet to the scent, while the woody depth of Sandalwood and Cypriol Oil infuses a sense of earthiness. Patchouli contributes a touch of rugged sophistication, while Musk embraces the composition with its sensuous and addictive nature.</p>

<p>Overall Impression: Paris Corner Kaheela Lux is a fragrance that exudes refinement and charm. Its all-encompassing blend of indulgent and luxurious notes appeals to the modern man who appreciates the finer things in life. Whether it's a romantic evening, a special occasion, or simply a desire to leave a lasting impression, this EDP perfume encapsulates a sense of timeless elegance and sophistication that will leave a mark wherever you go. Unleash your inner allure with Paris Corner Kaheela Lux, a fragrance that speaks volumes without uttering a word.</p>

<p>Top: Tobacco Leaf, Sour Cherry, Honey, Chocolate, Hazelnut<br>
Middle: Ceylon Cinnamon, May Rose, Damask Rose, Citrus Lea<br>
Base: Amber, Agarwood (Oud), Vanilla, Benzoin, Sandalwood, Cypriol Oil, Patchouli, Musk</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,85ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,2135.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Kaheela-Lux-85ML-EDP.png?v=1779878698,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-kaheela-platinum-85ml-edp,Paris Corner Kaheela Platinum 85ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Kaheela Platinum, an exquisite 85ML Eau de Parfum designed for men who seek a captivating and long-lasting fragrance experience. Crafted with meticulous attention to detail, this remarkable scent opens with a burst of invigorating freshness, with the top note featuring the zesty and aromatic essence of Bergamot. The vibrant Bergamot note immediately captivates the senses, leaving a trail of elegance and allure wherever you go.</p>

<p>As the fragrance settles into its heart, the intoxicating and tropical aroma of Coconut emerges, creating a harmonious balance between warmth and freshness. The middle note of Coconut exudes a sensuous and alluring character, making it an ideal companion for both daytime and evening wear.</p>

<p>At the core of Paris Corner Kaheela Platinum lies the rich and comforting base note of Tonka Bean. This profound and sophisticated note adds depth and longevity to the fragrance, ensuring its lingering presence on your skin throughout the day or night. The embrace of Tonka Bean complements the top and middle notes, weaving together a truly mesmerizing olfactory journey.</p>

<p>Paris Corner Kaheela Platinum is celebrated for its remarkable resemblance to the beloved Le Beau by Jean Paul Gaultier. Embodied with the same magnetic charm and spirit as its high-end counterpart, this fragrance captivates the essence of Le Beau, providing you with a luxurious experience at an accessible price.</p>

<p>Envelop yourself in the luxurious and enduring allure of Paris Corner Kaheela Platinum. Whether you're dressing up for a special occasion, impressing at a business meeting, or simply want to leave a lasting impression wherever you go, this long-lasting and sophisticated fragrance will undoubtedly become your signature scent, embodying the essence of refinement and charisma.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,85ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,2199.00,5000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Kaheela-Platinum-85ML-EDP.png?v=1779878697,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-wayward-charlie-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Wayward Charlie 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Wayward Charlie – an enchanting and captivating perfume designed exclusively for the modern gentleman. This sophisticated fragrance boasts a long-lasting formula that weaves a mesmerizing tale of allure and charisma, leaving a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>At the top, the scent opens with a harmonious blend of rich and indulgent notes. The delectable essence of caramel tempts the senses, complemented by the alluring warmth of tobacco, creating an intriguing fusion of sweet and smoky. The vibrant burst of red berries adds a touch of freshness and dynamism, while the zesty undertones of bitter orange inject a dash of zestful energy.</p>

<p>Moving into the heart of the fragrance, the aromatic journey delves into a lush and velvety embrace. The voluptuous tuberose intertwines with the delicate and feminine allure of lily and orchid. Together, they create a compelling fusion of floral elegance and masculine strength, forming an unforgettable olfactory experience.</p>

<p>As the scent settles into the base, an evocative and sensuous foundation emerges. The sultry Monoi Oil, extracted from the exotic Tahitian gardenia, brings a sense of tropical indulgence, evoking images of paradise beaches and sun-kissed skin. The smooth and inviting vanilla envelops the composition in a velvety embrace, exuding warmth and comfort. Finally, the timeless earthiness of patchouli adds depth and sophistication, tying together the layers of this extraordinary fragrance.</p>

<p>Paris Corner Wayward Charlie for men is a symphony of rich and diverse notes that come together in perfect harmony, offering a truly unforgettable scent experience. Its long-lasting nature ensures that this fragrance stays with you throughout the day, enhancing your presence and leaving a trail of allure and mystery. Embrace the essence of sophistication with Wayward Charlie, and let this captivating fragrance become your signature scent.</p>

<p>Top: Caramel, Tobacco, Red Berries and Bitter Orange</p>

<p>Middle: Tuberose, Lily and Orchid</p>

<p>Base: Monoi Oil, Vanilla and Patchouli.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1949.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Wayward-Charlie-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878696,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-forbidden-sugar-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Forbidden Sugar 100ml EDP,"Paris Corner Emir Forbidden Sugar, a captivating and long-lasting fragrance that will transport you to a world of indulgence and allure. This 100ML Eau de Parfum is a symphony of sweet and exotic notes, carefully blended to create a truly enchanting experience.

At the top, you'll be greeted by an irresistible concoction of delightful scents. The luscious sweetness of Marshmallow and Honey intertwines with the juicy allure of Cassis and Coconut, while the zesty freshness of Bergamot adds a citrusy twist. This tantalizing combination immediately captivates the senses, drawing you deeper into the fragrance's spell.

As the heart of the fragrance unfolds, a rich and creamy accord emerges, filled with warmth and comfort. Caramel and Vanilla create a sumptuous gourmand aroma, perfectly complemented by the juiciness of Pear and the softness of Jasmine. The essence of ripe Peach adds a touch of sophistication, making the middle notes of Forbidden Sugar an irresistible and memorable experience.

In the base, the fragrance takes a sensual turn, wrapping you in an alluring and mysterious embrace. White Musk lends a velvety smoothness, while Orange Blossom adds a touch of floral elegance. The fruity and slightly tangy notes of Raspberry provide a playful contrast, while Violet contributes a delicate and powdery aura, completing the fragrance with an air of sophistication.

Paris Corner Emir Forbidden Sugar is a masterpiece that seamlessly balances sweetness and sophistication. Its long-lasting formula ensures you remain enchanted throughout the day, leaving an unforgettable trail wherever you go. Embrace the forbidden allure of sugar and let this captivating fragrance be your ultimate signature scent.

 

Top: Marshmallow, Honey, Cassis, Coconut and Bergamot

Middle: Caramel, Vanilla, Pear, Jasmine and Peach

Base: White Musk, Orange Blossom, Raspberry and Violet",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1899.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Forbidden-Sugar-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878695,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-celestial-100ml-extrait-de-parfum,Paris Corner Emir Celestial 100ml Extrait De Parfum,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Celestial Extrait de Parfum 100ML, a captivating and long-lasting fragrance designed for the modern man who seeks to exude sophistication and allure. Emir Celestial embodies a harmonious blend of luxurious notes that transport you to a realm of celestial elegance and timeless charm.</p>

<p>At the core of this exquisite fragrance lies a foundation of deep and earthy mineral notes, providing a unique sense of groundedness and strength. These mineral accords create an enigmatic aura, evoking the essence of precious stones and natural landscapes.</p>

<p>The fragrance unfolds with the intoxicating richness of saffron, an opulent spice that infuses a warm and spicy aspect, captivating the senses with its exotic allure. Suede notes add a touch of velvety smoothness and sensuality, intertwining with the saffron to create a sumptuous and seductive experience.</p>

<p>As the scent evolves, a vibrant and verdant burst of violet leaf emerges, infusing the composition with a refreshing and green facet. This verdant essence serves as a counterpoint to the opulence of the saffron and suede, lending a dynamic and invigorating twist to the fragrance.</p>

<p>The heart of Emir Celestial is graced by the enchanting accords of Akigalawood, a modern and refined note with a captivating woody character and hints of patchouli-like warmth. This ingredient adds depth and complexity to the fragrance, enriching the olfactory journey with its intriguing blend of smoky and earthy nuances.</p>

<p>The base notes of this celestial composition are truly celestial, as they showcase the immortal charm of immortelle flowers. Renowned for their warm and honeyed aroma, these flowers add a luxurious and captivating sweetness, immersing the fragrance in an ethereal and timeless dimension.</p>

<p>Complementing the immortelle is the invigorating essence of Italian mandarin, a zesty and energizing note that injects a burst of citrus freshness, reminiscent of sunlit Mediterranean landscapes. Finally, the fragrance concludes with the subtle allure of Chinese osmanthus, an elegant and delicate floral note that imparts a touch of sophisticated sensuality.</p>

<p>Paris Corner Emir Celestial Extrait de Parfum 100ML is a masterful symphony of notes that come together to create an unforgettable fragrance experience. With its long-lasting formula, this scent becomes an integral part of your persona, leaving an indelible trail wherever you go. Embrace the celestial allure of Emir Celestial and leave a lasting impression as you embark on your journey through the world of refined masculinity.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,2649.00,4000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Celestial-Extrait-de-Parfum-100ML.png?v=1779878694,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,extrait,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-resurrection-100ml-extrait-de-parfum,Paris Corner Emir Resurrection 100ml Extrait De Parfum,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Resurrection Extrait de Parfum 100ML, a captivating and long-lasting fragrance designed exclusively for men. Crafted with the finest ingredients, this exquisite scent exudes sophistication and allure, making it the perfect companion for any occasion. Inspired by Acqua di Parma Colonia Oud perfume</p>

<p>At the very top of the fragrance pyramid, the Paris Corner Emir Resurrection opens with a burst of freshness, combining the zesty allure of Calabrian bergamot with the invigorating essence of Italian orange. These vibrant top notes create an energetic and uplifting introduction, setting the stage for the captivating journey that lies ahead.</p>

<p>As the scent evolves, the heart notes take center stage, weaving a rich tapestry of captivating aromas. The enchanting essence of Agarwood (oud) exudes a deep and mystical character, evoking a sense of mystery and sensuality. Accompanied by the warm and creamy notes of Amyris and the subtle hint of coriander, the heart of the fragrance offers a harmonious blend that entices the senses and leaves a lasting impression.</p>

<p>In the base notes, the Paris Corner Emir Resurrection reveals its true essence, unveiling a sense of sophistication and depth. The luxurious scent of leather intertwines with the enchanting allure of Atlas Cedar and the velvety smoothness of sandalwood, creating an opulent and indulgent foundation for the fragrance. Musk lends a subtle yet irresistible sensuality, while the earthy and aromatic Indonesian Patchouli Leaf completes the composition with an air of refinement.</p>

<p>The Paris Corner Emir Resurrection Extrait de Parfum is a masterful symphony of scents, skillfully blended to offer a fragrance that endures throughout the day and into the night, leaving a trail of charisma and allure wherever it is worn. With its distinct and powerful character, this fragrance captures the essence of modern masculinity, making it a truly remarkable addition to any gentleman's collection.</p>

<p>Indulge in the timeless charm of Paris Corner Emir Resurrection and embark on a journey of elegance, sophistication, and allure with every spritz.</p>

<p>Top notes: Calabrian bergamot, Italian orange</p>

<p>Middle notes: Agar (oud), Amyris, Coriander</p>

<p>Base: Leather, Atlas Cedar, Sandalwood, Musk, Indonesian Patchouli Leaf</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,2150.00,4000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Resurrection-Extrait-de-Parfum-100ML.png?v=1779878693,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,extrait,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-fascination-100ml-extrait-de-parfum,Paris Corner Emir Fascination 100ml Extrait De Parfum,"<p>Paris Corner presents Emir Fascination Extrait de Parfum, a captivating fragrance that transcends gender boundaries, enchanting both women and men alike. This exquisite fragrance is a celebration of timeless elegance and charisma, encapsulated in a 100ML bottle of pure olfactory luxury. Inspired by Richwood by Xerjoff</p>

<p>Sensational and Enduring</p>

<p>Emir Fascination is an extraordinary long-lasting fragrance that unveils a journey of sensory indulgence. Its intricate composition of premium ingredients creates a scent that remains enthralling from morning to night, effortlessly blending with your unique personality.</p>

<p>**Harmonious and Versatile Notes**</p>

<p>Top Notes: The fragrance opens with a burst of invigorating freshness, as radiant tangerine, zesty bergamot, and tangy grapefruit dance together, capturing the essence of a sunlit morning in Paris.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: At the heart of Emir Fascination lies the timeless allure of damask rose and succulent black currant. The soft, velvety petals of the rose embrace the sweet, juicy allure of black currant, creating a mesmerizing bouquet that embodies romance and sophistication.</p>

<p>Base Notes: As the scent matures, it unveils a rich and entrancing foundation. Earthy patchouli and creamy sandalwood intertwine, providing a warm and comforting embrace. Vanilla adds a subtle hint of sweetness, while labdanum contributes its resinous and amber-like character. The final touch is an elusive veil of musk that adds a touch of sensuality and allure, leaving an unforgettable impression.</p>

<p>Elevate Your Presence</p>

<p>Emir Fascination is an exquisite fragrance that effortlessly enhances your presence, exuding an aura of elegance and charm that captivates those around you. Whether you're strolling through the romantic streets of Paris or attending a lavish soirée, this fragrance becomes an essential accessory for those seeking to make a lasting impression.</p>

<p>Timeless Design</p>

<p>Encased in an elegant 100ML bottle, Emir Fascination showcases a sleek design that perfectly complements the essence of the fragrance within. The luxurious golden accents and refined font exude sophistication and add a touch of opulence to any dressing table.</p>

<p>Indulge in Emir Fascination</p>

<p>Embrace the allure of Emir Fascination Extrait de Parfum, where tantalizing top notes lead you on a voyage of floral elegance before settling into a harmonious and enchanting blend of base notes. Allow the magic of Paris to captivate your senses and immerse yourself in the everlasting allure of Emir Fascination.</p>

<p>Top: Tangerine, Bergamot, Grapefruit</p>

<p>Middle: Damask Rose, Black Currant</p>

<p>Base: Patchouli, Sandalwood, Vanilla, Labdanum, Musk</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1880.00,4000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Fascination-Extrait-de-Parfum-100ML.webp?v=1780392979,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,extrait,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-valar-a-walk-on-dirt-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Valar A Walk On Dirt 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Valar A Walk On Dirt, a long-lasting fragrance that takes you on an unforgettable olfactory journey. This exquisite Eau de Parfum is specially crafted for men who embrace adventure and seek to leave a lasting impression wherever they go.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: The scent opens with a refreshing burst of vitality, where the invigorating essence of Cypress intertwines with the zesty, citrusy aroma of Bergamot. This initial combination sets the tone for an enchanting olfactory experience, awakening your senses to the wonders that lie ahead.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: As the fragrance begins to unfold, the heart reveals a harmonious blend of woody and resinous accords. Rich and elegant Cedar Wood combines with the warm embrace of Amber, creating a captivating and charismatic aura. Labdanum adds a touch of oriental mystery, while Caramel infuses a delightful sweetness that adds depth and complexity.</p>

<p>Base Notes: The base notes of Emir Valar A Walk On Dirt unveil a grounding and sensuous foundation. Vetiver brings a smoky and earthy quality, evoking the essence of walking on freshly turned soil. Musk adds a touch of sensuality, drawing others closer to you, while the subtle floral grace of Jasmine adds a soft and sophisticated touch.</p>

<p>Long-lasting EDP:</p>

<p>Crafted with the utmost care and premium quality ingredients, Emir Valar A Walk On Dirt 100ML EDP ensures longevity and sillage, making it an ideal choice for those who desire a fragrance that stays with them throughout the day and night.</p>

<p>The Experience:</p>

<p>As you spray on Emir Valar A Walk On Dirt, an air of mystery and confidence will envelope you. The fragrance begins as a tribute to the natural world, embracing the essence of untamed wilderness. The exhilarating top notes take you on a hike through lush forests and sunlit glades. As it evolves, the heart notes weave a tale of worldly sophistication, capturing the charm of old-world architecture and intriguing historical alleys.</p>

<p>Finally, the base notes evoke a sense of adventure and discovery, reminiscent of exploring distant lands and exotic cultures. Each element of this fragrance harmoniously weaves together to create a captivating and unforgettable olfactory masterpiece.</p>

<p>Occasion:</p>

<p>Emir Valar A Walk On Dirt is versatile, making it suitable for both formal and casual occasions. Its long-lasting nature ensures that you can confidently wear it from a busy day at the office to an exciting evening out, leaving an everlasting impression wherever you venture.</p>

<p>Wrap-up:</p>

<p>Intriguing, powerful, and long-lasting, Paris Corner Emir Valar A Walk On Dirt 100ML EDP is a fragrance for the modern man who seeks a scent that complements his magnetic charisma. Unveil the allure of untamed wilderness and experience the magic of a walk on freshly turned earth with this captivating and alluring fragrance.</p>

<p>Top: Cypress, bergamot</p>

<p>Middle: Cedar wood, amber, labdanum, caramel</p>

<p>Base: Vetiver, musk, jasmine</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,1768.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Valar-A-Walk-On-Dirt-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878691,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-valar-smoky-leather-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Valar Smoky Leather 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Valar Smoky Leather, a sophisticated and alluring 100ML Eau de Parfum designed for the modern man seeking a fragrance that exudes elegance and charm. Crafted with a blend of carefully selected notes, this long-lasting scent captures the essence of masculine strength, warmth, and sensuality.</p>

<p>At the very opening, the top notes instantly make a bold statement with a captivating fusion of Vanilla, Cedarwood, Leather, Juniper, Patchouli, and Ambergris. The rich and robust Leather accord sets the tone, embracing the wearer in a confident and assertive aura, while the exotic Cedarwood and earthy Patchouli lend an air of depth and sophistication. As the scent develops, the aromatic Juniper and the alluring Ambergris seamlessly blend in, creating a captivating olfactory journey that is both masculine and inviting.</p>

<p>The heart notes emerge with a burst of freshness, combining zesty Mandarin and spicy Black Pepper. This dynamic duo infuses the fragrance with a lively and invigorating character, adding a touch of vibrancy to the overall composition. The mandarin brings a citrusy brightness, while the black pepper provides a subtle but captivating spiciness, making it the perfect complement to the more intense top notes.</p>

<p>Finally, as the fragrance gracefully settles, the final notes of Labdanum, Frankincense, Styrax, and Violet reveal themselves. The smoky and resinous aromas of Labdanum and Frankincense create a veil of mystery, adding an enigmatic allure to the fragrance. The sweet and balsamic notes of Styrax add a subtle touch of richness, enhancing the overall depth of the scent. Completing the experience, the delicate essence of Violet imparts a floral elegance, harmoniously balancing the boldness of the preceding notes.</p>

<p>Paris Corner Emir Valar Smoky Leather is a well-crafted symphony of notes that linger on the skin for hours, ensuring that you exude an air of confidence and sophistication throughout the day and into the night. This fragrance is a true testament to the art of perfumery, embodying the timeless charm of Parisian sophistication while adding a contemporary twist to captivate the modern man. Whether you're attending a formal event, a romantic dinner, or simply want to make a lasting impression, this fragrance is the perfect companion for any occasion. Step into the world of Emir Valar Smoky Leather and let its captivating scent elevate your presence, leaving an unforgettable trail wherever you go.</p>

<p>Top notes: Vanilla, Cedarwood, Leather, Juniper, Patchouli, Ambergris</p> 

<p>Heart notes: Mandarin, Black pepper</p> 

<p>Base note: Labdanum, Frankincense, Styrax, Violet</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1699.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Valar-Smoky-Leather-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878690,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-valar-a-chaos-in-the-ocean-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Valar A Chaos In The Ocean 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Valar A Chaos In The Ocean is an enchanting and long-lasting fragrance designed exclusively for the modern man who exudes charisma and confidence. This exquisite Eau de Parfum captures the essence of a turbulent yet harmonious oceanic journey, taking you on an olfactory adventure like no other.</p>

<p>At the first spritz, the top notes of cashmere wood and dried red rose greet your senses, evoking a sense of mystery and elegance. The rich and woody nuances of cashmere wood blend seamlessly with the delicate sweetness of dried red rose petals, setting the stage for the captivating journey ahead.</p>

<p>As the scent unfolds, the heart notes of patchouli, single citrus, and cane sugar come to life, offering a dynamic interplay of earthiness, zesty freshness, and a tantalizing hint of sweetness. The deep and earthy notes of patchouli create a strong, grounded presence, while the vibrant burst of single citrus adds a burst of invigorating energy. The subtle touch of cane sugar adds an addictive and alluring gourmand facet, making the fragrance truly irresistible.</p>

<p>Finally, at the base, the fragrance settles into an evocative symphony of musk, seaweed, and Oud wood essence. The sensuous musk embraces you in a warm and comforting embrace, while the marine-infused seaweed notes transport your senses to the heart of the ocean, adding an enigmatic touch to the overall composition. The rare and precious Oud wood essence adds depth and a touch of luxurious sophistication, leaving an unforgettable trail that lingers in the air long after you've passed.</p>

<p>""Paris Corner Emir Valar A Chaos In The Ocean"" is a powerful fragrance that embodies the perfect balance of chaos and tranquility, inspired by the ever-changing nature of the ocean. With its long-lasting formula, it ensures that you command attention and leave an indelible impression wherever you go, making it the ideal signature scent for the modern man who dares to venture into the unknown with confidence and style. Experience the captivating allure of the ocean with every spray, and embrace the chaos that brings out the true essence of a man destined for greatness.</p>

<p>Top notes: cashmere wood, dried red rose</p>

<p>Middle notes: patchouli, single citrus, cane sugar</p>

<p>Base notes: musk, seaweed, Oud wood essence</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,11,deny,manual,2399.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Valar-A-Chaos-In-The-Ocean-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878689,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-opulentia-primus-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Opulentia Primus 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Opulentia Primus 100ML Eau de Parfum, a captivating fragrance crafted to leave a lasting impression on the refined modern man. This olfactory masterpiece embodies opulence and sophistication, designed to evoke a sense of grandeur and timeless elegance. Inspired of King Creed Aventus</p>

<p>At its top, the fragrance bursts forth with a captivating blend of luscious fruits, featuring juicy Pineapple, zesty Bergamot, succulent Black Currant, and crisp Apple. This combination sets the tone for an enchanting and invigorating experience, awakening the senses and immediately drawing attention.</p>

<p>As the scent evolves, the heart reveals an intriguing interplay of woody and floral notes. Birch and Patchouli form a solid yet nuanced foundation, imparting strength and confidence to the wearer. Intertwined with the soft allure of Moroccan Jasmine and the velvety touch of Rose, this heart accord exudes an air of sophistication and allure.</p>

<p>Finally, as the fragrance settles into its base, a sensuous and warm embrace emerges. Musk envelopes the wearer in a seductive aura, while Oak moss and Ambergris add depth and complexity. The dry-down is further enhanced by the creamy and comforting touch of Vanille, leaving a lasting impression that lingers on the skin for hours.</p>

<p>Emir Opulentia Primus is a fragrance that encapsulates the spirit of modern masculinity, showcasing the perfect balance between strength and tenderness, power and refinement. Its long-lasting nature ensures that the captivating aura follows you throughout the day, making it an ideal companion for both casual and formal occasions. With its alluring and harmonious blend of notes, this Eau de Parfum becomes an essential addition to any man's collection, promising to elevate every experience to new heights of luxury and allure.</p>

<p>Top: Pineapple, Bergamot, Black Currant, Apple</p>

<p>Middle: Birch, Patchouli, Moroccan Jasmine, Rose</p>

<p>Base: Musk, Oak moss, Ambergris, Vanille</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1730.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Opulentia-Primus-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878688,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-opulentia-inverno-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Opulentia Inverno 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Opulentia Inverno 100ML EDP, a luxurious and long-lasting fragrance tailor-made for the discerning man. Capturing the essence of opulence and sophistication, this exquisite scent exudes an aura of confidence and allure that leaves a lasting impression on everyone in its wake. Inspired of Silver Mountain Water by Creed</p>

<p>At the top, bursts of invigorating Bergamot and zesty Mandarin set the stage for a vibrant and refreshing opening, instantly captivating the senses with their effervescent charm. As the fragrance unfolds, the heart notes reveal an intriguing blend of soothing Green Tea and succulent Black Currant. This unique combination lends a sophisticated and slightly mysterious character, drawing others in with its alluring magnetism.</p>

<p>The base notes of Opulentia Inverno are where its true opulence is unveiled. Rich and enchanting, Galbanum infuses the fragrance with a deep, resinous allure, adding a touch of earthiness that grounds the composition in sensuality. Smooth and velvety Musk intertwines with warm and comforting Sandalwood, creating a harmonious symphony of timeless masculinity that lingers on the skin like a soft caress. Completing the base, Petitgrain brings a touch of brightness, adding an unexpected twist to the overall experience.</p>

<p>Opulentia Inverno 100ML EDP embodies the spirit of a confident and refined man who embraces his sophistication with grace and style. Its long-lasting nature ensures that the fragrance stays with you throughout the day and into the night, accompanying you on your journey through life's most significant moments. This intoxicating blend of notes showcases the artistry of Paris Corner's perfumers, making it a must-have addition to any modern man's fragrance collection.</p>

<p>Top: Bergamot, Mandarin</p>

<p>Middle: Green tea, Black currant</p>

<p>Base: Galbanum, Musk, Sandalwood, Petitgrain</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1730.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Opulentia-Inverno-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878687,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-opulentia-empyreal-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Opulentia Empyreal 100ml EDP,"<p>Introducing Paris Corner Emir Opulentia Empyreal, a captivating and long-lasting fragrance designed for the modern and sophisticated man. This exquisite 100ml Eau de Parfum is a symphony of luxurious notes, skillfully blended to create an aura of opulence and refinement.</p>

<p>At the very first whiff, the top notes of Sea Salt and Fruity Notes entice the senses with a fresh, aquatic breeze that transports you to the shores of paradise. The interplay of zesty fruits adds a touch of vibrancy, setting the stage for the journey that lies ahead. Inspired of Millésime Impérial by Creed</p>

<p>The heart of this masterpiece unveils a harmonious composition of Sicilian Lemon, Bergamot, Iris, and Mandarin Orange. The citrusy accord cascades like golden sunlight, awakening a sense of invigorating energy while the delicate essence of Iris adds a layer of sensual allure. This captivating blend of notes dances on the skin, weaving a tale of warmth and sophistication.</p>

<p>Finally, the base notes gracefully settle into the skin with the mesmerizing allure of Sea Notes, evoking a sense of serenity and tranquility. The embrace of Musk adds depth and sensuality, leaving a trail of magnetic allure wherever you go. The perfume's rich and woody undertones complete the fragrance with a touch of timeless elegance, making it a signature scent to be remembered.</p>

<p>Paris Corner Emir Opulentia Empyreal is an olfactory masterpiece that stands the test of time, exuding confidence and charm with every spritz. Its long-lasting performance ensures that you make a lasting impression throughout the day and into the night. Embrace the allure of luxury and sophistication with this divine fragrance, designed to capture the essence of a modern-day emperor.</p>

<p>Top: Sea Salt, Fruity Notes</p>

<p>Middle: Sicilian Lemon, Bergamot, Iris, Mandarin Orange</p>

<p>Base: Sea Notes, Musk, Woody Notes</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1730.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Opulentia-Empyreal-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878686,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-lueur-despoir-ambre-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Lueur Despoir Ambre 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Lueur Despoir Ambre 100ML EDP, an exquisite long-lasting fragrance designed for men. This sophisticated scent captures the essence of masculine allure and offers an alluring olfactory journey that lingers throughout the day and night. Inspired of Ombre Nomade by Louis Vuitton</p>

<p>At the heart of this luxurious fragrance lies the rich and captivating note of Agarwood, also known as oud, which emanates an enigmatic and enticing aura. The intoxicating blend of geranium and raspberry adds a touch of sweetness and freshness, creating a vibrant and uplifting opening that awakens the senses.</p>

<p>As the scent develops, a harmonious bouquet of rose petals emerges, infusing the fragrance with a timeless elegance and a romantic nuance. Complementing this floral heart, amberwood and benzoin take center stage, adding depth and complexity to the composition. The earthy and smoky undertones of birch and incense bring an alluring and seductive quality to the fragrance, leaving a lasting impression of sophistication and allure.</p>

<p>Adding a touch of opulence, saffron weaves throughout the composition, elevating the overall experience with its rich and precious aroma. The combination of all these notes creates a symphony of scents that perfectly balances modernity and tradition, making Emir Lueur Despoir Ambre a truly captivating fragrance.</p>

<p>With its long-lasting nature, this Eau de Parfum becomes a signature scent, effortlessly accentuating the wearer's personality and style. Whether it's a formal event, a romantic date, or a casual gathering, this fragrance is the perfect choice for the modern man who seeks to make a lasting impression with every step he takes.</p>

<p>In conclusion, Paris Corner Emir Lueur Despoir Ambre 100ML EDP is a masterpiece that embodies the timeless charm and allure of a confident man. Its complex and alluring blend of oud, geranium, raspberry, rose, amberwood, benzoin, birch, incense, and saffron creates an unforgettable aroma that will undoubtedly leave a lasting memory on all who encounter it.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,8,deny,manual,2649.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Lueur-Despoir-Ambre-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878685,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-lueur-despoir-noche-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Lueur Despoir Noche 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Lueur Despoir Noche 100ML EDP, a captivating and long-lasting fragrance designed for both women and men, evoking an enchanting olfactory journey through the night. This exquisite scent is a celebration of sophistication, sensuality, and mystery, encapsulating the essence of a starlit evening in the heart of Paris. Inspired of Nuit de Feu by Louis Vuitton</p>

<p>At the core of Emir Lueur Despoir Noche lies the opulent and cherished Agarwood Oud, its rich and woody notes infusing the fragrance with a sense of timeless elegance. Accompanying this precious ingredient is the alluring and mystical essence of Incense, adding an element of spiritual allure and depth.</p>

<p>Olibanum, also known as frankincense, further enriches the composition, enveloping the wearer in a veil of sacredness and tranquility. As the scent unfolds, a hint of Leather emerges, adding a touch of sophistication and allure that perfectly complements the night's aura.</p>

<p>Finally, as the fragrance settles, a sublime blend of Musk emerges, creating a velvety and seductive trail that lingers in the air, leaving an unforgettable impression on everyone in its wake.</p>

<p>Emir Lueur Despoir Noche is a symphony of scents, masterfully harmonizing these luxurious ingredients to create a truly memorable and gender-fluid fragrance experience. Its longevity ensures that the fragrance endures throughout the night, accompanying the wearer on their nocturnal adventures and leaving a lasting impression wherever they go.</p>

<p>Whether attending a glamorous evening soirée or strolling hand in hand along the Seine, Paris Corner Emir Lueur Despoir Noche 100ML EDP is the perfect companion for those seeking a scent that exudes elegance, mystery, and allure long into the night.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes : Agarwood Oud, Incense, Olibanum, Leather And Musk.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,1999.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,"",https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Lueur-Despoir-Noche-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878684,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-lueur-despoir-arena-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Lueur Despoir Arena 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner's Emir Lueur Despoir Arena 100ML EDP is an exquisite fragrance that embodies timeless elegance and allure, making it the perfect choice for both men and women seeking a long-lasting and captivating scent. This luxurious Eau de Parfum boasts a carefully crafted composition that showcases a harmonious blend of notes, culminating in an enchanting olfactory experience.</p>

<p>At the heart of Emir Lueur Despoir Arena lies the essence of two distinct roses - Rose and Bulgarian Rose, creating a romantic and floral bouquet that evokes feelings of love and passion. To add depth and richness to the fragrance, Agarwood Oud comes into play, infusing a woody and resinous aroma that exudes sophistication and refinement.</p>

<p>As the fragrance unfolds on the skin, the mesmerizing allure of Ambergris emerges, offering a sensuous and captivating sweetness that lingers throughout the day. Saffron contributes a warm and spicy touch, adding a hint of opulence and extravagance to the overall scent. Finally, a subtle kick of Black Pepper spices up the blend, leaving a lingering trail of alluring sensuality that captivates the senses.</p>

<p>Emir Lueur Despoir Arena is a well-balanced and complex fragrance that effortlessly transitions from day to night, making it a versatile choice for any occasion. Its exceptional longevity ensures that the enchanting scent remains with you, leaving a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>

