paris-corner-emir-vanilla-and-roses-75ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Vanilla And Roses 75ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Vanilla And Roses 75ML EDP, a captivating and long-lasting fragrance specially crafted for women. This exquisite scent takes you on a delightful olfactory journey, enveloping your senses with a harmonious blend of refreshing top notes, alluring middle notes, and warm, comforting base notes. Inspired of Roses Vanille by Mancera</p>

<p>At the first spritz, the top notes of Lemon and Water create a sparkling and invigorating opening that instantly energizes the senses. The zesty Lemon adds a tangy brightness while the refreshing Water Notes evoke a sense of purity and crispness.</p>

<p>As the fragrance settles, the heart reveals a bouquet of lush and romantic notes. The mesmerizing Middle notes of Rose and Sugar intertwine gracefully, exuding an air of elegance and femininity. The delicate sweetness of Sugar complements the timeless and classic allure of Rose, evoking feelings of love and passion.</p>

<p>Finally, the base notes of Vanilla, Sugar, White Musk, and Cedar provide a warm and comforting foundation that lingers on the skin throughout the day. The rich and creamy Vanilla blends harmoniously with the sweet Sugar, creating a soft and alluring aura. Subtle hints of White Musk add a touch of sensuality, while the earthy Cedar brings depth and sophistication to the composition.</p>

<p>This Paris Corner fragrance is masterfully balanced, capturing the essence of a blooming garden adorned with roses and wrapped in the embrace of vanilla-infused breezes. Ideal for the modern, confident woman, Emir Vanilla And Roses is the perfect choice for any occasion, whether it's a casual day out, an evening soirée, or a special romantic date. Be prepared to leave a lasting impression wherever you go with this captivating and enduring Eau de Parfum.</p>

<p>Top: Top: Lemon and Water Notes</p>

<p>Middle: Rose and Sugar</p>

<p>Base: Vanilla, Sugar, White Musk and Cedar</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,75ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,1799.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Vanilla-And-Roses-75ML-EDP.png?v=1779878682,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,vanilla,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-oud-and-vanilla-75ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Oud And Vanilla 75ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Oud and Vanilla 75ML EDP is an exquisite and long-lasting fragrance tailored for sophisticated men who seek an aura of elegance and charisma. This captivating scent is a perfect blend of classic and contemporary, evoking a sense of mystery and allure. Inspired Of Aoud Vanille by Mancera</p>

<p>At the very first whiff, the top notes enchant the senses with a rich fusion of precious ingredients. The opulent and woody Agarwood, commonly known as Oud, takes the lead, leaving an intriguing trail of earthy warmth. A spicy kick follows, courtesy of the zesty Black Pepper, which is complemented by the aromatic and exotic Saffron, infusing the fragrance with a captivating allure. The inclusion of Cardamom adds a touch of sweetness and a hint of green freshness, making the opening an enticing experience.</p>

<p>The heart of the fragrance boasts a bouquet of delicate floral notes, which add a touch of refinement and balance to the composition. These floral accords exude a sense of luxury and enhance the masculine charm of the scent.</p>

<p>As the fragrance gracefully settles, the base notes emerge, weaving a luxurious tapestry of sensuality. Madagascar Vanilla lends its sweet and creamy essence, enveloping the wearer in a warm and inviting embrace. Guaiac Wood, with its smoky and leathery nuances, infuses a dash of strength and character to the scent. Finally, the smooth and velvety Sandalwood wraps up the composition, leaving a lasting impression of sophistication and elegance.</p>

<p>Emir Oud and Vanilla, with its unique combination of luxurious oud, delicate florals, and smooth vanilla, stands as a testament to Paris Corner's commitment to crafting captivating fragrances that leave a lasting impression. Ideal for special occasions or daily wear, this Eau de Parfum is a refined and powerful choice for the modern man seeking an enduring fragrance that mirrors his confident and sophisticated demeanor.</p>

<p>Top: Agarwood (Oud), Black Pepper, Saffron and Cardamom</p>

<p>Middle: Floral Notes</p>

<p>Base: Madagascar Vanilla, Guaiac Wood and Sandalwood.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,75ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,1699.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Oud-and-Vanilla-75ML-EDP.png?v=1779878681,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,vanilla,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-identity-oud-crescent-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Identity Oud Crescent 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Identity Oud Crescent is an exquisite and captivating long-lasting fragrance tailored for men who seek to make a bold and sophisticated statement. This 100ML Eau de Parfum embodies the essence of luxury and elegance, capturing the allure of Parisian craftsmanship in every bottle.</p>

<p>At the opening, a burst of tantalizing notes takes center stage, featuring the succulent sweetness of Raspberry and Litchi, enhanced by the warm and exotic touch of Saffron. This harmonious blend immediately entices the senses, setting the stage for an olfactory journey like no other. Inspired of The Moon by Frederic Malle</p>

<p>As the fragrance evolves, a rich and opulent heart emerges, blending the opulent charm of Turkish Rose with the smoky allure of Olibanum. Red Berries and Red Currant add a tantalizing fruity twist, while Violet adds a hint of floral sophistication. The heart of the scent is a symphony of contrasting elements, beautifully weaving together to create a distinctive and memorable experience.</p>

<p>Finally, the fragrance settles into a deep and sensual base that lingers on the skin for hours. The star of the show, Agarwood (Oud), unfolds its intense woody and resinous facets, exuding an aura of luxury and prestige. Leather and Patchouli add a touch of masculinity and earthiness, while Amber and Sandalwood provide a warm and inviting embrace, rounding off the composition with a hint of creamy sweetness.</p>

<p>Paris Corner Emir Identity Oud Crescent is a masterpiece of fragrance craftsmanship, fusing together premium ingredients to create a scent that leaves a lasting impression wherever it goes. This intoxicating blend is ideal for formal occasions, romantic evenings, or any moment when a man desires to leave a trail of sophistication and allure in his wake.</p>

