Amber and Sandalwood</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1765.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Identity-oud-crescent-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878680,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-identity-unique-portrait-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Identity Unique Portrait 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Identity Unique Portrait is an exquisite and captivating fragrance that defies conventional boundaries, making a striking impression on both women and men. Crafted with utmost precision and care, this 100ML Eau de Parfum is an emblem of sophistication and allure. Inspired of Portrait of a Lady by Frederic Malle</p>

<p>The top notes tantalize the senses with a harmonious blend of delicate Rose, warm Clove, and succulent Raspberry, laced with the richness of Black Currant and the subtle spiciness of Cinnamon. This intriguing combination sets the stage for an unforgettable olfactory journey.</p>

