paris-corner-emir-frenetic-red-tempt-80ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Frenetic Red Tempt 80ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Frenetic Red Tempt 80ML EDP is an invigorating and captivating fragrance designed for the modern man who seeks a long-lasting and distinguished scent. Bursting with a symphony of alluring notes, this Eau de Parfum embodies the essence of confidence, sophistication, and sensuality. Inspired Of Fahrenheit by Dior</p>

