<p>At the heart of this captivating scent lies a captivating bouquet of Violet Leaf, warm Nutmeg, and the rich, earthy tones of Cedar and Sandalwood. Honeysuckle, Carnation, Jasmine, and Lily-of-the-Valley intertwine, lending a subtle floral elegance to the fragrance.</p>

<p>The base notes exude a sense of allure and masculinity, with the deep and enigmatic essences of Leather and Vetiver. Musk and Amber infuse the composition with a seductive warmth, while Patchouli adds a hint of mystery. The fragrance is beautifully rounded off by the comforting and sweet aroma of Tonka Bean, leaving a lingering and irresistible trail.</p>

