paris-corner-emir-frenetic-men-80ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Frenetic Men 80ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Frenetic Men 80ML Eau de Parfum, a captivating fragrance designed for the modern man seeking a long-lasting and invigorating scent experience. This exquisite fragrance boasts a harmonious blend of carefully selected notes that exude sophistication and charisma from the very first spritz. Inspired Of Sauvage Elixir by Dior</p>

<p>At the top, an intriguing combination of Cinnamon, Nutmeg, Cardamom, and Grapefruit dance together, creating a tantalizing opening that immediately captures attention and sets the stage for what lies ahead. The zesty and citrusy notes of Grapefruit perfectly complement the warm and spicy tones of Cinnamon, Nutmeg, and Cardamom, crafting a rich and energetic introduction to the scent.</p>

<p>As the heart unfolds, Lavender takes center stage, providing a serene and calming essence that beautifully balances the initial zestiness. Lavender infuses the fragrance with a touch of elegance and refinement, adding depth and allure to the overall composition.</p>

<p>The base notes of Licorice, Sandalwood, Amber, Patchouli, and Haitian Vetiver form a mesmerizing foundation that lingers on the skin for hours. The combination of licorice's sweet allure, the woody and creamy essence of Sandalwood, the warm and inviting embrace of Amber, the earthiness of Patchouli, and the smoky sophistication of Haitian Vetiver create a captivating and memorable trail that resonates with confidence and masculinity.</p>

<p>Emir Frenetic Men is a symphony of fragrance notes that harmonize to create a memorable olfactory experience. It is a versatile scent that transitions effortlessly from day to night, making it an ideal companion for the modern man on any occasion. Unleash your inner charisma and allure with Paris Corner Emir Frenetic Men Eau de Parfum, and leave a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>Top: Cinnamon, Nutmeg, Cardamom, Grapefruit</p>

<p>Middle: Lavender</p>

<p>Base: Licorice, Sandalwood, Amber, Patchouli, Haitian Vetiver</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,80ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,1699.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Frenetic-Men-80ML-EDP.png?v=1779878677,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-vibrant-tobacco-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Vibrant Tobacco 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Vibrant Tobacco is an exquisite 100ML Eau de Parfum designed for the sophisticated man who exudes confidence and allure. This long-lasting fragrance is a captivating blend of rich, masculine notes that will leave a lasting impression wherever he goes. Inspired Of Tobacco Mandarin by Byredo</p>

<p>The top notes burst forth with an invigorating combination of Cumin, Mandarin Orange, and Coriander. The spicy warmth of Cumin intertwines with the zesty freshness of Mandarin Orange, while Coriander adds a subtle herbal twist, setting the stage for the aromatic journey that lies ahead.</p>

<p>As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes reveal a captivating fusion of Tobacco, Leather, and Labdanum. The sensuous allure of Tobacco envelopes the wearer, exuding a timeless elegance and sophistication. Rich Leather notes add a touch of rugged masculinity, creating a powerful and magnetic presence. Labdanum's resinous sweetness delicately weaves through the heart, adding a touch of opulence to the composition.</p>

<p>Finally, the base notes unfold with a mesmerizing blend of Olibanum, Sandalwood, and Agarwood (Oud). Olibanum, also known as frankincense, imparts a sacred aura and depth to the fragrance. Smooth Sandalwood offers a creamy, woody element that complements the preceding notes, while the enigmatic Agarwood, also known as Oud, infuses a touch of mystery and sensuality.</p>

<p>Paris Corner Emir Vibrant Tobacco leaves a trail of sophistication and allure, ensuring the wearer exudes an irresistible charm that lingers in the memory of all who encounter him. This long-lasting EDP is the perfect companion for the modern man seeking a fragrance that reflects his refined taste and distinctive style.</p>

