paris-corner-emir-identity-rose-and-leather-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Identity Rose And Leather 100ml EDP,"Paris Corner Emir Identity Rose and Leather 100ML EDP, a captivating and long-lasting fragrance designed for the modern man who exudes confidence and style. This exquisite scent opens with an invigorating blend of top notes, featuring the aromatic essence of Geranium, the fruity allure of Black Currant, and the spicy kick of Sichuan Pepper. This initial burst of freshness sets the stage for a truly memorable olfactory journey. Inspired of Rose &amp; Cuir by Frederic Malle

As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes take center stage, with the luxurious embrace of Leather intertwining with the timeless elegance of Rose. The combination of Leather and Rose creates a harmonious balance, embodying both strength and sensuality, making it perfect for the refined gentleman who appreciates the finer things in life.

Finally, in the base notes, the scent settles into a warm and earthy composition. The smoky depth of Vetiver adds a touch of mystery, while the woody essence of Cedar brings a sense of grounding and sophistication to the fragrance. These base notes provide a strong foundation for the entire composition, ensuring that the scent lingers on the skin throughout the day, leaving an unforgettable and memorable impression.

Paris Corner Emir Identity Rose and Leather 100ML EDP is an expression of masculine charm and allure, making it an ideal companion for both formal occasions and everyday wear. Its long-lasting nature ensures that the wearer remains enveloped in an aura of sophistication and charisma, making it a true signature scent for the modern man.

