paris-corner-emir-when-soul-gets-high-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir When Soul Gets High 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir When Soul Gets High is an exquisite and long-lasting fragrance designed for men who appreciate sophistication and allure. This 100ML Eau de Parfum opens with a tantalizing blend of fruity and spicy notes, captivating the senses from the very first spritz. Inspired Of Back to Black by By Kilian</p>

<p>The top notes burst with the richness of juicy Cherry and luscious Raspberry, enhanced by the warmth of spicy Cardamom and zesty Bergamot. As the fragrance settles, the heart unfolds a luxurious bouquet, combining the earthiness of Nutmeg, the floral allure of Geranium, and the calming essence of Chamomile. This aromatic blend is balanced to perfection with a touch of Coriander, adding an intriguing twist to the composition.</p>

<p>The base notes lend an air of sensuality and depth to the fragrance. Sweet and creamy Vanilla harmonizes with the alluring sweetness of White Honey and the nutty essence of Almond, creating a rich and inviting aroma. The spicy and resinous blend of Tobacco, Gingerbread, Amber, and Olibanum adds a captivating intensity, while the woody accords of Virginia Cedar and Oak evoke a sense of strength and elegance. The smooth and comforting Tonka Bean and Benzoin leave a mesmerizing trail that lingers long after the initial application.</p>

<p>Emir When Soul Gets High is an opulent and sophisticated fragrance that encapsulates the essence of a confident and refined man. Ideal for special occasions or evening wear, this captivating scent will undoubtedly leave a lasting impression wherever you go. Whether you are attending a formal event or enjoying a night out, this fragrance will elevate your style and confidence to new heights.</p>

<p>Notes: White honey, Tobacco, Cherry, Vanilla, Raspberry, Almond, Gingerbread, Amber, Tonka Bean, Nutmeg, Benzoin, Chamomile, Saffron, Cardamom, Patchouli, French labdanum, Olibanum, Oak, Virginia Cedar, Coriander, Geranium, Bergamot</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,1899.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-When-Soul-Gets-High-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878674,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-acadia-intenso-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Acadia Intenso 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Acadia Intenso is a captivating and long-lasting fragrance designed for the modern man who exudes sophistication and charm. The scent opens with a burst of invigorating freshness, where zesty notes of Grapefruit and Lemon intermingle with the cool essence of Mint and the spicy allure of Pink Pepper and Coriander. Adding depth and complexity, the fragrance is enriched with the delightful and woody undertones of Bergamot and Aldehydes. Inspired Of Bleu de Chanel Eau de Parfum by Chanel</p>

<p>As the scent evolves, it reveals an intriguing heart that embraces the warmth of Ginger and Nutmeg, lending a subtle hint of spiciness, while the delicate essence of Jasmine and the succulent aroma of Melon add a touch of refinement and sweetness to the composition.</p>

<p>The base notes of Emir Acadia Intenso create a sensuous and captivating trail that lingers for hours on the skin. A mesmerizing blend of smoky Incense and rich Amber creates an aura of mystique, while the comforting embrace of Cedar and Sandalwood infuses a woody and earthy accord. The enigmatic and slightly earthy Patchouli intertwines with the sweet and resinous scent of Labdanum, further enhancing the depth of the fragrance. Finally, the luxurious and velvety essence of Amberwood leaves a lasting impression, adding an elegant and confident finish to this remarkable olfactory journey.</p>

<p>Emir Acadia Intenso is a versatile and timeless fragrance that perfectly complements the gentleman's personality, making it ideal for both casual and formal occasions. Its long-lasting nature ensures that the captivating aura of the wearer remains intact throughout the day or night, making it a worthy addition to any fragrance collection.vv</p>

<p>Top: Grapefruit, Lemon, Mint, Pink Pepper, Bergamot, Aldehydes and Coriander</p>

<p>Middle: Ginger, Nutmeg, Jasmine and Melon</p>

<p>Base: Incense, Amber, Cedar, Sandalwood, Patchouli, Labdanum and Amberwood</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1949.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Acadia-Intenso-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878673,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-patchouli-no-7-60ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Patchouli No 7 60ml EDP,"Paris Corner Emir Patchouli No 7 is a captivating and long-lasting fragrance designed exclusively for the modern man. This exquisite Eau de Parfum combines the richness of oriental scents with a touch of woody warmth, creating a luxurious olfactory experience that leaves a lasting impression. Inspired Of Moonlight Patchouli by Van Cleef &amp; Arpels

At the top, the fragrance opens with an enticing fusion of Patchouli Leaf, adding depth and earthiness, accompanied by the alluring allure of Cacao, enhancing its warm and inviting character. Woody Notes interlace these top accords, infusing the scent with a rugged and masculine edge.

Moving to the heart of the composition, the fragrant bouquet blossoms with the elegance of Bulgarian Rose, offering a delicate floral touch that complements the earlier notes. The soft and powdery Iris Flower enhances the heart, lending a refined and sophisticated element that gracefully balances the fragrance.

As the scent settles into its base, it reveals an irresistible blend of Suede and Leather, exuding an aura of sensuality and masculinity. These leather notes create a magnetic attraction, evoking images of a confident and charismatic gentleman. Additionally, a hint of Fruity Notes adds a playful twist, providing a subtle sweetness that enhances the overall allure.

Paris Corner Emir Patchouli No 7 60ML EDP is a captivating fragrance that embraces the essence of a modern man's spirit. Its long-lasting formula ensures it stays with you throughout the day, making it the perfect companion for any occasion, from business meetings to intimate evenings. This opulent and distinctive scent will undoubtedly leave a lasting impression and become a staple in any man's fragrance collection.

Top: Patchouli Leaf, Cacao, Woodsy Notes
Middle: Bulgarian Rose, Iris Flower
Base: Suede, Leather, Fruity Notes",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,60ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1750.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Patchouli-No-7-60ML-EDP.png?v=1779878672,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-trillium-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Trillium 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Trillium is an exquisitely crafted and long-lasting fragrance designed for the modern man who exudes charisma and confidence. This captivating Eau de Parfum blends a harmonious symphony of aromatic notes, unveiling a captivating journey of olfactory pleasure that lingers throughout the day. Inspired Of Elysium Pour Homme Parfum Cologne by Roja Dove</p>

<p>At the top, a burst of zesty and invigorating citrus notes sets the stage. Sparkling grapefruit, lemon, bergamot, and lime intermingle with aromatic thyme, artemisia, and galbanum, creating an initial impression that is refreshing and uplifting.</p>

<p>In the heart of the fragrance, a fusion of sophistication and allure emerges. Aromatic vetiver and juniper merge with succulent berries and the irresistible sweetness of black currant and apple. The intriguing hint of pink pepper adds a touch of spice, while the warm embrace of cedar and the earthy essence of cypriol oil enhance the complexity. Soft and delicate florals, including lily-of-the-valley, jasmine, and rose, lend a graceful touch, balancing the composition.</p>

<p>As the scent settles into its base, a sense of sensuality and refinement takes center stage. Luxurious ambergris and supple leather create a rich and opulent foundation. The indulgent sweetness of vanilla and the resinous warmth of benzoin contribute to the allure, while the rich and smoky notes of labdanum bring depth and intensity.</p>

<p>The Paris Corner Emir Trillium EDP is a captivating fragrance that seamlessly transitions from day to night, making it the perfect companion for any occasion. Its long-lasting nature ensures that the wearer's presence remains unforgettable, leaving a trail of sophistication and elegance wherever they go. This fragrance is an ode to timeless masculinity and the epitome of confidence, embodying the spirit of the modern man who stands out effortlessly in any crowd.</p>

<p>Top: Grapefruit, Lemon, Bergamot, Lime, Thyme, Artemisia, Galbanum</p>

<p>Middle: Vetiver, Juniper, Berries, Black Currant, Apple, Pink Pepper, Cedar, Cypriol Oil or Nagarmotha, Lily-of-the-Valley, Jasmine, Rose</p>

<p>Base: Ambergris, Leather, Vanilla, Benzoin, Labdanum</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1999.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Trillium-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878670,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-killer-oud-sunrise-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Killer Oud Sunrise 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Killer Oud Sunrise is a specifically crafted for the modern man seeking a long-lasting and sophisticated fragrance. Embodying a perfect blend of traditional and contemporary notes, this exquisite scent sets the stage for an unforgettable olfactory experience. Inspired Of Sunshine Man by Amouage</p>

<p>At the top of this fragrance, notes of Lavender and Brandy intertwine to create a refined yet inviting opening. Immortelle lends a touch of warmth and uniqueness, while the essence of Orange adds a zesty twist, evoking memories of a sun-kissed morning in the heart of Paris.</p>

<p>Moving to the middle notes, a symphony of Juniper Berries and Clary Sage harmoniously dance with the invigorating essence of Bergamot. This aromatic fusion strikes a balance between freshness and masculinity, making it suitable for any occasion, from a casual daytime outing to a special evening event.</p>

<p>As the scent evolves, the base notes reveal the true essence of Paris Corner Killer Oud Sunrise. The alluring aroma of Tonka Bean and Vanilla entices the senses, exuding an air of sophistication and sensuality. Finally, the grounding presence of Cedar adds a woody depth, providing a solid foundation that ensures the longevity of the fragrance.</p>

<p>Paris Corner Killer Oud Sunrise 100ml EDP is the epitome of elegance and charm, capturing the essence of a confident man who leaves a lasting impression wherever he goes. Whether you're a connoisseur of fine fragrances or a discerning individual seeking the perfect signature scent, this fragrance is a must-have addition to your collection. Spritz it on and let the magical aroma transport you to the enchanting streets of Paris at sunrise, where dreams come to life and possibilities are endless.</p>

