<p>Base Notes : Madagascar Vanilla, Sandalwood, White Musk and Oakmoss</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,75ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,1699.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Super-Crush-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878669,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-rich-santal-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Rich Santal 100ml EDP,"The Rich Santal Emir Factory Edition is renowned for its irresistible blend of spicy, leathery, and musky notes, creating a unique and captivating aroma that both women and men can enjoy. This Woody Aromatic fragrance is known for its signature addictive allure, and its dry down is warm and comforting, thanks to the presence of cardamom and amber. Despite its warmth, this perfume remains fresh and lingers subtly on the skin. It is a perfume that exudes sensuality and universality, making it equally appealing to both men and women. With its unisex signature fragrance, this perfume provides an addictive and comforting experience that can boost your mood any time of day. Whether you need a mood lift or want to keep the good times rolling, RICH SANTAL EMIR FACTORY EDITION is the perfect scent to turn to.

