paris-corner-emir-voux-turquoise-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Voux Turquoise 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Voux Turquoise Eau de Parfum, a mesmerizing fragrance designed to entice both women and men into a world of sensory delight. This exquisite 100ML perfume is a testament to elegance and versatility, offering a long-lasting olfactory journey that lingers gracefully on the skin. Inspired Of Erba Pura by Xerjoff</p>

<p>Emir Voux Turquoise is a symphony of scents that beautifully marries the essence of coffee with a harmonious blend of notes. If you're a coffee aficionado, this fragrance is a must-have, as it skillfully intertwines the rich aroma of coffee with a myriad of other enticing ingredients.</p>

<p>Opening with a burst of invigorating freshness, the top notes include zesty Sicilian Orange, vibrant Calabrian Bergamot, and tangy Sicilian Lemon. This initial burst awakens the senses and sets the stage for the intriguing layers to come. The heart of the fragrance features a delightful fruitiness that adds a touch of sweetness and depth.</p>

<p>As the scent evolves, the base notes emerge, weaving a sense of warmth and sensuality. Madagascar Vanilla infuses a creamy sweetness, while White Musk contributes a soft, ethereal quality that envelops you in an irresistible embrace. Completing the composition, Amber lends a rich, resinous depth that adds complexity and sophistication.</p>

<p>The real magic of Emir Voux Turquoise lies in its ability to seamlessly blend masculine and feminine elements, creating a unisex fragrance that adapts beautifully to any occasion. Its remarkable longevity ensures that you can revel in its captivating aroma throughout the day and into the night.</p>

<p>Indulge your senses in the world of Paris Corner Emir Voux Turquoise, where the intoxicating notes of coffee, citrus, fruits, vanilla, musk, and amber converge to craft a fragrance that is truly enchanting and unforgettable.</p>

<p>Top notes are Sicilian Orange, Calabrian bergamot and Sicilian Lemon</p>

<p>Middle note is Fruits</p>

<p>Base notes are White Musk, Madagascar Vanilla and Amber.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,1730.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Voux-Turquoise-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878666,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-voux-violette-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Voux Violette 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Voux Violette EDP, a sublime fragrance that transcends traditional gender boundaries. This exquisite 100ML potion is a harmonious symphony of scents designed for both women and men who seek an enduring olfactory journey. Inspired Of Accento by Xerjoff</p>

<p>A testament to its longevity, Emir Voux Violette envelops the senses with an irresistible aromatic aura that lingers throughout the day. It's a fragrant masterpiece that caters to those with an affinity for the rich and invigorating aroma of coffee, making it an exceptional choice for coffee connoisseurs seeking a unique and luxurious scent.</p>

<p>At the outset, the perfume bursts forth with an intriguing blend of Pineapple and Hyacinth, creating a refreshing and vivacious opening that awakens the senses. As the scent settles, the heart notes come into play, intertwining Iris, Jasmine, and Pink Pepper. This fusion generates a magnetic and seductive allure, drawing others in with every whiff.</p>

<p>The journey culminates in the base notes, where the essence truly unveils its enduring character. The hypnotic dance of Musk, Vetiver, Amber, Vanilla, and Patchouli forms a sensual and intricate foundation that evokes depth and sophistication. This medley of elements not only contributes to the perfume's remarkable longevity but also leaves an indelible mark on the wearer's skin and memory.</p>

<p>Paris Corner Emir Voux Violette is more than a fragrance; it's an experience that defies norms and leaves a trail of enchantment. Whether worn by a man or a woman, its dynamic notes and long-lasting nature ensure that it becomes a part of their identity, a signature scent that captures their essence and elevates their presence. For those who appreciate the artistry of coffee and the art of perfumery, this exceptional EDP is an invitation to indulge in an unparalleled sensory adventure.</p>

<p>Top notes are Pineapple and Hyacinth</p>

<p>Middle notes are Iris, Jasmine and Pink Pepper</p>

<p>Base notes are Musk, Vetiver, Amber, Vanilla and Patchouli</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,1730.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Voux-Violette-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878665,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-voux-blue-oud-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Voux Blue Oud 100ml EDP,"<p>Experience the allure of Parisian elegance and Middle Eastern mystique with Paris Corner's Emir Voux Blue Oud Eau de Parfum, a luxurious olfactory journey designed for both women and men. This enchanting fragrance is a true testament to the artistry of perfumery, delivering an exquisite blend of contrasting notes that captivate the senses and leave a lasting impression. Inspired Of More Than Words by Xerjoff</p>

<p>At the heart of Emir Voux Blue Oud lies the soul-stirring aroma of Oud, a rich and deep note that anchors the composition in a sense of opulence and tradition. The fragrance opens with a burst of fruity notes that dance like sunlight through a blossoming orchard, infusing an air of freshness and playfulness. As the scent develops, floral notes unfurl delicately, weaving a tapestry of elegance and grace.</p>

<p>The journey takes a delightful twist as spicy notes intermingle, adding a dash of intrigue and sensuality. The warm embrace of ambergris lends a sophisticated depth, reminiscent of golden sands meeting the deep blue sea, while olibanum evokes a sense of sacred tranquility. Woody notes intertwine with labdanum, creating a harmonious balance between earthiness and ethereal beauty.</p>

<p>What sets Emir Voux Blue Oud apart is its exquisite homage to coffee lovers. As the fragrance evolves, an enchanting aroma of roasted coffee beans emerges, creating an intoxicating blend that awakens the senses and adds a unique twist to the traditional oud fragrance. This unexpected combination adds a layer of sophistication and modernity, making it a standout choice for those seeking a fragrance that defies convention.</p>

<p>Crafted with precision and dedication, Emir Voux Blue Oud is more than just a perfume – it's a journey, an experience, and a statement. Its long-lasting nature ensures that its captivating aura stays with you throughout the day and into the night, allowing you to exude confidence and charm wherever you go. Paris Corner's Emir Voux Blue Oud is the embodiment of luxury, passion, and innovation, a true masterpiece for fragrance enthusiasts who appreciate the art of scent composition.</p>

<p>Main Notes : Oud, fruity notes, floral notes, spicy notes, ambergris, olibanum, woody notes and labdanum.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1730.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Voux-Blue-Oud-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878664,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-voux-spices-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Voux Spices 100ml EDP,"Paris Corner Emir Voux Spices 100ML EDP, an exquisite olfactory symphony that defies conventional boundaries. This captivating fragrance, designed for both women and men, is a harmonious blend of daring spices and luxurious woods, embodying the perfect balance between strength and elegance. Inspired Of Ivory Route by Xerjoff

Crafted for those with a penchant for long-lasting fragrances, Emir Voux Spices envelops the senses in a lingering embrace that endures throughout the day. A true masterpiece for coffee enthusiasts, this scent boasts an irresistible coffee note that lends an invigorating and distinctive character.

The journey through Emir Voux Spices begins with its top notes, a fiery dance of spicy accords that awaken the senses with a burst of energy. As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes emerge, revealing the sensual embrace of sandalwood and patchouli. These precious woods intertwine, adding depth and warmth to the composition, while also creating a mesmerizing aura that draws people closer.

Finally, the base notes leave an indelible impression with the harmonious combination of allspice and basil. This distinctive blend exudes a captivating freshness that is both invigorating and soothing, leaving a trail that is as unforgettable as it is sophisticated.

Emir Voux Spices transcends gender norms, appealing to those who appreciate the complexity of fragrances that are rich and multifaceted. Whether worn to make a statement or to elevate daily experiences, this fragrance encapsulates the spirit of modern luxury and individuality.

In a sleek and elegant 100ML bottle, Paris Corner's Emir Voux Spices EDP is a testament to the artistry of perfumery, capturing the essence of passion, confidence, and the joy of savoring life's most alluring scents.

