paris-corner-emir-vibrant-sensual-saffron-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Vibrant Sensual Saffron 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Vibrant Sensual Saffron, a captivating olfactory masterpiece crafted for the modern man who seeks an air of mystery and sophistication. This 100ml Eau de Parfum is a symphony of scents that evokes a sense of exotic allure and timeless elegance.</p>

<p>At the heart of Emir Vibrant Sensual Saffron lies the enchanting and rare saffron, a precious spice that immediately grabs your attention. As the top notes unfurl, the fragrance reveals a burst of zesty Chinese grapefruit and the warmth of saffron, complemented by the subtle earthiness of juniper berries. This opening is an aromatic journey that sets the stage for what's to come.</p>

<p>The heart of the fragrance is a blend of smooth leather and the dark, velvety essence of black violet, adding an intriguing depth and sensuality. These notes intertwine gracefully, creating an aura of enigmatic charm that lingers in the air.</p>

<p>As the scent mellows into its base, you'll discover the sweet and slightly fruity embrace of raspberry, which seamlessly merges with the woody nuances of vetiver. Cashmeran adds a touch of warmth and sophistication, while anchoring the fragrance in a rich, long-lasting finish.</p>

<p>Paris Corner Emir Vibrant Sensual Saffron is reminiscent of the acclaimed Black Saffron by Byredo, an Amber Spicy fragrance for men. However, Emir Vibrant Sensual Saffron offers an affordable yet equally luxurious alternative, allowing you to embrace the same magnetic aura and distinctive character.</p>

<p>This fragrance is an invitation to step into a world of opulence and intrigue, where every spritz tells a story of elegance, sensuality, and refinement. Paris Corner Emir Vibrant Sensual Saffron is not just a scent; it's an experience that leaves a lasting impression, making it an essential addition to any gentleman's collection.</p>

<p>Top notes are Saffron, Juniper Berries and Chinese Grapefruit</p>

<p>Middle notes are Leather and Black Violet</p>

<p>Base notes are Raspberry, Cashmeran and Vetiver.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1699.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Vibrant-Sensual-Saffron-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878662,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-charuto-tobacco-vanille-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Charuto Tobacco Vanille 100ml EDP,"<p>Charuto Tobacco Vanille 100ml for men is a fragrance that exudes sophistication and mystery. This exquisite scent is a captivating homage to the iconic Tobacco Vanille by Tom Ford, offering a more affordable yet equally enchanting option for the modern man who appreciates the finer things in life.</p>

<p>At the top of this olfactory journey, you are greeted with the rich and warm embrace of tobacco leaf, intertwined with an enticing blend of spices. These top notes immediately set the tone for a scent that is both bold and inviting, making a powerful first impression.</p>

<p>As the fragrance evolves, the heart reveals a symphony of luxurious notes. The creamy sweetness of tonka bean and vanilla mingles seamlessly with the lush aroma of tobacco flower, while hints of cocoa add a subtle, gourmand touch. This harmonious combination creates an alluring and irresistible core that is both comforting and sensual.</p>

<p>In the base, Charuto Tobacco Vanille lingers with a trail of dry fruit accord and woody undertones. This depth and complexity give the fragrance a long-lasting and distinctive character that is perfect for special occasions and evening wear.</p>

<p>Top: Tobacco leaf, spices</p>

<p>Middle: Tonka bean, tobacco flower, vanilla, cocoa</p>

<p>Base: Dry fruit accord, woods</p>

<p>With its remarkable resemblance to Tom Ford's Tobacco Vanille, Paris Corner Charuto Tobacco Vanille 100ml for men is a true gem in the world of fragrances. It captures the essence of amber and spice, making it an irresistible choice for the modern man who seeks sophistication and charisma in every aspect of his life. Indulge in the allure of this scent and leave a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1962.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Charuto-Tobacco-Vanille-100ml.png?v=1779878661,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-charuto-mysterious-tobacco-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Charuto Mysterious Tobacco 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Charuto Mysterious Tobacco is an olfactory masterpiece that captivates the senses with its alluring blend of notes, drawing you into a world of mystery and sophistication. This 100ml elixir is an exquisite fragrance designed for those who appreciate the art of scent.</p>

<p>At the first spray, the top notes of ginger, osmanthus, artemisia, and citruses create an invigorating burst of freshness. The zesty citrus accord dances with the warm spiciness of ginger, setting the stage for the enchanting journey ahead.</p>

<p>As the fragrance unfolds, the heart reveals its true depth. Rich and robust, the middle notes of tobacco, guaiac wood, patchouli, and vetiver envelop you in a velvety embrace. The tobacco note, in particular, exudes a smoky and leathery allure that adds an air of mystique to the composition.</p>

<p>The base note of tonka bean adds a sweet and creamy undertone that lingers on the skin, leaving a memorable trail wherever you go. It anchors the fragrance with a touch of sensuality that perfectly balances the initial brightness and the heart's intensity.</p>

<p>Paris Corner Charuto Mysterious Tobacco is a remarkable Inspired of Red Tobacco by Mancera, a woody spicy masterpiece for men. It embodies the same essence of elegance and refinement, making it an excellent choice for those who appreciate the allure of Red Tobacco but seek a more accessible alternative.</p>

<p>Top notes are Ginger, Osmanthus, Artemisia and Citruses</p>

<p>Middle notes are Tobacco, Guaiac Wood, Patchouli and Vetiver</p>

<p>Base note is Tonka Bean.</p>

<p>With its long-lasting sillage, this fragrance is a testament to the timeless appeal of tobacco-based scents. Charuto Mysterious Tobacco invites you to step into a world of intrigue and charm, where every spritz is an invitation to adventure and sophistication.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,1420.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Charuto-Mysterious-Tobacco-100ML.png?v=1779878659,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,'1,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-the-triumphant-sapphire-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir The Triumphant Sapphire 100ml EDP,"<p>Emir The Triumphant Sapphire is a remarkable olfactory masterpiece that exudes sophistication and power in every spritz. This 100ML Eau de Parfum for men is a true triumph in the world of fragrance, capturing the essence of luxury and masculinity in a bottle.</p>

<p>At its first encounter, Emir The Triumphant Sapphire unfolds with an invigorating burst of top notes. Lemon, Chamomile, Sage, Saffron, and Tagetes blend harmoniously to create a zesty, herbal introduction that's both refreshing and intriguing. As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes emerge, showcasing a delicate bouquet of Rose, Indian Jasmine, and Magnolia. These floral tones add depth and sensuality to the composition, giving it a timeless quality.</p>

<p>The base notes of Agarwood (Oud), Patchouli, and Amber provide a solid foundation, leaving a lasting impression that is both woody and warm. This rich and alluring base lingers on the skin, creating an aura of sophistication and allure.</p>

<p>Emir The Triumphant Sapphire is a masterful Inspired of Blue Sapphire by Boadicea the Victorious, known for its amber-woody character. This fragrance pays homage to its predecessor while offering a more accessible option without compromising on quality or longevity. It embodies the spirit of a triumphant conqueror, confident and regal.</p>

