<p>This EDP is more than just a fragrance; it's a statement of power and refinement. With its impressive sillage and longevity, it's the perfect choice for a confident and modern man who seeks to leave a lasting impression wherever he goes. Paris Corner has truly created a triumphant masterpiece with Emir The Triumphant Sapphire.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1599.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-The-Triumphant-Sapphire-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878658,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-atoof-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Atoof 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Atoof 100ML Eau de Parfum for men is an olfactory masterpiece that captivates the senses and exudes an air of timeless elegance. This fragrance is a compelling homage to the classic Rosendo Mateu No 5 Floral, Amber, Sensual Musk, a testament to its enduring appeal. Atoof presents a symphony of notes that unfolds with sophistication and intrigue.</p>

<p>At first encounter, the top notes embrace you with a spicy and exotic floral dance, reminiscent of the most luxurious blooms and a touch of spice that adds an enigmatic allure. The heart of the fragrance unveils a rich bouquet of carnation and lily-of-the-valley, creating a refined and harmonious blend that resonates with the senses.</p>

