paris-corner-north-stag-phenominal-quatorze-xiv-extrait-de-parfum,Paris Corner North Stag Phenominal Quatorze XIV Extrait De Parfum,"<p>Paris Corner's North Stag Phenominal Quatorze XIV Extrait De Parfum for men is an olfactory masterpiece that exudes charisma and refinement. Crafted with meticulous attention to detail, this fragrance captures the essence of sophistication and intrigue. With a nod to the iconic Jazz Club by Maison Martin Margiela, it embodies the alluring world of leather fragrances with a unique twist.</p>

<p>Opening with an exhilarating burst of Pink Pepper, Neroli, and Lemon, this scent immediately commands attention. The zesty citrus notes mingle with the spiciness of Pink Pepper, creating an invigorating and memorable first impression. As the fragrance develops, it transitions into its heart, where the warm and aromatic blend of Rum, Java Vetiver Oil, and Clary Sage takes center stage. This combination evokes an air of mystery and intrigue, reminiscent of a cozy night at an exclusive jazz club.</p>

<p>The base notes of Tobacco Leaf, Vanilla Bean, and Styrax provide a rich and sensual foundation. The smoky allure of Tobacco Leaf harmonizes with the sweet warmth of Vanilla Bean, while Styrax adds a deep, resinous complexity. Together, they create a captivating and long-lasting dry down that lingers on the skin, leaving a trail of undeniable sophistication.</p>

<p>Top notes are Pink Pepper, Neroli and Lemon</p>

<p>Middle notes are Rum, Java vetiver oil and Clary Sage</p>

<p>Base notes are Tobacco Leaf, Vanilla Bean and Styrax.</p>

<p>North Stag Phenominal Quatorze XIV is more than a fragrance; it's an experience. It embodies the spirit of a gentleman who is confident, refined, and effortlessly stylish. With its exceptional longevity and sillage, this fragrance will accompany you through the day and into the night, making a powerful statement wherever you go. Elevate your presence with this exquisite Extrait De Parfum, and let it become an integral part of your signature style.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,2350.00,4000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-North-Stag-Phenominal-Quatorze-XIV-Extrait-De-Parfum.png?v=1779878655,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,extrait,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-fire-your-desire-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Fire Your Desire 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Fire Your Desire is a captivating and gender-neutral fragrance that sets hearts ablaze with its sultry blend of notes. This 100ml Eau de Parfum is a luxurious olfactory experience that evokes warmth, sensuality, and a touch of mystery.</p>

<p>At the top, Emir Fire Your Desire opens with the rich and inviting aroma of Cognac, immediately setting a sophisticated and alluring tone. As the scent unfolds, it reveals its heart notes of Cinnamon, Tonka Bean, and Oak. These elements add depth and complexity, infusing the fragrance with a spicy, woody allure that is both comforting and enticing.</p>

