paris-corner-north-stag-huit-viii-100ml-extrait-de-parfum,Paris Corner North Stag Huit VIII 100ml Extrait De Parfum,"Paris Corner's North Stag Huit VIII Extrait De Parfum, a 100ml olfactory masterpiece designed for the discerning modern man. This fragrance embodies sophistication and power, capturing the essence of a timeless gentleman.

At the top of this olfactory journey, you're greeted with an invigorating burst of Pink pepper, bergamot, lavender, and grapefruit. These opening notes are an elegant blend of citrusy freshness with a hint of spice, setting the stage for what's to come.

As the fragrance unfolds, the heart notes reveal themselves in a captivating symphony. Saffron, cinnamon, and black pepper infuse warmth and sensuality into the composition, creating a rich and spicy core that exudes confidence and charisma.

The base notes of tobacco, vanilla, leather, and vetiver provide the fragrance with a solid foundation, anchoring it in a deep and alluring masculinity. The interplay of these elements forms a seductive and long-lasting dry down that lingers on the skin, leaving an indelible impression.

Top notes are Pink Pepper, elemi, Bergamot and Grapefruit

Middle notes are Cinnamon, Saffron and Paprika

Base notes are Tobacco, Leather and Vetiver.

North Stag Huit VIII Extrait De Parfum is a homage to the iconic Spicebomb by Viktor&amp;Rolf, embodying the same spirit of a woody, spicy fragrance but at a fraction of the cost. This fragrance speaks to the man who is both refined and daring, who commands attention without saying a word. With its impressive longevity, it's the perfect companion for any occasion, whether it's a formal event or a night out on the town. Elevate your scent game with this captivating and affordable alternative to the classic favorite. Paris Corner has once again delivered an exceptional fragrance for the modern man who knows what he wants.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,2649.00,4000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-North-Stag-Huit-VIII-Extrait-De-Parfum-100-ml-1.png?v=1779878652,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,extrait,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-north-stag-sept-vii-100ml-extrait-de-parfum,Paris Corner North Stag Sept VII 100ml Extrait De Parfum,"Paris Corner's North Stag SEPT VII Extrait De Parfum, a captivating olfactory journey that defines sophistication and timeless elegance. This meticulously crafted fragrance, presented in a generous 100 ml flacon, is a testament to the art of perfumery, designed exclusively for the modern man who exudes charisma and confidence.

At the heart of this exquisite scent lies a symphony of meticulously selected notes, drawing inspiration from the legendary Aventus by Creed. North Stag SEPT VII opens with a burst of freshness, where top notes of Melon, Cucumber, Pineapple, Bergamot, and Black Currant intertwine, creating an invigorating and memorable first impression. These zesty top notes are reminiscent of a sun-kissed orchard, setting the stage for an olfactory experience like no other.

As the fragrance evolves, the middle notes of Patchouli, Jasmine, Sage, and Basil come into play, adding depth and complexity. The earthy, herbal qualities of patchouli harmonize with the delicate floral hints of jasmine, sage, and basil, resulting in a well-balanced and masculine heart.

The journey culminates in the rich and enduring base notes of Musk, Woody Notes, Vanilla, and Ambergris. These elements provide a solid foundation, leaving an unforgettable trail that lingers in your wake. The interplay of musk and woody notes adds sensuality, while vanilla and ambergris bring warmth and depth to the fragrance.

Top: Melon, Cucumber, Pineapple, Bergamot and Black Current

Middle: Patchouli, Jasmine, Sage &amp; Basil

Base: Musk, Woody notes, Vanilla &amp; Ambergris

Paris Corner's North Stag SEPT VII Extrait De Parfum is not just a fragrance; it's a statement. With its long-lasting performance and captivating aroma, this scent pays homage to the timeless Aventus by Creed while carving its path in the world of Chypre Fruity fragrances for men. Elevate your presence, embrace your allure, and leave an indelible mark with every spritz of this remarkable fragrance.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,2649.00,4000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-North-stag-SEPT-VII-Extrait-De-Parfum-100-ml-1.png?v=1779878652,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,extrait,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-north-stag-neuf-ix-100ml-extrait-de-parfum,Paris Corner North Stag Neuf IX 100ml Extrait De Parfum,"<p>Paris Corner North Stag Neuf IX Extrait De Parfum, a captivating olfactory masterpiece tailored for the modern man. This exquisite fragrance, housed in a 100 ml bottle, is a celebration of timeless elegance and sophistication.</p>

<p>At the heart of this scent lies a symphony of rich, warm, and seductive notes. The top notes greet you with a subtle hint of lavender, invoking a sense of relaxation and tranquility. As the fragrance evolves, the heart reveals a complex blend of Siam Benzoin and Spanish Labdanum, creating an intoxicating aura of resinous sweetness and deep amber warmth. Vanilla and Tonka Bean add a creamy, gourmand sweetness that is both comforting and inviting.</p>

<p>This fragrance is a masterful reinterpretation of Maison Francis Kurkdjian's Grand Soir, a classic amber fragrance loved by both men and women. The Paris Corner North Stag Neuf IX Extrait De Parfum captures the essence of Grand Soir with unparalleled precision.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:<br>
Amber, benzoin, vanilla, Tonka beans and Labdanum</p>

<p>What sets this fragrance apart is its longevity. With just a few spritzes, you'll experience a scent that lingers throughout the day and well into the night, making it perfect for formal occasions, romantic evenings, or whenever you want to leave a lasting impression.</p>

<p>The Paris Corner North Stag Neuf IX Extrait De Parfum is more than a scent; it's a statement. It embodies the essence of refinement and sophistication, making it the perfect choice for the modern man who values timeless elegance and a fragrance that stands the test of time. Immerse yourself in the luxurious world of this exquisite Inspired, and let your presence be unforgettable.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,2699.00,4000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-North-Stag-Neuf-IX-Extrait-De-Parfum-100-ml.png?v=1779878649,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,extrait,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-wild-and-tobacco-75ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Wild And Tobacco 75ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Wild And Tobacco is a captivating olfactory journey encapsulated in a 75ml Eau de Parfum, designed exclusively for the discerning modern man. This fragrance is an exquisite blend of aromatic notes that exude a sense of sophistication and charisma, paying homage to the timeless appeal of the original Red Tobacco by Mancera.</p>

<p>At the top of this aromatic pyramid, the fragrance bursts to life with a spicy and fruity fusion. Cinnamon, Agarwood (Oud), Incense, Saffron, Nutmeg, Green Apple, and White Pear dance harmoniously, creating an opening that is as invigorating as it is inviting. These top notes instantly make a statement, setting the stage for what's to come.</p>

<p>In the heart of the fragrance, Patchouli and Jasmine take center stage. Their rich, earthy, and floral tones lend a sense of depth and complexity, adding an alluring dimension to the composition.</p>

<p>As the fragrance settles into its base, a warm and woody embrace emerges. Tobacco, Madagascar Vanilla, Amber, Sandalwood, Guaiac Wood, White Musk, and Haitian Vetiver combine to create a sensuous and enduring trail. This blend of base notes imparts a remarkable longevity to Emir Wild And Tobacco, ensuring that it lingers on your skin for hours, leaving a trail of mesmerizing allure wherever you go.</p>

<p>Emir Wild And Tobacco is more than just a fragrance; it's an olfactory signature that tells a story of sophistication and power. This fragrance invites you to step into a world of opulence, where every spray is an experience, and every moment is elevated by its presence. Experience the allure and mystique of Emir Wild And Tobacco – a fragrance that mirrors the timeless elegance of Red Tobacco by Mancera.</p>

<p>Top: Cinnamon, Agarwood (Oud), Incense, Saffron, Nutmeg, Green Apple and White Pear</p>

<p>Middle: Patchouli and Jasmine</p>

<p>Base: Tobacco, Madagascar Vanilla, Amber, Sandalwood, Guaiac Wood, White Musk and Haitian Vetiver</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,75ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,1699.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Wild-And-Tobacco-75ml-EDP.png?v=1779878647,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-veracious-oud-nuit-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Veracious Oud Nuit 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Veracious Oud Nuit 100ml EDP for Men</p>

<p>Elevate your presence with Paris Corner's Veracious Oud Nuit, a sophisticated masterpiece in a bottle. This fragrance is a captivating symphony of scents that embodies timeless masculinity. Crafted with meticulous attention to detail, Veracious Oud Nuit is an olfactory journey that will leave a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>Scent Notes: The top notes of Black Pepper, Bitter Orange, and Neroli make a bold and invigorating entrance, setting the stage for what's to come. As the fragrance develops, the heart notes of Saffron, Cardamom, and Olibanum weave a rich tapestry of spices and incense, adding depth and complexity. Finally, the base notes of Agarwood (Oud), Patchouli, and Leatherwood create an enchanting and long-lasting dry down that is both sensual and mysterious.</p>

<p>Inspired by Versace Pour Homme Oud Noir: Veracious Oud Nuit draws inspiration from the renowned Versace Pour Homme Oud Noir by Versace, a fragrance celebrated for its amber woody character. Paris Corner's interpretation pays homage to this iconic scent, offering you a more accessible yet equally luxurious alternative.</p>

<p>Timeless Elegance: Veracious Oud Nuit is the essence of timeless elegance. Whether you're dressing up for a special occasion or making a lasting impression in your daily life, this fragrance is your secret weapon. Its longevity ensures that your presence lingers, leaving an indelible mark of sophistication.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top: Black Pepper, Bitter Orange and Neroli</p>

<p>Middle: Saffron, Cardamom and Olibanum</p>

<p>Base: Agarwood (Oud), Patchouli and Leatherwood</p>

<p>Paris Corner Veracious Oud Nuit is more than just a fragrance; it's a statement of refinement and confidence. Indulge in the allure of this scent, and let it become an integral part of your personal style. With Veracious Oud Nuit, you're not just wearing a fragrance; you're embracing a legacy of excellence in perfumery.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1299.00,2000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Veracious-Oud-Nuit-100Ml-EDP.png?v=1779878646,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-north-stag-hypnotic-oud-quinze-xv-100ml-extrait-de-parfum,Paris Corner North Stag Hypnotic Oud Quinze XV 100ml Extrait De Parfum,"<p>Introducing Paris Corner's North Stag Hypnotic Oud Quinze XV Extrait De Parfum, a masterpiece in the realm of men's fragrances. This 100ml elixir is not just a scent; it's an olfactory journey, a captivating tale of masculine allure that leaves an indelible mark.</p>

<p>The longevity of this fragrance is truly remarkable. It weaves an aromatic tale that begins with an intoxicating blend of top notes. As soon as it touches your skin, the scent comes alive with the exotic and spicy fusion of Cypriol, Labdanum, saffron, cardamom, cinnamon, and the zesty brightness of grapefruit. These opening notes create an immediate, alluring impression, making you impossible to forget.</p>

<p>The heart of this fragrance reveals its depth and complexity with a rich combination of woody notes, amber, velvety sandalwood, the sweet allure of jasmine, and the earthy aroma of tobacco. These middle notes create a warm and inviting essence that draws people closer to you, like a magnetic force.</p>

<p>As the scent settles and evolves, it reaches its grand crescendo in the base notes. Here, leather and musk intertwine with the sensuous richness of tonka bean and the legendary presence of oud. The base notes are where the true longevity of this fragrance becomes evident, lingering on your skin for hours, if not days.</p>

<p>Top: Cypriol, Labdanum, saffron, cardamom, cinnamon and grapefruit</p>

<p>Middle: Woody notes, Amber, Sandalwood, Jasmine and Tobacco</p>

<p>Base: Leather, Musk, Tonka and Oud</p>

<p>Paris Corner's North Stag Hypnotic Oud Quinze XV Extrait De Parfum is a masterpiece that can be likened to a fine wine - it only gets better with time. As you wear this fragrance, you'll experience the evolution of scents, from the initial burst of exotic spices to the deep, intoxicating embrace of the base notes. This fragrance isn't just a scent; it's an experience, a story that lingers in the memories of those you encounter.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,2680.00,4000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/North-stag-hypnotic-oud.png?v=1779878646,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,extrait,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-vertex-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Vertex 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Vertex is a captivating olfactory masterpiece, epitomizing the essence of luxury and elegance in a 100ML Eau de Parfum for Men. This fragrance stands out as an exceptional, long-lasting perfume that will leave an indelible mark on anyone who encounters it.</p>

<p>The top notes of Orange, Mandarin Orange, Bergamot, and Lemon create a vibrant and citrusy opening that is both refreshing and invigorating. As it settles, the heart notes emerge, featuring Pineapple, Cistus Incanus, and Jasmine. These notes infuse a lush, tropical sweetness, balanced by the aromatic resinous quality of Cistus Incanus.</p>

<p>The base notes of Paris Corner Emir Vertex are a symphony of earthy and woody elements, including Cypress, Balsam Fir, Oakmoss, Leather, Patchouli, and Tobacco. These rich and robust accords create a sensuous foundation, enriched with Olibanum, Juniper Berries, Musk, and Cashmere Wood. The fragrance evolves with Labdanum, Amber, Sandalwood, Elemi resin, Galbanum, Rum, Ambergris, and Benzoin, adding depth and complexity to its character.</p>

<p>Emir Vertex is celebrated as a remarkable Inspired of the prestigious Apex by Roja Dove, capturing the opulence and sophistication of the original in a more budget-friendly package. It exudes an aura of opulence and prestige, making it a perfect choice for those who seek luxury in their everyday lives.</p>

<p>Top notes are Orange, Mandarin Orange, Bergamot and Lemon</p>

<p>Middle notes are Pineapple, Cistus Incanus and Jasmine</p>

<p>Base notes are Cypress, Balsam Fir, Oakmoss, Leather, Patchouli, Tobacco, Olibanum, Juniper Berries, Musk, Cashmere Wood, Labdanum, Amber, Sandalwood, Elemi resin, Galbanum, Rum, Ambergris and Benzoin.</p>

<p>In essence, Paris Corner Emir Vertex is a testament to the artistry of perfumery, a scent that lingers with distinction, and a fragrance that mirrors the pinnacle of olfactory excellence. This fragrance is a gateway to the world of luxury scents, making it a timeless addition to any collection.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,1999.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Emir-Vertex.png?v=1779878645,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-vibrant-orange-and-neroli-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Vibrant Orange And Neroli 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Vibrant Orange and Neroli is an olfactory masterpiece designed for the modern man who exudes confidence and charm. This 100ml Eau de Parfum is more than just a fragrance; it's a statement, an aura that lingers in the air. Crafted to be exceptionally long-lasting, it ensures that your presence is memorable wherever you go.</p>

<p>At the top, Emir Vibrant Orange and Neroli opens with a burst of invigorating freshness, combining the zesty notes of Mandarin Orange and Californian Lemon. This citrusy embrace is the perfect introduction to the symphony that follows.</p>

<p>In the heart of the fragrance, Neroli and Jasmine Sambac take center stage, adding a floral elegance that's both sophisticated and inviting. The interplay between these floral notes creates a harmonious blend that resonates with refinement.</p>

<p>As the scent settles, the base notes of Cotton Candy and White Musk emerge, leaving a sweet and sensuous trail that lingers on your skin, a subtle reminder of your presence. This unique combination of notes creates a signature scent that's truly captivating.</p>

<p>Top: Mandarin Orange and Californian Lemon</p>

<p>Middle: Neroli and Jasmine Sambac</p>

<p>Base: Cotton Candy and White Musk</p>

<p>Emir Vibrant Orange and Neroli is celebrated for its remarkable resemblance to the much-loved and expensive fragrance, Sundazed by Byredo. Now, you can indulge in this budget-friendly alternative without compromising on quality or longevity. With its vibrant, long-lasting, and affordable charm, Emir Vibrant Orange and Neroli is the perfect olfactory companion for any occasion, adding an air of sophistication to your everyday style.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1730.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Emir-vibrant-orange-neroli.png?v=1779878643,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-cedrat-essence-75ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Cedrat Essence 75ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner's Emir Cedrat Essence 75ml Eau de Parfum for Men is the epitome of long-lasting luxury in a bottle. This exceptional fragrance captivates the senses with its exquisite blend of notes, creating an olfactory experience that is both timeless and modern.</p>

<p>At the outset, the top notes of Sicilian Lemon, Black Currant, Bergamot, and a hint of Spicy Notes burst forth, leaving a fresh and invigorating trail in their wake. The citrusy brightness of the lemon and the richness of black currant create an initial impression that is nothing short of captivating.</p>

<p>As this captivating scent unfolds, the heart notes emerge, featuring a harmonious fusion of Fruity Notes, Patchouli Leaf, and Water Jasmine. This combination strikes a perfect balance between earthy and floral, adding depth and complexity to the fragrance.</p>

<p>The journey concludes with a base that exudes sophistication and masculinity. Cedar, Leather, Sandalwood, Vanilla, White Musk, and Moss intertwine to form a warm and alluring foundation. The interplay of these elements creates a sensuous dry-down that lingers throughout the day, making Emir Cedrat Essence a truly enduring scent.</p>

<p>Top: Sicilian Lemon, Black Currant, Bergamot and Spicy Notes</p>

<p>Middle: Fruity Notes, Patchouli Leaf and Water Jasmine</p>

<p>Base: Cedar, Leather, Sandalwood, Vanilla, White Musk and Moss</p>

<p>This fragrance is undoubtedly a remarkable tribute to the ever-popular Cedrat Boise by Mancera, offering a budget-friendly alternative that doesn't compromise on quality or longevity. Paris Corner has masterfully crafted a fragrance that mirrors the allure of its inspiration while adding its own unique touch. Emir Cedrat Essence is a testament to timeless sophistication, making it the perfect choice for the modern man seeking an enduring and distinctive signature scent.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,75ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1749.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/emir-cedrat-essence.png?v=1779878642,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-you-re-drugged-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir You’re Drugged 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner's ""Emir You're Drugged"" Eau de Parfum for Men is a captivating olfactory journey, a fragrance that leaves an unforgettable trail. This 100ml bottle houses an elixir of pure sophistication and power, making it a must-have for the modern man seeking to leave a lasting impression.</p>

<p>This scent opens with an intriguing blend of top notes, where the warmth of cinnamon intertwines with the bold, intoxicating aroma of whiskey. It's an entrance that commands attention and exudes confidence. As the fragrance settles, the heart notes emerge, offering a symphony of cardamom's spicy, green allure and the sensual, earthy richness of nutmeg. Together, they create an alluring and mysterious depth.</p>

<p>What truly sets ""Emir You're Drugged"" apart is its base, where the essence of coffee and vanilla unfolds. This dynamic combination forms a luscious, aromatic foundation that envelops you in an aura of sensuality and charm. It's a scent that lingers throughout the day and into the night, ensuring you're unforgettable in every setting.</p>

<p>Top notes are Cinnamon and Whiskey</p>

<p>Middle notes are Cardamom and Nutmeg</p>

<p>Base notes are Coffee and Vanilla.</p>

<p>The perfume's longevity is remarkable, making it perfect for long days and nights. Not only is it an olfactory powerhouse, but it's also an excellent budget-friendly alternative to the renowned ""Intoxicated"" by By Kilian. ""Emir You're Drugged"" captures the essence of the original fragrance, making it a smart choice for those who appreciate luxury scents without the premium price tag. This fragrance is for the modern gentleman who craves a unique and long-lasting signature scent that commands attention and respect.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,2149.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Emir-Youre-Drugged.png?v=1779878642,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-arcana-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Arcana 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Arcana 100ML Eau de Parfum is a captivating fragrance that transcends the boundaries of gender. This scent is not just long-lasting; it's an olfactory journey that lingers in memory, leaving a trail of allure and sophistication. With an enchanting blend of notes, it evokes the essence of the iconic Kirke by Tiziana Terenzi, making it a remarkable alternative for fragrance enthusiasts.</p>

<p>At its opening, Emir Arcana unleashes a burst of fruity vibrancy. The top notes of passionfruit, peach, pear, raspberry, cassis, and sand create a juicy and tantalizing introduction. This symphony of fruits dances on your skin, exuding a sense of opulence.</p>

<p>As the fragrance matures, it gracefully transitions into the heart of the composition, where delicate lily-of-the-valley takes center stage. This floral accord adds a touch of elegance, balancing the fruity exuberance with its subtle, dewy sweetness.</p>

<p>The base notes of musk, sandalwood, vanilla, patchouli, and heliotrope provide a warm and sensuous foundation to Emir Arcana. These elements create an embracing and enduring aroma that clings to your skin, making it an ideal choice for those who appreciate longevity in their scents.</p>

<p>Top: Passionfruit, Peach, Pear, Raspberry, Cassis, Sand</p>

<p>Middle: Lily-of-the-Valley</p>

<p>Base: Musk, Sandalwood, Vanilla, Patchouli, Heliotrope</p>

<p>Emir Arcana is a fragrance that defies traditional gender boundaries, making it an enticing choice for both men and women. Its resemblance to Kirke by Tiziana Terenzi offers an affordable alternative without compromising on quality and allure. Whether worn during the day or for an evening soiree, Paris Corner's Emir Arcana is an enchanting elixir that exudes luxury and charm.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1949.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Emir-arcana.png?v=1779878640,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-voux-elegante-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Voux Elegante 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Voux Elegante 100ML Eau de Parfum for Men is an exquisite olfactory journey that exudes elegance, longevity, and character. Crafted with a meticulous blend of aromatic notes, this fragrance is a captivating alternative to the renowned XJ 1861 Naxos by Xerjoff, ensuring you experience luxury at an affordable price.</p>

<p>The top notes of cinnamon, lavender, and honey greet your senses with a warm, sweet embrace. This initial burst is inviting and intriguing, setting the stage for what's to come. As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes of jasmine, bergamot, and tobacco take center stage. The jasmine adds a touch of floral sophistication, balanced by the bergamot's citrusy freshness and the smoky allure of tobacco. Vanilla lends a creamy, gourmand quality that's both comforting and irresistible.</p>

<p>The base notes of cardamom, lemon, cashmeran, and tonka bean provide a rich and lasting foundation for Emir Voux Elegante. Cardamom adds a spicy twist, while lemon contributes a zesty, vibrant undertone. The fragrance's depth is enhanced by the woody, musky nuances of cashmeran and the sweet, warm embrace of tonka bean.</p>

<p>Top Notes -Cinnamon, lavender, honey</p>

<p>Heart Notes - jasmine, bergamot, tobacco, vanilla,</p>

<p>Base Notes - cardamom, lemon, cashmeran and tonka bean.</p>

<p>One of the most outstanding features of this scent is its remarkable longevity, ensuring that it lingers on your skin throughout the day or night. With Emir Voux Elegante, you can confidently make a lasting impression, exuding sophistication and style. Whether you're dressing up for a special occasion or adding a touch of luxury to your everyday life, this fragrance is the perfect companion.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,1730.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Voux-Elegante.png?v=1779878639,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-monster-cafe-intense-80ml-edp,Paris Corner Monster Cafe Intense 80ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Monster Cafe Intense is a captivating fragrance that blurs the lines between traditional gender boundaries. This 80ml Eau de Parfum is a testament to sophistication and longevity.</p>

<p>Top Notes: The scent journey begins with a delicate interplay of floral notes, setting a vibrant and inviting tone. These top notes are reminiscent of a blossoming garden, providing an immediate sense of freshness and intrigue.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: As the fragrance evolves, the heart reveals an alluring blend of rich rose and the bold intensity of coffee. The floral and coffee accords harmoniously intertwine, creating a unique olfactory experience. The rose adds a touch of romanticism, while the coffee infusion injects an element of energy and allure.</p>

<p>Base Notes: The fragrance gracefully settles into its base notes, featuring white musk, amber, and vanilla. This sensual foundation adds depth and longevity to the perfume. White musk contributes a clean and alluring quality, while amber and vanilla provide a warm and sweet embrace, leaving a lasting impression.</p>

<p>Paris Corner Monster Cafe Intense is akin to a well-crafted symphony, with its notes dancing together in perfect harmony. Its longevity is a remarkable feature, ensuring that you remain enveloped in this mesmerizing aroma throughout the day and night.</p>

<p>What's more, this fragrance is often celebrated as a worthy alternative to the renowned Montale's Intense Cafe. It captures the same essence of indulgent coffee and the alluring charm of rose, making it a budget-friendly choice for those who appreciate sophistication and luxury.</p>

<p>In summary, Monster Cafe Intense by Paris Corner is a unisex EDP that defies conventions, making it an ideal choice for both men and women who seek a long-lasting, elegant fragrance with an air of mystery and sensuality.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,80ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1399.00,2000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Monster-cafe-intense.png?v=1780393514,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-monster-rose-musk-80ml-edp,Paris Corner Monster Rose Musk 80ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner's Monster Rose Musk 80ml Eau de Parfum is an olfactory masterpiece that transcends traditional gender boundaries, offering a captivating and enduring fragrance experience for both men and women.</p>

<p>This fragrance boasts remarkable longevity, making it the perfect choice for individuals who desire a scent that lingers throughout the day and into the night. Its exquisite blend of notes is a testament to its sophistication and allure.</p>

<p>At the heart of Monster Rose Musk is a bouquet of Jasmine and Rose, two of the most beloved and timeless floral scents. These delicate blooms combine to create a lush, romantic aura that envelops you in a subtle, yet enchanting, embrace. The addition of Musk deepens the fragrance, lending it an alluring sensuality that is both sultry and comforting.</p>

<p>What sets Monster Rose Musk apart is its undeniable resemblance to the renowned Roses Musk by Montale. It's a brilliant Inspired, capturing the essence of the original masterpiece while offering an affordable alternative. Paris Corner's dedication to quality ensures that you receive a fragrance that matches the excellence of Montale's creation.</p>

<p>The unisex nature of this fragrance means that it can be shared and appreciated by anyone, regardless of gender. Its elegant simplicity makes it an ideal choice for those who appreciate the beauty of subtlety and the power of enduring scents.</p>

<p>In summary, Monster Rose Musk by Paris Corner is a long-lasting, unisex Eau de Parfum that celebrates the timeless elegance of Jasmine, Rose, and Musk. Its homage to Roses Musk by Montale, with its lasting power and affordable price point, makes it an enticing addition to any fragrance collection.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,80ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,5,deny,manual,1340.00,2000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Monster-rose-musk.png?v=1779878637,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,musky,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-monster-black-oud-80ml-edp,Paris Corner Monster Black Oud 80ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Monster Black Oud is an olfactory masterpiece that beckons the senses with its compelling blend of scents. A resolute and long-lasting perfume, it stands as a testament to the art of fragrance crafting.</p>

<p>At first whiff, the top notes of Mandarin and delicate Rose Petals dance in harmony, creating a bright and fresh opening that instantly captivates. This initial burst of citrus and floral notes invigorates the senses, setting the stage for what's to come.</p>

<p>As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes of Labdanum and Musk emerge, adding depth and sensuality. Labdanum, with its sweet, resinous aroma, provides a warm and slightly balsamic quality, while Musk lends a soft, animalic allure that lingers intriguingly on the skin.</p>

<p>The base notes, which are the soul of this fragrance, are dominated by the rich and enchanting Agarwood (Oud). This note infuses Monster Black Oud with an intense and dark character, creating an aura of mystery and sophistication that is characteristic of premium Oud-based perfumes.</p>

<p>Paris Corner Monster Black Oud is often compared to the renowned Black Aoud by Montale and for good reason. It captures the essence of the original, making it an exceptional Inspired that brings luxury and allure within reach. Whether you're attending a formal event or making a lasting impression during a casual outing, this fragrance ensures you leave an indelible mark.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Mandarin, rose petals<br>
Middle Notes: Labdanum, musk<br>
Base Notes: Agarwood</p>

<p>In an 80ml Eau de Parfum concentration, Monster Black Oud embodies power, elegance, and longevity. It's the olfactory statement for the confident and modern man who appreciates the allure of a classic and long-lasting fragrance.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,80ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1340.00,2000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Monster-black-oud.png?v=1779878637,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-rifaaqat-85ml-edp,Paris Corner Rifaaqat 85ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Rifaaqat for men is a captivating olfactory journey, a symphony of notes that weaves a tale of sophistication and allure. This fragrance is a testament to timeless masculinity, encapsulating a blend of spicy intensity and smooth sensuality that lingers throughout the day.</p>

<p>At the first whiff, the top notes of Black and Pink Pepper dance together, creating a vibrant and spicy opening. The fusion of elemi and additional Pink Pepper adds a layer of complexity, setting the stage for what's to come. The heart notes reveal a rich tapestry of Olibanum and Saffron, offering a warm and resinous core that adds depth and mystery to the composition.</p>

<p>As the fragrance unfolds, the base notes emerge, leaving an indelible impression. Bourbon Vanilla, with its sweet and creamy nuances, intertwines with the luxurious scent of suede and the woody elegance of Cedar. This combination creates a sensual and lasting dry down that is as memorable as it is sophisticated.</p>

<p>One of the outstanding features of Paris Corner Rifaaqat is its remarkable longevity. The fragrance is crafted to endure, providing an aromatic aura that accompanies you through the day and transitions seamlessly into the evening. The fusion of vanilla and leather notes contributes to this lasting power, making it a reliable companion for those who seek a fragrance that stands the test of time.</p>

<p>Top notes are Black and Pink Pepper, Black Pepper, elemi and Pink Pepper</p>

<p>Middle notes are Olibanum and Saffron</p>

<p>Base notes are Bourbon Vanilla, Suede and Cedar.</p>

<p>This olfactory masterpiece is not just a fragrance; it's an experience. Drawing inspiration from the esteemed Babycat by Yves Saint Laurent, Rifaaqat offers a more accessible alternative without compromising on quality. It captures the essence of luxury and exclusivity, allowing you to indulge in a world of refined elegance at a fraction of the cost. Paris Corner Rifaaqat is more than a scent; it's a statement of style, a fragrance that speaks volumes without uttering a word.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,85ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,2275.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/paris-corner-rifaaqat.png?v=1779878635,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-atomise-intensive-men-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Atomise Intensive Men 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Atomise Intensive Men 100ML EDP is an olfactory masterpiece designed for the modern man who seeks sophistication and charisma in every stride. This fragrance is a testament to timeless elegance and an olfactory journey that captivates the senses with its remarkable longevity.</p>

<p>Opening with a burst of freshness, the top notes unveil a symphony of Pear, Lavender, Mint, Bergamot, and Lemon. This invigorating blend sets the stage for a fragrance that is both vibrant and refined. As the scent evolves, the heart notes emerge, featuring a harmonious fusion of Cinnamon, Clary Sage, and Caraway. This aromatic core adds depth and complexity, creating an alluring aura around the wearer.</p>

<p>The base notes of Black Vanilla Husk, Amber, Patchouli, and Cedar anchor the fragrance in a sensuous and masculine embrace. The warm, woody undertones mingle with sweet vanilla and amber, leaving a lingering trail that is as memorable as it is irresistible.</p>

<p>What truly sets Emir Atomise Intensive Men apart is its extraordinary longevity. This Eau de Parfum is crafted to endure, ensuring that the captivating scent accompanies you throughout the day and well into the night. The seamless transition between the top, middle, and base notes creates a dynamic fragrance experience that evolves with the wearer, unveiling different facets of its character over time.</p>

<p>Top notes are Pear, Lavender, Mint, Bergamot and Lemon</p>

<p>Middle notes are Cinnamon, Clary Sage and Caraway</p>

<p>Base notes are Black Vanilla Husk, Amber, Patchouli and Cedar.</p>

<p>Notably, this perfume is renowned for being a remarkable alternative to the luxurious Ultra Male by Jean Paul Gaultier. It captures the essence of the original, offering a budget-friendly option without compromising on quality or intensity. Emir Atomise Intensive Men is more than a fragrance; it's a statement, an embodiment of sophistication that lingers in the memory long after the wearer has left.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1699.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-atomise-intensive-men.png?v=1779878634,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-vibrant-vetiver-delight-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Vibrant Vetiver Delight 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Vibrant Vetiver Delight 100ML Eau de Parfum for men is an olfactory masterpiece that captivates the senses with its enduring allure. This fragrance is renowned for its exceptional longevity, ensuring that its wearer is embraced by its distinct aroma throughout the day and into the night.</p>

<p>At the top notes, a symphony of invigorating scents unfolds. The infusion of Amalfi Lemon provides a citrusy brightness, harmonizing with the floral tones of Tagetes, Black Currant, and the timeless elegance of Bergamot. The essence of African Orange Flower adds a touch of exotic allure, creating an initial burst that is both refreshing and captivating.</p>

<p>As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes reveal a delicate and sophisticated blend. Violet, Cyclamen, and Jasmine intertwine to form a floral bouquet that adds depth and complexity. This medley of middle notes brings a subtle sweetness and a touch of floral elegance to the composition.</p>

<p>The base notes of Paris Corner Emir Vibrant Vetiver Delight anchor the fragrance with a sense of earthy warmth and sensuality. Vetiver, a key player in this symphony, combines with the rich and resinous notes of Amber and the timeless allure of Musk. Virginia Cedar adds a woody undertone, creating a solid foundation that lingers on the skin.</p>

<p>Top: Amalfi Lemon, Tagetes, Black Currant, Bergamot and African Orange flower</p>

<p>Middle: Violet, Cyclamen and Jasmine</p>

<p>Base: Vetiver, Amber, Musk and Virginia Cedar</p>

<p>This fragrance is celebrated not only for its unique and alluring composition but also for its remarkable resemblance to the luxurious Bal d'Afrique by Byredo. Emir Vibrant Vetiver Delight stands as a budget-friendly alternative, allowing individuals to indulge in the opulence of a high-end fragrance without compromising on quality. Immerse yourself in the rich and enduring scent of Paris Corner Emir Vibrant Vetiver Delight, an olfactory journey that echoes sophistication and luxury.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1730.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Vibrant-Vetiver-Delight.png?v=1779878633,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-barcode-signature-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Barcode Signature 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Barcode Signature, a captivating olfactory journey encapsulated in a 100ml Eau de Parfum designed for men who appreciate the artistry of fragrance. This scent is not merely a fleeting experience; it is an enduring symphony that resonates throughout the day, boasting an impressive longevity that sets it apart in the realm of perfumery.</p>

<p>At the pinnacle of this aromatic composition are the invigorating top notes of Bergamot, Mandarin, and Neroli. The citrusy burst of Bergamot dances harmoniously with the zesty allure of Mandarin, while Neroli adds a touch of floral sophistication, creating an initial impression that is both refreshing and refined.</p>

<p>As the fragrance unfolds, the heart reveals a nuanced blend of Green Tea and Blackcurrant. The earthy, slightly bitter nuances of Green Tea interlace seamlessly with the sweet and tangy essence of Blackcurrant, establishing a magnetic core that draws you into its verdant embrace.</p>

<p>The foundation of Barcode Signature rests upon a solid base of Musk and Sandalwood, providing a warm and sensual trail that lingers on the skin. Musk imparts a subtle animalic allure, adding depth to the composition, while the creamy, woody notes of Sandalwood contribute a touch of luxury and sophistication.</p>

<p>Top notes: Bergamot, mandarin and neroli</p>

<p>Middle notes: Green tea and blackcurrant</p>

<p>Base notes: Musk and sandalwood</p>

<p>What makes Barcode Signature truly noteworthy is its distinguished resemblance to the renowned Silver Mountain Water by Creed. This budget-friendly alternative captures the essence of the opulent original, offering a compelling option for those who seek a high-quality fragrance without the exorbitant price tag.</p>

<p>In essence, Paris Corner Barcode Signature is not just a perfume; it's an olfactory masterpiece that accompanies you throughout the day, leaving an indelible mark of sophistication and style. Elevate your presence with this exquisite blend that seamlessly marries longevity, affordability, and a captivating aroma inspired by the timeless allure of Silver Mountain Water.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1345.00,2999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Barcode-Signature.png?v=1779878633,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,musk; sandalwood,,,,,,,,,,,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,,,green-tea; black-currant,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,bergamot; mandarin; neroli,,,for-men,,'1,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-magic-oud-sandal-wood-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Magic Oud Sandal Wood 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner's Magic Oud Sandal Wood Eau de Parfum for men is an olfactory masterpiece that weaves an enchanting tale of opulence and sophistication. This 100ML fragrance is not just a scent; it's an experience, a journey through layers of aromatic excellence.</p>

<p>The top notes of Neroli and Jasmine greet your senses with a burst of floral freshness, setting the stage for the luxurious symphony that follows. As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes unfold, revealing a captivating blend of Peach, Rose, and Cinnamon. This combination adds a sensual warmth to the composition, creating an alluring and inviting aura.</p>

