paris-corner-killer-oud-revolution-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Killer Oud Revolution 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Killer Oud Revolution, a captivating 100ml Eau de Parfum for men that transcends the ordinary, leaving an indelible mark with its intense and enduring fragrance. This scent is more than a perfume; it's a journey into the realms of sophistication and masculinity.</p>

