paris-corner-killer-oud-lyre-intense-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Killer Oud Lyre Intense 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Killer Oud Lyre Intense, a captivating olfactory experience for the discerning man who appreciates the allure of mystique and luxury. This 100ml Eau de Parfum is more than just a fragrance; it's an embodiment of timeless elegance and sophistication.</p>

