paris-corner-killer-oud-midnight-ecstasy-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Killer Oud Midnight Ecstasy 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Killer Oud Midnight Ecstasy is an olfactory masterpiece designed for the modern man who seeks an enduring scent that mirrors sophistication and luxury. This 100ml Eau de Parfum is more than a fragrance; it's an aromatic journey that captivates the senses and leaves an indelible impression.</p>

