paris-corner-killer-oud-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Killer Oud 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Killer Oud is a 100ml Eau de Parfum crafted for the modern man who appreciates sophistication and allure in a fragrance. This olfactory masterpiece is renowned for its exceptional longevity, ensuring that the wearer is enveloped in its captivating aura throughout the day and well into the night.</p>

<p>At the initial spritz, the fragrance opens with a burst of freshness from the top notes, where the zesty notes of Bergamot seamlessly blend with the warmth of Allspice and the herbal allure of Oregano. This dynamic combination sets the stage for an olfactory journey that is both invigorating and mysterious.</p>

<p>As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes unfold, revealing a rich tapestry of scents. Opoponax, Incense, Amber, and Labdanum come together to create a complex and alluring bouquet. The resinous sweetness of Opoponax dances with the ancient charm of Incense, while Amber and Labdanum add depth and warmth, creating a scent profile that is both intriguing and sophisticated.</p>

<p>The journey concludes with the lingering base notes, leaving an indelible impression. Sandalwood and Patchouli provide an earthy foundation, while Leather and Oud infuse an exotic and sensuous quality. The inclusion of Oud, a highly prized and rare ingredient, adds a touch of opulence, making this fragrance truly distinctive.</p>

<p>Paris Corner Killer Oud is celebrated not just for its captivating scent but also for being a remarkable Inspired of the prestigious Interlude Man by Amouage. This budget-friendly alternative allows individuals to experience the luxury and grandeur associated with Interlude Man without compromising on quality. Embrace the mystique and allure of Paris Corner Killer Oud, a fragrance that leaves an unforgettable trail of sophistication and masculinity.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,5,deny,manual,1949.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Killer-Oud.png?v=1779878628,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-killer-oud-death-by-oud-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Killer Oud Death By Oud 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner presents the epitome of opulence with its Killer Oud Death By Oud, a 100ml Eau de Parfum designed exclusively for men. This olfactory masterpiece is not merely a fragrance; it's an experience that defies time with its extraordinary longevity. Crafted to leave an enduring impression, Killer Oud stands as a testament to the brand's commitment to luxury and sophistication.</p>

<p>Opening with an invigorating burst, the top notes of Grapefruit and Lavender dance together in perfect harmony. The citrusy vibrancy of Grapefruit intertwines seamlessly with the calming essence of Lavender, creating an initial impression that is both refreshing and refined. As the fragrance evolves, the heart reveals a captivating blend of Tobacco, Spices, and Leather. This dynamic combination exudes masculinity, evoking an air of mystery and allure.</p>

<p>However, it's the base notes that truly make Killer Oud Death By Oud an olfactory journey to remember. The rich, resinous depth of Amber merges with the rare and exotic Oud, creating a lingering trail that is both captivating and seductive. This fragrance pays homage to the traditions of perfumery by incorporating the timeless allure of Oud, a note revered for its complexity and depth.</p>

<p>What sets Killer Oud apart is its uncanny resemblance to the revered Oud Malaki by Chopard, a fragrance known for its exclusivity and prestige. Paris Corner has masterfully crafted a more accessible alternative without compromising on the essence of sophistication and luxury. This makes Killer Oud Death By Oud not only a superb fragrance for those who appreciate enduring, captivating scents but also an intelligent choice for those seeking the allure of a high-end classic at a more budget-friendly price point. Unleash the power of Killer Oud, and let the scent speak volumes about your style and sophistication.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,1999.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Killer-Oud-Death-By-Oud.png?v=1779878627,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-killer-oud-ethic-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Killer Oud Ethic 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Killer Oud Ethic, a 100ml Eau de Parfum designed for men who appreciate the allure of mystery and the power of a lasting impression. This olfactory masterpiece promises an enduring fragrance experience, ensuring you leave an indelible mark wherever you go.</p>

<p>At the first whiff, the top notes unfold a captivating blend of Frankincense, Pink Pepper, Cardamom, Saffron, Nutmeg, Cumin, Mace, Red Berries, and Myrtle. This symphony of spicy and aromatic elements sets the stage for a fragrance that is both bold and enigmatic. As the scent develops, the heart notes reveal Myrrh and Geranium, adding a touch of floral warmth to the composition.</p>

<p>The base notes, where the true essence of longevity resides, boast a rich and complex blend of Castoreum, Musk, Sandalwood, Cedarwood, Frankincense, Patchouli, Oud, and Leather. This robust foundation not only ensures an extended wear time but also imparts a deep and sophisticated character to the fragrance.</p>

