<p>In every spritz, Killer Oud Ethic unveils a story of refinement and allure, making it an indispensable companion for the modern man who seeks to make a lasting statement. Elevate your fragrance game with this captivating blend that marries tradition with contemporary elegance, leaving an olfactory trail that echoes in the memories of those you encounter.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1949.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/killer-oud-ethic.png?v=1779878626,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-killer-oud-cabana-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Killer Oud Cabana 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner's Killer Oud Cabana 100ml Eau de Parfum for men is a luxurious olfactory experience designed for those who appreciate a scent that transcends time. This fragrance is renowned for its exceptional longevity, ensuring that the captivating essence lingers throughout the day, leaving an indelible impression.</p>

<p>The top notes of Orange Blossom, Galbanum, and Mint combine to create an invigorating and fresh introduction that immediately captures attention. As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes of Vetiver, Moss, and Ivy take center stage, providing a green and earthy complexity that adds depth and sophistication to the composition.</p>

