<p>What makes Killer Oud Cabana truly exceptional is its undeniable resemblance to the highly coveted Beach Hut Man by Amouage. This fragrance serves as an excellent and budget-friendly alternative, allowing individuals to indulge in the opulence of a renowned scent without the exorbitant price tag.</p>

<p>The artful combination of notes in Killer Oud Cabana not only mirrors the richness of Beach Hut Man but also adds a unique touch, making it a distinctive fragrance in its own right. The interplay of citrus, green, and woody elements in this olfactory masterpiece ensures that every spritz is a journey to a sun-soaked paradise, making it an ideal choice for those who seek sophistication and longevity in their fragrance. Embrace the allure of Killer Oud Cabana, a scent that transcends time and captivates the senses with its harmonious blend of notes.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1949.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/killer-oud-cabana.png?v=1779878625,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-emir-elania-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Elania 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner's Emir Elania for Women is a captivating olfactory symphony that enchants the senses with its exquisite blend of notes, creating a fragrance that is both enduring and alluring. This 100ML Eau de Parfum is a testament to sophistication and allure, designed for the modern woman who seeks a scent as unique as she is.</p>

<p>The fragrance opens with a burst of freshness from top notes that include Litchi, Rhubarb, Bergamot, and Nutmeg. This initial olfactory experience is a dance of sweet and spicy, setting the stage for what unfolds. The heart of Emir Elania reveals a floral masterpiece, with Turkish Rose and Peony embracing the senses. Musk adds a touch of sensuality, while Petalia and Vanilla contribute a creamy sweetness that lingers delicately.</p>

<p>As the fragrance settles into its base notes, Emir Elania unveils a rich and grounding essence. Cashmeran provides warmth and depth, complemented by the woody allure of Cedar and the earthy sophistication of Haitian Vetiver. The final touch comes from the lingering tendrils of Incense, leaving a trace of mystery and seduction.</p>

<p>What makes Emir Elania truly remarkable is its exceptional longevity. This Eau de Parfum is crafted to be a steadfast companion, accompanying you throughout the day and into the night with its enduring allure. It stands out as a remarkable alternative to the renowned Delina by Parfums de Marly, offering a luxurious experience at a more accessible price point.</p>

<p>In every spritz, Emir Elania captures the essence of timeless elegance, making it an indispensable addition to the fragrance collection of the discerning woman who appreciates sophistication and enduring beauty.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1730.00,2999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Elania.png?v=1779878624,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-killer-oud-overdose-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Killer Oud Overdose 100ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Killer Oud Overdose 100ml EDP Perfume: Unleash the Power of Seduction</p>

<p>Prepare to embark on an olfactory journey like no other with Paris Corner Killer Oud Overdose, a tantalizing fragrance crafted exclusively for men. This 100ml Eau De Parfum is a testament to the allure of sophistication and masculinity, capturing the essence of refined elegance with every spritz.</p>

<p>🔥 Intoxicating Fragrance Notes: Indulge your senses as the layers of this mesmerizing scent unfold, revealing a symphony of captivating notes that tantalize the senses and leave a lasting impression.</p>

<p>Top Notes: A dynamic blend of cognac, cumin, cardamom, nutmeg, saffron, grapefruit, and ginger sets the stage for an explosive opening. This fusion of spices and citrus creates an invigorating burst that commands attention from the very first sniff.<br>
Middle Notes: The heart of Killer Oud Overdose unveils a rich and complex bouquet, featuring myrrh, labdanum, cinnamon, benzoin, mastic, patchouli, and geranium. These aromatic ingredients intertwine to create a warm and inviting core, exuding an air of sophistication and allure.<br>
Base Notes: As the fragrance settles, it leaves a lingering trail of sensuality with its base notes of animalic nuances, smoke, incense, sandalwood, leather, and clary sage. This seductive blend adds depth and complexity, ensuring an unforgettable olfactory experience that resonates long after the initial application.</p>

<p>A Fragrance for the Modern Gentleman: Paris Corner Killer Oud Overdose is more than just a perfume; it's a statement of confidence and refinement. Perfect for the modern gentleman who exudes charisma and sophistication, this fragrance is the ultimate accessory for any occasion.</p>

