paris-corner-emir-cherry-cola-75ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Cherry Cola 75ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Cherry Cola 75ML EDP: A Fusion of Sensuality and Playfulness for Men and Women</p>

<p>Embark on a tantalizing olfactory journey with Paris Corner Emir Cherry Cola, a captivating fragrance that transcends traditional boundaries. Blending the realms of masculinity and femininity, this 75ML Eau De Parfum celebrates the spirit of individuality and bold expression.</p>

