paris-corner-emir-frenetic-delicieuse-80ml-edp,Paris Corner Emir Frenetic Delicieuse 80ml EDP,"<p>Paris Corner Emir Frenetic Delicieuse 80ml EDP: A Unisex Ode to Exquisite Luxury</p>

<p>Embark on a sensory journey like no other with Paris Corner Emir Frenetic Delicieuse, an 80ml Eau De Parfum designed to captivate both men and women. This fragrance masterpiece echoes the essence of sophistication and opulence, drawing inspiration from the iconic Fève Délicieuse by Dior, yet offered at a fraction of the cost.</p>

