<p>🌹 A Tribute to Dior's Fève Délicieuse: Paris Corner Emir Frenetic Delicieuse pays homage to the renowned Fève Délicieuse by Dior, offering a comparable experience at an accessible price point. Immerse yourself in the same intoxicating aroma of sophistication and refinement, now within reach.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,80ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,1730.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-Emir-Frenetic-Delicieuse.png?v=1779878621,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
