paris-corner-blend-afgano-80ml-edp,Paris Corner Blend Afgano 80ml EDP,"<p><strong>Paris Corner Blend Afgano 80ml Eau De Parfum – Dark Smoky Luxury with Rich Woody Depth</strong> ✨</p>
