paris-corner-prive-zarah-ombre-de-louis-70ml-extrait-de-parfum,Paris Corner Prive Zarah Ombre De Louis 70ml Extrait De Parfum,"<p>Paris Corner Prive Zarah Ombre De Louis 70ml Extrait De Perfume: Embrace Timeless Elegance and Irresistible Longevity 🌟</p>

<p>Step into a world of refined masculinity and enduring allure with Paris Corner Prive Zarah Ombre De Louis, a distinguished fragrance crafted for the discerning gentleman. Made in the UAE, this 70ml Extrait De Perfume embodies sophistication and luxury, exuding an aura of confidence that leaves a lasting impression.</p>

<p>💫 Unveiling the Enchanting Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Agarwood (Oud): The essence of luxury, agarwood, sets the stage with its rich, woody aroma, captivating the senses and evoking a sense of opulence.<br>
Incense: A touch of mystique and spirituality, incense infuses the composition with depth and intrigue, adding an ethereal quality to the fragrance.<br>
Rose: Delicate yet powerful, rose petals lend a floral elegance, balancing the robustness of the other notes with a subtle sweetness.<br>
Raspberry: Juicy and vibrant, raspberry adds a fruity twist, injecting a burst of energy and freshness into the blend.<br>
Saffron: Exotic and aromatic, saffron contributes a spicy complexity, enhancing the overall richness of the fragrance.<br>
Amberwood: Warm and inviting, amberwood provides a solid foundation, exuding a comforting sensuality that lingers on the skin.<br>
Birch: Earthy and smoky, birch leaves a trail of masculine sophistication, adding a touch of ruggedness to the composition.<br>
Benzoin: Sweet and resinous, benzoin lends a comforting warmth, enveloping the wearer in a cocoon of indulgent luxury.<br>
Geranium: Crisp and green, geranium adds a fresh, herbal dimension, infusing the fragrance with vitality and brightness.</p>

