paris-corner-minya-caramel-dulce-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Minya Caramel Dulce 100ml EDP,"Paris Corner Minya Caramel Dulce – A Delicious Symphony of Sweetness, Warmth &amp; Gourmand Luxury 🍯🍫100ml Eau de Parfum for Women
