Middle Notes: Chestnut, Benzoin, ChocolateAs the fragrance evolves, the heart reveals a rich blend of roasted chestnut and golden benzoin, adding warmth and depth. A drizzle of smooth chocolate melts into the composition, creating a comforting and indulgent atmosphere that feels like a caramel-dipped embrace. 🌰🍫
