paris-corner-december-ambar-85ml-edp,Paris Corner December Ambar 85ml EDP,"Paris Corner December Ambar 85ml EDP – A Cozy Fusion of Warmth &amp; Elegance 🍏✨

Paris Corner December Ambar is a unisex Eau de Parfum that beautifully balances festive vibrance with deep, inviting warmth — perfect for the cooler months, evening gatherings, and moments when you want to leave a lasting impression. This scent opens with a bright, intriguing blend that quickly settles into an elegantly rich heart, before resting on a soft and addictive amber-gourmand base that wraps you in a comforting embrace.

Fragrance Notes

✨ Top Notes: Apple, Anise, Coconut
A fresh and crisp opening greets the senses with juicy apple and creamy coconut, while the subtle spice of anise adds a unique twist — bright, playful, and instantly captivating.

🌹 Middle Notes: Saffron, Rose, Plum
The heart unfolds with luxurious floral and fruity facets — exotic saffron and velvety rose mingle with succulent plum to deliver a rich and sophisticated character that feels both comforting and unforgettable.

🔥 Base Notes: Benzoin, Amber, Anise, Cedarwood, Vanilla, Caramel, Moss
A warm and indulgent base of amber, vanilla, caramel, and benzoin creates a luscious, golden trail. Cedarwood and moss add earthy depth, while a whisper of anise ties back to the top for a beautifully cohesive finish.

Paris Corner December Ambar is the perfect choice for cool evenings, romantic dinners, festive events, or anytime you want a scent that’s both cozy and classy. Its comforting amber-gourmand heart makes it especially inviting and wonderfully versatile across genders. 🌟✨",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,85ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,2199.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Paris-Corner-December-Ambar.png?v=1779878492,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-qissa-gala-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Qissa Gala 100ml EDP,"Paris Corner Qissa Gala 100ml EDP For Women – A Story of Grace &amp; Indulgence 🌸✨Feminine • Elegant • Long-Lasting
Paris Corner Qissa Gala is a beautifully composed fragrance that celebrates soft femininity wrapped in creamy sweetness. Floral, slightly gourmand, and effortlessly elegant, this scent feels romantic yet comforting—perfect for women who enjoy graceful fragrances with a modern, sweet touch.

Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Gardenia, Violet Leaf, Ylang-Ylang, Almond 🌼🌿The opening is smooth and inviting. Creamy almond blends with lush gardenia and exotic ylang-ylang, while violet leaf adds a fresh green nuance, creating a soft and elegant first impression.
Middle Notes: Tuberose, Lily of the Valley, Coconut, Plum 🌸🥥At the heart, rich white florals bloom beautifully. Tuberose adds depth and sensuality, lily-of-the-valley brings freshness, while coconut and plum introduce a creamy, fruity sweetness that feels indulgent yet balanced.
Base Notes: Musk, Vanilla, Sweet Notes, Moss 🤍🌙The base is warm and comforting. Smooth vanilla and sweet notes melt into clean musk, while moss adds a subtle earthy touch, leaving a soft, long-lasting, and elegant trail.
Perfect for daily wear, brunch dates, evenings, and special occasions, Qissa Gala is ideal for lovers of floral-gourmand fragrances with a creamy and feminine character.
✨ Delicate yet captivating, Paris Corner Qissa Gala tells a fragrance story filled with charm, warmth, and timeless beauty.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,2199.00,2200.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Qissa-Gala.png?v=1779878491,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
paris-corner-cosmic-giardino-100ml-edp,Paris Corner Cosmic Giardino 100ml EDP,"Paris Corner Cosmic Giardino 100ml EDP for Men &amp; Women – A Tropical Expression of Modern Elegance ✨
Paris Corner Cosmic Giardino is a unisex Eau de Parfum that beautifully blends sun-kissed freshness with smooth, contemporary sophistication. Inspired by Le Beau Paradise Garden by Jean Paul Gaultier, this fragrance opens with a refreshing tropical brightness, moves into a soft aromatic-floral heart, and settles into a warm, sensual base that feels both relaxed and refined. It’s an ideal choice for daytime wear, holidays, casual evenings, and moments when you want a scent that’s fresh yet confidently stylish.
Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Fig, Coconut &amp; Sea Salt 🥥🌿The opening is creamy and airy, with juicy fig adding a green sweetness, coconut bringing smooth tropical richness, and sea salt creating a clean, breezy freshness that instantly feels uplifting and modern.
Middle Notes: Lavender, Violet &amp; Geranium 🌸At the heart, aromatic lavender blends with soft violet and fresh geranium. This layer adds elegance and balance, giving the fragrance a refined unisex character that feels calm, smooth, and effortlessly wearable.
Base Notes: Tonka Bean, Sandalwood &amp; Ambroxan 🌿The dry-down is warm and addictive. Tonka bean adds gentle sweetness, sandalwood delivers creamy woods, and ambroxan provides a modern amber-musky depth with excellent longevity.
Paris Corner Cosmic Giardino is perfect for those who love fresh tropical openings, elegant aromatic hearts, and a cozy yet modern base—an easygoing yet sophisticated scent that transitions beautifully from day to night.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Paris Corner",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,2399.00,3499.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/PARIS-CORNER-Cosmic-Giardino.png?v=1779878489,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
