maison-alhambra-exclusif-rose-100ml-edp,Maison Alhambra Exclusif Rose 100ml EDP,"<p>Maison Alhambra Exclusif Rose is a Floral Fruity musky fragrance for Women and Men. Its a great Inspired of Burning Rose Carolina Herrera.</p>

<p>The elegant beauty Exclusif Rose opens with fruity accords that ring out slightly bitter bergamot with a citrus wave, the crisp freshness of green pear and the exotic, sweet and sour lychee.</p>

<p>The onset of lovely flowers begins with a fresh floral fantasy on peony petals, a velvety fruity Bulgarian rose and a Turkish rose with a fresh chypre undertone, whose greenery is enveloped by a vanilla aria.</p>

