maison-alhambra-amber-and-leather-100ml-edp,Maison Alhambra Amber And Leather 100ml EDP,"Maison Alhambra Opulence Leather (formerly Amber and Leather) 100ml EDP for Men – Unleash Bold Elegance 🌟

Experience luxury without compromise with Maison Alhambra Opulence Leather, a high-quality, rich-smelling fragrance crafted in the UAE. Known as the best budget Inspired of Tom Ford’s Ombre Leather, this scent offers a sophisticated blend of leather and spice, perfect for men who value elegance and refinement.

Fragrance Notes:

Top Note: Cardamom
(A warm, spicy opening that immediately captivates and intrigues.)
Middle Notes: Jasmine Sambac, Leather
(The heart of the fragrance, blending rich floral and bold leather accords for a daring, masculine appeal.)
Base Notes: Patchouli, Moss &amp; Amber
(A deep, earthy finish with touches of warmth and sensuality, leaving a long-lasting impression.)

The brand recently updated the name from Amber and Leather to Opulence Leather, but rest assured—the fragrance, quality, and presentation remain unchanged. This Maison Alhambra masterpiece offers a true-to-luxury scent experience with exceptional longevity, making it ideal for those who want the allure of Tom Ford’s iconic fragrance at an affordable price. Embrace sophistication and rugged charm with Opulence Leather, a fragrance that effortlessly combines style and depth.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Maison Alhambra",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,1699.00,2200.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-Opulence-Leather.png?v=1779878465,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
