maison-alhambra-jorge-di-profondo-100ml-edp,Maison Alhambra Jorge Di Profondo 100ml EDP,"Maison Alhambra Jorge Di Profumo Deep Blue 100ML EDP – Dive into Deep Blue Freshness 🌊

Note: Recently rebranded from Jorge Di Profundo to Jorge Di Profumo Deep Blue, this fragrance offers the same premium quality and elegant packaging. If you order Profundo, you’ll receive Profumo Deep Blue without any compromise in quality.

Experience the powerful allure of Maison Alhambra Jorge Di Profumo Deep Blue, a high-quality, rich-smelling fragrance crafted in the UAE. This aromatic fougère is designed for men who appreciate depth and sophistication.

Fragrance Notes:

Top Notes: Bergamot, Sicilian Lemon &amp; Black Pepper
(A vibrant, zesty opening with a hint of spice, evoking a fresh sea breeze.)
Heart Notes: Lavender, Tobacco &amp; Geranium
(An aromatic blend that adds warmth and complexity, perfect for a masculine edge.)
Base Notes: Sandalwood, Musk &amp; Vetiver
(A rich, earthy base that lingers, providing depth and longevity.)

As the best Inspired of Acqua di Giò Profondo by Giorgio Armani, this scent combines fresh citrus with warm, woody accords, making it perfect for any occasion. The long-lasting performance and refined blend of notes ensure you carry an air of confidence and sophistication all day. Embrace the essence of the deep blue sea with Jorge Di Profumo Deep Blue!",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Maison De Profumo",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1599.00,2200.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-Jorge-Di-Profumo-Deep-Blue_cf57a92f-4b6a-4a48-979f-d4b6b2cc446c.png?v=1779879873,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,'2,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
maison-alhambra-jubilant-rose-100ml-edp,Maison Alhambra Jubilant Rose 100ml EDP,"<p>Maison Alhambra Jubilant Rose 100ml EDP For Women – The Essence of Timeless Elegance 🌹</p>

<p>Introducing Maison Alhambra Jubilant Rose, formerly known as Versencia Crystal—though the name has changed, the luxurious quality and exquisite presentation remain the same. Made in the UAE, this high-quality, rich-smelling fragrance captures the spirit of elegance and sophistication, offering a beautifully balanced scent profile reminiscent of the celebrity favorite Bright Crystal by Versace.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Yuzu, Ice Accord, Pomegranate<br>
(A refreshing, icy burst with a hint of fruity sweetness to captivate the senses.)<br>
Middle Notes: Acajou, Plant Amber, Musk<br>
(Warm and sensual, adding depth and smoothness to the fragrance.)<br>
Base Notes: Peony, Magnolia, Lotus Flower<br>
(Soft and floral, creating a graceful and feminine finish.)</p>

<p>Maison Alhambra Jubilant Rose is a versatile fragrance suited to all-weather wear, making it perfect for any season. With its radiant floral and fresh notes, it’s ideal for both day and evening occasions, enveloping you in a soft yet long-lasting aroma. Embrace the charm and sophistication of Jubilant Rose—a scent that leaves a memorable impression everywhere you go.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Maison Alhambra",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,5,deny,manual,1499.00,2200.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Versencia-Crystal-Maison-Alhambra-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878459,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
