maison-alhambra-tux-90ml-edp,Maison Alhambra Tux 90ml EDP,"<p>Note : Brand has changed the name from TUX to WINSOME , but quality of the product remains same.</p>

<p>Maison Alhambra Tux 90ML EDP for Men, a captivating olfactory masterpiece that unveils an aura of timeless sophistication and rugged charm. This fragrance is a symphony of alluring notes, meticulously crafted to resonate with the modern man's distinct taste and personality. Inspired of Tuxedo by Yves Saint Laurent.</p>

<p>Maison Alhambra Tux opens with an invigorating burst of freshness, as the interplay of Violet Leaf Accord, Bergamot Oil, and Coriander Seeds oil infuses the composition with an energetic vibrancy. These top notes immediately draw you in with their crisp and invigorating facets, setting the stage for an olfactory journey unlike any other.</p>

<p>The heart of this fragrance is a harmonious blend of elegance and intensity. Rose Oil and Lily Of The Valley Accord intertwine, exuding a refined floral elegance that's balanced by the captivating allure of Black Pepper Oil. This heart note combination adds depth and complexity to the composition, revealing different facets with every wear.</p>

<p>What truly sets Maison Alhambra Tux apart is its base notes, a seductive and comforting symphony that lingers on the skin for hours. The warm embrace of Ambergris Accord is juxtaposed with the earthy richness of Patchouli Heart, creating a dynamic interplay that's both alluring and grounded. The scent experience reaches its crescendo with the enveloping sweetness of Vanilla Bourbon, leaving an indelible impression that lasts long after the first application.</p>

<p>For those who find solace in the intoxicating aroma of coffee, Maison Alhambra Tux is a revelation. This long-lasting perfume weaves a subtle thread of coffee-like richness throughout its composition, adding a unique and irresistible dimension to the fragrance. It's a scent that speaks of confidence, refinement, and a taste for the finer things in life.</p>

<p>Maison Alhambra Tux 90ML EDP for Men is more than a fragrance; it's an embodiment of masculinity, sophistication, and the power of scent to evoke emotions and memories. With its intricate blend of notes and its remarkable longevity, it's poised to become an essential addition to any connoisseur's collection.</p>

<p>Top Notes -Violet Leaf Accord, Bergamot Oil, Coriander Seeds oil<br>
Heart Notes - Rose Oil, Lily Of The Valley Accord, Black Pepper Oil<br>
Base Notes - Ambergris Accord, Patchouli Heart, Vanilla Bourbon</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Maison Alhambra",true,Size,90ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,16,deny,manual,2725.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-Tux-90ML-EDP.png?v=1779878402,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
maison-alhambra-narissa-ambre-100ml-edp,Maison Alhambra Narissa Ambre 100ml EDP,"<p>Narissa Ambre Maison Alhambra 100ML Eau de Parfum is a luxurious and enduring fragrance designed for the modern woman who exudes sophistication and grace. This exquisite perfume offers a captivating olfactory journey that lingers throughout the day and into the night, making it the perfect choice for those who seek a long-lasting, alluring scent.</p>

<p>At the top, you'll be greeted by a delightful blend of Frangipani, Ylang-Ylang, and White Flowers. These floral notes open the scent with a delicate and enchanting sweetness, evoking the sensation of walking through a blossoming garden in the early morning.</p>

<p>As the fragrance unfolds, the heart reveals a harmonious duet of Musk and Amber, adding depth and sensuality to the composition. These middle notes create a warm and inviting aura that draws people closer, leaving an indelible impression.</p>

<p>The base notes of Cashmeran, Vanilla, and Cedar provide a solid foundation for Narissa Ambre Maison Alhambra. They lend an elegant and woody dimension to the scent, leaving a trail of sophistication in your wake.</p>

<p>This fragrance, inspired by Narciso Eau de Parfum Ambrée by Narciso Rodriguez, is a remarkable Inspired that captures the essence of the original with remarkable precision. It exudes the same magnetic charm and sensuous allure, making it a perfect choice for those who appreciate the exquisite subtleties of amber floral fragrances. Narissa Ambre Maison Alhambra is an invitation to embrace your inner allure and leave a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>Top notes are Frangipani, Ylang-Ylang and White Flowers</p>

<p>Middle notes are Musk and Amber</p>

<p>Base notes are Cashmeran, Vanilla and Cedar</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Maison Alhambra",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1399.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Narissa-Ambre-Maison-Alhambra-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878401,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
maison-alhambra-floral-bloom-100ml-edp,Maison Alhambra Floral Bloom 100ml EDP,"<p>Floral Bloom Maison Alhambra, a 100ml Eau de Parfum that embodies timeless elegance and floral opulence. Crafted for the modern woman who seeks both longevity and beauty in her scent, this fragrance is an olfactory masterpiece. Renowned perfumer Alberto Morillas, the genius behind many iconic scents, has artfully blended a bouquet of exquisite notes to create a fragrance that lingers on your skin throughout the day.</p>

<p>At the heart of Floral Bloom Maison Alhambra is the enchanting jasmine, a symbol of femininity and grace. Its intoxicating aroma dances on your skin, captivating your senses with its sweet, floral allure. As the fragrance unfolds, the velvety tuberose emerges, adding depth and sensuality to the composition. Finally, the base note of Rangoon Creeper weaves a unique, exotic twist, leaving an indelible impression that is both captivating and mysterious.</p>

<p>What sets Floral Bloom Maison Alhambra apart is its remarkable longevity. This perfume is designed to accompany you from dawn to dusk, its fragrance evolving beautifully over time. With just a few spritzes, you'll embark on a sensory journey that mirrors the changing facets of a blooming flower.</p>

<p>For those who appreciate timeless elegance and the allure of florals, Floral Bloom Maison Alhambra is the perfect choice. It embodies the essence of femininity and is ideal for any occasion, from casual outings to formal events. This fragrance is a homage to the classic Gucci Bloom, designed to captivate the senses and leave an unforgettable impression. Indulge in the beauty of Floral Bloom Maison Alhambra and embrace the essence of floral luxury.</p>

<p>Top note is Jasmine</p>

<p>Middle note is Tuberose</p>

<p>Base note is Rangoon Creeper.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Maison Alhambra",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1399.00,2200.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Floral-Bloom-Maison-Alhambra-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878400,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,floral,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
maison-alhambra-cassius-100ml-edp,Maison Alhambra Cassius 100ml EDP,"<p>Maison Alhambra presents Cassius, a 100ML Eau de Parfum for men that embodies timeless sophistication and magnetic charm. Cassius is more than just a fragrance; it's a symphony of scents that leaves a lasting impression, making it the perfect choice for the modern man seeking distinction and allure.</p>

<p>Cassius opens with a captivating burst of Nutmeg, Green Apple, and Saffron. This initial olfactory journey is a tantalizing invitation to a world of elegance and charisma. As the scent unfolds, the heart notes emerge, revealing a harmonious blend of Tonka Bean, Rose, Osmanthus, and Davana. These floral and fruity elements add depth and complexity, evoking a sense of refinement that lingers in the air.</p>

<p>What truly sets Cassius apart is its remarkable longevity. This fragrance is designed to endure, accompanying you throughout the day and into the night, making it perfect for any occasion.</p>

<p>As Cassius dries down, it leaves a mesmerizing trail of Patchouli, Vanilla, and Opoponax in its wake. These base notes contribute to the fragrance's depth and sensuality, leaving an indelible mark wherever you go.</p>

<p>Top notes are Nutmeg, Green Apple and Saffron</p>

<p>Middle notes are Tonka Bean, Rose, Osmanthus and Davana</p>

<p>Base notes are Patchouli, Vanilla and Opoponax.</p>

<p>Cassius is more than a scent; it's an experience. It's a great alternative for those who appreciate the opulence of Carlisle by Parfums de Marly but seek a budget-friendly option. With its longevity, unique blend of notes, and magnetic aura, Cassius by Maison Alhambra is a must-have for the modern man who aspires to make a lasting impression wherever he ventures. Choose Cassius and embrace the art of alluring distinction.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Maison Alhambra",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1349.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-Cassius-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878399,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
maison-alhambra-b-a-d-femme-100ml-edp,Maison Alhambra B.A.D Femme 100ml EDP,"<p>Maison Alhambra B.A.D Femme, a captivating 100ml Eau de Parfum designed for men with a penchant for luxury and sensuality. This fragrance is a remarkable olfactory experience, reminiscent of the iconic Good Girl by Carolina Herrera, reimagined for the modern man. It's an enchanting blend that balances the contrasting elements of sweetness and spiciness, making it the perfect signature scent for the confident and sophisticated individual.</p>

<p>Top notes are Almond, Coffee, Bergamot and Lemon</p>

<p>Middle notes are Tuberose, Jasmine Sambac, Orange Blossom, Orris and Bulgarian Rose</p>

<p>Base notes are Tonka Bean, Cacao, Vanilla, Praline, Sandalwood, Musk, Amber, Cashmere Wood, Cinnamon, Patchouli and Cedar.</p>

<p>At the very first whiff, the top notes of Almond, Coffee, Bergamot, and Lemon dance on your skin, awakening your senses with a burst of invigorating citrus and the warm embrace of roasted coffee beans. As it settles, the heart notes reveal themselves in a harmonious symphony of Tuberose, Jasmine Sambac, Orange Blossom, Orris, and Bulgarian Rose. These floral accords add a touch of elegance and seduction to the composition, ensuring that this fragrance remains enticing throughout the day or night.</p>

<p>The base notes of Tonka Bean, Cacao, Vanilla, Praline, Sandalwood, Musk, Amber, Cashmere Wood, Cinnamon, Patchouli, and Cedar provide depth and longevity to this scent, leaving a trail of warmth and sophistication wherever you go. It's a fragrance that lingers in the air, leaving a lasting impression on everyone you encounter.</p>

<p>Maison Alhambra B.A.D Femme is more than just a fragrance; it's an embodiment of charisma and style. Embrace the duality of its character, embodying both the sweetness of a charming smile and the allure of a mysterious gaze. With every spray, you'll capture attention, leaving an indelible mark that defines your presence. Elevate your fragrance game with Maison Alhambra B.A.D Femme, the essence of modern masculinity.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Maison Alhambra",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,1549.00,2200.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-B.A.D-Femme-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878397,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
maison-alhambra-man-black-edition-100ml-edp,Maison Alhambra Man Black Edition 100ml EDP,"<p>Maison Alhambra Man Black Edition 100ML Eau de Parfum for men, a captivating and long-lasting fragrance that embodies sophistication and masculinity. This olfactory masterpiece is designed to leave a lasting impression, making it a perfect choice for the modern, confident man.</p>

<p>The top notes of Lavender, Pineapple, Bergamot, and Lemon Verbena immediately greet your senses with a burst of freshness and zest. These invigorating top notes create an enticing opening that sets the stage for what's to come.</p>

<p>As the fragrance evolves, you'll discover a heart of Red Apple, Dried Fruits, Oak Moss, Geranium, Coumarin, and Rose. This intriguing blend of middle notes adds depth and complexity, balancing fruity sweetness with earthy undertones, and a hint of floral elegance.</p>

<p>The base notes of Tonka Bean and Sandalwood provide a warm and sensual foundation that lingers on your skin throughout the day and into the evening. These rich, woody notes create a sophisticated trail that exudes confidence and allure.</p>

<p>Maison Alhambra Man Black Edition is celebrated for its remarkable resemblance to the popular Legend by Montblanc, making it an excellent budget-friendly alternative. This Aromatic Fougère fragrance is tailored for the man who appreciates quality without compromising on value. It's a fragrance that seamlessly transitions from day to night, from the boardroom to a special date night.</p>

<p>Top notes are Lavender, Pineapple, Bergamot and Lemon Verbena</p>

<p>Middle notes are Red Apple, Dried Fruits, oak moss, Geranium, Coumarin and Rose</p>

<p>Base notes are Tonka Bean and Sandalwood.</p>

<p>Experience the enduring charm and versatility of Maison Alhambra Man Black Edition. Immerse yourself in a world of elegance and sophistication with a scent that defines modern masculinity. It's the perfect choice for the discerning man who seeks a signature fragrance that leaves a lasting memory wherever he goes.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Maison Alhambra",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,1449.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-Man-black-edition-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878396,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
maison-alhambra-dark-door-intense-100ml-edp,Maison Alhambra Dark Door Intense 100ml EDP,"<p>Dark Door Intense : A Luxurious Olfactory Journey</p>

<p>Unlock the door to an enchanting olfactory experience with Maison Alhambra's Dark Door Intense. This 100ML Eau de Parfum for men is a testament to sophistication and sensuality, offering an enduring fragrance that lingers on the skin for hours.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Lavender</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Iris, Ambrette (Musk Mallow), Pear, Vanilla</p>

<p>Base Notes: Virginia Cedar, Vetiver</p>

<p>Crafted by the renowned perfumer François Demachy, Dark Door Intense opens with the crisp, refreshing note of Lavender, setting the stage for an aromatic journey like no other. As the scent evolves, the heart reveals a harmonious blend of Iris, Ambrette, and Pear. The Iris lends an elegant, powdery quality, while Ambrette and Pear add a touch of fruitiness and muskiness.</p>

<p>The fragrance reaches its crescendo with the base notes of Virginia Cedar and Vetiver. These woody elements infuse depth and masculinity into the composition, creating a captivating dry down that leaves an indelible impression.</p>

<p>Dark Door Intense is more than just a scent; it's a budget-friendly alternative to the classic Dior Homme Intense 2011 by Dior. It captures the essence of the original, with its Woody Floral Musk profile, offering a similar level of sophistication and allure at a fraction of the price.</p>

<p>Maison Alhambra's commitment to quality ensures that this fragrance is not only an affordable alternative but also a long-lasting one. Dark Door Intense is designed to accompany you through your day, from morning meetings to evening soirées, leaving an unforgettable trail of elegance wherever you go.</p>

<p>Unlock the Dark Door Intense and step into a world of timeless sophistication and allure, all within the reach of your budget. Elevate your fragrance game with Maison Alhambra, where luxury meets affordability.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Maison Alhambra",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1399.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-Dark-Door-Intense-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878396,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
maison-alhambra-dark-door-sport-100ml-edp,Maison Alhambra Dark Door Sport 100ml EDP,"<p>Maison Alhambra Dark Door Sport 100ML Eau de Parfum for men is an olfactory masterpiece that offers a captivating and long-lasting fragrance experience. This budget-friendly gem has quickly gained popularity as an excellent alternative to the renowned Dior Homme Sport 2021 by Dior, making luxury accessible to all.</p>

<p>Top notes are Lemon, Bergamot and Aldehydes</p>

<p>Middle notes are elemi and Pink Pepper</p>

<p>Base notes are Woody Notes, Olibanum and Amber.</p>

<p>As you embark on a sensory journey with Dark Door Sport, you'll be greeted by a zesty burst of top notes, where the freshness of Lemon and Bergamot intertwines seamlessly with the invigorating Aldehydes. This initial symphony sets the stage for what's to come, promising a vibrant and energetic fragrance.</p>

<p>In the heart of Dark Door Sport, the fragrance takes a dynamic turn with the fusion of Elemi and Pink Pepper. These middle notes add a spicy, resinous depth that exudes confidence and charm. This blend of elements gives the fragrance a unique character that's perfect for the modern man who appreciates sophistication with a touch of boldness.</p>

<p>As the scent evolves, it settles into a rich and warm base composed of Woody Notes, Olibanum, and Amber. These base notes create an elegant and lasting trail, leaving an unforgettable impression in your wake.</p>

<p>Maison Alhambra has crafted Dark Door Sport to be not only a remarkable Inspired of a high-end fragrance but also a testament to their commitment to quality and longevity. This fragrance boasts exceptional staying power, ensuring that you stay enveloped in its luxurious aura throughout the day.</p>

<p>With Maison Alhambra Dark Door Sport, you can indulge in the world of premium fragrances without breaking the bank. It's the perfect companion for the modern man who seeks a scent that's both enduring and affordable, making a lasting impression wherever he goes.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Maison Alhambra",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,1599.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-Dark-Door-Sport-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878395,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
maison-alhambra-la-voie-100ml-edp,Maison Alhambra La Voie 100ml EDP,"<p>Maison Alhambra's La Voie, a captivating fragrance designed for the modern woman who exudes confidence and grace. This 100ML Eau de Parfum is a symphony of scents that will leave a lasting impression, just like the indomitable spirit of the woman who wears it.</p>

<p>La Voie is renowned for its remarkable longevity, ensuring you stay enveloped in its enchanting aura throughout the day and into the night. With its carefully curated notes, it's a fragrant journey that unfolds gracefully on your skin.</p>

<p>At the top, the perfume bursts forth with the luminous and zesty notes of Orange Blossom and Bergamot. These opening notes are fresh and invigorating, setting the stage for what's to come.</p>

<p>In the heart of the fragrance, Tuberose and Indian Jasmine take center stage, creating a floral bouquet that is both elegant and alluring. These middle notes infuse La Voie with an irresistible feminine charm.</p>

<p>Finally, the base notes of Madagascar Vanilla, White Musk, and Virginian Cedar anchor the scent, leaving a sensual and woody trail that lingers on your skin like a secret you can't help but share.</p>

<p>What makes La Voie truly special is its affordability. It's a wonderful alternative to the luxurious My Way by Giorgio Armani, offering the same floral sophistication at a fraction of the price.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Orange Blossom and Bergamot<br>
Heart Notes: Tuberose and Indian Jasmine<br>
Base Notes: Madagascar Vanilla, White Musk and Virginian Cedar.</p>

<p>In summary, Maison Alhambra's La Voie is not just a perfume; it's a statement of individuality and style. With its long-lasting allure and budget-friendly nature, it's the perfect choice for women who want to make a memorable impression wherever they go.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Maison Alhambra",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,5,deny,manual,1599.00,2200.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-La-Voie-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878393,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
maison-alhambra-sceptre-malachite-100ml-edp,Maison Alhambra Sceptre Malachite 100ml EDP,"<p>Maison Alhambra introduces the Sceptre Malachite, a 100ML Eau de Parfum designed exclusively for men seeking sophistication and longevity in their fragrances. This olfactory masterpiece boasts remarkable staying power, ensuring you stay enveloped in its captivating aura throughout the day.</p>

<p>At its heart, Sceptre Malachite is a harmonious blend of olfactory notes that tell a story of timeless elegance. The top notes tantalize your senses with a symphony of freshness, combining zesty Bergamot, invigorating Lemon, soothing Lavender, and the uplifting Lemon Verbena. This refreshing prelude sets the stage for an aromatic journey unlike any other.</p>

<p>As the scent evolves, you'll discover the warm embrace of Amber and Oud, creating a sensuous and inviting atmosphere. The Aromatic and Herbal notes infuse the composition with depth and complexity, adding a hint of mystery and sophistication. A delicate touch of Rose adds a floral facet that perfectly balances the richness of the fragrance.</p>

<p>Sceptre Malachite by Maison Alhambra proudly stands as an excellent alternative to the renowned Kobraa by Bvlgari. It embodies the essence of an Amber Fougere fragrance, offering a budget-friendly option without compromising on quality or longevity. This fragrance exudes confidence and charisma, making it an ideal choice for the modern man who appreciates the finer things in life.</p>

<p>With its captivating blend of notes, impressive longevity, and budget-friendly appeal, Maison Alhambra's Sceptre Malachite is a true gem in the world of men's fragrances. Experience the allure of this scent and make a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Maison Alhambra",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,2099.00,5000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-Sceptre-Malachite-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878393,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
maison-alhambra-the-artist-no-1-100ml-edp,Maison Alhambra The Artist No 1 100ml EDP,"<p>Maison Alhambra's The Artist No.1 transcends gender boundaries with its captivating blend of notes. This fragrance is more than just a scent; it's a work of art that exudes elegance and passion, designed to leave a lasting impression on both men and women.</p>

<p>The Artist No.1 opens with the graceful allure of Rose, a timeless and delicate floral note that sets the stage for what's to come. As it unfolds, the heart notes of Blackcurrant, Raspberry, and Clove emerge, weaving a tapestry of sweet and spicy intrigue. This harmonious combination evokes a sense of mystery and allure that is simply irresistible.</p>

<p>As the scent matures, it settles into its base notes, which are a rich and luxurious blend of Patchouli, Sandalwood, and Frankincense. These notes bring depth and warmth, leaving a trail of sophistication and sensuality in their wake. The enduring presence of these base notes ensures that Maison Alhambra's The Artist No.1 lingers on the skin, making it a truly long-lasting fragrance.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Rose<br>
Heart Notes: Blackcurrant, Raspberry, and Clove<br>
Base Notes: Patchouli, Sandalwood, and Frankincense</p>

<p>What makes The Artist No.1 even more remarkable is its ability to capture the essence of Frederic Malle's iconic Portrait of a Lady, offering a budget-friendly alternative without compromising on quality. This Amber Floral fragrance is a masterpiece that embodies the spirit of both men and women who appreciate the finer things in life. With The Artist No.1, you can wear artistry and elegance, leaving your mark wherever you go.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Maison Alhambra",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1850.00,5000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-The-Artist-No-1-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878393,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
maison-alhambra-the-artist-no-2-100ml-edp,Maison Alhambra The Artist No 2 100ml EDP,"<p>Maison Alhambra presents The Artist No 2, a 100ML Eau de Parfum that transcends gender boundaries with its captivating blend of scents. This fragrance is more than just a perfume; it's an olfactory masterpiece that lingers on the skin, ensuring an enduring and memorable presence.</p>

<p>The top notes of Apple, Pink Pepper, and Rosemary create an invigorating and spicy opening, setting the stage for what's to come. As the fragrance develops, the heart notes reveal themselves, dominated by the exquisite essence of Bulgarian Rose and Turkish Rose, which infuse a rich, romantic floral bouquet with a touch of Clove's warmth. These middle notes convey a sense of elegance and passion.</p>

<p>The base notes of Cypriol Oil, Patchouli, Labdanum, Castoreum, and Ambroxan add depth and complexity to The Artist No 2. Cypriol Oil lends an earthy, woody character, while Patchouli contributes a sensual, velvety dimension. Labdanum, Castoreum, and Ambroxan intertwine to create a warm, resinous, and slightly animalic undertone, leaving a lasting impression on the senses.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Pink Pepper, Rosemary Oil, Apple Accord<br>
Heart Notes: Bulgarian Rose Oil, Turkish Rose Absolute, Clove Oil<br>
Base Notes: Patchouli Heart, Amboroxan, Labdanum, Cypriol Heart, Castoreum</p>

<p>This remarkable fragrance is not only a testament to artistry but also a remarkable budget-friendly alternative to Promise by Frederic Malle, known for its Amber Floral allure. The Artist No 2 by Maison Alhambra is an olfactory journey that defies conventions, making it suitable for both men and women who appreciate the timeless allure of a scent that lingers long after you've left the room. Immerse yourself in the captivating world of The Artist No 2 and let your presence be an unforgettable work of art.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Maison Alhambra",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,1850.00,5000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-The-Artist-No-2-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878391,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
maison-alhambra-your-touch-100ml-edp,Maison Alhambra Your Touch 100ml EDP,"<p>Maison Alhambra's The Artist No 2, a 100ML Eau de Parfum designed exclusively for men. This olfactory masterpiece is a testament to timeless elegance and unwavering charisma. Crafted for those who seek sophistication and longevity in their fragrance, The Artist No 2 is a scent that lingers, leaving an indelible impression.</p>

<p>At the top, a captivating blend of Cardamom, Pink Pepper, Mint, and Violet Leaf sets the stage, evoking an aura of freshness and intrigue. As the fragrance unfolds, the heart notes reveal themselves, a harmonious symphony of Pineapple, Sage, Watermelon, Cinnamon, and Lavender, creating a dynamic and captivating core. These heart notes balance sweet and spicy elements, ensuring an enigmatic allure.</p>

<p>But what truly sets The Artist No 2 apart is its robust and lasting base notes. Anchored by Vanilla's warmth and Chestnut's earthiness, the fragrance delves into the rich, woody depths of Cedar, Amberwood, and Guaiac Wood, culminating in a smoky, sensual embrace that endures throughout the day and into the night.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Cardamom, Pink Pepper, Mint and Violet Leaf<br>
Heart Notes: Pineapple, Sage, Watermelon, Cinnamon and Lavender<br>
Base Notes: Vanilla, Chestnut, Cedar, Amberwood and Guaiac Wood</p>

<p>This exceptional creation from Maison Alhambra is more than just a fragrance; it's a statement of refined taste and unwavering confidence. A remarkable Inspired and budget-friendly alternative to Emporio Armani Stronger With You Intensely by Giorgio Armani, The Artist No 2 is an Amber Fougere fragrance that exudes masculine strength and allure. Experience the lasting power of this scent, an olfactory masterpiece that will leave a lasting impression wherever you go. Elevate your presence and make a statement with Maison Alhambra's The Artist No 2.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Maison Alhambra",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,1699.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-Your-Touch-100ml-EDP.png?v=1779878389,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
maison-alhambra-your-touch-women-100ml-edp,Maison Alhambra Your Touch Women 100ml EDP,"<p>Maison Alhambra Your Touch Women is designed for women seeking a scent that leaves an enduring impression. This fragrance is a testament to sophistication and sensuality, offering a captivating and long-lasting olfactory experience.</p>

<p>Opening with an enchanting burst of top notes, ""Your Touch"" entices the senses with the delightful fusion of Raspberry, Lemon, and Neroli. This initial burst is refreshingly fruity and zesty, creating an inviting aura. As the fragrance evolves, it gracefully transitions into the heart note of Rose, lending a floral elegance that embodies femininity and grace. The Rose note adds a romantic and timeless dimension to the composition.</p>

<p>As the perfume unfolds further, it settles into its warm and lasting base notes. The combination of Vanilla, Musk, and Amberwood creates a sensual and enveloping dry-down that lingers on the skin, leaving an alluring trail wherever you go. This unique blend of base notes adds depth and character to the fragrance, making it perfect for both daytime and evening wear.</p>

<p>""Your Touch"" is a budget-friendly alternative to the renowned Emporio Armani Because It’s You by Giorgio Armani. It captures the essence of the original while offering a more affordable option without compromising on quality or longevity. This Floral Fruity fragrance is a celebration of modern femininity, making it an ideal choice for confident women who want a scent that reflects their unique charm and allure.</p>

<p>Indulge in the long-lasting allure of Maison Alhambra's ""Your Touch,"" and let this exquisite fragrance become an essential part of your daily ensemble.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Maison Alhambra",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1549.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-Your-Touch-Women-100ml-EDP.png?v=1779878388,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
maison-alhambra-zaffiro-collection-regale-100ml-edp,Maison Alhambra Zaffiro Collection Regale 100ml EDP,"<p>Maison Alhambra Zaffiro Collection Regale 100ML Eau de Parfum, a fragrance that exudes timeless elegance and sophistication. This perfume is more than just a scent; it's an olfactory masterpiece that captures the essence of luxury and exclusivity.</p>

<p>Maison Alhambra is renowned for creating fragrances that stand the test of time, and the Zaffiro Collection Regale is no exception. Its long-lasting formula ensures that you stay enveloped in its enchanting aroma throughout the day, making it a true companion for all your special moments.</p>

<p>At its heart, the Regale boasts a luxurious bouquet of Indian Saffron, which adds a rich, warm, and exotic allure. This is complemented by the delicate sweetness of jasmine, the enticing spiciness of cardamom, and the softness of rose notes. These elements combine to create a symphony of scents that are both captivating and alluring.</p>

<p>As the fragrance unfolds, key notes of patchouli and white cedar emerge, adding depth and complexity. The vanilla undertones infuse a creamy sweetness, while musk lends an irresistible sensuality that lingers in the air, leaving an indelible impression.</p>

<p>Maison Alhambra's Zaffiro Collection Regale is more than just a perfume; it's a statement of opulence and refinement. Whether you're attending a formal soirée or simply want to elevate your daily routine, this fragrance is your go-to choice for making a lasting impression. With its luxurious blend of ingredients and enduring scent, it's an olfactory masterpiece that embodies the essence of sophistication and luxury.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Maison Alhambra",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,2099.00,5000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-Zaffiro-Collection-Regale-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779878387,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
maison-alhambra-maitre-de-blue-100ml-edp,Maison Alhambra Maitre De Blue 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Maison Alhambra Maitre De Blue Parfum for men is a fragrance that truly captures the essence of sophistication and charisma. This remarkably long-lasting perfume is a testament to the craftsmanship of Maison Alhambra, designed to accompany you through day and night with its captivating scent.</p>

<p>At the top, a burst of invigorating freshness greets your senses, blending zesty Grapefruit, zingy Lemon, a touch of Mint, and a hint of Pink Pepper. This lively opening is like a breath of fresh air, setting the stage for what's to come.</p>

<p>In the heart of this fragrance, a complex interplay of spicy warmth and floral elegance emerges. Ginger and Nutmeg provide a tantalizing spiciness while the delicate allure of Jasmine and the woody nuances of Iso E Super create a magnetic and alluring core.</p>

<p>The base notes bring depth and longevity to Maitre De Blue, with a rich blend of Incense, Vetiver, Cedar, Sandalwood, Patchouli, Labdanum, and White Musk. This combination adds a sensuous and mysterious character, ensuring the fragrance lingers on your skin, leaving a lasting impression.</p>

<p>What makes Maitre De Blue even more captivating is its striking resemblance to the iconic Bleu de Chanel by Chanel, making it a fantastic and more budget-friendly alternative for those who appreciate this world-renowned scent.</p>

<p>Top notes are Grapefruit, Lemon, Mint and Pink Pepper</p>

<p>Middle notes are Ginger, Nutmeg, Jasmine and Iso E Super</p>

<p>Base notes are Incense, Vetiver, Cedar, Sandalwood, Patchouli, Labdanum and White Musk.</p>

<p>In summary, Lattafa Maison Alhambra Maitre De Blue is an olfactory masterpiece, offering a long-lasting aromatic experience that exudes confidence and allure. Its fusion of citrus, spice, and woodsy notes creates a versatile and appealing fragrance that stands out as a brilliant alternative to the beloved Bleu de Chanel. It's a scent that embodies sophistication and style, making it an excellent choice for the modern man.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Maison Alhambra",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,19,deny,manual,1599.00,2200.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-alhambra-maitre-de-blue.png?v=1779878386,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
