maison-alhambra-russe-leather-80ml-edp,Maison Alhambra Russe Leather 80ml EDP,"<p>Introducing Maison Alhambra's Russe Leather, an 80ML Eau de Parfum for both men and women, renowned for its extraordinary longevity that weaves an olfactory tale of sophistication and bold allure. This fragrance is a symphony of notes, carefully crafted to evoke a sense of passion and modernity, making it an ideal companion for every occasion.</p>

<p>The fragrance opens with a burst of invigorating freshness, combining the crispness of mint, the herbal elegance of clary sage, and the earthy nuances of cedar needle. Siberian pine and coriander add a touch of spice, creating a top note composition that is both refreshing and intriguing.</p>

<p>As Russe Leather evolves, it reveals a heart that is rich and complex. Lavender and rosemary lend an aromatic floral quality, while the warmth of nutmeg and the smoky essence of guaiac wood add depth. Basil and patchouli contribute to the heart notes, creating a captivating blend that is both timeless and contemporary.</p>

<p>The fragrance concludes with a sensuous and lasting impression. Tonka bean imparts a sweet and creamy quality, harmonizing with the distinct aroma of leather and the woody essence of cypress. This base note combination adds a layer of sophistication, ensuring that Russe Leather leaves a memorable and lingering trail.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Mint, Clary Sage, Cedar Needle, Siberian Pine, Coriander<br>
Heart Notes: Lavender, Rosemary, Nutmeg, Guaiac Wood, Basil, Patchouli<br>
Base Notes: Tonka Bean, Leather, Cypress</p>

<p>Maison Alhambra's Russe Leather is not only a fragrance but a narrative, a story of opulence and refinement. Remarkably long-lasting, it unfolds on the skin, transforming your daily routine into an olfactory adventure. As a splendid alternative to the expensive Russian Leather by Memo Paris, this EDP stands as a testament to affordable luxury, capturing the essence of the original in an artful interpretation that is both accessible and exquisite.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Maison Alhambra",true,Size,80ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1449.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Russe-leather-maison-alhambra.png?v=1779878382,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
maison-alhambra-roman-leather-80ml-edp,Maison Alhambra Roman Leather 80ml EDP,"<p>Maison Alhambra presents Roman Leather, an 80ML Eau de Parfum that embodies sophistication and longevity, making it an exceptional fragrance for both men and women. This olfactory masterpiece is meticulously crafted to offer a captivating experience that lingers throughout the day and into the night.</p>

<p>Indulge in the initial burst of luxury with a fusion of Leather and Musk. The top notes of Roman Leather establish a strong and distinctive introduction, setting the stage for the olfactory journey ahead.</p>

<p>As the fragrance unfolds, the Heart Notes reveal a harmonious blend of Honey and Vetiver. This intricate combination adds depth and warmth, creating a sensory symphony that resonates with elegance.</p>

<p>The enduring allure of Roman Leather is anchored in its Base Notes, where Amber takes center stage. This rich and resinous note, combined with the earlier layers, creates a profound and lasting impression that trails behind you with every step.</p>

<p>Top Notes - Leather, Musk<br>
Heart Notes - Honey, Vetiver<br>
Base Notes - Amber</p>

<p>Roman Leather stands out not only for its exceptional quality but also for its artful homage to the opulence found in Italian Leather by Memo Paris. This fragrance serves as an exquisite alternative, capturing the essence of the expensive and renowned original while offering a more budget-friendly option.</p>

<p>Indulge in the enduring charm of Maison Alhambra's Roman Leather, an 80ML EDP that elevates your presence with a timeless fragrance, making every moment unforgettable.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Maison Alhambra",true,Size,80ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1449.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Roman-Leather-Maison-Alhambra.png?v=1779878381,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
maison-alhambra-brulant-oud-100ml-extrait-de-parfum,Maison Alhambra Brulant Oud 100ml Extrait De Parfum,"<p>Maison Alhambra Brulant Oud 100ml Eau De Extrait For Men: A Majestic Ode to Timeless Elegance 🌟</p>

<p>Embark on a journey of unparalleled luxury with Maison Alhambra Brulant Oud, a fragrance that epitomizes sophistication and refinement. Crafted to perfection, this 100ml Eau De Extrait For Men is a testament to the artistry of perfumery, offering a sensorial experience that transcends boundaries.</p>

<p>🔥 A Tribute to Opulence: Maison Alhambra Brulant Oud stands as a timeless tribute to opulence, reminiscent of the revered Gold Man by Amouage. This exquisite creation exudes an aura of regal charm, captivating the senses with its unparalleled allure.</p>

<p>💫 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Delve into a world of intrigue with a captivating blend of grapefruit, cardamom, cumin, ginger, nutmeg, saffron, and cognac cord. This invigorating fusion sets the stage for the journey ahead, enticing the senses with its vibrant energy.<br>
Heart Notes: The heart of Maison Alhambra Brulant Oud reveals a symphony of warmth and depth, with notes of cinnamon, mastic pistachio, benzoin, hairy, patchouli, geranium, and myrrh. This rich and complex composition evokes a sense of intimacy and sophistication.<br>
Base Notes: As the fragrance unfolds, it leaves behind a lingering trail of sandalwood, smoky skin, sage, animalistic chord, and incense. This captivating blend adds a touch of mystery and allure, leaving an indelible impression that resonates long after the initial encounter.</p>

<p>🌞 Perfect for All Seasons: Maison Alhambra Brulant Oud is designed to transcend seasons, making it the perfect companion for every occasion. Whether it's a balmy summer evening or a crisp winter day, this fragrance adapts effortlessly to any weather, ensuring you exude confidence and style.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Maison Alhambra",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1999.00,5000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-Brulant-Oud.png?v=1779878380,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,extrait,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
maison-alhambra-glacier-le-noir-100ml-edp,Maison Alhambra Glacier Le Noir 100ml EDP,"<p>Maison Alhambra Glacier Le Noir Eau De Parfum 100ml: A Timeless Elixir of Masculine Sophistication</p>

