<p>❄️ Perfect for Cool Weather or Nighttime: Maison Alhambra Glacier Le Noir is ideally suited for cool evenings or nighttime adventures, enveloping you in a cloak of warmth and allure. Whether you're out for a romantic dinner or attending a formal event, this fragrance ensures you make a lasting impression.</p>

<p>🛍️ Indulge in Timeless Luxury: Elevate your fragrance collection with Maison Alhambra Glacier Le Noir Eau De Parfum 100ml and experience the epitome of sophistication and style. Unleash your inner charisma and leave a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Maison Alhambra",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1699.00,2999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-Glacier-Le-Noir.png?v=1779878381,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
maison-alhambra-jorge-di-profumo-100ml-edp,Maison Alhambra Jorge Di Profumo 100ml EDP,"<p>Jorge di Profumo Maison Alhambra 100ML EDP For Men: Embark on a Journey of Timeless Sophistication 🌟</p>

<p>Experience the epitome of elegance and refinement with Jorge di Profumo Maison Alhambra, a fragrance crafted to elevate your senses and captivate your soul. Inspired by the allure of the majestic Alhambra, this 100ml Eau De Parfum is a testament to luxury and sophistication, perfect for the modern gentleman who appreciates the finer things in life.</p>

<p>🌊 Aromatic Oasis of Sensations: Maison Alhambra invites you to immerse yourself in an aromatic oasis, where the crisp freshness of sea notes harmonizes with the uplifting zest of bergamot. This invigorating blend evokes the serenity of a coastal breeze, awakening your senses with every spritz.</p>

<p>🌿 Sensational Layers Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Embark on your olfactory journey with a burst of sea notes and bergamot, an enchanting introduction that sets the stage for the adventure ahead. Feel the cool embrace of the ocean breeze mingling with the citrusy tang of bergamot, creating a refreshing aura of vitality.<br>
Middle Notes: As the fragrance unfolds, notes of rosemary, sage, and geranium come to life, adding depth and complexity to the composition. These herbal accents infuse Maison Alhambra with a touch of earthy sophistication, reminiscent of sun-kissed Mediterranean gardens.<br>
Base Notes: The journey culminates in a mesmerizing blend of incense and patchouli, grounding the scent in an aura of timeless allure. Let the warm embrace of incense and the earthy richness of patchouli envelop you in a veil of sensual elegance, leaving a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>☀️ Perfect for Every Season and Occasion: Maison Alhambra is a versatile fragrance that transcends seasons and occasions, making it the perfect companion for summer days or daytime adventures year-round. Whether you're lounging by the pool or attending a sophisticated soirée, this fragrance is sure to leave a lasting impression.</p>

<p>🌐 Inspired by Timeless Classics: Maison Alhambra pays homage to the iconic Acqua di Giò Profumo by Giorgio Armani, infusing the timeless allure of the original with a unique twist. Embrace the essence of sophistication and embark on a journey of unrivaled elegance with Jorge di Profumo Maison Alhambra.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Maison Alhambra",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,1749.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/maison-alhambra-jorge-di-profumo.png?v=1779878378,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
