<p>🌟 A Tribute to Orza by Tiziana Terenzi: Maison Alhambra Oasis pays homage to the beloved Orza by Tiziana Terenzi, capturing its essence with unparalleled precision. As a Inspired, it inherits the same exquisite qualities and enchanting allure, offering a sensory experience that is truly divine.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Maison Alhambra",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1999.00,2499.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-Oasis.png?v=1779878372,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
maison-alhambra-purple-wood-100ml-edp,Maison Alhambra Purple Wood 100ml EDP,"<p>Experience Opulence with Maison Alhambra Purple Wood 100ml EDP 🌟</p>

<p>Indulge in the epitome of luxury with Maison Alhambra Purple Wood, a fragrance that transcends boundaries and captivates the senses. Crafted with precision in the UAE, this 100ml Eau De Parfum is a testament to sophistication, longevity, and freshness.</p>

<p>🌿 Long-Lasting Freshness: Maison Alhambra Purple Wood is not just a fragrance; it's an experience that lasts. Embrace the invigorating freshness that lingers throughout the day, enveloping you in a captivating aura of vitality and charm.</p>

<p>🌺 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Agarwood (Oud): Embark on a journey of richness and depth with the exquisite essence of agarwood, also known as oud. This iconic note infuses the fragrance with a sense of mystery and allure, leaving a lasting impression wherever you go.<br>
Saffron: Delight your senses with the intoxicating aroma of saffron, a spice revered for its opulence and sophistication. Its warm and spicy nuances add a touch of elegance to the fragrance, evoking a sense of indulgence and luxury.<br>
Pink Pepper: Experience a burst of vibrancy with the inclusion of pink pepper, a note that adds a subtle yet invigorating kick to the composition. Its peppery freshness complements the other ingredients, creating a harmonious blend that tantalizes the senses.<br>
Orange: Bright and uplifting, the essence of orange adds a refreshing twist to Maison Alhambra Purple Wood. Its citrusy aroma adds a zesty pop to the fragrance, enhancing its overall allure and making it a joy to wear.</p>

<p>👑 Best Inspired of Purple Oud by Dior: Maison Alhambra Purple Wood stands as a worthy successor to the iconic Purple Oud by Dior. Paying homage to its predecessor, this fragrance captures the essence of luxury and sophistication, offering an unparalleled olfactory experience.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Maison Alhambra",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1999.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-Purple-Wood.png?v=1779878371,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,woody,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
maison-alhambra-chants-tenderina-100ml-edp,Maison Alhambra Chants Tenderina 100ml EDP,"<p>Maison Alhambra Chants Tenderina 100ml EDP for Women: Embrace the Symphony of Freshness and Elegance 🌸</p>

