maison-alhambra-kismet-magic-100ml-edp,Maison Alhambra Kismet Magic 100ml EDP,"Maison Alhambra's Kismet Magic, a 100ML Eau De Parfum that transcends traditional boundaries with its exotic and gender-neutral allure. Revel in an olfactory journey that lasts beyond the ordinary; Kismet Magic is a symphony of scents, meticulously crafted to linger on the skin for an extended period, ensuring you carry an enchanting aura throughout the day and into the night.

Fragrance Notes:

Immerse yourself in the initial burst of sweetness with a combination of Vanilla, Honeycomb, and Amber. This harmonious blend sets the stage for a captivating sensory experience.

As the fragrance unfolds, the heart reveals a rich tapestry of Cognac, Cinnamon, Caramel, and Tonka Bean. This intricate fusion adds depth and complexity to the composition, evoking a sense of mystery and sophistication.

The lingering trail of Kismet Magic is adorned with the sumptuous essence of Dark Chocolate. This decadent foundation completes the fragrance, leaving an indelible mark on the senses.

Indulge in a perfume that defies conventional limitations, offering a prolonged aromatic experience that lasts up to 8 hours with each application. Kismet Magic stands as a testament to Maison Alhambra's commitment to quality and craftsmanship, presenting a fragrance that is both distinctive and enduring.

Top Notes - Vanilla, Honeycomb &amp; Amber;
Middle Notes - Cognac, Cinnamon, Caramel &amp; Tonka Bean;
Base Notes - Dark Chocolate.

This exceptional creation is not just a scent; it's a masterpiece, drawing inspiration from the opulence of Angels' Share by By Kilian. Immerse yourself in the luxury of Kismet Magicl, a remarkable and affordable alternative that mirrors the allure of the iconic original.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Maison Alhambra",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,12,deny,manual,2149.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Kismet-Magic.png?v=1779878368,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
