maison-alhambra-victorioso-nero-100ml-edp,Maison Alhambra Victorioso Nero 100ml EDP,"<p>Maison Alhambra Victorioso Nero 100ML EDP for Men</p>

<p>Discover the epitome of masculine elegance and power with Maison Alhambra Victorioso Nero, a fragrance that echoes the triumphant spirit of Invictus Victory by Paco Rabanne. This Eau de Parfum is designed for the modern man who embodies strength, confidence, and charisma.</p>

<p>🌟 Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Pink Pepper, Lemon 🍋</p>

<p>Heart Notes: Lavender, Olíbano 🌿</p>

<p>Base Notes: Vanilla, Tonka Bean, Amber 🌲</p>

<p>Maison Alhambra Victorioso Nero opens with a vibrant burst of Pink Pepper and zesty Lemon, creating an invigorating and dynamic introduction. This fresh and spicy accord instantly energizes the senses, setting the stage for the captivating journey ahead.</p>

<p>As the top notes fade, the heart of the fragrance reveals an enchanting blend of aromatic Lavender and smoky Olíbano. This harmonious combination adds a sophisticated and calming depth to the scent, evoking a sense of timeless elegance and inner strength.</p>

<p>The base notes of Vanilla, Tonka Bean, and Amber provide a warm and sensual foundation. The creamy sweetness of Vanilla intertwines with the rich, nutty nuances of Tonka Bean, while the resinous, earthy tones of Amber lend a lasting, magnetic allure. This trio creates a deeply alluring and comforting dry down, leaving a powerful and unforgettable impression.</p>

<p>Maison Alhambra Victorioso Nero is a celebration of victory and resilience. Its complex composition balances boldness with refinement, making it the perfect signature scent for any occasion. Whether you're conquering a boardroom or enjoying a night out, this fragrance will enhance your presence and leave an indelible mark.</p>

<p>Embrace your victorious side with Maison Alhambra Victorioso Nero – a fragrance that embodies the spirit of triumph and sophistication. 🎖️🏆</p>

<p>Unleash the power within you, and let Victorioso Nero be your olfactory armor.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Maison Alhambra",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1449.00,2300.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-victorioso-nero.png?v=1779878366,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
maison-alhambra-sceptre-amazonite-100ml-edp,Maison Alhambra Sceptre Amazonite 100ml EDP,"<p>🌟 Maison Alhambra Sceptre Amazonite EDP 100ml for Men: The Pinnacle of Long-Lasting Sophistication 🌟</p>

<p>Discover the essence of luxury and refinement with Maison Alhambra Sceptre Amazonite EDP 100ml for Men. This fragrance is an exquisite creation, meticulously crafted to embody elegance and endurance. As a top-tier Inspired of the renowned Falkar by Bvlgari, Sceptre Amazonite offers a mesmerizing olfactory experience that captures the essence of distinction.</p>

<p>🔥 Long-Lasting Excellence: Maison Alhambra Sceptre Amazonite is celebrated for its remarkable longevity, ensuring you remain enveloped in its captivating aura from morning till night. Its enduring performance makes it the ideal choice for the modern man who seeks sophistication and presence in every stride.</p>

<p>💐 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: The journey begins with a harmonious blend of nutmeg and cinnamon. This spicy duo creates an immediate impression of warmth and richness, setting a bold and inviting tone.<br>
Heart Notes: At the heart, cypriol oil (nagarmotha) and frankincense take center stage. These notes add a layer of complexity and depth, with the earthy and slightly smoky aroma of cypriol oil perfectly complementing the resinous and balsamic nuances of frankincense.<br>
Base Notes: The foundation of this fragrance is a masterful blend of oud, saffron, and black musk. Oud, known for its deep, woody character, intertwines with the luxurious spice of saffron and the dark, sensual allure of black musk, creating a lingering trail that exudes opulence and mystery.</p>

<p>🌞 Perfect for Cool weather : Maison Alhambra Sceptre Amazonite is a versatile fragrance, ideal for any setting—from formal gatherings to intimate evenings. Its sophisticated blend of notes ensures you stand out with an air of elegance and confidence.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, Maison Alhambra",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,2399.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Maison-Alhambra-sceptre-amazonite.png?v=1779878364,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
