maison-alhambra-renee-carmina-100ml-edp,Maison Alhambra Renee Carmina 100ml EDP,"Maison Alhambra Renée Carmina 100ml EDP – Elegant, Modern &amp; Sensual ✨🌸For Men &amp; Women | Floral • Woody • Musky
Maison Alhambra Renée Carmina is a refined and contemporary unisex fragrance that blends luminous florals with smooth woody-musky depth. Minimal yet expressive, this scent feels effortlessly elegant and modern, making it perfect for everyday wear or intimate evening moments. Clean, soft, and captivating, it leaves a sophisticated trail that feels both airy and sensual.
