fragrance-world-enigma-deux-100ml-edp,Fragrance World Enigma Deux 100ml EDP,"Fragrance World Enigma Deux 100ml EDP: A Captivating Symphony for Men &amp; Women

Embark on an enchanting olfactory journey with Fragrance World Enigma Deux 100ml Eau De Parfum, a mesmerizing scent designed to transcend traditional boundaries of gender. Crafted with precision and passion, Enigma Deux embodies the essence of allure and sophistication, enveloping both men and women in its irresistible charm.

🔥 Sensory Delight: Enigma Deux opens with a tantalizing blend of Tonka Bean and Oak, creating a harmonious symphony that captivates the senses from the very first spritz. The top notes dance together in perfect harmony, setting the stage for the unfolding drama of fragrance that lies ahead.

💖 Unisex Elegance: Breaking free from the confines of traditional gender norms, Enigma Deux celebrates individuality and self-expression. Its versatile nature allows both men and women to revel in its captivating aura, making it a statement of timeless elegance and modern sophistication.

🎵 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:

Top Notes: The journey begins with the rich and comforting aroma of Tonka Bean, complemented by the woody nuances of Oak. This opening creates an inviting atmosphere, drawing you deeper into the fragrance experience.
Heart Notes: As the scent evolves, notes of Cinnamon and Hazelnut emerge, infusing the heart of Enigma Deux with warmth and spice. This captivating blend adds depth and complexity, enticing the senses with its irresistible allure.
Base Notes: The fragrance journey reaches its crescendo with the sensual embrace of a Cognac Accord. Rich and intoxicating, this base note leaves a lasting impression, wrapping you in a veil of sophistication and mystery.

🌿 Timeless Sophistication: Enigma Deux is more than just a fragrance—it's a statement of refined taste and timeless sophistication. Whether worn during the day or for an evening rendezvous, its allure knows no bounds, leaving a lasting impression wherever you go.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Fragrance World, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,2299.00,4500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Untitled-800-x-800-px-500-x-500-px-1000-x-1000-px-1000-x-1000-px.webp?v=1780398470,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-najdia-100ml-edp,Lattafa Najdia 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Najdia is a remarkable perfume that combines the best elements of two renowned fragrances, Rasasi Hawas and Invictus by Paco Rabanne. This oriental fragrance is a true gem, opening with an invigorating blend of notes that instantly captivate the senses. With its long-lasting formula, Lattafa Najdia is perfect for daytime wear, making it an ideal choice for the summer season.and you can also wear it all year around.</p>

<p>At the top, you'll experience a refreshing burst of lemon, cinnamon, lemongrass, apple, and bergamot. These vibrant notes create a lively and uplifting aura that sets the stage for the fragrance to unfold. As it develops, the middle notes of watery notes, lavender, rosemary, and cardamom add depth and complexity, giving Lattafa Najdia a sophisticated touch.</p>

<p>The fragrance's base notes consist of amber, musk, cedar, sandalwood, and tobacco, creating a warm and sensual foundation. These rich and enticing notes linger on the skin, leaving a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>One of the most appealing aspects of Lattafa Najdia is its affordability. Despite its exceptional quality and longevity, it remains a budget-friendly option for men who appreciate high-quality fragrances. With Lattafa Najdia, you can enjoy a captivating scent that rivals more expensive options without breaking the bank. Its a must-have scent and you cant go wrong with this fragrance.</p>

<p>Top notes are Lemon, Cinnamon, Lemongrass, Apple and Bergamot</p>

<p>Middle notes are Watery Notes, Lavender, Rosemary and Cardamom</p>

<p>Base notes are Amber, Musk, Cedar, Sandalwood and Tobacco.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Daily Wear, Full, LATTAFA, Office Perfumes",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,8,deny,manual,2099.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/LATTAFA-NAJDIA-PERFUME-FOR-MEN-100-ML-EDP.png?v=1779821300,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,lattafa,,,,,,,,,,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
