lattafa-qaaed-al-shabaab-100ml-edp,Lattafa Qaaed Al Shabaab 100ml EDP,"<p>Qaa'ed Al Shabaab by Lattafa Perfumes is an Amber fragrance for men. This is a new fragrance from Lattafa launched in 2021. It's fruity in the beginning but in a different way, there is no sweetness you will get little bitter fruits like orange Some prominent notes are leather Soft oud, yellow floral hints, woody soft spicy hints. Little animalic also</p> 

<p>Best for mature men or confident men, it's a powerhouse again from Lattafa with great performance and longevity.</p>

<p>Top notes are Osmanthus and Ylang-Ylang</p>

<p>Middle notes are Leather and Cedar</p>

<p>Base notes are Agarwood (Oud) and Light Amber.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1599.00,2575.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Qaaed-Al-Shabaab-100ml-EDP.png?v=1779821264,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-qaaed-100ml-edp,Lattafa Qaaed 100ml EDP,"Lattafa Qaa`Ed EDP Perfume (Eau de Parfum) For Men &amp; Women 100 ML Directly From UAE. Qaa`Ed by Lattafa is mysterious, tempting with a strong smell of amber and musk, with herbs like savory and a vanilla note on the end that proves to be the highlight for a strong fragrance.

It is Long Lasting, 100% Original and Authentic Perfume and very easy to use. Perfect for gifting your special ones because of its fragrance and attractive Packaging.

