lattafa-raed-oud-100ml-edp,Lattafa Raed Oud 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Ra’ed Oud 100ml Eau de Parfum<br>
Fragrance accords: Oudh Notes, Spicy, Smoky, Sweet, Floral, Leathery, Ceder, Guaiac wood</p>

<p>Long Lasting and unique, Modern fragrance<br>
An Arabian oud perfume bottle of 100ml<br>
It's a unisex fragrance but more toward men's<br>
Beautifully packaged in a brown and gold box and glass bottle great option for gifting someone.<br>
Niche quality perfume that makes you attractive instantly.</p>

<p>Raed oud lattafa is the best Arabian oud perfume for men and women. Suitable for all occasions such as birthdays, anniversaries, or seasonal holidays, this fragrance will be a hit. Let your loved ones know you’re thinking of them with a delicate fragrance. Lift your mood and confidence with this elegant scent that will leave people in envy. Besides, the Ra’ed Oud 100ml Arabian perfume comes beautifully packaged in a patterned brown and gold box and crystal top glass bottle. Undoubtedly, the best Arabian Oud fragrance you will find…</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,8,deny,manual,2099.00,3575.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Raed-Oud-100ml-EDP.png?v=1779821242,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-raed-luxe-100ml-edp,Lattafa Raed Luxe 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Ra'ed Luxe is a Amber Spicy fragrance for women and men. Ra'ed Luxe was launched in 2019.</p>

<p>Top notes are Juniper, Pink Pepper, Pineapple, Silk tree blossom, Watermelon and Jasmine</p>

<p>Middle notes are Sage, Lavender, Cinnamon and Herbal Notes</p>

<p>Base notes are Amber, Vanilla, Vetiver, Tonka Bean, Chestnut, Ice, Sandalwood, Musk and Strawberry.</p>

<p>Luxurious, as Ra´ed has in the name, are the individual chords of the scent that embrace you with its sensually harmonious scent.</p>

<p>Perfume is a passion, and in Ra´ed Lux it is distinguished by tones of pink pepper and aromatic juniper, with its pleasantly resinous aroma and bittersweet aroma, blending into fruity woody scores.</p>

<p>The juicy pineapple with red melon will play a gourmet game of delicious seduction, in which gourmet wild strawberries with an ice crust of velvety sweet chestnuts, slowly dissolving in creamy whipped vanilla mousse, decorated with sage hazelnuts and sprinkled with cinnamon, enter.</p>

<p>The floral echoes of jasmine with touches of lavender and fougère accents, woody green, slightly earthy and at the same time fresh scent of cut grass, which is successfully followed by reflections of smoky dry vetiver, replace the warmth of sandalwood in harmony with the majestic amber.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,1998.00,3575.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-raed-Luxe-100ml-EDP.png?v=1779821241,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-ameer-al-oudh-intense-oud-100ml-edp,Lattafa Ameer Al Oudh Intense Oud 100ml EDP,"<p>Ameer Al Oudh Intense Oud by Lattafa Perfumes is a Amber fragrance for women and men. This is a new fragrance. Ameer Al Oudh Intense Oud was launched in 2021.</p>

<p>Top notes are Woodsy Notes and Agarwood (Oud)</p>

<p>Middle notes are Vanilla and Sugar</p>

<p>Base notes are Agarwood (Oud), Sandalwood and Herbal Notes.</p>

<p>Ameer Al Oudh Intense Oud by Lattafa, is an oriental fragrance with Oudh and smoky notes. The perfume is a blend of Oudh, woody notes, vanilla, sugar and labdanum. The predominant note is Oudh. The fragrance itself appears dry and smoky and is ideal for lovers of Oud scents and people who are looking for special and unusual perfumes.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1699.00,2075.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Ameer-Al-Oudh-Intense-oud-100ml-EDP.png?v=1779821239,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-raed-silver-100ml-edp,Lattafa Raed Silver 100ml EDP,"Ra'ed Silver by Lattafa Perfumes is an Amber Spicy fragrance for women and men. Ra'ed Silver was launched in 2021.Its a great long-lasting and masculine scent for Indian men.

The top notes are Citruses, Spices, and Mandarin Orange;

