lattafa-khamrah-100ml-edp,Lattafa Khamrah 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Khamrah 100ml EDP – A Captivating Unisex Masterpiece 🌟</p>

<p>Immerse yourself in the opulence of Lattafa Khamrah, a luxurious fragrance crafted in the UAE for men and women. This exquisite Eau de Parfum draws Inspiration from the highly coveted Kilian - Angel’s Share, offering a rich and intoxicating aroma that’s perfect for cool weather.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Cinnamon, Nutmeg, Bergamot<br>
(A warm and spicy opening with a zesty twist that captures attention instantly.)<br>
