lattafa-pride-blue-sapphire-100ml-edp,Lattafa Pride Blue Sapphire 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Pride Blue Sapphire is inspired by the Arabic words Latif for kindness and Lateefa for pleasant. Lattafa Pride Blue Sapphire is a ray of warmth with a touch of the extraordinary. With its cheerful and captivating demeanor, this fragrance celebrates joyous and lighthearted moments. A self-assured pure perfume that does not dominate but has an underlying coolness that is completely seductive. Subtle and fragrant, whatever the occasion is, Lattafa has the perfect fragrance for you which helps to charge the atmosphere with your presence.</p>

