<p>Winners Trophy Silver is a Woody-citrusy fragrance for unisex<br>
Top Notes: Mandarin, Olibanum<br>
Middle Notes: Lavender, Vanilla<br>
Base Notes: Cedarwood, Vetiver</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,2499.00,4000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Pride-Winner-Trophy-Silver-Eau-De-Parfum-100ml.png?v=1779821200,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-pride-ansaam-silver-100ml-edp,Lattafa Pride Ansaam Silver 100ml EDP,"<p>Ansaam Silver is another jewel from the Pride line, the perfume house of Lattafa, and will please both men and women with its special freshness.</p>

<p>Sweetly resinous cardamom with a richly spicy trace, opens its arms for the onset of citrusy bitter bergamot to present in a common duo expressive notes playing in the score between spices and fruits.</p>

<p>An outline of a floral touch, it is a lavender-cooling breeze, to which a velvet accord of majestic ambergris flows warmly, accented by bitter herbal wormwood, dissolving its sharpness into deliciously gourmand vanilla.</p>

<p>The finish reveals an earthy undertone, showing another green hue, this time in the form of patchouli.</p>

<p>Top notes: Cardamom, Bergamot.<br>
Middle notes: Lavender, Davana.<br>
Base notes: Vanilla, Pathcouli, Amber.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,2962.00,4000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Pride-Ansaam-Silver-Eau-De-Parfum-100ml.png?v=1779821200,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-pride-afaq-100ml-edp,Lattafa Pride Afaq 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Pride Afaq Perfume For Unisex EDP 100ml. it's a super long-lasting fragrance,</p>

<p>Afaq means in Arabic - world, universe, horizons - it is a richly exclusive concert of fragrant ingredients, hidden in a luxurious flacon depicting the composition of wood, on a golden foot, set in a black velvet bed, enclosed in a transparent dome - just look at this packaging , you will be tempted to explore the perfume that hides inside.</p>

<p>The opening fresh notes of crisp delicious pear, which is permeated with dazzling flowers, in which it vibrates with the noble beauty of tuberose and the tenderness of jasmine, reveal an intoxicating essence that embraces you.</p>

<p>A gourmandly gourmand scent, this is a trace of Cassie Liqueur made from spicy-carrying, blackcurrant, another of the deliciously sweet accords that flow to you from this uniquely composed fragrance.</p>

<p>Woods are gradually added, dominated by smooth milky sandalwood and a mixture of cashmeran, evoking a feeling of warmth and softness, with undertones of musk and fruit with a hint of radiant spice.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Pear, Cassis</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Tuberose, Jasmine</p>

<p>Base Notes: Cashmeran, Sandalwood</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,2699.00,4500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Pride-Afaq-Eau-De-Parfum-100ml.png?v=1779821198,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-pride-eternal-oud-100ml-edp,Lattafa Pride Eternal Oud 100ml EDP,"<p>Eternal Oud by Lattafa Perfumes is a Amber fragrance for women and men. This is a new fragrance. Eternal Oud was launched in 2022. This is a great hybrid of oriental scents with oud and aromatic notes. Oud can be intense for many and this perfume blends oud so well that its there but not harsh. It compliments the amber and vanilla so well.</p>

<p>Top notes are Plum and Grapefruit</p>

<p>Middle notes are Heliotrope and Orchid</p>

<p>Base notes are Benzoin, Amber, Vanilla, Tonka Bean, Agarwood (Oud) and Labdanum.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,2999.00,4500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Pride-Eternal-Oud-Eau-De-Parfum-100ml.png?v=1779821198,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-hayaati-gold-elixir-100ml-edp,Lattafa Hayaati Gold Elixir 100ml EDP,"<p>Introducing Hayaati Gold Elixir by Lattafa, a captivating fragrance that exudes opulence and allure. Crafted for both men and women, this exquisite Amber woody Spicy scent is a testament to timeless elegance. With its intoxicating blend of ingredients, this perfume leaves an everlasting impression, ensuring a truly luxurious experience.</p>

<p>At the top, the fragrance opens with the invigorating notes of Bergamot, Cassis, and Grapefruit, evoking a sense of freshness and vibrancy. As the scent develops, the heart reveals a harmonious composition of Peach, Leather, and Saffron, adding depth and sensuality. Finally, the base notes of Vanilla, Amber, Musk, and Vetiver create a warm and enveloping aura that lingers on the skin.</p>

<p>Hayaati Gold Elixir by Lattafa is a fragrance that seamlessly blends sophistication and intensity, making it an ideal choice for special occasions and intimate moments. Indulge in the allure of this fragrance, and let its long-lasting presence leave an indelible mark wherever you go. Experience the epitome of luxury with Hayaati Gold Elixir.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1699.00,2300.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Hayaati-Gold-Elixir-100-ML-EDP.png?v=1779821197,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-hayaati-al-maleky-blue-100ml-edp,Lattafa Hayaati Al Maleky Blue 100ml EDP,"<p>Hayaati Hayaati Al Maleky Blue, is an exquisite fragrance for men by the renowned Lattafa brand. This perfume is a captivating fusion of fresh fruity and woody notes, leaving an enchanting trail that lasts throughout the day.</p>

<p>The fragrance opens with a lively combination of Nutmeg, Pink Pepper, and Ginger, providing a tantalizing burst of spice and warmth. The invigorating essence of Bergamot adds a refreshing touch, further enhancing the vibrant character of this scent.</p>

<p>At its heart, a harmonious blend of Incense, Cedar, and Labdanum emerges, exuding a sense of sophistication and elegance. These woody notes create a captivating aura that is both alluring and charismatic.</p>

<p>The base notes, a blend of Woody Notes, Amber, Musk, and Ambergris, lend a luxurious and long-lasting quality to the fragrance. The warmth of Amber and the sensuality of Musk intertwine seamlessly, leaving an indelible impression on the senses.</p>

<p>Hayaati Hayaati Al Maleky is a masterpiece that embodies the essence of modern masculinity, offering an unforgettable olfactory experience for the discerning gentleman.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,1599.00,2300.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Hayaati-Al-Maleky-Blue-100-ML-EDP.png?v=1779821196,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-hayaati-black-100ml-edp,Lattafa Hayaati Black 100ml EDP,"<p>Indulge in the captivating allure of Hayaati Hayaati by Lattafa, a remarkable Woody Aromatic fragrance designed exclusively for men. Immerse yourself in the essence of luxury with this long-lasting scent that embraces sophistication and style.</p>

<p>Opening with a burst of freshness, the top notes of crisp Apple and zesty Bergamot awaken the senses, creating an invigorating and energetic aura. As the fragrance evolves, the heart reveals a warm and spicy blend of Cinnamon and Woodsy Notes, adding depth and richness to the composition. This alluring combination exudes a confident and charismatic presence.</p>

<p>Finally, the base notes of Musk and Vanilla emerge, leaving an irresistible trail that lingers in the air, making a lasting impression wherever you go. The smoothness of Musk intertwines with the creamy sweetness of Vanilla, adding a touch of sensuality and sophistication.</p>

<p>Hayaati Hayaati is a fragrance that embodies the essence of timeless elegance and leaves a lasting impression of luxury. Experience the allure of this exquisite scent and let it become an integral part of your distinguished persona.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,1799.00,2300.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Hayaati-Black-100-ML-EDP.png?v=1779821195,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,'1,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-ejaazi-intensive-silver-100ml-edp,Lattafa Ejaazi Intensive Silver 100ml EDP,"<p>Ejaazi Intensive Silver Perfume by Lattafa Brand is an exquisite fragrance designed specifically for men. With its aromatic fruity composition, this perfume offers a captivating scent that lingers throughout the day, leaving a lasting impression.</p>

<p>At the top of the fragrance, you will encounter the invigorating blend of Mandarin Orange and Grapefruit. These citrusy notes provide a refreshing and energetic opening, creating a sense of vibrancy and vitality.</p>

<p>As the fragrance develops, the heart notes of Cedar and Sea Notes come into play. The woody essence of Cedar adds depth and sophistication to the composition, while the Sea Notes introduce a hint of aquatic freshness. Together, these middle notes create a balanced fusion that is both alluring and captivating.</p>

<p>Finally, the base notes of Amber and Moss leave a lasting impression. Amber brings warmth and sensuality to the fragrance, enveloping the wearer in an aura of elegance and charm. The earthy tones of Moss add a touch of greenery, enhancing the overall depth and complexity of the scent.</p>

<p>The combination of these notes in Ejaazi Intensive Silver Perfume results in a fragrance that is both intriguing and long-lasting. Its aromatic fruity character is perfect for those who appreciate a harmonious blend of fresh and woody elements. Whether worn for special occasions or everyday use, this fragrance is sure to leave a lasting impression on those around you.</p>

<p>Lattafa Brand is renowned for its high-quality perfumes that offer a luxurious olfactory experience. Ejaazi Intensive Silver Perfume is no exception, showcasing the brand's commitment to excellence and attention to detail. With its long-lasting aroma and well-crafted notes, this fragrance is a testament to Lattafa's dedication to creating captivating scents for the discerning modern man.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1899.00,1999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Ejaazi-Intensive-Silver-Perfume-100-Ml-Edp.png?v=1779821194,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-rave-now-white-100ml-edp,Lattafa Rave Now White 100ml EDP,"<p>Rave Now White perfume by Lattafa, is a captivating fragrance that embodies the essence of freshness and elegance. Launched in 2023, this perfume is a testament to Lattafa's commitment to creating exceptional fragrances that leave a lasting impression.</p>

<p>Rave Now White opens with a burst of invigorating top notes, combining the succulent sweetness of peach with the vibrant zest of mandarin. The addition of tuberose adds a touch of floral sophistication, creating a harmonious blend that instantly uplifts your senses.</p>

<p>As the fragrance unfolds, the heart notes of gardenia, iris, and jasmine take center stage. The exquisite blend of these floral notes adds depth and complexity to the composition, evoking a sense of refined beauty and femininity.</p>

<p>Finally, the base notes of sandalwood, vanilla, and vetiver leave a warm and sensual trail, ensuring a long-lasting and memorable experience. The creamy richness of sandalwood combines seamlessly with the sweet allure of vanilla, while the earthy tones of vetiver add a touch of sophistication and depth.</p>

<p>Rave Now White is a fragrance that captivates with its fresh and citrusy character, making it ideal for everyday wear and special occasions alike. Its exceptional longevity ensures that you can confidently enjoy its enchanting aroma throughout the day and into the night.</p>

<p>Indulge in the allure of Rave Now White, a fragrance that embodies elegance, freshness, and timeless beauty. With its carefully selected notes and long-lasting performance, it is sure to become a cherished addition to your fragrance collection.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1480.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Rave-Now-White-EDP-100Ml.png?v=1779821193,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-pride-shaheen-silver-100ml-edp,Lattafa Pride Shaheen Silver 100ml EDP,"<p>Shaheen silver Lattafa perfume is a great Long lasting fragrance for men.</p>

<p>Lattafa Pride Shaheen Silver Perfume is an exceptional fragrance that captures the essence of the renowned and extravagantly priced Creed Aventus while offering an affordable alternative. This budget-friendly gem allows fragrance enthusiasts to indulge in the luxurious and captivating aroma without breaking the bank.</p>

<p>Opening with an invigorating burst of Cassis and Bergamot, the top notes of Lattafa Pride Shaheen Silver Perfume immediately captivate the senses. The vibrant and juicy Cassis intertwines with the uplifting citrusy notes of Bergamot, creating a refreshing and energetic introduction.</p>

<p>As the fragrance develops, the heart notes of Rose and Patchouli come to the forefront, adding depth and sophistication. The elegant and timeless essence of Rose blossoms, exudes a romantic and floral character. Patchouli, known for its earthy and woody qualities, complements the Rose, providing a warm and aromatic touch that adds complexity to the composition.</p>

<p>Finally, Lattafa Pride Shaheen Silver Perfume unveils its base notes, which consist of Musk, Oakmoss, and Amber. The sensual and musky allure of Musk intertwines with the deep and earthy aroma of Oakmoss, creating a robust foundation for the fragrance. Amber adds a touch of warmth and richness, enhancing the overall depth and longevity of the scent.</p>

<p>The combination of these notes in Lattafa Pride Shaheen Silver Perfume offers an enchanting experience reminiscent of the highly expensive Creed Aventus. It is a fragrance that exudes confidence, elegance, and sophistication, making it an ideal choice for any occasion.</p>

<p>With its affordability and exceptional quality, Lattafa Pride Shaheen Silver Perfume allows fragrance enthusiasts to enjoy a similar olfactory experience to Creed Aventus without compromising their budget. It's a fragrance that evokes luxury and prestige, making it a true gem for those seeking an affordable alternative to a renowned and expensive perfume.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Cassis, Bergamot</p>

<p>Middle Notes: Rose, Patchouli</p>

<p>Base Notes: Musk, Oakmoss, Amber</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,2499.00,4000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Pride-Shaheen-Silver-Eau-De-Parfum-100ml.png?v=1779821192,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-ana-abiyedh-i-am-white-60ml-edp,Lattafa Ana Abiyedh I Am White 60ml EDP,"<p>Introducing Lattafa Ana Abiyedh I am White, a captivating 100ML Eau de Parfum fragrance designed for both men and women. This delightful scent beautifully combines a harmonious blend of top, middle, and base notes that create a unique olfactory experience.</p>

<p>The top notes of Bergamot and Orange instantly capture your attention with their fresh and zesty aroma. These invigorating citrus notes provide a refreshing and uplifting start to the fragrance, setting the stage for the captivating journey that lies ahead.</p>

<p>As the scent unfolds, the heart reveals elegant notes of Vanilla and Pear. The luscious sweetness of Vanilla adds a creamy and comforting touch, while the delicate essence of Pear brings a fruity and succulent aspect to the composition. Together, these middle notes create a warm and inviting ambiance that envelops the wearer in a gentle embrace.</p>

<p>The base notes of Musk and Amber leave a lasting impression, ensuring that the fragrance lingers on the skin in a mesmerizing trail. Musk provides a sensual and animalic quality, adding depth and intrigue to the perfume. Amber, on the other hand, contributes a rich and captivating warmth, creating an irresistible allure that is both comforting and seductive.</p>

<p>Lattafa Ana Abiyedh I am White 100ML EDP perfume for men and women is a sophisticated and versatile fragrance that transcends gender boundaries. Its well-balanced blend of citrus, sweetness, and sensuality makes it suitable for any occasion, whether it be a casual day out or a special evening event. Embrace the enchanting journey that this fragrance offers and let it leave a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>Top notes are Bergamot and Orange</p>

<p>Middle notes are Vanilla and Pear</p>

<p>Base notes are Musk and Amber.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,1999.00,2300.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-ana-abiyedh-i-am-white-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779821191,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-rave-now-intense-100ml-edp,Lattafa Rave Now Intense 100ml EDP,"<p>Introducing Lattafa Rave Now Intense EDP 100ml, a captivating fragrance designed for the modern man who exudes confidence and charisma. This exquisite perfume is meticulously crafted to provide an unforgettable olfactory experience that lingers on the skin for an exceptionally long time, leaving a trail of enchantment wherever you go.</p>

<p>Inspired by the timeless classic La Nuit de L'Homme Eau Électrique by Yves Saint Laurent, Lattafa Rave Now Intense EDP pays homage to the original masterpiece while infusing its unique essence. This fragrance offers a luxurious and sensuous blend of notes that harmoniously fuse together, creating a scent that is both bold and refined.</p>

<p>At the top, the invigorating burst of Watermelon, Tangerine, and Cucumber sets the stage for an energizing and refreshing opening. The juicy sweetness of Watermelon is balanced by the zesty brightness of Tangerine, while the cool crispness of Cucumber adds a touch of sophistication.</p>

<p>As the scent develops, the heart reveals a compelling accord of Sage and Basil. The aromatic and herbal qualities of these middle notes lend an air of confidence and allure to the fragrance. Sage brings a sense of wisdom and depth, while Basil imparts a green, slightly spicy character that complements the overall composition.</p>

<p>Finally, the base notes of Sandalwood, Cedar, and Leather leave a lasting impression that is both warm and comforting. The creamy and woody facets of Sandalwood blend seamlessly with the aromatic nuances of Cedar, creating a luxurious foundation. The addition of Leather adds an element of allure and sensuality, providing the perfect finishing touch to this modern classic.</p>

<p>Lattafa Rave Now Intense EDP is an exceptional fragrance that embodies the spirit of sophistication and refinement. Its long-lasting nature ensures that you can confidently wear it throughout the day and into the night, making it an ideal companion for every occasion. Experience the allure of this remarkable scent, and indulge in the timeless elegance it brings to your style.</p>

<p>Top notes are Watermelon, Tangerine and Cucumber</p>

<p>Middle notes are Sage and Basil</p>

<p>Base notes are Sandalwood, Cedar and Leather.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1499.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Rave-Now-Intense-EDP-100Ml.png?v=1779821190,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-fakhar-extrait-100ml-edp,Lattafa Fakhar Extrait 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Fakhar Extrait Eau De Parfum, available in a generous 100ml bottle, is an olfactory masterpiece designed to captivate both men and women. This fragrance is more than just a scent; it's an enduring experience. The exceptional longevity of this perfume ensures you'll make a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>At the heart of Lattafa Fakhar Extrait Eau De Parfum lies a captivating blend of notes. The top notes are a zesty and invigorating mix of Grapefruit, Pink Pepper, and Cardamom, creating an exhilarating opening that immediately grabs your attention. As it settles, the middle notes reveal themselves, with Solar Notes, Artemisia, and Tuberose contributing to a unique and slightly mysterious character. Finally, the base notes of Labdanum, Cashmeran, Amber, and Leather lend an exquisite depth and sensuality to this fragrance, making it perfect for those special occasions.</p>

<p>Lattafa Fakhar Extrait Eau De Parfum is more than just an enchanting aroma; it's a pocket-friendly alternative to the luxurious 1 Million Parfum by Paco Rabanne. This Leather fragrance for men, with its striking resemblance to the renowned Paco Rabanne scent, offers a budget-friendly option without compromising on quality or allure.</p>

<p>Top notes are Grapefruit, Pink Pepper and Cardamom</p>

<p>Middle notes are Solar Notes, Artemisia and Tuberose</p>

<p>Base notes are Labdanum, Cashmeran, Amber and Leather.</p>

<p>Whether you're a man or a woman, Lattafa Fakhar Extrait Eau De Parfum will adorn you with an air of sophistication, leaving a trail of intrigue wherever you go. It's a fragrance that refuses to be forgotten, a testament to your unique style and elegance.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux de Parfum,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,5,deny,manual,2149.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Fakhar-Extrait-Eau-De-Parfum-100ml.png?v=1779821190,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edp,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-yara-tous-100ml-edp,Lattafa Yara Tous 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Yara Tous Perfume is a captivating olfactory experience that redefines luxury and sensuality. This exquisite 100ml Eau de Parfum for women boasts remarkable longevity, ensuring you stay enveloped in its enchanting aura all day long.</p>

<p>The fragrance opens with a burst of tropical allure, where the top notes of Coconut, Mango, and Passionfruit transport you to a paradisiacal world. These fruity nuances create an inviting and fresh introduction, setting the stage for the journey that awaits.</p>

<p>As the scent evolves, the heart notes emerge, weaving a delicate floral tapestry of Heliotrope, Jasmine, and Orange Blossom. This bouquet adds a layer of sophistication, combining the sweetness of jasmine with the powdery, almond-like scent of heliotrope, and the intoxicating bloom of orange blossom.</p>

<p>The perfume's allure deepens with its base notes, a rich and warm blend of Cashmeran, Vanilla, and Musk. These base notes provide a comforting, creamy, and sensual foundation that lingers on the skin, leaving an unforgettable trail. Cashmeran adds a woody and musky depth, while vanilla adds a sweet, gourmand touch, and musk infuses an enticing sensuality.</p>

<p>Lattafa Yara Tous Perfume is not just long-lasting; it's also uniquely captivating. This fragrance is a symphony of exotic fruits, elegant florals, and seductive base notes, making it a perfect choice for women and girls who appreciate a perfume that stands out and endures, leaving an indelible impression wherever they go. Indulge in this olfactory masterpiece, and let it accompany you on a journey of alluring sophistication and lasting allure.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,2199.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Yara-Tous-Perfume-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779821188,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-liam-blue-shine-100ml-edp,Lattafa Liam Blue Shine 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Liam Blue Shine 100ml Eau de Parfum for men is a fragrance that leaves an indelible impression, offering an exceptionally enduring scent experience. With its impressive longevity, this perfume is designed for the modern man who seeks a signature scent that will last throughout the day and into the night.</p>

<p>The top notes of Bergamot, Rosemary, and Pepper introduce a fresh and invigorating opening. The crispness of Bergamot pairs with the herbal depth of Rosemary, while the Pepper adds a touch of spiciness, making for an attention-grabbing initial impression.</p>

<p>In the heart of Liam Blue Shine, the fragrance transitions into a maritime symphony with Sea Notes and Violet. This combination creates a captivating and aquatic aura that's both refined and alluring, making it perfect for a wide range of occasions.</p>

<p>As the fragrance settles into the base notes, you'll discover the warmth of Amber, the earthiness of Patchouli, and the sensuality of Musk. These elements provide depth and complexity to the fragrance, leaving a remarkable, memorable trail that lingers on your skin and in the minds of those around you.</p>

<p>Top Notes : Bergamot, Pepper, Rosemary<br>
Heart Notes : Marine, Violet<br>
Base Notes : Patchouli, Amber, Musk</p>

<p>Liam Blue Shine is an exceptional alternative for those who appreciate Acqua di Giò Profondo by Giorgio Armani but are seeking a more budget-friendly option. This Aromatic Fougere fragrance embodies sophistication and versatility, making it an excellent choice for daily wear and special occasions. With its remarkable staying power, Liam Blue Shine ensures that you'll leave a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,2099.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Liam-Blue-Shine-100ml-EDP.png?v=1779821186,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-yara-100ml-edp,Lattafa Yara 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa's Yara Perfume, a captivating 100ml Eau de Parfum for women, is a fragrance that seamlessly weaves enchanting notes into an olfactory masterpiece. This scent is nothing short of captivating, leaving an enduring and delightful impression that lingers throughout the day and night.</p>

<p>The top notes of Tangerine, Heliotrope, and Orchid create an inviting and refreshing initial impression. These bright and citrusy notes are gracefully balanced by the subtle floral nuances, setting the stage for what's to come.</p>

<p>As the fragrance unfolds, the heart notes take center stage with a blend of Tropical Notes and Gourmand accords. This combination introduces an irresistible sweetness, reminiscent of exotic fruits and delectable treats. The heart notes evoke a sense of warmth and indulgence, making Yara a perfect companion for special occasions or everyday wear.</p>

<p>Finally, the fragrance settles into its rich and enduring base notes of Vanilla, Sandalwood, and Musk. This blend imparts depth and sensuality, leaving a lasting trail of elegance wherever you go. The oriental character of Yara's base notes adds a touch of mystery and sophistication to the overall composition.</p>

<p>TOP: Tangerine, Heliotrope, Orchid</p>

<p>HEART: Tropical Notes, Gourmand</p>

<p>BASE: Vanilla, Sandalwood, Musk</p>

<p>Yara is not just a perfume; it's an experience. Its long-lasting Eau de Parfum formula ensures that you remain enveloped in its alluring aura, from morning to night. This fragrance is the embodiment of timeless charm, suitable for women who seek a perfume that defines their individuality and leaves a lasting impression. Lattafa's Yara Perfume is a delightful journey through a world of scents, a testament to the brand's commitment to quality and elegance.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,2499.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Yara-Perfume-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779821185,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-yara-moi-100ml-edp,Lattafa Yara Moi 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Yara Moi Perfume is a luxurious olfactory masterpiece that captivates the senses with its enchanting blend of notes, making it the perfect olfactory accessory for the modern, confident woman. This 100ML Eau de Parfum boasts extraordinary longevity, ensuring that your signature scent lasts throughout the day and into the night.</p>

<p>At the heart of Yara Moi Perfume lies a harmonious composition that begins with a top note of Peach, exuding a luscious, juicy sweetness that instantly entices. Complementing this fruity allure is the delicate aroma of Jasmine, which lends a floral sophistication to the fragrance's initial impression.</p>

<p>As the perfume unfolds, the middle notes emerge to further enrich the olfactory journey. Caramel adds a delectable gourmand aspect to the scent, providing a mouthwatering sweetness that is both indulgent and alluring. Amber then weaves a warm, resinous depth into the composition, creating a rich and inviting heart.</p>

<p>The base notes of Patchouli and Sandalwood form a solid foundation for this enchanting fragrance. Patchouli contributes an earthy, slightly spicy dimension, while Sandalwood imparts a creamy, woody sensuality, leaving a lingering, memorable trail that embodies elegance and allure.</p>

<p>Top notes are Peach and Jasmine</p>

<p>Middle notes are Caramel and Amber</p>

<p>Base notes are Patchouli and Sandalwood.</p>

<p>Lattafa Yara Moi Perfume is a true statement fragrance for women who appreciate longevity and depth in their scents. Its evocative blend of Peach, Jasmine, Caramel, Amber, Patchouli, and Sandalwood harmoniously combines to create a fragrance that is as enduring as it is enchanting, making it the ideal choice for any occasion, from day to night.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,2249.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Yara-Moi-Perfume-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779821184,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-opulent-musk-100ml-edp,Lattafa Opulent Musk 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Opulent Musk is an exquisite 100ML Eau de Parfum designed for both men and women. This fragrance is a testament to the art of perfumery, encapsulating an air of luxury and opulence that lingers throughout the day. With remarkable longevity, it's a scent that will accompany you on your journey from morning till night, making a lasting impression.</p>

<p>At the heart of this olfactory masterpiece are meticulously selected notes that create an enchanting symphony. The top notes unveil a harmonious blend of White Musk, Saffron, and Lemon. This initial burst is refreshing, bright, and slightly spicy, setting the stage for what's to come. The heart of the fragrance reveals delicate White Flowers and Jasmine, adding a soft, floral elegance that gracefully balances the composition.</p>

<p>As the scent settles, the base notes of White Musk, Cedar, Amber, Resin, and Fir Resin take center stage. Here, the fragrance deepens, offering a rich, warm, and slightly resinous aroma that lingers on the skin, leaving a captivating and sensual trail.</p>

<p>Top notes are White Musk, Saffron and Lemon</p>

<p>Middle notes are White Flowers and Jasmine</p>

<p>Base notes are White Musk, Cedar, Amber, Resin and Fir Resin.</p>

<p>Lattafa Opulent Musk is reminiscent of the highly-praised Baccarat Rouge 540 by Maison Francis Kurkdjian and Instant Crush by Mancera, but it possesses a unique character that distinguishes it in the world of fragrances. It embodies sophistication, sensuality, and a touch of mystery. This fragrance is a statement of individuality and refined taste, making it the perfect choice for those who seek a scent that is both memorable and versatile, suiting any occasion and leaving a remarkable impression wherever you go.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,60ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,11,deny,manual,1699.00,2000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Opulent-Musk-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779821183,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-liam-silver-100ml-edp,Lattafa Liam Silver 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Liam Silver 100ml EDP for men is an olfactory masterpiece that offers a captivating and enduring scent experience. This fragrance is a testament to Lattafa's commitment to crafting high-quality scents at an affordable price, making it an excellent choice for those who appreciate both luxury and budget-conscious options.</p>

<p>Liam Silver is renowned for its exceptional longevity, ensuring that you remain enveloped in its intoxicating aura throughout the day and well into the night. This perfume embodies sophistication, making it the perfect choice for formal occasions, yet versatile enough for everyday wear.</p>

<p>At its opening, Liam Silver greets you with a tantalizing blend of cardamom, black tea, and fig. The top notes offer a spicy and slightly fruity introduction that instantly captures attention. As it evolves, the heart of the fragrance reveals an enchanting fusion of iris, vetiver, and labdanum. These middle notes provide a refined depth, infusing a sense of elegance into the scent. Finally, the fragrance settles into a warm and comforting base, where the woody richness of sandalwood, the sweetness of vanilla and tonka, and the earthy depth of patchouli come together to create an inviting and enduring dry-down.</p>

<p>Top notes are Fig, Cardamom and Black Tea</p>

<p>Middle notes are Labdanum, Iris and Vetiver</p>

<p>Base notes are Sandalwood, Vanilla, Patchouli and Tonka.</p>

<p>Liam Silver's ability to balance these notes beautifully, offering a harmonious and long-lasting fragrance, makes it an excellent alternative to Gris Charnel by BDK Parfums. This Amber Spicy fragrance is versatile, suitable for both men and women, and embodies the essence of luxury without breaking the bank. In essence, Lattafa Liam Silver is an olfactory gem, a budget-friendly revelation for those seeking a fragrant journey that transcends time and trends.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,2199.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Liam-Silver-100ml-EDP.png?v=1779821182,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-najdia-tribute-100ml-edp,Lattafa Najdia Tribute 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Najdia Tribute, a masterpiece in the world of fragrances, is a 100ml Eau de Parfum designed for men who appreciate the finer things in life. This scent is an olfactory journey that combines both classic and contemporary elements, making it the perfect choice for those who seek a unique and long-lasting aromatic experience.</p>

<p>With an opening burst of invigorating notes, Najdia Tribute sets the stage with zesty Ginger, Mandarin Orange, and a crisp Apple, all elegantly underscored by the timeless freshness of Bergamot. This initial explosion of citrus and fruit creates an irresistible allure that captivates the senses.</p>

<p>As the fragrance evolves, it unveils its heart, a rich and complex blend that includes Violet Leaf, Guaiac Wood, Saffron, and Cedar. These middle notes add depth and character, providing a sense of sophistication and masculinity that is both modern and classic.</p>

<p>Najdia Tribute's base notes exude strength and sensuality, with Leather, Ambergris, Agarwood (Oud), and Sandalwood forming a magnetic and long-lasting foundation. The warmth of Ambergris and the exotic allure of Oud harmonize with the smooth, woody nuances of Sandalwood and the seductive leather accord. This combination lingers on the skin, leaving a lasting impression that is both unforgettable and intensely masculine.</p>

<p>Top notes are Ginger, Mandarin Orange, Apple and Bergamot</p>

<p>Middle notes are Violet Leaf, Guaiac Wood, Saffron and Cedar</p>

<p>Base notes are Leather, Ambergris, Agarwood (Oud) and Sandalwood.</p>

<p>In essence, Lattafa Najdia Tribute is a tribute to timeless masculinity, combining the allure of tradition with the magnetism of the contemporary man. Its exceptional longevity ensures that you will be enveloped in this exquisite fragrance throughout the day, making it a distinctive choice for any occasion.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1550.00,1725.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Najdia-Tribute-100ml-EDP.png?v=1779821182,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-pride-shaheen-gold-100ml-edp,Lattafa Pride Shaheen Gold 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Pride Shaheen Gold Eau De Parfum, a fragrance designed for both women and men, is a captivating olfactory journey that leaves a lasting impression. This remarkable scent is not just a perfume; it's a testament to elegance and endurance.</p>

<p>Pride Shaheen Gold opens with an invigorating burst of fresh pineapple and zesty grapefruit, creating an enticing and revitalizing top note. These fruity elements dance together, setting the stage for an olfactory experience like no other.</p>

<p>As the fragrance evolves, the heart reveals a rich and harmonious blend of sweet fig and soothing lavender. This combination strikes a delicate balance between the sweet and the aromatic, making the scent alluring and comforting at the same time.</p>

<p>The base notes of vanilla, earthy patchouli, and warm, enveloping tonka bean provide a deep and long-lasting foundation. This symphony of base notes adds depth and sensuality to the fragrance, making it an ideal choice for those who seek a scent that lingers throughout the day and into the night.</p>

<p>Top notes are Pineapple and Grapefruit</p>

<p>Middle notes are Fig and Lavender</p>

<p>Base notes are Vanilla, Patchouli and Tonka.</p>

<p>Lattafa Pride Shaheen Gold Eau De Parfum is more than just a fragrance; it's a statement of endurance and sophistication. This unisex perfume is perfect for those who appreciate a long-lasting scent that combines the freshness of citrus with the warmth of aromatic and sweet elements. Pride Shaheen Gold embodies the essence of timeless allure for both men and women.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,2899.00,4000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Pride-Shaheen-Gold-Eau-De-Parfum-100ml.png?v=1779821180,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-azeezah-100ml-edp,Lattafa Azeezah 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Azeezah 100ML Eau de Parfum for women is a captivating and enduring fragrance that leaves a lasting impression. This perfume boasts an impressive longevity, ensuring you stay wrapped in its delightful aroma throughout the day or night.</p>

<p>At the top, it opens with a symphony of scents, including the invigorating freshness of Bergamot and Lemon, the rich allure of Almond, and the comforting warmth of Coffee. These top notes create an initial burst of energy and intrigue.</p>

<p>The heart of Lattafa Azeezah reveals an exquisite bouquet of floral and aromatic notes. Tuberose and Jasmine Sambac bring a seductive and sweet allure, while the Orange Blossom, Orris, and Bulgarian Rose add a touch of elegance and sophistication. This combination of middle notes is a delicate and harmonious blend that enchants the senses.</p>

<p>As the perfume settles, the base notes emerge to create a deep and enduring foundation. Tonka Bean, Cacao, and Vanilla infuse a gourmand sweetness, while Praline adds a nutty richness. The fragrance's woody and musky facets are enhanced by Sandalwood, Musk, Amber, Cashmere Wood, Cinnamon, Patchouli, and Cedar, delivering depth and complexity.</p>

<p>Top notes are Almond, Coffee, Bergamot and Lemon</p>

<p>Middle notes are Tuberose, Jasmine Sambac, Orange Blossom, Orris and Bulgarian Rose</p>

<p>Base notes are Tonka Bean, Cacao, Vanilla, Praline, Sandalwood, Musk, Amber, Cashmere Wood, Cinnamon, Patchouli and Cedar.</p>

<p>Lattafa Azeezah is an excellent alternative to the renowned Good Girl by Carolina Herrera, offering a budget-friendly option that doesn't compromise on quality. It falls under the category of an Amber Floral fragrance, making it perfect for women who appreciate a blend of sweet and floral notes with a hint of sensuality. This fragrance will undoubtedly make a bold statement, leaving an unforgettable trail wherever you go.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,1599.00,2300.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Azeezah-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779821179,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-mayar-100ml-edp,Lattafa Mayar 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Mayar Perfume is a captivating olfactory masterpiece in a 100ml Eau de Parfum that embodies sophistication, femininity, and enduring allure. Crafted for women who appreciate a fragrance that stands the test of time, Mayar is an exceptional choice.</p>

<p>Mayar opens with a delightful burst of freshness, where the top notes of Raspberry, Litchi, and Violet Leaf come together in a symphony of fruity and floral aromas. This initial impression is an enchanting prelude to the perfume's enduring beauty.</p>

<p>As Mayar evolves, it reveals a heart of elegant charm. The middle notes of Peony, White Rose, and Jasmine create a delicate, floral bouquet that is both tender and empowering. This floral core adds depth and complexity to the fragrance, making it perfect for any occasion.</p>

<p>What truly sets Mayar apart is its remarkable longevity. This Eau de Parfum lingers on your skin, ensuring that your signature scent lasts throughout the day and well into the night. The base notes of Vanilla and Musk infuse the perfume with a creamy, sensual warmth, leaving a lasting and memorable impression.</p>

<p>Top notes are Raspberry, Litchi and Violet Leaf</p>

<p>Middle notes are Peony, White Rose and Jasmine</p>

<p>Base notes are Vanilla and Musk.</p>

<p>Lattafa Mayar Perfume is more than just a fragrance; it's an olfactory experience that reflects the strength, elegance, and charisma of the modern woman. Whether you're heading to the office or stepping out for a special evening, Mayar is your faithful companion, ensuring that you leave an indelible mark wherever you go. Embrace the enduring charm of Mayar and let your presence linger in the hearts and minds of those you encounter.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,60ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,2099.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Mayar-Perfume-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779821178,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-aura-60ml-edp,Lattafa Aura 60ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Aura, a 60ml Eau de Parfum, is a fragrance that transcends gender boundaries. With remarkable longevity, it offers a unique olfactory experience for both women and men. This enchanting scent opens with a top note of saffron, which immediately sets the tone for a rich and luxurious olfactory journey.</p>

<p>As the fragrance unfolds, you'll discover a harmonious blend of balsam fir and jasmine in the heart notes. The balsam fir adds a touch of evergreen forest freshness, while the jasmine infuses an alluring floral sweetness, creating a well-balanced composition.</p>

<p>The base notes of Lattafa Aura are a symphony of sensuality, featuring ambergris, cashmeran, musk, cedarwood, and moss. This combination of ingredients creates a warm and inviting aura that lingers on the skin for hours, making it an excellent choice for those who appreciate long-lasting scents.</p>

<p>Lattafa Aura is celebrated for its similarity to the highly acclaimed Baccarat Rouge 540 by Maison Francis Kurkdjian, often referred to as a masterpiece in the fragrance world. This budget-friendly alternative captures the essence of Baccarat Rouge 540, with its amber floral profile, making it accessible to those who appreciate opulent scents without breaking the bank.</p>

<p>Top notes are Saffron and Jasmine</p>

<p>Middle notes are Amberwood and Ambergris</p>

<p>Base notes are Fir Resin and Cedar.</p>

<p>Lattafa Aura is more than just a fragrance; it's a journey of sensory delight that bridges the gap between genders, offering a captivating and long-lasting olfactory experience reminiscent of the finest fragrances in the world. Indulge in the affordable luxury of Lattafa Aura and let your presence leave an unforgettable trace in its wake.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,2120.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Aura-60ml-EDP.png?v=1779821177,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-khashabi-100ml-edp,Lattafa Khashabi 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Khashabi, a 100ml Eau de Parfum tailored for the modern man who seeks both elegance and longevity in his fragrance. This olfactory masterpiece is designed to leave an indelible impression, with an exceptional staying power that will carry you through the day and into the night. Lattafa Khashabi is the embodiment of refined masculinity.</p>

<p>At the top, zesty and invigorating notes of Lemon and Bergamot open the olfactory journey, creating an initial burst of freshness that sets the stage for what's to come. As the fragrance develops, the heart notes come into play. Jasmine, White Flowers, and Rose blend harmoniously, offering a delightful bouquet that is both floral and sophisticated. This aromatic middle phase adds a touch of romantic allure to the composition.</p>

<p>As the fragrance settles into its final act, the base notes take center stage. Woodsy Notes and Musk create a warm, embracing foundation that is undeniably masculine. The woody accords provide depth and stability, while Musk adds a sensual and enduring quality that lingers on the skin, making it perfect for special occasions or everyday wear.</p>

<p>Top notes are Lemon and Bergamot</p>

<p>Middle notes are Jasmine, White Flowers and Rose</p>

<p>Base notes are Woodsy Notes and Musk.</p>

<p>Lattafa Khashabi is a fragrance that makes a statement. Its long-lasting nature ensures that you'll leave a memorable trail wherever you go. This scent is the embodiment of sophistication, making it an ideal choice for the modern man who appreciates quality and endurance in his fragrances. Elevate your presence with Lattafa Khashabi, where freshness, floral elegance, and woody sensuality unite to create an unforgettable fragrance experience.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1799.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Khashabi-100ml-EDP.png?v=1779821177,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-mohra-100ml-edp,Lattafa Mohra 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Mohra 100ml Eau de Parfum for men is an olfactory masterpiece that promises a long-lasting and captivating fragrance experience. This budget-friendly gem stands as a remarkable alternative to the distinguished Halfeti Leather by Penhaligon's, known for its leather-infused allure. Mohra, an Eau de Parfum, belongs to the Leather fragrance family, making it an ideal choice for men who appreciate the rich and robust scent of leather.</p>

<p>At the top of the fragrance, Mohra opens with an exquisite blend of saffron, blood orange, lavender, and bergamot. The saffron adds a touch of luxury, while the zesty blood orange and bergamot create a vibrant and invigorating introduction. Lavender contributes a soothing and aromatic quality, setting the stage for the heart of the fragrance.</p>

<p>In the middle notes, Mohra takes an exciting turn with the inclusion of black pepper, rose, and cashmeran. The black pepper adds a spicy kick, while the rose provides a touch of elegance and floral charm. Cashmeran brings warmth and depth, balancing the composition beautifully.</p>

<p>The base notes are where the fragrance truly shines, with patchouli, sandalwood, cedar, labdanum, and musk. These elements work together to create a rich, woody foundation with smoky and resinous undertones. The interplay of these base notes ensures a lasting and memorable trail that lingers on your skin.</p>

<p>Top notes are Saffron, Blood Orange, Lavender and Bergamot;</p>

<p>Middle notes are Black Pepper, Rose and Cashmeran;</p>

<p>Base notes are Patchouli, Sandalwood, Cedar, Labdanum and Musk.</p>

<p>Mohra's exceptional longevity makes it a reliable choice for all-day wear, and its sophisticated blend of notes exudes a sense of luxury that belies its budget-friendly price point. This fragrance is a testament to the artistry of perfumery and offers a cost-effective option for those seeking a fragrance reminiscent of Halfeti Leather. With Mohra, Lattafa presents a compelling olfactory narrative that is bound to leave a lasting impression.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,12,deny,manual,1849.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Mohra100ml-EDP.png?v=1779821175,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-mohra-silky-rose-100ml-edp,Lattafa Mohra Silky Rose 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Mohra Silky Rose Perfume is a captivating and long-lasting olfactory masterpiece, designed for women who appreciate the allure of luxury but don't want to break the bank. This 100ml Eau de Parfum is a symphony of scents that will envelop you in an aura of sophistication and charm.</p>

<p>At the top, you'll be greeted by a delightful burst of Rose, Pink Pepper, and Litchi. This combination is a mesmerizing introduction, a floral and slightly spicy overture that immediately sets the stage for the opulent experience that follows. As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes of Rose, Musk, and Lily-of-the-Valley take center stage. The lush and velvety Rose remains dominant, while the Musk and Lily-of-the-Valley add depth and a touch of sweet innocence to the composition. Finally, in the base, the fragrance lingers with a captivating blend of Musk, Vanilla, and Patchouli. This rich and sensuous foundation ensures a memorable and long-lasting dry-down that will leave an impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>Mohra Silky Rose is reminiscent of the lavish scents found in two iconic and expensive fragrances, The Favourite by Penhaligon's and Delina by Parfums de Marly. With its rich and harmonious floral notes, it captures the essence of these high-end perfumes while being an affordable alternative that doesn't compromise on quality.</p>

<p>Top notes are Rose, Pink Pepper and Litchi</p>

<p>Middle notes are Rose, Musk and Lily-of-the-Valley</p>

<p>Base notes are Musk, Vanilla and Patchouli.</p>

<p>Indulge in the allure of luxury without the exorbitant price tag. Lattafa Mohra Silky Rose Perfume is a testament to the fact that opulence can be accessible, and beauty can be everlasting.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,1849.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Mohra-Silky-Rose-Perfume-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779821174,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-safwaan-lautre-musk-100ml-edp,Lattafa Safwaan Lautre Musk 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Safwaan Lautre Musk 100ml EDP: A Fragrance for Men and Women</p>

<p>Lattafa Safwaan Lautre Musk is a captivating unisex fragrance that comes in a 100ml Eau de Parfum bottle. This perfume offers a symphony of scents that intertwine seamlessly, creating a unique olfactory experience that lingers throughout the day and into the night.</p>

<p>Long-Lasting Elegance:</p>

<p>One of the most remarkable features of Lattafa Safwaan Lautre Musk is its exceptional longevity. This fragrance is designed to endure, making it an ideal choice for those who seek a scent that lasts from dawn to dusk. It gracefully transitions from day to night, ensuring you smell alluring no matter the occasion.</p>

<p>Sensational Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: The fragrance opens with a fresh and powdery blend of White Musk and Iris. The White Musk provides a clean and airy beginning, while Iris adds a touch of sophistication and elegance. This combination is the perfect introduction to the fragrance.</p>

<p>Heart Notes: Moving to the heart of the scent, you'll discover the delightful harmony of Vanilla and Coconut. These sweet, creamy notes add a warm and inviting dimension to the fragrance, evoking feelings of comfort and sensuality.</p>

<p>Base Notes: The fragrance settles into a captivating base of Heliotrope and Amber. Heliotrope brings a powdery, almond-like scent, while Amber contributes depth and complexity. This foundation ensures that Lattafa Safwaan Lautre Musk leaves a lasting impression.</p>

<p>A Unisex Masterpiece:</p>

<p>Lattafa Safwaan Lautre Musk is a fragrance that transcends gender boundaries. Its versatility allows both men and women to revel in its enchanting aroma, making it an excellent choice for couples who appreciate shared scents. This fragrance exemplifies the idea that beauty knows no gender, and its allure will undoubtedly leave an indelible mark on all who encounter it.</p>

<p>In summary, Lattafa Safwaan Lautre Musk 100ml EDP is a long-lasting fragrance that weaves together a symphony of White Musk, Iris, Vanilla, Coconut, Heliotrope, and Amber. Its unisex appeal ensures it's a versatile choice for all, while its enduring elegance makes it a scent to remember. Discover a fragrance that lingers, defines, and enchants with every spray.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1749.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Safwaan-Lautre-Musk-100ml-EDP.png?v=1779821173,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-bayaan-100ml-edp,Lattafa Bayaan 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Bayaan 100ml Eau de Parfum for men is an olfactory masterpiece that encapsulates a harmonious blend of notes, designed for the modern gentleman who seeks to make a lasting impression. This fragrance is a captivating journey through layers of scents that combine to create a truly unforgettable experience.</p>

<p>Boasting remarkable longevity, Lattafa Bayaan ensures that your presence lingers in the minds of those around you, leaving a trail of sophistication and allure. This fragrance is an ideal choice for those who appreciate a perfume that endures throughout the day and into the night.</p>

<p>At the top, the scent unfolds with a burst of vibrancy, with notes of Cassis, Cinnamon, Lychee, and Pink Pepper. The initial impression is one of spicy sweetness tempered with a touch of fruitiness. This leads into the heart of the fragrance, where Cardamom, Orange Flower, Rose, and Praline intertwine to create an alluring and complex aroma that balances floral, spicy, and gourmand elements.</p>

<p>As the scent matures, it settles into a captivating base, featuring Oud, Vanilla, and Moss. This combination adds depth and complexity to the fragrance, with the exotic allure of Oud blending seamlessly with the warmth of Vanilla and the earthy richness of Moss.</p>

<p>Lattafa Bayaan is a luxurious and enduring Eau de Parfum that offers an intriguing journey of scent, making it a must-have for men who desire a fragrance that leaves an indelible mark. With its unique and well-crafted composition, it stands as a testament to the artistry of perfumery.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,60ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,2249.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Bayaan-100ml-EDP.png?v=1779821172,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-ana-abiyedh-poudree-60ml-edp,Lattafa Ana Abiyedh Poudree 60ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Ana Abiyedh Poudree is an exquisite olfactory masterpiece, a 100ML Eau de Parfum designed for women who appreciate the allure of enduring fragrances. This enchanting perfume offers a sensory journey that unfolds over time, making it the perfect choice for those who crave a long-lasting, evocative scent.</p>

<p>At its very inception, Ana Abiyedh Poudree opens with a dazzling burst of floral elegance. The top notes of Rose, Orange Blossom, and Jasmine unite to create a symphony of floral harmony that's both delicate and alluring. These notes play together with a finesse that is simply captivating, setting the stage for the rich experience that follows.</p>

<p>In the heart of this fragrance, the singular note of Musk emerges, adding a sensuous and creamy dimension to the composition. It weaves a soft and lingering thread throughout, enhancing the overall depth and character of the scent.</p>

<p>As Ana Abiyedh Poudree reaches its final act, the base notes take center stage. A complex interplay of Vanilla, Tonka Bean, Cedar, Vetiver, and Patchouli create a mesmerizing and warm embrace that lingers on the skin for hours. The woody and earthy base notes ground the perfume, while the sweet, creamy, and slightly spicy elements of Vanilla and Tonka Bean add an irresistible sweetness.</p>

<p>This fragrance is a tribute to femininity, leaving a lasting impression wherever you go. Lattafa Ana Abiyedh Poudree is a fragrance that not only adorns the wearer but becomes a part of their essence, making it a truly exceptional and long-lasting perfume for the woman who desires an enchanting and memorable olfactory experience.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,9,deny,manual,1799.00,2300.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Ana-Abiyedh-Poudree-100ML-EDP.png?v=1779821171,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-haya-100ml-edp,Lattafa Haya 100ml EDP,"<p>Introducing Lattafa Haya Perfume, a captivating fragrance experience that leaves a trail of elegance and allure in its wake. This 100ML Eau de Parfum for women is a testament to sophistication and lasting beauty.</p>

<p>Lattafa Haya is not just a perfume; it's an olfactory journey. The moment you apply it, you'll be entranced by its impressive longevity, making it your faithful companion throughout the day and into the night.</p>

<p>This exquisite scent is a symphony of notes that dance on your skin. At the top, effervescent Champagne and zesty Blood Orange blend harmoniously with the sweetness of Strawberry, Rose, and the refreshing burst of Tangerine. These opening notes create a delightful and vivacious introduction to the fragrance.</p>

