lattafa-ramaad-al-oud-100ml-edp,Lattafa Ramaad Al Oud 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Ramaad Al Oud, a masterpiece in the world of fragrances, is a symphony of olfactory artistry designed for the modern man seeking an aura of sophistication and distinctiveness. This 100ml Eau de Parfum is more than just a fragrance; it's an olfactory journey that captivates the senses and leaves an indelible mark.</p>

<p>Unleash your inner charisma with Ramaad Al Oud's intoxicating blend of notes. It opens with a tantalizing burst of woody, mild spicy accords that create an immediate air of mystery. As you delve deeper into its essence, the leathery undertones provide a rich, luxurious backdrop that exudes confidence and strength.</p>

<p>The sweetness within this fragrance is subtle, adding depth and intrigue to the composition. It's not overpowering but lingers, leaving a trail of fascination in your wake. What truly sets Ramaad Al Oud apart is its unparalleled uniqueness. The scent is unlike anything you've experienced before, making it a rare gem in the world of perfumery.</p>

<p>Longevity is a hallmark of this Eau de Parfum. Once applied, it becomes your steadfast companion throughout the day, emanating an aura of refinement that lingers on your skin and in the memories of those you encounter.</p>

<p>Lattafa Ramaad Al Oud is more than a fragrance; it's an olfactory signature, a reflection of your individuality. With its woody, mild spicy, leathery, sweet, and remarkably unique aroma, it's the perfect choice for the discerning man who dares to stand out and leave an enduring impression.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,1499.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Ramaad-Al-Oud-100ml-EDP.png?v=1779821169,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-raghba-wood-intense-100ml-edp,Lattafa Raghba Wood Intense 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Raghba Wood Intense Eau de Parfum for Men, available in a generous 100ml bottle, is a fragrance that defines sophistication and charm. This perfume is not just long-lasting; it's an olfactory journey that lasts throughout your day, leaving an unforgettable trail of allure.</p>

<p>The Top notes of Caramel, Guaiac Wood, Licorice, and Cedar provide a rich, inviting opening that is both sweet and woody. As it settles, the heart of this fragrance unfolds with a warm blend of Sugar, Agarwood (Oud), Sandalwood, and Cashmere Wood, infusing depth and character into the scent. The base notes of Incense, Vanilla, Amber, Oakmoss, and Musk create a sublime and enduring dry-down that envelops you in an aura of mystique and sensuality.</p>

