lattafa-badee-al-oud-honor-glory-100ml-edp,Lattafa Badee Al Oud Honor & Glory 100ml EDP,"Lattafa Bade’e Al Oud Honor &amp; Glory Eau de Parfum is an exquisite fragrance that transcends gender boundaries, a captivating olfactory masterpiece designed to grace both men and women. This fragrance, presented in a generous 100ml bottle, offers an unforgettable, long-lasting experience that lingers throughout the day and night.

At the top of this olfactory symphony, a tantalizing blend of Pineapple and Creme Brulee creates an enchanting sweetness that immediately captivates the senses. This intriguing sweetness gives way to a heart of warmth and spice, where Cinnamon, Benzoin, Turmeric, and Black Pepper intermingle to deliver a dynamic and complex aromatic journey. The spiciness is perfectly balanced with the sweetness, creating a harmonious and alluring combination.

As the fragrance settles, the base notes emerge to provide a rich and lasting impression. Vanilla adds a creamy depth, while Cashmeran infuses an ethereal softness. The woody notes of Sandalwood, combined with the earthy essence of Moss, add a touch of nature's elegance, completing the fragrance with a sense of depth and sophistication.

Top notes are Pineapple and Creme Brulee

Middle notes are Cinnamon, Benzoin, Turmeric and Black Pepper

Base notes are Vanilla, Cashmeran, Sandalwood and Moss.

Lattafa Bade’e Al Oud Honor &amp; Glory EDP is a unisex scent that celebrates the strength and individuality of both men and women. It is a true olfactory representation of honor and glory, capturing the essence of self-assurance and sophistication in a single bottle. Whether worn during the day or for a special evening out, this fragrance is an enduring symbol of luxury and distinction.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,7,deny,manual,2699.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Honor-and-glory-lattafa.png?v=1779821167,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-blend-of-lattafa-100ml-edp,Lattafa Blend Of Lattafa 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa's ""Blend of Lattafa"" is a captivating olfactory masterpiece that encapsulates luxury, sophistication, and durability within a 100ml Eau de Parfum for men. This fragrance is renowned for its remarkable longevity, making it the perfect choice for those who desire an enduring, alluring scent that lingers throughout the day.</p>

<p>At the top of this aromatic journey, you'll be greeted by an enticing blend of Bergamot, Cinnamon, Saffron, and Lavender. These opening notes create an invigorating and spicy introduction, setting the stage for a memorable experience.</p>

<p>The heart of ""Blend of Lattafa"" features an exquisite fusion of Incense, Rose, Orange Blossom, and Cypriol Oil, also known as Nagarmotha. These middle notes add depth and complexity to the composition, evoking a sense of mystery and sensuality that is both intriguing and alluring.</p>

<p>As the fragrance matures and settles, it unveils a rich and luxurious base composed of Leather, Vanilla, Amber, Agarwood, and Sandalwood. These deep, warm base notes create a harmonious and seductive trail that leaves a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>

<p>Top notes are Bergamot, Cinnamon, Saffron and Lavender</p>

<p>Middle notes are Incense, Rose, Orange Blossom and Cypriol Oil or Nagarmotha</p>

<p>Base notes are Leather, Vanilla, Amber, Agarwood and Sandalwood.</p>

<p>""Blend of Lattafa"" is a symphony of scents that strike a perfect balance between classic and contemporary. Its combination of spicy, floral, and woody elements creates an exquisite aroma that is suitable for any occasion, from formal events to casual outings. This fragrance is a testament to Lattafa's commitment to crafting enduring and high-quality scents, and it stands as a testament to the brand's dedication to excellence in perfumery. Experience the allure and charm of ""Blend of Lattafa"" as it lingers on your skin, leaving a trail of elegance and distinction that captivates all those who encounter it.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,2399.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Blend-of-lattafa.png?v=1779821167,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-suqraat-100ml-edp,Lattafa Suqraat 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Suqraat is an exceptional fragrance that epitomizes timeless elegance and sophistication, housed in a 100ml Eau de Parfum bottle designed to charm the senses. Crafted for men who appreciate the finer things in life, Suqraat stands out as a remarkable olfactory masterpiece known for its extraordinary longevity.</p>

<p>At the top, the fragrance bursts to life with invigorating notes of Bergamot and Ginger. This initial burst is a zesty and spicy blend that awakens the senses and sets the stage for an olfactory journey that is truly remarkable.</p>

<p>As Suqraat unfolds, the heart notes reveal themselves, and it's a delicate dance of Violet Leaf and Lavender. The herbal, slightly floral nuances of these heart notes infuse the scent with a calming and refined quality, striking a harmonious balance with the vivacity of the top notes.</p>

<p>The fragrance's true character shines in the base notes, where Musk, Sandalwood, and Amber take center stage. The deep, sensual warmth of Musk combines seamlessly with the creamy, woody nuances of Sandalwood, creating a foundation that's simultaneously comforting and enticing. The Amber note adds a subtle touch of resinous sweetness, enriching the overall composition.</p>

<p>Suqraat is not just a fragrance; it's an olfactory experience that lingers on the skin for an extended period. Its long-lasting nature ensures that you remain enveloped in its luxurious aroma throughout the day or evening.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Bergamot and Ginger<br>
Heart Notes: Violet Leaf and Lavender<br>
Base Notes: Musk, Sandalwood, and Amber</p>

<p>Lattafa Suqraat is a testament to the brand's commitment to offering high-quality, budget-friendly fragrances that rival even the most renowned luxury scents. This Eau de Parfum is the ideal companion for the modern man who desires a fragrance that exudes confidence, sophistication, and endurance.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1899.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Suqraat.png?v=1779821165,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-pride-nebras-100ml-edp,Lattafa Pride Nebras 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Pride Nebras Eau De Parfum is a captivating olfactory masterpiece designed for both men and women, transcending traditional gender boundaries. This unisex fragrance offers an enduring sensory journey, with remarkable longevity that will keep you enveloped in its enchanting aura throughout the day or night.</p>

<p>At the top of the fragrance, you'll encounter a delightful burst of Red Berries and Mandarin Orange, creating an invigorating and zesty opening that piques your senses. These vibrant notes provide an initial burst of freshness that sets the stage for the complex layers to follow.</p>

<p>In the heart of Nebras, Vanilla, Cacao, and Rose intermingle to craft a rich and warm bouquet of scents. The interplay of velvety vanilla and the alluring sweetness of cacao combines harmoniously with the romantic, floral essence of rose, adding depth and complexity to the fragrance.</p>

<p>As the scent develops, the base notes emerge to ground Nebras in a sensual and lasting embrace. Sugar, Tonka Bean, Amber, and Musk come together to create a smooth, slightly sweet, and sensually musky foundation. This base provides a warm and comforting trail that lingers on the skin, making a memorable and long-lasting impression.</p>

<p>Top notes are Red Berries and Mandarin Orange</p>

<p>Middle notes are Vanilla, Cacao and Rose</p>

<p>Base notes are Sugar, Tonka Bean, Amber and Musk.</p>

<p>Lattafa Pride Nebras is not just a fragrance; it's an olfactory journey that gracefully bridges the boundaries of gender, making it a perfect choice for anyone seeking a captivating and enduring scent. This Eau De Parfum is a testament to Lattafa's commitment to quality and craftsmanship, promising to leave a mark of elegance wherever it's worn.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,2999.00,4000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-pride-nebras.png?v=1779821165,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-hayaatim-100ml-edp,Lattafa Hayaatim 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Hayaatim 100ML Eau de Parfum for Men is a captivating olfactory journey that beautifully encapsulates freshness and fruitiness, making it the perfect fragrance for those who crave a long-lasting and invigorating scent. This fragrance opens with a burst of zesty energy, blending the crisp notes of pineapple and bergamot with the sweet, juicy aroma of apple. These top notes provide an immediate sense of freshness that lingers throughout the day.</p>

<p>As Lattafa Hayaatim evolves, the heart of the fragrance emerges, revealing an enchanting blend of patchouli, jasmine, and rose. These middle notes add a touch of floral elegance and sophistication, balancing the initial fruitiness with a subtle, yet distinctive, floral bouquet.</p>

<p>The fragrance reaches its full crescendo as it dries down to reveal a harmonious base composed of musk, vanilla, oakmoss, sandalwood, cedarwood, and ambergris. This complex base imparts depth and character, enhancing the overall longevity of the scent while creating a warm and inviting aura that's perfect for daytime wear.</p>

<p>Lattafa Hayaatim is a versatile and safe choice suitable for individuals of all age groups. Its fresh and fruity profile ensures that it is never overwhelming, making it ideal for casual, professional, or everyday wear. With its exceptional longevity and balanced composition, this Eau de Parfum is a true standout in the realm of fragrances, offering a refreshing and enduring experience that will leave a lasting impression.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,1899.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-hayaatim.png?v=1779821163,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-vurv-assoluto-intense-100ml-edp,Lattafa Vurv Assoluto Intense 100ml EDP,"<p>Vurv Assoluto Intense By Lattafa is an olfactory masterpiece designed for the modern woman who exudes confidence and sensuality. This 100ML Eau de Parfum is a fragrant symphony that weaves an enchanting and long-lasting aura around you, making it a must-have addition to your collection.</p>

<p>At its heart, Vurv Assoluto Intense is a harmonious blend of delicate and daring notes. The initial burst of crisp apple awakens your senses with its fruity vivacity, offering a fresh and inviting start. This is complemented by the alluring sweetness of orange blossom, which adds a touch of floral elegance to the composition. Orchid, the heart's jewel, lends an exotic and exotic quality to the fragrance, creating a captivating, multi-faceted floral bouquet that lingers in the air.</p>

<p>As the perfume unfolds, it descends into a warm and alluring base. Labdanum, with its resinous and ambery character, adds depth and richness to the scent, evoking a sense of mystery and sophistication. Caramel, the final note, infuses Vurv Assoluto Intense with a delectable sweetness that's both comforting and enticing, leaving a memorable, delectable trail in your wake.</p>

<p>This fragrance is the epitome of elegance and passion, perfect for special occasions or everyday wear when you want to make a lasting impression. Lattafa Vurv Assoluto Intense 100ML EDP is a statement of your individuality, a symbol of your allure, and a testament to your style. It's a captivating scent that will accompany you throughout the day, ensuring you leave an unforgettable mark wherever you go.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1299.00,2200.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Vurv-Assoluto-Intense-Perfume.png?v=1779821162,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-pride-thouq-80ml-edp,Lattafa Pride Thouq 80ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Pride Thouq Eau De Parfum is a captivating fragrance designed for the modern woman who seeks a scent that not only lingers but also leaves an unforgettable impression. With its impressive longevity, this perfume is a true olfactory gem. In every spritz, you embark on a sensory journey that lasts for hours, making it perfect for all-day wear and special occasions.</p>

<p>At the top, the fragrance unfolds with the sparkling freshness of Bergamot and the sweet succulence of Litchi. These notes create an invigorating and inviting introduction that sets the stage for what's to come.</p>

<p>The heart of Pride Thouq is a harmonious blend of delicate Rose and mystical Incense. The Rose adds a soft, floral elegance to the scent, while the Incense provides depth and a touch of the exotic. This combination is both alluring and enchanting, making it a perfect choice for women who appreciate complexity in their fragrances.</p>

<p>The base notes of Amber and Vetiver anchor the composition with warmth and sensuality. Amber imparts a subtle sweetness, while Vetiver adds a woody, earthy depth that lingers on the skin.</p>

<p>Top notes: bergamot, lychee.</p>

<p>Middle notes: rose, incense.</p>

<p>Base notes: amber, vetiver.</p>

<p>What makes this fragrance even more remarkable is its resemblance to the renowned Delina Exclusif by Parfums de Marly. Lattafa Pride Thouq Eau De Parfum offers an affordable alternative to this high-end favorite, making luxury accessible to all. With its luxurious scent and long-lasting nature, Pride Thouq is a fragrance that empowers women with confidence and sophistication, leaving a trail of elegance wherever they go. This perfume is a testament to the fact that luxury can be attainable without compromise.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,3199.00,4700.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-pride-thouq.png?v=1779821161,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-pride-lahdath-80ml-edp,Lattafa Pride Lahdath 80ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Pride Lahdath Eau De Parfum for Women is a captivating and long-lasting fragrance that is sure to leave a lasting impression. This 80ml EDP is the epitome of luxury and sophistication, designed for the modern woman who exudes confidence and elegance.</p>

<p>The top notes of Rose and Lemon immediately grab your attention with their fresh and invigorating aroma. As the scent evolves, you'll be enveloped by the heart of the fragrance, where the delicate and enchanting notes of Rose blend seamlessly with the sweet and indulgent essence of Caramel. This harmonious combination creates a sense of warmth and sensuality, making it perfect for special occasions or everyday wear.</p>

<p>As the perfume dries down, the base notes of Vanilla, Cedarwood, and Musk come into play, adding depth and longevity to the scent. The rich and creamy Vanilla infuses the fragrance with a sweet and comforting aura, while the woody notes of Cedarwood provide a touch of sophistication. Musk, with its soft and alluring nature, lingers on the skin, leaving a seductive and unforgettable trail.</p>

<p>Top Notes: Iris, Lemon, Sage<br>
Heart Notes: Ylang-Ylang, Mint, Violet Leaves<br>
Base Notes: Sandalwood, Cedarwood, Tobacco, Oak Moss, Amber, Musk, Patchouli</p>

<p>Lattafa Pride Lahdath is often hailed as a remarkable Inspired of the renowned Roses Vanille by Mancera, offering a budget-friendly alternative without compromising on quality and performance. This fragrance not only showcases your unique style but also ensures that you remain memorable wherever you go. Whether you're heading to a formal event or simply want to feel extraordinary every day, Lattafa Pride Lahdath Eau De Parfum is your perfect olfactory companion. It's a testament to your individuality and an embodiment of timeless allure.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,80ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,3199.00,4700.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-pride-lahdath.png?v=1779821160,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-niche-emarati-antique-100ml-edp,Lattafa Niche Emarati Antique 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa's Niche Emarati Antique Parfum for Men is a fragrance that exemplifies luxury, timelessness, and unparalleled longevity. Crafted to perfection, this scent is a truly unique olfactory experience that caters to the connoisseur in you.</p>

<p>Upon the initial spray, you're greeted by an exquisite blend of top notes that set the tone for the journey ahead. Cardamom adds a touch of spicy intrigue, while fig and coconut bring a tropical sweetness that's tempered by the creamy allure of milk and the deep, earthy richness of black tea. These opening notes create a captivating fusion that immediately captures attention.</p>

<p>As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes take center stage. Here, the velvety iris intertwines with the earthy elegance of vetiver, creating a complex and alluring core. Jasmine adds a subtle floral brightness, lending a sense of timeless sophistication to the blend.</p>

<p>The dry-down is where the true magic of Niche Emarati Antique unfolds. Amber lends a warm, resinous depth, while sandalwood and tonka bean infuse an opulent creaminess. Caramel adds a hint of gourmand sweetness, and musk brings a sensual, lingering quality that lasts for hours on end.</p>

<p>Top notes: Cardamon, Fig, Coconut, Milk, Black Tea<br>
Middle notes: Iris, Vetiver, Jasmine<br>
Base notes: Amber, Sandalwood, Tonka Bean, Caramel, Musk</p>

<p>This fragrance is a masterpiece that showcases the art of perfumery at its finest. With a classic, unique, and long-lasting composition, Lattafa's Niche Emarati Antique EDP is the epitome of elegance, making it a must-have for any man seeking a scent that transcends time and leaves a lasting impression.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,80ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,4650.00,5999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-antique-niche-emarati-perfumes.png?v=1779821159,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-niche-emarati-al-dana-100ml-edp,Lattafa Niche Emarati Al Dana 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Niche Emarati Al Dana 100ml Eau de Parfum for Men is an olfactory masterpiece that encapsulates the essence of luxury and sophistication. This fragrance is a testament to Lattafa's commitment to creating unique and exquisite scents that leave a lasting impression.</p>

<p>At first spritz, you're greeted with an invigorating burst of fresh citrus notes that include Bergamot, Lemon, Pineapple, Pepper, and Lime. This top note medley is an uplifting and energizing start, immediately grabbing your attention. The citrusy opening creates a sense of vitality and sets the stage for what's to come.</p>

<p>As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes reveal a harmonious blend of Jasmine, Lily of the Valley, and Olibanum. These floral and resinous elements add depth and complexity to the composition, while maintaining the overall freshness.</p>

<p>The base notes, which linger on your skin for hours, feature a captivating fusion of Patchouli, Amber, Woody accords, a touch of Smokiness, and Musk. These elements give Lattafa Niche Emarati Al Dana its distinctive and enduring character. The fragrance's longevity is truly exceptional, making it an ideal choice for those who seek a long-lasting scent that carries them through the day and into the night.</p>

