lattafa-emeer-100ml-edp,Lattafa Emeer 100ml EDP,"<p>Indulge in the opulence of Lattafa Emeer Eau De Parfum, a 100ml bottle of pure sophistication for men. This super long-lasting and premium fragrance is a captivating blend of meticulously selected notes that elevate your olfactory experience to new heights.</p>

<p>The journey begins with a burst of citrus freshness, as zesty Lemon and Bergamot intertwine with the crispness of Juniper Berries and the herbal allure of Clary Sage. This invigorating symphony sets the stage for an unforgettable fragrance experience.</p>

<p>As the scent evolves, the heart notes come to life with an intriguing blend of Cardamom's spicy warmth, the delicate essence of White Tea, the creamy richness of Sandalwood, and the timeless allure of Olibanum. This harmonious combination creates a captivating and balanced olfactory profile.</p>

<p>The grand finale unfolds with a rich and enduring base. Ambergris adds a touch of sensuality, while Cashmeran brings a warm and musky depth. Patchouli contributes earthiness, and Cedarwood provides a solid, woody foundation. Together, these base notes create a lasting impression that lingers throughout the day, making Emeer an emblem of timeless elegance.</p>

<p>Top Note: Lemon, Bergamot, Juniper Berries, Clary Sage<br>
Heart Note: Cardamon, White Tea, Sandalwood, Olibanum<br>
Base Note: Ambergris, Cashmeran, Patchouli, Cedarwood</p>

<p>Lattafa Emeer is not just a fragrance; it's an expression of refined taste and enduring charisma. Immerse yourself in the luxury of this exquisite perfume, designed for those who appreciate the finer things in life.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA, men, Party",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,32,deny,manual,3799.00,5000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Emeer.png?v=1779821154,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-ajayeb-dubai-100ml-edp,Lattafa Ajayeb Dubai 100ml EDP,"<p>Experience the epitome of opulence with Lattafa Ajayeb Dubai Eau De Parfum, a captivating fragrance that transcends gender boundaries. Unveiling a symphony of enduring notes, this scent is an ode to timeless allure, perfect for those who seek a fragrance that lingers throughout the day.</p>

<p>Lattafa Ajayeb Dubai opens with a burst of citrusy brightness, where the zesty accord of orange and lemon dances in perfect harmony. This lively introduction creates an immediate sense of freshness, setting the stage for the journey into the heart of the fragrance.</p>

<p>As the scent evolves, the heart notes unfold, revealing a lush blend of jasmine, mango, and osmanthus. The floral elegance of jasmine intertwines with the sweet succulence of mango, creating a delightful and fruity bouquet. Osmanthus adds a touch of sophistication, elevating the composition to a higher level of olfactory delight.</p>

<p>The base notes of amber, sandalwood, musk, and oud form the olfactory foundation of this fragrance. Rich amber imparts a warm, honeyed character, seamlessly blending with the woody and creamy essence of sandalwood. Musk adds a sensuous depth, while oud, with its resinous and slightly smoky undertones, contributes an exotic touch that lingers on the skin.</p>

<p>The honey-fruity amber-based composition of Lattafa Ajayeb Dubai Eau De Parfum ensures an enduring olfactory experience. This fragrance is not merely a scent; it's a statement of luxury, a lingering trail of sophistication that effortlessly captivates the senses. Embrace the enchanting allure of Ajayeb Dubai and indulge in a fragrance that defines lasting elegance.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,12,deny,manual,1899.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Ajayeb-Dubai.png?v=1779821153,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-badee-al-oud-sublime-100ml-edp,Lattafa Badee Al Oud Sublime 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Badee Al Oud Sublime is an olfactory masterpiece that transcends traditional gender boundaries, offering an enchanting olfactory experience for both men and women. This 100ML Eau de Parfum is not just a fragrance; it's a journey into the sublime, a symphony of scents that lingers throughout the day and night, showcasing an exceptional longevity that truly sets it apart.</p>

<p>Opening with a burst of freshness, the top notes dance on the skin, revealing a delightful combination of crisp Apple, exotic Litchi, and the timeless elegance of Rose. This initial olfactory embrace sets the stage for a fragrance that evolves, unveiling a heart rich in complexity. Plum and Jasmine intertwine, creating a floral and fruity melody that captivates the senses.</p>

<p>As the fragrance progresses, it leaves a lasting impression with its deep and sensual base notes. Vanilla adds a touch of sweetness, while Moss and Patchouli provide an earthy depth that grounds the composition in sophistication. The result is a harmonious blend that is both alluring and comforting.</p>

<p>What sets Bade’e Al Oud Sublime apart is not only its luxurious scent but also its status as an excellent alternative to the renowned Eden Juicy Apple | 01 by Kayali Fragrances. This Lattafa creation captures the essence of the expensive favorite, offering a budget-friendly option without compromising on quality or longevity.</p>

<p>Top notes are Apple, Litchi and Rose</p>

<p>Middle notes are Plum and Jasmine</p>

<p>Base notes are Vanilla, Moss and Patchouli.</p>

<p>In every spray, Bade’e Al Oud Sublime becomes a signature scent, an aromatic companion that accompanies you through every facet of life. From its top notes that spark a sense of vibrancy to its lingering base that leaves an unforgettable trail, this fragrance embodies the sublime in a bottle, a testament to the artistry and allure of Lattafa's creations.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,2599.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-sublime.png?v=1779821152,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-qaaed-intense-100ml-edp,Lattafa Qaaed Intense 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Qaaed Intense 100ML Eau de Parfum for Men is a fragrance that transcends time, leaving an indelible impression with its captivating blend of notes. Immerse yourself in the allure of this exceptionally long-lasting perfume, a masterpiece in the world of olfactory craftsmanship.</p>

<p>At the first spritz, the top notes unfold a rich tapestry of White Honey and Tobacco, creating an initial burst of warmth and sophistication. This dynamic opening sets the stage for the aromatic journey that follows. As the fragrance evolves, the heart notes emerge in a harmonious dance — a symphony of Vanille, Cacao, and Patchouli. These accords infuse the scent with a sweet, velvety essence, evoking a sense of indulgence and luxury.</p>

<p>The journey culminates in the base notes, where the fragrance finds its depth and resonance. Amber, French Labdanum, and Styrax create a sensual and mysterious foundation, leaving a lingering trail that is both bold and refined. The interplay of these base notes adds a touch of the exotic to the composition, making it truly distinctive.</p>

<p>What makes Lattafa Qaaed Intense truly exceptional is its remarkable longevity. This fragrance is designed to accompany you throughout the day and into the night, making it an ideal choice for those who seek a scent that endures.</p>

<p>Top notes are White Honey and Tobacco, Cinnamon</p>

<p>Middle notes are Vanille, Cacao and Patchouli, Myrrh</p>

