lattafa-rave-now-rouge-100ml-edp,Lattafa Rave Now Rouge 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Rave Now Rouge Eau de Parfum, a captivating fragrance designed for both men and women, is an olfactory masterpiece that transcends the boundaries of conventional scents. This 100ml bottle houses an elixir that goes beyond a mere fragrance, offering an enchanting experience that lingers throughout the day and well into the night.</p>

