lattafa-al-nashama-100ml-edp,Lattafa Al Nashama 100ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Al Nashama 100ML EDP for women is a fragrance that encapsulates the essence of femininity with a delightful and enduring allure. This olfactory masterpiece is renowned for its exceptional longevity, making it a steadfast companion throughout the day and well into the night.</p>

