<p>As the perfume evolves on the skin, an animalic undertone emerges, adding a sensuous and primal quality. This final layer contributes depth and complexity, ensuring that Lattafa Al Nashama is not just a fragrance but an olfactory narrative that unfolds uniquely on each wearer.</p>

