lattafa-mashmoon-20ml-cpo,Lattafa Mashmoon 20ml CPO,"<p>Lattafa Mashmoon Attar 20ml Concentrated Perfume Oil – A Luxurious Floral-Gourmand Masterpiece ✨<br>
Lattafa Mashmoon Attar is a rich and enchanting concentrated perfume oil designed for women who adore refined florals intertwined with creamy sweetness. Inspired by the iconic Delina by Parfums de Marly, this attar captures the same radiant elegance and feminine charm, delivering a scent that’s both graceful and unforgettable. Its compact oil format makes it perfect for everyday wear as well as special occasions when you want a soft yet distinct trail that lingers close to the skin.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes ✨<br>
Top Notes: Rose, Bergamot 🌹🍊The opening is fresh and luminous, with delicate rose petals fused with zesty bergamot. This floral-citrus combination feels uplifting and refined, setting the tone for a graceful yet vibrant experience.<br>
Middle Notes: Caramel, Peony 🍬🌸In the heart, creamy caramel adds a delectable gourmand sweetness that blends beautifully with the soft, ethereal elegance of peony. The result is a lush, feminine core that feels both romantic and richly textured.<br>
Base Notes: Musk, Vanilla 🤍🍦The dry-down is warm and sensual. Smooth vanilla pairs with soft musk to create a comforting, long-lasting foundation that enhances the fragrance’s overall allure—sensual without being overpowering.<br>
Lattafa Mashmoon Attar is ideal for women who love floral yet sweet, elegant yet modern scents. Its blend of bright florals, creamy gourmand notes, and gentle warmth makes it perfect for daytime wear, evening gatherings, and moments when you want to feel effortlessly elegant with a hint of indulgence.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Attar, Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,20ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1799.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Mashmoon-Attar.png?v=1779821041,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-esraa-20ml-cpo,Lattafa Esraa 20ml CPO,"Lattafa Esraa Attar 20ml Concentrated Perfume Oil – A Juicy &amp; Irresistible Fruity-Gourmand Delight ✨
Lattafa Esraa Attar is a vibrant and deliciously uplifting concentrated perfume oil crafted for those who love playful fruitiness balanced with creamy sweetness. Inspired by Eden Juicy Apple | 01 Eau De Parfum by Kayali Fragrances, this attar is a celebration of ripe fruits, lush florals, and cozy gourmand warmth. Its concentrated oil format ensures a soft, intimate trail that sits beautifully close to the skin—perfect for everyday wear, casual outings, and moments when you want a cheerful, charming scent.

