Middle Notes: Red Fruits, Rose, Raspberry 🍓🌹At the heart, a rich blend of red fruits and raspberry deepens the fruity character while delicate rose adds a soft floral elegance—creating a lush, spirited core that’s both vibrant and beautifully feminine.
