Lattafa Esraa Attar is ideal for anyone who loves fruity-gourmand fragrances with a sweet, feel-good vibe—fresh yet warm, playful yet elegant. A perfect companion for daily wear, brunch dates, and anytime you want a scent that feels bright, sweet, and truly delightful.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Attar, Full, LATTAFA",true,Size,20ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,1799.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Lattafa-Esraa-Attar.png?v=1779821040,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
lattafa-layaan-75ml-edp,Lattafa Layaan 75ml EDP,"<p>Lattafa Layaan 75ml Eau de Parfum for Women | Made in UAE ✨🌸<br>
