lattafa-khamrah-waha-100ml-edp,Lattafa Khamrah Waha 100ml EDP,"Lattafa Khamrah Waha 100ml Eau De Parfum – Fresh Marine Woods with Creamy Warmth 🌊🍋✨
For Men &amp; Women | Fresh • Aromatic • Woody • Musky
Lattafa Khamrah Waha is a refreshing and modern unisex fragrance Crafted by renowned perfumer Jordi Fernández. Vibrant citrus, cool marine accords, and creamy woody warmth blend together in a scent that feels energetic, sophisticated, and effortlessly luxurious—perfect for those who enjoy fresh fragrances with depth and sensuality.
