At the heart, the fragrance becomes airy and aquatic. Fresh cucumber and sea salt create a breezy marine sensation, while sage adds aromatic depth. Soft iris brings a smooth, elegant touch that balances freshness with sophistication.
Base Notes: Ambrofix™, Akigalawood, Vanilla, Musk &amp; Tonka Bean 🌫️🪵🍦
The dry-down is creamy, woody, and long-lasting. Modern ambrofix and akigalawood provide a warm woody trail, while vanilla and tonka bean add subtle sweetness. Soft musk wraps the fragrance in a clean, sensual finish.
Perfect for daily wear, summer evenings, vacations, and signature scent lovers, this fragrance delivers a fresh yet comforting aura with impressive lasting power.
