fragrance-world-king-100ml-edp,Fragrance World King 100ml EDP,"<p>Fragrance World King 100ml EDP For Men and Women</p>

<p>Prepare to embark on a majestic olfactory journey with Fragrance World King, a fragrance that transcends gender boundaries to reign supreme in the realm of scent. With its exquisite blend of notes inspired by the luxurious Narcos'is by Vertus, this 100ml Eau De Parfum is a true testament to opulence and sophistication.</p>

<p>Regal Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Immerse yourself in a grand entrance of aromas as rhubarb, cardamom, coffee, and mandarin orange dance together in perfect harmony. The invigorating burst of citrus meets the warmth of coffee and spices, setting the stage for a truly regal experience.<br>
Middle Notes: The heart of Fragrance World King reveals a tantalizing fusion of mango, ginger, and amber. A tropical symphony unfolds, where the sweetness of mango meets the fiery kick of ginger, wrapped in the embracing embrace of amber.<br>
Base Notes: As the fragrance settles, vetiver, ambergris, and peach emerge to leave a lasting impression. A rich and earthy foundation is laid, with the sensual sweetness of peach intertwining with the deep, musky allure of vetiver and ambergris.</p>

<p>👑 Inspired by Luxury, Accessible to All: Fragrance World King pays homage to the prestigious Narcos'is by Vertus, a fragrance synonymous with extravagance and refinement. Now, you can indulge in the same lavish experience without breaking the bank, as Fragrance World brings luxury within reach of all.</p>

<p>🌟 Unisex Elegance: Breaking traditional gender norms, Fragrance World King is designed to be worn by both men and women who exude confidence and sophistication. Let its majestic aroma envelop you in a cloak of regal elegance, making every moment feel like a royal affair.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Fragrance World, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,2399.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Fragrance-World-King.png?v=1779821015,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
fragrance-world-queen-100ml-edp,Fragrance World Queen 100ml EDP,"<p>Fragrance World Queen 100ml EDP For Women: Reigning Supreme in Elegance and Luxury 👑</p>

