fragrance-world-jasmin-noir-100ml-edp,Fragrance World Jasmin Noir 100ml EDP,"<p>Elevate Your Essence with Fragrance World Jasmin Noir 100ml EDP For Women 🌸</p>

<p>Discover the epitome of femininity and allure with Fragrance World Jasmin Noir, a fragrance that encapsulates the essence of sophistication and elegance. Inspired by the timeless allure of Jasmin Noir by Bvlgari, this 100ml Eau De Parfum is a tribute to the modern woman who exudes confidence and grace.</p>

<p>✨ Unveiling the Fragrance Journey:</p>

<p>🌿 Top Notes: The journey begins with a delicate dance of gardenia and green notes, enveloping your senses in a refreshing and vibrant embrace. Experience the crispness of nature and the subtle sweetness that sets the stage for the enchantment to come.</p>

<p>🌼 Middle Notes: As the fragrance unfolds, the heart reveals a mesmerizing bouquet of jasmine sambac and almond. The floral essence of jasmine sambac intertwines with the nutty richness of almond, creating a harmonious symphony of scent that is both captivating and alluring.</p>

<p>🌰 Base Notes: The finale is a decadent blend of tonka bean, licorice, precious woods, musk, amber, and patchouli. This luxurious medley of base notes adds depth and complexity, leaving a trail of sensual warmth that lingers on the skin, captivating all who encounter it.</p>

<p>🎀 A Inspired of Timeless Elegance: Fragrance World Jasmin Noir pays homage to the iconic Jasmin Noir by Bvlgari, capturing its essence with precision and finesse. Every spritz is a tribute to the enduring legacy of sophistication and refinement, allowing you to embody the timeless elegance of the original fragrance.</p>

<p>🌟 Embrace Your Feminine Charm: Indulge in the allure of Fragrance World Jasmin Noir and embrace your inner femininity. Whether it's a special occasion or a daily indulgence, let this exquisite perfume be your signature scent, a reflection of your unique style and personality.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Fragrance World, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,1599.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/fragrance-world-jasmin-noir-poue-femme.png?v=1779821006,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
