fragrance-world-des-tentations-100ml-edp,Fragrance World Des Tentations 100ml EDP,"<p class=""isSelectedEnd""><strong><span>Fragrance World Des Tentations EDP 100ml for Men: A Fresh, Bold &amp; Seductive Signature Fragrance | Inspired by the Iconic Versace Eros</span></strong></p>
<p class=""isSelectedEnd""><span>Fragrance World Des Tentations 100ml Eau De Parfum is a luxurious fragrance designed for men who value confidence, elegance, and lasting impressions. Inspired by the iconic Versace Eros, this captivating scent perfectly blends vibrant citrus, aromatic accords, and warm woody notes to create a fragrance that is fresh, masculine, and effortlessly sophisticated. Whether you're heading to the office, a special occasion, or an evening out, Des Tentations delivers exceptional longevity and a refined scent trail that keeps you feeling confident all day.</span></p>
<p class=""isSelectedEnd""><span>🔥 </span><strong><span>Unveiling the Fragrance Notes:</span></strong></p>
<p class=""isSelectedEnd""><strong><span>Top Notes:</span></strong><span> The fragrance opens with an energizing burst of refreshing mint, crisp green apple, and sparkling lemon. This vibrant combination creates a fresh and invigorating introduction that instantly awakens the senses.</span></p>
<p class=""isSelectedEnd""><strong><span>Middle Notes:</span></strong><span> At the heart, creamy tonka bean blends beautifully with modern ambroxan and aromatic geranium. These notes add warmth, depth, and a refined masculine character, creating a smooth and captivating fragrance experience.</span></p>
<p class=""isSelectedEnd""><strong><span>Base Notes:</span></strong><span> The dry down reveals rich Madagascar vanilla, Virginian cedar, Atlas cedar, earthy vetiver, and oakmoss. These luxurious woody and gourmand accords provide remarkable depth, excellent longevity, and a warm, sensual finish that leaves an unforgettable impression.</span></p>
<p><span>🌿 </span><strong><span>Crafted for the Modern Gentleman:</span></strong><span> Fragrance World Des Tentations is more than just a fragrance—it's a symbol of confidence, sophistication, and timeless style. Perfect for daily wear, office use, date nights, and special occasions, this Eau De Parfum is an ideal choice for men seeking a versatile, long-lasting, and premium-quality signature scent.</span></p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Fragrance World, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,1599.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Fragrance-World-Des-Tentations.png?v=1779820966,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,madagascar-vanilla; virginia-cedar; vetiver; oakmoss,fragrance-world,,,edp,,fragrance-world,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Fragrance-World/Des-Tentations-108919.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,vanilla; aromatic; green; citrus; fresh-spicy; woody,,tonka-bean; geranium; ambroxan,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,mint; lemon; green-apple,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
fragrance-world-des-tentations-flame-100ml-edp,Fragrance World Des Tentations Flame 100ml EDP,"<p class=""isSelectedEnd""><strong><span>Fragrance World Des Tentations Flame EDP 100ml: A Fiery Fusion of Citrus, Spices &amp; Woods | Inspired by the Legendary Versace Eros Flame</span></strong></p>
<p class=""isSelectedEnd""><span>Fragrance World Des Tentations Flame 100ml Eau De Parfum is a premium fragrance crafted for men who radiate confidence, passion, and sophistication. Inspired by the iconic Versace Eros Flame, this luxurious scent blends vibrant citrus, aromatic spices, elegant florals, and warm woody accords into a bold and unforgettable fragrance. Designed for the modern gentleman, it offers exceptional longevity and a captivating scent trail that transitions effortlessly from day to night.</span></p>
