<p class=""isSelectedEnd""><strong><span>Middle Notes:</span></strong><span> At its heart, elegant rose blends beautifully with snaputis and a hint of pepper, creating a refined floral-spicy composition that adds warmth, depth, and masculine sophistication.</span></p>
<p class=""isSelectedEnd""><strong><span>Base Notes:</span></strong><span> The fragrance finishes with a rich blend of cedarwood, patchouli, tonka bean, vanilla, and sandalwood. These warm woody and creamy gourmand notes provide remarkable depth, smoothness, and long-lasting performance, leaving behind a sensual and memorable trail.</span></p>
<p><span>🌿 </span><strong><span>Crafted for the Modern Gentleman:</span></strong><span> Fragrance World Des Tentations Flame is more than just a fragrance—it's a symbol of strength, elegance, and timeless style. Perfect for office wear, evening occasions, date nights, and year-round use, this Eau De Parfum is an excellent choice for men seeking a bold, versatile, and long-lasting signature scent.</span></p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Fragrance World, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,1599.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Fragrance-World-Des-Tentations-Flame.png?v=1779820965,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,patchouli; vanilla; texas-cedar; sandalwood; tonka-beans; oakmoss,fragrance-world,,,edp,,fragrance-world,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Fragrance-World/Des-Tentations-Flame-108920.html,unisex,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,fresh-spicy; citrus; warm-spicy; aromatic; woody; vanilla; patchouli,,pepper; geranium; rose,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,mandarin-orange; black-pepper; lemon; rosemary; chinotto,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
