fragrance-world-feroce-pour-homme-100ml-edp,Fragrance World Feroce Pour Homme 100ml EDP,"Fragrance World Feroce Pour Homme 100ml EDP For Men – The Ultimate Fresh &amp; Woody Scent 🌟

Step into a world of refreshing elegance with Fragrance World Feroce Pour Homme, a high-quality, long-lasting fragrance made in the UAE. Crafted for the modern man, this rich-smelling scent combines cool, fresh, and woody elements, making it perfect for daytime wear during spring and summer. If you love Dolce &amp; Gabbana's Light Blue Forever Pour Homme, this fragrance will instantly remind you of that timeless classic.

Fragrance Notes:

Top Notes: Grapefruit &amp; Lemon
(A bright, zesty opening that feels fresh and energizing.)
Middle Note: Pink Pepper
(Adds a subtle warmth and spice, balancing the citrus burst.)
