<p data-start=""66"" data-end=""382"">Wrap yourself in the irresistible comfort of <strong data-start=""111"" data-end=""130"">Crème Of Clouds</strong>, a luxurious gourmand fragrance inspired by the rich sweetness of crème brûlée. Smooth, creamy, and deliciously addictive, this scent blends velvety coconut milk, rich vanilla, and caramelized sugar into a fragrance that's both elegant and comforting.</p>
<p data-start=""384"" data-end=""405"">✨ <strong data-start=""386"" data-end=""405"">Fragrance Notes</strong></p>
<ul data-start=""406"" data-end=""500"">
<li data-section-id=""c3ayge"" data-start=""406"" data-end=""432"">
<strong data-start=""408"" data-end=""416"">Top:</strong> Coconut Milk 🥥</li>
<li data-section-id=""2tavpl"" data-start=""433"" data-end=""456"">
<strong data-start=""435"" data-end=""445"">Heart:</strong> Vanilla 🌼</li>
<li data-section-id=""8r66ow"" data-start=""457"" data-end=""500"">
<strong data-start=""459"" data-end=""468"">Base:</strong> Burnt Sugar, Whipped Cream 🍯🍦</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=""502"" data-end=""788"">The fragrance opens with silky coconut milk, creating a soft and creamy introduction. A heart of warm vanilla adds richness and sophistication, while the dry-down of burnt sugar and fluffy whipped cream leaves a mouthwatering, long-lasting trail that's sweet without being overwhelming.</p>
<p data-start=""790"" data-end=""1062"" data-is-last-node="""" data-is-only-node="""">Perfect for cozy evenings, date nights, and anyone who loves dessert-inspired perfumes, <strong data-start=""878"" data-end=""897"">Crème Of Clouds</strong> is a dreamy gourmand that feels warm, feminine, and effortlessly indulgent. A must-have for lovers of creamy vanilla fragrances that leave a lasting impression. ✨🤍</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Fragrance World, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,1999.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Fragrance-World-Creme-Of-Clouds.png?v=1779820855,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,vanilla,fragrance-world,,,edp,,fragrance-world; inspired-by-creme-brulee,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Fragrance-World/Creme-of-Clouds-102885.html,unisex,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,creme-brulee,,vanilla; sweet; coconut; lactonic; tropical,,coconut-milk,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,whipped-cream; burnt-sugar,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
fragrance-world-azzure-aoud-100ml-edp,Fragrance World Azzure Aoud 100ml EDP,"<p>Fragrance World French Avenue Azzure Aoud 100ml EDP – A Sensory Journey of Exotic Oud ✨<br>
Unleash a bold and sophisticated aura with French Avenue Azzure Aoud, an exquisite Eau de Parfum crafted in the UAE. This luxurious scent is an ode to refinement, blending exotic oud with an irresistible fruity-woody harmony. Inspired by Oud Maracujá by Maison Crivelli, it offers a mesmerizing depth that lingers with effortless charm.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes:<br>
✨ Top Notes: Passionfruit, Fruity Notes, Rose, SaffronA vibrant fusion of juicy passionfruit and ripe fruity notes creates an intoxicating opening, enriched with the delicate elegance of rose and the exotic warmth of saffron.<br>
🔥 Middle Notes: Oud, Benzoin, PatchouliThe rich depth of oud intertwines with balsamic benzoin and earthy patchouli, adding a bold and resinous heart that exudes mystery and power.<br>
🌙 Base Notes: Leather, Vanilla, Amber, Guaiac Wood, Cedarwood, Labdanum, SandalwoodA seductive blend of smoky leather, creamy vanilla, and golden amber settles into a warm embrace of guaiac wood, cedarwood, and sandalwood, leaving an unforgettable, velvety trail.<br>
Perfect for evening wear and cooler seasons, French Avenue Azzure Aoud is an indulgent fragrance that speaks of confidence, luxury, and allure. 🖤🔥</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Fragrance World, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,2958.00,3999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Fragrance-World-Azzure-Aoud.png?v=1779820855,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,leather; guaiac-wood; amber; cedarwood; sandalwood; vanilla; labdanum,fragrance-world,,,edp,,fragrance-world; inspired-by-oud-maracuja,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/French-Avenue/Azzure-Oud-94714.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,oud-maracuja,6-8-hours,fruity; oud; leather; sweet; woody; tropical; amber,,oud; benzoin; patchouli,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,passionfruit; fruity-notes; rose; saffron,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
