fragrance-world-aqua-pura-50ml-edp,Fragrance World Aqua Pura 50ml EDP,"<p>Fragrance World Aqua Pura 50ml EDP For Men: Dive into Freshness and Masculine Sophistication 🌊</p>

<p>Embark on a journey of invigorating freshness and timeless masculinity with Fragrance World Aqua Pura 50ml Eau De Parfum for Men. Inspired by the allure of the vast ocean and the purity of nature, this captivating fragrance envelops you in a sense of serenity and sophistication.</p>

<p>🌟 Indulge in the Essence of Luxury: Crafted with meticulous attention to detail, Fragrance World Aqua Pura stands as a beacon of refinement and elegance. Its 50ml Eau De Parfum concentration ensures a long-lasting and impactful scent experience that captivates the senses and leaves an unforgettable impression.</p>

<p>💧 Unveiling the Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: The journey begins with a refreshing burst of bergamot and lemon, awakening the senses with their vibrant citrusy aroma. Feel the invigorating energy surge as the zesty top notes set the tone for the olfactory adventure ahead.<br>
Middle Notes: Dive deeper into the heart of Aqua Pura, where the essence of the sea comes to life. Seaweed, calone, and hedione intertwine to create a marine-inspired symphony that evokes images of sun-kissed shores and salty ocean breezes. Experience the serenity of the open sea captured in every breath.<br>
Base Notes: As the fragrance settles, a warm and comforting embrace emerges, courtesy of musk, ambroxan, and cedar. These grounding base notes add depth and sophistication to the composition, leaving a trail of irresistible allure that lingers in the air.</p>

<p>🚀 Inspired By : Fragrance World Aqua Pura pays homage to the iconic Megamare by Orto Parisi, offering a unique interpretation that captures the essence of its inspiration while adding its own distinct character. Embrace the familiarity of Megamare with a fresh twist that sets Aqua Pura apart.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","best seller, Fragrance World, Full",true,Size,50ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,8,deny,manual,699.00,1500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Fragrance-World-Aqua-Pura.png?v=1779820825,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,musk; ambroxan; cedar,fragrance-world,,Citrus Aromatic,edp,,fragrance-world; inspired-by-megamare-by-orto-parisi,,citrus; aquatics,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Fragrance-World/Aqua-Pura-104351.html,unisex,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,megamare-by-orto-parisi,4-6-hours,musky; vibrant-marine; citrus; fresh; aquatic,,sea-weed; calone; hedione,,,,,,,,,,,daily-wear,,most-reordered,fresh-clean,bergamot; lemon,,,for-men,,'12,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
fragrance-world-proud-of-you-absolute-50ml-edp,Fragrance World Proud Of You Absolute 50ml EDP,"<p>Fragrance World Proud of You Absolute 50ml EDP For Men – The Bold, Long-Lasting Scent 🌟</p>

