fragrance-world-venti-50ml-edp,Fragrance World Venti 50ml EDP,"Fragrance World Venti Eau de Parfum 50ml – A Bold Breeze of Citrus, Spice &amp; Strength 🍋🌿For Women &amp; Men | Made in UAE
Vibrant, confident, and full of energy — Venti by Fragrance World is a unisex Eau de Parfum designed for those who live life in full stride. Fresh yet powerful, elegant yet daring, this scent captures the perfect balance between dynamic citrus and deep, woody warmth.
Fragrance Notes:Top Notes: Pink Pepper, Lemon, Blackcurrant, Bergamot, AppleA bright and zesty opening — the sharp sparkle of lemon and bergamot meets juicy blackcurrant and crisp apple, while pink pepper adds a spicy kick of intrigue.
Middle Notes: Pineapple, Moroccan Jasmine, PatchouliThe heart is fruity and floral with an exotic twist — sun-ripened pineapple pairs with delicate Moroccan jasmine, grounded by earthy, aromatic patchouli.
Base Notes: Birch, Ambroxan, Musk, Oakmoss, CedarThe dry-down is smooth, smoky, and sensual — rich birch and cedarwood blend seamlessly with ambroxan, musk, and oakmoss for a lasting, confident finish.
Venti is a signature scent for those who turn heads effortlessly. Whether day or night, it's a fragrance that commands attention — fresh, fearless, and unforgettable. ⚡🌬️",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Fragrance World, Full",true,Size,50ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,7,deny,manual,699.00,1599.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Fragrance-World-Venti-50-ml.png?v=1779820779,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
fragrance-world-midori-50ml-edp,Fragrance World Midori 50ml EDP,"<p>Fragrance World Midori 50ml EDP for Men – A Green Symphony of Fresh Elegance 🌿<br>
Fragrance World Midori is a vibrant and refreshing Eau de Parfum crafted for the modern gentleman who seeks energy, elegance, and effortless style. Made in the UAE and Inspired by the luxurious Greenley by Parfums de Marly, this fragrance is a captivating ode to nature's vitality, bottled for daily sophistication.<br>
