fragrance-world-venti-silky-princess-50ml-edp,Fragrance World Venti Silky Princess 50ml EDP,"Fragrance World Venti Silky Princess Eau de Parfum 50ml – A Regal Symphony of Oud, Florals &amp; Incense 👑🌙For Women &amp; Men | Made in UAE
Venti Silky Princess by Fragrance World is a captivating unisex fragrance that weaves opulence and mystery into every drop. Rich, radiant, and deeply sensual, this Eau de Parfum is crafted for those who walk with quiet confidence and leave an unforgettable trail of elegance.
Fragrance Notes:Top Notes: Osmanthus, Saffron, MagnoliaThe journey begins with a golden glow — the fruity-floral depth of osmanthus and creamy magnolia are enriched by the warm, spicy touch of saffron.
Middle Notes: Tuberose, Agarwood (Oud), PatchouliAt the heart lies an intoxicating blend — lush tuberose dances with the smoky allure of agarwood and earthy patchouli, creating a luxurious floral-oud fusion.
Base Notes: Incense, Myrrh, Madagascar Vanilla, Cedarwood, Ambroxan, MuskThe base unfolds like a royal veil — sacred incense and myrrh swirl into sweet Madagascar vanilla, soft musk, and deep cedarwood, wrapped in the modern glow of ambroxan.
Mysterious, silky, and sophisticated, Venti Silky Princess is a fragrance that lingers like a whispered secret. Ideal for evening wear or bold daytime moments — timeless, powerful, and unforgettable. 🌌🔥",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Fragrance World, Full",true,Size,50ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,699.00,1599.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Fragrance-World-Venti-Silky-Princess.png?v=1779820776,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
