fragrance-world-vulcan-sable-100ml-edp,Fragrance World Vulcan Sable 100ml EDP,"<p>Fragrance World Vulcan Sable 100ml EDP – Command the Night And Winter Time<br>
Fragrance World Vulcan Sable is a powerful, unisex Eau de Parfum that embodies the spirit of mystery and luxury. Crafted in the UAE, this fragrance offers a rich, long-lasting scent designed for those who crave both elegance and boldness. With its intoxicating blend of contrasting notes, Vulcan Sable takes you on an unforgettable olfactory journey—one that is at once warm, spicy, and sensual.<br>
Fragrance Notes:<br>
Top Notes: Whiskey, Orange, Coriander, Mandarin(A rich, boozy opening of Whiskey mingles with the zesty brightness of Orange and Mandarin, while Coriander adds a sharp, aromatic spice, awakening the senses with a captivating start.)<br>
Middle Notes: Tonka, Cashmeran, Styrax, Anise(The heart of Vulcan Sable is smooth and refined, with Tonka bean offering a warm, sweet depth. Cashmeran adds a soft, musky touch, while Styrax brings an alluring smokiness. Anise introduces a delicate herbal sweetness, creating a complex and balanced middle.)<br>
Base Notes: Vanilla, Patchouli, Benzoin(The fragrance settles into an indulgent, resinous base of Vanilla and Patchouli, adding depth and warmth. Benzoin enhances the creamy sweetness with its balsamic richness, ensuring this scent lingers for hours.)<br>
Inspired by the luxurious Sand Dance by Stéphane Humbert Lucas 777, Vulcan Sable is for the bold, the daring, and those who seek a signature scent that leaves an impression long after the night ends. 🌙✨</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Fragrance World, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,30,deny,manual,3349.00,4699.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Fragrance-World-Vulcan-Sable.png?v=1779820768,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
fragrance-world-oud-madness-60ml-edp,Fragrance World Oud Madness 60ml EDP,"<p>Fragrance World Oud Madness 60ml EDP – A Bold Journey into Oud and Fruity Luxury 🍑✨<br>
Fragrance World’s Oud Madness is an intoxicating Eau de Parfum that blurs the lines between bold, exotic woods and vibrant fruits, offering a daring and unforgettable scent experience. Crafted for both men and women, this fragrance is a fusion of contrasts that exudes confidence and mystery, taking Inspiration from the luxurious Oud Maracujá by Maison Crivelli.<br>
The fragrance opens with a captivating burst of passionfruit and fruity notes, infused with the golden warmth of saffron and the delicate richness of Turkish rose. This vibrant top layer dances on the skin, balancing the sweetness of fruit with the deep, spicy essence of saffron.<br>
As the scent unfolds, the heart reveals the true power of Oud Madness: a blend of agarwood (oud), benzoin, and Indonesian patchouli leaf. These rich, woody elements bring a sensual depth that is both opulent and earthy, setting the stage for a bold, aromatic journey.<br>
The fragrance settles into a powerful base of leather, Akigalawood, amber, vanilla, and labdanum. This final layer is warm, smoky, and resinous, leaving behind a rich, complex trail that is both luxurious and mysterious.<br>
Fragrance Notes:<br>
Top Notes: Passionfruit, Fruity Notes, Saffron, Turkish Rose<br>
Middle Notes: Agarwood (Oud), Benzoin, Indonesian Patchouli Leaf<br>
Base Notes: Leather, Akigalawood, Amber, Vanilla, Labdanum<br>
Oud Madness is perfect for those who embrace the bold allure of oud but desire a unique twist with fruit and floral undertones. With its long-lasting power and rich complexity, this fragrance makes a statement that lingers, leaving a memorable impression wherever you go. 🌿💫</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Fragrance World, Full",true,Size,60ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,2099.00,2199.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Oud-Madness.png?v=1779820767,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
fragrance-world-artisan-perfumery-salted-caramel-80ml-edp,Fragrance World Artisan Perfumery Salted Caramel 80ml EDP,"<p>Fragrance World Artisan Perfumery Salted Caramel 80ml EDP – A Decadent Indulgence in Every Spray 🍬🍷<br>
Fragrance World’s Artisan Perfumery Salted Caramel is a mouthwatering yet sophisticated Eau de Parfum that invites you into a world of sweet, fruity, and luxurious indulgence. With every note carefully crafted, this fragrance balances playful sweetness with a deep, aromatic richness—creating a scent experience as comforting as it is captivating.<br>
The opening is a burst of vibrant raspberry and davana, perfectly complemented by the smooth, rich notes of red wine. These top notes immediately draw you in with their sweet and slightly tangy fruitiness, setting the stage for a fragrance that is as bold as it is delightful.<br>
As the scent develops, the heart reveals a delectable fusion of geranium, rose, and caramel. The floral notes add elegance and freshness, while the caramel introduces a deliciously creamy sweetness that evokes the feeling of a warm, sugary treat. This heart is at once indulgent and refined, enveloping you in a fragrant embrace.<br>
The base grounds the fragrance with the depth of patchouli, cedarwood, and brown sugar. These earthy, woody notes provide an unexpected contrast to the sweetness, giving the fragrance a balanced, lasting finish that is both sweet and savory.<br>
Fragrance Notes:<br>
Top Notes: Raspberry, Davana, Red Wine<br>
Heart Notes: Geranium, Rose, Caramel<br>
Base Notes: Patchouli, Cedarwood, Brown Sugar<br>
Salted Caramel is a perfect choice for those who adore gourmand fragrances with a twist—luxurious, warm, and utterly irresistible. Whether worn day or night, this scent wraps you in a delicious aura of sweetness and sophistication that lingers all day long. ✨🍯</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Fragrance World, Full",true,Size,80ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1899.00,3000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Artisan-Perfumery-Salted-Caramel.png?v=1779820766,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,cedarwood; patchouli; brown-sugar,fragrance-world,,,edp,,fragrance-world,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Fragrance-World/Salted-Caramel-Artisan-Perfumery-121906.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,,6-8-hours,wine; rose; caramel; woody; floral,,rose; caramel; geranium,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,red-wine; raspberry; davana,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
fragrance-world-velvet-rouge-100ml-edp,Fragrance World Velvet Rouge 100ml EDP,"Fragrance World Velvet Rouge 100ml EDP – A Sensual Tapestry of Elegance &amp; Mystery ❤️🌹✨Inspired by Rouge Velours by Yves Saint Laurent
Velvet Rouge by Fragrance World is a captivating unisex eau de parfum that blends softness and depth with effortless sophistication. Inspired by the luxurious allure of Rouge Velours, this fragrance drapes the wearer in a velvety aura—sensual, refined, and irresistibly magnetic.
