Middle Notes: Rose, Iris, Jasmine(The heart blossoms into a rich floral symphony, where velvety rose melts seamlessly into powdery iris and luminous jasmine. 🌹💐 This combination creates an elegant, romantic core that feels soft, smooth, and beautifully enveloping.)
Base Notes: Patchouli, Vetiver, Musk(As it dries down, Velvet Rouge reveals a sensual base of earthy patchouli and refined vetiver, grounded by a silky blanket of musk. 🌙🖤 The result is a warm, lingering trail that whispers sophistication and depth.)
Fragrance World Velvet Rouge is perfect for those who crave a smooth, romantic, and modern floral scent with a dark, graceful edge. Elegant yet daring, it’s a fragrance that leaves a lasting impression wherever you go. ❤️✨",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Fragrance World, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,15,deny,manual,1699.00,2199.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Fragrance-World-Velvet-Rouge.png?v=1779820765,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
fragrance-world-cocktail-intense-100ml-edp,Fragrance World Cocktail Intense 100ml EDP,"<h2 data-section-id=""1j2uv1w"" data-start=""0"" data-end=""74"" class=""PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer"">
<span role=""text""><strong data-start=""3"" data-end=""74"">Fragrance World Cocktail Intense – Warm, Boozy &amp; Sophisticated 🥃🔥</strong></span><span aria-hidden=""true"" class=""PDq2pG_selectionAnchor""></span>
</h2>
<p data-start=""76"" data-end=""153""><strong data-start=""76"" data-end=""107"">100ml Eau de Parfum for Men</strong><br data-start=""107"" data-end=""110""><strong data-start=""110"" data-end=""126"">Inspired by:</strong> Angels' Share by By Kilian</p>
<p data-start=""155"" data-end=""409"">Fragrance World Cocktail Intense is a rich gourmand-oriental fragrance that blends the warmth of cognac with sweet spices, creamy woods, and smooth vanilla. Bold, elegant, and long-lasting, it is ideal for evenings, special occasions, and cooler weather.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=""h5y3yk"" data-start=""411"" data-end=""434""><span role=""text""><strong data-start=""415"" data-end=""434"">Fragrance Notes</strong></span></h3>
<p data-start=""436"" data-end=""548""><strong data-start=""436"" data-end=""450"">Top Notes:</strong> 🥃 Cognac, 🔥 Cinnamon, 🍑 Plum<br data-start=""482"" data-end=""485"">A warm boozy opening enhanced by spicy cinnamon and juicy plum.</p>
