fragrance-world-royal-blend-sequoia-100ml-extrait-de-parfum,Fragrance World Royal Blend Sequoia 100ml Extrait De Parfum,"Fragrance World Royal Blend Sequoia 100ml Extrait De Parfum For Men: A Symphony of Warmth &amp; Modern Elegance 🌲🔥
Experience the allure of Fragrance World Royal Blend Sequoia, a masterfully crafted 100ml Extrait De Parfum designed for the man who values richness, depth, and unforgettable presence. Inspired by the luxurious essence of Angels' Share Paradis by By Kilian, this scent captures the perfect balance of gourmand warmth and refined masculinity.
🔥 Fragrance Notes:
Top Notes: The journey opens with a bold fusion of raspberry, liquor, and cognac, delivering a juicy, boozy, and tantalizing burst that immediately commands attention.Middle Notes: At its heart, a smooth duet of rose and moss adds sophistication—earthy, elegant, and subtly mysterious, enriching the fragrance with natural depth.Base Notes: The dry-down reveals a decadent blend of praline, oak, and sandalwood, wrapping the skin in creamy sweetness, woody richness, and long-lasting warmth.
🌐 Elevate Your Signature Scent:Royal Blend Sequoia is meticulously created for fragrance lovers who crave high-quality performance, pronounced projection, and exceptional longevity. Whether for evening wear or special occasions, its intoxicating profile leaves a memorable and irresistible trail.
Indulge in the artistry of Royal Blend Sequoia—and let every moment feel bold, warm, and effortlessly luxurious.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","Fragrance World, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,5,deny,manual,3199.00,4500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Fragrance-World-Royal-Blend-Sequoia.png?v=1779820763,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,extrait,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
fragrance-world-elysia-pista-sundae-100ml-edp,Fragrance World Elysia Pista Sundae 100ml EDP,"<p>Fragrance World Elysia Pista Sundae 100ml EDP 🍨💚✨ Made in UAE<br>
Elysia Pista Sundae is a deliciously whimsical gourmand escape — a fragrance crafted for lovers of creamy pistachio fantasies, sweet indulgence, and joyful, edible elegance. It feels like stepping into an artisan gelato shop on a warm afternoon, where nutty sweetness, airy florals, and soft woods swirl together in a velvety cloud of comfort.<br>
Top Notes: Pistachio, Ice Cream, Bergamot, Hazelnut, Rum, Cardamom 💚🍨🥃The opening is a cool, creamy delight — pistachio gelato drizzled with hazelnut and a playful splash of rum. Cardamom adds a subtle spice, while bergamot brightens the mix with a refreshing lift. Mouthwatering, smooth, and instantly addictive.<br>
Middle Notes: Lily-of-the-Valley, Pear, Jasmine, Peony, Geranium, White Peach, Raspberry 🌸🍐🍑The heart blooms with soft florals and juicy fruits. Jasmine and peony create a silky, airy bouquet, while pear, peach, and raspberry add a fresh, luscious sweetness that blends seamlessly with the gourmand top.<br>
Base Notes: Whipped Cream, Marshmallow, Cotton Candy, Tonka Bean, Loukhoum, Sandalwood, Cedar, Cacao 🤍🍬🌰The dry-down is pure dessert heaven — clouds of whipped cream, marshmallow, and cotton candy melt into creamy tonka, delicate loukhoum, and smooth cacao. A gentle woody undertone grounds the sweetness, giving it warmth and sophistication.<br>
Elysia Pista Sundae is for anyone who loves to smell delicious, dreamy, and unforgettable. A creamy treat you’ll want to wear every day. 🍨✨</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Fragrance World, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,1849.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Elysia-Pista-Sundae.png?v=1779820763,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
fragrance-world-elysia-elegance-100ml-edp,Fragrance World Elysia Elegance 100ml EDP,"Fragrance World Elysia Elegance – A Bloom of Modern Grace &amp; Soft Radiance 🌸✨100ml Eau de Parfum for Women
Immerse yourself in the luminous charm of Elysia Elegance, a feminine fragrance crafted for the woman who embodies confidence, sweetness, and effortless sophistication. This scent captures a bouquet of vibrant fruits, delicate florals, and warm gourmand nuances—creating an aura that feels romantic, uplifting, and beautifully refined.

Fragrance Notes
Top Notes: Mandarin, Orange, Juicy Pear, Sweet PeachThe experience opens with a bright, juicy burst of mandarin and orange, wrapped in the crisp freshness of pear and the soft sweetness of ripe peach. A sparkling, fruity introduction that feels playful and radiant. 🍊🍐🍑✨
Middle Notes: Magnolia, White Peony, Rose Centifolia, Violet WoodAt its heart, Elysia Elegance blooms with velvety magnolia, airy white peony, and the timeless beauty of rose centifolia. Hints of violet wood add subtle sophistication, creating a floral harmony that is elegant, gentle, and irresistibly feminine. 🌸🌿🤍
Base Notes: Vetiver, Super, Vanilla, Praline, MuskThe dry-down unfolds into warm vanilla, creamy praline, and soft musk, enriched by the modern depth of vetiver and woody accents. Smooth, comforting, and delicately addictive, it leaves a graceful trail that lingers like a soft whisper of elegance. 🍨🌫️🌙
Elysia Elegance is perfect for daytime charm, romantic outings, or anyone who loves a fragrance that balances sweetness, floral beauty, and refined warmth. A true celebration of feminine allure. ✨💗🌸",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Fragrance World, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,1849.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Fragrance-World-Elysia-Elegance.png?v=1779820761,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
fragrance-world-elysia-sugar-patchouli-100ml-edp,Fragrance World Elysia Sugar Patchouli 100ml EDP,"<p>Fragrance World Elysia Sugar Patchouli 100ml Eau de Parfum – A Decadent Vanilla Dream Drenched in Desire 🍮🔥<br>
Indulge in pure opulence with Fragrance World Elysia Sugar Patchouli, a luxurious eau de parfum created for lovers of rich gourmands and sensual depth. Inspired by Vanilla Royale Sugared Patchouli | 64 Eau de Parfum Intense by Kayali Fragrances, this scent is a bold celebration of molten sugar, creamy vanilla, and dark, intoxicating woods.<br>
Fragrance Notes ✨<br>
Top Notes: Rum, Vanilla Orchid, Jasmine 🍹The opening is intoxicating and lush. Boozy rum sets a sultry tone, wrapped in the creamy floral sweetness of vanilla orchid and the soft radiance of jasmine, creating an immediate sense of warmth and indulgence.<br>
Middle Notes: Vanilla, Crème Brûlée, Spicy Notes, Tonka Bean, Leather, Rose 🍯At the heart, layers of decadent vanilla and caramelized crème brûlée melt into spiced warmth. Tonka bean adds almond-like richness, while soft leather brings a seductive edge. A delicate rose blooms through the sweetness, adding elegance and balance.<br>
Base Notes: Patchouli, Brown Sugar, Oud, Sugar, Amber, Musk 🌙The dry-down is deep, addictive, and long-lasting. Earthy patchouli is drenched in brown sugar and golden amber, enriched by smoky oud and soft musk. A final dusting of sugar leaves a sensual, lingering trail that feels both powerful and irresistibly feminine.<br>
Elysia Sugar Patchouli is bold, seductive, and unapologetically sweet—a fragrance made for nights that demand confidence and unforgettable presence. ✨</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Fragrance World, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,1849.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Fragrance-World-Elysia-Sugar-Patchouli.png?v=1779820760,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
fragrance-world-elysia-lychee-fizz-100ml-edp,Fragrance World Elysia Lychee Fizz 100ml EDP,"<p>Fragrance World Elysia Lychee Fizz 100ml Eau de Parfum – A Sparkling Burst of Playful Sweetness 🍓✨<br>
Delight in a joyful explosion of fruity sparkle with Fragrance World Elysia Lychee Fizz, a radiant eau de parfum created for lovers of bright, feminine, and addictive scents. Inspired by Eden Sparkling Lychee | 39 Eau de Parfum by Kayali Fragrances, this fragrance captures the thrill of juicy fruits, blooming florals, and sugary warmth in a bubbly, feel-good composition.<br>
Fragrance Notes ✨<br>
Top Notes: Blackcurrant, Red Apple, Lychee, Italian Lemon 🍎The opening is lively and refreshing. Tart blackcurrant and crisp red apple blend with juicy lychee and zesty Italian lemon, creating a sparkling, mouth-watering burst that feels instantly uplifting and playful.<br>
Middle Notes: Violet, Rose, Jasmine 🌸At the heart, soft florals bloom gracefully. Powdery violet adds a delicate sweetness, while romantic rose and luminous jasmine bring elegance and femininity, balancing the fruity brightness with floral sophistication.<br>
Base Notes: Sugar, Vanilla, Sandalwood, Cedar, Musk, Amber 🍬The dry-down is smooth and comforting. Crystallized sugar and creamy vanilla melt into warm woods, sensual musk, and golden amber, leaving a soft, sweet trail that lingers beautifully on the skin.<br>
Elysia Lychee Fizz is fun, flirty, and irresistibly charming—a sparkling fragrance perfect for everyday wear, sunny days, and moments that call for effortless joy. 💖</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Fragrance World, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,1849.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Fragrance-World-Elysia-Lychee-Fizz.png?v=1779820759,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-women,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
fragrance-world-elysia-marshmallow-100ml-edp,Fragrance World Elysia Marshmallow 100ml EDP,"<p>Fragrance World Elysia Marshmallow 100ml Eau de Parfum – A Fluffy Fantasy of Sweet Indulgence 🍡✨<br>
Step into a world of soft sweetness with Fragrance World Elysia Marshmallow, a delectable eau de parfum made for lovers of cozy, gourmand delights. Inspired by Yum Boujee Marshmallow | 81 by Kayali Fragrances, this scent wraps you in a cloud of creamy sugar, airy vanilla, and velvety musk—playful, addictive, and irresistibly comforting.<br>
