fragrance-world-roses-de-mai-jacques-yves-100ml-edp,Fragrance World Roses De Mai Jacques Yves 100ml EDP,"Fragrance World Roses De Mai Jacques Yves 100ml Eau de Parfum – A Modern Rose Reimagined in Shadow &amp; Warmth 🌹✨
Discover a refined balance of elegance and edge with Fragrance World Roses De Mai Jacques Yves, a unisex eau de parfum that blends aromatic spice, creamy florals, and deep sensual woods. Sophisticated yet unconventional, this fragrance unfolds with confidence—where softness meets intensity in a beautifully composed contrast.
Fragrance Notes ✨
