fragrance-world-imaginary-jacques-yves-100ml-edp,Fragrance World Imaginary Jacques Yves 100ml EDP,"Fragrance World Imaginary Jacques Yves 100ml Eau de Parfum – A Bold Journey of Citrus, Spice &amp; Mystery 🍊✨
Step into a world of creativity and elegance with Fragrance World Imaginary Jacques Yves, a unisex eau de parfum Inspired by Imagination by Louis Vuitton. This scent balances sparkling citrus, warm spices, and deep woody notes to create a fragrance that is both uplifting and intriguingly sophisticated.
Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Bergamot, Citron, Orange 🍋The opening bursts with vibrant citrus—bright bergamot, zesty citron, and juicy orange create an energetic and refreshing introduction, instantly awakening the senses with a lively, sunlit glow.
Middle Notes: Ginger, Cinnamon, Neroli 🌿At the heart, warming spices unfold. Sharp ginger and aromatic cinnamon mingle with delicate neroli, producing a sophisticated yet playful contrast that adds intrigue and depth to the fragrance.
Base Notes: Guaiac Wood, Black Tea 🌲The dry-down is smooth, grounding, and mesmerizing. Rich guaiac wood blends with smoky black tea, leaving a long-lasting, refined trail that balances freshness and warmth with effortless elegance.
Imaginary Jacques Yves is vibrant, daring, and unforgettable—a fragrance that inspires creativity, captivates attention, and leaves a signature of refined individuality. ✨",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Fragrance World, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,1799.00,2500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Fragrance-World-Imaginary-Jacques-Yves.png?v=1779820756,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
fragrance-world-french-avenue-nectare-extradose-100ml-edp,Fragrance World French Avenue Nectare Extradose 100ml EDP,"<p>Fragrance World French Avenue Nectare Extradose 100ml For Men and Women – A Modern Classic Reimagined ✨<br>
Fragrance World French Avenue Nectare Extradose is a unisex Eau de Parfum that captures the essence of refined elegance with a vibrant, contemporary twist. Inspired by Bravi by Thameen, this scent blends zesty freshness and creamy sweetness with deep, warm undertones—making it versatile enough for daily wear, evenings out, and special moments. It’s a fragrance that feels familiar yet distinctive, perfect for anyone who loves bright openings paired with rich, seductive depth.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes ✨<br>
Top Notes: Bitter Orange, Bergamot, Neroli, Pear, Ginger 🍊🍐The opening is juicy and energetic—zesty bitter orange and bergamot meet the floral brightness of neroli, while crisp pear and a touch of spicy ginger add freshness and character right from the first spray.<br>
Middle Notes: Honey, Tuberose, Orange Blossom, Jasmine 🌼🍯At the heart, a lush floral bouquet blooms with creamy tuberose, sweet orange blossom, and delicate jasmine. A whisper of honey adds a warm, golden sweetness that feels rich and inviting without being overpowering.<br>
Base Notes: Walnut Milk, Vanilla, Woody Notes, Musk, Tobacco 🌰🌿The dry-down is smooth and comforting: velvety vanilla and creamy walnut milk blend with woody accords, soft musk, and a hint of tobacco. This creates a warm, sensual finish that lingers beautifully on skin.<br>
Fragrance World French Avenue Nectare Extradose is an elegant, modern, and versatile scent that sits perfectly between fresh and sweet, bright and deep—ideal for anyone who wants a fragrance that’s both approachable and unforgettable.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","French Avenue, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,6,deny,manual,4599.00,12000.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Fragrance-World-French-Avenue-Nectare-Extradose_6414949d-2657-4b69-aa36-d18ecd37e1c1.png?v=1779879436,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
fragrance-world-divin-musc-100ml-edp,Fragrance World Divin Musc 100ml EDP,"Fragrance World Divin Musc 100ml EDP For Men &amp; Women – Pure Elegance in Every Breath 🤍✨Made in UAE | Soft, Clean &amp; Long-Lasting
Fragrance World Divin Musc is a refined and soothing unisex fragrance created for those who appreciate understated luxury and timeless sophistication. Clean, airy, and effortlessly elegant, this scent is all about softness, balance, and skin-like comfort—perfect for everyday wear with a touch of class.

Fragrance Notes 🌿✨
Top Notes: Mandarin Orange, Red Berries, Neroli 🍊🍓The fragrance opens with a fresh and luminous blend of mandarin orange and red berries, uplifted by the crisp floral brightness of neroli. This opening feels clean, refreshing, and instantly comforting.
Middle Notes: White Flowers, Peony, Iris 🌸🌼At the heart lies a delicate floral bouquet. White flowers and peony add softness and elegance, while iris introduces a smooth, powdery refinement that enhances the fragrance’s graceful character.
Base Notes: Amber, Musk 🤍🌙The base settles into a warm, clean, and sensual blend of amber and musk. This soft musky dry-down lingers beautifully on the skin, creating a calm, cozy, and sophisticated trail.
Perfect for daily wear, office use, and all-season comfort, Divin Musc is ideal for those who love clean, musky, floral fragrances that feel intimate yet elegant.
🤍 Let Divin Musc become your signature of purity, grace, and effortless charm.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Fragrance World, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,3199.00,3499.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Fragrance-World-Divin-Musc.png?v=1779820754,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
fragrance-world-divin-vert-100ml-edp,Fragrance World Divin Vert 100ml EDP,"Fragrance World Divin Vert 100ml EDP For Men &amp; Women – Fresh Boldness with a Green Soul 🌿✨Made in UAE | Vibrant • Elegant • Long-Lasting
Fragrance World Divin Vert is a confident unisex fragrance that blends fresh citrus brightness with deep, earthy warmth. Modern yet timeless, this scent is crafted for those who enjoy a balance of freshness, character, and sophistication—perfect for both day and evening wear.

Fragrance Notes 🌱✨
Top Notes: Mandarin, Bergamot, Lemon 🍊🍋The opening is crisp and energizing, bursting with zesty citrus freshness. Mandarin and bergamot add a juicy sparkle, while lemon brings a sharp, clean edge that feels refreshing and uplifting.
Middle Notes: White Flowers, Pineapple, Labdanum, Leather, Jasmine 🌸🍍The heart unfolds into a complex and intriguing blend. White florals and jasmine add elegance, pineapple lends a subtle fruity sweetness, while labdanum and leather introduce depth, warmth, and a refined masculine-feminine balance.
Base Notes: Oakmoss, Benzoin, Amber, Rum 🌿🥃The base is rich and sensual. Earthy oakmoss pairs with resinous benzoin and warm amber, while a hint of rum adds a smooth, intoxicating finish that lingers beautifully.
Ideal for all-season wear, evenings, and signature scent lovers, Divin Vert is perfect for those who appreciate fresh-green fragrances with depth and character.
✨ Embrace freshness with strength and elegance—Divin Vert leaves a trail that feels bold, refined, and unforgettable.",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Fragrance World, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,3199.00,3499.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Fragrance-World-Divin-Vert.png?v=1779820753,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
fragrance-world-oud-nuclear-60ml-edp,Fragrance World Oud Nuclear 60ml EDP,"Fragrance World Oud Nuclear 60ml EDP For Men &amp; Women – An Explosion of Power &amp; Luxury 💣🖤Made in UAE | Intense • Dark • Long-LastingInspired by Oud Stallion by Maison Crivelli 🐎✨
Fragrance World Oud Nuclear is a bold and commanding unisex fragrance created for true oud connoisseurs. Deeply oriental and powerfully expressive, this scent blends fiery spices, elegant florals, and raw oud into a composition that feels untamed yet refined—perfect for those who enjoy strong, statement-making fragrances.

Fragrance Notes 🔥✨
Top Notes: Cardamom, Indonesian Nutmeg, Saffron 🌶️🧡The opening hits with a warm burst of aromatic spices. Cardamom and nutmeg add depth and intensity, while saffron introduces a rich, leathery spice that immediately sets a luxurious and bold tone.
Middle Notes: Jasmine, Osmanthus, Turkish Rose 🌹🌼The heart reveals a sophisticated floral core. Turkish rose and jasmine soften the composition with elegance, while osmanthus adds a subtle fruity-leathery nuance, creating a beautiful contrast to the spices.
Base Notes: Leather, Agarwood (Oud), Patchouli, Cedar, Tonka 🪵🖤The dry-down is dark, smoky, and addictive. Powerful oud and leather dominate, supported by earthy patchouli and dry cedar, with tonka adding a smooth, warm sweetness that lingers intensely on the skin.
Ideal for evenings, winters, special occasions, and oud lovers, Oud Nuclear is a fragrance that radiates strength, confidence, and refined wildness.
