fragrance-world-just-anabi-50ml-edp,Fragrance World Just Anabi 50ml EDP,"<p>Fragrance World Just Anabi 50ml EDP – Dark Cherry with Smoky Leather Depth 🍒🖤🔥For Women | Fruity • Smoky • Leather-Woody<br>
Fragrance World Just Anabi is a bold and mysterious feminine fragrance that blends juicy cherry with smoky leather and deep woody notes. Intense, seductive, and unique, it’s perfect for women who love standout, niche-style scents.</p>

<p>🌿 Fragrance Notes<br>
Top Notes:🍒 Cherry – Rich, juicy sweetness with a slightly dark twist.🌶️ Saffron – Warm, exotic spice adding depth and luxury.<br>
Heart Notes:🔥 Smoke – A bold smoky accord that adds mystery and intensity.🖤 Leather – Smooth, sensual leather giving a strong character.🌸 Osmanthus – Fruity-floral nuance that softens the smokiness.<br>
Base Notes:🌿 Vetiver – Earthy, slightly smoky green depth.🌲 Cedarwood – Clean woody structure for balance.🌾 Cypriol (Nagarmotha) – Dark, woody-spicy richness enhancing depth.🤍 Musk – Soft, lingering finish that smooths the composition.<br>
Just Anabi opens with a sweet spicy cherry burst, evolves into a smoky leathery heart, and settles into a deep woody-musky base that feels bold and long-lasting.<br>
Perfect for evenings, parties, winter wear, and special occasions, it suits women who enjoy dark, smoky, and unique fragrances with a fruity twist.<br>
🍒🖤 Just Anabi – bold, mysterious, and unforgettable.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Fragrance World, Full",true,Size,50ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,10,deny,manual,629.00,1500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Fragrance-World-Just-Anabi.png?v=1779820719,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,unisex,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
