armaf-club-de-nuit-man-105ml-edt,Armaf Club De Nuit Man 105ml EDT,"<p class=""isSelectedEnd""><strong><span>Armaf Club De Nuit Man 105ml Eau De Toilette – Fruity Citrus Freshness with Smoky Woody Elegance 🍍✨</span></strong></p>
<p class=""isSelectedEnd""><span>Discover </span><strong><span>Armaf Club De Nuit Man</span></strong><span>, a bold Eau De Toilette crafted for men who appreciate fresh citrus, smoky woods, and exceptional versatility. Blending vibrant fruits, elegant florals, and a rich woody base, this fragrance delivers a confident and long-lasting signature suitable for any occasion.</span></p>
<p class=""isSelectedEnd""><strong><span>Inspired By: Aventus by Creed</span></strong></p>
<p class=""isSelectedEnd""><strong><span>🌿 Fragrance Notes:</span></strong></p>
<ul data-spread=""false"">
<li>
<strong><span>Top:</span></strong><span> Lemon, Pineapple, Bergamot, Black Currant, Apple – A bright, juicy opening with sparkling citrus and fresh fruity accords.</span>
</li>
<li>
<strong><span>Heart:</span></strong><span> Birch, Jasmine, Rose – A refined heart where smoky birch blends with elegant jasmine and soft rose.</span>
</li>
<li>
<strong><span>Base:</span></strong><span> Musk, Ambergris, Patchouli, Vanilla – A rich, masculine finish with sensual musk, earthy patchouli, smooth vanilla, and ambergris.</span>
</li>
</ul>
<p class=""isSelectedEnd""><span>✨ </span><strong><span>Armaf Club De Nuit Man</span></strong><span> is perfect for daily wear, office settings, evenings, and special occasions — a fragrance that reflects confidence, sophistication, and timeless masculinity.</span></p>
<p><strong><span>Eau De Toilette • Long Lasting • For Men</span></strong></p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Armaf, Full",true,Size,105ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,5,deny,manual,2937.00,3500.00,true,false,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/ARMAF-CLUB-DE-NUIT-MAN-PERFUME-FOR-MEN-100-ML-EDT.png?v=1779820684,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,musk; ambergris; patchouli; vanilla,armaf,,,edt,,armaf; inspired-by-aventus,,,https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Armaf/Club-de-Nuit-Intense-Man-34696.html,men,moisturise-before-applying; follow-the-1-spot-2-sprays-rule; use-10-12-sprays-for-fresh-fragrances; spray-on-pulse-points-clothes; dont-rub-after-spraying,aventus,6-8-hours,citrus; fruity; leather; smoky; woody,,birch; jasmine; rose,,,,,,,,,,,party,,,,lemon; pineapple; bergamot; black-currant; apple,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
