armaf-seduction-for-men-100ml-edp,Armaf Seduction For Men 100ml EDP,"Seduction For Men is a bold woody musky scent that empowers itself through sea tones and grapefruit for a crisp opening.

The heart features a tantalising dance of spices, geranium, and bay leaf.

A base of guaiac wood and amber completes the fragrance.

It has a very nice Projection for about 2 hours 2 feet then you get good sillage for about 6 7 hours then it becomes very smooth musky woody ambery scent on skin and clothes for about 8+ hours easily.

 

