armaf-odyssey-mandarin-sky-100ml-edp,Armaf Odyssey Mandarin Sky 100ml EDP,"<p>Armaf Odyssey Mandarin Sky is an exquisite long-lasting perfume crafted for the modern man seeking an alluring scent that captures the essence of adventure and sophistication. Encased in a luxurious 100ml Eau de Parfum bottle, this fragrance evokes a sense of limitless horizons and boundless skies.</p>

<p>At the heart of Odyssey Mandarin Sky lies a captivating blend of natural and dynamic notes. The fragrance opens with a burst of vibrant Sage, entwined with the zestful and invigorating essence of Mandarin and Orange. This effervescent combination provides an immediate freshness that sets the tone for the journey ahead.</p>

<p>As the scent unfolds, the richness of Saffron and the sweetness of Caramel unite to create a warm and comforting aroma that tantalizes the senses. Underlying this luscious harmony, the comforting embrace of Tonka Bean adds a touch of sensuality, bringing depth and complexity to the fragrance.</p>

<p>Throughout the olfactory journey, the distinct and captivating scents of Tagetes, Vetiver, and Cedar intertwine, enhancing the fragrance with a touch of earthiness and a hint of smokiness. These exquisite natural notes ground the composition, evoking a sense of masculinity and strength.</p>

<p>Finally, the base note of Ambroxan gracefully ties everything together, leaving a lasting impression that lingers on the skin long after application. Armaf Odyssey Mandarin Sky is a fragrance that epitomizes the spirit of a daring and confident man, effortlessly exuding charisma and allure in any setting.</p>

<p>This Eau de Parfum is perfect for those who seek a timeless and versatile scent that complements both casual and formal occasions. With its harmonious blend of invigorating and comforting notes, Odyssey Mandarin Sky takes the wearer on an olfactory expedition, enveloping them in a captivating and unforgettable aroma.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Armaf, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,2,deny,manual,2299.00,2499.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Armaf-Odyssey-Mandarin-Sky-100ml-EDP.png?v=1779820669,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
