armaf-club-de-nuit-urban-elixir-105ml-edp,Armaf Club De Nuit Urban Elixir 105ml EDP,"<p>Armaf Club De Nuit Urban Elixir</p> 

<p>Armaf Club De Nuit Urban Elixir is a standout fragrance for men, celebrated for its exceptional longevity and captivating scent. This hybrid Inspired blends elements of Dior Sauvage and other designer fragrances like Aventus and Prada, offering a sophisticated and enduring experience.</p>

<p>Top Notes: The fragrance opens with a fresh and invigorating blend of bergamot, pink pepper, jasmine, and orange blossom, creating a vibrant and energetic introduction.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: The heart reveals a complex mix of soothing lavender, elegant geranium, earthy elemi, and unique tagetes. Vetiver adds a smoky, woody touch, while saffron introduces a hint of exotic spice.</p>

<p>Base Notes: The base provides a warm and sensual foundation with ambroxan’s amber-like aroma, earthy patchouli, luxurious amber, aromatic cedarwood, and resinous labdanum, leaving a memorable and captivating trail.</p>

<p>Armaf Club De Nuit Urban Elixir is perfect for those seeking a long-lasting, fresh, and alluring fragrance that makes a lasting impression. Best Inspired of Dior Sauvage with powerful performance.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Armaf, Full",true,Size,105ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,3299.00,4100.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Armaf-Club-De-Nuit-Urban-Elixir-105ml-EDP.png?v=1779820631,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
armaf-club-de-nuit-intense-man-150ml-pure-parfum,Armaf Club De Nuit Intense Man 150ml Pure Parfum,"<h3 data-section-id=""8sjpjq"" data-start=""0"" data-end=""52"">Armaf Club De Nuit Intense Man Pure Parfum 150ml</h3>
<p data-start=""54"" data-end=""438"">Experience the bold sophistication of <strong data-start=""92"" data-end=""138"">Armaf Club De Nuit Intense Man Pure Parfum</strong>, a fragrance celebrated for its striking resemblance to the legendary Creed Aventus—often regarded as the king of modern men's perfumery. Crafted for the confident gentleman, this scent delivers a powerful blend of freshness, smokiness, and elegance that leaves a lasting impression wherever you go.</p>
<p data-start=""440"" data-end=""853"">The fragrance opens with a vibrant burst of <strong data-start=""484"" data-end=""539"">apple, bergamot, blackcurrant, pineapple, and lemon</strong>, creating a fresh and energetic introduction. At its heart, an elegant fusion of <strong data-start=""621"" data-end=""649"">rose, birch, and jasmine</strong> adds depth, sophistication, and a signature smoky character. The scent settles into a rich and masculine base of <strong data-start=""763"" data-end=""795"">musk, patchouli, and vanilla</strong>, providing warmth, sensuality, and exceptional longevity.</p>
<p data-start=""855"" data-end=""874""><strong data-start=""855"" data-end=""874"">Fragrance Notes</strong></p>
<ul data-start=""875"" data-end=""1022"">
<li data-section-id=""j3zjb6"" data-start=""875"" data-end=""939"">
<strong data-start=""877"" data-end=""891"">Top Notes:</strong> Apple, Bergamot, Blackcurrant, Pineapple, Lemon</li>
<li data-section-id=""1k8k5bp"" data-start=""940"" data-end=""979"">
<strong data-start=""942"" data-end=""958"">Heart Notes:</strong> Rose, Birch, Jasmine</li>
<li data-section-id=""1sjoqn8"" data-start=""980"" data-end=""1022"">
<strong data-start=""982"" data-end=""997"">Base Notes:</strong> Musk, Patchouli, Vanilla</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=""1024"" data-end=""1373"">Renowned for its <strong data-start=""1041"" data-end=""1068"">all-weather versatility</strong>, Club De Nuit Intense Man performs exceptionally well in both warm and cool conditions, making it a perfect signature scent for every season. Its outstanding projection and long-lasting performance ensure you remain noticeable from day to night, whether at the office, a formal event, or a casual outing.</p>
<p data-start=""1375"" data-end=""1676"" data-is-last-node="""" data-is-only-node="""">For fragrance enthusiasts seeking the iconic Aventus-inspired experience without the luxury price tag, <strong data-start=""1478"" data-end=""1524"">Armaf Club De Nuit Intense Man Pure Parfum</strong> stands as one of the most admired and best-performing fragrances in its class—a timeless scent that exudes confidence, success, and modern masculinity.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Extracts,"","Armaf, best seller, Full",true,Size,150ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,82,deny,manual,5100.00,0.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Armaf-Club-De-Nuit-Intense-men-pure-parfum-150ml_43d00cf1-9240-46df-84e8-5ef0513a59e4.png?v=1779821802,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,inspired-by-aventus,,fruity,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,armaf-cdnim-150-flat-700-off,,,,,,for-men,,'2,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
armaf-club-de-nuit-oud-105ml-parfum,Armaf Club De Nuit Oud 105ml Parfum,"<p>Armaf Club De Nuit Oud 105ml Parfum: A Collector's Pride 🌟</p>

<p>Embark on a sensory journey like no other with Armaf Club De Nuit Oud 105ml Parfum – a masterpiece that transcends time and captivates the senses. Crafted to perfection, this fragrance stands as a testament to elegance, sophistication, and luxury, earning its place as a collector's pride.</p>

<p>🔥 Unveiling the Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: Dive into a luscious blend of peach, passionfruit, pear, pineapple, plum, and bergamot, where each note dances harmoniously to create a symphony of fruity delight. Experience the invigorating freshness that sets the stage for an unforgettable olfactory experience.<br>
Middle Notes: Delve deeper into the heart of Club De Nuit Oud, where jasmine, cashmere wood, freesia, and violet leaves intertwine to weave a tapestry of floral elegance. Let the floral bouquet envelop you in a veil of sophistication and grace.<br>
Base Notes: The grand finale unfolds with musk, crystal amber, vanilla, and Cambodian oud, leaving an indelible mark of sensuality and allure. Experience the richness of the oriental oud, balanced by the warmth of vanilla and the earthiness of musk, culminating in a mesmerizing symphony of scent.</p>

<p>🌞 Perfect for All Weather: Armaf Club De Nuit Oud is designed to transcend seasonal boundaries, making it the perfect companion for all weather conditions. Whether it's the crisp freshness of spring, the balmy days of summer, the golden hues of autumn, or the frosty chill of winter, this fragrance adapts effortlessly, ensuring you exude sophistication year-round.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Armaf, Full",false,Size,105ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,0.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Armaf-Club-de-Nuit-Oud.png?v=1779820629,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,draft
armaf-ventana-marine-pour-homme-100ml-edp,Armaf Ventana Marine Pour Homme 100ml EDP,"<p>Armaf Ventana Marine Pour Homme 100ml EDP: A Voyage into Masculine Elegance 🌊</p>

<p>Embark on an olfactory journey that captures the essence of the sea and the sophistication of the modern man with Armaf Ventana Marine Pour Homme. This 100ml Eau De Parfum encapsulates the spirit of adventure, exuding confidence and allure with every spritz. Crafted to perfection, this fragrance is a homage to the iconic Imagination by Louis Vuitton, offering an affordable luxury that resonates with discerning gentlemen worldwide.</p>

<p>🌿 Unveiling Fragrance Notes:</p>

<p>Top Notes: As the voyage begins, the scent unfurls with a burst of freshness, courtesy of petitgrain, citron, Calabrian bergamot, Sicilian orange, and cardamom. This invigorating blend evokes the crispness of a sea breeze, awakening the senses and setting the stage for the journey ahead.</p>

<p>Middle Notes: The heart of Ventana Marine Pour Homme reveals a captivating blend of Nigerian ginger, Tunisian neroli, Ceylon cinnamon, rosemary, lily-of-the-valley, and jasmine. This aromatic symphony evokes images of lush coastal landscapes, where the air is filled with the tantalizing scent of exotic blooms and spices.</p>

<p>Base Notes: As the fragrance settles, it leaves behind a trail of sophistication and warmth, thanks to Brazilian rosewood, sandalwood, Chinese black tea, and guaiac wood. These rich, woody notes add depth and complexity, ensuring a memorable and lasting impression.</p>

<p>⚓ Inspired Of Luxury: Armaf Ventana Marine Pour Homme pays homage to the iconic Imagination by Louis Vuitton, offering a luxurious experience at an accessible price point. Embrace the allure of high-end fragrance without breaking the bank, and make a statement wherever you go.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Armaf, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,2507.00,2950.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Armaf-Ventana-Marine.png?v=1779820628,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
armaf-club-de-nuit-intense-man-105ml-parfum,Armaf Club De Nuit Intense Man 105ml Parfum,"<p>Armaf Club De Nuit Intense Man 105ml Parfum Limited Edition: A Collector's Pride 🌟</p>

<p>Embark on an olfactory journey of distinction with the all-new Armaf Club De Nuit Intense Man 105ml Parfum Limited Edition – a testament to luxury and exclusivity. Crafted to captivate the senses and evoke an air of sophistication, this fragrance masterpiece is a collector's pride, redefining the essence of opulence.</p>

<p>🔥 Unparalleled Longevity: Experience the allure of enduring sophistication with Armaf Club De Nuit Intense Man. This fragrance, meticulously formulated and expertly blended in the UAE, boasts an unmatched longevity that ensures you stand out in every crowd, leaving a lasting impression that transcends time.</p>

<p>💎 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: A symphony of freshness awaits as apple, bergamot, blackcurrant, pineapple, and lemon converge to create an invigorating burst of citrus and fruit. Feel the vibrancy of this opening act, setting the stage for an unforgettable journey.<br>
Middle Notes: Delve deeper into the heart of elegance with the delicate fusion of rose, birch, and jasmine. These floral and woody accords add depth and complexity, infusing the fragrance with a refined charm that captivates the senses.<br>
Base Notes: The grand finale unfolds with the rich and sensual allure of musk, ambergris, patchouli, and vanilla. This symphony of base notes creates a warm and inviting trail that lingers on the skin, leaving a mesmerizing aura in your wake.</p>

<p>👑 The Creed Aventus Connection: Armaf Club De Nuit Intense Man stands proudly as the best Inspired of the iconic Creed Aventus, revered as the king in the fragrance community. Embrace the essence of royalty and sophistication with this remarkable creation, destined to become a timeless classic in its own right.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Armaf, Full, men, Party",true,Size,105ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,4,deny,manual,4037.00,,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Clubdenuitintense105mlEDT.png?v=1783578517,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
armaf-beau-star-100ml-edp,Armaf Beau Star 100ml EDP,"<p>Armaf Beau Star 100ml EDP For Men: The Epitome of Freshness and Longevity 🌟</p>

<p>Introducing Armaf Beau Star 100ml Eau De Parfum for Men, a fragrance that redefines sophistication and freshness. Launched in 2024, this exceptional scent is designed for the modern man who seeks a long-lasting fragrance that remains vibrant throughout the day. Armaf Beau Star combines a perfect balance of invigorating and woody notes, making it an essential addition to your fragrance collection.</p>

<p>🌿 Fragrance Notes Unveiled:</p>

<p>Top Notes: The journey begins with a refreshing burst of woody notes, lemon, bergamot, and marine notes. This invigorating blend offers an immediate sense of freshness and vitality, evoking the feeling of a cool sea breeze on a sunny day.<br>
Middle Notes: As the fragrance evolves, the heart reveals an intriguing combination of baby leaf, saffron, and additional woody notes. This sophisticated mix adds depth and complexity, creating a warm, slightly spicy, and green aroma that is both captivating and comforting.<br>
Base Notes: The base notes provide a smooth and sensual finish with musk, ambroxan, and sandalwood. These elements merge to form a rich, creamy, and enduring foundation that lingers on the skin, leaving a memorable and masculine trail.</p>

<p>🌞 A Fragrance for Every Occasion: Armaf Beau Star is versatile and suitable for all occasions. Whether you're heading to a business meeting, a casual outing, or a special event, this fragrance ensures you make a lasting impression. Its long-lasting nature means you can confidently wear it from morning until night without the need for reapplication.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Armaf, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,2975.00,3500.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Armaf-Beau-Star.png?v=1779820625,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
armaf-club-de-nuit-precieux-1-55ml-extrait-de-parfum,Armaf Club De Nuit Precieux 1 55ml Extrait De Parfum,"<p>Armaf Club De Nuit Precieux 1 Extrait De Parfum 55ML For Men: The Epitome of Luxury and Longevity 🌟</p>

<p>Experience the pinnacle of high-quality fragrance with Armaf Club De Nuit Precieux 1 Extrait De Parfum. Made in the UAE, this 55ml bottle encapsulates a rich, long-lasting scent that is designed for the discerning man. Known for its extraordinary similarity to Absolu Aventus by Creed, this perfume offers an opulent fragrance experience that rivals the original in both quality and sophistication.</p>

