armaf-club-de-nuit-man-7ml-edt,Armaf Club De Nuit Man 7ml EDT,"<p>Armaf Club De Nuit Man Perfume for Men 105ml EDT is a dynamic, long-lasting fragrance made in the UAE, crafted for men who seek sophistication with a bold edge. The scent opens with a fresh and invigorating blend of Mandarin Orange, Grapefruit, and crisp Mint, creating an energizing start that awakens the senses.</p>

<p>As the fragrance develops, the heart reveals a warm and spicy mix of Cinnamon, Cloves, Ginger, and Pepper. These middle notes bring a deep, masculine character to the perfume, adding richness and complexity to its profile.</p>

<p>The base is grounded with sensual Leather, earthy Patchouli, and warm Amber, complemented by Woody and Spicy Notes, providing a smooth and lasting finish. This combination ensures the fragrance leaves a striking impression, perfect for any occasion.</p>

<p>Known as one of the best Inspireds of 1 Million by Paco Rabanne, Armaf Club De Nuit Man delivers a similar luxurious experience at an affordable price. Its powerful, high-quality formulation guarantees long-lasting performance, making it an ideal choice for men who appreciate a fragrance that’s as bold and captivating as they are.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Eaux De Toilette,"","Armaf, Full",true,Size,7ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,0,deny,manual,299.00,600.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/armaf-club-de-nuit-man-eau-m-KMl436pK2.jpg?v=1779820571,1,"",false,,,479,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,edt,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
