armaf-odyssey-go-mango-100ml-edp,Armaf Odyssey Go Mango 100ml EDP,"Armaf Odyssey Go Mango 100ml EDP – Juicy Tropical Sweetness with Smoky Warm Depth 🥭🔥✨For Men &amp; Women | Fruity • Gourmand • Woody
Armaf Odyssey Go Mango is a bold and addictive unisex fragrance that blends vibrant tropical fruits with warm, creamy sweetness and a smoky woody base. Inspired by the luxurious essence of God of Fire, it delivers a rich, modern scent that feels both exotic and captivating.
Fragrance Notes ✨
Top Notes: Lemon, Pink Pepper, Ginger &amp; White Flowers 🍋🌸The fragrance opens with a lively burst of zesty lemon and spicy pink pepper, enhanced by the warmth of ginger and softened by delicate white florals—creating a bright yet slightly sensual introduction.
Heart Notes: Mango, Tonka Bean &amp; Dry Wood 🥭🌰At its heart, luscious ripe mango takes center stage, blending beautifully with creamy tonka bean and subtle dry woody accords for a sweet, smooth, and tropical richness.
