armaf-old-money-100ml-edp,Armaf Old Money 100ml EDP,"Armaf Old Money 100ml Eau De Parfum – Dark Gourmand Woody Signature 💼🔥For Men | Spicy • Gourmand • Smoky-Woody
Armaf Old Money is a bold and luxurious masculine fragrance that blends spicy freshness, rich gourmand accords, and deep smoky woods into a powerful modern scent. Sophisticated yet daring, it carries a confident “quiet luxury” character with a smooth dark sweetness and refined masculine depth.
🌿 Fragrance Notes
Top Notes:🌶️ Black Pepper – Sharp spicy energy that creates a bold opening.🍋 Bergamot – Fresh citrus brightness adding clean elegance.💜 Lavender – Aromatic freshness bringing a smooth masculine touch.
Middle Notes:☕ Coffee – Rich roasted warmth with addictive depth.🍐 Pear – Juicy fruity sweetness balancing the darker accords.🍬 Praline – Creamy caramelized sweetness adding a luxurious gourmand feel.🖤 Black Licorice – Dark herbal sweetness creating mystery and uniqueness.🌸 Tuscan Iris – Soft powdery floral elegance with refined character.🌿 Ambrette – Musky warmth that smooths the composition.
Base Notes:🪵 Vetiver &amp; Cedarwood – Earthy woody richness with masculine depth.🔥 Smoke &amp; Lava Notes – Dark smoky intensity adding bold character.🍫 Cocoa – Bitter-sweet warmth creating a sensual finish.🖤 Musk &amp; Skin Notes – Soft sensual undertones that linger smoothly.🌫️ Mineral &amp; Powdery Notes – Elegant dry texture giving sophistication.
Old Money opens with a fresh spicy aromatic burst, develops into a rich gourmand heart of coffee, praline, and licorice, then settles into a smoky woody base with sensual musky warmth.
Perfect for evenings, winter wear, formal occasions, and signature scent lovers, it suits men who enjoy dark sweet fragrances with a luxurious smoky edge.
