armaf-spartacus-100ml-edp,Armaf Spartacus 100ml EDP,"<p>Armaf Spartacus 100ml Eau De Parfum – Warm Spicy Gourmand Power ⚔️🔥For Men | Spicy • Sweet • Amber-Woody<br>
Armaf Spartacus is a rich and commanding masculine fragrance that blends warm spices, creamy sweetness, and deep amber woods into a bold modern scent. Smooth yet powerful, it carries a luxurious gourmand character with a confident masculine edge that feels intense, addictive, and refined.<br>
🌿 Fragrance Notes<br>
Top Notes:🍊 Orange Blossom – Bright floral freshness with soft sweetness.🌶️ Cinnamon – Warm spicy richness adding depth and energy.🍑 Plum – Dark fruity sweetness giving a smooth seductive touch.🌿 Cardamom – Aromatic spice creating a refined masculine opening.🍋 Bergamot – Fresh citrus brightness balancing the warmth.<br>
Middle Notes:🍦 Bourbon Vanilla – Rich creamy sweetness with luxurious warmth.🌿 Davana – Fruity aromatic depth adding uniqueness and character.🌰 Candied Almond – Sweet nutty gourmand accord with smooth softness.💜 Lavender – Clean aromatic freshness bringing balance and elegance.🌿 Elemi – Resinous spicy freshness adding complexity.<br>
Base Notes:🍬 Praline – Creamy caramel sweetness with addictive warmth.🌰 Tonka Bean – Smooth vanilla-like richness with soft spice.🧡 Amber – Warm sensual depth that enhances longevity.🖤 Musk – Soft sensual undertones creating a smooth dry down.🌳 Guaiac Wood – Smoky woody richness with masculine intensity.🌿 Patchouli – Earthy depth adding sophistication and boldness.🌰 Benzoin – Sweet resinous warmth giving a luxurious finish.<br>
Spartacus opens with a spicy fruity burst, develops into a creamy gourmand heart, and settles into a warm amber woody base that feels powerful, smooth, and irresistibly masculine.<br>
Perfect for evenings, parties, winter wear, and special occasions, it suits men who enjoy sweet spicy fragrances with a rich luxurious character.</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Armaf, Full",true,Size,100ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,3,deny,manual,3499.00,5499.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Armaf-Spartacus.png?v=1779820560,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
