<p>Albait Aldimashqi Imagination is a captivating fragrance for men that embodies the essence of refinement and allure. With its vibrant citrus opening and a rich, spicy heart, this long-lasting perfume from the UAE offers a perfect balance of freshness and depth, making it ideal for those who crave a sophisticated yet daring scent.</p>

<p>Fragrance Notes: Top Notes: Citron, Calabrian Bergamot, Sicilian Orange<br>
