<p>Base Notes: Chinese Black Tea, Ambroxan, Guaiac Wood, Olibanum<br>
(A smooth, woody base laced with a subtle smokiness delivers an enduring finish that leaves an irresistible trail.)</p>

<p>Inspired by the iconic Imagination by Louis Vuitton, Albait Aldimashqi Imagination invites you to embark on an unforgettable olfactory journey. Ideal for daytime wear or evening occasions, this fragrance makes a statement of elegance and strength, perfect for the modern man with a bold, imaginative spirit. 🌟</p>",Frags Talk,Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Oils,"","Albait Aldimashq, Full",true,Size,75ml,,,,,,,,,0.0,shopify,1,deny,manual,2499.00,4999.00,true,true,,,,,,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0999/6094/7002/files/Albait-Aldimashqi_bf946719-3c47-4524-b0ed-3a834994bcec.png?v=1779820504,1,"",false,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,for-men,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,kg,,,active
